  ('620033974108610912', 'The Boy in Blue', 1986, 'Drama', 'Charles Jarrott, Jacques Méthé, Pierre Mignot', 'Douglas Bowie', 'Nicolas Cage, Cynthia Dale, Christopher Plummer, David Naughton, Sean Sullivan, Melody Anderson, James B. Douglas, Walter Massey', 'R', 'Ned Hanlan was Canada''s most successful sculling champion at the turn of the 20th century. This dramatization of his life begins in his youth, when the wild young man is informally adopted by a gambler who promotes Ned on the sculling circuit, betting on the boy''s rowing skills solely to make money off him. Later, a ruthless businessman named Knox takes over Ned''s career, but when Ned realizes how dishonest Knox is, he finds another manager. Walter is an inventor and the first honest man Ned has dealt with in his career and, under Walter''s guidance, Ned rises to great success in the sculling world.', 'Ned Hanlan was Canada''s most successful sculling champion at the turn of the 20th century. This dramatization of his life begins in his youth, when the wild young man is informally adopted by a gambler who promotes Ned on the sculling circuit, betting on the boy''s rowing skills solely to make money off him. Later, a ruthless businessman named Knox takes over Ned''s career, but when Ned realizes how dishonest Knox is, he finds another manager. Walter is an inventor and the first honest man Ned has dealt with in his career and, under Walter''s guidance, Ned rises to great success in the sculling world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5O3ULQhgZXNxqDLfEvUmGqdQYbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83105'),
  ('282580081184610820', 'The Boy in the Mirror', 2014, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Guilherme Fiúza Zenha, José Roberto Eliezer, Maria Farkas', 'Cristiano Abud, André Carreira, Guilherme Fiúza Zenha', 'Lino Facioli, Giovanna Rispoli, Murilo Quirino, Ravi Hood, Mateus Solano, Regiane Alves, Ricardo Blat, Gisele Fróes', null, 'What child has never dreamed of having a double, someone who would do all of the annoying things in his place? Seeing his reflection get out of the mirror into the real world, this dream comes true for the fearless boy Fernando. Odnanref, his double, presents himself as a solution to all his problems. Adaptation of a successful Brazilian novel written by Fernando Sabino.', 'What child has never dreamed of having a double, someone who would do all of the annoying things in his place? Seeing his reflection get out of the mirror into the real world, this dream comes true for the fearless boy Fernando. Odnanref, his double, presents himself as a solution to all his problems. Adaptation of a successful Brazilian novel written by Fernando Sabino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3inJ0LKrccEK5mNqQzmJlGjLPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254435'),
  ('673104772674917680', 'The Boy in the Plastic Bubble', 1976, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Randal Kleiser, Archie R. Dalzell, Mike Moder', 'Douglas Day Stewart', 'John Travolta, Glynnis O''Connor, Robert Reed, Diana Hyland, Karen Morrow, Howard Platt, Buzz Aldrin, Ralph Bellamy', 'PG', 'Tod Lubitch is born with a deficient immune system. As such, he must spend the rest of his life in a completely sterile environment. His room is completely hermetically sealed against bacteria and virus, his food is specially prepared, and his only human contact comes in the form of gloved hands. The movie follows his life into a teenager.', 'Tod Lubitch is born with a deficient immune system. As such, he must spend the rest of his life in a completely sterile environment. His room is completely hermetically sealed against bacteria and virus, his food is specially prepared, and his only human contact comes in the form of gloved hands. The movie follows his life into a teenager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZHhtOaXj3GhmivPhsmCnLkitpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9878'),
  ('1054389515666273395', 'The Boy in the Striped Pyjamas', 2008, 'Drama, War, History', 'Benoît Delhomme, Mark Herman, Rod McLean', 'Mark Herman', 'Asa Butterfield, Vera Farmiga, David Thewlis, Jack Scanlon, Amber Beattie, Rupert Friend, David Hayman, Sheila Hancock', 'PG-13', 'When his family moves from their home in Berlin to a strange new house in Poland, young Bruno befriends Shmuel, a boy who lives on the other side of the fence where everyone seems to be wearing striped pajamas. Unaware of Shmuel''s fate as a Jewish prisoner or the role his own Nazi father plays in his imprisonment, Bruno embarks on a dangerous journey inside the camp''s walls.', 'When his family moves from their home in Berlin to a strange new house in Poland, young Bruno befriends Shmuel, a boy who lives on the other side of the fence where everyone seems to be wearing striped pajamas. Unaware of Shmuel''s fate as a Jewish prisoner or the role his own Nazi father plays in his imprisonment, Bruno embarks on a dangerous journey inside the camp''s walls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2C8QCXdMlojTxZjfBlINr4FWcb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14574'),
  ('427946896339354104', 'The Boy in the Tree', 1961, 'Drama', 'Arne Sucksdorff, Gunnar Fischer', 'Arne Sucksdorff', 'Tomas Bolme, Heinz Hopf, Björn Gustafson, Anders Henrikson, Birgitta Pettersson, Åke Lindman, Barbro Hiort af Ornäs, Björn Berglund', null, 'Göte is a young teen who seems to be at odds with his family and may not know his own mind that well either. Discontented and rebellious, Göte joins up with two mean-spirited game poachers in spite of the fact that he loves animals and nature. This contradiction between his own feelings and his need to rebel reaches a climax when a forest ranger starts to track down the young men in ever-tightening circles.', 'Göte is a young teen who seems to be at odds with his family and may not know his own mind that well either. Discontented and rebellious, Göte joins up with two mean-spirited game poachers in spite of the fact that he loves animals and nature. This contradiction between his own feelings and his need to rebel reaches a climax when a forest ranger starts to track down the young men in ever-tightening circles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5fVvuHV5iiMBSG8jLVJhtjFKZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119460'),
  ('395773853684918087', 'The Boy in the Woods', 2023, 'Drama, War, History', 'Rebecca Snow, Adam Madrzyk', 'Rebecca Snow', 'Jett Klyne, Richard Armitage, David Kohlsmith, Katherine Fogler, Masa Lizdek, Christopher Heyerdahl, Tara Nicodemo, Ari Millen', null, 'The remarkable true-life survival story of a Jewish boy hiding and being hunted in the forests of Nazi-occupied Eastern Europe, based on Maxwell Smart''s memoir.', 'The remarkable true-life survival story of a Jewish boy hiding and being hunted in the forests of Nazi-occupied Eastern Europe, based on Maxwell Smart''s memoir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njyE1IbwfBSISTJKnWKyE7rVJcd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083612'),
  ('899621997071976700', 'The Boy Next Door', 2008, 'Drama', 'Gregor Schmidinger, Sophia Woodward', 'Gregor Schmidinger', 'Michael Ellison, Truman Chambers, Damon Preston', 'NR', 'Mark, a 25-year-old male prostitute who suffers from anxiety attacks accidentally runs into the 10-year-old son of one of his clients. When the boy tells him he is looking for his father Mark, taken by surprise, wants nothing to do with him. But while they wait for the client to return Mark realizes that maybe this unexpected guest was exactly what he needed. Over the course of the night this strange new friendship grows and gives both Mark and Justin the courage to overcome their fears and face their own personal demons.', 'Mark, a 25-year-old male prostitute who suffers from anxiety attacks accidentally runs into the 10-year-old son of one of his clients. When the boy tells him he is looking for his father Mark, taken by surprise, wants nothing to do with him. But while they wait for the client to return Mark realizes that maybe this unexpected guest was exactly what he needed. Over the course of the night this strange new friendship grows and gives both Mark and Justin the courage to overcome their fears and face their own personal demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5WFHX0sK3yxOHSfV3dEIu6KUfL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44120'),
  ('815247333921629401', 'The Boy Next Door', 2015, 'Thriller', 'Rob Cohen, Gerard DiNardi, Mic Rodgers', 'Barbara Curry', 'Jennifer Lopez, Ryan Guzman, Ian Nelson, John Corbett, Kristin Chenoweth, Hill Harper, Lexi Atkins, François Chau', 'R', 'A recently cheated on married woman falls for a younger man who has moved in next door, but their torrid affair soon takes a dangerous turn.', 'A recently cheated on married woman falls for a younger man who has moved in next door, but their torrid affair soon takes a dangerous turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gicmSeLG6Uh7BF1r1mxZHUQ8r26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241251'),
  ('834541018770489367', 'The Boy Soldier', 1981, 'Drama, War', 'Yves Boisset, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Jacques Kirsner, Yves Boisset', 'Lucas Belvaux, Jean Carmet, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Jean-François Stévenin, Jacques Denis, Evelyn Cotton, Daniel Mesguich, Jean-Pol Dubois', null, 'In the 1930s a young fellow, Simon Chalumet, is sent to a military school by his overbearing father, an ex-soldier who has little sympathy for his son''s more gentle temperament, or for his interest in films.', 'In the 1930s a young fellow, Simon Chalumet, is sent to a military school by his overbearing father, an ex-soldier who has little sympathy for his son''s more gentle temperament, or for his interest in films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Z80vPZrLtfWQ7UpxkJTIsbSVP5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150983'),
  ('75024332670882138', 'The Boy Who Could Fly', 1986, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Nick Castle, Adam Holender, Steven Poster', 'Nick Castle', 'Lucy Deakins, Jay Underwood, Fred Savage, Bonnie Bedelia, Colleen Dewhurst, Fred Gwynne, Jason Priestley, Cameron Bancroft', 'PG', 'Milly and Louis, and their recently-widowed mom, Charlene, move to a new neighborhood. Once there, they all deal with a variety of personal problems, but Milly finds a friend in Eric, her autistic next door neighbor. Eric has a fascination with flight, and as the story progresses, he exerts an enthralling force of change on all those around him.', 'Milly and Louis, and their recently-widowed mom, Charlene, move to a new neighborhood. Once there, they all deal with a variety of personal problems, but Milly finds a friend in Eric, her autistic next door neighbor. Eric has a fascination with flight, and as the story progresses, he exerts an enthralling force of change on all those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYOc7glRhPhyTDKZ05FuT1IdVzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24086'),
  ('1038164866410636844', 'The Boy Who Cried Bitch', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Daniel Shulman, Juan José Campanella', 'Catherine May Levin', 'Harley Cross, Karen Young, Jesse Bradford, J.D. Daniels, Gene Canfield, Moira Kelly, Adrien Brody, Dennis Boutsikaris', null, 'Divorced rich mother Candice Love has three sons at boarding school. The eldest, 12 year-old Dan, is totally unmanageable and aggressive, a bad influence on his brothers. When attempts to ''socialise'' him fail, his mother takes him back home, where he gradually progresses into psychosis.', 'Divorced rich mother Candice Love has three sons at boarding school. The eldest, 12 year-old Dan, is totally unmanageable and aggressive, a bad influence on his brothers. When attempts to ''socialise'' him fail, his mother takes him back home, where he gradually progresses into psychosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p34oMp2fpQhelPP88ZgQzkUD1AK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214263'),
  ('624190657064527465', 'The Boy Who Cried Werewolf', 1973, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Nathan Juran, Michael P. Joyce', 'Bob Homel', 'Kerwin Mathews, Elaine Devry, Scott Sealey, Robert J. Wilke, David Cass Jr., Bob Homel, Susan Foster, Loretta Temple', 'PG', 'Little Richie Bridgestone goes to spend the weekend with his father at his secluded mountain cabin, and witnesses his father being attacked by ''a creature'' that the boy recognizes as a werewolf. He tries to convince his mother and his therapist that his father is now a werewolf.', 'Little Richie Bridgestone goes to spend the weekend with his father at his secluded mountain cabin, and witnesses his father being attacked by ''a creature'' that the boy recognizes as a werewolf. He tries to convince his mother and his therapist that his father is now a werewolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhgt0tu4NlpbljBeAuNYRV8MRBL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94542'),
