  ('891601696536397328', 'The Boy Who Saw the Wind', 2000, 'Adventure, Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Kazuki Ōmori, Kazuhiko Tamura, Minoru Maeda', 'Izuru Narushima', 'Yumi Adachi, Aki Maeda, Keiko Toda, Takashi Naito, Daijirō Harada, Hiro Tsunoda, Hiroshi Arikawa, Mari Natsuki', null, 'Amon is a boy who can control the wind. Branik, ruler of the Empire of the Golden Snake, wants Amon''s power to complete the ultimate weapon and sends his troops to capture the boy. Amon, using his talents, manages to runs away with Maria, one of the People of the Sea. Together, they try to stop the Empire of the Golden Snake from destroying and conquering everything.', 'Amon is a boy who can control the wind. Branik, ruler of the Empire of the Golden Snake, wants Amon''s power to complete the ultimate weapon and sends his troops to capture the boy. Amon, using his talents, manages to runs away with Maria, one of the People of the Sea. Together, they try to stop the Empire of the Golden Snake from destroying and conquering everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhshXn2w88U9dgfnGsFtVwjrX6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77194'),
  ('792106010067764709', 'The Boy Who Turned Yellow', 1972, 'Family, Science Fiction', 'Michael Powell, Christopher Challis', 'Emeric Pressburger', 'Mark Dightam, Robert Eddison, Helen Weir, Brian Worth, Esmond Knight, Laurence Carter, Patrick McAlinney, Lem Dobbs', null, 'John and his class visit the Tower of London, where he loses his pet mouse. He falls asleep during a lesson on electricity, but with some help, he learns about it, invades the Tower, and saves his pet.', 'John and his class visit the Tower of London, where he loses his pet mouse. He falls asleep during a lesson on electricity, but with some help, he learns about it, invades the Tower, and saves his pet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omPmQkneUlqxCS3ezr98axV2KwI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259660'),
