  ('86515574728715031', 'The Boy Who Wanted to Be a Bear', 2002, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Jannik Hastrup', 'Bent Haller', 'Marlon Vilstrup, Joachim Boje Helvang, Otto Brandenburg, Paprika Steen, Tommy Kenter, Thomas Bo Larsen, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Anne Clausen', null, 'When a boy child is stolen by bears who raise him as their own, his human parents hunt the bears in despair, and the boy is faced with the dilemma of who and what he is.', 'When a boy child is stolen by bears who raise him as their own, his human parents hunt the bears in despair, and the boy is faced with the dilemma of who and what he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0jLmXeVDs3usWTLsbTWtGveQOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15951'),
  ('543373254297219228', 'The Boy with Green Hair', 1948, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Joseph Losey, C. Bakaleinikoff, George Barnes', 'Ben Barzman, Alfred Lewis Levitt', 'Pat O''Brien, Robert Ryan, Barbara Hale, Dean Stockwell, Richard Lyon, Walter Catlett, Samuel S. Hinds, Regis Toomey', null, 'Peter, an orphaned boy, is adopted by Gramp Frye after his parents are killed in Europe while doing war relief work. The boy feels safe with his new caretaker, but when he is taunted for being an orphan, he gets demoralized. The next day Peter wakes up with green hair. Embarrassed and further ridiculed, Peter seeks solace in a nearby forest. To his surprise, he finds other orphans in the woods, who encourage him to spread news of the injustices of war.', 'Peter, an orphaned boy, is adopted by Gramp Frye after his parents are killed in Europe while doing war relief work. The boy feels safe with his new caretaker, but when he is taunted for being an orphan, he gets demoralized. The next day Peter wakes up with green hair. Embarrassed and further ridiculed, Peter seeks solace in a nearby forest. To his surprise, he finds other orphans in the woods, who encourage him to spread news of the injustices of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2secYe7o6mDllV6PAgrnaCaCzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43759'),
  ('802389341497858476', 'The Boy with My Son''s Face', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Gigi Saul Guerrero', 'Oritte Bendory, Barry Levy', 'Italia Ricci, Stephanie Izsak, Siobhan Williams, Georgia Bradner, Luke Camilleri', 'Not Rated', 'Susan Webster wakes up one night to find her newborn son missing-- but when the police arrive, they tell her he was never there.', 'Susan Webster wakes up one night to find her newborn son missing-- but when the police arrive, they tell her he was never there.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2pMsy3j8nOo8HTudb0PzXOa7TgL.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-boy-with-my-sons-face-2026'),
  ('244256552819284979', 'The Boy with Pink Pants', 2024, 'Drama', 'Margherita Ferri, Martina Cocco, Andrea Vellucci', 'Roberto Proia', 'Samuele Carrino, Claudia Pandolfi, Corrado Fortuna, Andrea Arru, Sara Ciocca, Settimo Palazzo, Maurizio Jiritano, Barbara Bovoli', null, 'On 20 November 2012, 15-year-old Andrea Spezzacatena took his own life. It was the first case in Italy of bullying and cyberbullying that led to a minor''s suicide. The triggering incident was his choice to wear a pair of red trousers, a gift from his mother, which turned pink due to a washing mishap.', 'On 20 November 2012, 15-year-old Andrea Spezzacatena took his own life. It was the first case in Italy of bullying and cyberbullying that led to a minor''s suicide. The triggering incident was his choice to wear a pair of red trousers, a gift from his mother, which turned pink due to a washing mishap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UI9pOCyvn7ibrFHleOo0PceAyD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280941'),
  ('981283930359873388', 'The Boys', 1962, 'Drama, War', 'Mikko Niskanen, Olavi Tuomi', 'Mikko Niskanen', 'Pentti Tarkiainen, Vesa-Matti Loiri, Uti Saurio, Hannu Vironmäki, Markku Söderström, Heikki Rissanen, Ilkka Liikanen, Martti Isosalo', null, 'When Continuation War started in Summer 1941, German soldiers arrived to Oulu. With their charm they conquered women and town boys. Finnish boys communicated with them on many levels: had trades, worked as interpreters, rotated business, spied on German love adventures and fought with each other about the favor of soldiers. In autumn 1944, the war was ending. Germans left Oulu by leaving behind fragile relationships, bastard kids and unfinished businesses. The most shocking of all was the faith of young Jake...', 'When Continuation War started in Summer 1941, German soldiers arrived to Oulu. With their charm they conquered women and town boys. Finnish boys communicated with them on many levels: had trades, worked as interpreters, rotated business, spied on German love adventures and fought with each other about the favor of soldiers. In autumn 1944, the war was ending. Germans left Oulu by leaving behind fragile relationships, bastard kids and unfinished businesses. The most shocking of all was the faith of young Jake...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ojmuidGFps3VzdqkSj6QUytQJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253105'),
  ('866541748921777907', 'The Boys', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Louis Saia, Sylvain Brault', 'Louis Saia', 'Marc Messier, Rémy Girard, Patrick Huard, Serge Thériault, Michel Barrette, Paul Houde, Luc Guérin, Yvan Ponton', null, 'Every Monday evening, at the arena, eleven men get together to lovingly put on the jersey of the Boys, the hockey team of a "garage" league to which they belong. As Stan, their revered trainer, would affectionately say, they have the "puck" tattooed on their hearts. It doesn''t matter if they are lawyers, policemen, mechanics or unemployed, as soon as they enter the locker room, everyone forgets their age, their work and their problems.', 'Every Monday evening, at the arena, eleven men get together to lovingly put on the jersey of the Boys, the hockey team of a "garage" league to which they belong. As Stan, their revered trainer, would affectionately say, they have the "puck" tattooed on their hearts. It doesn''t matter if they are lawyers, policemen, mechanics or unemployed, as soon as they enter the locker room, everyone forgets their age, their work and their problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yk4NokXK0Bg84ULFOiVFmXp12EC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42832'),
  ('443992262784928128', 'The Boys', 1998, 'Drama', 'Rowan Woods, Tristan Milani, Deborah Antoniou', 'Stephen Sewell', 'David Wenham, Toni Collette, Lynette Curran, John Polson, Anthony Hayes, Jeanette Cronin, Anna Lise Phillips, Pete Smith', null, 'Brett Sprague is a violent and psychopathic man, who is released on parole after serving a sentence for assault. As he returns to his family house and we watch him and his brothers, Stevie and Glenn, for the next 24 hours, it becomes clear this day will not end well.', 'Brett Sprague is a violent and psychopathic man, who is released on parole after serving a sentence for assault. As he returns to his family house and we watch him and his brothers, Stevie and Glenn, for the next 24 hours, it becomes clear this day will not end well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLyfVrwm5028RPhx5oXmJv01uSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13821'),
  ('874236026435329049', 'The Boys', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kim Hyeong-seok, Kim Uk, Chung Ji-young', 'Jeong Sang-hyeop', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Yu Jun-sang, Jin Kyung, Heo Sung-tae, Yeom Hye-ran, Kim Dong-young, Yoo Su-bin, Kim Kyung-ho', null, 'In 1999, a robbery-murder case occurs in a small supermarket in Samnye, Jeonbuk province. The police investigation quickly narrows down to three boys from the neighborhood, and these boys are falsely accused of being murderers overnight and are imprisoned without understanding what is happening. The following year, veteran detective Hwang Joon-cheol is newly appointed as the head of Crime Investigation Division. He receives a tip about the real culprits and embarks on a reinvestigation to clear the boys'' names. However, the interference of the detective responsible for the case at the time, Choi Woo-sung, leads to everything falling apart, and Hwang is demoted. Sixteen years later, the sole witness of the case and daughter of the victim, Yoon Mi-sook, and the boys return to Hwang, seeking justice...', 'In 1999, a robbery-murder case occurs in a small supermarket in Samnye, Jeonbuk province. The police investigation quickly narrows down to three boys from the neighborhood, and these boys are falsely accused of being murderers overnight and are imprisoned without understanding what is happening. The following year, veteran detective Hwang Joon-cheol is newly appointed as the head of Crime Investigation Division. He receives a tip about the real culprits and embarks on a reinvestigation to clear the boys'' names. However, the interference of the detective responsible for the case at the time, Choi Woo-sung, leads to everything falling apart, and Hwang is demoted. Sixteen years later, the sole witness of the case and daughter of the victim, Yoon Mi-sook, and the boys return to Hwang, seeking justice...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgyKMJkZfDdcfjfIPfNSgVJ7S44.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714651'),
  ('190479489681023536', 'The Boys & Girls Guide to Getting Down', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Paul Sapiano', 'Paul Sapiano', 'Cricket Leigh, Kat Turner, Steve Monroe, Jeff Bryan Davis, Navia Nguyen, Ravi Patel, C.C. Sheffield, Leyla Milani', 'R', 'Tongue-in-cheek look at 20-something singles clubbing and partying in L.A. Voice-over narration, charts and graphs, and visits to a research laboratory punctuate the story of a single night when groups of friends go out, drink alcohol, take drugs, dance and talk, and look for someone to go home with.', 'Tongue-in-cheek look at 20-something singles clubbing and partying in L.A. Voice-over narration, charts and graphs, and visits to a research laboratory punctuate the story of a single night when groups of friends go out, drink alcohol, take drugs, dance and talk, and look for someone to go home with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KDlKkjCKlGLdcltDI9ssamLj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13170'),
  ('658870943615973669', 'The Boys Are Back', 2009, 'Drama', 'Scott Hicks, Greig Fraser', null, 'Clive Owen, Laura Fraser, Emma Booth, George MacKay, Emma Lung, Natasha Little, Julia Blake, Nicholas McAnulty', 'PG-13', 'When the wife of sports-writer Joe Warr dies of cancer, he takes on the responsibility of raising their 6-year-old son, and his teenage son from a previous marriage. As Joe rejects the counsel of his mother-in-law and other parents, he develops his own philosophies on parenting.', 'When the wife of sports-writer Joe Warr dies of cancer, he takes on the responsibility of raising their 6-year-old son, and his teenage son from a previous marriage. As Joe rejects the counsel of his mother-in-law and other parents, he develops his own philosophies on parenting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sIPtMC5GxLrsSXgdMHXJf8X4qV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23512'),
  ('11667471243416039', 'The Boys Club', 1996, 'Drama, Adventure, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'John Fawcett, Thom Best', 'Peter Wellington', 'Chris Penn, Dominic Zamprogna, Stuart Stone, Devon Sawa, Amy Stewart, Nicholas Campbell, Jarred Blancard, Max Piersig', 'R', 'Three teenage boys in small-town Southern Ontario are thrilled when Luke Cooper, a mysterious American fugitive with a gunshot wound in his leg, decides to crash their secret hideout. Luke tells them that he''s a cop on the run from corrupt colleagues, and swears them to silence. As he recuperates, he becomes their buddy and confidante. By the time the boys realize Luke is not who he pretends to be, they''re in way over their heads', 'Three teenage boys in small-town Southern Ontario are thrilled when Luke Cooper, a mysterious American fugitive with a gunshot wound in his leg, decides to crash their secret hideout. Luke tells them that he''s a cop on the run from corrupt colleagues, and swears them to silence. As he recuperates, he becomes their buddy and confidante. By the time the boys realize Luke is not who he pretends to be, they''re in way over their heads', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axn4MXeCdFCOG7i8i6DvbolzZeG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73339'),
  ('226547993439941986', 'The Boys from Brazil', 1978, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Franklin J. Schaffner, Henri Decaë, Terence Churcher', 'Heywood Gould', 'Gregory Peck, Laurence Olivier, James Mason, Lilli Palmer, Uta Hagen, Steve Guttenberg, Denholm Elliott, Rosemary Harris', 'R', 'Nazi hunter Ezra Lieberman discovers a sinister and bizarre plot, masterminded by Dr. Josef Mengele, to rekindle the Third Reich.', 'Nazi hunter Ezra Lieberman discovers a sinister and bizarre plot, masterminded by Dr. Josef Mengele, to rekindle the Third Reich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7IZT1HJNmWcEj3Axwlwhya02OX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16241'),
  ('255122221356112537', 'The Boys from Fengkuei', 1983, 'Drama', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Chen Kun-hou', 'Chu Tien-Wen', 'Doze Niu Cheng-Tse, Chang Shih, Lin Hsiu-Ling, Grace Chen, Tou Tsung-hua, Yang Li-yin, Fanny Chang Chun-Fang, Yen Cheng-kuo', null, 'Ah-Ching and his friends have just finished school in their island fishing village, and now spend most of their time drinking and fighting. Three of them decide to go to the port city of Kaohsiung to look for work. They find an apartment through relatives, and Ah-Ching is attracted to the girlfriend of a neighbor. There they face the harsh realities of the big city.', 'Ah-Ching and his friends have just finished school in their island fishing village, and now spend most of their time drinking and fighting. Three of them decide to go to the port city of Kaohsiung to look for work. They find an apartment through relatives, and Ah-Ching is attracted to the girlfriend of a neighbor. There they face the harsh realities of the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6evRAtqfodrY9eytNt7Oc7gg0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105703'),
  ('334524711258979305', 'The Boys from Leningrad', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Semyon Timoshenko, Yevgeni Shapiro, Adolf Bergunker', 'Semyon Timoshenko', 'Georgiy Vitsin, Vsevolod Kuznetsov, Pavel Kadochnikov, Tatyana Konyukhova, Valentina Ushakova, Mark Bernes, Vladimir Belokurov, Yelena Tyapkina', null, 'Comedy about brothers Vesnushkin, Sasha and Vasya, who are playing for one team in a National Soccer Competition. However, Sasha falls in love with a beautiful girl and loses his confidence just before the final game, so his brother has to take the lead on the field in order to save the game.', 'Comedy about brothers Vesnushkin, Sasha and Vasya, who are playing for one team in a National Soccer Competition. However, Sasha falls in love with a beautiful girl and loses his confidence just before the final game, so his brother has to take the lead on the field in order to save the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwBInSNZ9VDLwa66xHu6saHvDMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267709'),
  ('1116669459382936085', 'The Boys from St. Petri', 1991, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Søren Kragh-Jacobsen, Dan Laustsen', 'Søren Kragh-Jacobsen, Bjarne Reuter', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Tomas Villum Jensen, Karl Bille, Bent Mejding, Solbjørg Højfeldt, Erik Wedersøe, Steen Springborg, Bjørn Watt-Boolsen', null, 'A group of school-mates form a resistance group in nazi-occupied Denmark.', 'A group of school-mates form a resistance group in nazi-occupied Denmark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nl17JQNO7lMEqS7pFAZLIyCFaog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38586'),
  ('732674632210177253', 'The Boys II', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Louis Saia', 'René Brisebois, François Camirand, Louis Saia', 'Marc Messier, Rémy Girard, Patrick Huard, Serge Thériault, Paul Houde, Luc Guérin, Yvan Ponton, Roc LaFortune', null, 'Our Boys are back a year after their last adventures. This time around, the players of Quebec''s most popular garage league travel to Chamonix, France, to take part in an international amateur hockey tournament.', 'Our Boys are back a year after their last adventures. This time around, the players of Quebec''s most popular garage league travel to Chamonix, France, to take part in an international amateur hockey tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o36DMQwV9rYkAXMpPVbTDxniD6u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42841'),
  ('228340665790389784', 'The Boys III', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Louis Saia', 'François Camirand, Louis Saia, René Brisebois', 'Marc Messier, Rémy Girard, Patrick Huard, Serge Thériault, Paul Houde, Luc Guérin, Yvan Ponton, Roc LaFortune', null, 'Three years have passed. The Boys are still a great hockey team in a garage league. Their coach Stan, in France for three years, returns from his trip to the delight of his troops. However, a wealthy businessman appears in the background and the players feel drawn to the lure of profit until the point where the Boys will face... the Boys.', 'Three years have passed. The Boys are still a great hockey team in a garage league. Their coach Stan, in France for three years, returns from his trip to the delight of his troops. However, a wealthy businessman appears in the background and the players feel drawn to the lure of profit until the point where the Boys will face... the Boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rq0XpPpamC1Se7b7yx7FJYms2Te.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42843'),
  ('887298841182673062', 'The Boys in Blue', 1982, 'Comedy, Family', 'Val Guest, Jack Atcheler', 'Val Guest', 'Bobby Ball, Tommy Cannon, Suzanne Danielle, Roy Kinnear, Eric Sykes, Jack Douglas, Jon Pertwee, Edward Judd', null, 'Sgt. Cannon (Tommy Cannon) and PC Ball (Bobby Ball) run the police station in the quiet town of Little Botham. When the station is threatened with closure due to a lack of crime, they decide to invent some crimes to justify their existence. When they try to steal a painting from a local rich businessman (Roy Kinnear), they accidently stumble across a gang of real art thieves who have just stolen £1 million worth of paintings. It is up to the two bungling cops to stop them escaping with their haul.', 'Sgt. Cannon (Tommy Cannon) and PC Ball (Bobby Ball) run the police station in the quiet town of Little Botham. When the station is threatened with closure due to a lack of crime, they decide to invent some crimes to justify their existence. When they try to steal a painting from a local rich businessman (Roy Kinnear), they accidently stumble across a gang of real art thieves who have just stolen £1 million worth of paintings. It is up to the two bungling cops to stop them escaping with their haul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQaIMGsF2gy7HhP4Rxe1Ub4ExBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68656'),
  ('807407168297068778', 'The Boys in Company C', 1978, 'War', 'Sidney J. Furie, Godfrey A. Godar', 'Rick Natkin, Sidney J. Furie', 'Stan Shaw, Andrew Stevens, James Canning, Michael Lembeck, Craig Wasson, Scott Hylands, James Whitmore Jr., Helen McNeely', 'R', 'Disheartened by futile combat, appalled by the corruption of their South Vietnamese ally, and constantly endangered by the incompetence of their own company commander, the young men find a possible way out of the war. They are told that if they purposely lose a soccer game against a South Vietnamese team, they can spend the rest of their tour playing exhibition games behind the lines.', 'Disheartened by futile combat, appalled by the corruption of their South Vietnamese ally, and constantly endangered by the incompetence of their own company commander, the young men find a possible way out of the war. They are told that if they purposely lose a soccer game against a South Vietnamese team, they can spend the rest of their tour playing exhibition games behind the lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nZyHahR2yrXgkha9IrbAGr3Yni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27521'),
  ('968093101293909900', 'The Boys in the Band', 1970, 'Drama', 'William Friedkin, Arthur J. Ornitz, William C. Gerrity', 'Mart Crowley', 'Kenneth Nelson, Leonard Frey, Peter White, Cliff Gorman, Frederick Combs, Reuben Greene, Laurence Luckinbill, Keith Prentice', 'R', 'A witty, perceptive and devastating look at the personal agendas and suppressed revelations swirling among a group of gay men in Manhattan. Harold is celebrating a birthday, and his friend Michael has drafted some other friends to help commemorate the event. As the evening progresses, the alcohol flows, the knives come out, and Michael''s demand that the group participate in a devious telephone game, unleashing dormant and unspoken emotions.', 'A witty, perceptive and devastating look at the personal agendas and suppressed revelations swirling among a group of gay men in Manhattan. Harold is celebrating a birthday, and his friend Michael has drafted some other friends to help commemorate the event. As the evening progresses, the alcohol flows, the knives come out, and Michael''s demand that the group participate in a devious telephone game, unleashing dormant and unspoken emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgPdZZkM2EVOFlw3e7qEmZv6Po8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34377'),
  ('682634295924370741', 'The Boys in the Band', 2020, 'Drama', 'Joe Mantello, Bill Pope', 'Ned Martel', 'Jim Parsons, Zachary Quinto, Matt Bomer, Andrew Rannells, Michael Benjamin Washington, Robin de Jesús, Tuc Watkins, Charlie Carver', 'R', 'At a birthday party in 1968 New York, a surprise guest and a drunken game leave seven gay friends reckoning with unspoken feelings and buried truths.', 'At a birthday party in 1968 New York, a surprise guest and a drunken game leave seven gay friends reckoning with unspoken feelings and buried truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2D2gi13hnrXWaspWuWmdbEZ8bef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597156'),
  ('942531438645277581', 'The Boys in the Band: Something Personal', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Joel Kazuo Knoernschild', 'Joel Kazuo Knoernschild', 'Mart Crowley, Jim Parsons, Zachary Quinto, Matt Bomer, Andrew Rannells, Charlie Carver, Robin de Jesús, Brian Hutchison', null, 'Decades after his play first put gay life center stage, Mart Crowley joins the cast and crew of the 2020 film to reflect on the story''s enduring legacy.', 'Decades after his play first put gay life center stage, Mart Crowley joins the cast and crew of the 2020 film to reflect on the story''s enduring legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGu4RHBAeOxdRW8ADzfbcrqlAOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748807'),
  ('634248073990504870', 'The Boys in the Boat', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'George Clooney, Jo Tew, Illias Thoms', 'Mark L. Smith', 'Joel Edgerton, Callum Turner, Peter Guinness, Sam Strike, Thomas Elms, Jack Mulhern, Luke Slattery, Bruce Herbelin-Earle', 'PG-13', 'The triumphant underdog story of the University of Washington men''s rowing team, who stunned the world by competing at the 1936 Berlin Olympics.', 'The triumphant underdog story of the University of Washington men''s rowing team, who stunned the world by competing at the 1936 Berlin Olympics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncJMztHprw3gLRAnDjNnnT23CIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823452'),
  ('850670320931299847', 'The Boys Next Door', 1986, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Penelope Spheeris, Arthur Albert, Warren Lewis', 'James Wong, Glen Morgan', 'Maxwell Caulfield, Charlie Sheen, Patti D''Arbanville, Christopher McDonald, Moon Unit Zappa, Hank Garrett, Paul C. Dancer, Blackie Dammett', 'R', 'Roy and Bo leave their small town the weekend after graduation for a short road trip to LA. Soon, they find themselves lashing out and leaving a trail of bodies behind them. The violence escalates throughout.', 'Roy and Bo leave their small town the weekend after graduation for a short road trip to LA. Soon, they find themselves lashing out and leaving a trail of bodies behind them. The violence escalates throughout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfH0EINXeLFJmwaC5YnfUIaLO4L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22323'),
  ('939133962722911779', 'The Boys Next Door', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'John Erman, Frank Tidy', null, 'Nathan Lane, Robert Sean Leonard, Tony Goldwyn, Michael Jeter, Courtney B. Vance, Mare Winningham, Elizabeth Wilson, Richard Jenkins', 'PG', 'Kind-hearted social worker Jack Palmer feels guilty about not spending enough time with his wife due to the pressures of his job taking care of four developmentally disabled men: obsessive-compulsive Norman, bipolar Arnold, childlike Lucien, and schizophrenic Barry. When Jack announces his decision to leave his job, his four charges react quite unexpectedly to the news.', 'Kind-hearted social worker Jack Palmer feels guilty about not spending enough time with his wife due to the pressures of his job taking care of four developmentally disabled men: obsessive-compulsive Norman, bipolar Arnold, childlike Lucien, and schizophrenic Barry. When Jack announces his decision to leave his job, his four charges react quite unexpectedly to the news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2tlnYQdRcRzOz8qOvyXD6bynWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54240'),
  ('239905449430326765', 'The Boys of Paul Street', 1969, 'Family, Drama', 'Zoltán Fábri, György Illés', 'Endre Bohem, Zoltán Fábri', 'Anthony Kemp, William Burleigh, John Moulder-Brown, Robert Efford, Julien Holdaway, Mark Colleano, Gary O''Brien, Martin Beaumont', null, 'In Budapest, two rival gangs of young boys lay claim to a vacant lot. The hostilities escalate yet never quite boil over into actual violence.', 'In Budapest, two rival gangs of young boys lay claim to a vacant lot. The hostilities escalate yet never quite boil over into actual violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cg1ii1WpO8K6KWpGrhy2DKN7NBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41064'),
  ('151895120272469366', 'The Boys of St. Vincent', 1994, 'Drama, Crime', 'John N. Smith, Pierre Letarte, Lisa Porter', 'Sam Grana, Des Walsh, John N. Smith', 'Henry Czerny, Johnny Morina, Brian Dooley, Philip Dinn, Brian Dodd, Ashley Billard, Maurice Podbrey, Jeremy Keefe', null, 'The true story of boys being sexually abused at their orphanage, run by a religious community in Newfoundland.', 'The true story of boys being sexually abused at their orphanage, run by a religious community in Newfoundland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cam0cG0UWdUVtQRvFHJXmNtL1hY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32119'),
  ('694273656174545948', 'The Boys of St. Vincent: 15 Years Later', 1992, 'Drama, Crime', 'John N. Smith, Pierre Letarte, Josée Lachance', 'Des Walsh, Sam Grana, John N. Smith', 'David Hewlett, Henry Czerny, Brian Dodd, Sebastian Spence, Johnny Morina, Timothy Webber, Ashley Billard, Mary Walsh', null, 'Fifteen years after the events of The Boys of St. Vincent took place, the various boys involved are brought in to testify against the brothers, now finally standing trial, who assaulted them when they were children.', 'Fifteen years after the events of The Boys of St. Vincent took place, the various boys involved are brought in to testify against the brothers, now finally standing trial, who assaulted them when they were children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlfW9Id3t40gTZLwELtXr8A6RuF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77840'),
  ('987011260721763659', 'The Boys Who Cried Wolf', 2016, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Kim Jin-hwang', 'Kim Jin-hwang', 'Park Jong-hwan, Kim Yae-eun, Lee Ga-sub, Cha Rae-hyung, Oh Chang-kyung, Ryu Jun-yeol, Ha Jun, Jeon Kwang-jin', null, 'Wan-ju, a failed stage actor, makes ends meet by playing real-life parts as someone’s boyfriend or wingman. Desperate for money, Wan-ju takes on his most challenging role ever when he agrees to pretend to have witnessed a murder.', 'Wan-ju, a failed stage actor, makes ends meet by playing real-life parts as someone’s boyfriend or wingman. Desperate for money, Wan-ju takes on his most challenging role ever when he agrees to pretend to have witnessed a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Mb4Cjsic9CsXd4cJVr9iFwXy3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404486'),
  ('105955736138882778', 'The Boys: The Sherman Brothers'' Story', 2009, 'Documentary, Music', 'Gregory V. Sherman, Jeff Sherman', null, 'Richard M. Sherman, Robert B. Sherman, Julie Andrews, Roy Edward Disney, Randy Newman, John Lasseter, Ben Stiller, Dick Van Dyke', null, 'The troubled fraternal relationship between songwriters Robert B. Sherman and Richard M. Sherman, the Oscar and Grammy-winning Sherman Brothers, famous for the iconic hits they wrote for Disney.', 'The troubled fraternal relationship between songwriters Robert B. Sherman and Richard M. Sherman, the Oscar and Grammy-winning Sherman Brothers, famous for the iconic hits they wrote for Disney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oA5eXc6fefFxlKAxKEJWqACEu2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64831'),
  ('18032134255201067', 'The Bra', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Veit Helmer, Felix Leiberg', 'Veit Helmer', 'Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Denis Lavant, Paz Vega, Chulpan Khamatova, Maia Morgenstern, Irmena Chichikova, Manal Issa, Boryana Manoilova', null, 'Train driver Nurlan’s heading to Baku for the last time before retirement, but on his fateful journey around the neighborhoods of the city his train snags a blue bra off a washing line. To escape from his lonely existence, Nurlan embarks on the most adventurous journey of his life: to find the owner of this perky piece of underwear. He rents a small room in Baku and begins his quest to find his “Cinderella”.', 'Train driver Nurlan’s heading to Baku for the last time before retirement, but on his fateful journey around the neighborhoods of the city his train snags a blue bra off a washing line. To escape from his lonely existence, Nurlan embarks on the most adventurous journey of his life: to find the owner of this perky piece of underwear. He rents a small room in Baku and begins his quest to find his “Cinderella”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bs99POs5bxy5tS7g9s1xipr17iV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498678'),
  ('537079365688823882', 'The Brady Bunch in the White House', 2002, 'Family, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Neal Israel, Robert Seaman', 'Hope Juber, Lloyd J. Schwartz, Sherwood Schwartz', 'Shelley Long, Gary Cole, Chad Doreck, Autumn Reeser, Blake Foster, Ashley Eckstein, Max Morrow, Sofia Vassilieva', null, 'Mike Brady becomes the President of the United States and names Carol as his V.P..', 'Mike Brady becomes the President of the United States and names Carol as his V.P..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkFW2MrGG2Vu2OdtgZtiYK80KH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44347'),
  ('600887590164860497', 'The Brady Bunch Movie', 1995, 'Family, Comedy, Romance', 'Mac Ahlberg, Betty Thomas', 'Rick Copp, Laurice Elehwany, Terry Turner', 'Shelley Long, Gary Cole, Christine Taylor, Christopher Daniel Barnes, Jennifer Elise Cox, Paul Sutera, Olivia Hack, Jesse Lee Soffer', 'PG-13', 'The original ''70s TV family is now placed in the 1990s, where they''re even more square and out of place than ever.', 'The original ''70s TV family is now placed in the 1990s, where they''re even more square and out of place than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbJfBJh5vEf5356Jlm6P37H48hD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9066'),
  ('337525830359252653', 'The Brady Girls Get Married', 1981, 'Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Lester Shorr, Barbara Gelman, Jan R. Lloyd', 'Sherwood Schwartz, Lloyd J. Schwartz', 'Robert Reed, Florence Henderson, Barry Williams, Maureen McCormick, Christopher Knight, Eve Plumb, Mike Lookinland, Susan Olsen', null, 'Made-for-tv movie, the pilot for a "Brady Bunch" revival series, "The Brady Brides." Jan and Marcia have met the men of their dreams and decide to tie the knot. They agree to hold the weddings together in the family''s back yard, but fight over whether to have a modern ceremony or a traditional one. Can the marriages be saved? All of the original cast members (except cousin Oliver) put in a return appearance.', 'Made-for-tv movie, the pilot for a "Brady Bunch" revival series, "The Brady Brides." Jan and Marcia have met the men of their dreams and decide to tie the knot. They agree to hold the weddings together in the family''s back yard, but fight over whether to have a modern ceremony or a traditional one. Can the marriages be saved? All of the original cast members (except cousin Oliver) put in a return appearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6zeFzgNpUNgsfrpHJVomEk03k9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107998'),
  ('491898551785397280', 'The Brahmin and the Butterfly', 1901, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A man attempts to engender a transformation of a giant worm into a butterfly.', 'A man attempts to engender a transformation of a giant worm into a butterfly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJiDNr3QfAn51etaTwHLqTUpWOj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107256'),
  ('1135953951146932179', 'The Braid', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Laetitia Colombani, Ronald Plante, Pietro Belloni', 'Laetitia Colombani, Sarah Kaminsky', 'Kim Raver, Fotinì Peluso, Mia Maelzer, Katharine King So, Avi Nash, Sarah Abbott, Lydia Zadel, Manuela Ventura', null, 'India. Smita is an untouchable. She dreams of seeing her daughter escape her miserable condition and enter school. Italy. Giulia works in her father’s workshop. When he has an accident, she discovers that the family business is ruined. Canada. Sarah, a successful lawyer, is about to be promoted to the head of her firm when she learns that she is ill. Three lives, three women, three continents. Three battles to fight. Although they don’t know each other, Smita, Giulia and Sarah are unknowingly linked by their most intimate and singular bond.', 'India. Smita is an untouchable. She dreams of seeing her daughter escape her miserable condition and enter school. Italy. Giulia works in her father’s workshop. When he has an accident, she discovers that the family business is ruined. Canada. Sarah, a successful lawyer, is about to be promoted to the head of her firm when she learns that she is ill. Three lives, three women, three continents. Three battles to fight. Although they don’t know each other, Smita, Giulia and Sarah are unknowingly linked by their most intimate and singular bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJnYgLeefl3ebgB5mHwSstSRreF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989596'),
  ('165755120025281527', 'The Brain', 1962, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Horror', 'Freddie Francis', 'Robert Banks Stewart, Philip Mackie', 'Anne Heywood, Peter van Eyck, Cecil Parker, Bernard Lee, Ellen Schwiers, Siegfried Lowitz, Hans Nielsen, Jeremy Spenser', 'NR', 'After the mysterious crash of a millionaire''s private plane, scientists secretly harvest the dying man''s brain and keep it alive in a laboratory in order to communicate via telepathy.', 'After the mysterious crash of a millionaire''s private plane, scientists secretly harvest the dying man''s brain and keep it alive in a laboratory in order to communicate via telepathy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4DJn97E7NF1zj9q6surMBWRb4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146852'),
  ('430513127449499078', 'The Brain', 1969, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Gérard Oury, Marc Monnet, Gérard Guérin', 'Danièle Thompson, Marcel Jullian, Gérard Oury', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Bourvil, David Niven, Eli Wallach, Silvia Monti, Raymond Gérôme, Fernand Guiot, Jacques Balutin', 'PG', 'Arthur and Anatole are two little robbers. They want to rob money, money that will travel in a special train from Paris to Bruxelles. They don''t know that other people have planned to do the same thing.', 'Arthur and Anatole are two little robbers. They want to rob money, money that will travel in a special train from Paris to Bruxelles. They don''t know that other people have planned to do the same thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCtaWDaOiGPVEoo7tiPBSH7sQx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33436'),
  ('290032895541678078', 'The Brain', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ed Hunt, Gilles Corbeil, Randi Richmond', 'Barry Pearson', 'Tom Bresnahan, Cynthia Preston, David Gale, George Buza, Bret Pearson, Christine Kossak, Bernice Quiggan, Susannah Hoffmann', 'R', 'Dr. Blake runs a TV show called "Independent Thinkers", which is sort of a Scientology-like self-help/religion program. But he''s not making his audience think any more independently - with the help of an alien organism he calls The Brain, he''s using brainwashing and mind control. The only thing that stands between them and world domination is a brilliant but troubled high school student with a penchant for pranks...', 'Dr. Blake runs a TV show called "Independent Thinkers", which is sort of a Scientology-like self-help/religion program. But he''s not making his audience think any more independently - with the help of an alien organism he calls The Brain, he''s using brainwashing and mind control. The only thing that stands between them and world domination is a brilliant but troubled high school student with a penchant for pranks...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kCTNR4709IFljoKoID5Ii06Rj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40222'),
  ('632972413846011167', 'The Brain Eaters', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Bruno VeSota, Lawrence Raimond, Mike Murphy', 'Gordon Urquhart', 'Ed Nelson, Joanna Lee, Cornelius Keefe, Alan Jay Factor, Jody Fair, David Hughes, Robert Ball, Phil Posner', 'NR', 'A huge, alien structure resembling an inverted cone, appears in the woods outside a small rural town. Sent from Washington to investigate the origin of the mysterious object, a team of investigators discovers that intelligent parasites from inside the "cone" can attach themselves to humans'' nervous systems and control their minds, taking control of the authorities and workers, making communication with the outside world impossible, and leaving the responsibility of stopping the invasion up to seven people who have thus far been able to avoid possession by these creatures from parts unknown.', 'A huge, alien structure resembling an inverted cone, appears in the woods outside a small rural town. Sent from Washington to investigate the origin of the mysterious object, a team of investigators discovers that intelligent parasites from inside the "cone" can attach themselves to humans'' nervous systems and control their minds, taking control of the authorities and workers, making communication with the outside world impossible, and leaving the responsibility of stopping the invasion up to seven people who have thus far been able to avoid possession by these creatures from parts unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b38BGdGMy5ExdIAOdfLcSanYgJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52204'),
  ('140312150651912716', 'The Brain from Planet Arous', 1957, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jacques R. Marquette, Nathan Juran, Bert Chervin', 'Ray Buffum', 'John Agar, Joyce Meadows, Robert Fuller, Thomas Browne Henry, Henry Travis, E. Leslie Thomas, Tim Graham, Bill Giorgio', null, 'An evil alien brain, bent on world domination, takes over the body of an atomic scientist, while a "good" alien brain inhabits the body of the scientist''s dog and waits for an opportunity to defeat the evil brain.', 'An evil alien brain, bent on world domination, takes over the body of an atomic scientist, while a "good" alien brain inhabits the body of the scientist''s dog and waits for an opportunity to defeat the evil brain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpxIaxnnld60lEI5Ix8gQVsNDtg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43248'),
  ('1050930985397034271', 'The Brain Machine', 1972, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Joy N. Houck Jr., Robert A. Weaver', 'Thomas Hal Phillips, Joy N. Houck Jr., Christian Garrison', 'James Best, Barbara Burgess, Gil Peterson, Gerald McRaney, Marcus J. Grapes, Doug Collins, Ann Latham, Thomas Hal Phillips', null, 'Several people volunteer for a scientific experiment about mind-reading and memory, but the experiment goes horribly wrong.', 'Several people volunteer for a scientific experiment about mind-reading and memory, but the experiment goes horribly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AWgEDOiik9T2K7nzg9leObd7d7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86939'),
  ('297400097022798744', 'The Brain Man', 2013, 'Crime, Science Fiction, Action', 'Tomoyuki Takimoto, Toyomichi Kurita, Hajime Gonno', 'Katsuhiko Manabe, Izuru Narushima', 'Toma Ikuta, Yasuko Matsuyuki, Yosuke Eguchi, Fumi Nikaido, Kensuke Owada, Ken Mitsuishi, Masahiro Komoto, Yukiyoshi Ozawa', null, 'A seemingly random series of bombings in a provincial city. The latest target is a public bus route. Detective Chaya chased terrorists and arrested a mysterious man with keen intelligence and physical power. The psychologist in charge of evaluating him is Dr. Mariko. After the psychiatric examination, she puts toward a hypothesis – “Is it possible he was born without emotions?”', 'A seemingly random series of bombings in a provincial city. The latest target is a public bus route. Detective Chaya chased terrorists and arrested a mysterious man with keen intelligence and physical power. The psychologist in charge of evaluating him is Dr. Mariko. After the psychiatric examination, she puts toward a hypothesis – “Is it possible he was born without emotions?”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1czIkoRpfyQ2zuQTKahfYyl5Vb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204053'),
  ('910429497610867958', 'The Brain That Wouldn''t Die', 1962, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Joseph Green, Stephen Hajnal, Tony LaMarca', 'Joseph Green', 'Jason Evers, Virginia Leith, Leslie Daniels, Adele Lamont, Bonnie Sharie, Doris Brent, Paula Morris, Marilyn Hanold', 'NR', 'Dr. Bill Cortner and his fiancée, Jan Compton, are driving to his lab when they get into a horrible car accident. Compton is decapitated. But Cortner is not fazed by this seemingly insurmountable hurdle. His expertise is in transplants, and he is excited to perform the first head transplant. Keeping Compton''s head alive in his lab, Cortner plans the groundbreaking yet unorthodox surgery. First, however, he needs a body.', 'Dr. Bill Cortner and his fiancée, Jan Compton, are driving to his lab when they get into a horrible car accident. Compton is decapitated. But Cortner is not fazed by this seemingly insurmountable hurdle. His expertise is in transplants, and he is excited to perform the first head transplant. Keeping Compton''s head alive in his lab, Cortner plans the groundbreaking yet unorthodox surgery. First, however, he needs a body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npg6NH4maZ4NTTWzA71KNCTvQNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33468'),
  ('632052435312141036', 'The Brainiac', 1962, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Chano Urueta, José Ortiz Ramos', 'Federico Curiel', 'Abel Salazar, Ariadna Welter, David Silva, Germán Robles, Luis Aragón, Mauricio Garcés, Ofelia Guilmáin, René Cardona', null, 'In 1661 Mexico, the Baron Vitelius of Astara is sentenced to be burned alive by the Holy Inquisition of Mexico for witchcraft, necromancy, and other crimes. As he dies, the Baron swears vengeance against the descendants of the Inquisitors. 300 years later, a comet that was passing overhead on the night of the Baron''s execution returns to earth, bringing with it the Baron in the form of a horrible, brain-eating monster that terrorizes the Inquisitor''s descendants', 'In 1661 Mexico, the Baron Vitelius of Astara is sentenced to be burned alive by the Holy Inquisition of Mexico for witchcraft, necromancy, and other crimes. As he dies, the Baron swears vengeance against the descendants of the Inquisitors. 300 years later, a comet that was passing overhead on the night of the Baron''s execution returns to earth, bringing with it the Baron in the form of a horrible, brain-eating monster that terrorizes the Inquisitor''s descendants', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCtRflp5RrPnxfOyLZCq09DVn1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42992'),
  ('88109825242541332', 'The Branches of the Tree', 1990, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Barun Raha', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Ajit Banerjee, Soumitra Chatterjee, Haradhan Bandyopadhyay, Dipankar Dey, Ranjit Mallick, Lily Chakravarty, Mamata Shankar, Soham Chakraborty', null, 'When a wealthy patriarch falls ill on his 70th birthday, three of his sons rush in from Calcutta, leading to a reunion filled with painful ironies and lingering disillusionment. As the family—including an addled fourth son who lives with the old man—watches and waits, the static occasion brings out simmering tensions in their family dynamics, from the father’s moral rectitude to the business ambition of two sons and the withdrawal of their siblings.', 'When a wealthy patriarch falls ill on his 70th birthday, three of his sons rush in from Calcutta, leading to a reunion filled with painful ironies and lingering disillusionment. As the family—including an addled fourth son who lives with the old man—watches and waits, the static occasion brings out simmering tensions in their family dynamics, from the father’s moral rectitude to the business ambition of two sons and the withdrawal of their siblings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPgUUjL6xs9ceZz9WgiHtvqOzSz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256101'),
  ('522685282448602194', 'The Brand New Adventures of Aladdin', 2018, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Lionel Steketee', 'Daive Cohen', 'Kev Adams, Jamel Debbouze, Ramzy Bedia, Éric Judor, Noémie Lenoir, Vanessa Guide, Wahid Bouzidi, Booder', null, 'After freeing Baghdad from its terrible ruler, Aladin delays his marriage to the princess until a new dictator arrives to take over the city.', 'After freeing Baghdad from its terrible ruler, Aladin delays his marriage to the princess until a new dictator arrives to take over the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dolYOzR2SnRRkNeRV6yE1c3bsxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459616'),
  ('877809093424436088', 'The Brand New Testament', 2015, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Christophe Beaucarne, Jaco Van Dormael, Renaud Alcalde', 'Jaco Van Dormael, Thomas Gunzig', 'Pili Groyne, Benoît Poelvoorde, Yolande Moreau, Catherine Deneuve, François Damiens, Serge Larivière, Didier De Neck, Laura Verlinden', null, 'God lives in Brussels. On Earth though, God is a coward, morally pathetic and odious to his family. His daughter, Ea, is bored at home and can''t stand being locked up in a small apartment in ordinary Brussels, until the day she decides to revolt against her dad...', 'God lives in Brussels. On Earth though, God is a coward, morally pathetic and odious to his family. His daughter, Ea, is bored at home and can''t stand being locked up in a small apartment in ordinary Brussels, until the day she decides to revolt against her dad...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRKgcuXSP9KiGlh2tlS85oh6ceN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330764'),
  ('670584162222722046', 'The Brandon Teena Story', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Susan Muska, Gréta Olafsdóttir', null, 'Kate Bornstein', null, 'Documentary about Brandon Teena, a transgender man who was murdered along with two others in 1993 in rural Nebraska.', 'Documentary about Brandon Teena, a transgender man who was murdered along with two others in 1993 in rural Nebraska.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VUVDdbInXCTn4X2ViCkIYE33r5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113096'),
  ('18023255909270485', 'The Brasher Doubloon', 1947, 'Mystery, Crime', 'John Brahm, Lloyd Ahern Sr., Alfred Newman', 'Leonard Praskins', 'George Montgomery, Nancy Guild, Florence Bates, Roy Roberts, Fritz Kortner, Conrad Janis, Marvin Miller, Reed Hadley', null, 'Mrs. Elizabeth Bright Murdock hires Marlowe to find an old rare coin, the Brasher Doubloon, that belonged in her deceased husband''s collection. Marlowe begins investigating, but quickly finds himself entangled in a series of unexplained murders.', 'Mrs. Elizabeth Bright Murdock hires Marlowe to find an old rare coin, the Brasher Doubloon, that belonged in her deceased husband''s collection. Marlowe begins investigating, but quickly finds himself entangled in a series of unexplained murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eneuf3VaJaMaVlZaFpcfV46VNnm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1840'),
  ('549076291100780600', 'The Brass Bottle', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Clifford Stine, Joseph E. Kenney, Carl Beringer', 'Oscar Brodney', 'Tony Randall, Burl Ives, Barbara Eden, Kamala Devi, Edward Andrews, Richard Erdman, Kathie Browne, Ann Doran', 'NR', 'A genie tends to get his master into more predicaments than he gets him out of.', 'A genie tends to get his master into more predicaments than he gets him out of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kw5rNiAXKgKkTZhR63cvKQPlORR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63083'),
  ('682548085528784554', 'The Brass Teapot', 2012, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Ramaa Mosley, Peter Simonite', 'Tim Macy', 'Juno Temple, Michael Angarano, Alexis Bledel, Billy Magnussen, Alia Shawkat, Bobby Moynihan, Steve Park, Ben Rappaport', 'R', 'When a couple discovers that a brass teapot makes them money whenever they hurt themselves, they must come to terms with how far they are willing to go.', 'When a couple discovers that a brass teapot makes them money whenever they hurt themselves, they must come to terms with how far they are willing to go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6txTmb8OIimrQezgD8ERMmrrbnT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127867'),
  ('55111914242896729', 'The Brat', 1931, 'Comedy', 'John Ford, Joseph H. August', 'S. N. Behrman, Sonya Levien', 'Sally O''Neil, Alan Dinehart, Frank Albertson, William Collier Sr., Virginia Cherrill, June Collyer, J. Farrell MacDonald, Mary Forbes', 'NR', 'A society novelist brings a brash young chorus girl home in order to study her for inspiration for his new novel. His family is distraught, but soon her behavior has forever altered their snobbish ways.', 'A society novelist brings a brash young chorus girl home in order to study her for inspiration for his new novel. His family is distraught, but soon her behavior has forever altered their snobbish ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3jPgMKJF4z6BOfo6AFJmi27Fa0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323108'),
  ('571255191957728084', 'The Brats', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Marciano, Jean-Paul Agostini, Pierre-Jacques Bénichou', 'Max Boublil, Noé Debré, Mona Achache', 'Alain Chabat, Max Boublil, Sandrine Kiberlain, Mélanie Bernier, Arié Elmaleh, Elisa Sednaoui, Alban Lenoir, François Dunoyer', null, 'Newly engaged, Thomas meets his future father-in-law Gilbert, who has been married for 30 years to Suzanne. Disillusioned Gilbert is convinced that his marriage has meant he''s missed out on life. He persuades Thomas not to marry his daughter Lola and encourages him to drop everything else in his life as well. The two men then throw themselves into a new brats'' life full of adventure, convinced that freedom is elsewhere. But at what cost do we rediscover our adolescent dreams?', 'Newly engaged, Thomas meets his future father-in-law Gilbert, who has been married for 30 years to Suzanne. Disillusioned Gilbert is convinced that his marriage has meant he''s missed out on life. He persuades Thomas not to marry his daughter Lola and encourages him to drop everything else in his life as well. The two men then throw themselves into a new brats'' life full of adventure, convinced that freedom is elsewhere. But at what cost do we rediscover our adolescent dreams?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84tyCh0H9iG1NRRUtCSbKmADoye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183836'),
  ('35942915854846773', 'The Bravados', 1958, 'Western', 'Henry King, Leon Shamroy, Stanley Hough', 'Philip Yordan', 'Gregory Peck, Joan Collins, Stephen Boyd, Albert Salmi, Henry Silva, Kathleen Gallant, Barry Coe, George Voskovec', 'NR', 'Jim Douglass arrives in the small town of Rio Arriba in order to witness the hanging of the four men he believes murdered his wife. When the convicts escape, Jim tracks them into Mexico, determined to see that justice is done. But the farther Jim goes in his quest for vengeance, the more merciless he becomes, losing himself in an unrelenting spiral of hatred and violence.', 'Jim Douglass arrives in the small town of Rio Arriba in order to witness the hanging of the four men he believes murdered his wife. When the convicts escape, Jim tracks them into Mexico, determined to see that justice is done. But the farther Jim goes in his quest for vengeance, the more merciless he becomes, losing himself in an unrelenting spiral of hatred and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKWu7yUqG4QAY9FuIiBDLGjQWRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61564'),
  ('670066089605307320', 'The Brave', 1997, 'Drama', 'Johnny Depp, Eugene D. Shlugleit, Vilko Filač', null, 'Johnny Depp, Marshall Bell, Elpidia Carrillo, Marlon Brando, Frederic Forrest, Clarence Williams III, Max Perlich, Luis Guzmán', null, 'A down-on-his-luck American Indian recently released from jail is offered the chance to "star" as the victim of a snuff film, the resulting pay of which could greatly help his poverty stricken family.', 'A down-on-his-luck American Indian recently released from jail is offered the chance to "star" as the victim of a snuff film, the resulting pay of which could greatly help his poverty stricken family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Img3pLjIsZQbOzAqei0v5920Vi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9956'),
  ('145396683784702655', 'The Brave Archer', 1977, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Kung Mu-To', 'Ni Kuang', 'Alexander Fu Sheng, Tien Niu, Phillip Kwok Chui, Ku Feng, Eddie Koo Koon Chung, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Li Yi-Min', null, 'Guo Jing and Yang Kang are the sons of two rebels. The rebels are killed by imperial soldiers and the boys are rescued by six pugilists later. The pugilists agree to separate the two boys, tutor them separately in martial arts, and let them meet again when they have grown up, to determine whose abilities are better. Guo becomes the student of the "Seven Freaks of Jiangnan" while Yang Kang becomes the foster son of a Jurchen prince inadvertently.', 'Guo Jing and Yang Kang are the sons of two rebels. The rebels are killed by imperial soldiers and the boys are rescued by six pugilists later. The pugilists agree to separate the two boys, tutor them separately in martial arts, and let them meet again when they have grown up, to determine whose abilities are better. Guo becomes the student of the "Seven Freaks of Jiangnan" while Yang Kang becomes the foster son of a Jurchen prince inadvertently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJjQKm3qZI7sXwa1AlrWG4x9Bp0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73749'),
  ('713951756520935757', 'The Brave Blacksmith', 1984, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Petr Švéda, Jiří Kolín, Ivan Frič', 'Bohumil Steiner, Jaroslav Petřík', 'Pavel Kříž, Ján Kroner, Jiří Knot, Vlado Müller, Viliam Polónyi, Petr Čepek, Martina Bezoušková, Jana Tomšů', null, 'Young blacksmith Mikeš sets out into the world for an adventure, accompanied by the miller''s assistant Matěj and the boy Ondra. On their journey to rescue three enchanted princesses, the young men encounter a mischievous old hag, magic, and traps set by the Black King, but most importantly, they face their own temptations.', 'Young blacksmith Mikeš sets out into the world for an adventure, accompanied by the miller''s assistant Matěj and the boy Ondra. On their journey to rescue three enchanted princesses, the young men encounter a mischievous old hag, magic, and traps set by the Black King, but most importantly, they face their own temptations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4BytOdnS3pBhKT9egWkA6wYkhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55511'),
  ('201473192224244798', 'The Brave Engineer', 1950, 'Animation, Family', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Jerry Colonna, Ken Darby, Jon Dodson, Bud Linn, Rad Robinson', 'G', 'Casey Jones is one of the best engineers there is and it is his duty to get his cargo to its destination on time via train. He sets off but is set back by a number of unfortunate circumstances such as a rain storm, a cow on the tracks, a mad bomber, and finally, when his train starts falling apart. Worst of all, he is on a collision course with another train coming in the opposite direction. After a terrific crash, the man at the train station assumes the worst when Casey doesn''t show up but, to his delight, Casey finally makes it to his destination a total wreck but on time (almost).', 'Casey Jones is one of the best engineers there is and it is his duty to get his cargo to its destination on time via train. He sets off but is set back by a number of unfortunate circumstances such as a rain storm, a cow on the tracks, a mad bomber, and finally, when his train starts falling apart. Worst of all, he is on a collision course with another train coming in the opposite direction. After a terrific crash, the man at the train station assumes the worst when Casey doesn''t show up but, to his delight, Casey finally makes it to his destination a total wreck but on time (almost).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42hPStDkAqood9jJ1Ax7n8hpaM3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78482'),
  ('534400776198742831', 'The Brave Little Tailor', 1956, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Helmut Spieß, Robert Baberske', 'Kurt Bortfeldt', 'Kurt Schmidtchen, Christel Bodenstein, Gisela Kretzschmar, Horst Drinda, Fred Kronström, Gerd Michael Henneberg, Fred Mahr, Wolf Kaiser', null, 'When Prince Vain got his shirt fixed, he proclaims that he had slain two lizards in front of the tailor''s house - "two in one strike". When the tailor swats seven flies at once, he sows himself a banner saying "seven in one strike", and together with his bird he starts a journey into the world to pronounce his deed.', 'When Prince Vain got his shirt fixed, he proclaims that he had slain two lizards in front of the tailor''s house - "two in one strike". When the tailor swats seven flies at once, he sows himself a banner saying "seven in one strike", and together with his bird he starts a journey into the world to pronounce his deed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUBtivrhyJbtujm4X03mWsA9LZn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13102'),
  ('1074081099376000452', 'The Brave Little Toaster', 1987, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Jerry Rees', 'Jerry Rees, Joe Ranft', 'Deanna Oliver, Jon Lovitz, Timothy Stack, Phil Hartman, Timothy E. Day, Thurl Ravenscroft, Joe Ranft, Judy Toll', 'G', 'A group of dated appliances, finding themselves stranded in a summer home that their family had just sold, decide to seek out their eight year old ''master''.', 'A group of dated appliances, finding themselves stranded in a summer home that their family had just sold, decide to seek out their eight year old ''master''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEZcPMNRqTcotOZSttN5MtmJbu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19933'),
  ('236482455791019345', 'The Brave Little Toaster Goes to Mars', 1998, 'Animation, Family', 'Robert C. Ramirez', 'Thomas M. Disch', 'Deanna Oliver, Thurl Ravenscroft, Roger Kabler, Stephen Tobolowsky, Eric Lloyd, Farrah Fawcett, Wayne Knight, Fyvush Finkel', 'G', 'Based on the book by Thomas M. Disch and intended as the third film in the series, this sequel was finished and released prior to ''The Brave Little Toaster To The Rescue''. Whilst trying to protect their new "Little Master" the anthropomorphic appliances set off on an epic adventure and make many new friends along the way.', 'Based on the book by Thomas M. Disch and intended as the third film in the series, this sequel was finished and released prior to ''The Brave Little Toaster To The Rescue''. Whilst trying to protect their new "Little Master" the anthropomorphic appliances set off on an epic adventure and make many new friends along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zO6SF0qLZfgSVRIfk8Y8l4hmN5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20377'),
  ('621126291511666427', 'The Brave Little Toaster to the Rescue', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Brian Chavanne, Mary Hidalgo, Robert C. Ramirez', 'Willard Carroll', 'Jessica Tuck, Chris Young, Roger Kabler, Deanna Oliver, Eric Lloyd, Thurl Ravenscroft, Andy Daly, Jonathan Benair', 'G', 'When Toaster and the gang spark friendships with the playful animals at the veterinary hospital, they soon discover their new pals are about to be sent to a testing laboratory.', 'When Toaster and the gang spark friendships with the playful animals at the veterinary hospital, they soon discover their new pals are about to be sent to a testing laboratory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCJEMzVnxQC6fdxY9W3eDf3EFfl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20378'),
  ('603456510168178284', 'The Brave One', 1956, 'Family, Drama', 'Irving Rapper, Jack Cardiff', 'Dalton Trumbo, Merrill G. White, Harry S. Franklin', 'Michel Ray, Rodolfo Hoyos Jr., Elsa Cárdenas, Carlos Navarro, Joi Lansing, Rafael Alcayde, Miguel Ángel Ferriz Sr., Fermín Rivera', 'NR', 'A young Mexican boy tirelessly tries to save his pet bull from death at the hands of a celebrated matador.', 'A young Mexican boy tirelessly tries to save his pet bull from death at the hands of a celebrated matador.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDoRHflS5fzFYJWmdtmUnA8iQrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107443'),
  ('1106685043838523359', 'The Brave One', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Neil Jordan, Philippe Rousselot, Marion Kolsby', 'Bruce A. Taylor, Cynthia Mort, Roderick Taylor', 'Jodie Foster, Terrence Howard, Nicky Katt, Naveen Andrews, Mary Steenburgen, Ene Oloja, Luis Da Silva, Jr., Blaze Foster', 'R', 'A woman struggles to recover from a brutal attack by setting out on a mission for revenge.', 'A woman struggles to recover from a brutal attack by setting out on a mission for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdbOFY9ZnmOcxbNThJqGaIGCOow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4413'),
  ('758455638613869784', 'The Brave Seven', 1936, 'History, Drama, Adventure', 'A. Golyshev, N. Alexeev, Evgeny Velichko', 'Yuri German, Sergei Gerasimov', 'Nikolai Bogolyubov, Tamara Makarova, Ivan Novoseltsev, Oleg Zhakov, Andrei Apsolon, Ivan Kuznetsov, Pyotr Aleynikov', null, 'Six polar explorers arrives to a remote island in Arctic for a year-long scientific expedition. When their ship departs, they unpack only to find a young stowaway, who romanticized Arctic heroes, and tried to join them on multiple occasions finally succeeding. That''s how six became seven. Life of polar explorers is tough, and full of danger. During one year they are largely isolated from the mainland, and should survive using their resourcefulness, smarts, knowledge, and existing supplies with occasional unreliable radio communications. The Seven are resilient, cheerful, they forged a true friendship. Now they are ready to face the unforgiving Arctic.', 'Six polar explorers arrives to a remote island in Arctic for a year-long scientific expedition. When their ship departs, they unpack only to find a young stowaway, who romanticized Arctic heroes, and tried to join them on multiple occasions finally succeeding. That''s how six became seven. Life of polar explorers is tough, and full of danger. During one year they are largely isolated from the mainland, and should survive using their resourcefulness, smarts, knowledge, and existing supplies with occasional unreliable radio communications. The Seven are resilient, cheerful, they forged a true friendship. Now they are ready to face the unforgiving Arctic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtPwiAicRk3kH1qnrF1sI9wGKUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158725'),
  ('498723190680411973', 'The Brave Tin Soldier', 1976, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Lev Milchin, Mikhail Druyan, Boris Filchikov', 'Alla Akhundova', 'Mariya Vinogradova, Aleksey Konsovskiy, Sergei Tseits', null, 'A beautiful and touching story based on Hans Christian Andersen''s fairy tale "The Steadfast Tin Soldier". A tin soldier without a leg sees a beautiful paper ballerina and falls in love. While trying to reach her, he falls from the window and has to overcome countless obstacles to see her again.', 'A beautiful and touching story based on Hans Christian Andersen''s fairy tale "The Steadfast Tin Soldier". A tin soldier without a leg sees a beautiful paper ballerina and falls in love. While trying to reach her, he falls from the window and has to overcome countless obstacles to see her again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuDS7vajvO3VFqgD8VrMSAN6d7A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90566'),
  ('951566193662097916', 'The Braves', 2022, 'Drama', 'Anaïs Volpé, Sean Price Williams', 'Anaïs Volpé', 'Souheila Yacoub, Déborah Lukumuena, Sveva Alviti, Angélique Kidjo, Sara Verhagen, Véronique Frumy, Elie Mittelmann, Matthieu Longatte', null, 'Best friends Alma and Margot are inseparable, whether it’s terrorizing cheating lovers or crashing wedding parties. The two women also share the same dream of a successful career on the stage. They get one step closer when they are cast as lead and understudy in a high-profile play in Paris. Alma is keeping a secret that puts her role in jeopardy, but with the unwavering support of Margot, they will try their best to ensure that the show goes on.', 'Best friends Alma and Margot are inseparable, whether it’s terrorizing cheating lovers or crashing wedding parties. The two women also share the same dream of a successful career on the stage. They get one step closer when they are cast as lead and understudy in a high-profile play in Paris. Alma is keeping a secret that puts her role in jeopardy, but with the unwavering support of Margot, they will try their best to ensure that the show goes on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ojKJUxvBdfVA9yAFdS7hXTDZ75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833421'),
  ('518740470755284278', 'The Bravest', 2019, 'Drama, Action', 'Shengji Liang, Tony Chan', 'Yu Yonggan, Tony Chan', 'Huang Xiaoming, Du Jiang, Tan Zhuo, Yang Zi, Ou Hao, Jason Koo, Hou Yong, Yin Xiaotian', null, 'Based on real life events, the film revolves around the heroic efforts of a team of firefighters as they attempt to deal with a fire that breaks out at an oil refinery in Dalian.', 'Based on real life events, the film revolves around the heroic efforts of a team of firefighters as they attempt to deal with a fire that breaks out at an oil refinery in Dalian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuFHsaAyTxbCBXDDXuvbaUqFxwz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605375'),
  ('440627942126046249', 'The Brazilwood Man', 1982, 'Comedy, History, Fantasy', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade, Marco Antonio Cury, Suzana de Moraes', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade', 'Ítala Nandi, Flávio Galvão, Regina Duarte, Cristina Aché, Dina Sfat, Dora Pellegrino, Grande Otelo, Paulo Hesse', null, 'Fantasy comedy about Brazilian writer Oswald de Andrade, one of the most important icons of Modernism in Brazil. In the film, Oswald is played by two actors: Ítala Nandi, as his feminine anima, and Flávio Galvão, as the masculine half.', 'Fantasy comedy about Brazilian writer Oswald de Andrade, one of the most important icons of Modernism in Brazil. In the film, Oswald is played by two actors: Ítala Nandi, as his feminine anima, and Flávio Galvão, as the masculine half.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydobloKEzmMmmeNinke4D5rP2bG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74432'),
  ('817705775563430668', 'The Breach', 1970, 'Thriller', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier, Paul Collet', 'Claude Chabrol', 'Stéphane Audran, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Jean-Claude Drouot, Michel Bouquet, Michel Duchaussoy, Annie Cordy, Jean Carmet, Catherine Rouvel', null, 'An innocent woman falls prey to her abusive husband, his wealthy father and a shady family friend.', 'An innocent woman falls prey to her abusive husband, his wealthy father and a shady family friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiX8v5NPmnxQvIPxb6aZp76UYeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4266'),
