  ('43927360728339478', 'The Bread and Alley', 1970, 'Drama, Family', 'Abbas Kiarostami, Arapik Baghdasarian, Mehrdad Fakhimi', 'Taghi Kiarostami', 'Reza Hashemi, Mehdi Shahravanfar', null, 'After returning from an errand to get bread, a young boy encounters a dog that frightens him making the journey to get home more difficult than he could’ve imagined.', 'After returning from an errand to get bread, a young boy encounters a dog that frightens him making the journey to get home more difficult than he could’ve imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lurWAbXDF7SBU6ePVlOvxdHR5Mr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128442'),
  ('1015465936297551484', 'The Break-Up', 2006, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Peyton Reed, Eric Alan Edwards, Todd Amateau', 'Jeremy Garelick, Jay Lavender', 'Jennifer Aniston, Vince Vaughn, Joey Lauren Adams, Ann-Margret, Jason Bateman, Judy Davis, Vincent D''Onofrio, Jon Favreau', 'PG-13', 'Pushed to the breaking-up point after their latest ''why can''t you do this one little thing for me?'' argument, Brooke calls it quits with her boyfriend Gary. What follows is a hilarious series of remedies, war tactics, overtures and undermining tricks – all encouraged by the former couple''s friends and confidantes …and the occasional total stranger! When neither ex is willing to move out of their shared apartment, the only solution is to continue living as hostile roommates until one of them reaches breaking point.', 'Pushed to the breaking-up point after their latest ''why can''t you do this one little thing for me?'' argument, Brooke calls it quits with her boyfriend Gary. What follows is a hilarious series of remedies, war tactics, overtures and undermining tricks – all encouraged by the former couple''s friends and confidantes …and the occasional total stranger! When neither ex is willing to move out of their shared apartment, the only solution is to continue living as hostile roommates until one of them reaches breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghCLIPRZNAndBoIZJ8f7lN5Mlly.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9767'),
  ('1081772335043903342', 'The Break-up Artist', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Steve Woo, C. Kim Miles, Blair Freeman-Marsh', 'Patrick Andrew O''Connor', 'Amanda Crew, Ryan Kennedy, Moneca Delain, Ali Liebert, Serinda Swan, Peter Benson, Tiffani Timms', 'PG-13', 'A woman who gets paid to break people up is forced to become a matchmaker when some new competition muscles her out of the break-up business. Now, in order to save her company (and keep her high-priced wardrobe) she''ll have to rely on her old nemesis: love.', 'A woman who gets paid to break people up is forced to become a matchmaker when some new competition muscles her out of the break-up business. Now, in order to save her company (and keep her high-priced wardrobe) she''ll have to rely on her old nemesis: love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqa5c7se84Pm0lJgd1AJsZtEnA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25356'),
  ('1046597788725483547', 'The Breaker Upperers', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Madeleine Sami, Jackie van Beek, Ginny Loane', 'Jackie van Beek, Madeleine Sami', 'Jackie van Beek, Madeleine Sami, Celia Pacquola, James Rolleston, Ana Scotney, Carl Bland, Brett O’Gorman, Cohen Holloway', null, 'Two women run a business breaking up couples for cash but when one develops a conscience their friendship unravels.', 'Two women run a business breaking up couples for cash but when one develops a conscience their friendship unravels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DtpXhqpS4okrnZvgTgf7PQjTgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502143'),
  ('51605032958254523', 'The Breakfast Club', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Hughes, Thomas Del Ruth, Robert P. Cohen', 'John Hughes', 'Emilio Estevez, Judd Nelson, Molly Ringwald, Anthony Michael Hall, Ally Sheedy, Paul Gleason, John Kapelos, Perry Crawford', 'R', 'Five high school students from different walks of life endure a Saturday detention under a power-hungry principal. The disparate group includes rebel John, princess Claire, outcast Allison, brainy Brian and Andrew, the jock. Each has a chance to tell his or her story, making the others see them a little differently -- and when the day ends, they question whether school will ever be the same.', 'Five high school students from different walks of life endure a Saturday detention under a power-hungry principal. The disparate group includes rebel John, princess Claire, outcast Allison, brainy Brian and Andrew, the jock. Each has a chance to tell his or her story, making the others see them a little differently -- and when the day ends, they question whether school will ever be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gp4zlj7wgbiofLMNsTPndMuO3PN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2108'),
  ('1082570579998343792', 'The Breaking Ice', 2023, 'Drama', 'Anthony Chen, Yu Jing-pin', 'Anthony Chen', 'Zhou Dongyu, Liu Haoran, Qu Chuxiao, Ruguang Wei, Liu Baisha, Zhao Wenhao, Li Yusheng', null, 'In cold wintry Yanji, a city on China''s northern border, young urbanite Haofeng, visiting from Shanghai, feels lost and adrift. By chance, he goes on a tour led by Nana, a charming tour guide who instantly fascinates him. She introduces him to Xiao, a personable but frustrated restaurant worker. The three bond quickly over a drunken weekend. Confronting their individual traumas, their frozen desires slowly thaw as they seek to liberate themselves from an icy world.', 'In cold wintry Yanji, a city on China''s northern border, young urbanite Haofeng, visiting from Shanghai, feels lost and adrift. By chance, he goes on a tour led by Nana, a charming tour guide who instantly fascinates him. She introduces him to Xiao, a personable but frustrated restaurant worker. The three bond quickly over a drunken weekend. Confronting their individual traumas, their frozen desires slowly thaw as they seek to liberate themselves from an icy world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBGYXCiXhHBNmgvFY7aKrmbXCdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923150'),
  ('482275200114447308', 'The Breaking Point', 1950, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Ted D. McCord, Sherry Shourds', 'Ranald MacDougall', 'John Garfield, Patricia Neal, Phyllis Thaxter, Juano Hernández, Wallace Ford, Edmon Ryan, Ralph Dumke, Guy Thomajan', 'NR', 'A fisherman with money problems hires out his boat to transport criminals.', 'A fisherman with money problems hires out his boat to transport criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmScaZfpgF9KkZ7TKFo0Fn4d7Yy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37954'),
  ('76878834329182386', 'The Breaks', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Eric Meza', 'Mitch Mullany', 'Mitch Mullany, Loretta Devine, Darius McCrary, Lamont Bentley, Edwin Hodge, Carl Anthony Payne II, Paula Jai Parker, Isaiah Barnes', null, 'Derrick, a racially-confused Irishman raised in the hood by a black family is having the worst day ever. Determined to prove to his fed-up mother and would-be girlfriend that he''s not a screw-up, he sets out to do one thing right (get some milk) and even that proves to be a challenge! Hilarious encounters with racist red-neck cops, local gangsters and ''flamboyant'' pawn shop owners ensue, and along the way Derek shows that he can actually do things for others and maybe even get his own life together.', 'Derrick, a racially-confused Irishman raised in the hood by a black family is having the worst day ever. Determined to prove to his fed-up mother and would-be girlfriend that he''s not a screw-up, he sets out to do one thing right (get some milk) and even that proves to be a challenge! Hilarious encounters with racist red-neck cops, local gangsters and ''flamboyant'' pawn shop owners ensue, and along the way Derek shows that he can actually do things for others and maybe even get his own life together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teNV6wHnhFQApC7F2HjixWfdffx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15031'),
  ('20058412381335304', 'The Breakup Guru', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Deng Chao, Yu Baimei', 'Yu Baimei', 'Deng Chao, Yang Mi, Gulnezer Bextiyar, Sun Li, Han Han, Xie Nan, Wu Jing, Ji Haixing', null, 'One is a bum, one gets by selling self-help DVDs: Mei Yuan Gui is a guy who survives by leeching off his girlfriends; Ye Xiao Chun is a girl who sells DVDs for a living. Two people in the bottom rungs of society meet by accident one day when the guy saves the girl, and so begins the most hilarious, silly and touching love story.', 'One is a bum, one gets by selling self-help DVDs: Mei Yuan Gui is a guy who survives by leeching off his girlfriends; Ye Xiao Chun is a girl who sells DVDs for a living. Two people in the bottom rungs of society meet by accident one day when the guy saves the girl, and so begins the most hilarious, silly and touching love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbFRZVdYbJwSEjKFLB31VcOCi3f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270724'),
  ('969261365719317727', 'The Breath', 2009, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Levent Semerci, Vedat Özdemir', 'Levent Semerci, M. Ilker Altinay, Hakan Evrensel', 'Mete Horozoğlu, İlker Kızmaz, Ibrahim Akoz, Serkan Altintas, Okan Avcı, Birce Akalay, Ertunc Atar, Baris Aydin', null, 'A small task force of the Turkish army have to defend a relay station in the middle of nowhere against a possible terrorist raid.', 'A small task force of the Turkish army have to defend a relay station in the middle of nowhere against a possible terrorist raid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFQW9HE7NrZQgWnKR8zl6mvHidx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27957'),
  ('103682769858608423', 'The Breed', 2001, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Michael Oblowitz, Chris Squires', 'Ruth Fletcher, Christos N. Gage', 'Adrian Paul, Bokeem Woodbine, Bai Ling, Péter Halász, James Booth, Lo Ming, Paul Collins, Debbie Javor', 'R', 'Vampires have come out of the shadows and are living as normal citizens. Two policemen, one a vampire, are assigned to track down a serial killer who tears the throat of his victims and drains their blood.', 'Vampires have come out of the shadows and are living as normal citizens. Two policemen, one a vampire, are assigned to track down a serial killer who tears the throat of his victims and drains their blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oLpJMfJ7NtfQX9yNbG8GjyGexL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51215'),
  ('223997853461616395', 'The Breed', 2006, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Nicholas Mastandrea, Giulio Biccari', null, 'Michelle Rodriguez, Taryn Manning, Eric Lively, Oliver Hudson, Hill Harper, Nick Boraine, Lisa-Marie Schneider', 'R', 'Brothers John and Matt have inherited an island cabin from their recently deceased uncle. Along with Matt''s girlfriend, Nicki, and other mutual friends, the siblings travel to the cabin for a relaxing weekend getaway. But, not long after arriving, the group is besieged by ravenous dogs. They watch in horror as another vacationer, Luke, is eaten alive. Soon, they discover a training facility where the dogs have been bred to kill.', 'Brothers John and Matt have inherited an island cabin from their recently deceased uncle. Along with Matt''s girlfriend, Nicki, and other mutual friends, the siblings travel to the cabin for a relaxing weekend getaway. But, not long after arriving, the group is besieged by ravenous dogs. They watch in horror as another vacationer, Luke, is eaten alive. Soon, they discover a training facility where the dogs have been bred to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84wIp36RZ1zpVBoJTjwzGjZVRxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10063'),
  ('533039899360462246', 'The Breeding', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Daniel Armando', 'Dane Harrington Joseph', 'Marcus Bellamy, Patrick Kuzara, Joe Macdougal, David J. Cork, Dedrick Anthony, Linda Manning, Drew Allen, Ano Okera', 'NR', 'An erotic thriller about a young artist whose obsession with a taboo fetish leads to life altering consequences.', 'An erotic thriller about a young artist whose obsession with a taboo fetish leads to life altering consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boXwcG0dB2z83O87DL5Fgahkikd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549110'),
  ('658581804739079551', 'The Breitner Commando', 2019, 'War, Drama', 'Tarik Ait Ben Ali, Abdel Raouf Dafri', 'Abdel Raouf Dafri', 'Johan Heldenbergh, Linh-Dan Pham, Lyna Khoudri, Steve Tientcheu, Pierre Lottin, Olivier Gourmet, Salim Kéchiouche, Hichem Yacoubi', null, '1959, France. Colonel Breitner is given a secret mission : find the body of his former aide, Colonel Delignières, who is reported missing in French Algeria, before the French army burns the whole place to the ground. Breitner puts together a team of five outlaws, who are promised freedom if the mission succeeds.', '1959, France. Colonel Breitner is given a secret mission : find the body of his former aide, Colonel Delignières, who is reported missing in French Algeria, before the French army burns the whole place to the ground. Breitner puts together a team of five outlaws, who are promised freedom if the mission succeeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGMVyK1pCXaPyo3LMCdFqM8qAQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582909'),
  ('516234341909085218', 'The Bremen Town Musicians', 1969, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy, Family', 'Inessa Kovalevskaya, Elena Petrova', 'Yury Entin, Vasiliy Livanov', 'Elmira Zherzdeva, Anatoliy Gorokhov, Oleg Anofriev, Gennadiy Gladkov', null, 'The adventures of the wandering musicians from Bremen such as Troubadour, Donkey, Dog, Cat and Rooster. In one of the towns Troubadour falls in love with a Princess and makes up a plan how to get the King''s confidence.', 'The adventures of the wandering musicians from Bremen such as Troubadour, Donkey, Dog, Cat and Rooster. In one of the towns Troubadour falls in love with a Princess and makes up a plan how to get the King''s confidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93qr4F5vlULIoxINtINuK3Bgcuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33108'),
  ('515996801099718243', 'The Bremen Town Musicians', 2024, 'Adventure, Family, Music', 'Alexey Nuzhnyy, Igor Grinyakin, Aleksey Samodelko', 'Alexey Nuzhnyy, Igor Grinyakin', 'Tikhon Zhiznevsky, Valentina Lyapina, Mariya Aronova, Sergey Burunov, Irina Gorbacheva, Roman Kurtsyn, Dmitriy Dyuzhev, Askar Nigamedzyanov', null, 'The legendary band of traveling musicians is back together! Troubadour and his friends - Donkey, Dog, Cat, and Rooster - rejoin to take on a heroic mission. The musicians and their leader set out to bring laughter and joy back to the gloomy streets of Bremen. First of all, they are tasked with making the King''s daughter laugh. The meeting between Troubadour and the Princess sparks feelings of love in them but also results in a dangerous adventure. Troubadour and his friends face many challenges but they push on through because love makes it all worthwhile. As for the Princess - she runs away from her father’s palace. Scheming bandits, a cunning detective, and the royal family''s internal squabbling create all kinds of problems, but in the end the cheerful Bremen Town Musicians make everyone dance to their tune!', 'The legendary band of traveling musicians is back together! Troubadour and his friends - Donkey, Dog, Cat, and Rooster - rejoin to take on a heroic mission. The musicians and their leader set out to bring laughter and joy back to the gloomy streets of Bremen. First of all, they are tasked with making the King''s daughter laugh. The meeting between Troubadour and the Princess sparks feelings of love in them but also results in a dangerous adventure. Troubadour and his friends face many challenges but they push on through because love makes it all worthwhile. As for the Princess - she runs away from her father’s palace. Scheming bandits, a cunning detective, and the royal family''s internal squabbling create all kinds of problems, but in the end the cheerful Bremen Town Musicians make everyone dance to their tune!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Awob5EoAOA4Dd51b9bMeKT5yC8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1179316'),
  ('898715157855556211', 'The Bribe', 1949, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Z. Leonard, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Marguerite Roberts', 'Robert Taylor, Ava Gardner, Charles Laughton, Vincent Price, John Hodiak, Samuel S. Hinds, John Hoyt, Tito Renaldo', null, 'United States Federal agent Rigby travels to the Central American island Carlotta to investigate a stolen aircraft engines smuggling racket.', 'United States Federal agent Rigby travels to the Central American island Carlotta to investigate a stolen aircraft engines smuggling racket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpSkLEOCFbFpmwmTuprWLl5DRRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25509'),
  ('596364520126714290', 'The Bribe of Heaven', 2016, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Lisandro Duque Naranjo, Eduardo Ramirez Gonzalez, Andrés Buitrago', 'Lisandro Duque Naranjo', 'Jaime Correa, Germán Jaramillo, Guillermo García, Wilderman García, Santiago Londoño, Milady Dau, Carlota Llano, Sara Deray', null, 'In a small Catholic village, the community stands against the local priest when the latter refuses to offer a funeral mass for a suicide victim. In reprisal, the priest denies the sacraments to the entire town, until the family of the deceased remove the body from the catholic graveyard.', 'In a small Catholic village, the community stands against the local priest when the latter refuses to offer a funeral mass for a suicide victim. In reprisal, the priest denies the sacraments to the entire town, until the family of the deceased remove the body from the catholic graveyard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNoRK9bNMfffqdIqFhO78OkAEWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432300'),
  ('1134698391732549440', 'The Brice Man', 2005, 'Comedy', 'James Huth, Philippe Piffeteau', 'Jean Dujardin, Karine Angeli, James Huth', 'Jean Dujardin, Clovis Cornillac, Élodie Bouchez, Bruno Salomone, Alexandra Lamy, Delphine Chanéac, François Chattot, Mathias Mlekuz', null, 'A wannabe surfer parties on the French Riviera while awaiting the perfect wave.', 'A wannabe surfer parties on the French Riviera while awaiting the perfect wave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bxno5lAD6PzulewOT9joMfGPsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17350'),
  ('551269065071636775', 'The Brick and the Mirror', 1966, 'Drama', 'Ebrahim Golestan, Amir Karari, Soleyman Minasian', 'Ebrahim Golestan', 'Taji Ahmadi, Zackaria Hashemi, Goli Bozorgmehr, Masoud Faghih, Parviz Fanizadeh, Manouchehr Farid, Ghaffar Hosseinpoor, Mohammadali Keshavarz', null, 'Hashem is a cab driver who finds an infant child in the back seat of his cab one night after he gives a ride to a young woman. Hashem and his girlfriend, Taji, try to cope with this unwanted child. Hashem insists on getting rid of the child, Taji on keeping him.', 'Hashem is a cab driver who finds an infant child in the back seat of his cab one night after he gives a ride to a young woman. Hashem and his girlfriend, Taji, try to cope with this unwanted child. Hashem insists on getting rid of the child, Taji on keeping him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRqL9ikTUlD8e8JI9YqUsf0uCci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149135'),
  ('677690444828780111', 'The Bricklayer', 1973, 'Documentary', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Jacek Maziarski, Witold Stok', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Józef Malesa', null, 'Joseph Malesa is a former party activist, labor leader, and mason. The documentary describes his career and life through ups and downs.', 'Joseph Malesa is a former party activist, labor leader, and mason. The documentary describes his career and life through ups and downs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44yOQHvnMxxqJE6nLtYOGIEItqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49103'),
  ('826214902702578607', 'The Bricklayer', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Matti Eerikäinen, Mark Roper, Velina Shtarbakova', 'Hanna Weg, Matt Johnson', 'Aaron Eckhart, Nina Dobrev, Clifton Collins Jr., Tim Blake Nelson, Ilfenesh Hadera, Oliver Trevena, Akis Sakellariou, Ori Pfeffer', 'R', 'Someone is blackmailing the CIA by assassinating foreign journalists and making it look like the agency is responsible. As the world begins to unite against the U.S., the CIA must lure its most brilliant – and rebellious – operative out of retirement, forcing him to confront his checkered past while unraveling an international conspiracy.', 'Someone is blackmailing the CIA by assassinating foreign journalists and making it look like the agency is responsible. As the world begins to unite against the U.S., the CIA must lure its most brilliant – and rebellious – operative out of retirement, forcing him to confront his checkered past while unraveling an international conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36pYugctLa70NmwMEgXTR1G31Kq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927107'),
  ('767884032026729288', 'The Bricklayers', 1976, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jorge Fons, Mario Llorca, Álex Phillips Jr.', 'Jorge Fons, Luis Carrión', 'Ignacio López Tarso, Adalberto Martínez, Jaime Fernández, José Alonso, Salvador Sánchez, Katy Jurado, José Carlos Ruiz, David Silva', null, 'When a worker is found murdered on the construction side, the investigation swiftly turns from things criminal to the political circumstances surrounding the building itself. Widespread corruption and neglect by the builder himself are seen to have brought the situation about. Much of the movie is filmed using hand-held cameras, and the majority of the dialogue is in the difficult-to-understand and very slangy Spanish dialect of Mexico City''s bricklayers.', 'When a worker is found murdered on the construction side, the investigation swiftly turns from things criminal to the political circumstances surrounding the building itself. Widespread corruption and neglect by the builder himself are seen to have brought the situation about. Much of the movie is filmed using hand-held cameras, and the majority of the dialogue is in the difficult-to-understand and very slangy Spanish dialect of Mexico City''s bricklayers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxmn7Z6izXbKbs7m5C9CpJqzsip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263815'),
  ('551125395657592549', 'The Brickmakers', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Marta Rodríguez, Jorge Silva', null, null, null, 'This film documents the life of a family of brick makers in the outskirts of Bogotá, using the personal experience of the Castañeda family to expose the exploitation of manual laborers. Marta Rodríguez and Jorge Silva worked on this documentary from 1966 to 1972, establishing a relationship with the family which allows the viewer an intimate look at their hardships.', 'This film documents the life of a family of brick makers in the outskirts of Bogotá, using the personal experience of the Castañeda family to expose the exploitation of manual laborers. Marta Rodríguez and Jorge Silva worked on this documentary from 1966 to 1972, establishing a relationship with the family which allows the viewer an intimate look at their hardships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vd6EPGD70LwoqDBpcTivq6pCHG7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197100'),
  ('569902978408056259', 'The Bride', 1973, 'Drama', 'Lütfi Akad, Gani Turanlı', 'Lütfi Akad', 'Hülya Koçyiğit, Kerem Yılmazer, Kahraman Kıral, Ali Şen, Aliye Rona, Kamran Usluer, Nazan Adalı, Günay Güner', null, 'The struggles of a migrant Anatolian family to adapt to and survive in the very different conditions of urban Istanbul. A young woman moves with her husband and small child to her husband''s family in Istanbul. Her son becomes ill and the doctor tells her that he will soon die if he doesn''t get an operation. The family refuses to help her because they can''t see anything wrong with the boy. What happens on a Eid morning becomes a breaking point for the family.', 'The struggles of a migrant Anatolian family to adapt to and survive in the very different conditions of urban Istanbul. A young woman moves with her husband and small child to her husband''s family in Istanbul. Her son becomes ill and the doctor tells her that he will soon die if he doesn''t get an operation. The family refuses to help her because they can''t see anything wrong with the boy. What happens on a Eid morning becomes a breaking point for the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gztT8HW36YwmkssNjXQZEl4fRub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96049'),
  ('683495036937340218', 'The Bride', 1985, 'Drama, Horror, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Franc Roddam, Laurent Brégeat, Chris Brock', 'Lloyd Fonvielle', 'Sting, Jennifer Beals, Anthony Higgins, Clancy Brown, David Rappaport, Geraldine Page, Cary Elwes, Timothy Spall', 'PG-13', 'Doctor Frankenstein creates a mate for his monster, a woman called Eva, who promptly rejects the male creature. In turn, the doctor becomes obsessed with Eva, and tries to make her a perfect Victorian woman.', 'Doctor Frankenstein creates a mate for his monster, a woman called Eva, who promptly rejects the male creature. In turn, the doctor becomes obsessed with Eva, and tries to make her a perfect Victorian woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5cCwJEnVSPtTqHgIE9UxHIoWFl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29077'),
  ('209445679058829582', 'The Bride', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paula Ortiz, Migue Amoedo', 'Javier García, Paula Ortiz', 'Inma Cuesta, Álex García, Asier Etxeandia, Leticia Dolera, Luisa Gavasa, Carlos Álvarez-Nóvoa, Consuelo Trujillo, Manuela Vellés', null, 'Based on the famous play "Bodas de sangre" (Blood Wedding) by Federico García Lorca, La novia tells the story of a passionate love triangle. A bride leaves her groom, no longer able to withstand the surging desires of her lover, Leonordo.', 'Based on the famous play "Bodas de sangre" (Blood Wedding) by Federico García Lorca, La novia tells the story of a passionate love triangle. A bride leaves her groom, no longer able to withstand the surging desires of her lover, Leonordo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyoXnjqwY5ay8SPqXqyFgIF8RVO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350849'),
  ('299093192921732028', 'The Bride', 2017, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Svyatoslav Podgaevsky, Anton Zenkovich, Aysurat Shamanova', 'Svyatoslav Podgaevsky', 'Victoria Agalakova, Vyacheslav Chepurchenko, Aleksandra Rebenok, Igor Khripunov, Anastasia Akatova, Viktor Solovyov, Dmitriy Kulichkov, Miroslava Karpovich', null, 'This is a story of a small town girl named Nastya. Her newly married husband Ivan drives her to his hometown to meet his family. Upon their arrival Nastya feels she made a wrong decision: she is surrounded by weird people and she sees creepy photos all around the house. Ivan disappears while his family prepares Nastya for a mysterious traditional Russian wedding ceremony. She struggles to calm herself down hoping all this will end and they will live happily ever after. Only if she stays alive...', 'This is a story of a small town girl named Nastya. Her newly married husband Ivan drives her to his hometown to meet his family. Upon their arrival Nastya feels she made a wrong decision: she is surrounded by weird people and she sees creepy photos all around the house. Ivan disappears while his family prepares Nastya for a mysterious traditional Russian wedding ceremony. She struggles to calm herself down hoping all this will end and they will live happily ever after. Only if she stays alive...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKKanGgtgHxrdb1e7OKxbvpio04.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422715'),
  ('1061674496714122395', 'The Bride and the Beast', 1958, 'Horror', 'Adrian Weiss, Roland Price', 'Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'Charlotte Austin, Lance Fuller, Johnny Roth, William Justine, Gil Frye, Jeanne Gerson, Trustin Howard, Eve Brent', null, 'When Laura and Dan get married, she''s more interested in Dan''s gorilla. It''s revealed through hypnosis that she was Queen of the Gorillas in a previous incarnation.', 'When Laura and Dan get married, she''s more interested in Dan''s gorilla. It''s revealed through hypnosis that she was Queen of the Gorillas in a previous incarnation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0QgoMo8uAVyxm5IPjsDUO6qzNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173047'),
  ('178928780345349121', 'The Bride Came C.O.D.', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William Keighley, Ernest Haller', 'Julius J. Epstein, Philip G. Epstein', 'James Cagney, Bette Davis, Stuart Erwin, Eugene Pallette, Jack Carson, George Tobias, Harry Davenport, William Frawley', 'NR', 'A financially-strapped charter pilot hires himself to an oil tycoon to kidnap his madcap daughter and prevent her from marrying a vapid band leader.', 'A financially-strapped charter pilot hires himself to an oil tycoon to kidnap his madcap daughter and prevent her from marrying a vapid band leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leMw2kY4B5YWyB7D38khfn1UpD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29886'),
  ('833195163679005481', 'The Bride from Hades', 1968, 'Horror', 'Satsuo Yamamoto', 'Yoshikata Yoda', 'Miyoko Akaza, Kōjirō Hongō, Hajime Koshikawa, Kō Nishimura, Mayumi Ogawa, Takashi Shimura, Atsumi Uda, Michiko Otsuka', null, 'On the night of the summer Obon festival, Hagiwara Shinzaburo meets a beautiful courtesan named Otsuyu. Not knowing she''s a ghost, he becomes infatuated by her.', 'On the night of the summer Obon festival, Hagiwara Shinzaburo meets a beautiful courtesan named Otsuyu. Not knowing she''s a ghost, he becomes infatuated by her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnfctnY9jNtVZoZ1e0MtUQ9Ldr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108648'),
  ('749545827174774265', 'The Bride of Glomdal', 1926, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer, Einar Olsen', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Einar Sissener, Tove Tellback, Stub Wiberg, Harald Stormoen, Alfhild Stormoen, Oscar Larsen, Einar Tveito, Rasmus Rasmussen', null, 'Tore, son of a poor farmer, loves Berit, daughter of a rich one, but she''s promised to another man whom she does not love and thus refuses to marry.', 'Tore, son of a poor farmer, loves Berit, daughter of a rich one, but she''s promised to another man whom she does not love and thus refuses to marry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVBYxlA23KKGUWvz4Mt6cMmCqb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148845'),
  ('848726998872641646', 'The Bride Walks Out', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Leigh Jason, J. Roy Hunt, Dewey Starkey', 'P.J. Wolfson, Philip G. Epstein', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Gene Raymond, Robert Young, Ned Sparks, Helen Broderick, Willie Best, Robert Warwick, Billy Gilbert', 'NR', 'Carolyn Martin is a fashion model who hastily marries her boyfriend, engineer Michael Martin. But part of the marriage arrangement requires that Carolyn quit her $50-per-week modeling job to be a full-time housewife; the couple will instead live on Michael’s $35-per-week job.', 'Carolyn Martin is a fashion model who hastily marries her boyfriend, engineer Michael Martin. But part of the marriage arrangement requires that Carolyn quit her $50-per-week modeling job to be a full-time housewife; the couple will instead live on Michael’s $35-per-week job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LxPfJES8LGIX5DlIvu1HK9FsA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112618'),
  ('862680628432397447', 'The Bride with White Hair', 1993, 'Fantasy, Drama, Action', 'Ronny Yu, Peter Pau Tak-Hai', 'Jason Lam Kee-To, Ronny Yu, Elsa Tang Bik-Yin', 'Leslie Cheung, Brigitte Lin, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Elaine Lui Siu-Ling, Yammie Lam Kit-Ying, Law Lok-Lam, Bao Fang, Eddy Ko Hung', null, 'The sensitive swordsman Cho Yi-Hang is tired of his life. He is the unwilling successor to the Wu-Tang clan throne and the unsure commander of the clan''s forces in a war against foreign tribes and an evil cult. One day, he meets the beautiful Lien, a killer for the evil cult who is equally unsatisfied with her situation, but their love angers both the Wu-Tang clan and the evil cult.', 'The sensitive swordsman Cho Yi-Hang is tired of his life. He is the unwilling successor to the Wu-Tang clan throne and the unsure commander of the clan''s forces in a war against foreign tribes and an evil cult. One day, he meets the beautiful Lien, a killer for the evil cult who is equally unsatisfied with her situation, but their love angers both the Wu-Tang clan and the evil cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vccyLghE5DylFPqlOKUFuB4TxO6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18817'),
  ('330318829774759662', 'The Bride with White Hair 2', 1993, 'Action, Fantasy, Romance', 'David Wu, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung', 'Ronny Yu, David Wu, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Leslie Cheung, Brigitte Lin, Sunny Chan Kam-Hung, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Joey Man Yee-Man, Lily Chung Suk-Wai, Richard Sun Kwok-Ho, Lee Heung-Kam', null, 'For ten years, Cho has been in the snow of Mount Shin Fung waiting for a rare flower to blossom that will cure his wife who, back in Chung Yuan, is slowly killing all of the members of the Eight Big Clans. Something Cho did to her early in their marriage has turned her hair white and driven her mad. Cho''s nephew, Kit, marries Lyre; they are deeply in love. On their wedding night, Ni-Chang, the bride with white hair, kidnaps Lyre and takes her to her harem of fighting women to indoctrinate her against Kit. Kit tries to lead a rescue party, but they are up against formidable opponents. Can Cho come in time with the blossom to soften Ni-Chang''s heart?', 'For ten years, Cho has been in the snow of Mount Shin Fung waiting for a rare flower to blossom that will cure his wife who, back in Chung Yuan, is slowly killing all of the members of the Eight Big Clans. Something Cho did to her early in their marriage has turned her hair white and driven her mad. Cho''s nephew, Kit, marries Lyre; they are deeply in love. On their wedding night, Ni-Chang, the bride with white hair, kidnaps Lyre and takes her to her harem of fighting women to indoctrinate her against Kit. Kit tries to lead a rescue party, but they are up against formidable opponents. Can Cho come in time with the blossom to soften Ni-Chang''s heart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFfxAufiZtZBOiSCi0oRmbnDSpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25384'),
  ('595964152392499771', 'The Bride Wore Black', 1968, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'François Truffaut, Raoul Coutard', null, 'Jeanne Moreau, Michel Bouquet, Jean-Claude Brialy, Charles Denner, Claude Rich, Michael Lonsdale, Daniel Boulanger, Alexandra Stewart', 'NR', 'Julie Kohler is prevented from suicide by her mother. She leaves home, with the intent track down, charm and kill five men who do not know her. What is her goal? What is her purpose?', 'Julie Kohler is prevented from suicide by her mother. She leaves home, with the intent track down, charm and kill five men who do not know her. What is her goal? What is her purpose?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iP7kuo3tMyR2hJfqBsssiPnEoik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4191'),
  ('228235090151763291', 'The Bride Wore Red', 1937, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Dorothy Arzner, George J. Folsey, Edward Woehler', 'Bradbury Foote, Tess Slesinger', 'Joan Crawford, Franchot Tone, Robert Young, Billie Burke, Reginald Owen, Lynne Carver, George Zucco, Mary Philips', 'NR', 'A poor singer in a bar masquerades as a rich society woman thanks to a rich benefactor.', 'A poor singer in a bar masquerades as a rich society woman thanks to a rich benefactor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7md7mwMMXEFZal5P2kysi4PkEAS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112885'),
  ('255821541959755121', 'The Bride!', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Fantasy', 'Lawrence Sher, Maggie Gyllenhaal, David Webb', 'Maggie Gyllenhaal', 'Jessie Buckley, Christian Bale, Peter Sarsgaard, John Magaro, Jeannie Berlin, Annette Bening, Jake Gyllenhaal, Penélope Cruz', 'R', 'A lonely Frankenstein travels to 1930s Chicago to ask groundbreaking scientist Dr. Euphronious to create a companion for him. The two revive a murdered young woman and The Bride is born. But what ensues is beyond what either of them imagined.', 'A lonely Frankenstein travels to 1930s Chicago to ask groundbreaking scientist Dr. Euphronious to create a companion for him. The two revive a murdered young woman and The Bride is born. But what ensues is beyond what either of them imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lV8YHwGkYZsm6EfIqnhaSz2avKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1159831'),
  ('849766017619738965', 'The Bride''s Play', 1922, 'Romance, Drama', 'George Terwilliger, Ira H. Morgan', 'Mildred Considine', 'Marion Davies, John B. O''Brien, Frank Shannon, Wyndham Standing, Carl Miller, Richard Cummings, Eleanor Middleton, Thea Talbot', null, 'A sweet-natured young Irish woman is courted by a romantic poet and a local country gentleman. Which man will she choose?', 'A sweet-natured young Irish woman is courted by a romantic poet and a local country gentleman. Which man will she choose?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JzT6kOhNnLsvl7VDAfdzms9UxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434011'),
  ('912120616300775231', 'The Bridegroom, the Actress, and the Pimp', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet, Niklaus Schilling', 'Helmut Färber', 'Irm Hermann, Kristin Peterson, Hanna Schygulla, Peer Raben, Rudolf Waldemar Brem, Jimmy Powell, Lilith Ungerer, Rainer Werner Fassbinder', null, 'Three sequences are linked together in this short film by Straub; the first sequence is a long tracking shot from a car of prostitutes plying their trade on the night-time streets of Germany; the second is a staged play, cut down to 10 minutes by Straub and photographed in a single take; the final sequence covers the marriage of James and Lilith, and Lilith’s subsequent execution of her pimp, played by Rainer Werner Fassbinder. "The film is a look entirely at Western decadence" - Jean-Marie Straub.', 'Three sequences are linked together in this short film by Straub; the first sequence is a long tracking shot from a car of prostitutes plying their trade on the night-time streets of Germany; the second is a staged play, cut down to 10 minutes by Straub and photographed in a single take; the final sequence covers the marriage of James and Lilith, and Lilith’s subsequent execution of her pimp, played by Rainer Werner Fassbinder. "The film is a look entirely at Western decadence" - Jean-Marie Straub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVOJlq8gO6rQKG15PmdENyWlZ2H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154902'),
  ('15817592634002429', 'The Bridegrooms of Eftyhia', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Sokrates Kapsaskis, Giovanni Varriano', 'Nikos Tsiforos, Polyvios Vasileiadis', 'Vasilis Avlonitis, Nikos Rizos, Georgia Vasileiadou, Popi Lazou, Elsa Rizou, Katerina Yioulaki, Giorgos Tsitsopoulos, Zeta Apostolou', null, 'The film focuses on the Tarniatis brothers, with the brother trying to marry his sister (Georgia Vasileiadou), who refuses to follow the fashion of the time and become a lustful woman, so that he too can marry, having been engaged for eight years. The last groom that Vangelis shows Eftychia is Kleomenis, who after their trip to Hydra falls in love with the family''s niece. However, Koulis also wants to marry Eftychia, who thinks he is inheriting 120,000 pounds.', 'The film focuses on the Tarniatis brothers, with the brother trying to marry his sister (Georgia Vasileiadou), who refuses to follow the fashion of the time and become a lustful woman, so that he too can marry, having been engaged for eight years. The last groom that Vangelis shows Eftychia is Kleomenis, who after their trip to Hydra falls in love with the family''s niece. However, Koulis also wants to marry Eftychia, who thinks he is inheriting 120,000 pounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZx3SwCwhdbYoccIibdugD0Azy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332126'),
  ('794980583029515478', 'The Brides Are Coming', 1978, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Emir Kusturica', 'Ivica Matić', 'Miodrag ''Miki'' Krstović, Zaim Muzaferija, Milka Podrug-Kokotović, Bogdan Diklić, Tanja Poberžnik, Zoran Simonović, Adnan Palangić, Slavko Zamola', null, 'Jelena, a woman of character, rules an inn in an isolated place in the countryside. She lives with her two sons: Martin and Jakov. Martin has been married to Kata for 5 years, but never succeeded in having a child. Jakov sleeps with his mother in postures suggesting incest, but he is in love with Kata. Each night he hears her cries, the sexual acts with her husband inevitably finish with violence. One day, Jakov can''t stand anymore, he leaves, and Kata is found dead the next morning. Two characters arrive then : an old man, who turns to be the father of Martin ; he settles and declares being returned to die here. And a girl, that Martin will keep as his new wife.', 'Jelena, a woman of character, rules an inn in an isolated place in the countryside. She lives with her two sons: Martin and Jakov. Martin has been married to Kata for 5 years, but never succeeded in having a child. Jakov sleeps with his mother in postures suggesting incest, but he is in love with Kata. Each night he hears her cries, the sexual acts with her husband inevitably finish with violence. One day, Jakov can''t stand anymore, he leaves, and Kata is found dead the next morning. Two characters arrive then : an old man, who turns to be the father of Martin ; he settles and declares being returned to die here. And a girl, that Martin will keep as his new wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJTyzceyUSB75HoFPCSz6mc6FK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210365'),
  ('568611826810851093', 'The Brides of Dracula', 1960, 'Horror', 'Terence Fisher, Jack Asher', 'Peter Bryan, Edward Percy, Jimmy Sangster', 'Peter Cushing, Martita Hunt, Yvonne Monlaur, Freda Jackson, David Peel, Miles Malleson, Henry Oscar, Mona Washbourne', 'PG', 'A young teacher on her way to a position in Transylvania helps a young man escape the shackles his mother has put on him. In so doing she innocently unleashes the horrors of the undead once again on the populace, including those at her school for ladies. Luckily for some, Dr. Van Helsing is already on his way.', 'A young teacher on her way to a position in Transylvania helps a young man escape the shackles his mother has put on him. In so doing she innocently unleashes the horrors of the undead once again on the populace, including those at her school for ladies. Luckily for some, Dr. Van Helsing is already on his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJYJmxZZIAkrn0BaMcYnvEB8wVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23220'),
  ('557276322122836381', 'The Brides of Fu Manchu', 1966, 'Crime, Adventure', 'Don Sharp, Ernest Steward', 'Don Sharp, Harry Alan Towers', 'Christopher Lee, Douglas Wilmer, Heinz Drache, Marie Versini, Howard Marion-Crawford, Tsai Chin, Rupert Davies, Kenneth Fortescue', null, 'This time Fu Manchu and his army of henchmen are kidnaping the daughters of prominent scientists and taking them to his remote island headquarters. Instead of asking for ransom, Fu demands that the fathers help him to build a death ray, which he intends to use to take over the world. But Fu''s archenemy, Nayland Smith of Scotland Yard, is determined not to let that happen.', 'This time Fu Manchu and his army of henchmen are kidnaping the daughters of prominent scientists and taking them to his remote island headquarters. Instead of asking for ransom, Fu demands that the fathers help him to build a death ray, which he intends to use to take over the world. But Fu''s archenemy, Nayland Smith of Scotland Yard, is determined not to let that happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5vuutKDt6lmS4OJx7eA4USApjo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30972'),
  ('1128689333203921196', 'The Bridesmaid', 2004, 'Thriller, Romance, Drama', 'Eduardo Serra, Claude Chabrol', 'Claude Chabrol, Pierre Leccia', 'Benoît Magimel, Laura Smet, Aurore Clément, Bernard Le Coq, Solène Bouton, Anna Mihalcea, Michel Duchaussoy, Suzanne Flon', null, 'A hard-working young man meets and falls in love with his sister''s bridesmaid. He soon finds out how disturbed she really is.', 'A hard-working young man meets and falls in love with his sister''s bridesmaid. He soon finds out how disturbed she really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DGGdYDDYeVknSsaBsBrwRWbjkP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72272'),
  ('1086522861003679188', 'The Bridge', 1928, 'Documentary', 'Joris Ivens', null, null, null, 'The Hefbrug may not be a remarkably beautiful bridge, but through a mix of close-ups, long shots, bird’s eye views and low angles, Joris Ivens conveys a sense of the bridge’s structure, its intricate mechanisms and ways of operating, the way it fits into the overall transport infrastructure and therefore the immense importance of this bridge for the whole city of Rotterdam.', 'The Hefbrug may not be a remarkably beautiful bridge, but through a mix of close-ups, long shots, bird’s eye views and low angles, Joris Ivens conveys a sense of the bridge’s structure, its intricate mechanisms and ways of operating, the way it fits into the overall transport infrastructure and therefore the immense importance of this bridge for the whole city of Rotterdam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzmaY9KtEVhXeHqjAjIWiRGmCiX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189872'),
  ('384234940560052627', 'The Bridge', 1929, 'Drama', 'Charles Vidor, William Wheeler', 'Charles Vidor', 'Nicholas Bela, Charles Darvas', null, 'A condemned man manages to avoid being hanged from a bridge over a river when the rope breaks. He falls into the water and his escape attempt ensues.', 'A condemned man manages to avoid being hanged from a bridge over a river when the rope breaks. He falls into the water and his escape attempt ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naU53kbSSrvzHGHkbLDsSjJDUEw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190308'),
  ('42221706736539994', 'The Bridge', 1959, 'Drama, History, War', 'Gerd von Bonin, Bernhard Wicki, Holger Lussmann', 'Karl-Wilhelm Vivier, Bernhard Wicki, Michael Mansfeld', 'Folker Bohnet, Fritz Wepper, Michael Hinz, Frank Glaubrecht, Karl Michael Balzer, Volker Lechtenbrink, Günther Hoffmann, Cordula Trantow', null, 'A group of German boys are ordered to protect a small bridge in their home village during the waning months of the second world war. Truckloads of defeated, cynical Wehrmacht soldiers flee the approaching American troops, but the boys, full of enthusiasm for the "blood and honor" Nazi ideology, stay to defend the useless bridge. The film is based on a West German anti-war novel of the same name, written by Gregor Dorfmeister.', 'A group of German boys are ordered to protect a small bridge in their home village during the waning months of the second world war. Truckloads of defeated, cynical Wehrmacht soldiers flee the approaching American troops, but the boys, full of enthusiasm for the "blood and honor" Nazi ideology, stay to defend the useless bridge. The film is based on a West German anti-war novel of the same name, written by Gregor Dorfmeister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCg5NqSdUFB1S6iJu3jyXwHOE8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1566'),
  ('1067268071310476492', 'The Bridge', 1969, 'War, Action', 'Hajrudin ''Šiba'' Krvavac', 'Predrag Golubović, Đorđe Lebović', 'Velimir Živojinović, Slobodan ''Cica'' Perović, Boris Dvornik, Relja Bašić, Sibina Mijatović, Boro Begović, Jovan Janićijević ''Burduš'', Igor Galo', null, 'In order to check the German offensive, Partizans send an elite team of explosive experts to blow up a strategically important bridge. Besides being heavily guarded, that bridge is almost indestructible and the only man who knows weak spots in the construction is the architect who built it. He is, however, reluctant to cooperate because he doesn''t want to see his masterpiece destroyed.', 'In order to check the German offensive, Partizans send an elite team of explosive experts to blow up a strategically important bridge. Besides being heavily guarded, that bridge is almost indestructible and the only man who knows weak spots in the construction is the architect who built it. He is, however, reluctant to cooperate because he doesn''t want to see his masterpiece destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIcdPuKYaoR6xOj7dqe0ooiXphG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251210'),
  ('471877424393083861', 'The Bridge', 1999, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gérard Depardieu, Frédéric Auburtin, Pascal Ridao', 'François Dupeyron', 'Carole Bouquet, Gérard Depardieu, Charles Berling, Dominique Reymond, Mélanie Laurent, Stanislas Forlani, Michelle Goddet', null, 'Mina is a movie buff with a husband, Georges, who''s out of work, and a 15-year-old son, Tommy. While Mina works part-time as a domestic for Claire Daboval, the family is terribly short on money, so when Georges is offered construction work on a massive bridge project, he immediately accepts, even though the job site is far away. One day, while taking in a matinee screening of West Side Story, Mina meets a man named Matthias, an engineer associated with the bridge project. It''s love at first sight for the both of them, and while Mina has no desire to hurt Georges, who is a good and decent man, she has found another good and decent man whom she loves even more. Tommy, on the other hand, has to deal with this crisis in his parents'' marriage while he''s sorting out his own infatuation with Ms. Daboval''s daughter, Lisbeth.', 'Mina is a movie buff with a husband, Georges, who''s out of work, and a 15-year-old son, Tommy. While Mina works part-time as a domestic for Claire Daboval, the family is terribly short on money, so when Georges is offered construction work on a massive bridge project, he immediately accepts, even though the job site is far away. One day, while taking in a matinee screening of West Side Story, Mina meets a man named Matthias, an engineer associated with the bridge project. It''s love at first sight for the both of them, and while Mina has no desire to hurt Georges, who is a good and decent man, she has found another good and decent man whom she loves even more. Tommy, on the other hand, has to deal with this crisis in his parents'' marriage while he''s sorting out his own infatuation with Ms. Daboval''s daughter, Lisbeth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g06nWE9KrAuoak3BCF8iCxDrLZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162383'),
  ('28261694301348352', 'The Bridge', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Eric Steel, Peter McCandless', null, 'Eric Geleynse, Susan Ginwalla, Caroline Pressley, Gene Sprague, Elizabeth ''Lisa'' Smith, Rachel Marker, Tara Harrell, Lyle Smith', 'R', 'The Bridge is a controversial documentary that shows people jumping to their death from the Golden Gate Bridge in San Francisco - the world''s most popular suicide destination. Interviews with the victims'' loved ones describe their lives and mental health.', 'The Bridge is a controversial documentary that shows people jumping to their death from the Golden Gate Bridge in San Francisco - the world''s most popular suicide destination. Interviews with the victims'' loved ones describe their lives and mental health.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAUA3oYIiDKwzKZoZuXEkHx6zG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1666'),
  ('915467707278537636', 'The Bridge', 2008, 'TV Movie, History, War', 'Wolfgang Panzer', null, 'François Goeske, Franka Potente, Lars Steinhöfel, Robert Höller, Paula Schramm, Felix von Manteuffel, Florian Heppert, Michael Lott', null, 'A group of German boys is ordered to protect a small bridge in their home village during the waning months of the second world war. Truckloads of defeated, cynical Wehrmacht soldiers flee the approaching American troops, but the boys, full of enthusiasm for the "blood and honor" Nazi ideology, stay to defend the useless bridge.', 'A group of German boys is ordered to protect a small bridge in their home village during the waning months of the second world war. Truckloads of defeated, cynical Wehrmacht soldiers flee the approaching American troops, but the boys, full of enthusiasm for the "blood and honor" Nazi ideology, stay to defend the useless bridge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jf38RPQNA9aH9lNXbkpo1AF719l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12314'),
  ('375101298535148163', 'The Bridge at Remagen', 1969, 'War, Action', 'John Guillermin, Stanley Cortez, Lynn Stalmaster', 'Richard Yates, William Roberts', 'George Segal, Robert Vaughn, Ben Gazzara, Bradford Dillman, E.G. Marshall, Peter van Eyck, Hans Christian Blech, Heinz Reincke', 'R', 'In March of 1945, as the War in Europe is coming to a close, fighting erupts between German and American troops at the last remaining bridgehead across the Rhine.', 'In March of 1945, as the War in Europe is coming to a close, fighting erupts between German and American troops at the last remaining bridgehead across the Rhine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWNzClIEf3bb4Cq1NH47QHCHUW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15873'),
  ('970131864284586354', 'The Bridge Curse', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Lester Hsi', 'Chang Keng-ming, Po-Hsiang Hao', 'JC Lin, Vera Yen, Summer Meng, Chang Ning, Chiao Yuan-Yuan, Joe Hsieh, Ko Cheng, RUKO', null, 'Four years after five students mysteriously committed suicide after taking part in a courage test on the ghost bridge in Donghu university, a reporter and a cinematographer are back to that place and try to get everything clear.', 'Four years after five students mysteriously committed suicide after taking part in a courage test on the ghost bridge in Donghu university, a reporter and a cinematographer are back to that place and try to get everything clear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUEu2FZLWZlLKoFqifK5o33mBHk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678489'),
  ('224800431910930087', 'The Bridge Curse: Ritual', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Chang Chun-lin, Wu Jun-xi, Lester Hsi', 'Huang Yen-chiao, Lu Shih-yuan, Po-Hsiang Hao', 'Wang Yu-xuan, JC Lin, Patrick Shih, Shawn Hu, Chan Tzu-hsuan, Xi Wei-lun, Boris Wang, Linus Wang', null, 'An architect disrupted the school during construction and turned it into supernatural entities. Years later, an augmented game involving dark rituals happens when a group of studentsunleash a swarm of evil spirits into the world.', 'An architect disrupted the school during construction and turned it into supernatural entities. Years later, an augmented game involving dark rituals happens when a group of studentsunleash a swarm of evil spirits into the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhCjWaHH81ufIISGTD3Y6jYB1qw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999087'),
  ('421690092581080828', 'The Bridge of Arts', 2004, 'Drama', 'Eugène Green, Raphaël O''Byrne', 'Eugène Green', 'Natacha Régnier, Adrien Michaux, Alexis Loret, Denis Podalydès, Olivier Gourmet, Camille Carraz, Jérémie Renier, Christelle Prot', null, 'The film is a love story which tells the impossible tale of two youths who have never before met. The action unrolls in Paris between 1979 and 1980.', 'The film is a love story which tells the impossible tale of two youths who have never before met. The action unrolls in Paris between 1979 and 1980.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aO5sH2KAruAV4yGm0fyWxUWDYl8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101909'),
  ('972683583194691626', 'The Bridge of San Luis Rey', 2004, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mary McGuckian, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'Mary McGuckian', 'Gabriel Byrne, F. Murray Abraham, Kathy Bates, Robert De Niro, Harvey Keitel, Pilar López de Ayala, Mark Polish, Michael Polish', 'PG', 'In 1714 Peru, a friar is tried by the Spanish Inquisition for questioning God''s intentions when five die in the collapse of an Andean rope bridge.', 'In 1714 Peru, a friar is tried by the Spanish Inquisition for questioning God''s intentions when five die in the collapse of an Andean rope bridge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jp26f92Z28eFVmwZ90Q09bnrBEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45881'),
  ('33761066044231619', 'The Bridge to Nowhere', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Blair Underwood', 'Blair Underwood', 'Ving Rhames, Bijou Phillips, Danny Masterson, Ben Crowley, Thomas Ian Nicholas, Alexandra Breckenridge, Tom Kurlander, Jackson Nunn', 'R', 'A group of 20-something blue-collar workers in Pittsburgh cook up a scheme to make extra money that involves prostitution. Their business takes off, then gets way out of hand.', 'A group of 20-something blue-collar workers in Pittsburgh cook up a scheme to make extra money that involves prostitution. Their business takes off, then gets way out of hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyxMeYptVoxusFuwuT7XycVgnI9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22165'),
  ('343187797053706737', 'The Bridges at Toko-Ri', 1954, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Mark Robson, Loyal Griggs', 'Valentine Davies', 'William Holden, Grace Kelly, Fredric March, Mickey Rooney, Robert Strauss, Charles McGraw, Keiko Awaji, Earl Holliman', 'NR', 'A U.S. Navy pilot and his squad are assigned to bomb a group of heavily defended bridges deep behind enemy lines during the Korean War.', 'A U.S. Navy pilot and his squad are assigned to bomb a group of heavily defended bridges deep behind enemy lines during the Korean War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAXMYP4SNKoV698ccC77vtJ9kLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35580'),
  ('1059972330926248942', 'The Bridges of Madison County', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Clint Eastwood, Jack N. Green, Bill Bannerman', 'Richard LaGravenese', 'Meryl Streep, Clint Eastwood, Annie Corley, Victor Slezak, Jim Haynie, Sarah Zahn, Christopher Kroon, Phyllis Lyons', 'PG-13', 'Photographer Robert Kincaid wanders into the life of housewife Francesca Johnson for four days in the 1960s.', 'Photographer Robert Kincaid wanders into the life of housewife Francesca Johnson for four days in the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCBrhOQjhG397GLkEZ49zReQEKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:688'),
  ('674196950811511211', 'The Bridges of Sarajevo', 2014, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Teresa Villaverde, Kamen Kalev, Jean-Luc Godard', 'Cristi Puiu, Teresa Villaverde', 'Bogdan Ninković, Feđa Stamenković, Andrej Ivančić, Nikola Brković, Mihailo Ković, Samuel Finzi, Gilles Tschudi, Gergana Pletnyova', null, 'Thirteen European directors explore the theme of Sarajevo; what this city has represented in European history over the past hundred years, and what Sarajevo stands for today in Europe. These eminent filmmakers of different generations and origins offer exceptional singular styles and visions.', 'Thirteen European directors explore the theme of Sarajevo; what this city has represented in European history over the past hundred years, and what Sarajevo stands for today in Europe. These eminent filmmakers of different generations and origins offer exceptional singular styles and visions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMFUgf8tGpwjYHxsBVsoT5xhABK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284051'),
  ('1004981088450730680', 'The Brig', 1964, 'War, Drama', 'Jonas Mekas, Jonas Mekas', 'Kenneth H. Brown', 'Warren Finnerty, Henry Howard, Tom Lilard, James Tiroff, Steven Ben Israel, Rufus Collins, Gene Lipton, Michael Elias', null, 'Jonas Mekas’s film captures The Living Theatre’s stage production of The Brig, an unflinching portrait of life inside a U.S. Marine Corps jail in Japan in 1957. Over the course of a single day, prisoners endure relentless drills, abuse, and dehumanization, exposing the brutality of military discipline with stark immediacy.', 'Jonas Mekas’s film captures The Living Theatre’s stage production of The Brig, an unflinching portrait of life inside a U.S. Marine Corps jail in Japan in 1957. Over the course of a single day, prisoners endure relentless drills, abuse, and dehumanization, exposing the brutality of military discipline with stark immediacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6tqAhMvn4Ft8jFQmOuWmwLxZms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165361'),
  ('375622331365932224', 'The Brigade', 2017, 'Drama', 'Olivier Jacquet, Jérôme Alméras, Pierre Jolivet', 'Marcia Romano, Pierre Jolivet', 'Roschdy Zem, Émilie Dequenne, Michaël Abiteboul, Guillaume Labbé, Grégoire Isvarine, Guillaume Douat, Brian Messina, Antoine Raffalli', null, 'Bénédicte Meursault, a female firefighter, has just been transferred to a small fire brigade in the South of France. She is welcomed by Philippe, 45, the wise captain of the brigade. Soon after being introduced to the men, the young woman jumps into action. Unfortunately, while rescuing the victims of a terrible car crash, she does not find one of the injured who was ejected thirty meters away. Now the man is in hospital in a coma and he may die because of her. Completely upset, Bénédicte decides to resign but Philippe dissuades her from doing it.', 'Bénédicte Meursault, a female firefighter, has just been transferred to a small fire brigade in the South of France. She is welcomed by Philippe, 45, the wise captain of the brigade. Soon after being introduced to the men, the young woman jumps into action. Unfortunately, while rescuing the victims of a terrible car crash, she does not find one of the injured who was ejected thirty meters away. Now the man is in hospital in a coma and he may die because of her. Completely upset, Bénédicte decides to resign but Philippe dissuades her from doing it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9XzkZ5qSZ6ePxcS4RUvH3f5uIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457181'),
  ('834892544451765643', 'The Brigand of Kandahar', 1965, 'Adventure, War, History', 'John Gilling, Reginald H. Wyer', 'John Gilling', 'Ronald Lewis, Oliver Reed, Duncan Lamont, Yvonne Romain, Katherine Woodville, Glyn Houston, Sean Lynch, Walter Brown', null, '1880. British India. Robert Case, a half-caste lieutenant, is unjustly discharged from the British Army. He joins the rebel Bengali tribesmen offensive against the colonial enemy. They capture a foreign journalist and Case recounts his story of false accusation on trumped-up charges, instigated by the bigotry and racism of his commanding officers. Following a successful attack by the British against the rebels Case is brutally shot by Colonel Drewe, his accuser. The journalist returns home determined to report the true story of The Brigand of Kandahar.', '1880. British India. Robert Case, a half-caste lieutenant, is unjustly discharged from the British Army. He joins the rebel Bengali tribesmen offensive against the colonial enemy. They capture a foreign journalist and Case recounts his story of false accusation on trumped-up charges, instigated by the bigotry and racism of his commanding officers. Following a successful attack by the British against the rebels Case is brutally shot by Colonel Drewe, his accuser. The journalist returns home determined to report the true story of The Brigand of Kandahar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDAIGPjBjVLfDR5MtUckqdYrmi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82811'),
  ('620141319355608045', 'The Bright Night', 1978, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Marcel Hanoun, Alain Fayel, Véra Caïs', 'Marcel Hanoun', 'Lorraine Bonnemaison, Gérard Rouzier, Florence Rousseau, Marie Manet, Hans Meyer, Liliane Oldriot, Jean de Gaspary, Annick Dhotel', null, 'In a montage alternating with moments of Nigel Rogers'' interpretation of the most beautiful passages from "Orpheus," the opera by Striggio and Monteverdi, La Nuit Claire is an evocation of the celebrated myth, within which images of the love between its two modern protagonists, Anne and Julien, are inscribed. - BAM/PFA', 'In a montage alternating with moments of Nigel Rogers'' interpretation of the most beautiful passages from "Orpheus," the opera by Striggio and Monteverdi, La Nuit Claire is an evocation of the celebrated myth, within which images of the love between its two modern protagonists, Anne and Julien, are inscribed. - BAM/PFA', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75EncVRolIbCNezcP26HUNS8Hwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273196'),
  ('272390554472513448', 'The Brightest Roof in the Universe', 2022, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Senzo Ueno, Gen Osaka, Michihito Fujii', 'Michihito Fujii', 'Kaya Kiyohara, Kaori Momoi, Kentaro Ito, Miki Mizuno, Takashi Yamanaka, Kotaro Daigo, Maki Sakai, Hidetaka Yoshioka', null, '14 year-old schoolgirl Tsubame is into university student Toru. She sees him in her area and really wants to be his. She struggles with how to inform him of her love. Then her stepmother becomes pregnant and she is distracted with that development. The one reliable part of her life is the calligraphy class she attends, but then she runs into a woman.', '14 year-old schoolgirl Tsubame is into university student Toru. She sees him in her area and really wants to be his. She struggles with how to inform him of her love. Then her stepmother becomes pregnant and she is distracted with that development. The one reliable part of her life is the calligraphy class she attends, but then she runs into a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCiO5NeIrygCYmwrJQxkXe9URBO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734969'),
  ('915930070069255222', 'The Brightest Star', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Kostas Karagiannis', 'Lakis Mihailidis', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Dimitris Papamichael, Lavrentis Dianellos, Nikitas Platis, Maria Ioannidou, Nitsa Tsaganea, Stavros Xenidis, Despoina Stylianopoulou', null, 'A girl from the slums of Athens becomes a famous singer while falling in love with her songwriter.', 'A girl from the slums of Athens becomes a famous singer while falling in love with her songwriter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJL6uBFugMvDLeJY6NZvB2qfVXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301492'),
  ('765395810990545524', 'The Brighton Strangler', 1945, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Max Nosseck, J. Roy Hunt, Lloyd Richards', 'Max Nosseck, Arnold Lipp', 'John Loder, June Duprez, Michael St. Angel, Miles Mander, Rose Hobart, Gilbert Emery, Rex Evans, Matthew Boulton', null, 'After suffering a head injury during the London Blitz, theatre actor John Loder comes to believe himself to be the Brighton Strangler, the murderer he was playing onstage.', 'After suffering a head injury during the London Blitz, theatre actor John Loder comes to believe himself to be the Brighton Strangler, the murderer he was playing onstage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5CGXrTI4sZOrB74jnmtpw1l9q0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109151'),
  ('193831958701120078', 'The Brink', 2017, 'Crime, Action', 'Jonathan Li Tsz-Chun, Annie Sit Pui-Yin, Terry Ng Ka-Wai', 'Melvin Li', 'Max Zhang, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Janice Man Wing-San, Wu Yue, Tai Bo, Cecilia So Lai-Shan, Yasuaki Kurata, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung', null, 'Reckless police inspector Sai Gau (Zhang Jin) is on a mission to crack down on criminal Shing''s (Shawn Yue) gold smuggling scheme, yet fails to arrest him. As Sai Gau continues his manhunt, he discovers Shing''s involvement with triad boss Blackie (Yasuaki Kurata), who hides on a casino cruise ship on the high seas. Shing has been involved in a power struggle within the smuggling ring, and is forced to kill his adopted father. He also loses his share of gold smuggling to Blackie. To get even, Shing appears on the cruise, while Sai Gau is there to hunt for him.', 'Reckless police inspector Sai Gau (Zhang Jin) is on a mission to crack down on criminal Shing''s (Shawn Yue) gold smuggling scheme, yet fails to arrest him. As Sai Gau continues his manhunt, he discovers Shing''s involvement with triad boss Blackie (Yasuaki Kurata), who hides on a casino cruise ship on the high seas. Shing has been involved in a power struggle within the smuggling ring, and is forced to kill his adopted father. He also loses his share of gold smuggling to Blackie. To get even, Shing appears on the cruise, while Sai Gau is there to hunt for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqAs8GjACNHcChpoIED8fkFxpWm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458257'),
  ('939573369888943407', 'The Brink''s Job', 1978, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, History', 'William Friedkin, Norman Leigh, Terence A. Donnelly', 'Walon Green', 'Peter Falk, Peter Boyle, Allen Garfield, Warren Oates, Gena Rowlands, Paul Sorvino, Sheldon Leonard, Kevin O''Connor', 'PG', 'In 1950, a group of unlikely criminal masterminds commits the robbery of the century. Led by Tony Pino, a petty thief fresh out of prison, and Joe McGinnis, who specializes in planning lucrative capers, the gang robs Brink''s main office in Boston of more than $2 million. However, things begin to go awry when the FBI gets involved, the cops start cracking down on the gang and McGinnis refuses to hand over the loot...', 'In 1950, a group of unlikely criminal masterminds commits the robbery of the century. Led by Tony Pino, a petty thief fresh out of prison, and Joe McGinnis, who specializes in planning lucrative capers, the gang robs Brink''s main office in Boston of more than $2 million. However, things begin to go awry when the FBI gets involved, the cops start cracking down on the gang and McGinnis refuses to hand over the loot...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXWJuGw8pFY0bWEE7dZ4Oz9qWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24429'),
  ('34190757914385003', 'The Broadway Melody', 1929, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Harry Beaumont, John Arnold', 'Edmund Goulding', 'Charles King, Anita Page, Bessie Love, Betty Arthur, J. Emmett Beck, Nacio Herb Brown, James Burrows, Eddie Bush', 'NR', 'The vaudeville act of Harriet and Queenie Mahoney comes to Broadway, where their friend Eddie Kerns needs them for his number in one of Francis Zanfield''s shows. When Eddie meets Queenie, he soon falls in love with her—but she is already being courted by Jock Warriner, a member of New York high society. Queenie eventually recognizes that, to Jock, she is nothing more than a toy, and that Eddie is in love with her.', 'The vaudeville act of Harriet and Queenie Mahoney comes to Broadway, where their friend Eddie Kerns needs them for his number in one of Francis Zanfield''s shows. When Eddie meets Queenie, he soon falls in love with her—but she is already being courted by Jock Warriner, a member of New York high society. Queenie eventually recognizes that, to Jock, she is nothing more than a toy, and that Eddie is in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giq8GJs8YGMzHxeKxNSuwzAdd1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65203'),
  ('327743626869815454', 'The Broken', 2008, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Sean Ellis, Angus Hudson', 'Sean Ellis', 'Lena Headey, Ulrich Thomsen, Melvil Poupaud, Michelle Duncan, Asier Newman, Richard Jenkins, Daren Elliott Holmes, Howard Ward', 'R', 'The life of a successful radiologist spirals out of control when she sees the spitting image of herself driving down a London street. While attempting to uncover who the imposter could be, she stumbles into a terrifying mystery that her family and closest friends are somehow involved in, leaving her with no one to trust.', 'The life of a successful radiologist spirals out of control when she sees the spitting image of herself driving down a London street. While attempting to uncover who the imposter could be, she stumbles into a terrifying mystery that her family and closest friends are somehow involved in, leaving her with no one to trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cHCv6SE9UmBrfkczRmT4JHBQCq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3511'),
  ('556605724424624468', 'The Broken Crown', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Jordi Frades, Raimon Lorda', 'José Luis Martín', 'Rodolfo Sancho, Irene Escolar, Raúl Mérida, Eusebio Poncela, Ramón Madaula, Jordi Díaz, Fernando Guillén Cuervo, Úrsula Corberó', null, 'In a Spain consumed by ambition and power, the future of an empire depends of the mind state of a single woman.', 'In a Spain consumed by ambition and power, the future of an empire depends of the mind state of a single woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rZS858pC2c859VCuQv9dHmTyMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356270'),
  ('901857247535738617', 'The Broken Ear', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Robert Réa, Alex Boon, J.D. Smith', 'Thierry Wermuth, Susan Roman, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin', null, 'When a South American fetish is stolen and then reappears the next morning, Tintin investigates.', 'When a South American fetish is stolen and then reappears the next morning, Tintin investigates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnoWSEqb47ShALfMucmvAwAO7wY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441122'),
  ('1142585443058116293', 'The Broken Hearts Club: A Romantic Comedy', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Greg Berlanti, Paul Elliott', 'Greg Berlanti', 'Timothy Olyphant, Zach Braff, Ben Weber, Dean Cain, Billy Porter, Matt McGrath, Justin Theroux, Andrew Keegan', 'R', 'A close-knit group of gay friends share the emotional roller coster of life, relationships, the death of friends, new beginnings, jealousy, fatherhood and professional success. At various stages of life''s disarray, these young men share humorous and tragic relationships and always have each other to rely on.', 'A close-knit group of gay friends share the emotional roller coster of life, relationships, the death of friends, new beginnings, jealousy, fatherhood and professional success. At various stages of life''s disarray, these young men share humorous and tragic relationships and always have each other to rely on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9bqbopRZYy5Z2137zFoFQRXVEW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22597'),
  ('582754790402783387', 'The Broken Hearts Gallery', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Natalie Krinsky, Alar Kivilo, Andrew M. Robinson', 'Natalie Krinsky, Erik Nyhuus', 'Geraldine Viswanathan, Dacre Montgomery, Utkarsh Ambudkar, Molly Gordon, Phillipa Soo, Arturo Castro, Suki Waterhouse, Sheila McCarthy', 'PG-13', 'Lucy is a young gallery assistant who collects mementos from her relationships. She discovers that she must let go of her past to move forward, and comes up with a lovely, artistic way to help herself and others who have suffered heartbreak.', 'Lucy is a young gallery assistant who collects mementos from her relationships. She discovers that she must let go of her past to move forward, and comes up with a lovely, artistic way to help herself and others who have suffered heartbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGkr4r1e8nubmSNKJpv3HL6sFrA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616251'),
  ('930293306186383607', 'The Broken Jug', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Gustav Ucicky, Emil Jannings, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Thea von Harbou', 'Emil Jannings, Friedrich Kayssler, Max Gülstorff, Lina Carstens, Angela Salloker, Bruno Hübner, Paul Dahlke, Elisabeth Flickenschildt', null, 'Today is a fateful day for village judge Adam. Who broke Widow Kull’s jug fleeing head over heels after his nightly visit to her daughter? As the trial unfolds, it becomes clear to everyone that the judge himself is the culprit. Judge Adam twists and turns, invents countless explanations, and piles up the most absurd lies. But he is conducting a trial against himself—one he cannot win.', 'Today is a fateful day for village judge Adam. Who broke Widow Kull’s jug fleeing head over heels after his nightly visit to her daughter? As the trial unfolds, it becomes clear to everyone that the judge himself is the culprit. Judge Adam twists and turns, invents countless explanations, and piles up the most absurd lies. But he is conducting a trial against himself—one he cannot win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plm4gBNUPjqbRKLpTz9D2047b9Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258070'),
  ('711587057571821151', 'The Broken Landlord', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nesli Çölgeçen', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'Şener Şen, Erdal Özyağcılar, Nilgün Nazlı, Can Kolukısa, Bahri Selin, Atilla Yiğit, Füsun Demirel, Ayla Arslancan', null, 'The landowner (Agha) of the Haraptar village marries off his old father with the young and beautiful Kiraz. But on the nuptial night, his father dies and everything starts to go bad for the Agha. Due to the long drought and provocations of Kekec Salman (big brother of Kiraz), the peasants steal the crops and run away to Istanbul. Without the peasants and crops, Agha is also forced to sell the village and move to Istanbul. But he cannot keep up with the big city life and consumes all his money and belongings. Agha''s wife and relatives leave him during this downfall.', 'The landowner (Agha) of the Haraptar village marries off his old father with the young and beautiful Kiraz. But on the nuptial night, his father dies and everything starts to go bad for the Agha. Due to the long drought and provocations of Kekec Salman (big brother of Kiraz), the peasants steal the crops and run away to Istanbul. Without the peasants and crops, Agha is also forced to sell the village and move to Istanbul. But he cannot keep up with the big city life and consumes all his money and belongings. Agha''s wife and relatives leave him during this downfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oM7pM0oUeuACCRrmBQyubs8o06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31401'),
  ('914210047845070668', 'The Bronte Sisters', 1979, 'Drama', 'André Téchiné, Bruno Nuytten', 'Jean Gruault', 'Isabelle Adjani, Marie-France Pisier, Isabelle Huppert, Pascal Greggory, Patrick Magee, Hélène Surgère, Roland Bertin, Alice Sapritch', null, 'In a small presbytery in Yorkshire, England, living under the watchful eyes of their aunt and father, a strict Anglican pastor, the Bronte sisters write their first works and quickly become literary sensations.', 'In a small presbytery in Yorkshire, England, living under the watchful eyes of their aunt and father, a strict Anglican pastor, the Bronte sisters write their first works and quickly become literary sensations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVadOTRkewx4lRaV7Admpzp296u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91901'),
  ('986938373489234493', 'The Bronze', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Scott Henriksen, Bryan Buckley', 'Winston Rauch, Melissa Rauch', 'Melissa Rauch, Gary Cole, Thomas Middleditch, Sebastian Stan, Cecily Strong, Haley Lu Richardson, Dale Raoul, Craig Kilborn', 'R', 'In 2004, Hope Ann Greggory became an American hero after winning the bronze medal for the women''s gymnastics team. Today, she''s still living in her small hometown, washed-up and embittered. Stuck in the past, Hope must reassess her life when a promising young gymnast threatens her local celebrity status.', 'In 2004, Hope Ann Greggory became an American hero after winning the bronze medal for the women''s gymnastics team. Today, she''s still living in her small hometown, washed-up and embittered. Stuck in the past, Hope must reassess her life when a promising young gymnast threatens her local celebrity status.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ah2nD3Kml59svErVsz6DUsxlJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308453'),
