  ('765735249856489770', 'The Brotherhood', 1968, 'Crime, Drama', 'Martin Ritt, Francesco Cinieri, Giorgio Gentili', 'Lewis John Carlino', 'Kirk Douglas, Alex Cord, Irene Papas, Luther Adler, Susan Strasberg, Murray Hamilton, Eduardo Ciannelli, Joe De Santis', 'PG-13', 'The son of a powerful Mafia don comes home from his army service in Vietnam and wants to lead his own life, but family tradition, intrigues and powerplays involving his older brother dictate otherwise, and he finds himself being slowly drawn back into that world.', 'The son of a powerful Mafia don comes home from his army service in Vietnam and wants to lead his own life, but family tradition, intrigues and powerplays involving his older brother dictate otherwise, and he finds himself being slowly drawn back into that world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3w6hBkhRS4G2uMui2S8gaji02JV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53654'),
  ('778982615420397447', 'The Brotherhood', 2001, 'Horror', 'David DeCoteau, Howard Wexler, Stephenson Crossley', 'Matthew Jason Walsh, Barry Levy', 'Sam Page, Josh Hammond, Bradley Stryker, Elizabeth Bruderman, Forrest Cochran, Michael Lutz, Donnie Eichar, Christopher Cullen', null, 'A college freshman goes to a frat party and wakes up with a strange thirst for blood. He soon discovers the fraternity is actually secret society of vampires and that he is their newest recruit.', 'A college freshman goes to a frat party and wakes up with a strange thirst for blood. He soon discovers the fraternity is actually secret society of vampires and that he is their newest recruit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7C1Iq2SSmlxYW0z0EnOQ298DZuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28933'),
  ('485609730653723068', 'The Brotherhood 2: Young Warlocks', 2001, 'Horror', 'David DeCoteau, J.L. Delcampo, Thom Buckley', 'Ryan Carrassi', 'Sean Faris, Forrest Cochran, Stacey Scowley, Justin Allen, C.J. Thomason, Jennifer Capo, Noah Frank, Greg Lyczkowski', null, 'John, a new student at an exclusive private school, is having trouble with a group of bullying jocks who are jealous of his friendship with beautiful classmate Mary. He''s intrigued, then, when enigmatic misfit Luc offers him a chance to get back at them using witchcraft - but doesn''t realise that the price of his new-found power may be his life.', 'John, a new student at an exclusive private school, is having trouble with a group of bullying jocks who are jealous of his friendship with beautiful classmate Mary. He''s intrigued, then, when enigmatic misfit Luc offers him a chance to get back at them using witchcraft - but doesn''t realise that the price of his new-found power may be his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEe1CxSdV8uc4c4Dca1SryvrNvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44259'),
