  ('238827184069933818', 'The Brotherhood of the Bell', 1970, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Paul Wendkos, Kurt Neumann, Robert B. Hauser', 'David Karp', 'Glenn Ford, Rosemary Forsyth, Dean Jagger, Maurice Evans, Will Geer, Eduard Franz, William Conrad, Robert Pine', 'NR', 'A successful professor has his life disrupted by a secret from his past — in his college days he became a member of a powerful secret society, and now the society has a job for him.', 'A successful professor has his life disrupted by a secret from his past — in his college days he became a member of a powerful secret society, and now the society has a job for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cARpfJHKpBpVUZdpZD8oG0Mbkgo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37323'),
  ('1032470660770759197', 'The Brothers', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gary Hardwick, Donald Sparks', 'Gary Hardwick', 'Morris Chestnut, D.L. Hughley, Bill Bellamy, Shemar Moore, Tatyana Ali, Jenifer Lewis, Tamala Jones, Gabrielle Union', 'R', 'This is the story of four African-American "yuppies" (a banker, a doctor, a lawyer, and a "playboy") who call themselves "The Brothers". When the playboy gets engaged, the other three friends find themselves having to come to terms with their own issues of commitment and honesty...', 'This is the story of four African-American "yuppies" (a banker, a doctor, a lawyer, and a "playboy") who call themselves "The Brothers". When the playboy gets engaged, the other three friends find themselves having to come to terms with their own issues of commitment and honesty...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/342I0mOBCNTzx4ls4GvIagfzu2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20322'),
  ('372600190737699021', 'The Brothers Bloom', 2008, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rian Johnson, Steve Yedlin, Sean Guest', 'Rian Johnson', 'Adrien Brody, Rachel Weisz, Mark Ruffalo, Rinko Kikuchi, Robbie Coltrane, Maximilian Schell, Ricky Jay, Nora Zehetner', 'PG-13', 'The Brothers Bloom are the best con men in the world, swindling millionaires with complex scenarios of lust and intrigue. Now they''ve decided to take on one last job – showing a beautiful and eccentric heiress the time of her life with a romantic adventure that takes them around the world.', 'The Brothers Bloom are the best con men in the world, swindling millionaires with complex scenarios of lust and intrigue. Now they''ve decided to take on one last job – showing a beautiful and eccentric heiress the time of her life with a romantic adventure that takes them around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIz8iwzyjgWGzcIwHKpqhBs77ML.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21755'),
  ('380542705281032955', 'The Brothers Carry-Mouse-Off', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jim Pabian, Maurice Noble', null, null, null, 'Tom tries setting out things to lure Jerry into a trap, but Jerry, riding on Tom, picks them up as Tom puts them down. Tom chases Jerry upstairs, where he runs out a door to the outside. Tom puts on a lady mouse costume and plays the ukulele and is suddenly surrounded by dozens of amorous mice then hungry cats.', 'Tom tries setting out things to lure Jerry into a trap, but Jerry, riding on Tom, picks them up as Tom puts them down. Tom chases Jerry upstairs, where he runs out a door to the outside. Tom puts on a lady mouse costume and plays the ukulele and is suddenly surrounded by dozens of amorous mice then hungry cats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFkt4Bw3PRtT1z1L2JOxrFJ000I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234375'),
  ('153729971226688919', 'The Brothers Grimm', 2005, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Terry Gilliam, Newton Thomas Sigel, Keith Pain', 'Terry Gilliam, Tony Grisoni, Ehren Kruger', 'Matt Damon, Heath Ledger, Lena Headey, Peter Stormare, Monica Bellucci, Mackenzie Crook, Roger Ashton-Griffiths, Jonathan Pryce', 'PG-13', 'Folklore collectors and con artists, Jake and Will Grimm, travel from village to village pretending to protect townsfolk from enchanted creatures and performing exorcisms. However, they are put to the test when they encounter a real magical curse in a haunted forest with real magical beings, requiring genuine courage.', 'Folklore collectors and con artists, Jake and Will Grimm, travel from village to village pretending to protect townsfolk from enchanted creatures and performing exorcisms. However, they are put to the test when they encounter a real magical curse in a haunted forest with real magical beings, requiring genuine courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6J7QGCSrtvwvqAt6783BbO3h61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4442'),
  ('315743606379701600', 'The Brothers Karamazov', 1958, 'Drama, History', 'John Alton, Richard Brooks', 'Richard Brooks', 'Yul Brynner, Maria Schell, Claire Bloom, Lee J. Cobb, William Shatner, Richard Basehart, Albert Salmi, Judith Evelyn', null, 'Ryevsk, Russia, 1870. Tensions abound in the Karamazov family. Fyodor is a wealthy libertine who holds his purse strings tightly. His four grown sons include Dmitri, the eldest, an elegant officer, always broke and at odds with his father, betrothed to Katya, herself lovely and rich. The other brothers include a sterile aesthete, a factotum who is a bastard, and a monk. Family tensions erupt when Dmitri falls in love with one of his father''s mistresses, the coquette Grushenka. Two brothers see Dmitri''s jealousy of their father as an opportunity to inherit sooner. Acts of violence lead to the story''s conclusion: trials of honor, conscience, forgiveness, and redemption.', 'Ryevsk, Russia, 1870. Tensions abound in the Karamazov family. Fyodor is a wealthy libertine who holds his purse strings tightly. His four grown sons include Dmitri, the eldest, an elegant officer, always broke and at odds with his father, betrothed to Katya, herself lovely and rich. The other brothers include a sterile aesthete, a factotum who is a bastard, and a monk. Family tensions erupt when Dmitri falls in love with one of his father''s mistresses, the coquette Grushenka. Two brothers see Dmitri''s jealousy of their father as an opportunity to inherit sooner. Acts of violence lead to the story''s conclusion: trials of honor, conscience, forgiveness, and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebehR57SnzCmA9ce8hZXVQgl0lU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43138'),
  ('668187709054748866', 'The Brothers Karamazov', 1969, 'Drama', 'Ivan Pyryev, Sergey Vronsky, Kirill Lavrov', 'Ivan Pyryev', 'Mikhail Ulyanov, Lionella Pyryeva, Kirill Lavrov, Andrey Myagkov, Mark Prudkin, Svetlana Korkoshko, Valentin Nikulin, Pavel Pavlenko', null, 'Based on the novel of the same name by Fyodor Dostoevsky. The tragic story of the Karamazov family takes place in a Russian province in the late 19th century. The relations of their father and three brothers are very complicated and contradictory. One of the brothers is accused of killing his father, whom he did not commit. The brothers are unable to help him, and only a loving girl follows him to hard labour.', 'Based on the novel of the same name by Fyodor Dostoevsky. The tragic story of the Karamazov family takes place in a Russian province in the late 19th century. The relations of their father and three brothers are very complicated and contradictory. One of the brothers is accused of killing his father, whom he did not commit. The brothers are unable to help him, and only a loving girl follows him to hard labour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHgtrCWtcMivzbSZWOtzeW45GrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173962'),
  ('808683622282253071', 'The Brothers Lionheart', 1977, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Rune Ericson, Olle Hellbom', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Staffan Götestam, Lars Söderdahl, Allan Edwall, Gunn Wållgren, Folke Hjort, Per Oscarsson, Tommy Johnson, Jan Nygren', null, 'After brothers Jonathan and Crusty pass away, they reunite in Nangijala, the land of eternal spring. Casting a long shadow over their world is the tyrant Tengil, ruler of the country Karmanjaka, where he’s building his new fortress up in the Ancient Mountains.', 'After brothers Jonathan and Crusty pass away, they reunite in Nangijala, the land of eternal spring. Casting a long shadow over their world is the tyrant Tengil, ruler of the country Karmanjaka, where he’s building his new fortress up in the Ancient Mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giPbP2p6R2pnIIETAEmWWhZ4jVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11291'),
  ('1101381285543471759', 'The Brothers McMullen', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Edward Burns, Dick Fisher', 'Edward Burns', 'Edward Burns, Michael McGlone, Connie Britton, Jack Mulcahy, Catharine Bolz, Shari Albert, Maxine Bahns, Jennifer Jostyn', 'R', 'Deals with the lives of the three Irish Catholic McMullen brothers from Long Island, New York, over three months, as they grapple with basic ideas and values — love, sex, marriage, religion and family — in the 1990s.', 'Deals with the lives of the three Irish Catholic McMullen brothers from Long Island, New York, over three months, as they grapple with basic ideas and values — love, sex, marriage, religion and family — in the 1990s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oWsOJP0ed5gs8n2UywcailoxFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16388'),
  ('797734188087590973', 'The Brothers Rico', 1957, 'Crime', 'Phil Karlson, Burnett Guffey', 'Lewis Meltzer, Ben Perry, Dalton Trumbo', 'Richard Conte, Dianne Foster, Kathryn Grant, Larry Gates, James Darren, Argentina Brunetti, Lamont Johnson, Harry Bellaver', null, 'Eddie Rico, the erstwhile bookkeeper for a big Mafia boss, is now making a living as an honest merchant in Florida with his family. Things go sour when the police start a search for his syndicate-linked brothers who are on the lam after a big hit, forcing Eddie to get involved with the Mafia again.', 'Eddie Rico, the erstwhile bookkeeper for a big Mafia boss, is now making a living as an honest merchant in Florida with his family. Things go sour when the police start a search for his syndicate-linked brothers who are on the lam after a big hit, forcing Eddie to get involved with the Mafia again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRGxLEbMmaywycJwO8PZxOs9qy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35017'),
  ('960175655913743630', 'The Brothers Solomon', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Bob Odenkirk, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Will Forte', 'Will Arnett, Will Forte, Kristen Wiig, Chi McBride, Lee Majors, Sam Lloyd, Malin Åkerman, Bill Hader', 'R', 'A pair of well-meaning, but socially inept brothers try to find their perfect mates in order to provide their dying father with a grandchild.', 'A pair of well-meaning, but socially inept brothers try to find their perfect mates in order to provide their dying father with a grandchild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63u2QZZZIaME05TSv3tLKpibII1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10071'),
  ('810250739726130495', 'The Brown Bunny', 2003, 'Drama', 'Vincent Gallo, Vincent Gallo', 'Vincent Gallo', 'Vincent Gallo, Chloë Sevigny, Cheryl Tiegs, Elizabeth Blake, Anna Vareschi, Mary Morasky, Jeffrey Wood, Eric Wood', 'NR', 'Bud Clay races motorcycles in the 250cc Formula II class of road racing. After a race in New Hampshire, he has five days to get to his next race in California. During his road trip, he is haunted by memories of the last time he saw Daisy, his true love.', 'Bud Clay races motorcycles in the 250cc Formula II class of road racing. After a race in New Hampshire, he has five days to get to his next race in California. During his road trip, he is haunted by memories of the last time he saw Daisy, his true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGzU4TgdqmMjIfPIgf2MjDW6H7c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12703'),
  ('1112819565178298758', 'The Browning Version', 1951, 'Drama', 'Anthony Asquith, Desmond Dickinson, George Pollock', 'Terence Rattigan', 'Michael Redgrave, Jean Kent, Nigel Patrick, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Bill Travers, Ronald Howard, Ivan Samson, Judith Furse', null, 'Andrew Crocker-Harris has been forced from his position as the classics master at an English public school due to poor health. As he winds up his final term, he discovers not only that his wife, Millie, has been unfaithful to him with one of his fellow schoolmasters, but that the school''s students and faculty have long disdained him. However, an unexpected act of kindness causes Crocker-Harris to re-evaluate his life''s work.', 'Andrew Crocker-Harris has been forced from his position as the classics master at an English public school due to poor health. As he winds up his final term, he discovers not only that his wife, Millie, has been unfaithful to him with one of his fellow schoolmasters, but that the school''s students and faculty have long disdained him. However, an unexpected act of kindness causes Crocker-Harris to re-evaluate his life''s work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRlXkYgQc6QfwYMAlv2neKhRswl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39946'),
  ('1089240342587690931', 'The Browning Version', 1994, 'Drama', 'Mike Figgis, Jean-François Robin', 'Ronald Harwood', 'Albert Finney, Greta Scacchi, Matthew Modine, Julian Sands, Michael Gambon, Ben Silverstone, Jim Sturgess, Joseph Beattie', 'R', 'Andrew Crocker-Harris is an embittered and disliked teacher of Greek and Latin at a British prep school. After nearly 20 years of service, he is being forced to retire for ''health reasons'', and perhaps may not even be given a pension. The boys regard him as a Hitler, with some justification. His unfaithful wife Laura tries to hurt him in any way she can. Andrew must come to terms with his failed life and at least regain his own self-esteem.', 'Andrew Crocker-Harris is an embittered and disliked teacher of Greek and Latin at a British prep school. After nearly 20 years of service, he is being forced to retire for ''health reasons'', and perhaps may not even be given a pension. The boys regard him as a Hitler, with some justification. His unfaithful wife Laura tries to hurt him in any way she can. Andrew must come to terms with his failed life and at least regain his own self-esteem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8My9Wnzu1zasVVzGdDj5y2dItuM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49805'),
  ('1106737558292281621', 'The Brutalist', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Lol Crawley, Brady Corbet, Célie Valdenaire', 'Brady Corbet, Mona Fastvold', 'Adrien Brody, Felicity Jones, Guy Pearce, Joe Alwyn, Raffey Cassidy, Stacy Martin, Isaach de Bankolé, Alessandro Nivola', 'R', 'When an innovative modern architect flees post-war Europe, he is given the opportunity to rebuild his legacy. Set during the dawn of the modern United States (in Pennsylvania), his wife joins him, and their lives are forever changed by a demanding, wealthy patron.', 'When an innovative modern architect flees post-war Europe, he is given the opportunity to rebuild his legacy. Set during the dawn of the modern United States (in Pennsylvania), his wife joins him, and their lives are forever changed by a demanding, wealthy patron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vP7Yd6couiAaw9jgMd5cjMRj3hQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549509'),
  ('364710918549341766', 'The Brutalization of Franz Blum', 1974, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Reinhard Hauff, W. P. Hassenstein', 'Burkhard Driest', 'Jürgen Prochnow, Burkhard Driest, Tilo Prückner, Lutz Mackensy, Fritz Hollenbeck, Edgar Bessen, Kurt Raab, Gert Haucke', null, 'Born into a well-off family, Franz Blum had led a carefree youth until, some time after graduating from high school, he was arrested by the police. For, involved by a gang of bad boys, the young man had taken part in a bank robbery. A "heroic deed" which earned him six years in prison. Once behind bars, he was treated with ruthless inhumanity by the guards. And little by little - but inexorably - Franz turned into an insurgent...', 'Born into a well-off family, Franz Blum had led a carefree youth until, some time after graduating from high school, he was arrested by the police. For, involved by a gang of bad boys, the young man had taken part in a bank robbery. A "heroic deed" which earned him six years in prison. Once behind bars, he was treated with ruthless inhumanity by the guards. And little by little - but inexorably - Franz turned into an insurgent...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkzzfIbOh62kAkopUBUFoGPwvvb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268555'),
  ('771489187153630379', 'The Brute', 1953, 'Drama, Crime', 'Luis Buñuel, Agustín Jiménez, Ignacio Villareal', 'Luis Buñuel, Luis Alcoriza', 'Pedro Armendáriz, Katy Jurado, Rosita Arenas, Andrés Soler, Paco Martínez, Gloria Mestre, Roberto Meyer, Beatriz Ramos', null, 'A tough young man, who helps to kick poor people out of their houses, falls in love with a girl. She lives with her father in the building about to be demolished.', 'A tough young man, who helps to kick poor people out of their houses, falls in love with a girl. She lives with her father in the building about to be demolished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLSssRzdL1Ww4mje7sBoirWJTv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42502'),
  ('299681100515753857', 'The Brute', 1977, 'Drama', 'Alf Hicks, Gerry O''Hara, Dennis C. Lewiston', 'Gerry O''Hara', 'Sarah Douglas, Julian Glover, Roberta Gibbs, Bruce Robinson, Suzanne Stone, Kenneth Nelson, Nicholas Barnes, Charlotte Cornwell', null, 'Glamour model Diane Shepherd is routinely being beaten by her husband Tim, who accuses her of infidelity. When she can''t take it anymore, she finds shelter with photographer Mark and his girlfriend Carrie. They introduce Diane to Millie, who is in a similar situation. Meanwhile, Tim informs Diane that if she doesn''t come back to him, he will see to it that he gains custody of their son, Timmy.', 'Glamour model Diane Shepherd is routinely being beaten by her husband Tim, who accuses her of infidelity. When she can''t take it anymore, she finds shelter with photographer Mark and his girlfriend Carrie. They introduce Diane to Millie, who is in a similar situation. Meanwhile, Tim informs Diane that if she doesn''t come back to him, he will see to it that he gains custody of their son, Timmy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZwy6WmaJZ0mhBpIiD2n9mH9yk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122050'),
  ('868867913688461749', 'The Brute Man', 1946, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Bernard B. Brown, Jean Yarbrough, Maury Gertsman', 'M. Coates Webster, George Bricker', 'Rondo Hatton, Tom Neal, Jan Wiley, Jane Adams, Donald MacBride, Peter Whitney, Fred Coby, Janelle Johnson Dolenz', null, 'A facially disfigured and mentally unhinged man wreaks his revenge on those he blames for his condition.', 'A facially disfigured and mentally unhinged man wreaks his revenge on those he blames for his condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzRslu8AbdUlxrb7NE56MGhQRw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84720'),
  ('1035444815654535038', 'The Brutes', 1970, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Roger Fritz', 'Jürgen Knop, Roger Fritz', 'Helga Anders, Klaus Löwitsch, Arthur Brauss, Rolf Zacher, Monika Zinnenberg, Henry van Lyck, Astrid Boner, Renate Grosser', null, 'On the edge of a big city on a go-kart track, Mike and Werner meet Alice and her friends. They like the girl. Mike manages to separate Alice from her group and get into the car with Werner. It had been decided to go to a lake with the others to take a bath at night. Too late Alice realizes that Mike and Werner did not drive to the agreed lake, but to a lonely gravel pit. The friends will not come anymore. And she realizes the intentions of her companions.', 'On the edge of a big city on a go-kart track, Mike and Werner meet Alice and her friends. They like the girl. Mike manages to separate Alice from her group and get into the car with Werner. It had been decided to go to a lake with the others to take a bath at night. Too late Alice realizes that Mike and Werner did not drive to the agreed lake, but to a lonely gravel pit. The friends will not come anymore. And she realizes the intentions of her companions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wWSm1U0x74Sa6hCxjUEJHPq9fi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290771'),
  ('329835849573518489', 'The Bubble', 1966, 'Science Fiction', 'Arch Oboler, Charles F. Wheeler', 'Arch Oboler', 'Michael Cole, Deborah Walley, Johnny Desmond, Kassie McMahon, Virginia Gregg, Barbara Eiler, Vic Perrin, Olan Soule', null, 'A couple encounter mysterious atmospheric effects in an airplane and find themselves in a town where people behave oddly.', 'A couple encounter mysterious atmospheric effects in an airplane and find themselves in a town where people behave oddly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhrsPEDNaUKr9Zi8e9h7xIecg65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247308'),
  ('108702353131058036', 'The Bubble', 2006, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Eytan Fox', 'Eytan Fox, Gal Uchovsky', 'Ohad Knoller, Yousef Sweid, Daniella Wircer, Alon Friedman, Tzion Baruch, Ruba Bilal, Oded Leopold, Zohar Liba', null, 'The movie follows a group of young friends in the city of Tel Aviv and is as much a love song to the city as it is an exploration of the claim that people in Tel Aviv are isolated from the rest of the country and the turmoil it''s going through. The movie looks at young people''s lives in Tel Aviv through the POVs of gays and straights, Jews and Arabs, men and women.', 'The movie follows a group of young friends in the city of Tel Aviv and is as much a love song to the city as it is an exploration of the claim that people in Tel Aviv are isolated from the rest of the country and the turmoil it''s going through. The movie looks at young people''s lives in Tel Aviv through the POVs of gays and straights, Jews and Arabs, men and women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b73kg6GIuUBAHavvQm2AKSCBA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15976'),
  ('557996744952889881', 'The Bubble', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Paul Ghirardani, Virginia Reina, James O''Donnell', 'Pam Brady, Judd Apatow', 'Karen Gillan, Iris Apatow, Fred Armisen, Maria Bakalova, Vir Das, David Duchovny, Samson Kayo, Keegan-Michael Key', 'R', 'Sneaking out. Hooking up. Melting down. The cast and crew of a blockbuster action franchise attempt to shoot a sequel while quarantining at a posh hotel.', 'Sneaking out. Hooking up. Melting down. The cast and crew of a blockbuster action franchise attempt to shoot a sequel while quarantining at a posh hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edYk5TSowZIDv138bCpF5ls3XI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765119'),
  ('358169606623802148', 'The Buccaneer', 1938, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance, History', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Victor Milner, Richard Harlan', 'Harold Lamb, C. Gardner Sullivan, Edwin Justus Mayer', 'Fredric March, Franziska Gaal, Akim Tamiroff, Margot Grahame, Walter Brennan, Ian Keith, Anthony Quinn, Douglass Dumbrille', 'NR', 'French pirate Jean Lafitte rescues a girl and joins the War of 1812.', 'French pirate Jean Lafitte rescues a girl and joins the War of 1812.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1AkDvp2eSrpfiqOPn7aCyg4Wt5X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115425'),
  ('182013856291567351', 'The Buccaneer', 1958, 'Adventure, Drama, War, History', 'Loyal Griggs, Anthony Quinn, Clem Jones', 'Harold Lamb, Jesse Lasky Jr., Bernice Mosk', 'Yul Brynner, Claire Bloom, Charles Boyer, Inger Stevens, Charlton Heston, Henry Hull, Lorne Greene, E.G. Marshall', 'NR', 'During the War of 1812 against Britain: General Andrew Jackson has only 1,200 men left to defend New Orleans when he learns that a British fleet will arrive with 60 ships and 16,000 men to take the city. In this situation an island near the city becomes strategically important to both parties, but it''s inhabited by the last big buccaneer: Jean Lafitte. Although Lafitte never attacks American ships, the governor hates him for selling merchandise without taxes - and is loved by the citizens for the same reason. When the big fight gets nearer, Lafitte is drawn between the fronts. His heart belongs to America, but his people urge him to join the party that''s more likely to win.', 'During the War of 1812 against Britain: General Andrew Jackson has only 1,200 men left to defend New Orleans when he learns that a British fleet will arrive with 60 ships and 16,000 men to take the city. In this situation an island near the city becomes strategically important to both parties, but it''s inhabited by the last big buccaneer: Jean Lafitte. Although Lafitte never attacks American ships, the governor hates him for selling merchandise without taxes - and is loved by the citizens for the same reason. When the big fight gets nearer, Lafitte is drawn between the fronts. His heart belongs to America, but his people urge him to join the party that''s more likely to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUUg1IuxuKl54eyQfyu5tCZhI1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4933'),
  ('221314054791334152', 'The Bucket List', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rob Reiner, John Schwartzman, Frank Capra III', 'Justin Zackham', 'Jack Nicholson, Morgan Freeman, Sean Hayes, Beverly Todd, Alfonso Freeman, Dawn Lewis, Rob Morrow, Brian Copeland', 'PG-13', 'Corporate billionaire Edward Cole and working class mechanic Carter Chambers are worlds apart. At a crossroads in their lives, they share a hospital room and discover they have two things in common: a desire to spend the time they have left doing everything they ever wanted to do and an unrealized need to come to terms with who they are. Together they embark on the road trip of a lifetime, becoming friends along the way and learning to live life to the fullest, with insight and humor.', 'Corporate billionaire Edward Cole and working class mechanic Carter Chambers are worlds apart. At a crossroads in their lives, they share a hospital room and discover they have two things in common: a desire to spend the time they have left doing everything they ever wanted to do and an unrealized need to come to terms with who they are. Together they embark on the road trip of a lifetime, becoming friends along the way and learning to live life to the fullest, with insight and humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idbNSe8zsYKQL97dJApfOrDSdya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7350'),
  ('483221456360545390', 'The Buckingham Murders', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Emma Dalesman, Hansal Mehta, Rishabh Ghelani', 'Aseem Arora, Raghav Raj Kakker, Kashyap Kapoor', 'Kareena Kapoor Khan, Ranveer Brar, Keith Allen, Ash Tandon, Prabhleen Sandhu, Sarah-Jane Dias, Sartaaj Kakkar, Haider Mohammed Javed', null, 'Fresh wounds are reopened when Jasmeet Bhamra, a cop and a single mother who recently lost her child in a shooting spree, transfers to High Wycombe and is assigned a case of a missing child.', 'Fresh wounds are reopened when Jasmeet Bhamra, a cop and a single mother who recently lost her child in a shooting spree, transfers to High Wycombe and is assigned a case of a missing child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opWu2Qf1g5OfAWP4HdmH4ildwuV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053348'),
  ('15009271709773458', 'The Buckskin Lady', 1957, 'Western', 'Carl K. Hittleman, Ellsworth Fredericks', 'David Lang, Carl K. Hittleman', 'Patricia Medina, Richard Denning, Gerald Mohr, Henry Hull, Hank Worden, Dorothy Adams, Byron Foulger, Frank Sully', 'NR', 'Patricia Medina plays the title character in The Buckskin Lady. Medina is cast as female gambler Angela Medley, who is forced by circumstances to align herself with outlaw Slinger. But Angela has never gotten over her love for honest frontier doctor Bruce Merritt, and at the first opportunity she redeems herself by catching a bullet intended for the doc. Henry Hull delivers the film''s most memorable performance as Angela''s drunken wretch of a father. Per the title, Buckskin Lady affords the viewer ample opportunity to see Patricia Medina in form-fitting western garb.', 'Patricia Medina plays the title character in The Buckskin Lady. Medina is cast as female gambler Angela Medley, who is forced by circumstances to align herself with outlaw Slinger. But Angela has never gotten over her love for honest frontier doctor Bruce Merritt, and at the first opportunity she redeems herself by catching a bullet intended for the doc. Henry Hull delivers the film''s most memorable performance as Angela''s drunken wretch of a father. Per the title, Buckskin Lady affords the viewer ample opportunity to see Patricia Medina in form-fitting western garb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fmUi7DHDB9mcC4cSRatV19KEOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78062'),
  ('614857929097339410', 'The Buddhist Fist', 1980, 'Action', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Tsui Siu-Ming', 'Tsui Siu-Ming, Wong Jing, Lam Chi-Ming', 'Tsui Siu-Ming, Chan Siu-Pang, Yuen Shun-Yi, Fan Mei-Sheng, Simon Yuen Siu-Tien, Lee Hoi-Sang, Peter Chan Lung, Ho Pak-Kwong', null, 'Two orphans raised by monks are taught divine secrets of kung fu. As adults, one chooses the path of the monks while the other opts for the outside world. Aspiring barber and experienced kung-fu fighter Shang learns that his childhood friend, Siu Ming, has been framed for murder by an unknown villain.When Shang begins looking into the crime, he soon finds himself the target of an assassination attempt. They reunite to find their missing godfather and seek vengeance on his kidnappers. Who is behind all these crimes, and can Shang stop them?', 'Two orphans raised by monks are taught divine secrets of kung fu. As adults, one chooses the path of the monks while the other opts for the outside world. Aspiring barber and experienced kung-fu fighter Shang learns that his childhood friend, Siu Ming, has been framed for murder by an unknown villain.When Shang begins looking into the crime, he soon finds himself the target of an assassination attempt. They reunite to find their missing godfather and seek vengeance on his kidnappers. Who is behind all these crimes, and can Shang stop them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xR0mBnDeH6iENFhZ7TVTglFnD49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61039'),
  ('708418250242967333', 'The Buddies', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Yves Robert', 'François Boyer, Yves Robert, Jules Romains', 'Philippe Noiret, Pierre Mondy, Claude Rich, Christian Marin, Jacques Balutin, Guy Bedos, Michael Lonsdale, Claude Piéplu', null, 'Seven old pals live inseparable lives, dividing their time between hilarious pranks and memorable drinking bouts. Bénin is the mastermind, Broudier the enforcer and Lesueur the prankster. One evening, a grandiose plan was hatched: to wreak havoc in two peaceful sub-prefectures: Ambert and Issoire. Broudier begins: in the middle of the night, disguised as a minister, he wakes up a barracks in Ambert and sets in motion a thunderous maneuver. The next day, disguised as a Dominican, Bénin climbed to the pulpit of the cathedral and delivered a sermon insulting Christian doctrine. The same day, in Issoire, the local authorities were preparing to unveil a statue of Vercingetorix. But the statue came to life, pelting the crowd with tomatoes: it was Lesueur. With their minds at rest, the friends headed off to the Côte-d''Or for a vacation. But already, one of them begins to perform a new prank.', 'Seven old pals live inseparable lives, dividing their time between hilarious pranks and memorable drinking bouts. Bénin is the mastermind, Broudier the enforcer and Lesueur the prankster. One evening, a grandiose plan was hatched: to wreak havoc in two peaceful sub-prefectures: Ambert and Issoire. Broudier begins: in the middle of the night, disguised as a minister, he wakes up a barracks in Ambert and sets in motion a thunderous maneuver. The next day, disguised as a Dominican, Bénin climbed to the pulpit of the cathedral and delivered a sermon insulting Christian doctrine. The same day, in Issoire, the local authorities were preparing to unveil a statue of Vercingetorix. But the statue came to life, pelting the crowd with tomatoes: it was Lesueur. With their minds at rest, the friends headed off to the Côte-d''Or for a vacation. But already, one of them begins to perform a new prank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmgfML9nSXFhismrlMgEgzFJG3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76792'),
  ('80658642092707566', 'The Buddy Holly Story', 1978, 'Drama, Music', 'Steve Rash, Stevan Larner, Carol Himes', 'Robert Gittler', 'Gary Busey, Don Stroud, Charles Martin Smith, Conrad Janis, William Jordan, Maria Richwine, Amy Johnston, Dick O''Neill', 'PG', 'A chronicle of the rise and brief career of rock ''n'' roll star Buddy Holly, who aspires to play music the way he wants it to sound. Holly and his band, the Crickets, are first invited to record in Nashville, where they encounter creative differences with the producing staff. Later they play a major booking at the Apollo Theater, scheduled there under the mistaken assumption that they''re a black band. Holly''s career eventually goes solo -- until the tragic day the music dies.', 'A chronicle of the rise and brief career of rock ''n'' roll star Buddy Holly, who aspires to play music the way he wants it to sound. Holly and his band, the Crickets, are first invited to record in Nashville, where they encounter creative differences with the producing staff. Later they play a major booking at the Apollo Theater, scheduled there under the mistaken assumption that they''re a black band. Holly''s career eventually goes solo -- until the tragic day the music dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Zu9YdN5O4jnXJmqBMHckkKpJ2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24153'),
  ('637623914386262437', 'The Buddy System', 1984, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Glenn Jordan, Matthew F. Leonetti', 'Mary Agnes Donoghue', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Susan Sarandon, Nancy Allen, Jean Stapleton, Wil Wheaton, Edward Winter, Keene Curtis, Tom Lacy', null, 'A school truant officer uncovers a young boy''s attempt to fake his residential address and subsequently befriends the kid and his mother.', 'A school truant officer uncovers a young boy''s attempt to fake his residential address and subsequently befriends the kid and his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1Ozz1hXrOXt9k4Tzd5FjctEYMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61471'),
  ('430367046422694295', 'The Buffalo Boy and His Flute', 1963, 'Animation', 'Duan Xiaoxuan, Qian Jiajun, Te Wei', 'Te Wei', null, null, 'A young boy who likes to play the flute dreams that he has lost his water buffalo.', 'A young boy who likes to play the flute dreams that he has lost his water buffalo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/535DEhugZONmeYGfbKJ1rL55WLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266700'),
  ('343080225025348793', 'The Bugs Bunny/Road Runner Movie', 1979, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Music, Science Fiction', 'Chuck Jones, Phil Monroe', 'Chuck Jones, Michael Maltese, John W. Dunn', 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan, Paul Julian, Nicolai Shutorev, Joan Gerber', 'G', 'A collection of Warner Brothers short cartoon features, "starring" the likes of Daffy Duck, Porky Pig and Wile.E.Coyote. These animations are interspersed by Bugs Bunny reminiscing on past events and providing links between the individual animations which are otherwise unconnected. This 1979 feature-length compilation includes several of his best cartoons. Among the 11 shorts shown in their entirety are the classics "Robin Hood Daffy," "What''s Opera, Doc?," "Bully for Bugs," and "Duck Amuck". The Bugs Bunny Road Runner Movie provides a showcase not only for Jones''s razor-sharp timing, but for the work of his exceptional crew, which included designer Maurice Noble, writer Mike Maltese, composers Carl Stalling and Milt Franklyn, and voice actor Mel Blanc.', 'A collection of Warner Brothers short cartoon features, "starring" the likes of Daffy Duck, Porky Pig and Wile.E.Coyote. These animations are interspersed by Bugs Bunny reminiscing on past events and providing links between the individual animations which are otherwise unconnected. This 1979 feature-length compilation includes several of his best cartoons. Among the 11 shorts shown in their entirety are the classics "Robin Hood Daffy," "What''s Opera, Doc?," "Bully for Bugs," and "Duck Amuck". The Bugs Bunny Road Runner Movie provides a showcase not only for Jones''s razor-sharp timing, but for the work of his exceptional crew, which included designer Maurice Noble, writer Mike Maltese, composers Carl Stalling and Milt Franklyn, and voice actor Mel Blanc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fogEHQJvyVkqk1R9ZzVyxtT5gH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20007'),
  ('542426711449040225', 'The Bulldog Breed', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Robert Asher, Jack Asher', 'Jack Davies, Henry Blyth, Norman Wisdom', 'Norman Wisdom, Ian Hunter, David Lodge, Robert Urquhart, Edward Chapman, Eddie Byrne, Peter Jones, John Le Mesurier', null, 'Norman Puckle, a well-meaning but clumsy grocer''s assistant, can''t seem to do anything right. After being rejected by Marlene, the love of his life, he attempts suicide, but can''t even do that. He is saved from jumping off a cliff at ''Lover''s Leap'' by a Royal Navy petty officer. He persuades Puckle to join the Royal Navy, where he''ll meet ''lots of girls''. Life in the Navy proves not to be as rosy as it''s been described, and Puckle fails at every task during basic training. But despite this, he''s regarded by the Admiral in charge of a rocket project to be a ''typical average British sailor'', and chosen to be the first man to fly into outer space in an experimental rocket.', 'Norman Puckle, a well-meaning but clumsy grocer''s assistant, can''t seem to do anything right. After being rejected by Marlene, the love of his life, he attempts suicide, but can''t even do that. He is saved from jumping off a cliff at ''Lover''s Leap'' by a Royal Navy petty officer. He persuades Puckle to join the Royal Navy, where he''ll meet ''lots of girls''. Life in the Navy proves not to be as rosy as it''s been described, and Puckle fails at every task during basic training. But despite this, he''s regarded by the Admiral in charge of a rocket project to be a ''typical average British sailor'', and chosen to be the first man to fly into outer space in an experimental rocket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57ZDmjcPF6T85DKlkkT6xxUW540.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14116'),
  ('1071598248045564898', 'The Bullet Train', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Junya Satō, Masahiko Iimura, Masao Shimizu', 'Ryūnosuke Ono, Junya Satō', 'Ken Takakura, Sonny Chiba, Kei Yamamoto, Eiji Gō, Akira Oda, Raita Ryu, Masayo Utsunomiya, Ken Utsui', 'NR', 'A Japanese bullet train is threatened with a bomb that will explode automatically if the train slows below 80 km/h, unless a ransom is paid. Police race to find the bombers so the train crew can learn how to defuse the bomb.', 'A Japanese bullet train is threatened with a bomb that will explode automatically if the train slows below 80 km/h, unless a ransom is paid. Police race to find the bombers so the train crew can learn how to defuse the bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXaBBPqJRkW4SGqkbiLHNzDbzIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47634'),
  ('1072741320293991282', 'The Bullet Vanishes', 2012, 'Action, Mystery', 'Lo Chi-Leung, Chan Chi-Ying', 'Lo Chi-Leung, Yeung Sin-Ling', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Yang Mi, Wu Gang, Jing Boran, Gao Hu, Jiang Yiyan, Chin Ka-Lok', 'PG-13', 'One rainy night in an arms factory near Shanghai, a young female worker accused of stealing a box of bullets from the ruthless Boss Ding is violently killed in a game of Russian roulette. Half a month later, a series of inexplicable deaths takes place in the factory, where the victims are shot but no bullets are found. Rumors of a deadly curse begin to spread in the factory, terrorizing the workers there. So, eccentric police inspector Song Donglu and his hot-blooded, gunslinging partner Guo Zhui are sent in to investigate the mystery of the phantom bullets...', 'One rainy night in an arms factory near Shanghai, a young female worker accused of stealing a box of bullets from the ruthless Boss Ding is violently killed in a game of Russian roulette. Half a month later, a series of inexplicable deaths takes place in the factory, where the victims are shot but no bullets are found. Rumors of a deadly curse begin to spread in the factory, terrorizing the workers there. So, eccentric police inspector Song Donglu and his hot-blooded, gunslinging partner Guo Zhui are sent in to investigate the mystery of the phantom bullets...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8G5SjBSUuWYn4se8rIOxAZdsFxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129850'),
  ('1145441687223362583', 'The Bulleteers', 1942, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Bud Collyer, Joan Alexander, Jackson Beck, Julian Noa', null, 'Criminals with rocket powered car loot and extort the city, and only Superman can stop them!', 'Criminals with rocket powered car loot and extort the city, and only Superman can stop them!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVLYnYmrsOnwGrC0NKbmoyh9NTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145963'),
  ('867591812599576311', 'The Bullfighters', 1945, 'Comedy, Music', 'Malcolm St. Clair, Emil Newman, Norbert Brodine', 'Malcolm St. Clair, Stan Laurel', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Margo Woode, Richard Lane, Carol Andrews, Diosa Costello, Rory Calhoun', null, 'Bumbling detective Stan Laurel disguises himself as a famous matador in order to hide from the vengeful Richard K. Muldoon, who spent time in prison on Stan''s bogus testimony.', 'Bumbling detective Stan Laurel disguises himself as a famous matador in order to hide from the vengeful Richard K. Muldoon, who spent time in prison on Stan''s bogus testimony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxXu8LwRR8kNalvHMdK1uB9JFOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58732'),
  ('522608926758244595', 'The Bumblebee Flies Anyway', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stephen Kazmierski, Martin Duffy', 'Jennifer Sarja', 'Elijah Wood, Janeane Garofalo, Roger Rees, Joe Perrino, Rachael Leigh Cook, George O. Gore II, Adam LaVorgna, Oni Faida Lampley', null, 'An amnesiac youth tries to piece together his past, but what he discovers may jeopardize his future.', 'An amnesiac youth tries to piece together his past, but what he discovers may jeopardize his future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4k1fezf5fVMv7rqecGFeXhtQdNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96716'),
  ('817316773180376887', 'The Bund', 1983, 'Drama', 'Dennis Chiu Jan-Keung', 'Chan Kiu-Ying', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Ray Lui, Angie Chiu Nga-Chi, Danny Lau Dan, Susanna Au-Yeung Pui-San, Lau Nga-Lai, Meg Lam Kin-Ming, Pak Man-Biu', null, 'After losing everything, a young man rebuilds his life and finds love in 1920s Shanghai -- all while rising to power in an organized crime syndicate.', 'After losing everything, a young man rebuilds his life and finds love in 1920s Shanghai -- all while rising to power in an organized crime syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Yqufx2ALSDhIEQsBbyKJ0Uunav.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537795'),
  ('108759258303475366', 'The Bunker', 1981, 'War, Drama', 'George Schaefer, Gabriel Aghion, Jacques Bataille', 'John Gay', 'Anthony Hopkins, Richard Jordan, Cliff Gorman, James Naughton, Michael Lonsdale, Martin Jarvis, Michael Kitchen, Andrew Ray', null, 'Dramatization depicting the events surrounding Adolf Hitler''s last weeks in and around his underground bunker in Berlin before and during the battle for the city.', 'Dramatization depicting the events surrounding Adolf Hitler''s last weeks in and around his underground bunker in Berlin before and during the battle for the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0meiXebNi3GqFfceTG0ynGd08B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41407'),
  ('271678033044020303', 'The Bunker', 2001, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Rob Green, John Pardue, Daniel Toland', 'Clive Dawson', 'Jason Flemyng, Andrew Tiernan, Christopher Fairbank, Simon Kunz, Andrew-Lee Potts, John Carlisle, Eddie Marsan, Jack Davenport', null, 'In 1944, in the Belgian - German border, seven German soldiers survive an American attack in the front and lock themselves in a bunker to protect the position. Under siege by the enemy and with little ammunition, they decide to explore underground tunnels to seek supplies and find an escape route. While in the tunnel, weird things happen with the group.', 'In 1944, in the Belgian - German border, seven German soldiers survive an American attack in the front and lock themselves in a bunker to protect the position. Under siege by the enemy and with little ammunition, they decide to explore underground tunnels to seek supplies and find an escape route. While in the tunnel, weird things happen with the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR6ggIeLAFO1uLbytNVzW8ASq57.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7454'),
  ('208594805925255704', 'The Bunker', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Horror', 'Nikias Chryssos, Matthias Reisser', 'Nikias Chryssos', 'Pit Bukowski, Daniel Fripan, Oona von Maydell, David Scheller', 'PG-13', 'A student moves in with a family that lives in an underground house in the middle of the forest, far from civilization. His hopes of peace and quiet are soon shattered, when it becomes apparent that both the parents and their son have a screw loose.', 'A student moves in with a family that lives in an underground house in the middle of the forest, far from civilization. His hopes of peace and quiet are soon shattered, when it becomes apparent that both the parents and their son have a screw loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BbZgnZZiBYsN9M8cfxbZDsycFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324440'),
  ('992078565749276061', 'The Bunker', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Brian Hanson, Roman Zenz, David Guglielmo', 'Brian Hanson, Charles L. Bunce', 'Chelsea Edmundson, Tony Todd, Tobin Bell, Chad Michael Collins, Cullen Douglas, Christopher Matthew Cook, Debbie Fan, Sharif Ibrahim', null, 'When mysterious alien ships appear in the sky, a scientist is sealed in an underground bunker and must create a bio-weapon to stop the unknown visitors, but paranoia and isolation cause her to question the true intention of her mission.', 'When mysterious alien ships appear in the sky, a scientist is sealed in an underground bunker and must create a bio-weapon to stop the unknown visitors, but paranoia and isolation cause her to question the true intention of her mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvT1btNgSDPtLjp7JHyRIl5Fp1N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831396'),
  ('801119403785655382', 'The Bunker Game', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Roberto Zazzara, Marco Graziaplena', 'Davide Orsini, Roberto Zazzara, Chesca Forristal', 'Gaia Weiss, Mark Ryder, Makita Samba, Felice Jankell, Tudor Aaron Istodor, Amina Ben Ismaïl, Serena De Ferrari, Lorenzo Richelmy', 'NR', 'Laura, 25, is an actress in a L.A.R.P. (Live Action Role Playing) Game, where the participants play the survivors of an atomic war who live underground in a sealed bunker. After several mysterious accidents, the game is interrupted and the players leave the bunker while the staff remain behind to investigate the disappearance of Greg, the mastermind of the game. They soon find themselves trapped inside and in peril as they begin to die in mysterious ways and the group realizes that someone or something paranormal is playing a twisted game with them which quickly plunges into a terrifying fight for survival.', 'Laura, 25, is an actress in a L.A.R.P. (Live Action Role Playing) Game, where the participants play the survivors of an atomic war who live underground in a sealed bunker. After several mysterious accidents, the game is interrupted and the players leave the bunker while the staff remain behind to investigate the disappearance of Greg, the mastermind of the game. They soon find themselves trapped inside and in peril as they begin to die in mysterious ways and the group realizes that someone or something paranormal is playing a twisted game with them which quickly plunges into a terrifying fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FGenj5LnApAsJVLbd5Ehmn16XV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:794234'),
  ('511030972970484540', 'The Bunker of the Last Gunshots', 1982, 'Science Fiction', 'Marc Caro, Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Bruno Delbonnel', 'Gilles Adrien, Marc Caro, Jean-Pierre Jeunet', 'Jean Marie De Busscher, Marc Caro, Patrice Succi, Gilles Adrien, Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Spot', null, 'A military group of men is locked up in a bunker in an unknown future. All those soldiers are waiting for an eventual enemy. But the discovery of a certain project will cause several catastrophies and will make those men kill each other...', 'A military group of men is locked up in a bunker in an unknown future. All those soldiers are waiting for an eventual enemy. But the discovery of a certain project will cause several catastrophies and will make those men kill each other...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWOYJZLPmxPYdYajeLLKIVzbwy8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60813'),
  ('608665551823738685', 'The Bunny Game', 2011, 'Horror', 'Adam Rehmeier, Adam Rehmeier', null, 'Rodleen Getsic, Norwood Fisher, Gregg Gilmore, Paul Ill, Jeff F. Renfro, Drettie Page, Coriander Womack, Loki', null, 'A prostitute looking for her next meal hitches a ride with a trucker that leaves her praying for her next breath.', 'A prostitute looking for her next meal hitches a ride with a trucker that leaves her praying for her next breath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvjeqnxIfKMjTkXyJyfxBKDHnkk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84520'),
  ('409744310925076182', 'The Burglar', 1957, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Paul Wendkos, Don Malkames', 'David Goodis', 'Dan Duryea, Jayne Mansfield, Martha Vickers, Peter Capell, Mickey Shaughnessy, Wendell K. Phillips, Phoebe Mackay, Stewart Bradley', 'NR', 'Burglar Nat Harbin and his two associates set their sights on wealthy spiritualist Sister Sarah, who has inherited a fortune -- including a renowned emerald necklace -- from a Philadelphia financier. Using Nat''s female ward, Gladden, to pose as an admirer and case the mansion where the woman lives, they set up a perfect break-in. Things get complicated afterwards.', 'Burglar Nat Harbin and his two associates set their sights on wealthy spiritualist Sister Sarah, who has inherited a fortune -- including a renowned emerald necklace -- from a Philadelphia financier. Using Nat''s female ward, Gladden, to pose as an admirer and case the mansion where the woman lives, they set up a perfect break-in. Things get complicated afterwards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19eVor0aJVzLJMUVa1wYlDBsHQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33843'),
  ('957379093369257038', 'The Burglar', 1987, 'Drama', 'Valeriy Ogorodnikov, Aliakper Gasan-Zade, Valery Mironov', 'Valeriy Priyomykhov', 'Oleg Yelykomov, Konstantin Kinchev, Yuriy Tsapnik, Svetlana Gaytan, Polina Petrenko, Oleg Garkusha, Nikolay Dik, Leonid Fedorov', null, 'With a brother dedicated to punk rock stardom at any cost and a drunken father who chases skirt between robotic dancing lessons from the TV, young Senka stands as much chance of nurture as the hero of Truffaut''s 400 Blows. The amazing thing about Ogorodnikov''s film is that it was made in Russia. Clearly, plenty of Soviet teenies share the nihilistic feelings of their Western counterparts, and the extensive footage of safety-pin chic at concerts perhaps points to a sound export instinct on the director''s part. Senka''s brother Kostya is under pressure from Howmuch, a very heavy rocker, to steal a synthesiser from the Community Centre, so to protect him Senka steals it himself. The story occupies little more space than the music, but the performances are splendid enough to lodge Senka''s predicament in the heart.', 'With a brother dedicated to punk rock stardom at any cost and a drunken father who chases skirt between robotic dancing lessons from the TV, young Senka stands as much chance of nurture as the hero of Truffaut''s 400 Blows. The amazing thing about Ogorodnikov''s film is that it was made in Russia. Clearly, plenty of Soviet teenies share the nihilistic feelings of their Western counterparts, and the extensive footage of safety-pin chic at concerts perhaps points to a sound export instinct on the director''s part. Senka''s brother Kostya is under pressure from Howmuch, a very heavy rocker, to steal a synthesiser from the Community Centre, so to protect him Senka steals it himself. The story occupies little more space than the music, but the performances are splendid enough to lodge Senka''s predicament in the heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84UgZyjVUHigHFSTZAW8SDepZao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142779'),
  ('1031814189582237263', 'The Burglars', 1898, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'Cops chase a pair of burglars on the rooftops of the city. Gaston Breteau filmed the original film in early 1898 for Lumiére, and also the remake in late 1898 for Gaumont.', 'Cops chase a pair of burglars on the rooftops of the city. Gaston Breteau filmed the original film in early 1898 for Lumiére, and also the remake in late 1898 for Gaumont.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzSZxPNkpyC51jQMvNvj2gCkEbU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119955'),
  ('375747309167833472', 'The Burglars', 1971, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Henri Verneuil, Claude Renoir', 'Vahé Katcha, Henri Verneuil', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Omar Sharif, Dyan Cannon, Robert Hossein, Nicole Calfan, Myriam Feune de Colombi, Raoul Delfosse, José Luis de Vilallonga', 'PG', 'In Athens a collection of emeralds is successfully stolen by a team of robbers, led by safe-cracker Azad. Things go smoothly until they miss the ship by which they planned their escape; a police chief pursues Azad while he waits for the next ship to set off.', 'In Athens a collection of emeralds is successfully stolen by a team of robbers, led by safe-cracker Azad. Things go smoothly until they miss the ship by which they planned their escape; a police chief pursues Azad while he waits for the next ship to set off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qt3JVm7hhwESFFxuO5BlN3A6TfI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34184'),
  ('247707144672440271', 'The Burial', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Maryse Alberti, Lee Blaine, Ian Watermeier', 'Margaret Betts, Doug Wright', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Jamie Foxx, Jurnee Smollett, Alan Ruck, Mamoudou Athie, Pamela Reed, Bill Camp, Amanda Warren', 'R', 'When a handshake deal goes sour, funeral home owner Jeremiah O''Keefe enlists charismatic, smooth-talking attorney Willie E. Gary to save his family business. Tempers flare and laughter ensues as the unlikely pair bond while exposing corporate corruption and racial injustice.', 'When a handshake deal goes sour, funeral home owner Jeremiah O''Keefe enlists charismatic, smooth-talking attorney Willie E. Gary to save his family business. Tempers flare and laughter ensues as the unlikely pair bond while exposing corporate corruption and racial injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ssNSfNKpzZwhbFsnW3wa82m2sG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763165'),
  ('886272723917354565', 'The Buried Forest', 2005, 'Drama', 'Kōhei Oguri', 'Kōhei Oguri', 'Karen, Tadanobu Asano, Hiromitsu Tosaka, Mai Enoki, Tokie Hidari, Mitsuru Hirata, Ittoku Kishibe, Tomoko Nakajima', null, 'Three high school girls living out in the country build stories out from their local environment, mountainous and bordered by an unkempt buried forest.', 'Three high school girls living out in the country build stories out from their local environment, mountainous and bordered by an unkempt buried forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NkqJFFgXbqHHshdcqPj9r6KaYp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25054'),
  ('902913123152894367', 'The Burmese Harp', 1956, 'Drama, War', 'Kon Ichikawa, Minoru Yokoyama, Toshio Masuda', 'Natto Wada', 'Rentaro Mikuni, Shōji Yasui, Jun Hamamura, Taketoshi Naitō, Shunji Kasuga, Kō Nishimura, Keishichi Nakahara, Toshiaki Itō', null, 'In Burma during the closing days of WWII, a Japanese soldier separated from his unit disguises himself as a Buddhist monk to escape imprisonment as a POW.', 'In Burma during the closing days of WWII, a Japanese soldier separated from his unit disguises himself as a Buddhist monk to escape imprisonment as a POW.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTKpylld64pjRYgRMK9GN6Jo2bA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33319'),
  ('988943544579526692', 'The Burned Barns', 1973, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Jean Chapot, Sacha Vierny, Louis Boussaroque', 'Jean Chapot, Sébastien Roulet', 'Alain Delon, Simone Signoret, Bernard Le Coq, Miou-Miou, Paul Crauchet, Catherine Allégret, Christian Barbier, Jean Bouise', null, 'The body of a young woman is discovered near a farm. The judge, Larcher is in charge and thinks that the farmers have something to do with the murder.', 'The body of a young woman is discovered near a farm. The judge, Larcher is in charge and thinks that the farmers have something to do with the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnRqLluRvLI2QAXb0XW0IMASfpw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6160'),
  ('604075397534259792', 'The Burning', 1981, 'Horror', 'Tony Maylam, Harvey Harrison', 'Peter Lawrence', 'Brian Matthews, Leah Ayres, Brian Backer, Larry Joshua, Jason Alexander, Ned Eisenberg, Carrick Glenn, Carolyn Houlihan', 'R', 'A caretaker at a summer camp is burned when a prank goes tragically wrong. After several years of intensive treatment at hospital, he is released back into society, albeit missing some social skills. What follows is a bloody killing spree with the caretaker making his way back to his old stomping ground to confront one of the youths that accidentally burned him.', 'A caretaker at a summer camp is burned when a prank goes tragically wrong. After several years of intensive treatment at hospital, he is released back into society, albeit missing some social skills. What follows is a bloody killing spree with the caretaker making his way back to his old stomping ground to confront one of the youths that accidentally burned him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8as1GtCAhlc5rirarnUUd85gJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24124'),
  ('587987467306801997', 'The Burning Bed', 1984, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Isidore Mankofsky, Robert Greenwald, Michael Daves', null, 'Farrah Fawcett, Paul Le Mat, Richard Masur, Grace Zabriskie, Penelope Milford, Christa Denton, James T. Callahan, Gary Grubbs', null, 'An abused battered wife has had enough of husband beating up on her. Everywhere she turns for help, there''s not much anyone will do. After he rapes her one night, she sets the bed on fire with him in it asleep.', 'An abused battered wife has had enough of husband beating up on her. Everywhere she turns for help, there''s not much anyone will do. After he rapes her one night, she sets the bed on fire with him in it asleep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOElJBqX7u8gz94oQ3UpzpbSPiG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60573'),
  ('891732508416642777', 'The Burning Crucible', 1923, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Ivan Mosjoukine, Nikolai Toporkoff, Joseph-Louis Mundwiller', 'Ivan Mosjoukine', 'Ivan Mosjoukine, Nathalie Lissenko, Nicolas Koline, Camille Bardou, Huguette Delacroix, Franco Zellas, Paul Franceschi, Jules de Spoly', null, 'A woman, named simply "Elle" and her husband, a wealthy industrialist, are not on the best of terms. While she enjoys the way he caters to her every whim, she wonders whether he really loves her. He, on the other hand, torments himself by imagining rivals. One morning she awakens from a nightmare in which she has been pursued by a man in various guises, who turns out to be the famous Detective Z, whose memoirs she has been reading. When she and her husband quarrel over leaving Paris permanently for a country estate, he goes to the "Trouve Tout" Agency and hires, of all people, Detective Z, to win back her affection.', 'A woman, named simply "Elle" and her husband, a wealthy industrialist, are not on the best of terms. While she enjoys the way he caters to her every whim, she wonders whether he really loves her. He, on the other hand, torments himself by imagining rivals. One morning she awakens from a nightmare in which she has been pursued by a man in various guises, who turns out to be the famous Detective Z, whose memoirs she has been reading. When she and her husband quarrel over leaving Paris permanently for a country estate, he goes to the "Trouve Tout" Agency and hires, of all people, Detective Z, to win back her affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsm3qeAPUNbRZjeeG9mGQSjisBb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186166'),
  ('350893630175544941', 'The Burning Hell', 1974, 'Drama, Horror', 'Ron Ormond', 'Ron Ormond', 'Estus W. Pirkle, Tim Ormond, Jimmy Robbins, Robert G. Lee, Jack Hyles, Bob Gray, Terence Hendricks, Don Green', null, 'Pastor Estus W. Pirkle preaches about hell, where all non-Christians will suffer eternal torment. He''s also visited by two self-professed “Christians” who don''t believe in hell.', 'Pastor Estus W. Pirkle preaches about hell, where all non-Christians will suffer eternal torment. He''s also visited by two self-professed “Christians” who don''t believe in hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9w9lAtDSo1XFjMMZIIdZchi7ICa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83311'),
  ('684353328501026711', 'The Burning Hills', 1956, 'Western', 'Stuart Heisler, Ted D. McCord, Chuck Hansen', 'Irving Wallace', 'Tab Hunter, Natalie Wood, Skip Homeier, Eduard Franz, Earl Holliman, Claude Akins, Ray Teal, Frank Puglia', 'NR', 'When Trace Jordan''s brother is murdered by members of the land-grabbing Sutton family, he vows to report this injustice to the nearest Army fort.', 'When Trace Jordan''s brother is murdered by members of the land-grabbing Sutton family, he vows to report this injustice to the nearest Army fort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxFwtSnW8MggY8dy6v4HYnIF1Hx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89079'),
  ('386615777575081417', 'The Burning Moon', 1992, 'Horror', 'Olaf Ittenbach, Michael Müller, Olaf Ittenbach', 'Olaf Ittenbach', 'Bernd Muggenthaler, Beate Neumeyer, Andrea Arbter, Ellen Fischer, Olaf Ittenbach, Ronald Fuhrmann, Kurt Nauder, Helmut Neumeyer', 'NR', 'A delinquent brother reads his kid sister two bedtime stories after injecting himself with heroin. These disturbingly morbid stories focus on a serial killing blind date and a murderous, psychotic priest.', 'A delinquent brother reads his kid sister two bedtime stories after injecting himself with heroin. These disturbingly morbid stories focus on a serial killing blind date and a murderous, psychotic priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYmV7xOdBzfbmMWyqssEDtETIyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40058'),
  ('247477184607439303', 'The Burning Plain', 2008, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Guillermo Arriaga, Robert Elswit, John Toll', 'Guillermo Arriaga', 'Charlize Theron, Kim Basinger, Jennifer Lawrence, Joaquim de Almeida, John Corbett, Robin Tunney, Fernanda Romero, Brett Cullen', 'R', 'A trailer is burning in the middle of a plain. The bodies of two adulterous lovers are found. Scenes from both families, before and after the dramatic events, suggest an unusual connection between them. But what is their secret?', 'A trailer is burning in the middle of a plain. The bodies of two adulterous lovers are found. Scenes from both families, before and after the dramatic events, suggest an unusual connection between them. But what is their secret?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZlChM3LmOLUCQCfnbaf2dQKe9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12165'),
  ('681852840017144159', 'The Burning Sea', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Kristian Mejdell Nissen, John Andreas Andersen, Pål Ulvik Rokseth', 'Lars Gudmestad, Harald Rosenløw-Eeg', 'Kristine Kujath Thorp, Henrik Bjelland, Rolf Kristian Larsen, Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Bjørn Floberg, Anneke von der Lippe, Ane Skumsvoll, Cengiz Al', 'PG-13', 'An oil platform dramatically goes down on the Norwegian coast, and researchers try to find out what happened when they realize this is just the start of something even more serious.', 'An oil platform dramatically goes down on the Norwegian coast, and researchers try to find out what happened when they realize this is just the start of something even more serious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bB7uV5ljDWKG2m5Z4cgWwDMAeY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623511'),
  ('335433507758317527', 'The Burning Season', 1994, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Frankenheimer, John R. Leonetti', 'William Mastrosimone, Michael Tolkin, Andrew Revkin', 'Raúl Juliá, Carmen Argenziano, Sonia Braga, Kamala Lopez, Luis Guzmán, Nigel Havers, Tomas Milian, Esai Morales', null, 'Based on the true story of a Brazilian rubber tapper who leads his people in protest against government and developers, who want to cut down their part of the rainforest for a new road and ranch land. The rich and the powerful will stop at nothing, and frequently resort to murder', 'Based on the true story of a Brazilian rubber tapper who leads his people in protest against government and developers, who want to cut down their part of the rainforest for a new road and ranch land. The rich and the powerful will stop at nothing, and frequently resort to murder', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgrbmywgBa86e6q7QUw0eunwKbm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167891'),
  ('1035950708682944383', 'The Burning Snail', 1996, 'Drama', 'Thomas Stiller, Nancy Rivas, Frank Griebe', 'Thomas Stiller', 'Barbara Auer, Sebastian Koch, Maximilian Haas, Tobias Nath, Michael Huml, Wasja Stettner, Jonas Kipp, Florian Stenschke', null, 'In this grim German drama, a troubled 14-year-old boy''s pent-up rage and frustration leads him to involvement with a bad crowd and gets him caught up in an inescapable spiral of increasingly self-destructive and deadly violence.', 'In this grim German drama, a troubled 14-year-old boy''s pent-up rage and frustration leads him to involvement with a bad crowd and gets him caught up in an inescapable spiral of increasingly self-destructive and deadly violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubdpyP7wLMuogMRBWfPPmUq2pLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196960'),
  ('580601484627277784', 'The Burning Soil', 1922, 'Drama', 'F. W. Murnau, Karl Freund, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Willy Haas, Arthur Rosen, Thea von Harbou', 'Werner Krauss, Eugen Klöpfer, Vladimir Gajdarov, Eduard von Winterstein, Lya De Putti, Stella Arbenina, Alfred Abel, Eugen Rex', null, 'When farmer Rog dies, his eldest Peter takes over the farm while his youngest Johannes is determined for a better life: he becomes secretary to Count Rudenberg and starts courting his daughter Gerda. When he learns that the Count, who is terminally ill, has bequeathed a piece of land under which lies a petroleum field to his second wife, he courts her instead.', 'When farmer Rog dies, his eldest Peter takes over the farm while his youngest Johannes is determined for a better life: he becomes secretary to Count Rudenberg and starts courting his daughter Gerda. When he learns that the Count, who is terminally ill, has bequeathed a piece of land under which lies a petroleum field to his second wife, he courts her instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lORHdoWSl3e1MnranH9SsFvvfdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55549'),
  ('30111376707014927', 'The Burning Train', 1980, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ravi Chopra, Dharam Chopra', 'Ravi Chopra, Kamleshwar', 'Dharmendra, Jeetendra, Hema Malini, Parveen Babi, Vinod Mehra, Danny Denzongpa, Neetu Singh, Vinod Khanna', null, 'An engineer''s dream of making the perfect train for Indian Railways is given hope when the company commissions his prototype. After years dedicating himself to his dream, his family has suffered, but now he hopes to make it all up to them with the train''s triumphant inaugural journey. However, an embittered fellow employee has other ideas.', 'An engineer''s dream of making the perfect train for Indian Railways is given hope when the company commissions his prototype. After years dedicating himself to his dream, his family has suffered, but now he hopes to make it all up to them with the train''s triumphant inaugural journey. However, an embittered fellow employee has other ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjxvY0pbfTE9QM4qxr1JpzdFK0o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168498'),
  ('255572972089317843', 'The Burnt Orange Heresy', 2020, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Giuseppe Capotondi, David Ungaro, Inti Carboni', 'Scott B. Smith', 'Claes Bang, Elizabeth Debicki, Mick Jagger, Donald Sutherland, Rosalind Halstead, Alessandro Fabrizi, Flaminia Fegarotti', 'R', 'Hired to steal a rare painting from one of the most enigmatic painters of all time, an ambitious art dealer becomes consumed by his own greed and insecurity as the operation spins out of control.', 'Hired to steal a rare painting from one of the most enigmatic painters of all time, an ambitious art dealer becomes consumed by his own greed and insecurity as the operation spins out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPO6yDif5TKSoO3lb3kFp44OR6Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566872'),
  ('370150075539576497', 'The Burrowers', 2008, 'Horror, Western', 'J.T. Petty, Phil Parmet, Thom Buckley', null, 'Doug Hutchison, Clancy Brown, William Mapother, Karl Geary, Jocelin Donahue, Laura Leighton, David Busse, Alexandra Edmo', 'R', 'It is 1879 in the Dakota Territories, a band of men who set out to find and recover a family of settlers that has mysteriously vanished from their home. Expecting the offenders to be a band of fierce natives, but they soon discover that the real enemy stalks them from below.', 'It is 1879 in the Dakota Territories, a band of men who set out to find and recover a family of settlers that has mysteriously vanished from their home. Expecting the offenders to be a band of fierce natives, but they soon discover that the real enemy stalks them from below.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usdEYNShCQi6IcQh2mMnnALTRhT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15846'),
  ('898570844078233308', 'The Bus', 1974, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Tunç Okan', 'Tunç Okan', 'Björn Gedda, Tuncel Kurtiz, Aras Ören, Oğuz Roylas, Tunç Okan, Nuri Sezer, Hasan Gül, Sümer Isgör', null, 'A group of illegal immigrants are brought to Stockholm in a bus by a smuggler who takes all their money and passports, and then runs away.', 'A group of illegal immigrants are brought to Stockholm in a bus by a smuggler who takes all their money and passports, and then runs away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEmCbsqcnrmBR57zRHwyCLJ7v6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287011'),
  ('759143311985240249', 'The Bus of Life', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ibon Cormenzana', 'Eduard Sola, Ibon Cormenzana', 'Dani Rovira, Susana Abaitua, Julen Castillo, Miriam Rubio, Pablo Scapigliati, Javier Tolosa, Elena Irureta, Antonio Durán ''Morris''', null, 'Andrés, a music teacher diagnosed with cancer, seeks treatment at a hospital in the city. His travels there on a singular, dilapidated bus accompanied by other cancer patients. It soon becomes an extraordinary experience, giving him new friends and a far more joyous understanding of life. He also learns to conquer his fears, such as the stage fright which has frustrated a budding career as a musician.', 'Andrés, a music teacher diagnosed with cancer, seeks treatment at a hospital in the city. His travels there on a singular, dilapidated bus accompanied by other cancer patients. It soon becomes an extraordinary experience, giving him new friends and a far more joyous understanding of life. He also learns to conquer his fears, such as the stage fright which has frustrated a budding career as a musician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5is3YYJDsECjD5dutQHmn1X17Sm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115729'),
  ('46699532146828865', 'The Bushido Blade', 1981, 'History, Action, Drama', 'Tsugunobu Kotani, Shoji Ueda', 'William Overgard', 'Richard Boone, Toshirō Mifune, Mike Starr, Timothy Patrick Murphy, Frank Converse, Laura Gemser, William Ross, Bin Amatsu', 'R', 'A steel samurai blade that was to be given to the American ambassador by the Emperor of Japan is stolen. American sailors and Japanese samurai are sent to find it.', 'A steel samurai blade that was to be given to the American ambassador by the Emperor of Japan is stolen. American sailors and Japanese samurai are sent to find it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g98mee2JmeN4VPR9LjEjS6VofhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146091'),
  ('336020303981185226', 'The Business', 2005, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Nick Love, Damian Bromley', 'Nick Love', 'Danny Dyer, Tamer Hassan, Geoff Bell, Georgina Chapman, Eddie Webber, Adam Bolton, Linda Henry, Roland Manookian', 'R', 'During the ''80s, a young man named Frankie dreams of escaping London''s South East region, and his mother''s thug of a boyfriend gives him just the opportunity. After beating up the abusive beau, Frankie runs off to Spain, where he lands a job delivering a package to the dapper Playboy Charlie, a gangster who takes him under his wing. Working as Charlie''s driver, Frankie is immersed in a world of fast cars and pretty women -- but all the excess could be his undoing.', 'During the ''80s, a young man named Frankie dreams of escaping London''s South East region, and his mother''s thug of a boyfriend gives him just the opportunity. After beating up the abusive beau, Frankie runs off to Spain, where he lands a job delivering a package to the dapper Playboy Charlie, a gangster who takes him under his wing. Working as Charlie''s driver, Frankie is immersed in a world of fast cars and pretty women -- but all the excess could be his undoing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiDGny79xE3s9fydhaewKtFeaxe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5145'),
  ('134738798517773639', 'The Business of Strangers', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Patrick Stettner, Cecily Kaston, Peter Thorell', 'Patrick Stettner', 'Stockard Channing, Julia Stiles, Frederick Weller, Mary Testa, Jack Hallett, Marcus Giamatti, Buddy Fitzpatrick, Salem Ludwig', 'R', 'A dark thriller about a successful businesswoman and her young assistant who toy with a slow-witted businessman while stuck at an airport hotel.', 'A dark thriller about a successful businesswoman and her young assistant who toy with a slow-witted businessman while stuck at an airport hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iVwXnV2fraxy6NYzxZ07jMWW0u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31064'),
