  ('776377801367219564', 'The Butcher', 1970, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier, Fred Surin', 'Claude Chabrol', 'Stéphane Audran, Jean Yanne, Roger Rudel, Antonio Passalia, Mario Beccara, William Guérault, Pascal Ferone', 'NR', 'An unlikely friendship between a dour, working class butcher and a repressed schoolteacher coincides with a grisly series of Ripper-type murders in a provincial French town.', 'An unlikely friendship between a dour, working class butcher and a repressed schoolteacher coincides with a grisly series of Ripper-type murders in a provincial French town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/An2gkXn5TATag9Adul2Zbq5Ndrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2912'),
  ('43404895954939465', 'The Butcher', 1981, 'Drama, History', 'Franz Antel, Ernst W. Kalinke', 'H.C. Artmann, Kurt Nachmann', 'Karl Merkatz, Alfred Böhm, Sieghardt Rupp, Gustav Knuth, Klausjürgen Wussow, Ida Krottendorf, Georg Schuchter, Regina Sattler', null, 'A politically naive Viennese butcher manages to survive the Nazi occupation of Austria and the second world war.', 'A politically naive Viennese butcher manages to survive the Nazi occupation of Austria and the second world war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HB0mCr0RWqCFxSQfnulq70r261.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24140'),
  ('253687526189907283', 'The Butcher', 1998, 'Drama', 'Aurelio Grimaldi, Filippo Orobello', 'Alina Reyes, Aurelio Grimaldi', 'Alba Parietti, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Lorenzo Majnoni, Giulio Base, Caterina Vertova, Rosa Pianeta, Cinzia Insinga, Alessandra Costanzo', 'R', 'Alina is a brilliant and enterprising woman who runs a successful art gallery in Palermo. Her husband Daniele, a successful orchestra conductor, cultured and intelligent, is not a regular presence. One day, while accompanying Daniele to the airport, Alina feels a sense of emptiness. She will try to fill it with a butcher who is always joking and full of erotic allusions and who arouses a strong attraction in her.', 'Alina is a brilliant and enterprising woman who runs a successful art gallery in Palermo. Her husband Daniele, a successful orchestra conductor, cultured and intelligent, is not a regular presence. One day, while accompanying Daniele to the airport, Alina feels a sense of emptiness. She will try to fill it with a butcher who is always joking and full of erotic allusions and who arouses a strong attraction in her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCbZGO0y1oWLY6rPY54ybJ1ARw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72768'),
  ('194647747817946162', 'The Butcher', 2006, 'Horror, Action', 'Edward Gorsuch, Hank Baumert Jr., Michael Feifer', 'Michael Hurst', 'Hazel Dean, Myiea Coy, Bill Jacobson, Tiffany Kristensen, Ashley Rebecca Hawkins, Nick Stellate, Alan Ritchson, Tom Nagel', 'R', 'A tragic car accident in the middle of nowhere finds six stranded college students fighting for their lives after making a horrifying discovery in a remote farmhouse in director Edward Gorsuch''s rural frightener. With no place to run and no police station for miles, these doomed students are about to discover that down home hospitality is the last thing on the minds of the murderous family who stalks them through the woods.', 'A tragic car accident in the middle of nowhere finds six stranded college students fighting for their lives after making a horrifying discovery in a remote farmhouse in director Edward Gorsuch''s rural frightener. With no place to run and no police station for miles, these doomed students are about to discover that down home hospitality is the last thing on the minds of the murderous family who stalks them through the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fNBPCwhsB8OOd6MKWNnE7UtqFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10250'),
  ('168299477253520298', 'The Butcher', 2007, 'Horror, Action', 'Kim Jin-won', 'Kim Jin-won', 'You Dong-hun, Yu-il Ha, Sung-Il Kim, Taek-su Kim, Mu-Nyeong Lee, Myung-hun Seo', null, 'Relentlessly gruesome, South Korean filmmaker Kim Jin-Won''s torture flick chronicles the making of a snuff film from two perspectives: that of the sadistic producers and that of the unfortunate "stars." Their terror captured through vérité-style camera work, the victims are made to endure the agonizing screams of their fellow captives before meeting their own grim fate at the hands the titular butcher in his bloody abattoir.', 'Relentlessly gruesome, South Korean filmmaker Kim Jin-Won''s torture flick chronicles the making of a snuff film from two perspectives: that of the sadistic producers and that of the unfortunate "stars." Their terror captured through vérité-style camera work, the victims are made to endure the agonizing screams of their fellow captives before meeting their own grim fate at the hands the titular butcher in his bloody abattoir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZ8OyoUWFwpypsxJd7uQ6hCorKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106505'),
  ('1046743267681842245', 'The Butcher Boy', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Neil Jordan, Adrian Biddle', 'Neil Jordan, Pat McCabe', 'Eamonn Owens, Alan Boyle, Fiona Shaw, Stephen Rea, Ian Hart, Peter Gowen, Sean McGinley, Aisling O''Sullivan', 'R', 'Francie and Joe live the usual playful, fantasy filled childhoods of normal boys. However, with a violent, alcoholic father and a manic depressive, suicidal mother the pressure on Francie to grow up are immense. When Francie''s world turns to madness, he tries to counter it with further insanity, with dire consequences.', 'Francie and Joe live the usual playful, fantasy filled childhoods of normal boys. However, with a violent, alcoholic father and a manic depressive, suicidal mother the pressure on Francie to grow up are immense. When Francie''s world turns to madness, he tries to counter it with further insanity, with dire consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KrClE5Ax6wzCAwgaGRhQI2Eolk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22797'),
  ('283839984720616099', 'The Butcher, the Chef, and the Swordsman', 2011, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Wuershan', 'An Changhe, Wuershan', 'Masanobu Ando, Zhang Yuqi, Liu Xiao-Ye, Han Pengyi, Dong Li-Fan, Gao Lei, Liu Xu, Senggerenqin', 'PG-13', 'A tale of revenge, honor and greed follows a group of misfits that gets involved with a kitchen cleaver made from the top five swords of the martial arts world in this wild and brash action comedy.', 'A tale of revenge, honor and greed follows a group of misfits that gets involved with a kitchen cleaver made from the top five swords of the martial arts world in this wild and brash action comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAjpmmrEcse50jauiOps1YisHkw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58679'),
  ('463924203815042417', 'The Butcher''s Blade', 2026, 'Action, Crime', 'Liu Wenpu', null, 'Liu Fengchao, Chunyu Shanshan, Yuan Fufu, Liu Enshang, Gao Weiman', null, 'A low-ranking constable faces persecution, becomes a scapegoat in a theft case, and gets rescued by his teacher. Now caught between serving corrupt officials or fighting for freedom, he must choose his path.', 'A low-ranking constable faces persecution, becomes a scapegoat in a theft case, and gets rescued by his teacher. Now caught between serving corrupt officials or fighting for freedom, he must choose his path.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fog9NYoyrFji63IwsTdQP5bow0qE.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-butchers-blade'),
  ('590641430070918620', 'The Butcher''s Daughter', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Christopher Thompson, Thomas Samoun, Catherine Cambier', 'Christopher Thompson, Fabrice Roger-Lacan', 'Géraldine Pailhas, Arnaud Ducret, Alison Wheeler, Stéphane De Groodt, Jean-François Stévenin, Antoine Gouy, Élisa Erka, Pascal Vannson', null, 'Charly is the editor in chief of a fashion magazine. When her father dies, she inherits the family business: a butchery. Not exactly her passion in life... She’s about to sell it when Mar- tial, who worked for her father, wants to take it over, but she is having second thoughts. These two opposite characters will have to get used to one another.', 'Charly is the editor in chief of a fashion magazine. When her father dies, she inherits the family business: a butchery. Not exactly her passion in life... She’s about to sell it when Mar- tial, who worked for her father, wants to take it over, but she is having second thoughts. These two opposite characters will have to get used to one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBMlMuGMQw5Q6XdpEyo0ThJ9r7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:757341'),
  ('278356846522526707', 'The Butcher''s Wife', 1991, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Terry Hughes, Frank Tidy', 'Ezra Litwak, Marjorie Schwartz', 'Demi Moore, Jeff Daniels, George Dzundza, Mary Steenburgen, Frances McDormand, Margaret Colin, Max Perlich, Miriam Margolyes', 'PG-13', 'A clairvoyant woman thinks that she''s met her future husband because she''s seen him in a dream. They marry and he takes her back to his butcher shop in New York city, where her powers tend to influence everyone she meets while working in the shop. Through her advice, she helps others and eventually finds the true man of her dreams.', 'A clairvoyant woman thinks that she''s met her future husband because she''s seen him in a dream. They marry and he takes her back to his butcher shop in New York city, where her powers tend to influence everyone she meets while working in the shop. Through her advice, she helps others and eventually finds the true man of her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKwvnb2bypMyXD2UraWdXxUoqLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20096'),
  ('441907045093988540', 'The Butler', 2013, 'Drama', 'Lee Daniels, Andrew Dunn, Sebastián Silva', 'Danny Strong', 'Forest Whitaker, Oprah Winfrey, David Oyelowo, John Cusack, Jane Fonda, Cuba Gooding Jr., Mariah Carey, Terrence Howard', 'PG-13', 'Cecil Gaines was a sharecropper''s son who grew up in the 1920s as a domestic servant for the white family who casually destroyed his. Eventually striking out on his own, Cecil becomes a hotel valet of such efficiency and discreteness in the 1950s that he becomes a butler in the White House itself. There, Cecil would serve numerous US Presidents over the decades as a passive witness of history with the American Civil Rights Movement gaining momentum even as his family has troubles of its own. As his wife, Gloria, struggles with alcoholism and his defiant eldest son, Louis, strives for a just world, Cecil must decide whether he should take action in his own way.', 'Cecil Gaines was a sharecropper''s son who grew up in the 1920s as a domestic servant for the white family who casually destroyed his. Eventually striking out on his own, Cecil becomes a hotel valet of such efficiency and discreteness in the 1950s that he becomes a butler in the White House itself. There, Cecil would serve numerous US Presidents over the decades as a passive witness of history with the American Civil Rights Movement gaining momentum even as his family has troubles of its own. As his wife, Gloria, struggles with alcoholism and his defiant eldest son, Louis, strives for a just world, Cecil must decide whether he should take action in his own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAi8Bl3ZKX6pANPVhNwbhbQANop.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132363'),
  ('1102582652520205634', 'The Butt', 1974, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Bo Widerberg, John Olsson', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Johan Bergman, Monica Zetterlund, Magnus Härenstam, Ernst-Hugo Järegård, Carl Billquist, Stig Ossian Ericson, Liselott Wærum, Annelie Bergman', null, '6-year-old Johan (nicknamed ''Fimpen'') loves football. One day, his talents are discovered, and it doesn''t take long before Fimpen gets to travel around with the national team. Fimpen becomes an idol and the media wants a piece of him all the time. It gets hard to catch up in school.', '6-year-old Johan (nicknamed ''Fimpen'') loves football. One day, his talents are discovered, and it doesn''t take long before Fimpen gets to travel around with the national team. Fimpen becomes an idol and the media wants a piece of him all the time. It gets hard to catch up in school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3ImxbFgz1ZmpM29q2Ufl34P8XA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49977'),
  ('604336515382517263', 'The Butter Battle Book', 1989, 'Animation, Family', 'Ralph Bakshi, Kent Butterworth, Dave Marshall', 'Dr. Seuss', 'Charles Durning, Miriam Flynn, Clive Revill, Joseph Cousins, Christopher Collins', null, 'A cold war between two lands over a ridiculous dispute leads to a perilous arms race.', 'A cold war between two lands over a ridiculous dispute leads to a perilous arms race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5UcXHvleQ6dEDHba4POderV3L8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52458'),
  ('506170996816259580', 'The Buttercream Gang', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Bruce Neibaur', 'Forrest S. Baker III', 'Michael D. Weatherred, Brandon Blaser, Jason Glenn, Scott Wilkinson, Stephanie Dees, Otto J. Mileti III, Kathryn Little, Miranda Brook Chivers', null, 'Unlike most gangs, the ButterCream gang does good deeds. Their leader, Pete, has to go live with his aunt in Chicago. But things don''t go well in Chicago and Pete is changed when he returns. Soon Pete is hanging around with the wrong crowd. But the remaining members of the gang, especially their new leader Scott, refuse to give up on their friend Pete.', 'Unlike most gangs, the ButterCream gang does good deeds. Their leader, Pete, has to go live with his aunt in Chicago. But things don''t go well in Chicago and Pete is changed when he returns. Soon Pete is hanging around with the wrong crowd. But the remaining members of the gang, especially their new leader Scott, refuse to give up on their friend Pete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOwKydnK3lWxCpS3bvdsXW08clO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55033'),
  ('190736666943769003', 'The Buttercream Gang in: Secret of Treasure Mountain', 1993, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Scott Swofford, Brian Capener', 'Carter Burch, Leo D. Paur', 'Brandon Blaser, Jason Johnson, Jason Glenn, Isaac Fugel, Stephanie Dees, Marissa Porritt, Rick Macy, Frank Gerrish', null, 'ButterCreamer Eldon finds part of an ancient map and becomes intrigued with the search for hidden treasure. Unaware that danger lurks in the shadows, Eldon talks the other ButterCreamers into helping hunt for conquistador gold was a way to help their ailing and needy friend, Mr. Graff. But Eldon almost lets his secret wish for fame disrupt those plans. The Young man must discover something more precious than gold - that being a true hero is often nothing more than caring enough to help someone in need and preserving until that need is met.', 'ButterCreamer Eldon finds part of an ancient map and becomes intrigued with the search for hidden treasure. Unaware that danger lurks in the shadows, Eldon talks the other ButterCreamers into helping hunt for conquistador gold was a way to help their ailing and needy friend, Mr. Graff. But Eldon almost lets his secret wish for fame disrupt those plans. The Young man must discover something more precious than gold - that being a true hero is often nothing more than caring enough to help someone in need and preserving until that need is met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ij9IbGauBKX7DYset0rcTevj2Lv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83262'),
  ('54402024690214546', 'The Butterfly', 2001, 'Science Fiction', 'Moon Seung-wook', 'Moon Seung-wook', 'Kim Ho-jung, Kang Hye-jung, Jang Hyun-sung, Kim Jung-nan, Lee Gyeong-seon', null, 'In a near future Korea, where an "oblivion virus" which causes memory loss has become the centre of a tourist industry aimed at those who wish to forget the past, Anna Kim, a German woman of Korean descent, seeks the virus in order to erase painful memories and, along the way, develops a close bond with her driver and her teenage guide.', 'In a near future Korea, where an "oblivion virus" which causes memory loss has become the centre of a tourist industry aimed at those who wish to forget the past, Anna Kim, a German woman of Korean descent, seeks the virus in order to erase painful memories and, along the way, develops a close bond with her driver and her teenage guide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKyMcWDSgnxWUCF9bBQEZZDFMoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186328'),
  ('256132880555066631', 'The Butterfly', 2002, 'Family, Drama', 'Philippe Muyl, Nicolas Herdt', 'Philippe Muyl', 'Michel Serrault, Claire Bouanich, Nade Dieu, Françoise Michaud, Pierre Poirot, Jacky Nercessian, Jacques Bouanich, Hélène Hily', null, 'An old man who has one interest in life, collecting butterflies, has his life changed by an eight year old girl.', 'An old man who has one interest in life, collecting butterflies, has his life changed by an eight year old girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tZCGXqlEPSGxNWZup6YxxCzS5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45699'),
  ('949737590891124448', 'The Butterfly Circus', 2009, 'Drama', 'Joshua Weigel', 'Rebekah Weigel, Joshua Weigel', 'Eduardo Verástegui, Nick Vujicic, Doug Jones, Matt Allmen, Connor Rosen, Lexi Pearl', null, 'At the height of the Great Depression, the showman of a renowned circus leads his troupe through the devastated American landscape, lifting the spirits of audiences along the way. During their travels, they discover a man without limbs at a carnival sideshow. However, after an intriguing encounter with the showman, he becomes driven to hope against everything he has ever believed.', 'At the height of the Great Depression, the showman of a renowned circus leads his troupe through the devastated American landscape, lifting the spirits of audiences along the way. During their travels, they discover a man without limbs at a carnival sideshow. However, after an intriguing encounter with the showman, he becomes driven to hope against everything he has ever believed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQUQbZ4HjlSEUaKUtOvbOpz2Zl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58500'),
  ('114102484288645415', 'The Butterfly Effect', 1995, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Fernando Colomo, Martin Carr', 'Fernando Colomo, Anna Klamburg, Joaquín Oristrell', 'María Barranco, Coque Malla, Rosa María Sardà, Peter Sullivan, James Fleet, Cécile Pallas, Sakuntala Ramanee, Josep Maria Pou', null, 'Luis, a Spanish student, goes to London to get a course in Economics. He lives at a house the neighbor of her aunt, but when she broke up with her husband, Luis goes to live with her.', 'Luis, a Spanish student, goes to London to get a course in Economics. He lives at a house the neighbor of her aunt, but when she broke up with her husband, Luis goes to live with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhmuoz9vxREuclMdyMzwZwHcAMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201051'),
  ('918864387862821324', 'The Butterfly Effect', 2004, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Eric Bress, Matthew F. Leonetti, J. Mackye Gruber', 'J. Mackye Gruber, Eric Bress', 'Ashton Kutcher, Amy Smart, Melora Walters, Elden Henson, William Lee Scott, Eric Stoltz, Ethan Suplee, Logan Lerman', 'R', 'A young man struggles to access sublimated childhood memories. He finds a technique that allows him to travel back into the past, to occupy his childhood body and change history. However, he soon finds that every change he makes has unexpected consequences.', 'A young man struggles to access sublimated childhood memories. He finds a technique that allows him to travel back into the past, to occupy his childhood body and change history. However, he soon finds that every change he makes has unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ea5iv7TWMh18fOKoRGgmtcg85Gx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1954'),
  ('747663390991089479', 'The Butterfly Effect 2', 2006, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'John R. Leonetti, Brian Pearson, Teresa Weston', 'Michael D. Weiss', 'Eric Lively, Erica Durance, Dustin Milligan, Gina Holden, Susan Hogan, David James Lewis, Chris Gauthier, Lindsay Maxwell', 'R', 'After his girlfriend, Julie, and two best friends are killed in a tragic auto accident, Nick struggles to cope with his loss and grief. Suffering from migraine-like seizures, Nick soon discovers that he has the power to change the past via his memories. However, his time-traveling attempts to alter the past and save his one true love have unexpected and dire consequences.', 'After his girlfriend, Julie, and two best friends are killed in a tragic auto accident, Nick struggles to cope with his loss and grief. Suffering from migraine-like seizures, Nick soon discovers that he has the power to change the past via his memories. However, his time-traveling attempts to alter the past and save his one true love have unexpected and dire consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g87nPhHf2xfENBV6PCbkO88sthd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14620'),
  ('724548498214006887', 'The Butterfly Effect 3: Revelations', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Seth Grossman, Dan Stoloff, David Markowitz', 'Holly Brix', 'Mia Serafino, Rachel Miner, Chris Carmack, Melissa Jones, Lynch R. Travis, Sarah Habel, Chantel Giacalone, Hugh Maguire', 'R', 'The story revolves around a man trying to uncover the mysterious death of his girlfriend and save an innocent man from the death chamber in the process, by using his unique power to time travel. However in attempting to do this, he also frees a spiteful serial-killer.', 'The story revolves around a man trying to uncover the mysterious death of his girlfriend and save an innocent man from the death chamber in the process, by using his unique power to time travel. However in attempting to do this, he also frees a spiteful serial-killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7utgDyfae053YExAuUKcwkzUKMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16258'),
  ('918635863646465141', 'The Butterfly Murders', 1979, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Thriller, Horror, Action', 'Tsui Hark, Fan Chin-Yu, Lawrence Ah Mon', 'Lam Chi-Ming, Fan Lin', 'Lau Siu-Ming, Michelle Yim, Wong Shu-Tong, JoJo Chan Kei-Kei, Chiang Wang, Chang Kuo-Chu, Eddy Ko Hung, Ha Kwong-Li', null, 'A journalist attempting to solve a mystery in "Martial World" enlists the aid of a master fighter and a woman named Green Breeze. They go to a mysterious castle where they come across poisonous butterflies and a black-leather-clad killer.', 'A journalist attempting to solve a mystery in "Martial World" enlists the aid of a master fighter and a woman named Green Breeze. They go to a mysterious castle where they come across poisonous butterflies and a black-leather-clad killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thaX9u6NRNAlY3S9hK5JsIpMeCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44914'),
  ('456896022117051876', 'The Butterfly Room', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rob Givens, Frank Caridi, Ellary Eddy', 'Luigi Sardiello, Paolo Guerrieri, Jonathan Zarantonello', 'Barbara Steele, Heather Langenkamp, Ray Wise, Camille Keaton, Erica Leerhsen, Jasmine Jessica Anthony, Julia Putnam, Ellery Sprayberry', 'NR', 'A reclusive and butterfly-obsessed elderly lady suffering from bipolar disorder develops a disturbing relationship with a mysterious but seemingly innocent youngster.', 'A reclusive and butterfly-obsessed elderly lady suffering from bipolar disorder develops a disturbing relationship with a mysterious but seemingly innocent youngster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3qWNikZnuyzaVcZ5w9ClTROnhv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101176'),
  ('184434810399477581', 'The Butterfly''s Dream', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan, Gökhan Tiryaki', null, 'Kıvanç Tatlıtuğ, Mert Fırat, Belçim Bilgin, Farah Zeynep Abdullah, Yılmaz Erdoğan, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Taner Birsel, İpek Bilgin', null, 'In a small Turkish town, two young tuberculous poets try to survive while publishing their poems. As they both fall in love, their life would never be the same.', 'In a small Turkish town, two young tuberculous poets try to survive while publishing their poems. As they both fall in love, their life would never be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3tvOh6QmyQDSth9EKKNzpdaZ0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171160'),
  ('508100647802767111', 'The Bye Bye Man', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Stacy Title, James Kniest, Scott Lazar', 'Jonathan Penner', 'Douglas Smith, Lucien Laviscount, Cressida Bonas, Doug Jones, Michael Trucco, Jenna Kanell, Erica Tremblay, Marisa Echeverria', 'PG-13', 'When three college students move into an old house off campus, they unwittingly unleash a supernatural entity known as The Bye Bye Man, who comes to prey upon them once they discover his name. The friends must try to save each other, all the while keeping The Bye Bye Man''s existence a secret to save others from the same deadly fate.', 'When three college students move into an old house off campus, they unwittingly unleash a supernatural entity known as The Bye Bye Man, who comes to prey upon them once they discover his name. The friends must try to save each other, all the while keeping The Bye Bye Man''s existence a secret to save others from the same deadly fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bape74Eeli5NJ6x4UKuUr604xXh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292280'),
  ('1095364989119029008', 'The Bygone', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Graham Phillips, Parker Phillips, David J. Myrick', 'Graham Phillips, Parker Phillips', 'Graham Phillips, Shawn Hatosy, Jacqueline Toboni, Irene Bedard, Sydney Schafer, Jamie McShane, Ritchie Coster, Tokala Black Elk', null, 'When a young rancher crosses paths with a Lakota girl from a nearby reservation, her mysterious disappearance sparks a search that uncovers a harrowing past and hints at a dire future.', 'When a young rancher crosses paths with a Lakota girl from a nearby reservation, her mysterious disappearance sparks a search that uncovers a harrowing past and hints at a dire future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aojffTKjmQYFKIitUKHG5MD6yE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519674'),
  ('1152895523292112853', 'The Cabbage Soup', 1981, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Edmond Richard, Jean Girault', null, 'Louis de Funès, Jean Carmet, Jacques Villeret, Christine Dejoux, Claude Gensac, Henri Génès, Marco Perrin, Max Montavon', null, 'Two buddy farmers are visited by aliens who like their domestic cabbage soup.', 'Two buddy farmers are visited by aliens who like their domestic cabbage soup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eT52CpkNpVrFqamL2WD6iMZuChf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9317'),
  ('619758700992571741', 'The Cabbage-Patch Fairy', 1896, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Alice Guy-Blaché, Alice Guy-Blaché', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'A brief fantasy tale involving a strange fairy who can produce and deliver babies coming out of cabbages. This film is lost. Copies of it online are actually the 1900 remake.', 'A brief fantasy tale involving a strange fairy who can produce and deliver babies coming out of cabbages. This film is lost. Copies of it online are actually the 1900 remake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KlwuEAdZHn2Vjt9s2XwmMOO9Rk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147554'),
  ('657609587941348832', 'The Cabbage-Patch Fairy', 1900, 'Fantasy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', 'Yvonne Serand', null, 'The fairy at a cabbage patch hovers over the babies. This is a remake of Guy''s 1896 film on the same subject, this time shot in 35 mm.', 'The fairy at a cabbage patch hovers over the babies. This is a remake of Guy''s 1896 film on the same subject, this time shot in 35 mm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6f0YdtnrVODzoZTtSUxvqC1uUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119977'),
  ('695295094096259250', 'The Cabbie', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Chen Yi-wen, Chang Hwa-Kun', 'Su Chaobin', 'Rie Miyazawa, Chu Chung-heng, Tai Bo, Sophia Ching, Vega Tsai, Su Chaobin, Leon Dai, Duan Chun-hao', null, 'After falling in love with a traffic cop, a cab driver commits as many traffic violations as he can in order to see her again.', 'After falling in love with a traffic cop, a cab driver commits as many traffic violations as he can in order to see her again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5jGk9giZGBQCX3HakYQgr1ST0o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314444'),
