  ('28513570210666737', 'The Cabin in the Woods', 2012, 'Horror, Mystery, Comedy', 'Peter Deming, Drew Goddard, Chris Grun', 'Joss Whedon, Drew Goddard', 'Kristen Connolly, Fran Kranz, Chris Hemsworth, Jesse Williams, Anna Hutchison, Richard Jenkins, Bradley Whitford, Amy Acker', 'R', 'Five friends set out for a weekend at a remote cabin in the woods, expecting nothing more than fun and relaxation. As night falls, they discover that something far more unsettling is at work and that nothing about their getaway is what it seems.', 'Five friends set out for a weekend at a remote cabin in the woods, expecting nothing more than fun and relaxation. As night falls, they discover that something far more unsettling is at work and that nothing about their getaway is what it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZZe5wn0udlhMtdlDjN4NB72R6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22970'),
  ('919041560158187912', 'The Cabinet of Caligari', 1962, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Roger Kay, John L. Russell, Lee Lukather', 'Robert Bloch', 'Glynis Johns, Dan O''Herlihy, Richard Davalos, Lawrence Dobkin, J. Pat O''Malley, Vicki Trickett, Estelle Winwood, Doreen Lang', 'NR', 'A delirious young woman feels trapped in a remote mansion at the mercy of a madman.', 'A delirious young woman feels trapped in a remote mansion at the mercy of a madman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RlWkmxgdjGrAzCM5hVBbxtEOGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109133'),
  ('968098948507706917', 'The Cabinet of Dr. Caligari', 2005, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'David Lee Fisher', 'David Lee Fisher', 'Judson Pearce Morgan, Daamen J. Krall, Doug Jones, Lauren Birkell, Neil Hopkins, William Gregory Lee, Randy Mulkey, Time Winters', null, 'Remake of Das Cabinet des Dr. Caligari (1920). Shot entirely on green screen. Some exact shots from the 1920 film were superimposed to properly replicate the original. Francis relates the story of traveling magician Dr. Caligari and Cesare. Their arrival in a town coincides with savage killings.', 'Remake of Das Cabinet des Dr. Caligari (1920). Shot entirely on green screen. Some exact shots from the 1920 film were superimposed to properly replicate the original. Francis relates the story of traveling magician Dr. Caligari and Cesare. Their arrival in a town coincides with savage killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxZWFn5eSI1UsV78BIoV6MJsOFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27227'),
  ('116313832090566274', 'The Cabinet of Jan Švankmajer', 1984, 'Animation', 'Stephen Quay, Timothy Quay, Keith Griffiths', null, null, null, 'In Prague, a professorial puppet, with metal pincers for hands and an open book for a hat, takes a boy as a pupil. First, the professor empties fluff and toys from the child''s head, leaving him without the top of his head for most of the film. The professor then teaches the lad about illusions and perspectives, the pursuit of an object through exploring a bank of drawers, divining an object, and the migration of forms. The child then brings out a box with a tarantula in it: the professor puts his "hands" into the box and describes what he feels. The boy receives a final lesson about animation and film making; then the professor gives him a brain and his own open-book hat.', 'In Prague, a professorial puppet, with metal pincers for hands and an open book for a hat, takes a boy as a pupil. First, the professor empties fluff and toys from the child''s head, leaving him without the top of his head for most of the film. The professor then teaches the lad about illusions and perspectives, the pursuit of an object through exploring a bank of drawers, divining an object, and the migration of forms. The child then brings out a box with a tarantula in it: the professor puts his "hands" into the box and describes what he feels. The boy receives a final lesson about animation and film making; then the professor gives him a brain and his own open-book hat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cFZ7au4nArf0zUfwuig5YZr8iW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59355'),
  ('78330237133870427', 'The Cable Guy', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Brinkmann, Ben Stiller, Lori Rowbotham', 'Lou Holtz Jr.', 'Jim Carrey, Matthew Broderick, Leslie Mann, Jack Black, George Segal, Diane Baker, Ben Stiller, Eric Roberts', 'PG-13', 'When recently single Steven moves into his new apartment, cable guy Chip comes to hook him up—and doesn''t let go. Initially, Chip is just overzealous in his desire to be Steven''s pal, but when Steven tries to end the ''friendship'', Chip shows his dark side. He begins stalking Steven, who''s left to fend for himself because no one else can believe Chip''s capable of such behaviour.', 'When recently single Steven moves into his new apartment, cable guy Chip comes to hook him up—and doesn''t let go. Initially, Chip is just overzealous in his desire to be Steven''s pal, but when Steven tries to end the ''friendship'', Chip shows his dark side. He begins stalking Steven, who''s left to fend for himself because no one else can believe Chip''s capable of such behaviour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YJt9l3RdrRohI95btQKPXwpdii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9894'),
  ('786752804449868460', 'The Cactus Kid', 1930, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Western', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', null, 'Mickey walks into the tavern where Minnie is dancing, and begins to dance and play piano himself. Pegleg Pete comes in and treats Minnie badly. Mickey tries to defend her, but Pete steals her away. Mickey, riding Horace Horsecollar, gives chase. He manages to throw Pete off a cliff.', 'Mickey walks into the tavern where Minnie is dancing, and begins to dance and play piano himself. Pegleg Pete comes in and treats Minnie badly. Mickey tries to defend her, but Pete steals her away. Mickey, riding Horace Horsecollar, gives chase. He manages to throw Pete off a cliff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0gLrZZa6wDe2JiiZaLRLXbYVmm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39093'),
  ('430284926597864034', 'The Caddy', 1953, 'Comedy, Music', 'Norman Taurog, Daniel L. Fapp, Michael D. Moore', 'Edmund L. Hartmann, Danny Arnold', 'Jerry Lewis, Dean Martin, Donna Reed, Barbara Bates, Joseph Calleia, Fred Clark, Clinton Sundberg, Howard Smith', 'NR', 'Although the son of a skilled golfer and an outstanding player in his own right, Harvey Miller is too nervous to play in front of a gallery, so he acts as coach and caddy for Joe Anthony, his girlfriend''s brother.', 'Although the son of a skilled golfer and an outstanding player in his own right, Harvey Miller is too nervous to play in front of a gallery, so he acts as coach and caddy for Joe Anthony, his girlfriend''s brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1zLzZ8Ko6FdT4ISJOZM6I21l7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44747'),
  ('735014750513809913', 'The Cage', 1947, null, 'Sidney Peterson', null, null, null, 'A soundless film starts in a studio: an artist sits, a nude stands; a page burns, paper cutouts appear, images are distorted. The artist removes his eye; it falls from his hand, seeing images spin as it rolls. A man falls, objects in the studio falls on him, he''s not the artist. A woman gets help from a man in a lab coat; he and the man on the floor fight over a shotgun. Outside, in the city, people and cars move backwards. On the street, those from the studio chase a woman who''s stolen leeks. In the backward cityscape, they move forward. They run toward a seaside amusement park. The artist follows, his head in a bird cage. He ends up with the woman who went for help; or does he?', 'A soundless film starts in a studio: an artist sits, a nude stands; a page burns, paper cutouts appear, images are distorted. The artist removes his eye; it falls from his hand, seeing images spin as it rolls. A man falls, objects in the studio falls on him, he''s not the artist. A woman gets help from a man in a lab coat; he and the man on the floor fight over a shotgun. Outside, in the city, people and cars move backwards. On the street, those from the studio chase a woman who''s stolen leeks. In the backward cityscape, they move forward. They run toward a seaside amusement park. The artist follows, his head in a bird cage. He ends up with the woman who went for help; or does he?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jL0H87XK73tSPNts8M2rBmPJXtg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159629'),
  ('1082243648753764691', 'The Cage', 1964, 'Fantasy', 'Shūji Terayama, Yoshihiro Tatsuki', 'Shūji Terayama', 'Eiko Kujo, Mr. Nippon, Yoshihiro Tatsuki, Ishihara Yuko, Debuko Ôyama, Ken Takeuchi', null, 'An experimental fantasy short dedicated to questioning whether or not man is a prisoner of time.', 'An experimental fantasy short dedicated to questioning whether or not man is a prisoner of time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9FTmBr0tJwWrfvLzyjXnAt6ed5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192104'),
  ('777021556961417194', 'The Cage', 1975, 'Drama', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Walter Wottitz', 'Pascal Jardin, Pierre Granier-Deferre', 'Lino Ventura, Ingrid Thulin, William Sabatier, Dominique Zardi, Jean Turlier, Sophie Sam', null, 'The story of a woman who is suddenly visited by her estranged ex-husband. The ex-hubby wants to buy her country house, which she received in the divorce settlement. Instead he finds himself locked in a cage in the cellar.', 'The story of a woman who is suddenly visited by her estranged ex-husband. The ex-hubby wants to buy her country house, which she received in the divorce settlement. Instead he finds himself locked in a cage in the cellar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVPxeYMU5mPbGfqF7Rs2ZmtGqbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271919'),
  ('649586926229236243', 'The Cage', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Andrés Díaz, David Rivera, José Salaverría', 'Inti Torres Melo, José Salaverría', 'Karina Velásquez, Ananda Troconis, Juvel Vielma, Leónidas Urbina, Ilya Izaguirre', null, 'Aliens wipe out the earth population except for 3 people. How will the adapt and survive?', 'Aliens wipe out the earth population except for 3 people. How will the adapt and survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIPZbV05DUFcHuc9gb4Mk6shI3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:861250'),
  ('27098172390870523', 'The Cage - Nella gabbia', 2024, 'Drama', 'Gianni Chiarini, Massimiliano Zanin', 'Vittorio Alonzo, Massimiliano Zanin', 'Aurora Giovinazzo, Valeria Solarino, Brando Pacitto, Alessio Sakara, Desirée Popper, Patrizio Oliva, Fabrizio Ferracane', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zus9VmdmL8RLSAwYyJ0phSNo6JJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033576'),
  ('648402951116960089', 'The Caged Flower', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jun Yoriko', null, 'Misaki Morino, Shingo Ota, Yumi Fukuda, Uta Kohaku, Kyoko Hayami', null, 'Yoriko Jun turned Miyuki Fukashi’s sensual novel with the same name into a movie. An ordinary office lady and a boy meet on the Internet, they get into a master-slave relationship and are drowned in a world of pleasure.', 'Yoriko Jun turned Miyuki Fukashi’s sensual novel with the same name into a movie. An ordinary office lady and a boy meet on the Internet, they get into a master-slave relationship and are drowned in a world of pleasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBRcWxp0W4IrmEk2G78Uyy2KTCE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435941'),
  ('380496725839729514', 'The Caiman', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nanni Moretti, Arnaldo Catinari, Loredana Conte', 'Nanni Moretti, Francesco Piccolo, Federica Pontremoli', 'Silvio Orlando, Margherita Buy, Jasmine Trinca, Michele Placido, Antonello Grimaldi, Elio De Capitani, Paolo Sorrentino, Paolo Virzì', null, 'Bruno Bonomo was a famous producer of B-movies in the ‘70s. After a long hiatus, Bonomo offers a screenplay to RAI centered on the figure of Italy’s prime minister and media tycoon Silvio Berlusconi, a subject so controversial that even the public television broadcaster refuses to produce it', 'Bruno Bonomo was a famous producer of B-movies in the ‘70s. After a long hiatus, Bonomo offers a screenplay to RAI centered on the figure of Italy’s prime minister and media tycoon Silvio Berlusconi, a subject so controversial that even the public television broadcaster refuses to produce it', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPil7yQR4norsr2urNofv9Ym1Ql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31289'),
  ('971703996130744720', 'The Caine Mutiny', 1954, 'Drama, War', 'Edward Dmytryk, Franz Planer, Carter DeHaven Jr.', 'Stanley Roberts', 'Humphrey Bogart, Robert Francis, Van Johnson, Fred MacMurray, May Wynn, Katherine Warren, Jerry Paris, José Ferrer', 'NR', 'When a US Naval captain shows signs of mental instability that jeopardize his ship, the first officer relieves him of command and faces court martial for mutiny.', 'When a US Naval captain shows signs of mental instability that jeopardize his ship, the first officer relieves him of command and faces court martial for mutiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuO4Z3wOWVlhq35MS9asZeT9rVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10178'),
  ('540007723496513378', 'The Caine Mutiny Court-Martial', 1988, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Robert Altman, Jacek Laskus', null, 'Eric Bogosian, Jeff Daniels, Brad Davis, Peter Gallagher, Michael Murphy, Kevin J. O''Connor, Danny Darst, Laurence Ballard', null, 'A full-length adaptation, originally staged as a play, of the court-martial segment from the novel "The Caine Mutiny".', 'A full-length adaptation, originally staged as a play, of the court-martial segment from the novel "The Caine Mutiny".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3YSJrhAAU7DW5AAgpADZIXRIhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132961'),
  ('1123840916561368077', 'The Caine Mutiny Court-Martial', 2023, 'Drama, War', 'Michael Grady, David Marnell, Michael Salven', null, 'Kiefer Sutherland, Jason Clarke, Jake Lacy, Monica Raymund, Lance Reddick, Lewis Pullman, Tom Riley, Jay Duplass', 'PG-13', 'Barney Greenwald, a skeptical lawyer, reluctantly defends an officer of the navy who took control of the Caine from its captain, Lt. Philip Francis Queeg, while caught in a violent sea storm. As the court-martial proceeds, however, Greenwald increasingly questions if it was truly a mutiny or rather the courageous acts of a group of sailors who could not trust their unstable leader.', 'Barney Greenwald, a skeptical lawyer, reluctantly defends an officer of the navy who took control of the Caine from its captain, Lt. Philip Francis Queeg, while caught in a violent sea storm. As the court-martial proceeds, however, Greenwald increasingly questions if it was truly a mutiny or rather the courageous acts of a group of sailors who could not trust their unstable leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jii0CWMcjFmCfrTXsRyMuwjlNY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018332'),
  ('446228538796612022', 'The Cake Eaters', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mary Stuart Masterson, Peter Masterson', 'Jayce Bartok', 'Kristen Stewart, Aaron Stanford, Bruce Dern, Elizabeth Ashley, Jayce Bartok, Miriam Shor, Talia Balsam, Tom Cavanagh', 'R', 'The death of the Kimbrough family matriarch affects the three male survivors of the clan. Widower Easy tries to reconnect with his old flame, Marg. Eldest son and struggling musician Guy moves back to town, feeling guilty that he missed the funeral. His brother, Beagle, who was his mother''s caretaker, falls for Marg''s granddaughter, Georgia, a chronically ill girl who fears her time is growing short.', 'The death of the Kimbrough family matriarch affects the three male survivors of the clan. Widower Easy tries to reconnect with his old flame, Marg. Eldest son and struggling musician Guy moves back to town, feeling guilty that he missed the funeral. His brother, Beagle, who was his mother''s caretaker, falls for Marg''s granddaughter, Georgia, a chronically ill girl who fears her time is growing short.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIomPiujrKChXFGNHofw8hkDGoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16071'),
  ('209700833836100726', 'The Cakemaker', 2017, 'Drama', 'Ofir Raul Graizer, Omri Aloni', 'Ofir Raul Graizer', 'Tim Kalkhof, Sarah Adler, Roi Miller, Zohar Shtrauss, Sandra Sade, Tamir Ben Yehuda, Stephanie Stremler, Tagel Eliyahu', null, 'Thomas, a young German baker, is having an affair with Oren, an Israeli married man who has frequent business visits in Berlin. When Oren dies in a car crash in Israel, Thomas travels to Jerusalem seeking for answers regarding his death. Under a fabricated identity, Thomas infiltrates the life of Anat, his lover’s newly widowed wife, who owns a small Café in downtown Jerusalem. Thomas starts to work for her, creating German cakes and cookies that bring her Café to life. Thomas finds himself involved in Anat’s life in a way far beyond his anticipation. To protect the truth he will stretch his lie to a point of no return.', 'Thomas, a young German baker, is having an affair with Oren, an Israeli married man who has frequent business visits in Berlin. When Oren dies in a car crash in Israel, Thomas travels to Jerusalem seeking for answers regarding his death. Under a fabricated identity, Thomas infiltrates the life of Anat, his lover’s newly widowed wife, who owns a small Café in downtown Jerusalem. Thomas starts to work for her, creating German cakes and cookies that bring her Café to life. Thomas finds himself involved in Anat’s life in a way far beyond his anticipation. To protect the truth he will stretch his lie to a point of no return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WwHLnuqqwhvCkBACCMAR5xuQMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464825'),
  ('77243654971183789', 'The Calamari Wrestler', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Minoru Kawasaki', 'Masakazu Migita, Minoru Kawasaki', 'Osamu Nishimura, Akira Nogami, Miho Shiraishi, Nobuo Kameko, Yoshihiro Takayama, Matthew Saliba, Kana Ishida, Hiroyuki Taniguchi', null, 'This wild comedy pokes fun at the world of pro-wrestling by placing its accomplished wrestler protagonist Koji Taguchi against a giant squid known as the Calamari Wrestler. The Calimari Wrestler not only proves to be Koji''s most difficult opponent yet, but also has an effect on several people''s personal lives when he becomes the unlikely object of a young girl''s affection.', 'This wild comedy pokes fun at the world of pro-wrestling by placing its accomplished wrestler protagonist Koji Taguchi against a giant squid known as the Calamari Wrestler. The Calimari Wrestler not only proves to be Koji''s most difficult opponent yet, but also has an effect on several people''s personal lives when he becomes the unlikely object of a young girl''s affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpL3p7tgt2iGL9FLrEEmp3Wbki7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34062'),
  ('184168366260258152', 'The Calcium Kid', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Alex De Rakoff, David M. Dunlap', 'Derek Boyle, Raymond Friel, Alex De Rakoff', 'Orlando Bloom, Omid Djalili, Michael Lerner, Michael Peña, Tamer Hassan, Rafe Spall, Mark Heap, Frank Harper', null, 'When milkman Jimmy Connelly accidentally puts Britain''s contender for the World title out of action, he is propelled from amateur boxer to the world stage and announced as the replacement contender for the championship fight.', 'When milkman Jimmy Connelly accidentally puts Britain''s contender for the World title out of action, he is propelled from amateur boxer to the world stage and announced as the replacement contender for the championship fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eug0h5nFQZTClWpmuf3E3xovsgS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31063'),
  ('275949706922472338', 'The Calculus Affair', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ray Goossens', 'Charles Shows', 'Georges Poujouly, Jean Clarieux, Fernand Fabre, Jacques Marin, Lita Recio', null, 'Strange things are happening in the evening at the mansion: glass things break without any apparent reason. Professor Calculus, somewhat apathetic to the whole series of events, leaves the following day to attend a conference on nuclear physics in Geneva. Foreign powers get wind of his work and send their agents to investigate.', 'Strange things are happening in the evening at the mansion: glass things break without any apparent reason. Professor Calculus, somewhat apathetic to the whole series of events, leaves the following day to attend a conference on nuclear physics in Geneva. Foreign powers get wind of his work and send their agents to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2T88qDvqBilCfa0HtlqwP1bX8Ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582820'),
  ('372369087771841651', 'The Calculus Affair', 1991, 'Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Action, Comedy, Crime, Family, Mystery', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Christophe Poujol', 'Thierry Wermuth, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin', null, 'Strange things are happening in the evening at the mansion. Glass things break without any apparent reason. The Professor, somewhat apathetic to the whole series of events, leaves the following day to attend a conference on nuclear physics in Geneva. Foreign powers get wind of the Professor''s work and send their agents to investigate.', 'Strange things are happening in the evening at the mansion. Glass things break without any apparent reason. The Professor, somewhat apathetic to the whole series of events, leaves the following day to attend a conference on nuclear physics in Geneva. Foreign powers get wind of the Professor''s work and send their agents to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HJZSOj8QicbDU2wW7NH34x6L8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536552'),
  ('486285832312605032', 'The Calendar Killer', 2025, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Adolfo J. Kolmerer, Christian Huck', 'Susanne Schneider', 'Luise Heyer, Sabin Tambrea, Friedrich Mücke, Rainer Bock, Andreas Döhler, Dennenesch Zoudé, Isabel Thierauch, Kristin Suckow', null, 'Klara is going to die today unless she kills her husband instead. The Calendar Killer has given her that impossible choice. When Jules starts his night shift at a telephone safety helpline for lonely women on their way home, Klara''s call reaches him. He soon becomes her last hope for survival and races against time to save her.', 'Klara is going to die today unless she kills her husband instead. The Calendar Killer has given her that impossible choice. When Jules starts his night shift at a telephone safety helpline for lonely women on their way home, Klara''s call reaches him. He soon becomes her last hope for survival and races against time to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnciRmZZSdyqp7HcrAwNG0mObaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1388694'),
  ('793430429980432198', 'The Calico Dragon', 1935, 'Animation, Family', 'Rudolf Ising', null, null, null, 'A little girl reads a story about a dragon; as she falls asleep, her doll rides off on his calico horse through a calico land to do battle with a three-headed singing calico dragon.', 'A little girl reads a story about a dragon; as she falls asleep, her doll rides off on his calico horse through a calico land to do battle with a three-headed singing calico dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifSqCXLhU9FLPycgATaehLolGip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184589'),
  ('629440517396189341', 'The California Kid', 1974, 'Action, Thriller, Horror, TV Movie', 'Richard T. Heffron, Terry K. Meade, John Gaudioso', 'Richard Compton', 'Martin Sheen, Vic Morrow, Michelle Phillips, Stuart Margolin, Nick Nolte, Janit Baldwin, Gary Morgan, Frederic Downs', null, 'A sadistic small-town sheriff has a habit of deliberately forcing speeders to their deaths on the mountain roads leading into town. The brother of one of the victims rolls into town in his hot rod to investigate his brother''s death.', 'A sadistic small-town sheriff has a habit of deliberately forcing speeders to their deaths on the mountain roads leading into town. The brother of one of the victims rolls into town in his hot rod to investigate his brother''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHH7WrcNxd84sfswvOVIHExtTou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53102'),
  ('593263976116894070', 'The Call', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stefano Pasetto', null, 'Francesca Inaudi, Sandra Ceccarelli, César Bordón, Guillermo Pfening, Arturo Goetz, Julieta Cardinali, Hilda Bernard', null, 'Two woman, one a married middle-aged airline stewardess, and the other a free-wheeling factory worker open to experience and opportunity, meet and decide to change their lives. Moving to Patagonia and leaving their men behind they find that escape carries with it a different set of responsibilities.', 'Two woman, one a married middle-aged airline stewardess, and the other a free-wheeling factory worker open to experience and opportunity, meet and decide to change their lives. Moving to Patagonia and leaving their men behind they find that escape carries with it a different set of responsibilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RyNtbTzxy9RtWghHfcUdmgLNjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137868'),
  ('403473366100649181', 'The Call', 2013, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Brad Anderson, Thomas Yatsko', 'Richard D''Ovidio', 'Halle Berry, Abigail Breslin, Morris Chestnut, Michael Eklund, David Otunga, Michael Imperioli, Justina Machado, José Zúñiga', 'R', 'Jordan Turner is an experienced 911 operator but when she makes an error in judgment and a call ends badly, Jordan is rattled and unsure if she can continue. But when teenager Casey Welson is abducted in the back of a man''s car and calls 911, Jordan is the one called upon to use all of her experience, insights and quick thinking to help Casey escape, and not just to save her, but to make sure the man is brought to justice.', 'Jordan Turner is an experienced 911 operator but when she makes an error in judgment and a call ends badly, Jordan is rattled and unsure if she can continue. But when teenager Casey Welson is abducted in the back of a man''s car and calls 911, Jordan is the one called upon to use all of her experience, insights and quick thinking to help Casey escape, and not just to save her, but to make sure the man is brought to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mG334OlDVJpD8gMfTCM2Mpp0gQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158011'),
  ('535734316544661662', 'The Call', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Pablo Díez, Timothy Woodward Jr.', 'Patrick Stibbs', 'Lin Shaye, Tobin Bell, Chester Rushing, Erin Sanders, Judd Lormand, Mike C. Manning, Sloane Morgan Siegel, Randy J. Goodwin', 'NR', 'In the fall of 1987, a group of small-town friends must survive the night in the home of a sinister couple after a tragic accident occurs. Needing only to make a single phone call, the request seems horribly ordinary until they realize that this call could change their life…or end it.', 'In the fall of 1987, a group of small-town friends must survive the night in the home of a sinister couple after a tragic accident occurs. Needing only to make a single phone call, the request seems horribly ordinary until they realize that this call could change their life…or end it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKmykghTmvQj6zum79TsdUL5mPF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746817'),
  ('835551250349483411', 'The Call of Cthulhu', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Leman', 'Sean Branney', 'Matt Foyer, John Bolen, Ralph Lucas, Chad Fifer, Susan Zucker, Kalafatic Poole, John Klemantaski, Jason Owens', null, 'A dying professor leaves his great-nephew a collection of documents pertaining to the Cthulhu Cult. The nephew begins to learn why the study of the cult so fascinated his grandfather. Bit-by-bit he begins piecing together the dread implications of his grandfather''s inquiries, and soon he takes on investigating the Cthulhu cult as a crusade of his own.', 'A dying professor leaves his great-nephew a collection of documents pertaining to the Cthulhu Cult. The nephew begins to learn why the study of the cult so fascinated his grandfather. Bit-by-bit he begins piecing together the dread implications of his grandfather''s inquiries, and soon he takes on investigating the Cthulhu cult as a crusade of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCrOkzrWs8ux31oVCc1R8tt6zTC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20981'),
  ('734056449923813021', 'The Call of Sex', 1977, 'Thriller', 'Tulio Demicheli, Douglas Sandoval', 'Fernando Orozco', 'Andrés García, Rossy Mendoza, George Hilton, Claudia Gravy, Eduardo Fajardo, Verónica Miriel, Franklin Dominguez, Augusto Feria', null, 'A man finds a woman that reminds him of his long lost love: his step-sister with whom he initiated his sex life. But he is married and his wife wants proof of the cheating to get a divorce.', 'A man finds a woman that reminds him of his long lost love: his step-sister with whom he initiated his sex life. But he is married and his wife wants proof of the cheating to get a divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mK8z5RWaUVDBoiagrxoF8UZQuCr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105666'),
  ('511824197211683566', 'The Call of the Toad', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert Gliński', 'Cezary Harasimowicz, Pawel Huelle', 'Krystyna Janda, Matthias Habich, Dorothea Walda, Bhasker Patel, Udo Samel, Mareike Carrière, Joachim Król, Frederick Lau', null, 'A Polish woman and a German man fall in love against the odds and decide to set up a cemetery for exiles. But can their daring venture survive the call of the toad? Adapted from Gunter Grass’ novel.', 'A Polish woman and a German man fall in love against the odds and decide to set up a cemetery for exiles. But can their daring venture survive the call of the toad? Adapted from Gunter Grass’ novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0GSjJhTh4WorPPT9mknUDEVQZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54709'),
  ('498058915743206612', 'The Call of the Wild', 1972, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Ken Annakin, John Cabrera', 'Harry Alan Towers, Wyn Wells, Peter Yeldham', 'Charlton Heston, Raimund Harmstorf, George Eastman, Maria Rohm, Juan Luis Galiardo, Sancho Gracia, Friedhelm Lehmann, Horst Heuck', 'PG', 'John Thornton, is a fearless man who''s after more than gold; he wants to do what''s right. Thornton works for the U.S. mail and is the only person daring and smart enough to figure out how to travel the deadly 600 miles from Skagway to Dawson, Alaska in the icy winter. His incredibly dog Buck is by his side and part of how he survives.', 'John Thornton, is a fearless man who''s after more than gold; he wants to do what''s right. Thornton works for the U.S. mail and is the only person daring and smart enough to figure out how to travel the deadly 600 miles from Skagway to Dawson, Alaska in the icy winter. His incredibly dog Buck is by his side and part of how he survives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaQr0RnOnscsCLE0OS2QsVErhtr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42759'),
  ('712443640616628630', 'The Call of the Wild', 2020, 'Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Chris Sanders, Conte Mark Matal, K.C. Colwell', 'Michael Green', 'Harrison Ford, Dan Stevens, Colin Woodell, Karen Gillan, Omar Sy, Raven Scott, Wes Brown, Cara Gee', 'PG', 'Buck is a big-hearted dog whose blissful domestic life is turned upside down when he is suddenly uprooted from his California home and transplanted to the exotic wilds of the Yukon during the Gold Rush of the 1890s. As the newest rookie on a mail delivery dog sled team—and later its leader—Buck experiences the adventure of a lifetime, ultimately finding his true place in the world and becoming his own master.', 'Buck is a big-hearted dog whose blissful domestic life is turned upside down when he is suddenly uprooted from his California home and transplanted to the exotic wilds of the Yukon during the Gold Rush of the 1890s. As the newest rookie on a mail delivery dog sled team—and later its leader—Buck experiences the adventure of a lifetime, ultimately finding his true place in the world and becoming his own master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33VdppGbeNxICrFUtW2WpGHvfYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481848'),
  ('1056937332376404653', 'The Call of the Wild: Dog of the Yukon', 1997, 'Adventure, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Peter Svatek, Sylvain Brault', 'Graham Ludlow', 'Rutger Hauer, Richard Dreyfuss, Raymond Ducasse, Eric Hoziel, Deano Clavet, Barry Blake, Luc Morissette, Robert-Pierre Côté', 'PG', 'Jack London''s classic story from 1903 about Buck, a dog kidnapped from his home in California and taken to the Yukon where he is mistreated until a prospector discovers him and relates to his situation. Although the two are bonded, Buck yearns to run free with the wild dogs in the wilderness.', 'Jack London''s classic story from 1903 about Buck, a dog kidnapped from his home in California and taken to the Yukon where he is mistreated until a prospector discovers him and relates to his situation. Although the two are bonded, Buck yearns to run free with the wild dogs in the wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbGRXPPfFCqYwn9vQt5EbfEeTLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56217'),
  ('286959495398694680', 'The Call Up', 2016, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Charles Barker, John Lee, Ryan William White', 'Charles Barker', 'Max Deacon, Morfydd Clark, Ali Cook, Chris Obi, Tom Benedict Knight, Dino Fazzani, Adriana Randall, Malcolm Modele', null, 'When a group of elite online gamers each receive a mysterious invitation to trial a state-of-the-art virtual reality video game, it’s a dream come true and impossible to resist. Arriving at the test site, the group step into hi-tech gear and prepare for a revolutionary, next-level gaming experience that brings modern warfare to life with frightening realism. At first it’s a unique and exhilarating experience. But what starts out like a dream encounter with cutting edge technology quickly takes a turn for the sinister. Once the group are attacked by enemy combatants, they soon realize this is no game after all. Make a mistake here and you pay with your life. Now these masters of the shoot ‘em up will have to fight for survival within a game gone bad, but this time it’s for real.', 'When a group of elite online gamers each receive a mysterious invitation to trial a state-of-the-art virtual reality video game, it’s a dream come true and impossible to resist. Arriving at the test site, the group step into hi-tech gear and prepare for a revolutionary, next-level gaming experience that brings modern warfare to life with frightening realism. At first it’s a unique and exhilarating experience. But what starts out like a dream encounter with cutting edge technology quickly takes a turn for the sinister. Once the group are attacked by enemy combatants, they soon realize this is no game after all. Make a mistake here and you pay with your life. Now these masters of the shoot ‘em up will have to fight for survival within a game gone bad, but this time it’s for real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llnI8LlA0ct9HILRgUHd70xoTwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388347'),
  ('1109296781088890016', 'The Call-up', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Lasse Åberg, Peter Hald, Hanno-Heinz Fuchs', 'Bo Jönsson, Lars Molin, Lasse Åberg', 'Janne ''Loffe'' Carlsson, Lasse Åberg, Ted Åström, Lasse Haldenberg, Weiron Holmberg, Lennart Skoogh, Ingvar Andersson, Lena-Maria Gårdenäs-Lawton', null, 'It''s time for Jonsson to return to his old regiment to rehearse what he learned during conscription a few years ago. He meets his old friends, platoon leader Larsson and the music loving captain ''Beethoven''. Jonsson and his comrades doesn''t take it very serious - but they have a jolly good time. A female journalist follows the exercise to write an article, and gets interested in him.', 'It''s time for Jonsson to return to his old regiment to rehearse what he learned during conscription a few years ago. He meets his old friends, platoon leader Larsson and the music loving captain ''Beethoven''. Jonsson and his comrades doesn''t take it very serious - but they have a jolly good time. A female journalist follows the exercise to write an article, and gets interested in him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWx9ymAlun2Jm1yWmhjP3k2bq2u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18142'),
  ('940925160713392276', 'The Caller', 1987, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Arthur Allan Seidelman, Anthony Barnao, Gianni Cozzo', 'Michael Sloan', 'Malcolm McDowell, Madolyn Smith Osborne', 'R', 'One night, an unusual stranger in need asks a woman living alone in a house in the woods if he can use her phone. It soon becomes clear that they''re playing a strange mind game and that there''s something very wrong about the woods.', 'One night, an unusual stranger in need asks a woman living alone in a house in the woods if he can use her phone. It soon becomes clear that they''re playing a strange mind game and that there''s something very wrong about the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTMassx0Cr9IjTOQFUMRGvtjECW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110327'),
  ('71741259542226881', 'The Caller', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Matthew Parkhill, Alexander Melman', 'Sergio Casci', 'Rachelle Lefevre, Stephen Moyer, Luis Guzmán, Ed Quinn, Lorna Raver, Lydia Echevarría, Aris Mejias, Gladys Rodríguez', 'R', 'Troubled divorcee Mary Kee is tormented by a series of sinister phone calls from a mysterious woman. When the stranger reveals she''s calling from the past, Mary tries to break off contact. But the caller doesn''t like being ignored, and looks for revenge in a unique and terrifying way...', 'Troubled divorcee Mary Kee is tormented by a series of sinister phone calls from a mysterious woman. When the stranger reveals she''s calling from the past, Mary tries to break off contact. But the caller doesn''t like being ignored, and looks for revenge in a unique and terrifying way...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xhuufxE28PhQrUUoUe1TYg6oeU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73588'),
  ('54089508561527465', 'The Calligrapher', 1991, 'Animation', 'Stephen Quay, Timothy Quay', null, null, null, 'With harpsichord music in the background, a dandy, seated at a table, plucks a quill pen from a ceiling full of them above him, dips it in ink, thinks, then draws a straight line down the page in front of him, out of which sprout six more quill pens, each held by a hand. The calligrapher moves all the hands and pens in unison, drawing an elaborate feathered wing, which comes to live, peeling off the page, and, now a quill pen, slips in to his hand. He tucks it behind his left ear.', 'With harpsichord music in the background, a dandy, seated at a table, plucks a quill pen from a ceiling full of them above him, dips it in ink, thinks, then draws a straight line down the page in front of him, out of which sprout six more quill pens, each held by a hand. The calligrapher moves all the hands and pens in unison, drawing an elaborate feathered wing, which comes to live, peeling off the page, and, now a quill pen, slips in to his hand. He tucks it behind his left ear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wnnHGTqypDpg2pLdDD4lqrcyip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219255'),
  ('69632100643019730', 'The Calling', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Richard Caesar, Joachim Berc, Jeremy Kincaid Smith', 'John Rice, Rudy Gaines', 'Laura Harris, Richard Lintern, Francis Magee, Alex Roe, Alice Krige, John Standing, Peter Waddington, Nick Brimble', null, 'On her wedding night, a young woman conceives a child during an hallucinatory encounter. Several years later, as her friends and family begin to behave strangely, she pieces together clues that lead to one conclusion...her son is the Antichrist', 'On her wedding night, a young woman conceives a child during an hallucinatory encounter. Several years later, as her friends and family begin to behave strangely, she pieces together clues that lead to one conclusion...her son is the Antichrist', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83aIfGKzE7TE4MqYC5ht14jAPz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47191'),
  ('986276701985557198', 'The Calling', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Jason Stone, David Robert Jones, Rebecca Zhao', 'Scott Abramovitch', 'Susan Sarandon, Gil Bellows, Ellen Burstyn, Topher Grace, Donald Sutherland, Christopher Heyerdahl, Ella Ballentine, Kristin Booth', 'R', 'Detective Hazel Micallef hasn''t had much to worry about in the sleepy town of Port Dundas until a string of gruesome murders in the surrounding countryside brings her face to face with a serial killer driven by a higher calling.', 'Detective Hazel Micallef hasn''t had much to worry about in the sleepy town of Port Dundas until a string of gruesome murders in the surrounding countryside brings her face to face with a serial killer driven by a higher calling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqJGIh2mZVwTD20GeDVTUNOwd5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283384'),
  ('674993774683822996', 'The Calling Witch', 2026, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Mark Wilson, Thomas Rose, Eric Zaragoza', 'Chris Retts', 'Danika Golombek, Grayson Eddey, Nathalie Söderqvist, Marcus DeAnda, Zachary Cowan, Greg Lutz, Hilary Barraford, Cali Kira', null, 'A brother and sister are terrorized by what seems to be their late-author mother''s most sinister literary creation - The Calling Witch.', 'A brother and sister are terrorized by what seems to be their late-author mother''s most sinister literary creation - The Calling Witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8o2NzIH4ze28NAVs1eRkejAJIk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1475490'),
  ('500783453269425003', 'The Calm', 1980, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Jacek Petrycki', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Jerzy Stuhr, Izabela Olszewska, Jerzy Trela, Danuta Wiercińska, Michal Sulkiewicz, Elżbieta Karkoszka, Michał Żarnecki', null, 'A young man in his twenties leaves prison after a three-year sentence. He wants to start a new life in a place where he is not known and dreams only of a job, a wife and a family. He succeeds partially in fulfilling these dreams, but then runs into a conflict on a construction job between the corrupt boss and fellow workers secretly planning a strike. He becomes a pawn in one camp while remaining true to his ideals in the other. Filmed in 1976 and shelved for five years.', 'A young man in his twenties leaves prison after a three-year sentence. He wants to start a new life in a place where he is not known and dreams only of a job, a wife and a family. He succeeds partially in fulfilling these dreams, but then runs into a conflict on a construction job between the corrupt boss and fellow workers secretly planning a strike. He becomes a pawn in one camp while remaining true to his ideals in the other. Filmed in 1976 and shelved for five years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssUyksiuBFGxD6ci8FUiCqjj2Ai.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108733'),
  ('302471035080336476', 'The Calm Beyond', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Nathan Wong, Joshua Wong', 'Joshua Wong', 'Kara Wang, Sarinna Boggs, Terence Yin Chi-Wai, Joyce Cheng Yan-Yi, Jai Day, Timmy Gunn, Jason Lim, Jane Wong', null, 'A young woman lives, hidden in plain sight in a ruined Hong Kong building after a tsunami destroyed the city - a castaway on a concrete island. Her concealed existence is changed forever when a small child literally floats into her life.', 'A young woman lives, hidden in plain sight in a ruined Hong Kong building after a tsunami destroyed the city - a castaway on a concrete island. Her concealed existence is changed forever when a small child literally floats into her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLBqqA6oXWzNCPYgYKz9eFIBIeB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748412'),
  ('157219338122778696', 'The Cambridge Squatter', 2017, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Eliane Caffé, Tarsila Araújo, Arthur Schmidt', 'Inês Figueiró, Eliane Caffé, Bruno Campello', 'Carmen Silva, José Dumont, Isam Ahmad Issa, Suely Franco, Paulo Américo, Juliane Arguello, Thais Carvalho, Preta Ferreira', null, 'The Cambridge Squatter tells the story of refugees, recently arrived in Brazil who, together with a group of low-income workers, occupy an old abandoned building in downtown São Paulo. Daily dramas, comical situations and different views on the world commingle with the threat of impending eviction.', 'The Cambridge Squatter tells the story of refugees, recently arrived in Brazil who, together with a group of low-income workers, occupy an old abandoned building in downtown São Paulo. Daily dramas, comical situations and different views on the world commingle with the threat of impending eviction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaXAeK4yqVugvNVoFhnzZfRFOgY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417544'),
  ('208003110383107713', 'The Cameraman''s Revenge', 1912, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Władysław Starewicz, Władysław Starewicz', 'Władysław Starewicz', null, null, 'A jilted husband takes his revenge by filming his wife and her lover and showing the result at the local cinema. This was one of Starewicz'' first animated films, and stars a cast of animated beetles.', 'A jilted husband takes his revenge by filming his wife and her lover and showing the result at the local cinema. This was one of Starewicz'' first animated films, and stars a cast of animated beetles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJ8IQrSWc8wNWSySa3WoMs6np2Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90056'),
  ('785659862541499527', 'The Camp', 2021, 'Action, Family, Comedy', 'Vali Dobrogeanu, Paul Tatcu', 'Vali Dobrogeanu', 'Andrei Șelaru, Diana Condurache, Smaranda Știrbu, Andrei Gavril, Mădălina Bellariu Ion, Cezara Cristescu, Matei Dima, David Dobrincu', null, 'After a group of teenagers winds up in a camp free of technology, they quickly discover mysterious occurrences at the facility.', 'After a group of teenagers winds up in a camp free of technology, they quickly discover mysterious occurrences at the facility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4ZyFEUKu6yAyhBZI5IRjKisfm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915765'),
  ('938118236357098828', 'The Camp Followers', 1965, 'Drama, War', 'Valerio Zurlini, Tonino Delli Colli, Tersicore Kolosoff', 'Franco Solinas, Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi', 'Anna Karina, Lea Massari, Marie Laforêt, Tomas Milian, Mario Adorf, Valeria Moriconi, Aleksandar Gavrić, Rossana Di Rocco', null, 'In WWII, Lieut. Martino and his men are assigned to lead a group of prostitutes through the mountainous ways to serve in brothels for Italian soldiers in Albania.', 'In WWII, Lieut. Martino and his men are assigned to lead a group of prostitutes through the mountainous ways to serve in brothels for Italian soldiers in Albania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiyvD7pIfawVozM9uiFbsezNSCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81799'),
  ('52750693171344329', 'The Camp on Blood Island', 1958, 'War, Thriller, Drama', 'Val Guest, Jack Asher', 'Val Guest', 'André Morell, Carl Möhner, Walter Fitzgerald, Edward Underdown, Phil Brown, Barbara Shelley, Michael Goodliffe, Michael Gwynn', 'NR', 'Set in a Japanese prisoner of war camp during World War II, the film focuses on the brutality and horror that the allied prisoners were exposed to as the Japanese metered out subjugation and punishment to a disgraced and defeated enemy. This harrowing drama concentrates on the deviations of legal and moral definitions when two opposing cultures clash. Although fictional, this was one of the earliest films to deal realistically with life and death in a Japanese prisoner-of-war camp during the Second War.', 'Set in a Japanese prisoner of war camp during World War II, the film focuses on the brutality and horror that the allied prisoners were exposed to as the Japanese metered out subjugation and punishment to a disgraced and defeated enemy. This harrowing drama concentrates on the deviations of legal and moral definitions when two opposing cultures clash. Although fictional, this was one of the earliest films to deal realistically with life and death in a Japanese prisoner-of-war camp during the Second War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQ0Bj6uI3Ei2TyRjgb3sEQUU2II.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123755'),
  ('128904250440852067', 'The Campaign', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jay Roach, Jim Denault, Josh King', 'Chris Henchy, Shawn Harwell', 'Will Ferrell, Zach Galifianakis, Jason Sudeikis, Katherine LaNasa, Dylan McDermott, Sarah Baker, John Lithgow, Dan Aykroyd', 'R', 'Two rival politicians compete to win an election to represent their small North Carolina congressional district in the United States House of Representatives.', 'Two rival politicians compete to win an election to represent their small North Carolina congressional district in the United States House of Representatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMWjJ13sFTT07DwjNlqh8VY4sK6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77953'),
  ('457037118646206060', 'The Can', 2007, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Tomáš Vorel', null, 'Tomáš Vorel, Jiří Mádl, Martina Procházková, Lenka Jurošková, Tomáš Matonoha, Eva Holubová, Zuzana Bydžovská, Tomáš Hanák', null, 'This movie is about strange relationships in one "noname" gymnasium in Czech republic.', 'This movie is about strange relationships in one "noname" gymnasium in Czech republic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orMm2Iz574vNAyBT8sIXhQcPLdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16517'),
  ('536647145627955701', 'The Canal', 2014, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Hannah Quinn, Ivan Kavanagh, Piers McGrail', 'Ivan Kavanagh', 'Rupert Evans, Antonia Campbell-Hughes, Hannah Hoekstra, Steve Oram, Kelly Byrne, Serena Brabazon, Anthony Murphy, Calum Heath', 'NR', 'A man who suspects his wife is cheating on him begins having nightmarish visions of an evil presence that he believes inhabits his house.', 'A man who suspects his wife is cheating on him begins having nightmarish visions of an evil presence that he believes inhabits his house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5c4FFLSUx4ZBqcS2rq5CLVJdY9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265010'),
  ('237097743684688166', 'The Canaries', 1969, null, 'Jerome Hill', null, null, null, 'Live-action footage of canaries and beachgoers overlaid with hand-painted effects.', 'Live-action footage of canaries and beachgoers overlaid with hand-painted effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHPaReDEUvrwwCt5dsi5QHNxYDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209706'),
  ('1056956708455010919', 'The Canary Murder Case', 1929, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Malcolm St. Clair, Frank Tuttle, Cliff Blackstone', 'Florence Ryerson', 'William Powell, James Hall, Louise Brooks, Jean Arthur, Charles Lane, Lawrence Grant, Gustav von Seyffertitz, E.H. Calvert', 'NR', 'A beautiful showgirl, name "the Canary" is a scheming nightclub singer. Blackmailing is her game and with that she ends up dead. But who killed "the Canary". All the suspects knew and were used by her and everyone had a motive to see her dead. The only witness to the crime has also been ''rubbed out''. Only one man, the keen, fascinating, debonair detective Philo Vance, would be able to figure out who is the killer.', 'A beautiful showgirl, name "the Canary" is a scheming nightclub singer. Blackmailing is her game and with that she ends up dead. But who killed "the Canary". All the suspects knew and were used by her and everyone had a motive to see her dead. The only witness to the crime has also been ''rubbed out''. Only one man, the keen, fascinating, debonair detective Philo Vance, would be able to figure out who is the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x21cBrK1sM30j0xNlHKPI33toTS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82105'),
  ('581946356004771837', 'The Candidate', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Ritchie, Victor J. Kemper', 'Jeremy Larner', 'Robert Redford, Peter Boyle, Melvyn Douglas, Don Porter, Allen Garfield, Karen Carlson, Quinn K. Redeker, Morgan Upton', 'PG', 'Bill McKay is a candidate for the U.S. Senate from California. He has no hope of winning, so he is willing to tweak the establishment.', 'Bill McKay is a candidate for the U.S. Senate from California. He has no hope of winning, so he is willing to tweak the establishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zcDSOe1akUXsc2Q1APfchKcVaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21711'),
  ('279185749900208777', 'The Candidate', 2007, 'Drama', 'Niels Arestrup, Romain Winding', 'Niels Arestrup', 'Yvan Attal, Niels Arestrup, Maurice Bénichou, Guillaume Gallienne, Clotilde de Bayser, Sophie Broustal, Cyril Couton, Alain Doutey', null, 'Shortly before the presidential election in a European state, Michel Dedieu stepped in at the last minute to replace his party''s candidate, who was forced to withdraw due to a rapidly spreading cancer. The day after the first round, he has very little time to prepare with his close team for the televised debate that will pit him against his opponent. Unpopular with the media and the public, he must improve his image and refine his arguments at all costs.', 'Shortly before the presidential election in a European state, Michel Dedieu stepped in at the last minute to replace his party''s candidate, who was forced to withdraw due to a rapidly spreading cancer. The day after the first round, he has very little time to prepare with his close team for the televised debate that will pit him against his opponent. Unpopular with the media and the public, he must improve his image and refine his arguments at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSFIUUyHafrdvHLtAShHeLlL3jE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60101'),
  ('818682257678279098', 'The Candidate', 2008, 'Thriller', 'Kasper Barfoed, Peter Bækkel, Manuel Alberto Claro', 'Stefan Jaworski', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Ulf Pilgaard, Laura Christensen, Tuva Novotny, David Dencik, Kim Bodnia, Henning Jensen, Jesper Langberg', null, 'Jonas Bechmann, a defense attorney, is a man of the system. Until the day he himself is accused of murder. Taking matters into his own hands, he throws himself into the hunt for a group of blackmailers who threaten to expose him as the killer. But nothing is what it appears to be, and the blackmail links back to his father''s death under mysterious circumstances a year and a half earlier.', 'Jonas Bechmann, a defense attorney, is a man of the system. Until the day he himself is accused of murder. Taking matters into his own hands, he throws himself into the hunt for a group of blackmailers who threaten to expose him as the killer. But nothing is what it appears to be, and the blackmail links back to his father''s death under mysterious circumstances a year and a half earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AplfoslVOepKWbU9EgV4jWrviit.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15932'),
  ('169439888011698112', 'The Candidate', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Pamela Livia Delgado, Daniel Yafalián, Daniel Hendler', 'Alberto Rojas Apel, Daniel Hendler', 'Diego De Paula, Matías Singer, Ana Katz, José Luis Arias, César Troncoso, Roberto Suárez, Alan Sabbagh, Fernando Amaral', null, 'A team of advisers is brought in to manufacture the image of Marchand, producing social media profiles, commercials and a new public persona. Conflict arises when it is revealed that not everyone is who they present themselves to be. At his country estate, a rich businessman who wants to be president is groomed by a campaign team to create an image palatable to middle-class voters.', 'A team of advisers is brought in to manufacture the image of Marchand, producing social media profiles, commercials and a new public persona. Conflict arises when it is revealed that not everyone is who they present themselves to be. At his country estate, a rich businessman who wants to be president is groomed by a campaign team to create an image palatable to middle-class voters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0WbB0pYKU8xieuCZjiCs3Uux3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428401'),
  ('241066706455267824', 'The Candy Snatchers', 1973, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Guerdon Trueblood, Robert Maxwell', 'Bryan Gindoff, Guerdon Trueblood', 'Tiffany Bolling, Ben Piazza, Susan Sennett, Brad David, Vince Martorano, Bonnie Boland, Leon Charles, Dolores Dorn', 'R', 'A nonverbal autistic boy stumbles upon a teenage heiress who has been kidnapped by a trio of young psychopaths, who are intent on extorting diamonds from her stepfather.', 'A nonverbal autistic boy stumbles upon a teenage heiress who has been kidnapped by a trio of young psychopaths, who are intent on extorting diamonds from her stepfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGTe3W3kPoVMv1Sf5Kt9zX0h4EQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39889'),
  ('700596277017032508', 'The Candy Tangerine Man', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Matt Cimber', 'Mikel Angel', 'John Daniels, Richard Kennedy, Meri McDonald, Marilyn Joi, Tallie Cochrane, George Buck Flower, Patrick Wright, Mikel Angel', 'R', 'Sunset Boulevard is a lucrative place to work for the Black Baron, a pimp with a distinctive red and yellow Rolls Royce and plenty of girls on his books. He don''t take no mess from his girls, his madam or his competitors and viciously defends his patch. First, he clobbers the Mob who attempt to move in on his patch. Second, he tracks down one of his girls who runs off with a suitcase full of his cash. Third, he disposes of two policemen. But by now he knows his pimping days are numbered, so after a final explosive gun battle he switches to being his alter ego, mild-mannered businessman Ron who lives out in the leafy suburbs with an unsuspecting wife and family.', 'Sunset Boulevard is a lucrative place to work for the Black Baron, a pimp with a distinctive red and yellow Rolls Royce and plenty of girls on his books. He don''t take no mess from his girls, his madam or his competitors and viciously defends his patch. First, he clobbers the Mob who attempt to move in on his patch. Second, he tracks down one of his girls who runs off with a suitcase full of his cash. Third, he disposes of two policemen. But by now he knows his pimping days are numbered, so after a final explosive gun battle he switches to being his alter ego, mild-mannered businessman Ron who lives out in the leafy suburbs with an unsuspecting wife and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7B6NNc4iMcb6kXNduShAREl4rGz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86462'),
  ('11464528041813175', 'The Cannibal Club', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Guto Parente, Lucas Barbi, Breno Baptista', 'Guto Parente', 'Ana Luiza Rios, Tavinho Teixeira, Zé Maria, Pedro Domingues, Galba Nogueira, Bruno Prata, LC Galetto, Fátima Muniz', null, 'Otavio and Gilda are a very wealthy couple of the Brazilian elite who have the habit of eating their employees. Otavio owns a private security company and is a notable member of The Cannibal Club. When Gilda accidentally discovers a secret from Borges, a powerful congressman and the Club’s leader, her and her husband’s lives are in grave danger.', 'Otavio and Gilda are a very wealthy couple of the Brazilian elite who have the habit of eating their employees. Otavio owns a private security company and is a notable member of The Cannibal Club. When Gilda accidentally discovers a secret from Borges, a powerful congressman and the Club’s leader, her and her husband’s lives are in grave danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTKlgGr2v1rgRKs1Ptd9u8aVCTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499195'),
  ('87594678873374711', 'The Cannibal Man', 1972, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Raúl Artigot, Luis Gómez Valdivieso', 'Antonio Fos, Eloy de la Iglesia', 'Vicente Parra, Emma Cohen, Eusebio Poncela, Lola Herrera, Vicky Lagos, Ismael Merlo, Fernando Sánchez Polack, Charly Bravo', 'R', 'A young man, Marco, working as a butcher, accidentally kills a taxi driver. His girlfriend Paula wants to go to the police so he has to kill her too. He then has to kill his brother, his brother’s fiancée and his father, who have become suspicious. He gets rid of the bodies by taking them to a slaughter house.', 'A young man, Marco, working as a butcher, accidentally kills a taxi driver. His girlfriend Paula wants to go to the police so he has to kill her too. He then has to kill his brother, his brother’s fiancée and his father, who have become suspicious. He gets rid of the bodies by taking them to a slaughter house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2srdcBbijsL8wzfy9HM87NaVji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29336'),
  ('850929033714037957', 'The Cannibalistic Councillor', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Almodóvar, Joaquín Manchado', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Carmen Machi, Penélope Cruz, Marta Aledo', null, 'Spin Off from "Broken Embraces"', 'Spin Off from "Broken Embraces"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hoNLNx3C5kYXA2lXNooRACoNbm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96580'),
  ('577560704132255754', 'The Cannibals', 1988, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Fernando Vendrell, Jaime Silva', 'João Paes', 'Luis Miguel Cintra, Leonor Silveira, Diogo Dória, Oliveira Lopes, Pedro T. da Silva, Joel Costa, Rogério Samora, Rogério Vieira', null, 'This odd film is a major representative of an even odder film genre: direct-to-celluloid opera. It was commissioned by the Portuguese master of style, director Manoel de Oliveira from composer João Paes. Musically, it ranges from 19th-century romanticism to popular, modernist and even "post-modernist" styles. In the initially tame story, a host-narrator tells the story of a wedding between the two lovebirds: Viscount d''Aveleda and the beautiful Marguerite. However, what happens in the bridal chamber is incredibly bizarre. The events after that are even stranger, and the wedding guests and family indulge in cannibalism, among other perversions.', 'This odd film is a major representative of an even odder film genre: direct-to-celluloid opera. It was commissioned by the Portuguese master of style, director Manoel de Oliveira from composer João Paes. Musically, it ranges from 19th-century romanticism to popular, modernist and even "post-modernist" styles. In the initially tame story, a host-narrator tells the story of a wedding between the two lovebirds: Viscount d''Aveleda and the beautiful Marguerite. However, what happens in the bridal chamber is incredibly bizarre. The events after that are even stranger, and the wedding guests and family indulge in cannibalism, among other perversions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSZ7Z5okvU198FQijlpXmF0q8TS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198450'),
  ('877788808674042286', 'The Cannonball Run', 1981, 'Action, Comedy, Family', 'Hal Needham, Michael C. Butler, Bill Coker', 'Brock Yates', 'Burt Reynolds, Roger Moore, Farrah Fawcett, Dom DeLuise, Dean Martin, Sammy Davis Jr., Jack Elam, Adrienne Barbeau', 'PG', 'A cross-country road race is based on an actual event, the Cannonball Baker Sea to Shining Sea Memorial Trophy Dash, organized by Brock Yates to protest the 55 mph speed limit then in effect in the U.S. The Cannonball was named for Erwin G. "Cannonball" Baker, who in the roaring 20''s rode his motorcycle across the country. Many of the characters are based on ruses developed by real Cannonball racers over the several years that the event was run.', 'A cross-country road race is based on an actual event, the Cannonball Baker Sea to Shining Sea Memorial Trophy Dash, organized by Brock Yates to protest the 55 mph speed limit then in effect in the U.S. The Cannonball was named for Erwin G. "Cannonball" Baker, who in the roaring 20''s rode his motorcycle across the country. Many of the characters are based on ruses developed by real Cannonball racers over the several years that the event was run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvn9SbMq9q8wJXt3KAp9kP7pmpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11286'),
  ('154296725270047460', 'The Canterville Ghost', 1944, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jules Dassin, Robert H. Planck, Douglas Shearer', 'Edwin Blum', 'Charles Laughton, Robert Young, Margaret O''Brien, William Gargan, Reginald Owen, Una O''Connor, Rags Ragland, Donald Stuart', 'NR', 'The descendent of a ghost imprisoned for cowardice hopes to free the spirit by displaying courage when under duress.', 'The descendent of a ghost imprisoned for cowardice hopes to free the spirit by displaying courage when under duress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZA7Xu3Sd2ie3GjzwqZ3eBnZmS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19463'),
  ('330150206409409041', 'The Canterville Ghost', 1970, 'Animation, Family', 'Valentina Brumberg, Zinaida Brumberg, Boris Kotov', 'Georgi Munblit', 'Vladimir Kenigson, Klara Rumyanova, Yevgeni Vesnik, Rina Zelyonaya, Aleksey Konsovskiy, Irina Kartashyova, Mariya Vinogradova, Tamara Dmitrieva', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwR7qLSLpOMCNoAiqSu9BxGqD67.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244575'),
  ('658260398987638578', 'The Canterville Ghost', 1986, 'Family, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Paul Bogart, Chris Dando', null, 'Ted Wass, Andrea Marcovicci, Alyssa Milano, John Gielgud, Lila Kaye, Harold Innocent, George Baker, Dorothea Phillips', null, 'A young American couple inherits an English castle, only to find that it is haunted by the spirit of a disgraced ancestor, doomed to stay on the estate because of his cowardice. The only way he can escape is if one of his descendants performs an heroic act, something he intends to get the husband to do.', 'A young American couple inherits an English castle, only to find that it is haunted by the spirit of a disgraced ancestor, doomed to stay on the estate because of his cowardice. The only way he can escape is if one of his descendants performs an heroic act, something he intends to get the husband to do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bX2o4hqC9PiKjIBBeRYSqcs6Dr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65465'),
  ('503032222967208268', 'The Canterville Ghost', 1996, 'TV Movie, Fantasy, Drama, Family', 'Sydney Macartney, Dennis C. Lewiston, Jerry Daly', null, 'Patrick Stewart, Neve Campbell, Joan Sims, Donald Sinden, Cherie Lunghi, Leslie Phillips, Daniel Betts, Edward Wiley', 'PG', 'When a teenaged girl moves to England, with her brothers and parents into the ancient Canterville Hall, she''s not at all happy. Especially as there''s a ghost and a mysterious re-appearing bloodstain on the hearth. She campaigns to go back home, and her dad, believing the ghost''s pranks are Ginny''s, is ready to send her back. But then Ginny actually meets the elusive 17th-century Sir Simon de Canterville (not to mention the cute teenaged duke next door), and she sets her hand to the task of freeing Sir Simon from his curse.', 'When a teenaged girl moves to England, with her brothers and parents into the ancient Canterville Hall, she''s not at all happy. Especially as there''s a ghost and a mysterious re-appearing bloodstain on the hearth. She campaigns to go back home, and her dad, believing the ghost''s pranks are Ginny''s, is ready to send her back. But then Ginny actually meets the elusive 17th-century Sir Simon de Canterville (not to mention the cute teenaged duke next door), and she sets her hand to the task of freeing Sir Simon from his curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daQl68yTtTnFIwKJoI3rrYsyvTO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48358'),
  ('703123316843621631', 'The Canterville Ghost', 2016, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Yann Samuell', 'Yann Samuell', 'Audrey Fleurot, Michaël Youn, Michèle Laroque, Lionnel Astier, Mathilde Daffe, Julien Frison', null, 'In the depths of a British legend, the ghost of Eleanor Canterville is condemned to haunt the castle of his family and to scare away any inhabitant. It fulfills this task perfectly, helped by Gwilherm, his faithful servant. But when Otis, a family fleeing Parisian life, buy the castle, Eleanor is upset because she cannot scare this tribe of the twenty-first century. Worse yet, children ridicule and parents are unaware. Only Virginia Otis, aged fifteen, moved by the fate of Canterville Ghost, will seek to deliver from curse on it.', 'In the depths of a British legend, the ghost of Eleanor Canterville is condemned to haunt the castle of his family and to scare away any inhabitant. It fulfills this task perfectly, helped by Gwilherm, his faithful servant. But when Otis, a family fleeing Parisian life, buy the castle, Eleanor is upset because she cannot scare this tribe of the twenty-first century. Worse yet, children ridicule and parents are unaware. Only Virginia Otis, aged fifteen, moved by the fate of Canterville Ghost, will seek to deliver from curse on it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8hJX328M9mTtVzCxoZuXRNyVr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359538'),
  ('905873045808437477', 'The Canterville Ghost', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Kim Burdon, Robert Chandler', 'Keiron Self, Giles New', 'Stephen Fry, Hugh Laurie, Freddie Highmore, Emily Carey, Imelda Staunton, Meera Syal, David Harewood, Miranda Hart', 'PG', 'An American family moves in to the Canterville Chase, a London mansion that has been haunted by ghost Sir Simon De Canterville for 300 years.', 'An American family moves in to the Canterville Chase, a London mansion that has been haunted by ghost Sir Simon De Canterville for 300 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFu8oHN805ZRzpQZNOjkiLzMbep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269509'),
