  ('595374033674677722', 'The Canyons', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Paul Schrader, John DeFazio', 'Bret Easton Ellis', 'Nolan Gerard Funk, Lindsay Lohan, James Deen, Amanda Brooks, Tenille Houston, Gus Van Sant, Jarod Einsohn, Danny Wylde', 'R', 'The discovery of an illicit love affair leads two young Angelenos on a violent, sexually charged tour through the dark side of human nature.', 'The discovery of an illicit love affair leads two young Angelenos on a violent, sexually charged tour through the dark side of human nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tZR5o2KJXY6UGxoCsuCmZqROwO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109729'),
  ('450860793986511883', 'The Cape Canaveral Monsters', 1960, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Phil Tucker, W. Merle Connell, William Hinshaw', 'Phil Tucker', 'Scott Peters, Linda Connell, Jason Johnson, Katherine Victor, Billy Greene, Chuck Howard, Gary Travis, Thelaine Williams', null, 'When a couple are killed in an auto accident their bodies are immediately inhabited by extraterrestrial beings. Taking refuge in an underground cave, the aliens attempt to sabotage the U.S. space program.', 'When a couple are killed in an auto accident their bodies are immediately inhabited by extraterrestrial beings. Taking refuge in an underground cave, the aliens attempt to sabotage the U.S. space program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35o68BMXVeBMIg0Vpq8bjR8dhiy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97895'),
  ('736517885386929060', 'The Cape Town Affair', 1967, 'Action, Thriller', 'David Millin, Robert D. Webb', 'Harold Medford, Samuel Fuller', 'James Brolin, Jacqueline Bisset, Claire Trevor, Bob Courtney, John Whiteley, Gordon Mulholland, Siegfried Mynhardt, James White', 'NR', 'South African secret agents attempt to save confidential microfilm before it falls into the hands of Communists. A color remake of the Sam Fuller film, Pickup on South Street.', 'South African secret agents attempt to save confidential microfilm before it falls into the hands of Communists. A color remake of the Sam Fuller film, Pickup on South Street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guAa6dgLtcnaadLlxlAQLqgQgPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43214'),
  ('87765251381402649', 'The Capsule', 2012, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Athina Rachel Tsangari, Thimios Bakatakis', 'Athina Rachel Tsangari, Aleksandra Waliszewska', 'Ariane Labed, Clémence Poésy, Isolda Dychauk-Ott, Evangelia Randou, Aurora Marion, Deniz Gamze Ergüven, Sofia Dona, Ying Gao', null, 'Seven girls, a mansion perched on a Cycladic rock, a cycle of lessons on discipline, desire and demise-infinitely.', 'Seven girls, a mansion perched on a Cycladic rock, a cycle of lessons on discipline, desire and demise-infinitely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6iscG46EmzKP6ui8AMRDwQlp1L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137002'),
  ('521974571560708131', 'The Captain', 2018, 'War, Drama, History', 'Robert Schwentke, Florian Ballhaus, Julien Weizenhöfer', 'Robert Schwentke', 'Max Hubacher, Milan Peschel, Frederick Lau, Alexander Fehling, Britta Hammelstein, Waldemar Kobus, Sebastian Rudolph, Marko Dyrlich', 'R', 'Germany, 1945. Soldier Willi Herold, a deserter of the German army, stumbles into a uniform of Nazi captain abandoned during the last and desperate weeks of the Third Reich. Newly emboldened by the allure of a suit that he has stolen only to stay warm, Willi discovers that many Germans will follow the leader, whoever he is.', 'Germany, 1945. Soldier Willi Herold, a deserter of the German army, stumbles into a uniform of Nazi captain abandoned during the last and desperate weeks of the Third Reich. Newly emboldened by the allure of a suit that he has stolen only to stay warm, Willi discovers that many Germans will follow the leader, whoever he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdUSP7svZ3DOgCnB0upT1yiueUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475094'),
  ('768313215304172366', 'The Captain', 2019, 'Adventure', 'Edmond Fung Yuen-Man, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Wong Fei-Fei', 'Yu Yonggan', 'Zhang Hanyu, Ou Hao, Du Jiang, Yuan Quan, Zhang Tian''ai, Li Qin, Zhang Yamei, Yang Qiru', null, 'Based on the true story of a pilot who had to ensure the safety of 128 passengers and crew members on the plane when its windshield became damaged mid-flight. The incident is regarded as one of the miracles in aviation history.', 'Based on the true story of a pilot who had to ensure the safety of 128 passengers and crew members on the plane when its windshield became damaged mid-flight. The incident is regarded as one of the miracles in aviation history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jG82eg6xnG95XuR6Tqn6GjXytQI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589712'),
  ('394701153906757345', 'The Captain from Kopenick', 1956, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Helmut Käutner, Albert Benitz', 'Helmut Käutner, Carl Zuckmayer', 'Heinz Rühmann, Martin Held, Hannelore Schroth, Willy A. Kleinau, Leonard Steckel, Friedrich Domin, Erich Schellow, Walter Giller', null, 'A young shoemaker is arrested for stealing a small amount of money, and is jailed for fifteen years. Upon his release, he wants to get a permit to get a job and start anew, but finds that without a job he can''t get a permit, and without a permit he can''t get a job. Ensnared in the absurd net of Prussian bureaucracy, he can''t see any way out. That is, until he enters a thrift shop and spots a Prussian officer''s uniform that fits him like a second skin...', 'A young shoemaker is arrested for stealing a small amount of money, and is jailed for fifteen years. Upon his release, he wants to get a permit to get a job and start anew, but finds that without a job he can''t get a permit, and without a permit he can''t get a job. Ensnared in the absurd net of Prussian bureaucracy, he can''t see any way out. That is, until he enters a thrift shop and spots a Prussian officer''s uniform that fits him like a second skin...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/volBGUE8Ch7Xq22VvzYWuYA4ZJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10626'),
  ('472376577708800466', 'The Captain''s Christmas', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', 'Joseph Barbera', 'Billy Bletcher, Mel Blanc, Shirley Reed, Robert Winkler, Robert Tait, Charles Bennett, Stuart Hall, John Moss', null, 'Pirate John and his crew threaten Christmas after taking over the Captain''s role as Santa.', 'Pirate John and his crew threaten Christmas after taking over the Captain''s role as Santa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FmiuVhmRULy3Pp1soV4gfmucxY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144455'),
  ('983644561798955392', 'The Captain''s Paradise', 1953, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Anthony Kimmins, Edward Scaife, Jack Causey', 'Alec Coppel, Nicholas Phipps', 'Alec Guinness, Yvonne De Carlo, Celia Johnson, Charles Goldner, Miles Malleson, Walter Crisham, Nicholas Phipps, Bill Fraser', null, 'Mediterranean ferryboat captain Henry St James has things well organized - a loving and very English wife Maud in Gibraltar, and the loving if rather more hot-blooded Mistress, Nita in Tangiers. A perfect life. As long as neither woman decides to follow him to the other port.', 'Mediterranean ferryboat captain Henry St James has things well organized - a loving and very English wife Maud in Gibraltar, and the loving if rather more hot-blooded Mistress, Nita in Tangiers. A perfect life. As long as neither woman decides to follow him to the other port.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0mqZ0iS5QhjFNE99BgATuAJWl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43354'),
  ('294784985275050917', 'The Captains', 2011, 'Documentary, Science Fiction', 'William Shatner, Decebal Dascau', 'William Shatner', 'William Shatner, Patrick Stewart, Avery Brooks, Kate Mulgrew, Scott Bakula, Chris Pine, René Auberjonois, Jeri Ryan', null, 'The Captains is a feature-length documentary film written and directed by William Shatner. The film follows Shatner as he interviews the other actors who have portrayed starship captains in the Star Trek franchise.', 'The Captains is a feature-length documentary film written and directed by William Shatner. The film follows Shatner as he interviews the other actors who have portrayed starship captains in the Star Trek franchise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ex8S1Xypc8NHb2jvI3hZskPyVhh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70703'),
  ('26193077609888278', 'The Captivating Star of Happiness', 1975, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Vladimir Motyl, Dmitri Meskhiyev, V. Apananskiy', 'Oleg Osetinsky, Vladimir Motyl, Mark Zakharov', 'Oleg Strizhenov, Aleksey Batalov, Natalya Bondarchuk, Irina Kupchenko, Igor Kostolevskiy, Oleg Yankovskiy, Ewa Szykulska, Aleksandr Porokhovshchikov', null, 'In December 1825, distinguished members of the Russian military, most of whom were quite affluent and of noble lineage, took it upon themselves to stir revolution against the autocratic and tyrannical Czar Nikolai I in the wake of his not honoring the drafting of a constitution for the Russian people. The revolution failed miserably and the conspirators (known as the Decembrists) were weeded out by the czar himself. One by one, each of the conspirators confess and are systematically exiled to the harsh winters of Siberia, slated to work and wither in a prison/mine. The wives of the conspirators are faced with the prospect of leaving the bosom of wealth and family (including their own children) to be with their husbands in the brutal Siberian locale. If they agree to this, they face having their illustrious social stations stripped away and certain disdain from everyone around them...', 'In December 1825, distinguished members of the Russian military, most of whom were quite affluent and of noble lineage, took it upon themselves to stir revolution against the autocratic and tyrannical Czar Nikolai I in the wake of his not honoring the drafting of a constitution for the Russian people. The revolution failed miserably and the conspirators (known as the Decembrists) were weeded out by the czar himself. One by one, each of the conspirators confess and are systematically exiled to the harsh winters of Siberia, slated to work and wither in a prison/mine. The wives of the conspirators are faced with the prospect of leaving the bosom of wealth and family (including their own children) to be with their husbands in the brutal Siberian locale. If they agree to this, they face having their illustrious social stations stripped away and certain disdain from everyone around them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pro002D4VHkctx8Wvald7XZ3Ppd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73546'),
  ('550327100646012834', 'The Captive', 1985, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'René Laloux, Philippe Caza', 'René Laloux, Philippe Caza', null, null, 'Two kids travel to a city where silence is kept sacred.', 'Two kids travel to a city where silence is kept sacred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRohkDKLIK4DIXzU4BpeLHyMKcW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116350'),
  ('177529281407120254', 'The Captive', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chantal Akerman, Sabine Lancelin, Xavier Gens', 'Eric de Kuyper, Chantal Akerman', 'Sylvie Testud, Stanislas Merhar, Olivia Bonamy, Liliane Rovère, Bérénice Bejo, Aurore Clément, Anna Mouglalis, Xavier Morange', null, 'Ariane lives with Simon in his large Paris flat. Simon is obsessed with her: he wants to know everything about her, secretly follows her when she goes out, asks questions all the time, even in the most intimate moments. Ariane seems to take it all in stride, but Simon realises that she''s hiding something.', 'Ariane lives with Simon in his large Paris flat. Simon is obsessed with her: he wants to know everything about her, secretly follows her when she goes out, asks questions all the time, even in the most intimate moments. Ariane seems to take it all in stride, but Simon realises that she''s hiding something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7M7jy1tzLR5Il0jZptEYw0ECnt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47244'),
  ('828833580655293247', 'The Captive', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Atom Egoyan, Paul Sarossy, Daniel J. Murphy', 'David Fraser, Atom Egoyan', 'Ryan Reynolds, Mireille Enos, Rosario Dawson, Scott Speedman, Kevin Durand, Alexia Fast, Christine Horne, Bruce Greenwood', 'R', 'Eight years after their daughter Cassandra''s abduction tore them apart, an estranged couple discover disturbing clues that indicate that she is still alive.', 'Eight years after their daughter Cassandra''s abduction tore them apart, an estranged couple discover disturbing clues that indicate that she is still alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLoFxTZFEfAzFLk2qSoPbcz58Jb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244761'),
  ('1091943113116915704', 'The Captive', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Alejandro Amenábar, Álex Catalán, Eva Leira', 'Alejandro Amenábar', 'Julio Peña, Alessandro Borghi, Miguel Rellán, Fernando Tejero, Luis Callejo, José Manuel Poga, Roberto Álamo, Albert Salazar', null, 'In 1575, the young soldier Miguel de Cervantes is captured on the high seas by Barbary pirates and taken to Algiers as a hostage. Aware that a cruel death awaits him if his family does not pay his ransom soon, he finds refuge in his passion for storytelling.', 'In 1575, the young soldier Miguel de Cervantes is captured on the high seas by Barbary pirates and taken to Algiers as a hostage. Aware that a cruel death awaits him if his family does not pay his ransom soon, he finds refuge in his passion for storytelling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aI9XOKEXN6J3uwZ84wwBaKzqcMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1238188'),
  ('974963331826622976', 'The Captive City', 1952, 'Drama, Crime', 'Robert Wise, Lee Garmes, Ivan Volkman', 'Alvin M. Josephy', 'John Forsythe, Joan Camden, Harold J. Kennedy, Marjorie Crossland, Victor Sutherland, Ray Teal, Martin Milner, Geraldine Hall', null, 'A small-town newspaper editor defies threats to expose the mob.', 'A small-town newspaper editor defies threats to expose the mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qL0PE0B6klruRntPfuZmQywCOxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62006'),
  ('795632007402514037', 'The Captive Heart', 1946, 'Drama, War', 'Basil Dearden, Muriel Cole, John Meadows', 'Angus MacPhail, Guy Morgan', 'Michael Redgrave, Rachel Kempson, Frederick Leister, Mervyn Johns, Rachel Thomas, Jack Warner, Gladys Henson, James Harcourt', null, 'A series of stories about the lives and loves of men in a Prisoner of War camp over five years. The main story is of Hasek (Redgrave) a Czech soldier who needs to keep his identity a secret from the Nazis. To do this, he poses as a dead English Officer and corresponds with the man''s wife. Other inmates’ stories are also revealed. Location shooting in the British occupied part of Germany adds believability.', 'A series of stories about the lives and loves of men in a Prisoner of War camp over five years. The main story is of Hasek (Redgrave) a Czech soldier who needs to keep his identity a secret from the Nazis. To do this, he poses as a dead English Officer and corresponds with the man''s wife. Other inmates’ stories are also revealed. Location shooting in the British occupied part of Germany adds believability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5g9d9RYuTp7TDzsi3AKniQkVngG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82819'),
