  ('770119468956842119', 'The Car', 1977, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Elliot Silverstein, Gerald Hirschfeld, Robert Latham Brown', 'Dennis Shryack, Michael Butler, Lane Slate', 'James Brolin, Kathleen Lloyd, John Marley, R.G. Armstrong, John Rubinstein, Elizabeth Thompson, Roy Jenson, Kim Richards', 'PG', 'The Utah community of Santa Ynez is being terrorized by a mysterious black coupe that appears out of nowhere and begins running people down. After the car kills off the town sheriff, Captain Wade Parent is determined to stop the murderous driver.', 'The Utah community of Santa Ynez is being terrorized by a mysterious black coupe that appears out of nowhere and begins running people down. After the car kills off the town sheriff, Captain Wade Parent is determined to stop the murderous driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFM9yMrO4fQMiG440Lx6bazB517.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24655'),
  ('138651894325889063', 'The Car', 2003, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Luis Alberto Orjuela', 'Dago García', 'Diego Cadavid, Monica Lopera, César Badillo, Luly Bossa, Diana Hoyos, Bernardo García, Fernando Arévalo, Fernando Solórzano', null, 'When the Velezes agree to buy a used Chevrolet Bel-Air from their neighbors, who''ve recently won a brand-new car in a school raffle, they''re thrilled about the prospect of leaving Bogotá''s public transportation system behind. Little do they know that, despite its glossy red exterior, their newfound status symbol is a real lemon. Colombian director Luis Orjuela helms this hilarious look at the pitfalls of automobile ownership.', 'When the Velezes agree to buy a used Chevrolet Bel-Air from their neighbors, who''ve recently won a brand-new car in a school raffle, they''re thrilled about the prospect of leaving Bogotá''s public transportation system behind. Little do they know that, despite its glossy red exterior, their newfound status symbol is a real lemon. Colombian director Luis Orjuela helms this hilarious look at the pitfalls of automobile ownership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnnkmVG0DaYLKBJPLrHkx3xP7LN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275847'),
