  ('901690125078706375', 'The Car: Road to Revenge', 2019, 'Action, Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Stanimir Stamatov, Martin Chichov, G.J. Echternkamp', 'Michael Tabb, G.J. Echternkamp, Matt Yamashita', 'Grant Bowler, Kathleen Munroe, Martin Hancock, Micah Balfour, Burt Grinstead, Nina Bergman, Jamie Bamber, Ronny Cox', null, 'In a dilapidated cyberpunk city plagued by crime and corruption, an unscrupulous District Attorney is savagely murdered and tossed out of a building onto his brand new car. Mysteriously, the District Attorney and his car come back to life as a single being with a thirst for vengeance. The eerie driverless car embarks on a vicious rampage, exacting revenge on the criminals who murdered him...', 'In a dilapidated cyberpunk city plagued by crime and corruption, an unscrupulous District Attorney is savagely murdered and tossed out of a building onto his brand new car. Mysteriously, the District Attorney and his car come back to life as a single being with a thirst for vengeance. The eerie driverless car embarks on a vicious rampage, exacting revenge on the criminals who murdered him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czynIdEiHjpGhUWMnoax7Q3lMAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573560'),
  ('497368439250909310', 'The Carabineers', 1963, 'War, Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Jean-Paul Savignac, Charles L. Bitsch', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Jean Gruault, Roberto Rossellini', 'Marino Masé, Patrice Moullet, Geneviève Galéa, Catherine Ribeiro, Barbet Schroeder, Jean-Louis Comolli, Gérard Poirot, Jean Brassat', null, 'During a war in an imaginary country, unscrupulous soldiers recruit poor farmers with promises of an easy and happy life. Two of these farmers write to their wives of their exploits.', 'During a war in an imaginary country, unscrupulous soldiers recruit poor farmers with promises of an easy and happy life. Two of these farmers write to their wives of their exploits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBL7ragSWtX8rHswM25BkdzQzWZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52705'),
  ('644660767607784653', 'The Card', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Ronald Neame, Oswald Morris', 'Eric Ambler', 'Alec Guinness, Glynis Johns, Valerie Hobson, Petula Clark, Edward Chapman, Veronica Turleigh, George Devine, Joan Hickson', 'NR', 'A charming and ambitious young man finds many ways to raise himself through the ranks in business and social standing - some honest, some not quite so. If he can just manage to avoid a certain very predatory woman.', 'A charming and ambitious young man finds many ways to raise himself through the ranks in business and social standing - some honest, some not quite so. If he can just manage to avoid a certain very predatory woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFK9EPjJAxSCQcx9jDeF7HplEUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43369'),
  ('275166717634826112', 'The Card Counter', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Paul Schrader, Alexander Dynan, Marty Jedlicka', 'Paul Schrader', 'Oscar Isaac, Tiffany Haddish, Tye Sheridan, Willem Dafoe, Alexander Babara, Bobby C. King, Ekaterina Baker, Bryan Truong', 'R', 'William Tell just wants to play cards. His spartan existence on the casino trail is shattered when he is approached by Cirk, a vulnerable and angry young man seeking help to execute his plan for revenge on a military colonel. Tell sees a chance at redemption through his relationship with Cirk. But keeping Cirk on the straight-and-narrow proves impossible, dragging Tell back into the darkness of his past.', 'William Tell just wants to play cards. His spartan existence on the casino trail is shattered when he is approached by Cirk, a vulnerable and angry young man seeking help to execute his plan for revenge on a military colonel. Tell sees a chance at redemption through his relationship with Cirk. But keeping Cirk on the straight-and-narrow proves impossible, dragging Tell back into the darkness of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5DNLVg0gPiGSkuK4yFc4fjQ42Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643532'),
  ('1068198868707798047', 'The Card Game', 1896, 'Comedy, History', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Alphonse Winckler, Antoine Féraud, Antoine Lumière, Félicien Trewey', null, 'Three men are sitting around a table, two of them playing a game of Écarté. When the game is over, a domestic serves drinks.', 'Three men are sitting around a table, two of them playing a game of Écarté. When the game is over, a domestic serves drinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0smxZNlXJ4wzWjbDcH8nz8TQB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163064'),
  ('1103641718490523922', 'The Card Player', 2004, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime, Horror', 'Dario Argento, Benoît Debie, Francesco Perri', 'Dario Argento, Franco Ferrini', 'Stefania Rocca, Liam Cunningham, Silvio Muccino, Cosimo Fusco, Fiore Argento, Adalberto Maria Merli, Claudio Santamaria, Mia Benedetta', 'NR', 'Policewoman Anna Mari is forced to play a dangerous game with the title serial killer. If she loses, she witnesses the maniac''s tortured victims having their throats cut in explicit close-up detail via webcam. She teams up with British cop John Brennan to find out the identity of the murderer.', 'Policewoman Anna Mari is forced to play a dangerous game with the title serial killer. If she loses, she witnesses the maniac''s tortured victims having their throats cut in explicit close-up detail via webcam. She teams up with British cop John Brennan to find out the identity of the murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33rZkxArZICmef1UgSl59PKK9Vd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15483'),
  ('532400329781873410', 'The Cardboard Village', 2011, 'Drama', 'Ermanno Olmi, Fabio Olmi, Leopoldo Pescatore', 'Ermanno Olmi', 'Michael Lonsdale, Rutger Hauer, Alessandro Haber, Massimo De Francovich, Ibrahima Faye El Hadji, Irma Pino Viney, Fatima Alì, Samuels Leon Delroy', null, 'When a group of African immigrants builds a cardboard village between the pews of a church soon to be closed, an elderly priest must choose between his calling and his orders.', 'When a group of African immigrants builds a cardboard village between the pews of a church soon to be closed, an elderly priest must choose between his calling and his orders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsFuwX7Mjb02kblX21IzZ6FVeP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77956'),
