  ('220521907541914549', 'The Care Bears Adventure in Wonderland', 1987, 'Family, Animation', 'Raymond Jafelice', 'John de Klein, Susan Snooks', 'Bob Dermer, Eva Almos, Dan Hennessey, Jim Henshaw, Alyson Court, Tracey Moore, Luba Goy, Colin Fox', 'G', 'The cuddly Care Bears and their cousins star in this charming third feature-length film incorporating characters from Alice in Wonderland. A young girl named Alice and the Care Bears travel together into the whimsical land of the Mad Hatter and the Cheshire Cat. In this magical story about friendship and self-esteem, they try to thwart an evil wizard''s attempt to become the King of Wonderland.', 'The cuddly Care Bears and their cousins star in this charming third feature-length film incorporating characters from Alice in Wonderland. A young girl named Alice and the Care Bears travel together into the whimsical land of the Mad Hatter and the Cheshire Cat. In this magical story about friendship and self-esteem, they try to thwart an evil wizard''s attempt to become the King of Wonderland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRuyXsh8aMXt95Mjj2Gaj9zADwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33838'),
  ('20146701593459040', 'The Care Bears Movie', 1985, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Arna Selznick, David Altman, Barbara Sachs', 'Peter Sauder', 'Mickey Rooney, Jackie Burroughs, Georgia Engel, Sunny Besen Thrasher, Eva Almos, Patricia Black, Melleny Melody, Bob Dermer', 'G', 'The Care Bears team up with a troubled brother and sister who just moved to a new town to help a neglected young magician''s apprentice whose evil spell book causes sinister things to happen.', 'The Care Bears team up with a troubled brother and sister who just moved to a new town to help a neglected young magician''s apprentice whose evil spell book causes sinister things to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hInHHG8oiKLLXPtO87aUZ9txX4q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11243'),
  ('195555258954559579', 'The Career of a Chambermaid', 1976, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Dino Risi, Claudio Cirillo, Claudio Risi', 'Ruggero Maccari, Dino Risi, Bernardino Zapponi', 'Agostina Belli, Cochi Ponzoni, Maurizio Arena, William Berger, Lino Toffolo, Vittorio Gassman, Ugo Tognazzi, Paolo Baroni', null, 'This slight skewering of the mindset of the Fascist era when Italy’s “White Telephone” films (conservative minded sophisticated comedy-dramas revolving around the bourgeoisie) were in vogue gives Agostina Belli her best role – an ambitious Venetian girl that goes from chambermaid to prostitute to singer to film-star to mistress of ‘Il Duce’! – for which she received a special David Di Donatello award, the Italian equivalent of the Oscar.', 'This slight skewering of the mindset of the Fascist era when Italy’s “White Telephone” films (conservative minded sophisticated comedy-dramas revolving around the bourgeoisie) were in vogue gives Agostina Belli her best role – an ambitious Venetian girl that goes from chambermaid to prostitute to singer to film-star to mistress of ‘Il Duce’! – for which she received a special David Di Donatello award, the Italian equivalent of the Oscar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uXHpLbjiRchUAOkHzB1ZBrLOJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129941'),
  ('508389193653170497', 'The Career of Nikos Dyzma', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Jacek Bromski, Arkadiusz Tomiak', 'Tomasz Kępski', 'Cezary Pazura, Anna Przybylska, Andrzej Grabowski, Ewa Kasprzyk, Katarzyna Figura, Krzysztof Globisz, Krzysztof Pieczyński, Mikołaj Grabowski', null, 'Nikos is a master of funeral ceremonies (that''s undertaker to you and me) who doesn''t expect much from life. After drunkenly insulting a diplomat at a party, weird things begin to happen for Nikos. The news that a mysterious stranger offended the hated Deputy Prime Minister galvanizes the political elite assembled at the banquet, and a rumor that Nikos can take care of anything spreads like wildfire, making him an idol of the masses.', 'Nikos is a master of funeral ceremonies (that''s undertaker to you and me) who doesn''t expect much from life. After drunkenly insulting a diplomat at a party, weird things begin to happen for Nikos. The news that a mysterious stranger offended the hated Deputy Prime Minister galvanizes the political elite assembled at the banquet, and a rumor that Nikos can take care of anything spreads like wildfire, making him an idol of the masses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yJadqcF5GcL8YEchsKyJ2fUpoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38371'),
  ('983435296942761409', 'The Caretaker', 1964, 'Drama', 'Clive Donner, Nicolas Roeg', 'Harold Pinter', 'Alan Bates, Donald Pleasence, Robert Shaw, Harold Pinter', null, 'Aston, a quiet, reserved man, lives alone in a top-floor cluttered room of a small abandoned house in a poor London district. He befriends and takes in Mac Davies, an old derelict who has been fired from a menial job in a café. In time Aston offers him a job as caretaker of the house. Aston''s brother, Mick - a taunting, quasi-sadist - harasses the derelict when his brother is away, countermanding his orders...', 'Aston, a quiet, reserved man, lives alone in a top-floor cluttered room of a small abandoned house in a poor London district. He befriends and takes in Mac Davies, an old derelict who has been fired from a menial job in a café. In time Aston offers him a job as caretaker of the house. Aston''s brother, Mick - a taunting, quasi-sadist - harasses the derelict when his brother is away, countermanding his orders...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCHKMYQjZxxLQTIB2Qe0yWeMWtI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120959'),
  ('714542748377343120', 'The Caretaker', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Bruno Roberti, Julio Santi, Uli Burtin', 'Julio Santi, João Segall', 'Bruno Garcia, Malu Rodrigues, Leopoldo Pacheco, Denise Weinberg, Annalara Prates, Bianca Batista, Fabio Takeo, Pedro Bosnich', null, 'Davi Carvalho is a psychology professor who wrote a book about how we project traumas of our past as paranormal events. A student from out of the city, Renata, appears in his life, asking for help for his little sister, Julia. Someone is hurting her and her father believes it is the ghost of a caretaker that lived in the family property years ago. Renata seeking for a rational answer, invites Davi to go to there family''s house in order to find the truth behind it.', 'Davi Carvalho is a psychology professor who wrote a book about how we project traumas of our past as paranormal events. A student from out of the city, Renata, appears in his life, asking for help for his little sister, Julia. Someone is hurting her and her father believes it is the ghost of a caretaker that lived in the family property years ago. Renata seeking for a rational answer, invites Davi to go to there family''s house in order to find the truth behind it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hs2hfeBKa1npkV3cXHbGVl6QmKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379316'),
  ('1073407134534930786', 'The Caretaker', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Luke Tedder', 'Luke Tedder', 'Mackenzie Larsen, Scott Hume, Lauren Shotton, Livvy Dawson, Chris McQuire', null, 'Eddie is mute, he takes a caretaker job at the coastal Lockbridge Academy to avoid homelessness. There, he forms a bond with cleaner Marie, while uncovering dark secrets that threaten the Aberdeen family''s control of the school.', 'Eddie is mute, he takes a caretaker job at the coastal Lockbridge Academy to avoid homelessness. There, he forms a bond with cleaner Marie, while uncovering dark secrets that threaten the Aberdeen family''s control of the school.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F9JWtu9Rk3szuJ33tAAWmxC2cN07.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-caretaker-2026'),
  ('975314429515502160', 'The Caretakers', 1963, 'Drama', 'Hall Bartlett, Lucien Ballard, Sydney M. Fogel', 'Henry F. Greenberg', 'Robert Stack, Polly Bergen, Joan Crawford, Janis Paige, Diane McBain, Van Williams, Sharon Hugueny, Herbert Marshall', 'NR', 'This movie chronicles the trials of the mentally ill and their care-givers in an over-crowded ward of a hospital.', 'This movie chronicles the trials of the mentally ill and their care-givers in an over-crowded ward of a hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sSpMxxCLtAyJiOC4zJtKIsySIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85640'),
