  ('895647875788307159', 'The Carmilla Movie', 2017, 'Horror, Comedy, Romance', 'Spencer Maybee, James Poremba, Alex Shiri', 'Alejandro Alcoba, Jordan Hall', 'Elise Bauman, Natasha Negovanlis, Annie Briggs, Kaitlyn Alexander, Nicole Stamp, Grace Lynn Kung, Cara Gee, Matt O''Connor', 'R', 'It has been five years since Laura and Carmilla vanquished the apocalypse and Carmilla became a bonafide mortal human. They have settled in to a cozy apartment in downtown Toronto, Laura continues to hone her journalism skills while Carmilla adjusts to a non-vampire lifestyle. Their domestic bliss is suddenly ruptured when Carmilla begins to show signs of "re-vamping" – from a fondness for bloody treats to accidental biting – while Laura has started having bizarre, ghostly dreams. The couple must now enlist their old friends from Silas University to uncover the unknown supernatural threat and save humanity – including Carmilla''s.', 'It has been five years since Laura and Carmilla vanquished the apocalypse and Carmilla became a bonafide mortal human. They have settled in to a cozy apartment in downtown Toronto, Laura continues to hone her journalism skills while Carmilla adjusts to a non-vampire lifestyle. Their domestic bliss is suddenly ruptured when Carmilla begins to show signs of "re-vamping" – from a fondness for bloody treats to accidental biting – while Laura has started having bizarre, ghostly dreams. The couple must now enlist their old friends from Silas University to uncover the unknown supernatural threat and save humanity – including Carmilla''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jL8FaFdMLoxCaXhZfPY4tFbXwe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421131'),
  ('222398048996438978', 'The Carnal Sutra Mat', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Ho Fan', null, 'Paul Che Biu-Law, Cheung Wing-Yee, Kwan Hoi-San, Yumi Mizushima, Mizue Morita', null, 'Adapted from the same infamous ancient text as the popular 1992 opus Sex and Zen, this film. Mei Yeung-sun is a man of letters who is less than thrilled with his sex life with his comely young wife Ti Yuk-xiang. Yet when Mei uncovers the family sex manual, their physical relationship improves considerably. So successful is the transformation that the two spend all of their time in the sack, much to the consternation of the girl''s father. Later, Mei leaves home supposedly to become an official in the big city. In fact, Mei really plans to troll around the countryside and have sex with as many women as possible. Thanks to the advice of master thief Tsoi Kwun-lung, Mei visits a noted doctor and leaves the place with a massive newly installed penis. Brimming with cocksure confidence, he soon seduces lonely housewife Yim-fong. Her thuggish husband Kuan Low-si soon gets his revenge.', 'Adapted from the same infamous ancient text as the popular 1992 opus Sex and Zen, this film. Mei Yeung-sun is a man of letters who is less than thrilled with his sex life with his comely young wife Ti Yuk-xiang. Yet when Mei uncovers the family sex manual, their physical relationship improves considerably. So successful is the transformation that the two spend all of their time in the sack, much to the consternation of the girl''s father. Later, Mei leaves home supposedly to become an official in the big city. In fact, Mei really plans to troll around the countryside and have sex with as many women as possible. Thanks to the advice of master thief Tsoi Kwun-lung, Mei visits a noted doctor and leaves the place with a massive newly installed penis. Brimming with cocksure confidence, he soon seduces lonely housewife Yim-fong. Her thuggish husband Kuan Low-si soon gets his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fGULTfD8pcbI8N8YExRKgy4PGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646749'),
  ('315092512818810309', 'The Carpenter', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David Wellington, David Franco', 'Doug Taylor', 'Wings Hauser, Lynne Adams, Pierre Lenoir, Barbara Jones, Louise-Marie Mennier, Johnny Cuthbert, Robert Austern, Anthony Ulc', null, 'A carpenter, who was executed in the electric chair, comes back to finish his dream house, now inhabited by a young married couple.', 'A carpenter, who was executed in the electric chair, comes back to finish his dream house, now inhabited by a young married couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxaTaffV6E6JE6kFmC9b9zhyI5x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82020'),
  ('1118589431603250323', 'The Carpenter''s Son', 2025, 'Horror', 'Lotfy Nathan, Simon Beaufils, Yannis Chatzistavris', 'Lotfy Nathan', 'Nicolas Cage, Noah Jupe, FKA twigs, Isla Johnston, Souheila Yacoub, Kaiti Manolidaki, Penelope Markopoulou, Orestis Paliadelis', 'R', 'A remote village in Roman-era Egypt explodes into spiritual warfare when a carpenter, his wife and their child are targeted by supernatural forces.', 'A remote village in Roman-era Egypt explodes into spiritual warfare when a carpenter, his wife and their child are targeted by supernatural forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXEtdZjoaHqjDjSxZJWwDVjIfx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1286185'),
  ('928811313617222', 'The Carpetbaggers', 1964, 'Drama', 'Edward Dmytryk, Joseph MacDonald, Michael D. Moore', 'John Michael Hayes', 'George Peppard, Alan Ladd, Carroll Baker, Robert Cummings, Martha Hyer, Elizabeth Ashley, Lew Ayres, Martin Balsam', null, 'Jonas Cord is a disagreeable young tycoon who''s building planes, directing films, and catting around on the corporate make in 1930s Hollywood.', 'Jonas Cord is a disagreeable young tycoon who''s building planes, directing films, and catting around on the corporate make in 1930s Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjDleWaF5dUMV2FiBlMnH5QvXjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42792'),
  ('194916520683880197', 'The Carrier', 1988, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Nathan J. White, Peter Deming', 'Nathan J. White', 'Gregory Fortescue, Stevie Lee, Steve Dixon, Paul Silverman, Paul Urbanski, DeLaney Provencher, Matt Shear, Ron Asheton', 'R', 'An orphaned teen is attacked by a mysterious beast and struck with an infectious disease that turns everything he touches into a death trap.', 'An orphaned teen is attacked by a mysterious beast and struck with an infectious disease that turns everything he touches into a death trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ex7j6okHHR1VP9bACdkRzBbctnO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83913'),
  ('1015445548793239554', 'The Carriers Are Waiting', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Benoît Mariage, Philippe Guilbert', 'Emmanuelle Bada, Jean-Luc Seigle, Benoît Mariage', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Morgane Simon, Bouli Lanners, Dominique Baeyens, Philippe Grand''Henry, Jean-François Devigne, Lisa Lacroix, Philippe Nahon', null, 'Roger Closset is a man who obviously loves his family, though that doesn''t always make them feel better. Dad is an obsessive type with a short fuse and a long list of curious ideas, and his wife and children must often bear the brunt of his eccentricities. Roger works as a reporter, a job he doesn''t like which doesn''t pay especially well, either. One day, Roger learns an area business association is sponsoring a contest for a family that can break a world record, with the grand prize being a new car. Suddenly, Roger gets a brainstorm -- if his son can open and shut a door 40,000 times in 24 hours, the car will be theirs. 15-year-old Michel, however, is not at all happy to have been drafted into this new responsibility, especially when dad builds a practice door in the backyard and finds a trainer to teach Michel how to open and close it with greatest efficiency.', 'Roger Closset is a man who obviously loves his family, though that doesn''t always make them feel better. Dad is an obsessive type with a short fuse and a long list of curious ideas, and his wife and children must often bear the brunt of his eccentricities. Roger works as a reporter, a job he doesn''t like which doesn''t pay especially well, either. One day, Roger learns an area business association is sponsoring a contest for a family that can break a world record, with the grand prize being a new car. Suddenly, Roger gets a brainstorm -- if his son can open and shut a door 40,000 times in 24 hours, the car will be theirs. 15-year-old Michel, however, is not at all happy to have been drafted into this new responsibility, especially when dad builds a practice door in the backyard and finds a trainer to teach Michel how to open and close it with greatest efficiency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IjpBJXORA8ekNudBjs5j4qpgyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31336'),
  ('198454095587884433', 'The Cars That Ate Paris', 1974, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Peter Weir, John R. McLean', 'Peter Weir', 'John Meillon, Terry Camilleri, Kevin Miles, Max Gillies, Rick Scully, Danny Adcock, Bruce Spence, Kevin Golsby', 'PG', 'After surviving a car accident, a young man finds himself trapped in the isolated town of Paris, where the local economy depends on deliberately causing crashes and salvaging the wreckage. As he becomes entangled in the town’s routines, tensions between its residents and a rebellious group of youths begin to surface.', 'After surviving a car accident, a young man finds himself trapped in the isolated town of Paris, where the local economy depends on deliberately causing crashes and salvaging the wreckage. As he becomes entangled in the town’s routines, tensions between its residents and a rebellious group of youths begin to surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocYL30byfNiimXpzFUBVBtE6RN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62761'),
  ('727295905899142594', 'The Cart Boy', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Mike Clattenburg', 'Mike Clattenburg, John Paul Tremblay, Robb Wells', 'Mike Smith, John Paul Tremblay, Robb Wells', null, 'Two mall security guards confront the mysterious "Cart Boy" who has been stealing shopping carts from the mall''s parking lot.', 'Two mall security guards confront the mysterious "Cart Boy" who has been stealing shopping carts from the mall''s parking lot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kB5Hw36lJ6NqcgKRcdgzXu36NNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354444'),
  ('379066184203839696', 'The Carter Effect', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Tomasz Kurek, Sean Menard', null, 'Vince Carter, Drake, David Stern, Tracy McGrady, Steve Nash, Charles Oakley, Jerry Stackhouse, Muggsy Bogues', null, 'In his latest documentary, Sean Menard gives viewers an unprecedented look at Vince Carter: the six-foot-six, eight-time NBA All-Star from Daytona Beach who made waves in the Canadian basketball scene when he joined the Toronto Raptors in 1998.', 'In his latest documentary, Sean Menard gives viewers an unprecedented look at Vince Carter: the six-foot-six, eight-time NBA All-Star from Daytona Beach who made waves in the Canadian basketball scene when he joined the Toronto Raptors in 1998.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fP9EOjbAByoe7BGpynLEcZKhw1L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475013'),
  ('897348770751692521', 'The Casagrandes Movie', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Miguel Puga', 'Rebecca May, Rosemary Contreras, Lalo Alcaraz', 'Izabella Alvarez, Sumalee Montano, Paulina Chávez, Angélica Aragón, Sonia Manzano, Kate del Castillo, Alex Cazares, Carlos PenaVega', 'PG', 'On a birthday trip to Mexico, 12-year-old Ronnie Anne accidentally frees a demigod trapped in a mountain and needs her family''s help to set things right.', 'On a birthday trip to Mexico, 12-year-old Ronnie Anne accidentally frees a demigod trapped in a mountain and needs her family''s help to set things right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZHetsKD44xB63ZjTjqryC0CtoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1216512'),
  ('700555178101562559', 'The Case Against Brooklyn', 1958, 'Crime, Drama', 'Paul Wendkos, Fred Jackman Jr., Leonard Katzman', 'Bernard Gordon', 'Darren McGavin, Margaret Hayes, Warren Stevens, Peggy McCay, Tol Avery, Emile Meyer, Nestor Paiva, Brian G. Hutton', 'NR', 'A rookie cop takes on criminals who have the local government in their pocket.', 'A rookie cop takes on criminals who have the local government in their pocket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKF0FaMRitLIgxMRRj42zju2ctu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44873'),
  ('128832155031908614', 'The Case for Christ', 2017, 'Drama', 'Jon Gunn', 'Brian Bird', 'Mike Vogel, Erika Christensen, Faye Dunaway, Robert Forster, Frankie Faison, L. Scott Caldwell, Mike Pniewski, Tom Nowicki', 'PG', 'Based on the true story of an award-winning investigative journalist -- and avowed atheist -- who applies his well-honed journalistic and legal skills to disprove the newfound Christian faith of his wife... with unexpected, life-altering results.', 'Based on the true story of an award-winning investigative journalist -- and avowed atheist -- who applies his well-honed journalistic and legal skills to disprove the newfound Christian faith of his wife... with unexpected, life-altering results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTKwkxMv5MCkN8vMXiEmMmAHafh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424998'),
  ('591272570587494018', 'The Case Is Closed, Forget It', 1971, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Damiano Damiani, Riccardo Sesani, Claudio Ragona', 'Massimo De Rita, Damiano Damiani, Dino Maiuri', 'Franco Nero, Georges Wilson, John Steiner, Riccardo Cucciolla, Turi Ferro, Piero Nuti, Patrizia Adiutori, Ferruccio De Ceresa', null, 'Arrested on suspicion of a hit and run, a succesful architect is put in prison awaiting trial or release. Whilst there he witnesses the grim reality of life behind bars: corrupt staff, corrupt inmates, an inhuman judicial system and the power of the Mafia.', 'Arrested on suspicion of a hit and run, a succesful architect is put in prison awaiting trial or release. Whilst there he witnesses the grim reality of life behind bars: corrupt staff, corrupt inmates, an inhuman judicial system and the power of the Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLnWmIb91drnjtyuAKjOM3Hr2nK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64465'),
  ('111533934549368722', 'The Case of Dr. Laurent', 1957, 'Drama', 'Henri Alekan, Jean-Paul Le Chanois', 'René Barjavel, Jean-Paul Le Chanois', 'Jean Gabin, Nicole Courcel, Silvia Monfort, Henri Arius, Antoine Balpêtré, Georges Lannes, Michel Barbey, Marcel Daxely', null, 'A Paris-based doctor tries to spread the gospel of Natural Childbirth. Working in a cloistered rural community, Gabin runs up against the stone walls of fear and prejudice. His theories are proven sound when unwed mother Nicole Courcel gives birth within Gabin''s methodology. The childbirth sequence is filmed straight-on with a delicate combination of taste and frankness. Nonetheless, the lurid ad campaign of Cas Du Dr. Laurent sensationalized this sequence all out of proportion.', 'A Paris-based doctor tries to spread the gospel of Natural Childbirth. Working in a cloistered rural community, Gabin runs up against the stone walls of fear and prejudice. His theories are proven sound when unwed mother Nicole Courcel gives birth within Gabin''s methodology. The childbirth sequence is filmed straight-on with a delicate combination of taste and frankness. Nonetheless, the lurid ad campaign of Cas Du Dr. Laurent sensationalized this sequence all out of proportion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75XMdGax4u8AEvKiKzTrVtfxUKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78183'),
  ('944804876702317383', 'The Case of Hana & Alice', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery', 'Shunji Iwai, Yoko Kuno, Chigi Kanbe', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Yu Aoi, Anne Suzuki, Ryo Katsuji, Haru Kuroki, Tae Kimura, Sei Hiraizumi, Shoko Aida, Ranran Suzuki', null, 'After transferring to Ishinomori Middle School, Tetsuko "Alice" Arisugawa overhears her classmates discussing a strange rumor. The previous occupant of her seat, a nondescript "Judas," is missing and presumed murdered. Amidst dealing with her mother''s undesired meddling in her affairs and warding off her classmates'' bullying, the troubled Alice starts to investigate the mystery surrounding Judas'' disappearance. The trail of clues leads her to the house of her next-door neighbor, the quirky and reclusive Hana Arai.', 'After transferring to Ishinomori Middle School, Tetsuko "Alice" Arisugawa overhears her classmates discussing a strange rumor. The previous occupant of her seat, a nondescript "Judas," is missing and presumed murdered. Amidst dealing with her mother''s undesired meddling in her affairs and warding off her classmates'' bullying, the troubled Alice starts to investigate the mystery surrounding Judas'' disappearance. The trail of clues leads her to the house of her next-door neighbor, the quirky and reclusive Hana Arai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9zJ3Dx90DmOTeEMx5K6BQN9J0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311054'),
  ('85237616782218806', 'The Case of Itaewon Homicide', 2009, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Hong Ki-seon, Oh Cheng-ok, Kang Seong-hoon', 'Maeng-yu Lee', 'Jung Jin-young, Jang Keun-suk, Shin Seung-hwan, Oh Kwang-rok, Ko Chang-seok, Kim Joong-ki, Song Young-chang, Song Joong-ki', null, 'On the night of April 8, 1997, an innocent college student was brutally murdered in a burger shop washroom for no apparent reason. 2 Korean-American teenagers are brought for questioning and are charged with murder and possession of lethal weapon and withholding evidence. Neither is remorseful for their heinous crimes and blames each other for the killing.', 'On the night of April 8, 1997, an innocent college student was brutally murdered in a burger shop washroom for no apparent reason. 2 Korean-American teenagers are brought for questioning and are charged with murder and possession of lethal weapon and withholding evidence. Neither is remorseful for their heinous crimes and blames each other for the killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hv4vltgQzIHO9btWn1bwi4ZU19D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54457'),
  ('307372185310067613', 'The Case of Marcel Duchamp', 1984, 'Documentary, Drama', 'David Rowan, Deborah Kingsland, Walter Lassally', 'David Rowan', 'Guy Rolfe, Raymond Francis, Juliet Hammond-Hill, Jeff Rawle, Bernard Kay, Jonathan Newth, Charles Lewsen, Bruce Lidington', null, 'A witty, feature-length drama-documentary in which Marcel Duchamp, who once compared his own mind to that of a master criminal, is investigated by Sherlock Holmes. Holmes comes out of retirement, and with the assistance of Dr. Watson, proceeds to delve into the mystery of Duchamp’s major work, the once-notorious Large Glass (The Bride Stripped Bare by the Bachelors, even) 1915-23.', 'A witty, feature-length drama-documentary in which Marcel Duchamp, who once compared his own mind to that of a master criminal, is investigated by Sherlock Holmes. Holmes comes out of retirement, and with the assistance of Dr. Watson, proceeds to delve into the mystery of Duchamp’s major work, the once-notorious Large Glass (The Bride Stripped Bare by the Bachelors, even) 1915-23.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kgh2tUNyhM7dcrA1kM5iDZARdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960296'),
  ('630082173592575214', 'The Case of the Bloody Iris', 1972, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Giuliano Carnimeo, Stelvio Massi, Michele Massimo Tarantini', 'Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Edwige Fenech, George Hilton, Paola Quattrini, Giampiero Albertini, Franco Agostini, Oreste Lionello, Carla Brait, George Rigaud', null, 'A high-rise apartment populated by models, nightclub dancers and call girls becomes the focus of a mysterious serial killer. When a young model named Jennifer and her friend Marilyn move into one of the victims'' former apartments, Jennifer becomes the next target and the pair try to identify the killer.', 'A high-rise apartment populated by models, nightclub dancers and call girls becomes the focus of a mysterious serial killer. When a young model named Jennifer and her friend Marilyn move into one of the victims'' former apartments, Jennifer becomes the next target and the pair try to identify the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afpZ3Eckzo0NyU2SyKbIouoQ3jm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29167'),
  ('953815504557257744', 'The Case of the Curious Bride', 1935, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Michael Curtiz, David Abel, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Tom Reed', 'Warren William, Margaret Lindsay, Donald Woods, Claire Dodd, Allen Jenkins, Phillip Reed, Barton MacLane, Wini Shaw', 'NR', 'After giving the District Attorney another stinging defeat, Perry plans to take a vacation in China. That is, he was, until Rhoda, his old flame, meets him at a restaurant. It seems that her husband Moxley, who had been allegedly dead for four years, is alive and demanding money as she has married into wealth. The case escalates when the police find the body of Moxley and charge her with the murder.', 'After giving the District Attorney another stinging defeat, Perry plans to take a vacation in China. That is, he was, until Rhoda, his old flame, meets him at a restaurant. It seems that her husband Moxley, who had been allegedly dead for four years, is alive and demanding money as she has married into wealth. The case escalates when the police find the body of Moxley and charge her with the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5ObflTlxn2JthUW3su3YaiGohr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75770'),
  ('135493566557757145', 'The Case of the Frightened Lady', 1940, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'George King, Hone Glendinning, Hal Mason', 'Edward Dryhurst, Robert Stevenson', 'Marius Goring, Helen Haye, Penelope Dudley-Ward, Felix Aylmer, George Merritt, Ronald Shiner, Patrick Barr, Roy Emerton', null, 'A classic British thriller set in a sinister old house, based on a story by Edgar Wallace.', 'A classic British thriller set in a sinister old house, based on a story by Edgar Wallace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niplS3nlvbpLs7PBRM6T49hBhaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30179'),
  ('487354280013410926', 'The Case of the Grinning Cat', 2006, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Chris Marker', 'Chris Marker', 'Bertrand Cantat, Dieudonné, Léon Schwartzenberg, Marina Vlady, Patrick Poivre d''Arvor, Frédéric Taddeï, Jacques Chirac, Jean-Marie Le Pen', null, 'Chris Marker’s The Case of the Grinning Cat (Chats perchés) follows the appearance of the yellow M. Chat graffiti across Paris in the early 2000s, using it as a lens to reflect on art, protest, and politics in the post-9/11 era. Blending street imagery with footage of global and local unrest, the film serves as a playful yet pointed companion to Marker’s earlier A Grin Without a Cat.', 'Chris Marker’s The Case of the Grinning Cat (Chats perchés) follows the appearance of the yellow M. Chat graffiti across Paris in the early 2000s, using it as a lens to reflect on art, protest, and politics in the post-9/11 era. Blending street imagery with footage of global and local unrest, the film serves as a playful yet pointed companion to Marker’s earlier A Grin Without a Cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUuTJI5SJhsWsrOJGEVdoIdLJVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126141'),
  ('882869576659019281', 'The Case of the Hillside Stranglers', 1989, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Steve Gethers, Ronald M. Lautore', null, 'Richard Crenna, Dennis Farina, Billy Zane, Tony Plana, James Tolkan, Karen Austin, Matthew Faison, Robert Harper', 'NR', 'The chilling true story of the "two of a kind" killing cousins, Angelo Buono and Kenneth Bianchi, better known as the Hillside Stranglers.', 'The chilling true story of the "two of a kind" killing cousins, Angelo Buono and Kenneth Bianchi, better known as the Hillside Stranglers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqmlAhEdqyQSTKvKpKijMidbxyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238760'),
  ('118421087597620406', 'The Case of the Howling Dog', 1934, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Alan Crosland, William Rees', 'Ben Markson', 'Warren William, Mary Astor, Allen Jenkins, Grant Mitchell, Helen Trenholme, Helen Lowell, Dorothy Tree, Gordon Westcott', null, 'A very nervous man named Cartwright comes into Perry''s office to have the neighbor arrested for his howling dog. He states that the howling is a sign that there is a death in the neighborhood. He also wants a will written giving his estate to the lady living at the neighbors house. It is all very mysterious and by the next day, his will is changed and Cartwright is missing, as is the lady of the house next door. Perry has a will and a retainer and must find out whether he has a client or a beneficiary.', 'A very nervous man named Cartwright comes into Perry''s office to have the neighbor arrested for his howling dog. He states that the howling is a sign that there is a death in the neighborhood. He also wants a will written giving his estate to the lady living at the neighbors house. It is all very mysterious and by the next day, his will is changed and Cartwright is missing, as is the lady of the house next door. Perry has a will and a retainer and must find out whether he has a client or a beneficiary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LWjIvP8vzcZ1PMBUbSer22sz8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144475'),
  ('283598098217655633', 'The Case of the Lucky Legs', 1935, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Archie Mayo, Leo F. Forbstein, Tony Gaudio', 'Brown Holmes', 'Warren William, Genevieve Tobin, Patricia Ellis, Lyle Talbot, Allen Jenkins, Barton MacLane, Peggy Shannon, Porter Hall', 'NR', 'A con man who stages phony "lucky legs" beauty contests and leaves town with the money is found with a surgical knife in his heart by Mason.', 'A con man who stages phony "lucky legs" beauty contests and leaves town with the money is found with a surgical knife in his heart by Mason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHFKPKYBnsbAxAiKxYdSuptq21I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148617'),
  ('547849585320442236', 'The Case of the Scorpion''s Tail', 1971, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Sergio Martino, Nico D''Alessandria, Mariano Canales', 'Ernesto Gastaldi, Eduardo Manzanos, Sauro Scavolini', 'George Hilton, Anita Strindberg, Alberto de Mendoza, Ida Galli, Janine Reynaud, Luigi Pistilli, Tom Felleghy, Luis Barboo', null, 'After her husband dies in a freak plane accident, a woman leaves London for Athens to collect his generous life insurance policy. She soon discovers that others besides herself are keen to get their hands on the money - and are willing to kill for it. Meanwhile, a private investigator arrives to investigate irregularities in the claim, teaming up with a beautiful reporter.', 'After her husband dies in a freak plane accident, a woman leaves London for Athens to collect his generous life insurance policy. She soon discovers that others besides herself are keen to get their hands on the money - and are willing to kill for it. Meanwhile, a private investigator arrives to investigate irregularities in the claim, teaming up with a beautiful reporter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4UM3TqaWjyi3JVNHKOnx5pPRUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16825'),
  ('1086530541942011635', 'The Case of the Stuttering Pig', 1937, 'Animation, Horror, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher, Sara Berner', null, 'Porky Pig and his family inherit Uncle Solomon''s estate, but if they die everything goes to the lawyer, who turns himself into a Mr. Hyde-style monster in an effort to kill off the pigs.', 'Porky Pig and his family inherit Uncle Solomon''s estate, but if they die everything goes to the lawyer, who turns himself into a Mr. Hyde-style monster in an effort to kill off the pigs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okamzPF9bhn3dQh4DitS86LBqKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175180'),
  ('457223798664311234', 'The Case of the Whitechapel Vampire', 2002, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime, TV Movie', 'Rodney Gibbons, Serge Ladouceur', 'Rodney Gibbons', 'Matt Frewer, Kenneth Welsh, Norris Domingue, Isabel Dos Santos, Neville Edwards, Maria Bertrand', null, 'The scene of the crime is Whitechapel, the same London district notorious for the recent attacks of Jack the Ripper. Three monks are found dead, the apparent victims of a vampire - now, someone else is out for blood. Or is it something else? As bizarre events unfold, the answer is left to Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson to find.', 'The scene of the crime is Whitechapel, the same London district notorious for the recent attacks of Jack the Ripper. Three monks are found dead, the apparent victims of a vampire - now, someone else is out for blood. Or is it something else? As bizarre events unfold, the answer is left to Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson to find.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueQqFcj093gptJfaFWaK91DUMO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81382'),
  ('178720625265801791', 'The Case of Unfaithful Klara', 2009, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Maurizio Calvesi, Roberto Faenza', 'Valentina Leotta, Hugh Fleetwood', 'Claudio Santamaria, Iain Glen, Laura Chiatti, Kierston Wareing, Paulina Němcová, Anna Geislerová, Miroslav Šimůnek, Yemi A.D.', null, 'In Prague, a musician is consumed by jealousy for his beautiful girlfriend. He hires a private eye to spy on her, but the plan backfires...', 'In Prague, a musician is consumed by jealousy for his beautiful girlfriend. He hires a private eye to spy on her, but the plan backfires...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Z9X91VXO0iyAq2pi8ayG26AFMd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42419'),
  ('215612978674197521', 'The Casino Murder Case', 1935, 'Action, Mystery, Comedy, Crime', 'Edwin L. Marin, Joseph C. Wright, Edwin B. Willis', 'Edgar Allan Woolf, Florence Ryerson', 'Paul Lukas, Alison Skipworth, Donald Cook, Rosalind Russell, Arthur Byron, Ted Healy, Eric Blore, Isabel Jewell', null, 'After socialite Lynn Llewellyn receives an anonymous threat, he is poisoned at his uncle''s casino, and although he recovers, his wife is murdered by the same killer.', 'After socialite Lynn Llewellyn receives an anonymous threat, he is poisoned at his uncle''s casino, and although he recovers, his wife is murdered by the same killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psMxJHNMj2xP6msln8l9QGaTy4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87881'),
  ('920356963008061471', 'The Cassandra Crossing', 1976, 'Action, Thriller', 'George P. Cosmatos, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Tom Mankiewicz, George P. Cosmatos, Robert Katz', 'Sophia Loren, Richard Harris, Martin Sheen, O. J. Simpson, Ava Gardner, Burt Lancaster, Lionel Stander, Ann Turkel', 'R', 'Passengers on a European train have been exposed to a deadly disease, and nobody will let them off the train.', 'Passengers on a European train have been exposed to a deadly disease, and nobody will let them off the train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WKV7PPWp6ybjibhZF6AMfFErqp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32037'),
  ('743565863324851448', 'The Castafiore Emerald', 1992, 'Animation, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Eric Rondeaux, Martin Brossollet', 'Thierry Wermuth, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Michel Ruhl, Marie Vincent, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin, Susan Roman', null, 'The opera diva Bianca Castafiore spends a few days with Tintin and his friends at Marlinspike Hall, where a mysterious theft is perpetrated.', 'The opera diva Bianca Castafiore spends a few days with Tintin and his friends at Marlinspike Hall, where a mysterious theft is perpetrated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7LIiNv9iDiqwPzBwHC9Zt3zVA6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441336'),
  ('1050045265153030366', 'The Castaway', 1931, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Walt Disney', null, 'Mickey, apparently shipwrecked, is on a raft; he washes up on a tropical island, where a banana tree takes care of his hunger. He then discovers a piano that washed ashore, and begins playing it. The animals come around; a gorilla, after playing a 4-hands piece with his feet, destroys the piano. Mickey runs away and accidentally wakes a lion. The lion chases Mickey to a stream, where he jumps onto a rock that turns out to be right next to a crocodile.', 'Mickey, apparently shipwrecked, is on a raft; he washes up on a tropical island, where a banana tree takes care of his hunger. He then discovers a piano that washed ashore, and begins playing it. The animals come around; a gorilla, after playing a 4-hands piece with his feet, destroys the piano. Mickey runs away and accidentally wakes a lion. The lion chases Mickey to a stream, where he jumps onto a rock that turns out to be right next to a crocodile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvEjqk1lXDUstu6v9g8c0JfaAxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162331'),
  ('232086554971702604', 'The Castaway Cowboy', 1974, 'Adventure, Family, Comedy, Western', 'Vincent McEveety, Christopher Hibler, Richard Caffey', 'Don Tait', 'James Garner, Vera Miles, Eric Shea, Robert Culp, Manu Tupou, Gregory Sierra, Shug Fisher, Kim Kahana', 'G', 'A Wayward Texas cowboy washes up on the beaches of Hawaii and is taken home by an fatherless boy. He saves the family''s business while romancing the single mom.', 'A Wayward Texas cowboy washes up on the beaches of Hawaii and is taken home by an fatherless boy. He saves the family''s business while romancing the single mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/881Frzo4noOfezARUO9f3eo8GjG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80351'),
  ('491468604857214649', 'The Castaways of Turtle Island', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Rozier, Colin Mounier', 'Jacques Rozier', 'Pierre Richard, Maurice Risch, Jacques Villeret, Caroline Cartier, Dominique Constanza, Lise Guicheron, Tania Lopert, Bernadette Palas', null, 'Jean-Arthur has been working as a clerk in a travel agency. One day, he, along with his colleague comes to a brilliant idea: what if I offer tourists real extreme recreation? So the group of tourists land on a deserted island with no food, no shelter, nothing.', 'Jean-Arthur has been working as a clerk in a travel agency. One day, he, along with his colleague comes to a brilliant idea: what if I offer tourists real extreme recreation? So the group of tourists land on a deserted island with no food, no shelter, nothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99x0fmR78eHc4nsHp7g5YDlICYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64564'),
  ('917050496360091562', 'The Castle', 1994, 'Drama', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Vladimir Studennikov, Mikhail Grigoriev', 'Sergei Selyanov, Aleksei Balabanov', 'Nikolay Stotskiy, Svetlana Pismichenko, Anvar Libabov, Viktor Sukhorukov, Igor Shibanov, Andrey Smirnov, Vladislav Demchenko, Bolot Beyshenaliev', null, 'Closely based on Franz Kafka''s book "Das Schloß", the movie shares the same action on a land surveyor who is called to a village to do a job that no one seems to have ordered. Once there, he takes up the struggle against bureaucracy emanating from the castle.', 'Closely based on Franz Kafka''s book "Das Schloß", the movie shares the same action on a land surveyor who is called to a village to do a job that no one seems to have ordered. Once there, he takes up the struggle against bureaucracy emanating from the castle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdhq9Iryl5qfAkuvfE1vcsSOt3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104376'),
  ('523106110404337679', 'The Castle', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Annie Maver, Rob Sitch, Miriana Marusic', 'Santo Cilauro, Tom Gleisner, Jane Kennedy', 'Michael Caton, Anne Tenney, Stephen Curry, Anthony Simcoe, Sophie Lee, Wayne Hope, Tiriel Mora, Eric Bana', 'R', 'The quirky Kerrigan family lives together in a makeshift home they built themselves – with great pride and a bizarre attention to detail – a few yards from the edge of Melbourne, Australia''s busy Tullamarine Airport. When a building inspector condemns the building and reveals that the government plans to use their land for an airport expansion, Darryl Kerrigan and his brood recruit hack attorney Dennis Denuto and prepare themselves for the fight of their lives.', 'The quirky Kerrigan family lives together in a makeshift home they built themselves – with great pride and a bizarre attention to detail – a few yards from the edge of Melbourne, Australia''s busy Tullamarine Airport. When a building inspector condemns the building and reveals that the government plans to use their land for an airport expansion, Darryl Kerrigan and his brood recruit hack attorney Dennis Denuto and prepare themselves for the fight of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QKTPz9gpIIt9Po091LfG0CASfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13852'),
  ('744207262142400913', 'The Castle', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Massimo D''Anolfi, Martina Parenti, Massimo D''Anolfi', 'Massimo D''Anolfi, Martina Parenti', null, null, 'One year at Malpensa: four seasons spent following the bureaucracy, the procedures, the controls and the movements that are everyday occurrences inside an intercontinental airport. A public space, in which Italian and international police forces collaborate, where every gesture is captured by closed-circuit cameras, each piece of luggage is studied in all its recesses in an attempt to ward off a potential and unknown threat. A place in which fear is the only thing not in transit.', 'One year at Malpensa: four seasons spent following the bureaucracy, the procedures, the controls and the movements that are everyday occurrences inside an intercontinental airport. A public space, in which Italian and international police forces collaborate, where every gesture is captured by closed-circuit cameras, each piece of luggage is studied in all its recesses in an attempt to ward off a potential and unknown threat. A place in which fear is the only thing not in transit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFwyFc5hRYJvypfi4Jf0VQtSduV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257237'),
  ('917074774359807035', 'The Castle of Cagliostro', 1979, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Shigetsugu Yoshida, Hirokata Takahashi', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Haruya Yamazaki', 'Yasuo Yamada, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Sumi Shimamoto, Taro Ishida, Kohei Miyauchi', null, 'After a successful robbery leaves famed thief Lupin the Third and his partner Jigen with nothing but a large amount of expertly crafted counterfeit bills, he decides to track down the forgers responsible—and steal any other treasures he may find in the Castle of Cagliostro, including the ''damsel in distress'' he finds imprisoned there.', 'After a successful robbery leaves famed thief Lupin the Third and his partner Jigen with nothing but a large amount of expertly crafted counterfeit bills, he decides to track down the forgers responsible—and steal any other treasures he may find in the Castle of Cagliostro, including the ''damsel in distress'' he finds imprisoned there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7xL3WYeclgtGCLrWfBrXKdBV7d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15371'),
  ('661724859663593421', 'The Castle of Fu Manchu', 1969, 'Crime, Adventure', 'Jesús Franco, Manuel Merino, Santiago Ontañón', 'Manfred Barthel, Harry Alan Towers', 'Christopher Lee, Richard Greene, Howard Marion-Crawford, Tsai Chin, Günther Stoll, Rosalba Neri, Maria Perschy, José Manuel Martín', 'PG', 'The evil mastermind Fu Manchu plots his latest scheme to basically freeze over the Earth''s oceans with his diabolical new device. Opposing him is his arch-nemesis, Interpol''s very British Nayland Smith.', 'The evil mastermind Fu Manchu plots his latest scheme to basically freeze over the Earth''s oceans with his diabolical new device. Opposing him is his arch-nemesis, Interpol''s very British Nayland Smith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRRVPZ5TyBa5T9pZrepNthAumet.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3485'),
