  ('616639357514545022', 'The Castle of Sand', 1974, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Yoshitarō Nomura, Isao Kumagai, Takashi Kawamata', 'Shinobu Hashimoto, Yoji Yamada', 'Tetsuro Tamba, Gō Katō, Kensaku Morita, Yoko Shimada, Karin Yamaguchi, Shin Saburi, Yoshi Katō, Kazuhide Haruta', null, 'Two detectives are tasked to investigate the murder of an old man, found bludgeoned to death in a Tokyo rail yard.', 'Two detectives are tasked to investigate the murder of an old man, found bludgeoned to death in a Tokyo rail yard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzliUvv0f5E97m5xyttoZrEUiSp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29268'),
