  ('710427753425550066', 'The Cat Came Back', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Bernice Hansen, Elvia Allman', null, 'Mama cat is teaching her kittens to catch mice. Meanwhile, across the basement, mama mouse is teaching her little ones how to avoid cats.', 'Mama cat is teaching her kittens to catch mice. Meanwhile, across the basement, mama mouse is teaching her little ones how to avoid cats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suM89VtP8N4zwZzUI1JhyhijunH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202004'),
