  ('977315086622940665', 'The Cat Creature', 1973, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Curtis Harrington, Robert J. Anderson, Charles Rosher Jr.', null, 'Meredith Baxter, David Hedison, Gale Sondergaard, John Carradine, Renne Jarrett, Keye Luke, Kent Smith, Stuart Whitman', null, 'When a rich man dies, some items from a collection of his are stolen- an ancient Egyptian gold amulet and the mummy that was wearing it. The police consult scholars from the local University to help with the investigation, which is taking a more serious turn as people connected with the case are killed by wounds that seem to be from a housecat.', 'When a rich man dies, some items from a collection of his are stolen- an ancient Egyptian gold amulet and the mummy that was wearing it. The police consult scholars from the local University to help with the investigation, which is taking a more serious turn as people connected with the case are killed by wounds that seem to be from a housecat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h41uI9vm6h7Dr5kD8q5wyhgGCY7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152907'),
