  ('884209331655931394', 'The Cat from Outer Space', 1978, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Norman Tokar, Bill Carroll, Gene Sultan', 'Ted Key', 'Ken Berry, Sandy Duncan, Harry Morgan, Roddy McDowall, McLean Stevenson, Jesse White, Alan Young, Hans Conried', 'G', 'A UFO is stranded on earth and impounded by the US government. Its pilot, a cat with a collar that gives it special powers, including the ability to communicate with humans, has eluded the authorities and seeks the help of a scientist in order to reclaim and repair his ship and get back home.', 'A UFO is stranded on earth and impounded by the US government. Its pilot, a cat with a collar that gives it special powers, including the ability to communicate with humans, has eluded the authorities and seeks the help of a scientist in order to reclaim and repair his ship and get back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jspJBPlYGuMlwLbSSo0hdgfbnY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19378'),
  ('669353531434148722', 'The Cat Has Nine Lives', 1968, 'Drama', 'Ula Stöckl, Dietrich Lohmann, Thomas Mauch', 'Ula Stöckl', 'Liane Hielscher, Kristine De Loup, Jürgen Arndt, Elke Kummer, Alexander Kaempfe, Antje Ellermann, Hartmut Kirste, Heidi Stroh', null, 'In the summer of 1967, journalist Katharina is visited in Munich by her French friend Anne. They take day trips and visit cafés, acquaintances, and parties. In a series of conversations between them and other women, they talk about the chances for female emancipation in a male-dominated society.', 'In the summer of 1967, journalist Katharina is visited in Munich by her French friend Anne. They take day trips and visit cafés, acquaintances, and parties. In a series of conversations between them and other women, they talk about the chances for female emancipation in a male-dominated society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/su4zmNUeycrlYsRVk9zotOdQN9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315986'),
  ('978522358116609169', 'The Cat in Heat', 1972, 'Thriller', 'Nello Rossati, Joe D''Amato', 'Nello Rossati', 'Eva Czemerys, Silvano Tranquilli, Anthony Fontane, Renato Pinciroli, Ada Pometti, Sergio Serafini, Attilio Duse, Ennio Biasciucci', null, 'A man returns home to his wife from a business trip only to find a dead body in their yard.', 'A man returns home to his wife from a business trip only to find a dead body in their yard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3N7SNr2aTUgbBm2JJyMvhv80qDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114257'),
  ('1106398296032349837', 'The Cat in the Bag', 1964, 'Drama', 'Gilles Groulx, Jean-Claude Labrecque', 'Gilles Groulx', 'Claude Godbout, Barbara Ulrich, Manon Blain, Véronique Vilbert, Jean-Paul Bernier, André Leblanc, Paul-Marie Lapointe, Jean V. Dufresne', null, 'A young journalist is unhappy with society and contemplates what he can do about it. Symbolizes the political coming of age of the people of Québec.', 'A young journalist is unhappy with society and contemplates what he can do about it. Symbolizes the political coming of age of the people of Québec.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vt3csd5RNRCa9LjU1ZEZEOQjs2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170532'),
  ('474130254416467019', 'The Cat in the Hat', 1971, 'TV Movie, Animation, Family', 'Hawley Pratt', 'Dr. Seuss', 'Allan Sherman, Daws Butler, Pamelyn Ferdin, Tony Frazier, Gloria Camacho, Thurl Ravenscroft, Gene Morford', 'G', 'In a marvelously animated version of one of the most beloved of all Dr. Seuss tales, two youngsters find themselves at home with nothing to do on a rainy afternoon. But when the magical, mischievous Cat in the Hat arrives on the scene, they''re all cat-apulted into a day of rousing, romping, outlandish antics they - and you - will never forget!', 'In a marvelously animated version of one of the most beloved of all Dr. Seuss tales, two youngsters find themselves at home with nothing to do on a rainy afternoon. But when the magical, mischievous Cat in the Hat arrives on the scene, they''re all cat-apulted into a day of rousing, romping, outlandish antics they - and you - will never forget!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDbWgGUs1loHxi0joaqjI82C7xz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43580'),
  ('769647391195300331', 'The Cat in the Hat', 2003, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Emmanuel Lubezki, Bo Welch, Jack Gill', 'David Mandel, Jeff Schaffer, Alec Berg', 'Mike Myers, Dakota Fanning, Spencer Breslin, Kelly Preston, Alec Baldwin, Amy Hill, Sean Hayes, Danielle Chuchran', 'PG', 'During a rainy day, and while their mother is out, Conrad and Sally, and their pet fish, are visited by the mischievous Cat in the Hat. Fun soon turns to mayhem, and the siblings must figure out how to rid themselves of the maniacal Cat.', 'During a rainy day, and while their mother is out, Conrad and Sally, and their pet fish, are visited by the mischievous Cat in the Hat. Fun soon turns to mayhem, and the siblings must figure out how to rid themselves of the maniacal Cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYYLz67e5xEQMsY858VSSCDsLU6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10588'),
  ('1111616830614569734', 'The Cat Kingdom', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Hellberg, Bernhard Rasmusson', 'John Hellberg, Bernhard Rasmusson', 'Stefan Larsson, Björn Andersson, Nermina Lukač, Gunvor Pontén, Jonas Sykfont', null, 'The unemployed engineer Kenneth devotes all his time to building hobby models. On his way to an imposed job interview, he crosses paths with marine biologist Sten, who offers him work as an assistant at his shipyard. Kenneth''s heavily pregnant partner Marta breathes a sigh of relief. But what starts as a simple paint job on a boat hull and some routine sorting slowly draws Kenneth into an increasingly complex and elusive investigation.', 'The unemployed engineer Kenneth devotes all his time to building hobby models. On his way to an imposed job interview, he crosses paths with marine biologist Sten, who offers him work as an assistant at his shipyard. Kenneth''s heavily pregnant partner Marta breathes a sigh of relief. But what starts as a simple paint job on a boat hull and some routine sorting slowly draws Kenneth into an increasingly complex and elusive investigation.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FzMOCfL6E1NyxURjUMCzKTEPGOAO.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-cat-kingdom'),
  ('446834471818846278', 'The Cat o'' Nine Tails', 1971, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Dario Argento, Erico Menczer, Roberto Pariante', 'Dario Argento, Bryan Edgar Wallace', 'James Franciscus, Karl Malden, Catherine Spaak, Pier Paolo Capponi, Horst Frank, Rada Rassimov, Aldo Reggiani, Carlo Alighiero', null, 'A newsman works with a blind puzzle-solver to uncover a deadly conspiracy linked to a genetic research facility.', 'A newsman works with a blind puzzle-solver to uncover a deadly conspiracy linked to a genetic research facility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVfylUKX9Lz3Idpu0J3ds7vGXoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27431'),
  ('566912309711247466', 'The Cat of the Worm''s Green Realm', 1997, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Flares of color break into streams of light, leaves, wood grain and prism-etched vegetation. A moon lifts out of this dark weave to be replaced by autumn leaves against a grainy sky, a fiery sky. A gray cat licks itself. A black cat sits quickly down on a green lawn. A "night" of showering dark, a "dawn" of pinks and yellows of plant growth in close-up. A gentle yellow "high noon" prevails into which the orange worm appears and reappears, twisting, arching, turning. A phosphorescent orange of leaves explodes midst greens and black holes appropriate to the image of the worm. The forms of many varieties of leafage mix with a veritable rain or clash of overall tones, a fire of forms, a glowing color photo-negative of worm, and the final canopies of autumn tone and sky tone permeated by sun, sun streaks and octagonal prism shapes ad infinitum.', 'Flares of color break into streams of light, leaves, wood grain and prism-etched vegetation. A moon lifts out of this dark weave to be replaced by autumn leaves against a grainy sky, a fiery sky. A gray cat licks itself. A black cat sits quickly down on a green lawn. A "night" of showering dark, a "dawn" of pinks and yellows of plant growth in close-up. A gentle yellow "high noon" prevails into which the orange worm appears and reappears, twisting, arching, turning. A phosphorescent orange of leaves explodes midst greens and black holes appropriate to the image of the worm. The forms of many varieties of leafage mix with a veritable rain or clash of overall tones, a fire of forms, a glowing color photo-negative of worm, and the final canopies of autumn tone and sky tone permeated by sun, sun streaks and octagonal prism shapes ad infinitum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caZ0f3glHYYpp2qe5vKLcwYBFBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164607'),
  ('733130301835971678', 'The Cat Piano', 2009, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Eddie White, Ari Gibson', 'Eddie White', 'Nick Cave', null, 'A city of singing cats is preyed upon by a shadowy figure intent on performing a twisted feline symphony.', 'A city of singing cats is preyed upon by a shadowy figure intent on performing a twisted feline symphony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9LDVTk02Xo5W4VoC3obySqnCIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90851'),
