  ('170052496850437689', 'The Cat Vanishes', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Carlos Sorin, Fabiana Tiscornia, Julián Apezteguia', 'Carlos Sorin', 'Beatriz Spelzini, Luis Luque, María Abadi, Norma Argentina, Damián Guitián, Hugo Sigman, Javier Niklison, Alfredo Martín', null, 'Luis has just returned home after spending time in a neuropsychiatric, and Beatrice, his wife, he fears a relapse. The disappearance of the house cat and certain behaviors Beatriz Luis begins to grow increasingly suspicious of his behavior.', 'Luis has just returned home after spending time in a neuropsychiatric, and Beatrice, his wife, he fears a relapse. The disappearance of the house cat and certain behaviors Beatriz Luis begins to grow increasingly suspicious of his behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBV7k0eO3cwuQ9kxmQ9js5qycpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69985'),
  ('31814589163584813', 'The Cat Who Walked by Herself', 1988, 'Drama, Animation', 'Ideya Garanina', 'Ideya Garanina, Mariya Solovyova, Ideya Garanina', 'Valentina Ponomaryova, Nogon Shumarov, Georgi Burkov, Nikolay Burlyaev, Inna Churikova, Anna Kamenkova, Yelena Sanayeva, Ivan Burlyaev', null, 'Two parents put their child in his crib for the night and leave the room. The child starts crying, and the Cat comes into the room to keep him company. The child grabs her tail, and the Cat angrily reminds him that they agreed a thousand years ago that he would not do that. Upon seeing that the child doesn''t remember, the Cat sighs and decides to tell him the story from the beginning. The story starts when the planet was young and life on Earth is starting with dinosaurs.', 'Two parents put their child in his crib for the night and leave the room. The child starts crying, and the Cat comes into the room to keep him company. The child grabs her tail, and the Cat angrily reminds him that they agreed a thousand years ago that he would not do that. Upon seeing that the child doesn''t remember, the Cat sighs and decides to tell him the story from the beginning. The story starts when the planet was young and life on Earth is starting with dinosaurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1i7A8bkYcshwttukrsSyD6zMpjX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279598'),
