  ('347471493564771073', 'The Cat''s Out', 1931, 'Animation, Horror, Comedy', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, null, 'NR', 'A cat, being sent out for the night, begins to make trouble for some birds. He later has a nightmare that the birds grow and begin to extract their revenge.', 'A cat, being sent out for the night, begins to make trouble for some birds. He later has a nightmare that the birds grow and begin to extract their revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOD0zNSerdP0X8Y2gIrly7xB4AB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53178'),
  ('5911516562503344', 'The Cat''s-Paw', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Sam Taylor', 'Sam Taylor', 'Harold Lloyd, Una Merkel, George Barbier, Nat Pendleton, Grace Bradley, Alan Dinehart, Grant Mitchell, John George', 'NR', 'Naive Ezekial Cobb, brought up by his missionary father in China returns to America to seek a wife. Corrupt politicians enlist him to run for mayor as a dummy candidate with no chance of winning. Their plan backfires as he wins and embarks upon a reform crusade.', 'Naive Ezekial Cobb, brought up by his missionary father in China returns to America to seek a wife. Corrupt politicians enlist him to run for mayor as a dummy candidate with no chance of winning. Their plan backfires as he wins and embarks upon a reform crusade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxrR4uZ1JpNQDS0FKYvuueYh3cn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41347'),
  ('21824610638672878', 'The Catch', 1961, 'War, Drama', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Yoshitsugu Tonegawa, Hiromi Yanagida', 'Tsutomu Tamura, Toshio Matsumoto, Toshirō Ishidō', 'Rentaro Mikuni, Akiko Koyama, Yōko Mihara, Hugh Hurd, Masako Nakamura, Teruko Kishi, Sadako Sawamura, Kyū Sazanka', null, 'Towards the end of WWII, a black American pilot is captured and imprisoned by rural Japanese villagers, who await official instructions as to how to proceed with their ''catch''.', 'Towards the end of WWII, a black American pilot is captured and imprisoned by rural Japanese villagers, who await official instructions as to how to proceed with their ''catch''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xg5hBIr9ktsGcUQyhRfePQtAuTE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90191'),
  ('903172355583329063', 'The Catcher', 1998, 'Horror', 'Yvette Hoffman, Guy Crawford, Paul DeGruccio', null, 'David Heavener, Monique Parent, Joe Estevez, Sean J. Dillingham, Leslie Garret, Paul Moncrief, James Patterson, Mike Kepple', null, 'In Taft, California, 1981, Johnny (Fred Meyers) is a unassuming baseball hopeful who turned against his stern and demanding father (Joe Estevez) and beat him to death with a baseball bat on a baseball diamond field. 17 years later, Johnny is released from the local insane asylum and begins a killing spree, with his father''s ghost as an umpire.', 'In Taft, California, 1981, Johnny (Fred Meyers) is a unassuming baseball hopeful who turned against his stern and demanding father (Joe Estevez) and beat him to death with a baseball bat on a baseball diamond field. 17 years later, Johnny is released from the local insane asylum and begins a killing spree, with his father''s ghost as an umpire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhOtnyVDtNBH7qtSoX3IANG2XhD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29925'),
  ('439524177008907608', 'The Catcher Was a Spy', 2018, 'Drama, War, Thriller, History', 'Andrew Munro, Petra Vencelidesová, Lucie Burianová', 'Robert Rodat', 'Paul Rudd, Mark Strong, Sienna Miller, Connie Nielsen, Shea Whigham, Hiroyuki Sanada, Tom Wilkinson, William Hope', 'R', 'Former major league baseball player Moe Berg lives a double life working for the Office of Strategic Services in World War II Europe.', 'Former major league baseball player Moe Berg lives a double life working for the Office of Strategic Services in World War II Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aBv9Oln0aoBrEbkMabHIVat6CY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467952'),
  ('440370228086020', 'The Catered Affair', 1956, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Brooks, John Alton, William Shanks', 'Gore Vidal', 'Bette Davis, Ernest Borgnine, Debbie Reynolds, Barry Fitzgerald, Rod Taylor, Robert F. Simon, Madge Kennedy, Dorothy Stickney', 'NR', 'An Irish cabby in the Bronx watches his wife go overboard planning their daughter''s wedding.', 'An Irish cabby in the Bronx watches his wife go overboard planning their daughter''s wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfRcP2beAtOSHUNnB9vCbezZFHJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107592'),
  ('618610217854641422', 'The Cathedral', 2002, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Tomek Bagiński', 'Tomek Bagiński', 'Jola Rzebuska, Maria Kucharska, Marcin Jaskowski, Piotr Widlarz', null, 'Story of a pilgrim who comes to the Cathedral on the border of the known world. He wants to find answers. He finds tranquility.', 'Story of a pilgrim who comes to the Cathedral on the border of the known world. He wants to find answers. He finds tranquility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDEoh70DVvUbNgKDJQUbqkcfb7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15990'),
  ('770963642015393183', 'The Catholic School', 2021, 'Drama', 'Luigi Martinucci, Valentina Vincenzini, Giulia Emiliani', 'Stefano Mordini, Luca Infascelli, Massimo Gaudioso', 'Benedetta Porcaroli, Giulio Pranno, Emanuele Maria Di Stefano, Giulio Fochetti, Leonardo Ragazzini, Alessandro Cantalini, Andrea Lintozzi, Guido Quaglione', null, 'Three well-off young men—former students at Rome’s prestigious all-boys Catholic high school San Leone Magno—brutally tortured, raped, and murdered two young women in 1975. The event, which came to be known as the Circeo massacre, shocked and captivated the country, exposing the violence and dark underbelly of the upper middle class at a moment when the traditional structures of family and religion were seen as under threat.', 'Three well-off young men—former students at Rome’s prestigious all-boys Catholic high school San Leone Magno—brutally tortured, raped, and murdered two young women in 1975. The event, which came to be known as the Circeo massacre, shocked and captivated the country, exposing the violence and dark underbelly of the upper middle class at a moment when the traditional structures of family and religion were seen as under threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WTTXAtuyQY93oe1yetWYMGbO7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747687'),
  ('903325018096163608', 'The Catman of Paris', 1946, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Lesley Selander, John Grubbs, Richard Cherwin', 'Sherman L. Lowe', 'Carl Esmond, Lenore Aubert, Adele Mara, Douglass Dumbrille, Gerald Mohr, Fritz Feld, Francis Pierlot, Georges Renavent', null, 'When author Charles Regnier returns to Paris with a best-selling book that criticizes the government, he''s tormented by frequent blackouts. After a mysterious cat-like creature slaughters people close to him, Charles is suspected of murder. Charles fears that he is the beast, but his paramour Marie and best friend Henry, believe he''s innocent... until the creature begins to stalk Marie.', 'When author Charles Regnier returns to Paris with a best-selling book that criticizes the government, he''s tormented by frequent blackouts. After a mysterious cat-like creature slaughters people close to him, Charles is suspected of murder. Charles fears that he is the beast, but his paramour Marie and best friend Henry, believe he''s innocent... until the creature begins to stalk Marie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNgo49AIJVDCm7pB6OfZbo0frkw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101013'),
  ('644139927042401153', 'The Cats Bah', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Chuck Jones, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', null, 'Penelope, an American tourist cat who''s gotten a white stripe of paint down her back, is pursued through the Casbah by the amorous skunk Pepe Le Pew, who woos her with his rendition of "As Time Goes By".', 'Penelope, an American tourist cat who''s gotten a white stripe of paint down her back, is pursued through the Casbah by the amorous skunk Pepe Le Pew, who woos her with his rendition of "As Time Goes By".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v91BEhdZJFJQDsIyjVV2X7XBP1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147913'),
  ('564688780048010462', 'The Cave', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Thriller', 'Bruce Hunt, Ross Emery, Charles Rotherham', 'Tegan West, Michael Steinberg', 'Cole Hauser, Lena Headey, Morris Chestnut, Eddie Cibrian, Piper Perabo, Daniel Dae Kim, Kieran Darcy-Smith, Rick Ravanello', 'PG-13', 'After a group of biologists discovers a huge network of unexplored caves in Romania and, believing it to be an undisturbed eco-system that has produced a new species, they hire the best American team of underwater cave explorers in the world. While exploring deeper into the underwater caves, a rockslide blocks their exit, and they soon discover a larger carnivorous creature has added them to its food chain.', 'After a group of biologists discovers a huge network of unexplored caves in Romania and, believing it to be an undisturbed eco-system that has produced a new species, they hire the best American team of underwater cave explorers in the world. While exploring deeper into the underwater caves, a rockslide blocks their exit, and they soon discover a larger carnivorous creature has added them to its food chain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7eyZY2Akj68ivnRZ86OduCUexy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9042'),
  ('1050997126013666543', 'The Cave', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Feras Fayyad, Muhammed Khamir Al Shami, Ammar Suleiman', 'Alisar Hasan, Feras Fayyad', 'Amani Ballour, Salim Namour', 'PG-13', 'Deep beneath the surface in the Syrian province of Ghouta, a group of female doctors have established an underground field hospital. Under the supervision of paediatrician Dr. Amani and her staff of doctors and nurses, hope is restored for some of the thousands of children and civilian victims of the ruthless Syrian civil war.', 'Deep beneath the surface in the Syrian province of Ghouta, a group of female doctors have established an underground field hospital. Under the supervision of paediatrician Dr. Amani and her staff of doctors and nurses, hope is restored for some of the thousands of children and civilian victims of the ruthless Syrian civil war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Zb8U2EXBv36DGG9jaEESNEeJv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621729'),
  ('621937485787767835', 'The Cave of the Golden Rose', 1991, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Lamberto Bava, Romano Albini', 'Francesca Melandri, Gianni Romoli', 'Alessandra Martines, Mario Adorf, Kim Rossi Stuart, Ángela Molina, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Markéta Hrubešová, Tomáš Valík, Stefano Davanzati', null, 'After a queen''s tragic death, the king abandons his newborn daughter in a cave, but a witch saves her. Years later, the tomboy princess must confront and ultimately falls in love with the enemy king.', 'After a queen''s tragic death, the king abandons his newborn daughter in a cave, but a witch saves her. Years later, the tomboy princess must confront and ultimately falls in love with the enemy king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oZjPqEp9KUxxgyHNZuuGvVxEOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159704'),
  ('906559205383528455', 'The Cave of the Golden Rose 2', 1992, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Lamberto Bava, Gianlorenzo Battaglia', 'Gianni Romoli', 'Alessandra Martines, Kim Rossi Stuart, Stefano Davanzati, Tomáš Valík, Mario Adorf, Brigitte Nielsen, Lenka Kužvartová, Jakub Zdeněk', null, 'Fantaghiro and Romualdo are preparing their marriage when the Black Queen disgusted by their deep love captures Fantaghiro''s father. Romualdo and his soldiers go on their journey to free him. But the insidious Black Queen transforms herself into Fantaghiro, makes Romualdo her slave by kissing him and captures the rest of his army. Fantaghiro follows Romualdo although she promised him to stay home, finds the camp deserted and enters the near castle of the Black Queen. When she asks for a duel to free her people she is very surprised to face Romualdo who has forgot her completely due to the magic of the Black Queen.', 'Fantaghiro and Romualdo are preparing their marriage when the Black Queen disgusted by their deep love captures Fantaghiro''s father. Romualdo and his soldiers go on their journey to free him. But the insidious Black Queen transforms herself into Fantaghiro, makes Romualdo her slave by kissing him and captures the rest of his army. Fantaghiro follows Romualdo although she promised him to stay home, finds the camp deserted and enters the near castle of the Black Queen. When she asks for a duel to free her people she is very surprised to face Romualdo who has forgot her completely due to the magic of the Black Queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eNx0yBUOgKJmTvXmAkaMRNBWa2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173727'),
  ('1105537555605581871', 'The Cave of the Golden Rose 3', 1993, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Lamberto Bava, Romano Albani', 'Gianni Romoli', 'Alessandra Martines, Ursula Andress, Kim Rossi Stuart, Elena D''lppolito, Nicholas Rogers, Brigitte Nielsen, Barbora Kodetová, Kateřina Brožová', null, 'The powerful evil wizard Tarabas gets knowledge about a prophecy that a king''s child will defeat him. So he sends out his army of dead soldiers to kidnap all royal children. When the soldiers attack Fantaghiro''s castle to steal the babies of her sisters, the battle seems to be lost until she discovers the secret to defeat the solders but by doing that she loses Romualdo. Now Fantaghiro must find the evil wizard Tarabas and convince him to break the spell and bring back Romualdo.', 'The powerful evil wizard Tarabas gets knowledge about a prophecy that a king''s child will defeat him. So he sends out his army of dead soldiers to kidnap all royal children. When the soldiers attack Fantaghiro''s castle to steal the babies of her sisters, the battle seems to be lost until she discovers the secret to defeat the solders but by doing that she loses Romualdo. Now Fantaghiro must find the evil wizard Tarabas and convince him to break the spell and bring back Romualdo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xRkLoMRxCbL3AN17KUdjZ5heLD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173731'),
  ('220002349132214281', 'The Cave of the Golden Rose 4', 1994, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Lamberto Bava, Romano Albani', 'Gianni Romoli', 'Alessandra Martines, Nicholas Rogers, Horst Buchholz, Ursula Andress, Brigitte Nielsen, Gaia Bulferi Bulferetti, Agathe de La Fontaine, Kim Rossi Stuart', null, 'A black cloud travels across country, kills animals and plants and dries up the rivers. When the cloud reaches Fantaghiro''s kingdom she meets Prince Parsel who follows the cloud to get his stolen castle back. After her castle vanishes, too, Fantaghiro joins Parsel on his journey to find her home, her people, her family and her love.', 'A black cloud travels across country, kills animals and plants and dries up the rivers. When the cloud reaches Fantaghiro''s kingdom she meets Prince Parsel who follows the cloud to get his stolen castle back. After her castle vanishes, too, Fantaghiro joins Parsel on his journey to find her home, her people, her family and her love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97MClGvx4qztBC3rXaygwwmLgUi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173736'),
  ('1003461100894576156', 'The Cave of the Golden Rose 5', 1996, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Lamberto Bava, Romano Albani', 'Gianni Romoli', 'Alessandra Martines, Remo Girone, Luca Venantini, Ludwig Briand, Ariadna Caldas, Joan Fort, Brigitte Nielsen, Amarilys Nuñez Barrios', null, 'In this last film princess Fantaghirò ends up in a parallel dimension fairy land full of kids. Here the princess must fight against a villain called "Nameless".', 'In this last film princess Fantaghirò ends up in a parallel dimension fairy land full of kids. Here the princess must fight against a villain called "Nameless".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gKDuhYplSpDZPneKajPK89gFqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173737'),
  ('574448717812595880', 'The Cave of the Silken Web', 1967, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action, Music', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Lam Kwok-Cheung', 'Cheng Kang', 'Chow Lung-Cheung, Ho Fan, Pang Pang, Tien Shun, Liu Liang-Hua, Angela Yu Chien, Shen Yi, Helen Ma Hoi-Lun', null, 'Monkey King, Pig and Friar Sand must rescue his master Buddhist monk from seven witches / spiders who believe themselves to be immortal if they eat the monk''s flesh. The third part of the Shaw Brothers film series about Monkey King after the novel "Journey to the West."', 'Monkey King, Pig and Friar Sand must rescue his master Buddhist monk from seven witches / spiders who believe themselves to be immortal if they eat the monk''s flesh. The third part of the Shaw Brothers film series about Monkey King after the novel "Journey to the West."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEvNC9J2UzWc3PkptXMGcGVxSNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104594'),
  ('1148381812586304719', 'The Cave of the Yellow Dog', 2005, 'Drama', 'Byambasuren Davaa, Daniel Schönauer', 'Byambasuren Davaa', 'Batchuluun Urjindorj, Buyandulam Daramdadi, Nansal Batchuluun, Nansalmaa Batchuluun, Batbayar Batchuluun, Tserenpuntsag Ish, Scharav Sumiya, Battur Lhamsuren', null, 'The little nomad girl, Nansal, finds a baby dog in the Mongolian veld, who becomes her best friend - against all rejections of her parents. A story about a Mongolian family of nomads - their traditional way of life and the rising call of the City.', 'The little nomad girl, Nansal, finds a baby dog in the Mongolian veld, who becomes her best friend - against all rejections of her parents. A story about a Mongolian family of nomads - their traditional way of life and the rising call of the City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4FNp6mb5Lh02vno2ujkGJX9tfl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1393'),
  ('649576057583941567', 'The Caveman''s Valentine', 2001, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kasi Lemmons, Amy Vincent', 'George Dawes Green', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Colm Feore, Ann Magnuson, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Tamara Tunie, Anthony Michael Hall, Erik LaRay Harvey, Rodney Eastman', 'R', 'Romulus, a misunderstood musician turned recluse hiding from personal demons in a New York City cave, finds the frozen body of a young drifter in a tree. The authorities, including his police officer daughter, claim the death is accidental. Romulus is convinced the man was murdered by a prominent art photographer but how can he prove he''s right when everyone thinks he''s insane?', 'Romulus, a misunderstood musician turned recluse hiding from personal demons in a New York City cave, finds the frozen body of a young drifter in a tree. The authorities, including his police officer daughter, claim the death is accidental. Romulus is convinced the man was murdered by a prominent art photographer but how can he prove he''s right when everyone thinks he''s insane?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWjoiGvFZPXuBi93reGblvDHIax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25208'),
  ('886641534573091336', 'The Cavern Crimes', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Manuel Ríos San Martín, Ángel Iguacel, Marisa Muñoz', 'Manuel Ríos San Martín, Victoria dal Vera', 'Blanca Suárez, Daniel Grao, Aria Bedmar, Cosimo Fusco, Víctor Palmero, Daniel Horvath, Fernando Cayo, Pablo Rivero', null, 'An intense suspense thriller with an attractive blend of crime and mystery set in the unique historical backdrop of the Atapuerca paleontological site, home of the oldest human remains outside of Africa.', 'An intense suspense thriller with an attractive blend of crime and mystery set in the unique historical backdrop of the Atapuerca paleontological site, home of the oldest human remains outside of Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o410zKXtZYy2vVBcQJPxzOc9KYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1310871'),
  ('692174916134560594', 'The Cay', 1974, 'Adventure, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Patrick Garland', null, 'James Earl Jones, Alfred Lutter, Gretchen Corbett', null, 'When Young Phillip is separated form his mother and found by a black man named Timothy and his cat Stewcat, Phillip becomes blind and they all end up on an island. Will they survive or will they die?', 'When Young Phillip is separated form his mother and found by a black man named Timothy and his cat Stewcat, Phillip becomes blind and they all end up on an island. Will they survive or will they die?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxepjgywK22yzCalEOWpx4vFcvm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213804'),
  ('1117558052846822104', 'The Celestine Prophecy', 2006, 'Romance, Drama, Adventure', 'Armand Mastroianni, R. Michael Givens', 'Dan Gordon, Barnet Bain, James Redfield', 'Matthew Settle, Thomas Kretschmann, Sarah Wayne Callies, Héctor Elizondo, Joaquim de Almeida, Annabeth Gish, Oliver Adams, Rachel Erickson', null, 'A spiritual adventure film chronicling the discovery of ancient scrolls in the rainforests of Peru. The prophecy and its nine key insights predict a worldwide awakening, arising within all religious traditions, that moves humanity toward a deeper experience of spirituality.', 'A spiritual adventure film chronicling the discovery of ancient scrolls in the rainforests of Peru. The prophecy and its nine key insights predict a worldwide awakening, arising within all religious traditions, that moves humanity toward a deeper experience of spirituality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hI6gIW203lNGSF9qzoqQEuYjpEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18524'),
  ('358574221704681701', 'The Cell', 2000, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Paul Laufer, Tarsem Singh, Guy Hendrix Dyas', 'Mark Protosevich', 'Jennifer Lopez, Vince Vaughn, Vincent D''Onofrio, Catherine Sutherland, James Gammon, Colton James, Dylan Baker, Marianne Jean-Baptiste', 'R', 'A psychotherapist journeys inside a comatose serial killer in the hopes of saving his latest victim.', 'A psychotherapist journeys inside a comatose serial killer in the hopes of saving his latest victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfYVxvDDAJoFq2knHUzAZP09pAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8843'),
  ('11195223135598947', 'The Cell 2', 2009, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Tim Iacofano, Geno Salvatori, Troy Rohovit', 'Rob Rinow, Erik Klein, Alex Barder', 'Tessie Santiago, Chris Bruno, Frank Whaley, Bart Johnson, Michael Flynn, Amee Walden, Charles Halford, Paul Kiernan', 'R', 'The Cusp is a serial killer who kills his victims and then brings them back to life; over and over again; until they beg to die! Maya is a psychic investigator who gained her powers after a 1 year coma after she was the Cusp''s first victim! Now the Cusp Killer is back and Maya has little time to do what she has never done before: go into the mind of a killer unprotected and save his latest victim.', 'The Cusp is a serial killer who kills his victims and then brings them back to life; over and over again; until they beg to die! Maya is a psychic investigator who gained her powers after a 1 year coma after she was the Cusp''s first victim! Now the Cusp Killer is back and Maya has little time to do what she has never done before: go into the mind of a killer unprotected and save his latest victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6r89osQfchdtnQiB5snCg7uTqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18759'),
  ('127096090685721184', 'The Cellar', 1989, 'Horror', 'Kevin Tenney, Tom Jewett', 'John Woodward', 'Patrick Kilpatrick, Chris Miller, Suzanne Savoy, Ford Rainey, Michael Wren, Lou Perryman, Danny Mora, Alex Pederson', 'PG-13', 'A young boy finds an ancient Comanche monster spirit in the basement of his home. His parents don''t believe him, so he must kill the monster alone.', 'A young boy finds an ancient Comanche monster spirit in the basement of his home. His parents don''t believe him, so he must kill the monster alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7lMjqKCSaReCpW9pbon5Zzgh9e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89747'),
  ('537459252430062238', 'The Cellar', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Tom Comerford, Brendan Muldowney', 'Brendan Muldowney', 'Elisha Cuthbert, Eoin Macken, Dylan Fitzmaurice-Brady, Tara Lee, Michael-David McKernan, Andrew Bennett, Aaron Monaghan, Marie Mullen', null, 'When Keira Woods'' daughter mysteriously vanishes in the cellar of their new house in the country, she soon discovers there is an ancient and powerful entity controlling their home that she will have to face or risk losing her family''s souls forever.', 'When Keira Woods'' daughter mysteriously vanishes in the cellar of their new house in the country, she soon discovers there is an ancient and powerful entity controlling their home that she will have to face or risk losing her family''s souls forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtfGeS5WMXA6PtikIYUmYTSbVdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758724'),
  ('855536310181833087', 'The Cellar Door', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Matt Zettell', 'Christopher Nelson', 'James DuMont, Michelle Tomlinson, Heather Sconyers, Christina Reynolds, Annie Coffey', null, 'Having developed an uncontrollable obsession with the beautiful young Rudy (Michelle Tomlinson), crazed serial killer Herman (James DuMont) kidnaps her and locks her in a cage in his basement. The only way for Rudy to survive this nightmare is to outsmart her psychopathic tormentor. But Herman has experience on his side: He''s entrapped and tortured other women before, playing sick and twisted mind games with his frightened victims.', 'Having developed an uncontrollable obsession with the beautiful young Rudy (Michelle Tomlinson), crazed serial killer Herman (James DuMont) kidnaps her and locks her in a cage in his basement. The only way for Rudy to survive this nightmare is to outsmart her psychopathic tormentor. But Herman has experience on his side: He''s entrapped and tortured other women before, playing sick and twisted mind games with his frightened victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkWjhSqwbXgav7IPKCwdlK4EhZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18496'),
  ('1029724044923180413', 'The Celluloid Closet', 1996, 'Documentary, History', 'Rob Epstein, Jeffrey Friedman, Nancy Schreiber', 'Armistead Maupin', 'Lily Tomlin, Tony Curtis, Susan Sarandon, Gore Vidal, Whoopi Goldberg, Antonio Fargas, Shirley MacLaine, John Schlesinger', 'R', 'Exuberant, eye-opening movie that serves up a dazzling hundred-year history of the role of gay men and lesbians have had on the silver screen. Film contains fabulous footage from 120 films showing the changing face of cinema sexuality, from cruel stereotypes to covert love to the activist triumphs of the 1990s.', 'Exuberant, eye-opening movie that serves up a dazzling hundred-year history of the role of gay men and lesbians have had on the silver screen. Film contains fabulous footage from 120 films showing the changing face of cinema sexuality, from cruel stereotypes to covert love to the activist triumphs of the 1990s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0DSh3uMeQk6EG1DHjGJUywN7C0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32562'),
  ('731841093286382289', 'The Cement Garden', 1993, 'Drama', 'Andrew Birkin, Stephen Blackman', 'Andrew Birkin', 'Andrew Robertson, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Alice Coulthard, Ned Birkin, Sinéad Cusack, Hanns Zischler, Jochen Horst, Gareth Brown', null, 'After the death of her husband, the mother of Julie, Jack, Sue and Tom begins to suffer from a mysterious illness. Aware that she is going to have to go into hospital she opens a bank account for the children, so that they can be financially self-sufficient and will be able to avoid being taken into care by the authorities. Unfortunately she also dies and Julie and Jack (the older, teenage children) decide to hide her body in the basement so that they can have free reign of their household. Soon Tom has taken to dressing as a girl whilst Sue has become increasingly reticent, confiding only to her diary, meanwhile Jack and Julie sense an attraction developing for each other. However Julie''s new beau, Derek, threatens to unearth the many dark secrets within this family as he becomes increasingly suspicious of Jack.', 'After the death of her husband, the mother of Julie, Jack, Sue and Tom begins to suffer from a mysterious illness. Aware that she is going to have to go into hospital she opens a bank account for the children, so that they can be financially self-sufficient and will be able to avoid being taken into care by the authorities. Unfortunately she also dies and Julie and Jack (the older, teenage children) decide to hide her body in the basement so that they can have free reign of their household. Soon Tom has taken to dressing as a girl whilst Sue has become increasingly reticent, confiding only to her diary, meanwhile Jack and Julie sense an attraction developing for each other. However Julie''s new beau, Derek, threatens to unearth the many dark secrets within this family as he becomes increasingly suspicious of Jack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnEoE3tHBStCXZx2i9qsUYkwucu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14832'),
  ('953970525116209294', 'The Cemetery Club', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Bill Duke, Steven Poster', 'Ivan Menchell', 'Ellen Burstyn, Olympia Dukakis, Diane Ladd, Danny Aiello, Lainie Kazan, Jeff Howell, Christina Ricci, Bernie Casey', null, 'The story of three Pittsburgh widows who meet every year to visit their husband''s graves and talk about perspectives in their lives.', 'The story of three Pittsburgh widows who meet every year to visit their husband''s graves and talk about perspectives in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWAA4NuA2fmkZQL3CEWRzPif6D7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79888'),
  ('666588631717181350', 'The Cemil Show', 2021, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Barış Sarhan', null, 'Ozan Çelik, Nesrin Cavadzade, Alican Yücesoy, Cezmi Baskın, Başar Alemdar, Sennur Nogaylar, Fuat Kökek, Ülkünur Arslan', null, 'Cemil, a wannabe actor auditions for the villain role in a film. He can''t get the role but the role gets him.', 'Cemil, a wannabe actor auditions for the villain role in a film. He can''t get the role but the role gets him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJqOTSLNGnyfajcoB8N9Fq7Eyej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674322'),
  ('128441897297507047', 'The Centaurs', 1921, 'Fantasy, Animation, Romance', 'Winsor McCay', 'Winsor McCay', null, null, 'A female centaur enters a clearing in the woods and picks flowers. She is met by a male centaur and the two romance each other. They then seek parental consent for their union. Surviving footage of a now lost film.', 'A female centaur enters a clearing in the woods and picks flowers. She is met by a male centaur and the two romance each other. They then seek parental consent for their union. Surviving footage of a now lost film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esbHOgpUcOHX5qeHEdbyKnVu97Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146744'),
  ('999545854730343469', 'The Center of the World', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wayne Wang, Mauro Fiore, Jonathan McGarry', 'Ellen Benjamin Wong', 'Molly Parker, Peter Sarsgaard, Carla Gugino, Shane Edelman, Karry Brown, Alisha Klass, Mel Gorham, Lisa Newlan', null, 'A couple checks into a suite in Las Vegas. In flashbacks we see that he''s a computer whiz on the verge of becoming a dot.com millionaire, she''s a lap dancer at a club. He''s depressed, withdrawing from work, missing meetings with investors. He wants a connection, so he offers her $10,000 to spend three nights with him in Vegas, and she accepts with conditions. Is mutual attraction stirring?', 'A couple checks into a suite in Las Vegas. In flashbacks we see that he''s a computer whiz on the verge of becoming a dot.com millionaire, she''s a lap dancer at a club. He''s depressed, withdrawing from work, missing meetings with investors. He wants a connection, so he offers her $10,000 to spend three nights with him in Vegas, and she accepts with conditions. Is mutual attraction stirring?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmcabkCsSQ08yll4dIVclWc2RSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32590'),
  ('980467999323989456', 'The Centerfold Girls', 1974, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'John Peyser, Robert Maxwell, William F. Sheehan', 'Bob Peete', 'Andrew Prine, Tiffany Bolling, Jennifer Ashley, Aldo Ray, Jaime Lyn Bauer, Ray Danton, Francine York, Janet Wood', 'R', 'Police try to halt a psychotic killer''s rampage against women who posed nude in men''s magazines.', 'Police try to halt a psychotic killer''s rampage against women who posed nude in men''s magazines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mVRfoteQMX4UzKNF9zeJolMxY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28147'),
  ('443684617018610001', 'The Central Park Five', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Sarah Burns, Ken Burns, David McMahon', 'David McMahon, Sarah Burns, Ken Burns', 'Antron McCray, Kevin Richardson, Yusef Salaam, Raymond Santana, Kharey Wise, Matias Reyes, Jim Dwyer, Angela Black', 'NR', 'In 1989, five black and Latino teenagers from Harlem were arrested and later convicted of raping a white woman in New York City''s Central Park. They spent between 6 and 13 years in prison before a serial rapist confessed that he alone had committed the crime, leading to their convictions being overturned. Set against a backdrop of a decaying city beset by violence and racial tension, this is the story of that horrific crime, the rush to judgment by the police, a media clamoring for sensational stories and an outraged public, and the five lives upended by this miscarriage of justice.', 'In 1989, five black and Latino teenagers from Harlem were arrested and later convicted of raping a white woman in New York City''s Central Park. They spent between 6 and 13 years in prison before a serial rapist confessed that he alone had committed the crime, leading to their convictions being overturned. Set against a backdrop of a decaying city beset by violence and racial tension, this is the story of that horrific crime, the rush to judgment by the police, a media clamoring for sensational stories and an outraged public, and the five lives upended by this miscarriage of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKlQ8Sjr07OkCLuYkRYtpVSMm3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124067'),
  ('456120716767908474', 'The Central Warmth', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Vladimir Yanchev', 'Vladimir Yanchev', 'Naum Shopov, Konstantin Kotsev, Tatyana Lolova, Georgi Cherkelov, Lachezar Stoyanov, Stoyan Stoychev, Valentin Rusetzki, Bozhidar Lechev', null, 'A tenement house needs to have steam heating installed. The residents find the necessary workers to do it, sign the contract and pay them in advance. The workers show up and start their job, but disappear immediately. Panic-stricken, the residents set up to search for them, only to find the workers in jail. Totally desperate, their only chance is to come up with an ingenious plan how to bring the work to the end.', 'A tenement house needs to have steam heating installed. The residents find the necessary workers to do it, sign the contract and pay them in advance. The workers show up and start their job, but disappear immediately. Panic-stricken, the residents set up to search for them, only to find the workers in jail. Totally desperate, their only chance is to come up with an ingenious plan how to bring the work to the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyhvQWk599cJsXie2GGhUVQdBLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266952'),
  ('594292647204344612', 'The Ceremony', 1963, 'Drama, Crime', 'Laurence Harvey, Oswald Morris, Pedro Vidal', 'Ben Barzman', 'Laurence Harvey, Sarah Miles, Robert Walker Jr., John Ireland, Ross Martin, Lee Patterson, Jack MacGowran, Carlos Casaravilla', null, 'A man has an affair with his condemned brother''s girlfriend while plotting his escape in Tangier.', 'A man has an affair with his condemned brother''s girlfriend while plotting his escape in Tangier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhLEcDmdeeDxRBidjg8R1ILuYuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170315'),
  ('226241568694035923', 'The Ceremony', 1965, 'Animation', 'Borivoj Dovniković ''Bordo''', 'Borivoj Dovniković ''Bordo''', null, null, 'Six people are grouped in front of a wall as if for a photograph. The entire ceremony is supervised by a seventh person, who, like a photographer, looks at the group from different angles and rearranges the group by hand-signals.', 'Six people are grouped in front of a wall as if for a photograph. The entire ceremony is supervised by a seventh person, who, like a photographer, looks at the group from different angles and rearranges the group by hand-signals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTFNjpEi9XJVwTCoPYZw6KIPU8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281679'),
  ('307107765273194785', 'The Ceremony', 1971, 'Drama', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Tōichirō Narushima', 'Mamoru Sasaki, Nagisa Ōshima, Tsutomu Tamura', 'Kenzō Kawarasaki, Atsuko Kaku, Atsuo Nakamura, Nobuko Otowa, Hōsei Komatsu, Rokkō Toura, Fumio Watanabe, Shizue Kawarazaki', null, 'Oshima’s magisterial epic, centering on the ambivalent surviving heir of the Sakurada clan, uses ritual and the microcosm of the traditional family to trace the rise and fall of militaristic Japan across several decades.', 'Oshima’s magisterial epic, centering on the ambivalent surviving heir of the Sakurada clan, uses ritual and the microcosm of the traditional family to trace the rise and fall of militaristic Japan across several decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcF7oQAmnSpYZQSWXsJdI6WuWyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94466'),
  ('284800166295844830', 'The Ceremony', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Lina Mannheimer, Daniel Takács', null, 'Catherine Robbe-Grillet, Beverly Charpentier, Dominique Corringer, Alain Robbe-Grillet, Christian Hersant, Claude Helleu, Ulriqa Fernqvist, Emma Kim Hagdahl', null, 'In an extravagant house in Paris, people gather for sexual ceremonies in luxurious environments. The 83-year-old author, Catherine Robbe-Grillet is the brains and heart behind the erotic role playing. She is the dominatrix who controls what goes on and her partner, who is 31 years her junior, has promised to submit to her smallest command. Lina Mannheimer portrays a puzzling, intellectual and deeply fascinating woman who, accompanied by her husband Alain Robbe-Grillet, has dedicated herself to investigating sex both in life and in literature. The sadomasochistic ceremonies are presented with an intense presence and cinematic focus in this beautiful and thought-provoking debut film about desire, power and silk scarves.', 'In an extravagant house in Paris, people gather for sexual ceremonies in luxurious environments. The 83-year-old author, Catherine Robbe-Grillet is the brains and heart behind the erotic role playing. She is the dominatrix who controls what goes on and her partner, who is 31 years her junior, has promised to submit to her smallest command. Lina Mannheimer portrays a puzzling, intellectual and deeply fascinating woman who, accompanied by her husband Alain Robbe-Grillet, has dedicated herself to investigating sex both in life and in literature. The sadomasochistic ceremonies are presented with an intense presence and cinematic focus in this beautiful and thought-provoking debut film about desire, power and silk scarves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncVxy2F8pKMdeOzN1oCVKowrhC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322434'),
  ('370869140298211570', 'The Cézanne Affair', 2009, 'Drama, History, Comedy', 'Sergio Rubini, Fabio Cianchetti', 'Sergio Rubini, Carla Cavalluzzi, Domenico Starnone', 'Sergio Rubini, Valeria Golino, Riccardo Scamarcio, Fabrizio Gifuni, Anna Falchi, Maurizio Micheli, Margherita Buy, Guido Giaquinto', null, 'Gabriele returns home in southern Italy to bid farewell to his father Ernesto, a former stationmaster in a small town not far from Bari. The old man reawakens in Gabriele memories of his childhood, of his loving mother, his uncle, his friends... but also of his father''s rage and bitterness over his failure in achieving his artistic ambitions: Ernesto was convinced he was destined to be a famous painter, and was willing to sacrifice everything for this belief, even his own dignity – and this made his son swear that he wouldn''t turn out like him. Only now, many years later, through chance and circumstances, Gabriele begins to understand Ernesto and to see what sort of person his father really was.', 'Gabriele returns home in southern Italy to bid farewell to his father Ernesto, a former stationmaster in a small town not far from Bari. The old man reawakens in Gabriele memories of his childhood, of his loving mother, his uncle, his friends... but also of his father''s rage and bitterness over his failure in achieving his artistic ambitions: Ernesto was convinced he was destined to be a famous painter, and was willing to sacrifice everything for this belief, even his own dignity – and this made his son swear that he wouldn''t turn out like him. Only now, many years later, through chance and circumstances, Gabriele begins to understand Ernesto and to see what sort of person his father really was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smhRtXKicEuyQDEehrjmfjIYwDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56988'),
  ('901259179043944439', 'The Chain', 1997, 'Animation', 'Phil Mulloy', null, null, null, 'A child makes a grotesque and primitive painting, only for it to be criticized by their father. What happens after is a tale of deception, tragedy, war, death, and destruction from those who encounter the affected painting and its supposedly limitless power.', 'A child makes a grotesque and primitive painting, only for it to be criticized by their father. What happens after is a tale of deception, tragedy, war, death, and destruction from those who encounter the affected painting and its supposedly limitless power.', null, 'tmdb:movie:48510'),
  ('575369690637580225', 'The Chain Gang', 1930, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig', null, 'Mickey Mouse and several other characters are on a prison chain gang, guarded by Pegleg Pete. They break rocks for a while, then Mickey breaks out a harmonica and everyone starts making music and/or dancing. Soon there''s a jail-break, and Mickey''s on the run, tracked by bloodhounds (including his future pet, Pluto, in his first appearance). He falls off a cliff and right into a jail cell.', 'Mickey Mouse and several other characters are on a prison chain gang, guarded by Pegleg Pete. They break rocks for a while, then Mickey breaks out a harmonica and everyone starts making music and/or dancing. Soon there''s a jail-break, and Mickey''s on the run, tracked by bloodhounds (including his future pet, Pluto, in his first appearance). He falls off a cliff and right into a jail cell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rJDPpKGj4j9wVW89eU4mwagiXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68516'),
  ('523506778056245150', 'The Chain Reaction', 1980, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ian Barry, Russell Boyd, Andrew Thomas Wilson', 'Ian Barry', 'Steve Bisley, Arna-Maria Winchester, Ross Thompson, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Ralph Cotterill, Richard Moir, Tim Burns, Lorna Lesley', null, 'Contaminated by a nuclear-plant spill, an Australian worker hides with a woman and tries to warn the public.', 'Contaminated by a nuclear-plant spill, an Australian worker hides with a woman and tries to warn the public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sstLy91wB3nMqgXaPCAC3faad4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60591'),
  ('369603078899035109', 'The Chair', 1963, 'Animation', 'Daniel Szczechura', 'Emil Saski, Daniel Szczechura', null, null, 'A story about the fight for power told with the help of simple graphics. The huge building, the huge column hall, one chair around the chairman''s board table is empty. We observe the fight for that chair: little men run and fight, all tricks are allowed.', 'A story about the fight for power told with the help of simple graphics. The huge building, the huge column hall, one chair around the chairman''s board table is empty. We observe the fight for that chair: little men run and fight, all tricks are allowed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYCHP9eLArbMKVr8YwuamAgPJVS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153082'),
  ('615756158494798085', 'The Chair', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brett Sullivan', 'Michael Capellupo', 'Alanna Chisholm, Lauren Roy, Nick Abraham, Paul Soren, Nickolas Tortolano, Adam Seybold, David Kim, Michael Capellupo', null, 'Psychology student Danielle inadvertently wakes a evil spirit while renting a century old Victorian house. In setting out to prove his existence, Danielle inadvertently frees and becomes a puppet of the spirit of serial killer Edgar Crowe. Danielle''s sister Anna now must find a way to stop Crowe without killing her sister.', 'Psychology student Danielle inadvertently wakes a evil spirit while renting a century old Victorian house. In setting out to prove his existence, Danielle inadvertently frees and becomes a puppet of the spirit of serial killer Edgar Crowe. Danielle''s sister Anna now must find a way to stop Crowe without killing her sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aJdvv488VkSEtCefQzaSw7oDQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22072'),
  ('760125794836061335', 'The Chair', 2022, 'Horror', 'Curry Barker', 'Curry Barker', 'Jonnathon Cripple, Seth Goodfellow, David Alan Graf, Anthony Pavone, Haley Schwartz, Tristan Welsh', null, 'After Reese brings home an antique chair, a series of horrific events follow, leading him to question if it''s a malevolent spirit the chair possesses or the darkness inside his own mind.', 'After Reese brings home an antique chair, a series of horrific events follow, leading him to question if it''s a malevolent spirit the chair possesses or the darkness inside his own mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lme7ENcayuHNNVgKXyF9a70BbYP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118403'),
  ('634230226851693970', 'The Chairman', 1969, 'Action, Thriller', 'J. Lee Thompson, John Wilcox, Ferdinand Fairfax', 'Ben Maddow', 'Gregory Peck, Anne Heywood, Arthur Hill, Alan Dobie, Keye Luke, Zienia Merton, Conrad Yama, Ori Levy', null, 'An American scientist is sent to Red China to steal the formula for a newly developed agricultural enzyme. What he is not told by his bosses is that a micro-sized bomb has been planted in his brain so that should the mission ever look likely to fail, he can be eliminated at the push of a button!', 'An American scientist is sent to Red China to steal the formula for a newly developed agricultural enzyme. What he is not told by his bosses is that a micro-sized bomb has been planted in his brain so that should the mission ever look likely to fail, he can be eliminated at the push of a button!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBEt1EGaR0wUI1VW1dWrgrRRZ0V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107353'),
  ('745546749454159724', 'The Chalk Circle Man', 2009, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Josée Dayan, Stefan Ivanov', 'Emmanuel Carrère', 'Jean-Hugues Anglade, Charlotte Rampling, Jacques Spiesser, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Stanislas Merhar, Hélène Fillières, Corinne Masiero', null, 'For months a strange phrase has been found scrawled on Paris sidewalks next to chalk circles containing odd objects. Policeman Adamsberg gets involved when a dead woman is found in one of the circles.', 'For months a strange phrase has been found scrawled on Paris sidewalks next to chalk circles containing odd objects. Policeman Adamsberg gets involved when a dead woman is found in one of the circles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3JTgXaqvKIGvoMathybYhwZbMk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193289'),
  ('693755003450174982', 'The Chalk Garden', 1964, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ronald Neame, Arthur Ibbetson', 'John Michael Hayes, Enid Bagnold', 'Deborah Kerr, Hayley Mills, John Mills, Edith Evans, Felix Aylmer, Elizabeth Sellars, Lally Bowers, Toke Townley', null, 'The peculiar antics of Laurel, an emotionally troubled young girl, are the focus of The Chalk Garden – a stately household drama set on the cliffs of the English south coast. Edith Evans plays a matriarchal grandmother who, in raising her granddaughter, has neglected her other love – a barren chalk garden. Mayhem ensues as Laurel''s behavior frightens away a succession of governesses until an enigmatic one is hired in spite of her mysterious references. She skillfully sets about tending to the girl''s reckless emotions and the pitifully failed garden.', 'The peculiar antics of Laurel, an emotionally troubled young girl, are the focus of The Chalk Garden – a stately household drama set on the cliffs of the English south coast. Edith Evans plays a matriarchal grandmother who, in raising her granddaughter, has neglected her other love – a barren chalk garden. Mayhem ensues as Laurel''s behavior frightens away a succession of governesses until an enigmatic one is hired in spite of her mysterious references. She skillfully sets about tending to the girl''s reckless emotions and the pitifully failed garden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IXGqj9MoPFbaoBcUkUZf97XHlx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66022'),
  ('941602644194541469', 'The Chalk Line', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Ignacio Tatay, Oriol Barcelona, Álvaro Haro', 'Ignacio Tatay, Isabel Peña', 'Elena Anaya, Pablo Molinero, Eva Tennear, Eva Llorach, Carlos Santos, Esther Acebo, Eloy Azorín, Mona Martínez', 'PG-13', 'After a couple finds a traumatized child of unknown origins, wife Paula must decipher the girl''s strange behaviors to unlock her identity and dark past.', 'After a couple finds a traumatized child of unknown origins, wife Paula must decipher the girl''s strange behaviors to unlock her identity and dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifxAT8LVbSCxAi290VplTwbEQNh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960875'),
  ('641304439132345729', 'The Challenge', 1958, 'Drama', 'Gianni Di Venanzo, Francesco Rosi, Roberto Pariante', 'Francesco Rosi, Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Enzo Provenzale', 'Rosanna Schiaffino, José Suárez, Nino Vingelli, Decimo Cristiani, José Jaspe, Tina Castigliano, Pasquale Cennamo, Elsa Valentino Ascoli', null, 'Vito Polara is ambitious and wants to get as more power and money as possible. He decides to leave the cigarette smuggling and try to get the total control of the regional fruit and vegetable distribution considered more profitable. He looks for the help of a rural crime Boss.', 'Vito Polara is ambitious and wants to get as more power and money as possible. He decides to leave the cigarette smuggling and try to get the total control of the regional fruit and vegetable distribution considered more profitable. He looks for the help of a rural crime Boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxO2gHT0xNHk2dGyd377NMaLSvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156135'),
  ('365073760618370291', 'The Challenge', 1982, 'Action, Drama', 'John Frankenheimer, Kōzō Okazaki', 'Ivan Moffat, John Sayles, Richard Maxwell', 'Scott Glenn, Toshirō Mifune, Donna Kei Benz, Atsuo Nakamura, Calvin Jung, Clyde Kusatsu, Sab Shimono, Kiyoaki Nagai', 'R', 'Rick, a down-and-out American boxer, is hired to transport a sword to Japan, unaware that the whole thing is a set up in a bitter blood-feud between two brothers, one who follows the traditional path of the samurai and the other a businessman. At the behest of the businessman, Rick undertakes samurai training from the other brother, but joins his cause. He also becomes romantically involved with the samurai''s daughter.', 'Rick, a down-and-out American boxer, is hired to transport a sword to Japan, unaware that the whole thing is a set up in a bitter blood-feud between two brothers, one who follows the traditional path of the samurai and the other a businessman. At the behest of the businessman, Rick undertakes samurai training from the other brother, but joins his cause. He also becomes romantically involved with the samurai''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j91nghOu6UDRXGUHoxOwZXMqgo3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39274'),
  ('1116646579861997720', 'The Challenge', 2003, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Craig Shapiro, Guy Livneh', 'Michael Swerdlick, Elizabeth Kruger', 'Ashley Olsen, Mary-Kate Olsen, Lukas Behnken, Brian Skala, Theo Rossi, Sarah Bastian, Joe Michael Burke, Zakk Moore', 'G', 'Estranged twins Lizzie and Shane are chosen for a Survivor-like popular game show with college scholarships as the prize.', 'Estranged twins Lizzie and Shane are chosen for a Survivor-like popular game show with college scholarships as the prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrOwyD2mHc3bbHt0nZ220NgrWJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44899'),
  ('252330445286730789', 'The Challenge', 2005, 'Action', 'Marcus Stotz, Johannes Jaeger', 'Johannes Jaeger', 'Mathis Landwehr, Esther Schweins, Volkram Zschiesche, Christian Monz, Sinta Weisz, Bela B., Ron Matz, Wolfgang Stegemann', null, 'Welcome to the future. Civilization has been obliterated by natural catastrophes and global economic collapse. In the rotting skeletons of once great cities, the remnants of mankind struggle to survive under the brutal reign of vicious warlords who rule by fear and the power of the fist. The only hope for a courageous band of street urchins is the brave fighter Jonas, the last surviving keeper of the secrets of an ancient martial arts dynasty. Jonas must challenge the heartless Bosco in a fight for freedom or death ... only then can he become master of mankind''s destiny.', 'Welcome to the future. Civilization has been obliterated by natural catastrophes and global economic collapse. In the rotting skeletons of once great cities, the remnants of mankind struggle to survive under the brutal reign of vicious warlords who rule by fear and the power of the fist. The only hope for a courageous band of street urchins is the brave fighter Jonas, the last surviving keeper of the secrets of an ancient martial arts dynasty. Jonas must challenge the heartless Bosco in a fight for freedom or death ... only then can he become master of mankind''s destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmGEcsuOdNscE8Lh8o8awk8hiCB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10270'),
  ('845780826113059627', 'The Challenge', 2023, 'Drama', 'Aleksey Samodelko, Evgeny Dostal, Yekaterina Dyukova', 'Klim Shipenko, Bakur Bakuradze, Ilya Malakhova', 'Yulia Peresild, Miloš Biković, Klim Shipenko, Alyona Mordovina, Vladimir Mashkov, Oleg Novitsky, Anton Shkaplerov, Elena Valyushkina', null, 'Thoracic surgeon Evgenia Belyaeva has one month to prepare for a flight to the International Space Station, where she must operate on a crew member. Will she be up for the challenge? Can she overcome her fears and insecurities? Will she be able to perform the complicated surgery in zero gravity, and give the cosmonaut a chance to return to Earth alive?', 'Thoracic surgeon Evgenia Belyaeva has one month to prepare for a flight to the International Space Station, where she must operate on a crew member. Will she be up for the challenge? Can she overcome her fears and insecurities? Will she be able to perform the complicated surgery in zero gravity, and give the cosmonaut a chance to return to Earth alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNkKYzAgXsZPpTVUv0zQqkQIoes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745987'),
  ('316503368312970852', 'The Challenge of the Lady Ninja', 1983, 'Action', 'Lee Tso-Nam, Chuang Yan-Chien, Shin Myung-Yue', 'Wei Hsin', 'Loretta Yang Hui-shan, Chen Kuan-Tai, Hsiang Yun-Peng, Peng Gang, Hsueh Han, Tsao Chien, Sun Jung-Chi, Chien Te-Men', null, 'During the Japanese occupation of Shanghai, a Chinese woman trains in the covert arts. When she arrives in Hong Kong, she learns that her brother works on behalf the Japanese cause. She then pulls together a team of women warriors to stop her brother', 'During the Japanese occupation of Shanghai, a Chinese woman trains in the covert arts. When she arrives in Hong Kong, she learns that her brother works on behalf the Japanese cause. She then pulls together a team of women warriors to stop her brother', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/N0AyzIeg0LWFCRYs1OsHnqYt5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157389'),
  ('226538263221775627', 'The Challenger Disaster', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama, History, TV Movie', 'James Hawes, Lukas Strebel', 'Kate Gartside', 'William Hurt, Bruce Greenwood, Joanne Whalley, Brian Dennehy, Eve Best, Kevin McNally, Henry Goodman, Langley Kirkwood', 'PG-13', 'When the space shuttle Challenger blew up in 1986, it was the most shocking event in the history of American spaceflight. The deaths of seven astronauts, including the first teacher in space Christa McAuliffe, were watched live on television by millions of viewers. But what was more shocking was that the cause of the disaster might never be uncovered. The Challenger is the story of how Richard Feynman, one of America''s most famous scientists, helped to discover the cause of a tragedy that stunned America.', 'When the space shuttle Challenger blew up in 1986, it was the most shocking event in the history of American spaceflight. The deaths of seven astronauts, including the first teacher in space Christa McAuliffe, were watched live on television by millions of viewers. But what was more shocking was that the cause of the disaster might never be uncovered. The Challenger is the story of how Richard Feynman, one of America''s most famous scientists, helped to discover the cause of a tragedy that stunned America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltSiY7rORMGlSHGI7Lr0sgI8D6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177203'),
  ('782491554347421490', 'The Challenges', 1969, 'Drama', 'José Luis Egea, Víctor Erice, Claudio Guerín Hill', 'Rafael Azcona, Claudio Guerín Hill, José Luis Egea', 'Dean Selmier, Francisco Rabal, Daisy Granados, Asunción Balaguer, Teresa Rabal, Alfredo Mayo, Julia Gutiérrez Caba, Barbara Deist', null, 'Los desafíos presents three separate stories that are linked by an American presence in Spain in the 1960s, with Dean Selmier playing the role of the American male in all three.', 'Los desafíos presents three separate stories that are linked by an American presence in Spain in the 1960s, with Dean Selmier playing the role of the American male in all three.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttGVuPPHxW6iJgDEjbsNwPLhmvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258057'),
  ('314668726786405194', 'The Chamber', 1996, 'Crime, Drama', 'James Foley, Ian Baker', 'William Goldman, Phil Alden Robinson', 'Chris O''Donnell, Gene Hackman, Faye Dunaway, Robert Prosky, Lela Rochon, Bo Jackson, Millie Perkins, David Marshall Grant', 'R', 'Idealistic young attorney Adam Hall takes on the death row clemency case of his racist grandfather, Sam Cayhall, a former Ku Klux Klan member he has never met.', 'Idealistic young attorney Adam Hall takes on the death row clemency case of his racist grandfather, Sam Cayhall, a former Ku Klux Klan member he has never met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHwB9Fn2uBEkxkMZZxWpxMGrhL3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6346'),
  ('165915623889565161', 'The Chambermaid', 2019, 'Drama', 'Lila Avilés, Carlos Rossini', 'Lila Avilés, Juan Carlos Marquéz', 'Gabriela Cartol, Teresa Sánchez, Agustina Quinci, Marisa Villarruel, Clementina Guadarrama, Alan Uribe Villaruel, José Manuel Ramírez Gloria', null, 'Eve, a young chambermaid at a luxurious Mexico City hotel, confronts the monotony of long workdays with quiet examinations of forgotten belongings and budding friendships that nourish her newfound and determined dream for a better life.', 'Eve, a young chambermaid at a luxurious Mexico City hotel, confronts the monotony of long workdays with quiet examinations of forgotten belongings and budding friendships that nourish her newfound and determined dream for a better life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Dr1yp7540apLUtKU3n1MhE1f1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543760'),
  ('349801859064795052', 'The Chambermaid Lynn', 2015, 'Drama', 'Ingo Haeb, Sophie Maintigneux', 'Ingo Haeb', 'Vicky Krieps, Lena Lauzemis, Steffen Münster, Christian Aumer, Christine Schorn, Sonja Baum, Lisa Guth, Cornelia Dörr', null, 'Lynn Zapatek, a chambermaid in a large hotel, has a deathly fear of human interaction yet she craves intimacy. A chance encounter prompts her to emerge from her cocoon.', 'Lynn Zapatek, a chambermaid in a large hotel, has a deathly fear of human interaction yet she craves intimacy. A chance encounter prompts her to emerge from her cocoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYlYPlUWvNKUxdhW3hMPHRFTNSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293069'),
  ('145598799582286157', 'The Chambermaid on the Titanic', 1997, 'Romance, Drama', 'Bigas Luna', 'Cuca Canals, Jean-Louis Benoît', 'Olivier Martinez, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Romane Bohringer, Didier Bezace, Aldo Maccione, Jean-Marie Juan, Arno Chevrier, Marianne Groves', null, 'Horty, a French foundry worker, wins a contest and is sent to see the sailing of the Titanic. In England, Marie, saying she is a chambermaid on the Titanic and cannot get a room, asks to share his room. They do, chastely; when he awakens, she is gone, but he sees her at the sailing and gets a photo of her. When he returns home, he suspects that his wife Zoe has been sleeping with Simeon, the foundry owner. Horty goes to the bar, where his friends get him drunk and he starts telling an erotic fantasy of what happened with him and Marie, drawing a larger audience each night.', 'Horty, a French foundry worker, wins a contest and is sent to see the sailing of the Titanic. In England, Marie, saying she is a chambermaid on the Titanic and cannot get a room, asks to share his room. They do, chastely; when he awakens, she is gone, but he sees her at the sailing and gets a photo of her. When he returns home, he suspects that his wife Zoe has been sleeping with Simeon, the foundry owner. Horty goes to the bar, where his friends get him drunk and he starts telling an erotic fantasy of what happened with him and Marie, drawing a larger audience each night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4frEECepz84DjgB7clmwBOXldE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115872'),
  ('250988779414674140', 'The Chameleon Slayer', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Josée Dayan, Stefan Ivanov', 'Sylvain Saada', 'Catherine Frot, Jeanne Balibar, Julie Depardieu, Jérôme Kircher, Jacques Bonnaffé, Philippe du Janerand, Brigitte Chamarande, Brigitte Aubry', null, 'Pattern never changes. She finds lonely, anonymous, almost invisible women doing menial jobs, becomes their friend and confidante and then kills them and takes their identity, their job and their apartment. Police investigator Judith Corel serves as bait in an attempt to trap the chameleon killer.', 'Pattern never changes. She finds lonely, anonymous, almost invisible women doing menial jobs, becomes their friend and confidante and then kills them and takes their identity, their job and their apartment. Police investigator Judith Corel serves as bait in an attempt to trap the chameleon killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zL5xXFDm5vINOQAESv5Emk9YuDQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443136'),
  ('734133976917273379', 'The Champ', 1931, 'Drama, Family', 'King Vidor, Gordon Avil, Robert A. Golden', 'Frances Marion, Leonard Praskins', 'Wallace Beery, Jackie Cooper, Irene Rich, Roscoe Ates, Edward Brophy, Hale Hamilton, Jesse Scott, Marcia Mae Jones', 'NR', 'A broken-down alcoholic prizefighter struggles to keep custody of his adoring son.', 'A broken-down alcoholic prizefighter struggles to keep custody of his adoring son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5miye3zystUco0k4WtN5cKoKJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42816'),
  ('241740742986144281', 'The Champ', 1979, 'Drama', 'Franco Zeffirelli, Fred J. Koenekamp, David Silver', 'Walter Newman', 'Jon Voight, Faye Dunaway, Rick Schroder, Jack Warden, Arthur Hill, Strother Martin, Joan Blondell, Mary Jo Catlett', null, 'Billy used to be a great boxer, but he''s settled into a hardscrabble life that revolves around drinking, training horses, and the one bright spot in his existence — his young son, T.J. Although Billy has had custody of T.J. since his wife, Annie, left the family years ago, her return prompts a new struggle for the former fighter. Determined to hold on to his son, Billy gets back into the ring to try and recapture his past success.', 'Billy used to be a great boxer, but he''s settled into a hardscrabble life that revolves around drinking, training horses, and the one bright spot in his existence — his young son, T.J. Although Billy has had custody of T.J. since his wife, Annie, left the family years ago, her return prompts a new struggle for the former fighter. Determined to hold on to his son, Billy gets back into the ring to try and recapture his past success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GyHL4TftI4SKVA8Jj9JpthhIu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30547'),
  ('90618823184635638', 'The Champagne Murders', 1967, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier, Vincent Gardair', 'Derek Prouse, Paul Gégauff, Claude Brulé', 'Anthony Perkins, Maurice Ronet, Yvonne Furneaux, Stéphane Audran, Annie Vidal, Henry Jones, Catherine Sola, George Skaff', 'NR', 'A champagne tycoon''s partner suspects his partner''s gigolo husband of murders he''s been framed for.', 'A champagne tycoon''s partner suspects his partner''s gigolo husband of murders he''s been framed for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XywxqcN7OS3Q5onQdlZe35zg5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74399'),
  ('481615410521417299', 'The Champion', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Leonardo D''Agostini, Michele Paradisi, Francesca Borromeo', 'Giulia Louise Steigerwalt', 'Stefano Accorsi, Andrea Carpenzano, Ludovica Martino, Anita Caprioli, Mario Sgueglia, Massimo Popolizio, Yuliia Sobol, Douglas Dean', null, 'Christian is an extremely talented as well as unpredictable football player. After his latest screw-up, the president of his team decides to assign him a personal tutor, to help him in controlling his temper. Valerio is a shy and solitary professor, the exact opposite of the champion. Sparks will fly between the two at first, but soon their relationship will change both for the better.', 'Christian is an extremely talented as well as unpredictable football player. After his latest screw-up, the president of his team decides to assign him a personal tutor, to help him in controlling his temper. Valerio is a shy and solitary professor, the exact opposite of the champion. Sparks will fly between the two at first, but soon their relationship will change both for the better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUaxotl1o4caOM9aG540ZymAdhs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589524'),
  ('307628620561611940', 'The Champion', 2021, 'Drama, History, War', 'Witold Płóciennik, Maciej Barczewski, Aleksander Kowalski', 'Maciej Barczewski', 'Piotr Głowacki, Jan Szydłowski, Grzegorz Małecki, Marcin Bosak, Marcin Czarnik, Marek Kasprzyk, Piotr Witkowski, Marian Dziędziel', null, 'It is 1940. The first transport of prisoners arrives at the newly created concentration camp Auschwitz. One of them is Tadeusz “Teddy” Pietrzykowski, pre-war boxing champion of Warsaw. The camp officers force him to fight in the ring for his and other prisoners’ lives. However, his every win strengthens the hope that Nazis are not invincible. Auschwitz officers notice the growing resistance. The confrontation with the authorities of the camp becomes inevitable.', 'It is 1940. The first transport of prisoners arrives at the newly created concentration camp Auschwitz. One of them is Tadeusz “Teddy” Pietrzykowski, pre-war boxing champion of Warsaw. The camp officers force him to fight in the ring for his and other prisoners’ lives. However, his every win strengthens the hope that Nazis are not invincible. Auschwitz officers notice the growing resistance. The confrontation with the authorities of the camp becomes inevitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY0Rs6CJwr9VFe8pXzN34jhCKTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845875'),
  ('137712215569829374', 'The Champion', 2024, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Carlos Therón, Imanol Nabea', 'Joan Gual, Joaquín Oristrell', 'Dani Rovira, Swit Eme, Pablo Chiapella, Luis Fernández, Cintia García, Carlos Librado "Nene", Pedro Romero, Pere Brasó', null, 'Diego has just been voted best young player in Europe and at the age of 20 he is on his way to making his team, Atlético de Madrid, champions of La Liga. But his impulsive and conflictive character makes the club, fed up with his excesses, hire Álex, a withdrawn and lonely psychology professor, to improve his behaviour. The two will have no choice but to learn to understand each other.', 'Diego has just been voted best young player in Europe and at the age of 20 he is on his way to making his team, Atlético de Madrid, champions of La Liga. But his impulsive and conflictive character makes the club, fed up with his excesses, hire Álex, a withdrawn and lonely psychology professor, to improve his behaviour. The two will have no choice but to learn to understand each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBftPyDCfxZ9XD5J5X6LYzFzZYK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1062323'),
  ('847610723869386206', 'The Champions', 1983, 'Action, Comedy', 'Brandy Yuen Jan-Yeung, Ma Koon-Wah, Sung Gwong-Wa', 'Brandy Yuen Jan-Yeung', 'Yuen Biao, Cheung Kwok-Keung, Moon Lee Choi-Fung, Dick Wei, Chang Ching-Po, Eddy Ko Hung, Gam Biu, Tong Tin-Hei', null, 'An acrobatic country hick is forced flee his village after injuring a wealthy socialite during an innocent competition. Fresh off the boat, he runs into a struggling football team who discover his talents.', 'An acrobatic country hick is forced flee his village after injuring a wealthy socialite during an innocent competition. Fresh off the boat, he runs into a struggling football team who discover his talents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJaRyNUTG2bxaaftFSGSDDBpWBq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231017'),
  ('64806845631636690', 'The Champions Five Supermen', 1972, 'Action', 'Federico Curiel', 'Ramón Obón', 'Blue Demon, Aarón Rodríguez Arellano, El Rayo de Jalisco, El Fantasma Blanco, El Avispon Escarlata, Yolanda Liévana, Julio César Agrasánchez, Carlos Blanco', null, 'The Champions against an army of rats turned into people.', 'The Champions against an army of rats turned into people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7tRBnLbCZCPwUBgGVilO5XypQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463488'),
  ('961070460737628129', 'The Champions League', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Giulio Base, Raffaele Androsiglio', 'Giulio Base', 'Massimo Boldi, Max Tortora, Massimo Ceccherini, Anna Maria Barbera, Loredana De Nardis, Matthew T. Reynolds, Pia Lanciotti, Livio Beshir', null, 'Two men must struggle to travel to Prague for Champions League Football Final match.', 'Two men must struggle to travel to Prague for Champions League Football Final match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYCdGMJfonAo7YtsfrvhkLPpjNR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393868'),
  ('309416672100633648', 'The Champions of Justice', 1971, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Federico Curiel', null, 'Blue Demon, Aarón Rodríguez Arellano, El Médico Asesino, Alejandro Cruz, Tinieblas, David Silva, Elsa Cárdenas, Jorge Pinguino', null, 'Blue Demon and pals square off against the Black Hand''s army of super powered midgets. Five luchadores (Blue Demon, Mil Mascaras, El Medico Asesino, La Sombra Vengadora, Tinieblas plus Black Shadow) face off against a mad scientist and his army of powerful wrestling midgets.', 'Blue Demon and pals square off against the Black Hand''s army of super powered midgets. Five luchadores (Blue Demon, Mil Mascaras, El Medico Asesino, La Sombra Vengadora, Tinieblas plus Black Shadow) face off against a mad scientist and his army of powerful wrestling midgets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lye9cG2S4fUShSEevqcg3KtQ0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98131'),
  ('128392404568649107', 'The Champions of Mexican Wrestling', 2008, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Eddie Mort', 'Keith J. Rainville', 'Gabriel Basurto, Eduardo Giaccardi, Gerardo Vázquez, Iliana Fox, Andrés Palacios, Lux Interior', null, 'Dragon Rojo Jr., Mr. Profesional, ¡Sorpresa!, Rayo X and TseTse Fly are five friends who, with their fabulous wrestling skills, try to defend in the ring a village being attacked by a group of monstrous rudos (bad guy wrestlers) under the leadership of Rey Extremo. By the creators of ¡Mucha Lucha!', 'Dragon Rojo Jr., Mr. Profesional, ¡Sorpresa!, Rayo X and TseTse Fly are five friends who, with their fabulous wrestling skills, try to defend in the ring a village being attacked by a group of monstrous rudos (bad guy wrestlers) under the leadership of Rey Extremo. By the creators of ¡Mucha Lucha!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rob6cgu3f7DDmOiwvjMZLzltzsY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347150'),
  ('477456655039762865', 'The Change-Up', 2011, 'Comedy', 'David Dobkin, Eric Alan Edwards, Ian Gracie', 'Jon Lucas, Scott Moore', 'Jason Bateman, Ryan Reynolds, Leslie Mann, Olivia Wilde, Alan Arkin, Gregory Itzin, Mircea Monroe, Sydney Rouviere', 'R', 'Lifelong friends Dave and Mitch are envious of the other''s life. Mitch thinks Dave has it all: a beautiful, loving family and a high-paying job at a prestigious law firm. But Dave thinks Mitch’s stress-free playboy life without obligation or consequence is the real dream come true. One fateful drunken night, they both admit that they wish they had the other’s life while peeing in a fountain when lightning strikes. The next morning, they wake up, hungover, in each other’s bodies! With time not on their side, Mitch and Dave comically struggle to avoid completely destroying each other’s lives before they can find a way to get their old ones back.', 'Lifelong friends Dave and Mitch are envious of the other''s life. Mitch thinks Dave has it all: a beautiful, loving family and a high-paying job at a prestigious law firm. But Dave thinks Mitch’s stress-free playboy life without obligation or consequence is the real dream come true. One fateful drunken night, they both admit that they wish they had the other’s life while peeing in a fountain when lightning strikes. The next morning, they wake up, hungover, in each other’s bodies! With time not on their side, Mitch and Dave comically struggle to avoid completely destroying each other’s lives before they can find a way to get their old ones back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iV6ARQZyGpjygtzFMdWH9U1Lj9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49520'),
  ('1126085188766590487', 'The Changeling', 1980, 'Horror', 'Peter Medak, John Coquillon, Ted Voigtlander', 'William Gray, Diana Maddox', 'George C. Scott, Trish Van Devere, Melvyn Douglas, John Colicos, Barry Morse, Madeleine Sherwood, Helen Burns, Eric Christmas', 'R', 'After a tragic event happens, composer John Russell moves to Seattle to try to overcome it and build a new and peaceful life in a lonely big house that has been uninhabited for many years. But, soon after, the obscure history of such an old mansion and his own past begin to haunt him.', 'After a tragic event happens, composer John Russell moves to Seattle to try to overcome it and build a new and peaceful life in a lonely big house that has been uninhabited for many years. But, soon after, the obscure history of such an old mansion and his own past begin to haunt him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4nTYj3JZ5jWAhDgrmEhW2GRAzb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13550'),
  ('812656522512377045', 'The Changeover', 2017, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Horror', 'Stuart McKenzie, Miranda Harcourt, Andrew Stroud', 'Stuart McKenzie', 'Timothy Spall, Melanie Lynskey, Lucy Lawless, Nicholas Galitzine, Erana James, Kate Harcourt, Benji Purchase, Ella Edward', 'PG-13', 'Laura Chant, 16, lives with her mother and four-year-old brother Jacko in a poor new suburb on the edge of a partially demolished Christchurch, New Zealand. Laura is drawn into a supernatural battle with an ancient spirit who attacks Jacko and slowly drains the life out of him as the spirit becomes ever younger. Laura discovers her true identity and the supernatural ability within her, and must harness it to save her brother''s life.', 'Laura Chant, 16, lives with her mother and four-year-old brother Jacko in a poor new suburb on the edge of a partially demolished Christchurch, New Zealand. Laura is drawn into a supernatural battle with an ancient spirit who attacks Jacko and slowly drains the life out of him as the spirit becomes ever younger. Laura discovers her true identity and the supernatural ability within her, and must harness it to save her brother''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfXRe0oE2A6JnbmBUNyr0pfRkFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426034'),
  ('298273744315886609', 'The Channel', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Martin Rit, Thierry Binisti', 'Pierre Chosson, Sophie Gueydon', 'Alice Isaaz, Adam Bessa, Ilan Debrabant, Catherine Salée, Carole Franck, Samy Lechea', null, 'Natacha (25), a young single parent who works as a fast-food waitress, struggles to raise her 8-year-old son Enzo. Torn between a strong desire for independence and the comfort that her mother Irène unfailingly wants to provide for them, Natacha feels trapped. Her encounter with Walid, who is waiting to save enough money to pay for his crossing to England will open new horizons for her.', 'Natacha (25), a young single parent who works as a fast-food waitress, struggles to raise her 8-year-old son Enzo. Torn between a strong desire for independence and the comfort that her mother Irène unfailingly wants to provide for them, Natacha feels trapped. Her encounter with Walid, who is waiting to save enough money to pay for his crossing to England will open new horizons for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHzoNZCIC0Ap0Oxc5NWowbJgx1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977553'),
  ('478053037729283993', 'The Chant of Jimmie Blacksmith', 1978, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Fred Schepisi, Ian Baker', 'Fred Schepisi', 'Tom E. Lewis, Freddy Reynolds, Ray Barrett, Jack Thompson, Don Crosby, Angela Punch McGregor, Steve Dodd, Peter Carroll', null, 'The true story of a part Aboriginal man who finds the pressure of adapting to white culture intolerable, and as a result snaps in a violent and horrific manner.', 'The true story of a part Aboriginal man who finds the pressure of adapting to white culture intolerable, and as a result snaps in a violent and horrific manner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbyEtX16Tk58WMeii5rVEfB1OUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69069'),
  ('1026546124154730353', 'The Chanting: Revisited', 2018, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Rizal Mantovani, Yadi Sugandi', 'Alim Sudio', 'Sandrinna Michelle, Aurélie Moeremans, Fero Walandouw, Nena Rosier, Andryan Sulaiman, Adlu Fahrezy, Ciara Nadine Brosnan, Ali Fikry', null, 'A group of kids agree to explore an abandon house in order to win a reality show contest, which requires them to prove that the stories of the evil Kuntilanak are real. They soon discover that the ghost is very much real when it appears from an old mirror and starts haunting them.', 'A group of kids agree to explore an abandon house in order to win a reality show contest, which requires them to prove that the stories of the evil Kuntilanak are real. They soon discover that the ghost is very much real when it appears from an old mirror and starts haunting them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pn3wmdsCTDLukJK1lDF68aJ2wVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524736'),
  ('689898014329348712', 'The Chaos Class', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ertem Eğilmez, Hüseyin Özşahin, Sami Güçlü', 'Umur Bugay', 'Münir Özkul, Tarık Akan, Kemal Sunal, Halit Akçatepe, Adile Naşit, Ahmet Arıman, Feridun Şavlı, Cengiz Nezir', null, 'Lazy, uneducated students mostly coming from money, share a very close band. They live together in the dormitory of this private highschool, where they daily plan their latest pranks on teachers or the other classes. When a new and obviously strict headmaster arrives, the students naturally try to overthrow him. A comic war of nitwits follows.', 'Lazy, uneducated students mostly coming from money, share a very close band. They live together in the dormitory of this private highschool, where they daily plan their latest pranks on teachers or the other classes. When a new and obviously strict headmaster arrives, the students naturally try to overthrow him. A comic war of nitwits follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2xLuEeZhy4uyiWIFT9D4mmyEA8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83651'),
  ('921474839077501049', 'The Chaos Class Again', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Doğa Can Anafarta', 'Ayşe Balıbey Tanıl, Evren Erdoğan', 'Altan Erkekli, Toygan Avanoğlu, Hande Katipoğlu, Sadi Celil Cengiz, Yusuf Çim, Özge Özaçar, Giray Altınok, Sami Aksu', null, 'A private boy''s school opts to become mixed, and male students must adjust to the presence of new female students.', 'A private boy''s school opts to become mixed, and male students must adjust to the presence of new female students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tIGirUEU44fqSZu9x6C5MizIc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594170'),
  ('163511075867101528', 'The Chaos Class Failed the Class', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Ertem Eğilmez, Sami Güçlü, Kartal Tibet', 'Sadık Şendil', 'Münir Özkul, Tarık Akan, Kemal Sunal, Adile Naşit, Halit Akçatepe, Semra Özdamar, Şener Şen, Ahmet Arıman', null, 'A young and beautiful female teacher starts working in an all boys high school.', 'A young and beautiful female teacher starts working in an all boys high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMfsVXGxJy2xh0FwUWcZ1XXDZus.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31534'),
  ('613436686842870104', 'The Chaos Class in the Military', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Ferdi Eğilmez', null, 'Mehmet Ali Erbil, Hülya Avşar, Halit Akçatepe, Şafak Sezer, Memet Ali Alabora, Peker Açıkalın, Cengiz Küçükayvaz, Melih Ekener', null, 'After the latest prank they pulled on Deli Bedri, the boys are sent to mandatory military service to learn discipline.', 'After the latest prank they pulled on Deli Bedri, the boys are sent to mandatory military service to learn discipline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8hfwQrvoUxg6Aey6KEXNQQfpYB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32313'),
  ('149328148056187933', 'The Chaos Class Is Fretting Over', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet', 'Sadık Şendil, Rıfat Ilgaz', 'Münir Özkul, Şener Şen, Adile Naşit, Perran Kutman, İlyas Salman, Şevket Altuğ, Zümrüt Cansel, Talip Güran', null, 'Lazy, uneducated students mostly coming from money, share a very close band. They live together in the dormitory of this private highschool, where they daily plan their latest pranks on teachers or the other classes. When one of the students get his girlfriend pregnant, the whole class acts together to help him. The mother has to leave the baby for a while with the father, and this leads to a series of funny events.', 'Lazy, uneducated students mostly coming from money, share a very close band. They live together in the dormitory of this private highschool, where they daily plan their latest pranks on teachers or the other classes. When one of the students get his girlfriend pregnant, the whole class acts together to help him. The mother has to leave the baby for a while with the father, and this leads to a series of funny events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odAZRy6re7Sj97sqXrfe6e2Ay37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83655'),
  ('220893562333487515', 'The Chaos Class Is on Vacation', 1977, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Ertem Eğilmez', 'Sadık Şendil', 'Münir Özkul, Kemal Sunal, Adile Naşit, Şener Şen, Ayşen Gruda, Sevda Aktolga, Avni Yalçın, Ertuğrul Bilda', null, 'Lazy, uneducated male students mostly coming from money, share a very close band. They live together in the dormitory of this private highschool, where they daily plan their latest pranks on teachers or the other classes. Because of the financial crisis, the headmaster agrees to enroll female students. As the new students try to fit in, a struggle between both parties start, trying to prank the other part away. The prank war continues until PE-Teacher decides to take the class out on a trip for a becoming scouts.', 'Lazy, uneducated male students mostly coming from money, share a very close band. They live together in the dormitory of this private highschool, where they daily plan their latest pranks on teachers or the other classes. Because of the financial crisis, the headmaster agrees to enroll female students. As the new students try to fit in, a struggle between both parties start, trying to prank the other part away. The prank war continues until PE-Teacher decides to take the class out on a trip for a becoming scouts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJCB6RL59Jx0opaRfNaLmdSUAHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31402'),
  ('487464577170830119', 'The Chaos Class Is Waking Up', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Ertem Eğilmez', 'Sadık Şendil', 'Münir Özkul, Kemal Sunal, Adile Naşit, Halit Akçatepe, Şener Şen, Ahmet Sezerel, Şevket Altuğ, Muharrem Gürses', null, 'A sincere and hardworking student joins the Chaos Class, but acceptance seems unlikely when he becomes the target of their pranks.', 'A sincere and hardworking student joins the Chaos Class, but acceptance seems unlikely when he becomes the target of their pranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6ysusBx8oBrbMXQEfD3leMmMHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31408'),
  ('497697525056580706', 'The Chaos Class: Bye Bye', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Ertem Eğilmez', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'İlyas Salman, Yaprak Özdemiroğlu, Mehmet Ali Erbil, Adile Naşit, Ayşen Gruda, Şevket Altuğ, Hüseyin Kutman, Savaş Dinçel', null, 'Lazy, uneducated students mostly coming from money, share a very close band. They live together in the dormitory of this private highschool, where they daily plan their latest pranks on teachers or the other classes. Especially, the new teacher for literature receives his share.', 'Lazy, uneducated students mostly coming from money, share a very close band. They live together in the dormitory of this private highschool, where they daily plan their latest pranks on teachers or the other classes. Especially, the new teacher for literature receives his share.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4p185nAApEDZGHeqRXJON3HbEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83656'),
  ('468949720401864662', 'The Chaos Class: Summer Games', 2021, 'Family, Comedy', 'Doğa Can Anafarta', 'Giray Altınok, Levent Çimen, Muammer Tali', 'Altan Erkekli, Toygan Avanoğlu, Yusuf Çim, Fırat Albayram, Mehmet Ali Erbil, Giray Altınok, Deniz Akkaya, Hakan Meriçliler', null, 'At a school tournament in Cyprus, Yakışıklı, Racon, Format and Dede wind up competing — and goofing off — on behalf of the Private Çamlıca School.', 'At a school tournament in Cyprus, Yakışıklı, Racon, Format and Dede wind up competing — and goofing off — on behalf of the Private Çamlıca School.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqzRg4ewAXLzbB6zH5rQQWg7YUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:859546'),
  ('320021768506602490', 'The Chapel', 2023, 'Horror, Drama', 'Carlota Pereda, Sara San Martín, Rita Noriega', 'Albert Bertran Bas, Carlota Pereda, Carmelo Viera', 'Maia Zaitegi, Belén Rueda, Josean Bengoetxea, Loreto Mauleón, Jon Olivares, Elena Irureta, Nagore Aranburu, María Barrios', null, 'Emma wants to learn how to communicate with the spirit of a girl who has been trapped in a hermitage for centuries, and to that end, she tries to persuade Carol, a sceptical medium, to help her.', 'Emma wants to learn how to communicate with the spirit of a girl who has been trapped in a hermitage for centuries, and to that end, she tries to persuade Carol, a sceptical medium, to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hUc6E3akm7vWtEvUzY8Z5TaD02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1078928'),
  ('357702586268872504', 'The Chaperone', 2011, 'Comedy, Family, Action', 'Stephen Herek, Kenneth Zunder', 'S.J. Roth', 'Paul Levesque, Ariel Winter, Kevin Corrigan, José Zúñiga, Kevin Rankin, Annabeth Gish, Ashley Taylor, Enrico Colantoni', 'PG-13', 'An ex-con on the run from his criminal past, hides out from those he ratted on by chaperoning a field trip to New Orleans.', 'An ex-con on the run from his criminal past, hides out from those he ratted on by chaperoning a field trip to New Orleans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5IKZ3V5OF1Feake5w1aVxIsV8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54557'),
  ('538931217594865855', 'The Chaplin Revue', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Jerome Epstein, Charlie Chaplin, Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Albert Austin, Henry Bergman, Kitty Bradbury, Syd Chaplin, Tom Murray, Edna Purviance, Charles Reisner', null, 'Three Chaplin silent comedies "A Dog''s Life", "Shoulder Arms", and "The Pilgrim" are strung together to form a single feature length film. Chaplin provides new music, narration, and a small amount of new connecting material. "Shoulder Arms" is now described as taking place in a time before "the atom bomb".', 'Three Chaplin silent comedies "A Dog''s Life", "Shoulder Arms", and "The Pilgrim" are strung together to form a single feature length film. Chaplin provides new music, narration, and a small amount of new connecting material. "Shoulder Arms" is now described as taking place in a time before "the atom bomb".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Z3SUitp5xVz8hiIgqz5yjDUIgx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554678'),
  ('546855876962174980', 'The Chapman Report', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'George Cukor, James T. Vaughn, Sergei Petschnikoff', 'Don Mankiewicz, Wyatt Cooper', 'Efrem Zimbalist Jr., Shelley Winters, Jane Fonda, Claire Bloom, Glynis Johns, Ray Danton, Ty Hardin, Andrew Duggan', 'NR', 'A research psychologist gets involved in the personal lives of four women.', 'A research psychologist gets involved in the personal lives of four women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHlkaDldivwkL9H8qOmb2zyXqNo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118955'),
  ('293336787834737380', 'The Charge of the Light Brigade', 1936, 'Drama, Adventure, War', 'Michael Curtiz, Sol Polito, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Michael Jacoby, Rowland Leigh', 'Errol Flynn, Olivia de Havilland, Patric Knowles, Henry Stephenson, Nigel Bruce, Donald Crisp, David Niven, C. Henry Gordon', 'NR', 'In 1853, as the British and Russian empires compete to gain and maintain their place in the dreadful Great Game of political intrigues and alliances whose greatest prize is the domination of India and the border territories, Major Geoffrey Vickers must endure several betrayals and misfortunes before he can achieve his revenge at the Balaclava Heights, on October 25, 1854, the most glorious day of the Crimean War.', 'In 1853, as the British and Russian empires compete to gain and maintain their place in the dreadful Great Game of political intrigues and alliances whose greatest prize is the domination of India and the border territories, Major Geoffrey Vickers must endure several betrayals and misfortunes before he can achieve his revenge at the Balaclava Heights, on October 25, 1854, the most glorious day of the Crimean War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7PFjyhEAWKGQ8g6cTGw4GzYKsa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43884'),
