  ('629976983252130148', 'The Charlots Return', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Jean Sarrus', 'Jean Sarrus', 'Jean Sarrus, Gérard Filipelli, Luis Rego, Richard Bonnot, Guy Montagné, Canto e Castro, Ana Padrão, Jango Edwards', null, 'Antonio returned to Portugal ten years ago with his lovely (and quite thin) French wife. She has since become quite a hefty specimen of womanhood, and his eye has lately been wandering to others. When his strong-tempered wife catches him with another woman (their neighbor), she bonks him on the head. In order to avoid further embarrassment, he pretends this has induced amnesia. He does so well in his pretense that his worried wife calls his old Parisian buddies (the rest of the Charlots) and asks them to come and help revive his memory.', 'Antonio returned to Portugal ten years ago with his lovely (and quite thin) French wife. She has since become quite a hefty specimen of womanhood, and his eye has lately been wandering to others. When his strong-tempered wife catches him with another woman (their neighbor), she bonks him on the head. In order to avoid further embarrassment, he pretends this has induced amnesia. He does so well in his pretense that his worried wife calls his old Parisian buddies (the rest of the Charlots) and asks them to come and help revive his memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ct0IoCo9wxZPIA8BHDt5Q3EOoCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62663'),
  ('709891710120566214', 'The Charterhouse of Parma', 1948, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christian-Jaque, Romolo Garroni, Nicolas Hayer', 'Christian-Jaque, Pierre Jarry, Pierre Véry', 'Gérard Philipe, Renée Faure, María Casares, Louis Salou, Louis Seigner, Tullio Carminati, Lucien Coëdel, Aldo Silvani', null, 'This adaptation of Stendhal''s timeless masterpiece of French literature tells the tale of Fabrice Del Dongo (Grard Philipe) a young archibishop who gives his heart and soul to romance rather than to the Church creating upheaval in the lives of evergone around him the Countess of Sanseverine (Maria Casares) is but one of the may women who love him. In turn she incurs jealous retributions from those in high places who desire her. For his crimes Fabrice is thrown in Prison where from Crimes Fabrice is thrown in prison where form his lonely window he falls in love with his jailer s daughter and plans a daring escape she however calls his plan insane and takes a vow to the Virgin Mary to never see him again ever if his escape succeeds the Charterhouse of Parma explodes with conflicting desires man s desire form God vs. his desire for romance.', 'This adaptation of Stendhal''s timeless masterpiece of French literature tells the tale of Fabrice Del Dongo (Grard Philipe) a young archibishop who gives his heart and soul to romance rather than to the Church creating upheaval in the lives of evergone around him the Countess of Sanseverine (Maria Casares) is but one of the may women who love him. In turn she incurs jealous retributions from those in high places who desire her. For his crimes Fabrice is thrown in Prison where from Crimes Fabrice is thrown in prison where form his lonely window he falls in love with his jailer s daughter and plans a daring escape she however calls his plan insane and takes a vow to the Virgin Mary to never see him again ever if his escape succeeds the Charterhouse of Parma explodes with conflicting desires man s desire form God vs. his desire for romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5K39lhLx94u7j0tBzkNVtfePUtU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65657'),
  ('209072133379914173', 'The Chase', 1946, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Franz Planer, Arthur Ripley, Jack Voglin', 'Philip Yordan', 'Robert Cummings, Michèle Morgan, Steve Cochran, Peter Lorre, Lloyd Corrigan, Jack Holt, Don Wilson, Alex Minotis', null, 'Chuck Scott gets a job as chauffeur to tough guy Eddie Roman; but Chuck''s involvement with Eddie''s fearful wife becomes a nightmare.', 'Chuck Scott gets a job as chauffeur to tough guy Eddie Roman; but Chuck''s involvement with Eddie''s fearful wife becomes a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTlMQv1xnnuJha3vMa3LPH8QSxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29100'),
  ('985472277773660497', 'The Chase', 1966, 'Crime, Drama', 'Joseph LaShelle, Arthur Penn, Russell Saunders', 'Lillian Hellman', 'Marlon Brando, Jane Fonda, Robert Redford, E.G. Marshall, Angie Dickinson, Janice Rule, Miriam Hopkins, Martha Hyer', 'NR', 'The escape of Bubber Reeves from prison affects the inhabitants of a small Southern town.', 'The escape of Bubber Reeves from prison affects the inhabitants of a small Southern town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpX8szjdzaXqxKBiV8xfRVNzSiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31602'),
  ('234302337237313066', 'The Chase', 1994, 'Adventure, Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Adam Rifkin, Alan Jones, Donald Sparks', 'Adam Rifkin', 'Charlie Sheen, Kristy Swanson, Henry Rollins, Rocky Carroll, Ray Wise, Cary Elwes, Flea, Anthony Kiedis', 'PG-13', 'Jack Hammond is sentenced to life in prison, but manages to escape. To get away from the police he takes a girl as hostage and drives off in her car. The girl happens to be the only daughter of one of the richest men in the state. In a while the car chase is being broadcast live on every TV-channel.', 'Jack Hammond is sentenced to life in prison, but manages to escape. To get away from the police he takes a girl as hostage and drives off in her car. The girl happens to be the only daughter of one of the richest men in the state. In a while the car chase is being broadcast live on every TV-channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEmGW4Fc9wMRLIKq6NRojZnTbdp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10694'),
  ('910668180609763726', 'The Chase', 2017, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Choi Joo-young, Kim Hong-sun, Lim Byeong-woo', 'Yoo Gap-yeol, Kim Hong-sun, Lee Young-jong', 'Baek Yoon-sik, Sung Dong-il, Bae Jong-ok, Son Jong-hak, Kim Hye-in, Jo Dal-hwan, Lee Kan-hee, Park Hyoung-soo', null, 'After people in his town start turning up dead, a grumpy landlord is visited by a man who recounts an unsolved serial murder case from 30 years ago that may hold the clue to what is happening now.', 'After people in his town start turning up dead, a grumpy landlord is visited by a man who recounts an unsolved serial murder case from 30 years ago that may hold the clue to what is happening now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZPJ0b73HhbwMzeyucC56HUOOXh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488621'),
  ('277161888285783608', 'The Chase', 2024, 'Thriller, Action', 'David Koch, Charlotte Trunet, Vanille Collienne', 'Juan Carlos Medina', 'Sami Bouajila, Julie Gayet, Anne Azoulay, Yannick Choirat, Manon Azem, Dimitri Storoge, Marilyne Canto, Gilles Cohen', null, '11 years ago, inspector Malik couldn’t solve a kidnapping case and a little girl died. Now with only a few days before the crime gets classified, he decides to reopen the case. Malik owes it to the mother and to himself. As he digs into the past, a child is kidnapped again. The pattern is the same one as a decade ago, it’s no coincidence. Malik knows he has a few days to make things right and to bring justice.', '11 years ago, inspector Malik couldn’t solve a kidnapping case and a little girl died. Now with only a few days before the crime gets classified, he decides to reopen the case. Malik owes it to the mother and to himself. As he digs into the past, a child is kidnapped again. The pattern is the same one as a decade ago, it’s no coincidence. Malik knows he has a few days to make things right and to bring justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foyiQu23zq4WhmffnQkFiNAvqcJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025527'),
  ('551914228061995599', 'The Chaser', 1928, 'Comedy', 'Harry Langdon', 'Robert Eddy, Clarence Hennecke, Harry McCoy', 'Harry Langdon, Gladys McConnell, Helen Hayward, Bud Jamison, Charles Thurston, Frank Brownlee', null, 'A wife, tired of her husband''s non-stop carousing, sues him for divorce. The judge, however, comes up with a novel solution--he makes the husband take his wife''s place in the household--including dressing like her--for 30 days to see what it''s like to be his wife.', 'A wife, tired of her husband''s non-stop carousing, sues him for divorce. The judge, however, comes up with a novel solution--he makes the husband take his wife''s place in the household--including dressing like her--for 30 days to see what it''s like to be his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iG5gwY7GVpb8KMQSzkJi8sheeXP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208061'),
  ('443874334828536238', 'The Chaser', 2008, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Lee Seong-je, Na Hong-jin', 'Shinho Lee, Hong Won-chan, Na Hong-jin', 'Kim Yun-seok, Ha Jung-woo, Seo Young-hee, Kim Yoo-jung, Jeong In-gi, Park Hyo-ju, Jo Deok-jae, Choi Jung-woo', 'PG-13', 'Joong-ho is a dirty detective turned pimp, who''s in financial trouble as several of his girls have recently disappeared without clearing their debts. While trying to track them down, he finds a clue that the vanished girls were all called up by the same client, whom one of his girls is meeting with right now.', 'Joong-ho is a dirty detective turned pimp, who''s in financial trouble as several of his girls have recently disappeared without clearing their debts. While trying to track them down, he finds a clue that the vanished girls were all called up by the same client, whom one of his girls is meeting with right now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hy49xJiKN1nakkN1ZmKuOf6vQYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13855'),
  ('1067594268111491218', 'The Chasers', 1959, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Erik Løchen', 'Erik Løchen', 'Rolf Søder, Bente Børsum, Tor Stokke, Carsten Byhring, Olafr Havrevold, Harald Aimarsen, Anders Boger, Bjarne Bø', null, 'A love triangle of two men who desire the same woman. We follow them through three days of grouse hunting, a chase that ends violently. Or does it?', 'A love triangle of two men who desire the same woman. We follow them through three days of grouse hunting, a chase that ends violently. Or does it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIqAWfTcElyYeepcypTtQn5D5Zn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102913'),
  ('317704529710061964', 'The Chasing World', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Issei Shibata, Shin Hayasaka', 'Issei Shibata', 'Takuya Ishida, Mitsuki Tanimura, Shunsuke Daitoh, Rio Matsumoto, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Akira Emoto', null, 'A teenager is transported to a parallel world where everyone who shares his family name is being hunted down by the dictatorial government.', 'A teenager is transported to a parallel world where everyone who shares his family name is being hunted down by the dictatorial government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pEF9GHI8wnXxRll2UvuedVVvXZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69726'),
  ('694095160547605122', 'The Cheap Detective', 1978, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Robert Moore, John A. Alonzo', 'Neil Simon', 'Peter Falk, Ann-Margret, Eileen Brennan, Sid Caesar, Stockard Channing, James Coco, Dom DeLuise, Louise Fletcher', 'PG', 'A spoof of the entire 1940s detective genre. San Francisco private detective, Lou Pekinpaugh is accused of murdering his partner at the instigation of his mistress—his partner''s wife.', 'A spoof of the entire 1940s detective genre. San Francisco private detective, Lou Pekinpaugh is accused of murdering his partner at the instigation of his mistress—his partner''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7poVN0zQuxCIorAR9N6JDJN0dGG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14584'),
  ('1046749920207105362', 'The Cheat', 1915, 'Drama', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Alvin Wyckoff', 'Jeanie Macpherson, Jeanie Macpherson', 'Fannie Ward, Sessue Hayakawa, Jack Dean, James Neill, Yutaka Abe, Dana Ong, Hazel Childers, Arthur H. Williams', 'NR', 'A venal, spoiled stockbroker''s wife impulsively embezzles $10,000 from the charity she chairs and desperately turns to a Burmese ivory trader to replace the stolen money.', 'A venal, spoiled stockbroker''s wife impulsively embezzles $10,000 from the charity she chairs and desperately turns to a Burmese ivory trader to replace the stolen money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cnktg7gG1HutqKQ47jgcAWsP9R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70368'),
  ('951903546358222307', 'The Cheat', 1931, 'Drama', 'George Abbott, George J. Folsey', 'Harry Hervey', 'Tallulah Bankhead, Harvey Stephens, Irving Pichel, Jay Fassett, Ann Andrews, William Ingersoll, Hanaki Yoshiwara, Willard Dashiell', 'NR', 'Elsa Carlyle is impulsive and a gambler. Though loved by her husband Jeff, she''s spoiled and selfish, concerned with social standing. Meanwhile, Jeff wants to stop spending while he completes business deals that could make them rich. One night, on a hunch, she bets and loses big at a casino, and then she doubles her problems with more impulsive decisions. Hardy Livingstone, a wealthy Casanova just back from the Orient, makes a play for her. Elsa dallies with Hardy, but soon, his insistence and her dire financial affairs seem destined to lead to adultery. Who''s the cheat?', 'Elsa Carlyle is impulsive and a gambler. Though loved by her husband Jeff, she''s spoiled and selfish, concerned with social standing. Meanwhile, Jeff wants to stop spending while he completes business deals that could make them rich. One night, on a hunch, she bets and loses big at a casino, and then she doubles her problems with more impulsive decisions. Hardy Livingstone, a wealthy Casanova just back from the Orient, makes a play for her. Elsa dallies with Hardy, but soon, his insistence and her dire financial affairs seem destined to lead to adultery. Who''s the cheat?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZoDYjyZ7RY8CV8cGYI1M135Srp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156324'),
