  ('736145390552315463', 'The Chef''s Wife', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Anne Le Ny, Jérôme Alméras', 'Anne Le Ny', 'Karin Viard, Emmanuelle Devos, Roschdy Zem, Philippe Rebbot, Anne Le Ny, Philippe Fretun, Annie Mercier, Marion Lecrivain', null, 'The wife of a successful chef feels unfulfilled in her rôle as dining-room hostess and consults career counselor, who is herself dissatisfied by her useful but mundane place in the scheme of things. Without meaning to, the two women find their lives growing tangled together, with ever more complex tragicomic consequences.', 'The wife of a successful chef feels unfulfilled in her rôle as dining-room hostess and consults career counselor, who is herself dissatisfied by her useful but mundane place in the scheme of things. Without meaning to, the two women find their lives growing tangled together, with ever more complex tragicomic consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liCeyrVWivCadzF8O1tnTuYuknu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270342'),
  ('793914014615026114', 'The Cherokee Kid', 1996, 'Western, Action, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Jack Conroy, Paris Barclay', 'Denise DeClue, Tim Kazurinsky', 'Sinbad, James Coburn, Burt Reynolds, A Martinez, Gregory Hines, Ernie Hudson, Mark Pellegrino, Vanessa Bell Calloway', 'PG-13', 'Isaih Turner didn’t want to be a hero-all he wanted was revenge. Orphaned when both his parents were cruelly murdered by the wealthy and powerful Cyrus Bloomington, the young Isaiah grew up with one air in mind: to find the man who killed his folks and take him down.', 'Isaih Turner didn’t want to be a hero-all he wanted was revenge. Orphaned when both his parents were cruelly murdered by the wealthy and powerful Cyrus Bloomington, the young Isaiah grew up with one air in mind: to find the man who killed his folks and take him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGjtGuCvB0qMSG37OUey1npx82l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56281'),
  ('857194532924110573', 'The Cheshire Murders', 2013, 'Documentary', 'David Heilbroner, Kate Davis', null, 'Marilyn Bartoli, Deb Biggins, Michael Daluz, Jeremiah Donovan, Bob Farr, William Gerace, Rebekah Greer-Carney, Marybelle Hawke', null, 'In the early-morning hours of July 23, 2007, in Cheshire, Conn., ex-convicts Steven Hayes and Joshua Komisarjevsky broke into the family home of William Petit, his wife, Jennifer, and their daughters, Michaela, 11, and Hayley, 17. Dr. Petit was beaten and tied to a pole in the basement. The three women were bound in their bedrooms while the men ransacked the house. The brutal ordeal continued throughout the morning, ending with rape, arson and a horrific triple homicide.', 'In the early-morning hours of July 23, 2007, in Cheshire, Conn., ex-convicts Steven Hayes and Joshua Komisarjevsky broke into the family home of William Petit, his wife, Jennifer, and their daughters, Michaela, 11, and Hayley, 17. Dr. Petit was beaten and tied to a pole in the basement. The three women were bound in their bedrooms while the men ransacked the house. The brutal ordeal continued throughout the morning, ending with rape, arson and a horrific triple homicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLV5rvsA4CK2zgbn7txFGPlhHfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209204'),
  ('392155831057585871', 'The Chess Player', 2017, 'History, Drama', 'Luis Oliveros, Juan Carlos Gómez', 'Julio Castedo', 'Marc Clotet, Melina Matthews, Alejo Sauras, Maarten Dannenberg, Andrés Gertrúdix, Lionel Auguste, Stefan Weinert, Martin Angerbauer', null, 'In 1934 Diego Padilla wins the Spanish Championship of Chess and meets a French journalist, Marianne Latour, and they fall in love. At the end of the Civil War, Marianne convinces Diego to live in France with their daughter, where shortly afterwards Diego will be accused of spying by the Nazis and imprisoned in an SS prison. In prison, Diego will try to survive in a hostile environment thanks to Colonel Maier''s passion for chess.', 'In 1934 Diego Padilla wins the Spanish Championship of Chess and meets a French journalist, Marianne Latour, and they fall in love. At the end of the Civil War, Marianne convinces Diego to live in France with their daughter, where shortly afterwards Diego will be accused of spying by the Nazis and imprisoned in an SS prison. In prison, Diego will try to survive in a hostile environment thanks to Colonel Maier''s passion for chess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/li4gwTyZAwbCR2lgxLMf2e0s7Ro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438421'),
  ('63629907070831512', 'The Chess Players', 1977, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Ashoke Bose, Ramesh Sen', 'Munshi Premchand', 'Sanjeev Kumar, Saeed Jaffrey, Amjad Khan, Shabana Azmi, Farida Jalal, Veena, David Abraham Cheulkar, Victor Banerjee', null, 'In the year 1856, Nawab Wajid Ali Shah is the King of Awadh, one of the last independent kingdoms of India. The British intend to control this rich land and send General Outram to clear way for an annexation. Pressure is mounting amidst intrigue and political maneuvers, but the Nawab whiles away his time in pursuit of pleasure and religious practice. The court is of no help either — noblemen Mir and Mirza ignore all duties and spend their days playing endless games of chess.', 'In the year 1856, Nawab Wajid Ali Shah is the King of Awadh, one of the last independent kingdoms of India. The British intend to control this rich land and send General Outram to clear way for an annexation. Pressure is mounting amidst intrigue and political maneuvers, but the Nawab whiles away his time in pursuit of pleasure and religious practice. The court is of no help either — noblemen Mir and Mirza ignore all duties and spend their days playing endless games of chess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fb0gA6K2xyWBuxMOweUmEHTjt6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80556'),
  ('921574208530956809', 'The Cheyenne Social Club', 1970, 'Western, Comedy', 'Gene Kelly, William H. Clothier', 'James Lee Barrett', 'James Stewart, Henry Fonda, Shirley Jones, Sue Ane Langdon, Elaine Devry, Robert Middleton, Arch Johnson, Dabbs Greer', 'PG', 'Two cowboys inherit a "social club" specializing in satisfying men.', 'Two cowboys inherit a "social club" specializing in satisfying men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bRm0ALG9yPO53Y2kKuPPV3irdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28303'),
  ('621806550150554549', 'The Chicken', 1965, 'Comedy, Family', 'Claude Berri, Ghislain Cloquet', null, 'Jacques Marin, Viviane Bourbonneux, Martin Serre', null, 'The Chicken [Le Poulet] is a 1965 French short comedy film directed by Claude Berri. The film follows a father, mother, and son who go to visit a chicken farm. The son catches and brings home a chicken. The father plans to eat it if the chicken doesn''t lay eggs. The boy aims to save the chicken and comedy ensues. It won an Oscar in 1966 for Best Short Subject.', 'The Chicken [Le Poulet] is a 1965 French short comedy film directed by Claude Berri. The film follows a father, mother, and son who go to visit a chicken farm. The son catches and brings home a chicken. The father plans to eat it if the chicken doesn''t lay eggs. The boy aims to save the chicken and comedy ensues. It won an Oscar in 1966 for Best Short Subject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dGsTYQOJU9YbBHPQFC3Nb1jp2x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34063'),
  ('926492263241828134', 'The Chicken from Outer Space', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'John R. Dilworth', 'John R. Dilworth', 'Howard Hoffman', null, 'An elderly couple''s dog must defend them from a malicious space chicken, bent on conquest by infecting them with mutagenic eggs. First this quiet farm in the middle of nowhere, next, the world!', 'An elderly couple''s dog must defend them from a malicious space chicken, bent on conquest by infecting them with mutagenic eggs. First this quiet farm in the middle of nowhere, next, the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iU7nWuRt41e4NdxI0RFB6B6SPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214163'),
  ('408411296279824936', 'The Chief of Chukotka', 1967, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, History', 'Vitaliy Melnikov, Eduard Rozovsky, Lev Makhtin', 'Vladimir Valutskiy, Viktor Rabinovich', 'Mikhail Kononov, Aleksei Gribov, Nikolai Volkov St., Pavel Pankov, Anatoly Korolkevich, Gennadi Danzanov, Pavel Vinnik, Stepan Krylov', null, 'Young patriotic young man ends up in the on Chukotka right after the civil war, where he intends to spread ideas of justice and equality among the natives. As it happens, instead he learn the local capitalist ways, and he start profitable fur trading with US, Japanese and other merchants.', 'Young patriotic young man ends up in the on Chukotka right after the civil war, where he intends to spread ideas of justice and equality among the natives. As it happens, instead he learn the local capitalist ways, and he start profitable fur trading with US, Japanese and other merchants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWlAz2mInrw4QH6vvddu2Ho9CsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89231'),
  ('818649597684331230', 'The Child', 1977, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Mori Alavi, Robert Voskanian', 'Ralph Lucas', 'Laurel Barnett, Rosalie Cole, Frank Janson, Richard Hanners, Ruth Ballan, Slosson Bing Jong, Rod Medigovich, Wendell Hudiburg', 'R', 'In early 20th century California, a young woman takes a job as a nanny to a young girl whose mother has recently died. On her way to the rural, secluded home, she meets a neighbor who warns her of the family''s reputation. She soon meets the crabby, morbid Mr. Nordon, his awkward son Len, and the aloof Rosalie; who can seemingly animate objects when she is angry.', 'In early 20th century California, a young woman takes a job as a nanny to a young girl whose mother has recently died. On her way to the rural, secluded home, she meets a neighbor who warns her of the family''s reputation. She soon meets the crabby, morbid Mr. Nordon, his awkward son Len, and the aloof Rosalie; who can seemingly animate objects when she is angry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUkNBWZPTvdP5THpXNjg2yjTPwM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83834'),
  ('672965443774166634', 'The Child', 2005, 'Drama', 'Luc Dardenne, Alain Marcoen, Jean-Pierre Dardenne', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne', 'Jérémie Renier, Déborah François, Olivier Gourmet, Jérémie Segard, Stéphane Bissot, François Olivier, Mireille Bailly, Fabrizio Rongione', 'R', 'A poor young Belgian mother wants her petty thief of a boyfriend to be gainfully employed to raise their newborn child, but he has other ideas.', 'A poor young Belgian mother wants her petty thief of a boyfriend to be gainfully employed to raise their newborn child, but he has other ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dk7ZpsVKLt2nwjQZZIde0WP4oQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11490'),
  ('893386854981233969', 'The Child', 2012, 'Thriller', 'Zsolt Bács', 'Brian Cordray, Zsolt Bács', 'Eric Roberts, Ben Becker, Christian Traeumer, Sunny Mabrey, Peter Greene, Yvonne Schäfer, Clemens Schick, Reiner Schöne', null, 'Simon Sachs, a terminally ill ten year old boy, claims to have been a serial killer in his previous life and apparently he can prove it. He leads a lawyer, Robert Stern, to the locations of the bodies, who were killed long before Simon was born. Stern takes on the most compelling and mysterious case of his life.', 'Simon Sachs, a terminally ill ten year old boy, claims to have been a serial killer in his previous life and apparently he can prove it. He leads a lawyer, Robert Stern, to the locations of the bodies, who were killed long before Simon was born. Stern takes on the most compelling and mysterious case of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDDw0NZGzoUbq6qwihEci6JKdQA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133183'),
  ('378678240086130393', 'The Child I Never Was', 2002, 'Drama, Crime', 'Egon Werdin, Kai S. Pieck', 'Kai S. Pieck', 'Tobias Schenke, Ulrike Bliefert, Walter Gontermann, Jürgen Christoph Kamcke, Sebastian Rüger, Stephan Szasz, Roland Riebeling, Sebastian Urzendowsky', null, 'A serial killer dispassionately discusses the nuts and bolts of his grisly avocation, as well as the youthful traumas which helped to mold him into a psychopath, in this disturbing independent drama from Germany, based on the true story of of Germany''s most famous child murderer Juergen Bartsch who, between the ages of 15 and 19, abused, tortured and killed four schoolboys in the Ruhr region of Germany from 1962 to 1966.', 'A serial killer dispassionately discusses the nuts and bolts of his grisly avocation, as well as the youthful traumas which helped to mold him into a psychopath, in this disturbing independent drama from Germany, based on the true story of of Germany''s most famous child murderer Juergen Bartsch who, between the ages of 15 and 19, abused, tortured and killed four schoolboys in the Ruhr region of Germany from 1962 to 1966.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riK4gY3REipRnMw06cUXTK4NEcN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4377'),
  ('744790144504632793', 'The Child in Time', 2018, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Julian Farino, Debbie Bowser, Emlyn Pool', 'Stephen Butchard', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Kelly Macdonald, Stephen Campbell Moore, Saskia Reeves, Andrea Hall, Jim Creighton, Beatrice White, Rosa-Marie Lewis', null, 'A successful writer of children''s books, Stephen Lewis is confronted with the unthinkable—he loses his only child, four-year-old Kate, in a supermarket. In one horrifying moment that replays itself over the years that follow, Stephen realises his daughter is gone. Kate''s absence sets Stephen and his wife on diverging paths as both struggle with an all-consuming grief.', 'A successful writer of children''s books, Stephen Lewis is confronted with the unthinkable—he loses his only child, four-year-old Kate, in a supermarket. In one horrifying moment that replays itself over the years that follow, Stephen realises his daughter is gone. Kate''s absence sets Stephen and his wife on diverging paths as both struggle with an all-consuming grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4bJtOuloUb495V2EWeSQC0VXP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448565'),
  ('326105266214610452', 'The Child of Paris', 1913, 'Drama', 'Léonce Perret', 'Léonce Perret', 'Léonce Perret, Louis Leubas, Maurice Lagrenée, Émile Keppens, Marc Gérard, Henri Duval, Marie Dorly, Suzanne Le Bret', null, 'The young daughter of an army captain missing in action runs away from school and is kidnapped by Parisian lowlifes. When the kidnapper flees to Nice with the child, the kind-hearted employee of one of his accomplices sets off in pursuit.', 'The young daughter of an army captain missing in action runs away from school and is kidnapped by Parisian lowlifes. When the kidnapper flees to Nice with the child, the kind-hearted employee of one of his accomplices sets off in pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/me87mIv1uKyn19pnS7kBSSPg3Rh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133940'),
  ('528299822893291174', 'The Child Prodigy', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Luc Dionne, Bruce Chun, Daniel Jobin', 'Luc Dionne', 'Patrick Drolet, Marc Labrèche, Macha Grenon, Lothaire Bluteau, Benoît Brière, Marc Béland, Patrice Coquereau, Françoise Faucher', null, 'On the keyboard, the young hands fly rapidly and the melody rises. For the child, nothing is easier; he hears the sounds in his head. These hands belong to 6 years old André Mathieu. He won his audiences and fired up concerts halls in London, New York, Paris and around the world. Adulated, hailed, praised, the child prodigy seemed to have everything to succeed. From the top of his vertiginous successes, to depths of torment, the life of the "Little Canadian Mozart" blends into his music. A romantic and passionate composer wishing for happiness, his story is nevertheless played on tragic notes.', 'On the keyboard, the young hands fly rapidly and the melody rises. For the child, nothing is easier; he hears the sounds in his head. These hands belong to 6 years old André Mathieu. He won his audiences and fired up concerts halls in London, New York, Paris and around the world. Adulated, hailed, praised, the child prodigy seemed to have everything to succeed. From the top of his vertiginous successes, to depths of torment, the life of the "Little Canadian Mozart" blends into his music. A romantic and passionate composer wishing for happiness, his story is nevertheless played on tragic notes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rdjEvsu3LmAV6inGEezowQ25tQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62120'),
  ('409272635922052804', 'The Child Snatcher: Manhunt', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Sam Budd', null, 'Aryria Drury, Melissa Hartzel, Sean Tizzard', null, 'First-hand testimonies tell the story of one of the UK''s largest murder investigations: hunting an unknown serial killer obsessed with abducting and murdering young girls.', 'First-hand testimonies tell the story of one of the UK''s largest murder investigations: hunting an unknown serial killer obsessed with abducting and murdering young girls.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:the-child-snatcher-manhunt'),
  ('115271491547772980', 'The Child Who Measured the World', 2024, 'Drama', 'Anna Nikolaou, Takis Candilis, Julie David', 'Takis Candilis, Karim Boukercha, Samy Baaroun', 'Bernard Campan, Maria Apostolakea, Fotinì Peluso, Raphael Brottier, Anna Tzanakaki, Stathis Kokkoris, Panos Kranidiotis, Metin Arditi', null, 'Alexandre Varda, a powerful property developer of Greek origin, finds his life suddenly turned upside down. On the same day, he is sacked by his sharhold- ers and learns of the death of his daughter, whom he has not seen for 12 years. When he arrives in Greece the next day to repatriate the body, he also discovers that he is the grandfather of a 9-year-old boy with autistic syndrome...', 'Alexandre Varda, a powerful property developer of Greek origin, finds his life suddenly turned upside down. On the same day, he is sacked by his sharhold- ers and learns of the death of his daughter, whom he has not seen for 12 years. When he arrives in Greece the next day to repatriate the body, he also discovers that he is the grandfather of a 9-year-old boy with autistic syndrome...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4T9i1X8OZcWkwqXsFH7UN0Ap5h0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118836'),
  ('40342120968795730', 'The Childe', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Jo Yong-Jun, Kim Hae-il, Kim Hong-mok', 'Park Hoon-jung', 'Kim Seon-ho, Kang Tae-ju, Kim Kang-woo, Go Ara, Jung Lael, Heo Joon-seok, Choi Jung-woo, Lee Ki-young', 'NR', 'Han, a Filipino-Korean boxer hits the final punch against his opponent at an illegal game and returns home with a few dollars to pay for his mother''s surgery.', 'Han, a Filipino-Korean boxer hits the final punch against his opponent at an illegal game and returns home with a few dollars to pay for his mother''s surgery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydC8ubFXQfkPJDhkduMhbE9mTz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1057001'),
  ('786704567195484487', 'The Childhood of a Leader', 2016, 'Drama', 'Brady Corbet, Hedvig Király, Lol Crawley', 'Mona Fastvold, Brady Corbet', 'Bérénice Bejo, Liam Cunningham, Stacy Martin, Yolande Moreau, Jacques Boudet, Robert Pattinson, Tom Sweet, Sophie Lane Curtis', 'NR', 'The chilling story of a young American boy living in France in 1918 whose father is working for the US government on the creation of the Treaty of Versailles. What he witnesses helps to mold his beliefs – and we witness the birth of a terrifying ego.', 'The chilling story of a young American boy living in France in 1918 whose father is working for the US government on the creation of the Treaty of Versailles. What he witnesses helps to mold his beliefs – and we witness the birth of a terrifying ego.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xf1MGzVzEpoWrE5ztcBf7Mhu0Sz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330982'),
  ('905046326082628192', 'The Childhood of Maxim Gorky', 1938, 'Drama', 'Mark Donskoy, Pyotr Yermolov', 'Mark Donskoy, Ilya Gruzdev', 'Aleksei Lyarsky, Varvara Massalitinova, Mikhail Troyanovsky, Yelizaveta Alekseyeva, Aleksandr Zhukov, K. Zubkov, Daniil Sagal, Sergey Tikhonravov', null, 'Young Maxim grows up under the czarist regime with his grandparents as guardians. Continually demeaned by his martinet grandfather, Maxim is drawn to his warm-hearted grandmother, who instills in him the willingness to pursue his writing muse.', 'Young Maxim grows up under the czarist regime with his grandparents as guardians. Continually demeaned by his martinet grandfather, Maxim is drawn to his warm-hearted grandmother, who instills in him the willingness to pursue his writing muse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uI8hOIUV1y4NkNgkwVJf0E3Z1J4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129417'),
  ('448506961048851077', 'The Children', 1980, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Max Kalmanowicz, Barry Abrams', 'Carlton J. Albright, Edward Terry', 'Martin Shakar, Gil Rogers, Gale Garnett, Shannon Bolin, Tracy Griswold, Joy Glaccum, Jeptha Evans, Clara Evans', 'R', 'A nuclear-plant leak turns a bus-load of children into murderous atomic zombies with black fingernails.', 'A nuclear-plant leak turns a bus-load of children into murderous atomic zombies with black fingernails.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aJnz1MFL01xDududqIwuEJLhCb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84107'),
  ('968641738129138686', 'The Children', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Marguerite Duras, Bruno Nuytten', 'Jean Mascolo, Jean-Marc Turine, Marguerite Duras', 'Axel Bogousslavsky, Daniel Gélin, Tatiana Moukhine, Martine Chevallier, André Dussollier, Pierre Arditi', null, 'Ernesto, a seven-year-old boy who has the body of a thirty-year-old man, decides, upon attending his first day of school, that he no longer wishes to attend, because he does not wish to be taught matters that he does not know.', 'Ernesto, a seven-year-old boy who has the body of a thirty-year-old man, decides, upon attending his first day of school, that he no longer wishes to attend, because he does not wish to be taught matters that he does not know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2t6lQh3VUUepfFvZQK3WHVNpgys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86096'),
  ('117061831832918011', 'The Children', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Christian Vincent, Hélène Louvart', 'Dan Franck, Christian Vincent', 'Karin Viard, Gérard Lanvin, Brieuc Quiniou, Nicolas Jouxtel, Phareelle Onoyan, Martin Combes, Nathalie Richard, Anne Rousselet', null, 'Pierre Esteban is a middle-aged technology teacher, divorced from Hélène, who has two children. Jeanne Lancry is a lively estate agent in the same situation : a divorcée with two children. They discover they love visiting empty apartments together and...more than just that! Life would be just wonderful if they were fifteen years earlier. But there are the children. It would be fine to live altogether in the same place. The question is : will the kids get on well with each other?', 'Pierre Esteban is a middle-aged technology teacher, divorced from Hélène, who has two children. Jeanne Lancry is a lively estate agent in the same situation : a divorcée with two children. They discover they love visiting empty apartments together and...more than just that! Life would be just wonderful if they were fifteen years earlier. But there are the children. It would be fine to live altogether in the same place. The question is : will the kids get on well with each other?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJzNp2tP5bPFAH5OC6lOORfRkPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64922'),
  ('980052041868874369', 'The Children', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nickie Sault, David Katznelson, Elaine Mackenzie', 'Paul Andrew Williams, Tom Shankland', 'Eva Birthistle, Hannah Tointon, Stephen Campbell Moore, Rachel Shelley, Jeremy Sheffield, Rafiella Brooks, Jake Hathaway, William Howes', 'R', 'A relaxing Christmas vacation turns into a terrifying fight for survival as the children begin to turn on their parents.', 'A relaxing Christmas vacation turns into a terrifying fight for survival as the children begin to turn on their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTyc2ahe0qq7BVBlPD3L4zAl7WU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16342'),
  ('505451061734588341', 'The Children Act', 2018, 'Drama', 'Richard Eyre, Andrew Dunn, Astrid Sieben', 'Ian McEwan', 'Emma Thompson, Stanley Tucci, Fionn Whitehead, Jason Watkins, Anthony Calf, Paul Jesson, Ben Chaplin, Eileen Walsh', 'R', 'In the midst of a marital crisis, a High Court judge must decide if she should order a life-saving blood transfusion for a teen with cancer despite his family''s refusal to accept medical treatment for religious reasons.', 'In the midst of a marital crisis, a High Court judge must decide if she should order a life-saving blood transfusion for a teen with cancer despite his family''s refusal to accept medical treatment for religious reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWwmYzdLReu3Yn4YKuX9idDReaz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467936'),
  ('846632426409112594', 'The Children Are Watching Us', 1943, 'Drama', 'Vittorio De Sica, Giuseppe Caracciolo, Romolo Garroni', 'Adolfo Franci, Gherardo Gherardi, Cesare Giulio Viola', 'Emilio Cigoli, Luciano De Ambrosis, Isa Pola, Adriano Rimoldi, Giovanna Cigoli, Jone Frigerio, Maria Gardena, Dina Perbellini', 'NR', 'In his first collaboration with renowned screenwriter and longtime partner Cesare Zavattini, Vittorio De Sica examines the cataclysmic consequences of adult folly on an innocent child. Heralding the pair’s subsequent work on some of the masterpieces of Italian neorealism, The Children Are Watching Us is a vivid, deeply humane portrait of a family’s disintegration.', 'In his first collaboration with renowned screenwriter and longtime partner Cesare Zavattini, Vittorio De Sica examines the cataclysmic consequences of adult folly on an innocent child. Heralding the pair’s subsequent work on some of the masterpieces of Italian neorealism, The Children Are Watching Us is a vivid, deeply humane portrait of a family’s disintegration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEkp2FoxUFpCGeioWdUS4wb7ezh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61461'),
  ('609183819629392549', 'The Children of Chance', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Malik Chibane', 'Malik Chibane', 'Philippe Torreton, Pauline Cheviller, Mathias Mlekuz, Antoine Gouy, Anne Charrier, Néo Rouleau, Anthony Bajon, Eliott Lobrot', null, 'In the backdrop of the Nazi occupation of France, taken to the hospital for a broken leg from an accident, twelve-year-old Maurice Gutman is narrowly spared from the mass roundup that will take his family from him and leave them imprisoned in a distant death camp. At the hospital, Dr. Daviel diagnoses him with tuberculosis and imposes a long treatment, perhaps a humane ruse to prevent him from being deported. Over the course of two years, while living with the hospital staff, Maurice and eight other young boarders unforgettably experience friendship, solidarity and extraordinary courage. These are the children of luck.', 'In the backdrop of the Nazi occupation of France, taken to the hospital for a broken leg from an accident, twelve-year-old Maurice Gutman is narrowly spared from the mass roundup that will take his family from him and leave them imprisoned in a distant death camp. At the hospital, Dr. Daviel diagnoses him with tuberculosis and imposes a long treatment, perhaps a humane ruse to prevent him from being deported. Over the course of two years, while living with the hospital staff, Maurice and eight other young boarders unforgettably experience friendship, solidarity and extraordinary courage. These are the children of luck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aliNBheWwVBsADwAqpMW3ikzuGz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415356'),
  ('566226163241869128', 'The Children of Huang Shi', 2008, 'Drama, War', 'Roger Spottiswoode, Zhao Xiaoding', 'Simon van der Borgh, Jane Hawksley, James MacManus', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Radha Mitchell, Chow Yun-Fat, Anastasia Kolpakova, Michelle Yeoh, Zhou Bo, Guang Li, Ji Lin', 'R', 'About young British journalist, George Hogg, who with the assistance of a courageous Australian nurse, saves a group of orphaned children during the Japanese occupation of China in 1937.', 'About young British journalist, George Hogg, who with the assistance of a courageous Australian nurse, saves a group of orphaned children during the Japanese occupation of China in 1937.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjmo26BnSimVjhCE97cH8VCtEUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13405'),
  ('179433914074502664', 'The Children of Leningradsky', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Hans Jurgen Burkard, Andrzej Celiński, Hanna Polak', 'Hanna Polak, Andrzej Celiński', null, null, 'Since the fall of the Iron Curtain an estimated four million children have found themselves living on the streets in the former countries of the Soviet Union. In the streets of Moscow alone there are over 30,000 surviving in this manner at the present time. The makers of the documentary film concentrated on a community of homeless children living hand to mouth in the Moscow train station Leningradsky. Eight-year-old Sasha, eleven-year-old Kristina, thirteen-year-old Misha and ten-year-old Andrej all dream of living in a communal home. They spend winter nights trying to stay warm by huddling together on hot water pipes and most of their days are spent begging. Andrej has found himself here because of disagreements with his family. Kristina was driven into this way of life by the hatred of her stepmother and twelve-year-old Roma by the regular beatings he received from his constantly drunk father. "When it is worst, we try to make money for food by prostitution," admits ...', 'Since the fall of the Iron Curtain an estimated four million children have found themselves living on the streets in the former countries of the Soviet Union. In the streets of Moscow alone there are over 30,000 surviving in this manner at the present time. The makers of the documentary film concentrated on a community of homeless children living hand to mouth in the Moscow train station Leningradsky. Eight-year-old Sasha, eleven-year-old Kristina, thirteen-year-old Misha and ten-year-old Andrej all dream of living in a communal home. They spend winter nights trying to stay warm by huddling together on hot water pipes and most of their days are spent begging. Andrej has found himself here because of disagreements with his family. Kristina was driven into this way of life by the hatred of her stepmother and twelve-year-old Roma by the regular beatings he received from his constantly drunk father. "When it is worst, we try to make money for food by prostitution," admits ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOMbBOZO9TOlQQiETdMOL0vKjXe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73856'),
  ('259573172024585522', 'The Children of Noisy Village', 1986, 'Family', 'Lasse Hallström, Jens Fischer, Catti Edfeldt', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Anna Sahlin, Henrik Larsson, Linda Bergström, Crispin Dickson Wendenius, Ellen Demérus, Harald Lönnbro, Tove Edfeldt, Elisabeth Nordkvist', null, 'The story of the children who live in Bullerbyn, Sweden, through the spring and summer months.', 'The story of the children who live in Bullerbyn, Sweden, through the spring and summer months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3J8XDd1MmwfWlUFktdw313otVbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21394'),
  ('546289701417790328', 'The Children of the Century', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Diane Kurys, Vilko Filač', 'François-Olivier Rousseau, Murray Head, Diane Kurys', 'Juliette Binoche, Benoît Magimel, Stefano Dionisi, Robin Renucci, Karin Viard, Isabelle Carré, Patrick Chesnais, Arnaud Giovaninetti', null, 'True tale of the tumultuous love affair between two French literary icons of the 19th Century, novelist George Sand and poet Alfred de Musset. But their affair falls apart during an excursion to Venice, Italy where Musset is distracted by drugs and Sand by a handsome doctor.', 'True tale of the tumultuous love affair between two French literary icons of the 19th Century, novelist George Sand and poet Alfred de Musset. But their affair falls apart during an excursion to Venice, Italy where Musset is distracted by drugs and Sand by a handsome doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5qDyTNNXBEw8SMrnyt1607tJs0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46466'),
  ('37670824162329612', 'The Children of the Dead', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Kelly Copper, Kelly Copper, Pavol Liska', 'Kelly Copper, Pavol Liska', 'Andrea Maier, Greta Kostka, Klaus Unterrieder, Tamara Pregernigg, Lukas Eigl, Georg Beyer, Jasmin Karami, Ditz Fejer', null, 'Tourism is booming at the Pension Alpenrose. After a dying in an accident, Karin returns as one of the undead. In a cinema owned by a Nazi widow where the past is mourned, she brings the dead back to life.', 'Tourism is booming at the Pension Alpenrose. After a dying in an accident, Karin returns as one of the undead. In a cinema owned by a Nazi widow where the past is mourned, she brings the dead back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNh8jktq8mWWFIkgu8EWoLsRwJK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576034'),
  ('391255393855053293', 'The Children of the Marshland', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean Becker, Jean-Marie Dreujou', 'Sébastien Japrisot', 'Jacques Villeret, Jacques Gamblin, André Dussollier, Michel Serrault, Isabelle Carré, Éric Cantona, Suzanne Flon, Jacques Dufilho', null, 'The film is set in Marais, a quiet region along the banks of Loire river in 1918. Riton is afflicted with a bad-tempered wife and three unruly children. Garris lives alone with his recollections of World War I trenches. Their daily life consists of seasonal work and visits from their two pals: Tane, the local train conductor and Amédée, a dreamer and voracious reader of classics.', 'The film is set in Marais, a quiet region along the banks of Loire river in 1918. Riton is afflicted with a bad-tempered wife and three unruly children. Garris lives alone with his recollections of World War I trenches. Their daily life consists of seasonal work and visits from their two pals: Tane, the local train conductor and Amédée, a dreamer and voracious reader of classics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tEvO0H3Eg43MJQm4t1ChukCu8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36719'),
  ('90444259308570968', 'The Children of the Resistance', 2026, 'History, Drama, War, Adventure', 'Christophe Barratier, Sylvie Brocheré, Jérôme Alméras', 'Christophe Barratier, Stéphane Keller', 'Artus, Gérard Jugnot, Pierre Deladonchamps, Julien Arruti, Oscar Boissière, Leslie Medina, Julien Pestel, Vanessa Guide', null, 'During the German occupation of World War II, François, Eusèbe, and Lisa, three courageous children, embark on a secret adventure: resisting the Nazis in the heart of France. Through sabotage, hidden messages, and perilous escapes, they carry out clandestine actions right under the enemy''s nose. Daring and friendship are their only weapons in the fight against injustice.', 'During the German occupation of World War II, François, Eusèbe, and Lisa, three courageous children, embark on a secret adventure: resisting the Nazis in the heart of France. Through sabotage, hidden messages, and perilous escapes, they carry out clandestine actions right under the enemy''s nose. Daring and friendship are their only weapons in the fight against injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imsxGd3NaNzdOSZuRCUxDSOU9zU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1309400'),
  ('311148048935601408', 'The Children of the War', 1984, 'War, Drama', 'Bebe Kamín', 'María Teresa Ferrari', 'Gustavo Belatti, Gabriel Rovito, Leandro Regúnaga, Tina Serrano, Alfonso De Grazia, Héctor Alterio, Marta González, Emilia Mazer', null, 'Based on the lives of four boys, all of different social classes and psychological makeup, this film tries to reflect through them the political history of Argentina during the years leading up to the Malvinas War.', 'Based on the lives of four boys, all of different social classes and psychological makeup, this film tries to reflect through them the political history of Argentina during the years leading up to the Malvinas War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuE6y11e7SYBuUKcqgXsibX8ilF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367161'),
  ('626193411409413897', 'The Children of Times Square', 1986, 'TV Movie, Drama, Crime', 'Curtis Hanson, Robert Elswit', 'Curtis Hanson', 'Howard Rollins, Joanna Cassidy, David Ackroyd, Larry B. Scott, Jason Bernard, Danny Nucci, Silvana Gallardo, Joe Spinell', null, 'An alienated teenage boy runs away from home and ventures to New York City where he falls in with a gang of juvenile delinquents working as drug dealers and pickpockets for a shady crime boss.', 'An alienated teenage boy runs away from home and ventures to New York City where he falls in with a gang of juvenile delinquents working as drug dealers and pickpockets for a shady crime boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0vAmynv5qsgp6m0ZqitI3Lg7EY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256770'),
  ('949716324920008357', 'The Children of Villa Emma', 2016, 'Drama, History, War', 'Nikolaus Leytner, Hermann Dunzendorfer', 'Agnes Pluch', 'Sophie Stockinger, Ludwig Trepte, Nina Proll, August Zirner, Justus Schlingensiepen, Muriel Wimmer, Laurence Rupp, Michele Oliveri', null, 'According to true events, the moving drama "The Children of Villa Emma" tells of a dangerous escape that took place during the Second World War. In 1942/1943, the Italian village of Nonantola was indeed a refuge for 73 Jewish children who wanted to escape the merciless access of the National Socialists on their way to the "Promised Land" of Palestine. Director Nikolaus Leytner describes the dangerous journey as an exciting test, presented by a talented young cast.', 'According to true events, the moving drama "The Children of Villa Emma" tells of a dangerous escape that took place during the Second World War. In 1942/1943, the Italian village of Nonantola was indeed a refuge for 73 Jewish children who wanted to escape the merciless access of the National Socialists on their way to the "Promised Land" of Palestine. Director Nikolaus Leytner describes the dangerous journey as an exciting test, presented by a talented young cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkXRYxqPDzg2iOyqbv6rj5kjEgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432646'),
  ('1136089564149504108', 'The Children Thief', 1991, 'Drama', 'Christian de Chalonge, Bernard Zitzermann', 'Dominique Garnier', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Ángela Molina, Michel Piccoli, Virginie Ledoyen, Loïc Even, Nada Strancar, Cécile Pallas, Gabriele Tinti', null, 'Although he was once a colonel in Argentina, the principal character in this film is now a wealthy exile living in Paris with his beloved wife, who has been unable to bear children. To fill this void in their lives, he feeds and clothes abandoned children, raising them in his mansion as if they were his own. As would never be the case in real life today, in this fantasized story set in 1925, no one objects to this behavior, and they live pleasantly and enjoyably together. Things grow considerably more animated when a stage magician places his very attractive daughter in the colonel''s household, which stirs a lively romantic interest from his boys and from the great man himself.', 'Although he was once a colonel in Argentina, the principal character in this film is now a wealthy exile living in Paris with his beloved wife, who has been unable to bear children. To fill this void in their lives, he feeds and clothes abandoned children, raising them in his mansion as if they were his own. As would never be the case in real life today, in this fantasized story set in 1925, no one objects to this behavior, and they live pleasantly and enjoyably together. Things grow considerably more animated when a stage magician places his very attractive daughter in the colonel''s household, which stirs a lively romantic interest from his boys and from the great man himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNTGAi14b8Dl5abdHV8DbIqr0Fl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65925'),
  ('443518136631306395', 'The Children''s Train', 2024, 'Drama', 'Cristina Comencini, Italo Petriccione, Laura Muccino', 'Cristina Comencini, Furio Andreotti, Giulia Calenda', 'Barbara Ronchi, Serena Rossi, Christian Cervone, Stefano Accorsi, Francesco Di Leva, Antonia Truppo, Monica Nappo, Dora Romano', 'PG', 'In late 1940s Italy, a mother makes the difficult decision to send her son to the north, where he catches glimpses of a new life away from poverty.', 'In late 1940s Italy, a mother makes the difficult decision to send her son to the north, where he catches glimpses of a new life away from poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfQvaLi9P5JdyWjz0b5IhIjLCu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180634'),
  ('464289881507109740', 'The Chill Factor', 1993, 'Horror', 'Christopher Webster, Joseph Friedman', 'Julian Weaver', 'Dawn Laurrie, Aaron Kjenaas, Connie Snyder, David Fields, Eve Montgomery, Jim Cagle, Bekki Vallin, Mark Armstrong', null, 'A group of snowmobilers become trapped on a lake, and hole up in an abandoned camp once used by a satanic cult for its rituals.', 'A group of snowmobilers become trapped on a lake, and hole up in an abandoned camp once used by a satanic cult for its rituals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKa5SAv2yxRDPsEAl051nbh8pQr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124668'),
  ('481340956577842835', 'The Chilling', 1989, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jack A. Sunseri, Deland Nuse', 'Jack A. Sunseri', 'Linda Blair, Dan Haggerty, Troy Donahue, Jack De Rieux, Ron Vincent, Michael Jacobs, John Flanagan, Steve Gluck', null, 'The bodies at a cryogenic centre are defrosted by accident and turn into cannibalistic zombies.', 'The bodies at a cryogenic centre are defrosted by accident and turn into cannibalistic zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJiRVmqZIontGnl0PiFam34c6IO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60413'),
  ('155064329614156257', 'The Chimp', 1932, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott', 'H.M. Walker, Oliver Hardy, Stan Laurel', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, James Finlayson, Billy Gilbert, Charles Gemora, Dorothy Layton', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie play bumbling circus performers who inadvertently drive the circus into bankruptcy. The circus can''t pay them their wages so they are given a gorilla and a flea circus as payment. Bedlam ensues.', 'Stan and Ollie play bumbling circus performers who inadvertently drive the circus into bankruptcy. The circus can''t pay them their wages so they are given a gorilla and a flea circus as payment. Bedlam ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15UlyyhcUd39AVfEQlYHX8aCsCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48670'),
  ('819851733853714923', 'The China Hustle', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Tom Hurwitz, Jed Rothstein', 'Jed Rothstein', 'Dan David, Matthew Wiechert, Carson Block, Jim Chanos, Soren Aandahl, Maj Soueidnn, Alexandra Stevenson, Crocker Coulson', 'R', 'An unsettling and eye-opening Wall Street horror story about Chinese companies, the American stock market, and the opportunistic greed behind the biggest heist you''ve never heard of.', 'An unsettling and eye-opening Wall Street horror story about Chinese companies, the American stock market, and the opportunistic greed behind the biggest heist you''ve never heard of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1TsjdrKm2HxvqoALGnHh0BYOlA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474753'),
  ('1071125444548773275', 'The China Plate', 1931, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, null, 'NR', 'An old plate tells the tale of the Emperor of China, whose palace was disrupted by some children.', 'An old plate tells the tale of the Emperor of China, whose palace was disrupted by some children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGiA6wFanp0STwtodJlq7Knr4RP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106097'),
  ('1150753794407292143', 'The China Shop', 1934, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, null, 'NR', 'The elderly owner of a china shop leaves for the night, and the various figurines and decorated mugs come to life. A demonic figure captures an upper-class lady and does battle with her lord, damaging much of the shop. But the demon proves to have a glass jaw and, literally, a yellow streak, and the happy couple is soon reunited. No dialogue, but some signs are in English, particularly the final punch-line.', 'The elderly owner of a china shop leaves for the night, and the various figurines and decorated mugs come to life. A demonic figure captures an upper-class lady and does battle with her lord, damaging much of the shop. But the demon proves to have a glass jaw and, literally, a yellow streak, and the happy couple is soon reunited. No dialogue, but some signs are in English, particularly the final punch-line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpKtLIcANyDGmCtiXNzG1jGdQcl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67585'),
  ('589649628396719739', 'The China Syndrome', 1979, 'Drama, Thriller', 'James Bridges, James Crabe, Joel Chernoff', 'Mike Gray, T.S. Cook, James Bridges', 'Jane Fonda, Michael Douglas, Jack Lemmon, Scott Brady, James Hampton, Peter Donat, Wilford Brimley, Richard Herd', 'PG', 'While doing a series of reports on alternative energy sources, opportunistic reporter Kimberly Wells witnesses an accident at a nuclear power plant. Wells is determined to publicize the incident, but soon finds herself entangled in a sinister conspiracy to keep the full impact of the incident a secret.', 'While doing a series of reports on alternative energy sources, opportunistic reporter Kimberly Wells witnesses an accident at a nuclear power plant. Wells is determined to publicize the incident, but soon finds herself entangled in a sinister conspiracy to keep the full impact of the incident a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHwwQIlt4XwpTFhX9ZT1A8xSW7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:988'),
  ('630746362732381697', 'The Chinese Botanist''s Daughters', 2006, 'Drama', 'Dai Sijie, Guy Dufaux', 'Dai Sijie, Nadine Perront', 'Mylène Jampanoï, Li Xiaoran, Wang Weiguang, Như Quỳnh, Nguyen Van Quang, Linh Thj Bich Thu, Xuân Thức, Phương Thanh', null, 'At the house of a famous Chinese botanist teacher his daughter and a female intern fall in love with each other - a forbidden love that must be kept secret.', 'At the house of a famous Chinese botanist teacher his daughter and a female intern fall in love with each other - a forbidden love that must be kept secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FRnusvcTz3xfPL7GTChXHfeoH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1899'),
  ('817861161455225584', 'The Chinese Boxer', 1970, 'Action', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Hua Shan', 'Jimmy Wang Yu', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Lo Lieh, Wang Ping, Chao Hsiung, Fang Mian, Cheng Lui, Wang Kuang-Yu, Chai No', null, 'Lei Ming, a noble young martial arts student who doesn''t know the meaning of giving up. He faces a treacherous, blood-thirsty Japanese karate expert, which leads to many memorable battles as well as several unforgettable training sequences.', 'Lei Ming, a noble young martial arts student who doesn''t know the meaning of giving up. He faces a treacherous, blood-thirsty Japanese karate expert, which leads to many memorable battles as well as several unforgettable training sequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4SE13qaIl3rNdsGgZNv6Kv3toL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62762'),
  ('737796039628486144', 'The Chinese Feast', 1995, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tsui Hark, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Poon Hang-Sang', 'Philip Cheng Chung-Tai, Ng Man-Fai, Tsui Hark', 'Leslie Cheung, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Law Kar-Ying, Kenny Bee, Vincent Zhao Wenzhuo, Xiong Xinxin, Joyce Ni Shu-Chun, Amy Fan', null, 'Within a few years, petty crook Chiu rises to gang leader. But his professional ambitions are actually quite different: he wants to leave illegality behind and make a career for himself and his lover in Canada... as a chef. However, this craft must first be learned and Chiu''s talent in the field of cooking leaves much to be desired.', 'Within a few years, petty crook Chiu rises to gang leader. But his professional ambitions are actually quite different: he wants to leave illegality behind and make a career for himself and his lover in Canada... as a chef. However, this craft must first be learned and Chiu''s talent in the field of cooking leaves much to be desired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbal71oj7AlzQSlvUeAMXHFM1rz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93465'),
  ('353924275379510126', 'The Chinese Mayor', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Zhou Hao, Tianhui Zhang', null, 'Geng Yanbo', null, 'Once the thriving capital of Imperial China, the city of Datong now lies in near ruins. Not only is it the most polluted city in the country, it is also crippled by decrepit infrastructure and even shakier economic prospects. But Mayor Geng Yanbo plans to change all that, announcing a bold, new plan to return Datong to its former glory, the cultural haven it was some 1,600 years ago. Such declarations, however, come at a devastatingly high cost. Thousands of homes are to be bulldozed, and a half-million of its residents (30 percent of Datong’s total population) will be relocated under his watch. Whether he succeeds depends entirely on his ability to calm swarms of furious workers and an increasingly perturbed ruling elite. The Chinese Mayor captures, with remarkable access, a man and, by extension, a country leaping frantically into an increasingly unstable future.', 'Once the thriving capital of Imperial China, the city of Datong now lies in near ruins. Not only is it the most polluted city in the country, it is also crippled by decrepit infrastructure and even shakier economic prospects. But Mayor Geng Yanbo plans to change all that, announcing a bold, new plan to return Datong to its former glory, the cultural haven it was some 1,600 years ago. Such declarations, however, come at a devastatingly high cost. Thousands of homes are to be bulldozed, and a half-million of its residents (30 percent of Datong’s total population) will be relocated under his watch. Whether he succeeds depends entirely on his ability to calm swarms of furious workers and an increasingly perturbed ruling elite. The Chinese Mayor captures, with remarkable access, a man and, by extension, a country leaping frantically into an increasingly unstable future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2m32fuAgLEG74maxMkiwFh9A1Tp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319090'),
  ('774143755379943710', 'The Chinese Ring', 1947, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'William Beaudine, William A. Sickner, Kenneth Kessler', 'Scott Darling', 'Roland Winters, Warren Douglas, Louise Currie, Mantan Moreland, Victor Sen Yung, Philip Ahn, Thayer Roberts, Byron Foulger', 'NR', 'Soon after a Chinese princess comes to the US to buy planes for her people, she is murdered by a poison dart fired by an air rifle.', 'Soon after a Chinese princess comes to the US to buy planes for her people, she is murdered by a poison dart fired by an air rifle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wncJaRcPCWm2eBjOWxwjJllaLdZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90010'),
  ('440120657543887000', 'The Chinese Widow', 2017, 'Drama, Romance, History, War', 'Filip Zumbrunn, Bille August', 'Greg Latter', 'Liu Yifei, Emile Hirsch, Fangcong Li, Kevin Yan, Yu Shaoqun, Vincent Riotta, Tsukagoshi Hirotaka, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung', 'R', 'It’s 1941 and the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor has destroyed America’s morale. The US President Franklin D. Roosevelt then decides to risk it all by bombing Tokyo and raise more hope for his citizens. After completing its mission, a unit of the US Air Force is forced to make an emergency landing in China. Its commander Jack Turner (Emilie Hirsch) barely survives but gets rescued by Ying (Crystal Liu), a local widow who will stop at nothing to hide him from the Japanese occupant.', 'It’s 1941 and the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor has destroyed America’s morale. The US President Franklin D. Roosevelt then decides to risk it all by bombing Tokyo and raise more hope for his citizens. After completing its mission, a unit of the US Air Force is forced to make an emergency landing in China. Its commander Jack Turner (Emilie Hirsch) barely survives but gets rescued by Ying (Crystal Liu), a local widow who will stop at nothing to hide him from the Japanese occupant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztcaeAzK3VkllaWB0VEQdcSD7BO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528210'),
  ('742600183343106075', 'The Chipmunk Adventure', 1987, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Music', 'Janice Karman, Skip Jones, Kathleen Quaife-Hodge', 'Ross Bagdasarian, Jr., Janice Karman', 'Ross Bagdasarian, Jr., Janice Karman, Dody Goodman, Susan Tyrrell, Anthony De Longis, Frank Welker, Nancy Cartwright, Philip L. Clarke', 'G', 'The Chipmunks and the Chipettes go head to head in a hot air balloon race, and the winner gets $100,000. Unbeknownst to the participants, the "race" is actually a diamond smuggling ring!', 'The Chipmunks and the Chipettes go head to head in a hot air balloon race, and the winner gets $100,000. Unbeknownst to the participants, the "race" is actually a diamond smuggling ring!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0d8qJL8anmGG14UfjBC7HHATJK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21793'),
  ('253284625772121485', 'The Chips Are Down', 1947, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jean Delannoy, Christian Matras', 'Jean-Paul Sartre', 'Micheline Presle, Marcello Pagliero, Marguerite Moreno, Charles Dullin, Fernand Fabre, Jacques Erwin, Colette Ripert, Marcel Mouloudji', null, 'A society heiress and a resistance fighter are tragically killed at the same moment and meet in the afterlife. They are offered a second chance at life if they can prove their love is real or be doomed to roam the earth as ghosts.', 'A society heiress and a resistance fighter are tragically killed at the same moment and meet in the afterlife. They are offered a second chance at life if they can prove their love is real or be doomed to roam the earth as ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBLpUby9T9aHsToPs5cldCPumN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189904'),
  ('1111945092747931786', 'The Chocolate War', 1988, 'Drama', 'Keith Gordon, Tom Richmond', 'Keith Gordon', 'John Glover, Ilan Mitchell-Smith, Wallace Langham, Doug Hutchison, Corey Gunnestad, Brent David Fraser, Robert Davenport, Jenny Wright', 'R', 'Jerry, a new student at an elite Catholic prep school, must face the hazing practices handed down by the Vigils, a group of powerful students. When teacher Brother Leon pushes the students to sell chocolates for a fundraiser, the head of the Vigils, Archie, gets Jerry to reject selling for 10 days. However, Jerry decides to keep up the refusal past the original time frame, which pits him against the Vigils and the school staff.', 'Jerry, a new student at an elite Catholic prep school, must face the hazing practices handed down by the Vigils, a group of powerful students. When teacher Brother Leon pushes the students to sell chocolates for a fundraiser, the head of the Vigils, Archie, gets Jerry to reject selling for 10 days. However, Jerry decides to keep up the refusal past the original time frame, which pits him against the Vigils and the school staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sft956vBp7kRX3ra0E5JnLyIgzb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32086'),
  ('726781065631000316', 'The Choice', 1971, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Youssef Chahine, Ahmed Khorshed, Ali Badrakhan', 'Naguib Mahfouz, Youssef Chahine', 'Ezzat Al Alaily, Soad Hosny, Huda Sultan, Mahmoud El Meligy, Seif Abdelrahman, Youssef Wahby, Mimi Chakib, Ali Al Sharif', null, 'When a free-spirited sailor is found murdered, his twin brother, a famous novelist, is the prime suspect. Investigators uncover a possible liaison between the dead sailor and the writer''s wife, and also learn that Sayed''s successful fictions owed much to the inspiration of his brother Mahmoud''s adventurous life. Just as the evidence against the writer seems overwhelming, Mahmoud turns up alive. But why are the twins never seen together...?', 'When a free-spirited sailor is found murdered, his twin brother, a famous novelist, is the prime suspect. Investigators uncover a possible liaison between the dead sailor and the writer''s wife, and also learn that Sayed''s successful fictions owed much to the inspiration of his brother Mahmoud''s adventurous life. Just as the evidence against the writer seems overwhelming, Mahmoud turns up alive. But why are the twins never seen together...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KSu3sZRBYidNqZsy2p8uISD4nn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282225'),
  ('605545318372061516', 'The Choice', 2015, 'Drama', 'Arnaldo Catinari, Michele Placido', 'Giulia Calenda, Michele Placido', 'Ambra Angiolini, Raoul Bova, Valeria Solarino, Michele Placido, Manrico Gammarota, Monica Contini, Gennaro Diana, Marcello Catalano', null, 'A childless couple struggle in the aftermath of a sexual assault leaves the woman pregnant.', 'A childless couple struggle in the aftermath of a sexual assault leaves the woman pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9Wy1mZ6ObLqV0Qq6fPtNsq0275.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333884'),
  ('991624173356277039', 'The Choice', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ross Katz, Alar Kivilo, Chad Graves', 'Bryan Sipe', 'Benjamin Walker, Teresa Palmer, Maggie Grace, Alexandra Daddario, Tom Welling, Brett Rice, Brad James, Jesse C. Boyd', 'PG-13', 'Travis and Gabby first meet as neighbors in a small coastal town and wind up in a relationship that is tested by life''s most defining events.', 'Travis and Gabby first meet as neighbors in a small coastal town and wind up in a relationship that is tested by life''s most defining events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MF3cdAasnF17SG9bmeamQ066iJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330483'),
