  ('887810308773309621', 'The Choppers', 1961, 'Action, Drama', 'Leigh Jason', 'Arch Hall Sr.', 'Arch Hall Jr., Robert Paget, Burr Middleton, Rex Holman, Chuck Barnes, Tom Brown, Marianne Gaba, Bruno VeSota', null, 'A gang of teenage delinquents terrorize a small community by stealing cars and stripping them for parts, then selling the parts to a crooked junkyard owner. The police and an insurance company investigator set out to break up the gang.', 'A gang of teenage delinquents terrorize a small community by stealing cars and stripping them for parts, then selling the parts to a crooked junkyard owner. The police and an insurance company investigator set out to break up the gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZ426d765ydnRcGmP9zqwCjCi7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114214'),
  ('797806287655267953', 'The Chops', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'François Catonné, Bertrand Blier', 'Bertrand Blier', 'Philippe Noiret, Michel Bouquet, Farida Rahouadj, Catherine Hiegel, Hammou Graïa, Jérôme Hardelay, Axelle Abbadie, Anne Suarez', null, 'A father arrives at his son''s house one evening. They begin talking about women, love, relationships and things turn awkward fast.', 'A father arrives at his son''s house one evening. They begin talking about women, love, relationships and things turn awkward fast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhDoFi0z9eem3s5dt1YL4jmKiDE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68970'),
  ('340969053380843675', 'The Choral', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Nicholas Hytner, Mike Eley, Astrid Sieben', 'Alan Bennett', 'Ralph Fiennes, Roger Allam, Mark Addy, Alun Armstrong, Simon Russell Beale, Robert Emms, Lyndsey Marshal, Ron Cook', 'R', 'As World War I rages on, Dr. Henry Guthrie takes over a British choral society that''s lost most of its men to the army. The community soon discovers that the best response to the chaos of war is to make beautiful music together.', 'As World War I rages on, Dr. Henry Guthrie takes over a British choral society that''s lost most of its men to the army. The community soon discovers that the best response to the chaos of war is to make beautiful music together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQtms7CSM0CE0W6dYbLLAATb5rL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1262815'),
  ('460079979157213201', 'The Chorus', 1982, 'Drama', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Yoosef Moghaddam', null, 'An old man with a hearing aid tires of listening to the noises of the town. But when he takes his aid out he can''t hear his grandchildren coming to see him.', 'An old man with a hearing aid tires of listening to the noises of the town. But when he takes his aid out he can''t hear his grandchildren coming to see him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQjghQBeA6H2dLT6HtFMdSJTcIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129945'),
  ('78823360923482102', 'The Chosen', 1981, 'Drama', 'Jeremy Kagan, Arthur J. Ornitz', 'Edwin Gordon', 'Barry Miller, Robby Benson, Maximilian Schell, Rod Steiger, Hildy Brooks, Kaethe Fine, Ron Rifkin, Robert John Burke', 'PG', 'In a 1940s New York, two Jewish teenage boys are determined to remain friends despite the deep differences between their two families.', 'In a 1940s New York, two Jewish teenage boys are determined to remain friends despite the deep differences between their two families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtw4jMMKz5CfB4H408XGAa87XHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25773'),
  ('322432901387207346', 'The Chosen', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ben Jehoshua', 'Barry Jay', 'Kian Lawley, Elizabeth Keener, Angelica Rose Torres, Chris Gann, Dayna Devon, Wiley B. Oscar, Emily Killian, Melissa Navia', null, 'When a child-stealing demon attaches itself to a little girl, her family is thrust into a battle against time in order to save the girl and send the demon back to hell.', 'When a child-stealing demon attaches itself to a little girl, her family is thrust into a battle against time in order to save the girl and send the demon back to hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntc1h25jQiz1twYFcg1zJ0gkTYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346170'),
  ('34904101258735899', 'The Chosen', 2016, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Antonio Chavarrías, Carles Velat Angelat, María Fernanda Rivero Payán', 'Antonio Chavarrías', 'Alfonso Herrera, Hannah Murray, Henry Goodman, Julian Sands, Elvira Mínguez, Emilio Echevarría, Frances Barber, Alejandro Calva', null, 'Spain, 1937. Ramón Mercader, a young communist combatant, is recruited and trained by the Soviet intelligence service to participate in a top secret mission ordered by the ruthless dictator Joseph Stalin: the assassination of his former political rival, Leon Trotsky, who is living in exile in Mexico.', 'Spain, 1937. Ramón Mercader, a young communist combatant, is recruited and trained by the Soviet intelligence service to participate in a top secret mission ordered by the ruthless dictator Joseph Stalin: the assassination of his former political rival, Leon Trotsky, who is living in exile in Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJJS8MDLENjbNp42dLMubFEDTWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387940'),
  ('217501887207215946', 'The Chosen One: Legend of the Raven', 1998, 'Action, Thriller, Fantasy, Horror', 'Robert C. New, Lawrence Lanoff', 'Sam Rappaport, Khara Bromiley', 'Carmen Electra, Shauna Sand, Michael Stadvec, Debra Beatty, Dave Oliver, Tim Bagley, Frank Salsedo, Lawrence Lanoff', null, 'When a serial killer mysteriously and savagely murders a young native woman in rural Los Angeles County, her sister McKenna must replace her as the keeper of an amulet, the sacred crescent. Reluctantly, McKenna accepts the role of chosen one. With the amulet and after the rigors of the ritual, she takes on the spirit and powers of the raven, the good forces in the battle against evil, the wolf. McKenna''s powers include a thirst for milk and great sexual energy, which she unleashes on her former boyfriend, Henry, a cop. The spirit of the wolf inhabits Rose, Henry''s jilted lover. Rose wreaks havoc of her own before a final showdown with the chosen one.', 'When a serial killer mysteriously and savagely murders a young native woman in rural Los Angeles County, her sister McKenna must replace her as the keeper of an amulet, the sacred crescent. Reluctantly, McKenna accepts the role of chosen one. With the amulet and after the rigors of the ritual, she takes on the spirit and powers of the raven, the good forces in the battle against evil, the wolf. McKenna''s powers include a thirst for milk and great sexual energy, which she unleashes on her former boyfriend, Henry, a cop. The spirit of the wolf inhabits Rose, Henry''s jilted lover. Rose wreaks havoc of her own before a final showdown with the chosen one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AKlujoGXKA3gOm0w7MH8RanaU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76790'),
  ('759433806613837043', 'The Chosen Ones', 2014, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Christoph Röhl, Peter Steuger', 'Sylvia Leuker, Benedikt Röskau', 'Julia Jentsch, Ulrich Tukur, Johanna Gastdorf, Lena Stolze, Patrick Joswig, Rainer Bock, Anna Blomeier, Nico Kleemann', null, 'In the late 70s, young Petra Grust begins teaching at the progressive Odenwald School. She is flattered by the trust placed in her by its widely respected headmaster Simon Pistorius. But gradually certain incidents at the boarding school begin to unsettle her. Petra then realizes that Pistorius is abusing Frank, a 13-year-old. When Frank is told that he has to spend school holidays with Pistorius, he tries to commit suicide. Petra tells Frank''s father (the chairman of the school''s governing body) but he believes Pistorius instead of his own son. Petra fails to convince people of the man''s true nature. 30 years later, Frank goes to Petra, who has long since left the school and has stopped teaching altogether. He has never been able to speak about what happened but now, after the suicide of another pupil, he is no longer willing to remain silent. He wants Petra to bear witness at the school''s forthcoming anniversary celebrations.', 'In the late 70s, young Petra Grust begins teaching at the progressive Odenwald School. She is flattered by the trust placed in her by its widely respected headmaster Simon Pistorius. But gradually certain incidents at the boarding school begin to unsettle her. Petra then realizes that Pistorius is abusing Frank, a 13-year-old. When Frank is told that he has to spend school holidays with Pistorius, he tries to commit suicide. Petra tells Frank''s father (the chairman of the school''s governing body) but he believes Pistorius instead of his own son. Petra fails to convince people of the man''s true nature. 30 years later, Frank goes to Petra, who has long since left the school and has stopped teaching altogether. He has never been able to speak about what happened but now, after the suicide of another pupil, he is no longer willing to remain silent. He wants Petra to bear witness at the school''s forthcoming anniversary celebrations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gB3OTe6lQZwQTq5fZKQR5vPvrBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296081'),
  ('859362045143480052', 'The Chosen Ones', 2015, 'Drama', 'David Pablos, Carolina Costa', 'David Pablos', 'Nancy Talamantes, Óscar Torres, José Santillán Cabuto, Raquel Presa, Alicia Quiñonez, Leidi Gutiérrez, Edward Coward', null, 'Sofia, 14 years old, is in love with Ulises. Because of him, in spite of him, she is forced into a prostitution network in Mexico. To set her free, Ulises will have to find another girl to replace her. Adapted from Jorge Volpi’s novel, set in the world of juvenile prostitution.', 'Sofia, 14 years old, is in love with Ulises. Because of him, in spite of him, she is forced into a prostitution network in Mexico. To set her free, Ulises will have to find another girl to replace her. Adapted from Jorge Volpi’s novel, set in the world of juvenile prostitution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0Zpnhi8ltBEETEdrCroBKynNDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336201'),
  ('562219734592731748', 'The Christ of the Ocean', 1971, 'Drama', 'Ramón Fernández, Luciano Martino, Renato Pecoriello', 'Federico De Urrutia, Anatole France', 'Nino del Arco, Paolo Gozlino, Pilar Velázquez, Leonard Mann, Roberto Camardiel, Elio Marconato, José Manuel Martín, Goyo Lebrero', null, 'The people of a fishing village is about to witness a miracle thanks to the new mysterious friend of a young, lonely boy.', 'The people of a fishing village is about to witness a miracle thanks to the new mysterious friend of a young, lonely boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4IUXkyLHf1LEGjsuXF4dDTN0At.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264735'),
  ('576531796248401720', 'The Christmas Angel', 1904, 'Drama', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès, Rachel Gillet', null, 'A poor family in a rundown house where snow falls through the broken roof, there''s no coal to heat the pathetic little stove, mother is sick, father sends daughter out to beg. Rejected by other beggars, the girl collapses in the snow…', 'A poor family in a rundown house where snow falls through the broken roof, there''s no coal to heat the pathetic little stove, mother is sick, father sends daughter out to beg. Rejected by other beggars, the girl collapses in the snow…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbmFCkCTBdfbhImqTMtQMslFncM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196141'),
  ('666847930969029871', 'The Christmas Blessing', 2005, 'Drama, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Karen Arthur', null, 'Neil Patrick Harris, Rebecca Gayheart, Angus T. Jones, Hugh Thompson, Shaun Johnston, Rob Lowe, Robert Clinton, Wanda Cannon', 'NR', 'Nathan Andrews is all grown up. As a young doctor, Nathan finds himself questioning his career choice, so he goes to his hometown to soul search and reconnect with his father. Once home, a blossoming romance with teacher Megan Sullivan and a fast friendship with student Charlie Bennett teach Nathan to live life in the moment and embrace the time he has with friends and family.', 'Nathan Andrews is all grown up. As a young doctor, Nathan finds himself questioning his career choice, so he goes to his hometown to soul search and reconnect with his father. Once home, a blossoming romance with teacher Megan Sullivan and a fast friendship with student Charlie Bennett teach Nathan to live life in the moment and embrace the time he has with friends and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3Hi43VP3NpJB9oiLQgAH9ykjQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57854'),
  ('195687600874073106', 'The Christmas Bow', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Clare Niederpruem, Jeremy Prusso', 'Erin Rodman, Gary Yates, Peyton McDavitt', 'Lucia Micarelli, Michael Rady, James Saito, Ashley Erin Campbell, Nate Bynum, Jyl Kaneshiro, Anne Sward, Annette Ciavarella', null, 'When an accident puts her music dreams on hold, a gifted violinist reconnects with an old family friend, who helps her heal and find love during the holidays.', 'When an accident puts her music dreams on hold, a gifted violinist reconnects with an old family friend, who helps her heal and find love during the holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQLx1b5P4niYC0n1S28FJLobYPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737794'),
  ('174717567522026566', 'The Christmas Box', 1995, 'Drama, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Marcus Cole, John Newby', 'Richard Paul Evans, Greg Taylor', 'Richard Thomas, Maureen O''Hara, Annette O''Toole, Kelsey Mulrooney, Robert Curtis Brown, Michael Ensign, Greg Brouwer, Nicole Forester', 'G', 'A ski-shop owner reluctantly moves himself, his wife, and his daughter in to an estate as live-in help for an elderly widow. While struggling to balance his career and family life, he has recurring dreams about an angel.', 'A ski-shop owner reluctantly moves himself, his wife, and his daughter in to an estate as live-in help for an elderly widow. While struggling to balance his career and family life, he has recurring dreams about an angel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezbT2hvOHJJlhSg6JifhPf5ODBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57857'),
  ('976797367893159432', 'The Christmas Calendar', 2017, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy, Romance', 'John Helme, Allan Harmon', 'Cookie Boyle, Walter Sawadsky', 'Laura Bell Bundy, Brendon Zub, Paloma Kwiatkowski, Frazey Ford, Johannah Newmarch, Jordan Ninko, Steven Cree Molison, Curtis Tweedie', null, 'When Emily, a struggling baker in a small town, receives a handmade Christmas Calendar from a secret admirer, the local residents become obsessed with finding out the identity of the sender.', 'When Emily, a struggling baker in a small town, receives a handmade Christmas Calendar from a secret admirer, the local residents become obsessed with finding out the identity of the sender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zazcbohG6IQAUykFun9XvXeQiHf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488262'),
  ('873223966122425918', 'The Christmas Card', 2006, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Maximo Munzi, Stephen Bridgewater, Lance Lanfear', 'Joany Kane', 'John Newton, Ed Asner, Alice Evans, Peter Jason, Ben Weber, Lois Nettleton, Glorinda Marie, Charlie Holliday', 'G', 'Sergeant Cody Cullen is deeply touched by a homemade Christmas card he receives while serving in Afghanistan. Upon his discharge, he treks to the picturesque California town of Nevada City. Cody is soon welcomed into the Spelman home and unexpectedly falls in love with the woman who sent the card, Faith.', 'Sergeant Cody Cullen is deeply touched by a homemade Christmas card he receives while serving in Afghanistan. Upon his discharge, he treks to the picturesque California town of Nevada City. Cody is soon welcomed into the Spelman home and unexpectedly falls in love with the woman who sent the card, Faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmw4hOBdpyzUyDJePhLh8oQTvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46526'),
  ('640023254773310724', 'The Christmas Carol', 1949, 'Fantasy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Arthur Pierson', null, 'Vincent Price, Taylor Holmes, Patrick Whyte, Nelson Leigh, Robert Hyatt, Jill St. John, Robert Clarke, Earl Lee', null, 'A Christmas Carol was a 1949 syndicated, black and white television special narrated by Vincent Price.', 'A Christmas Carol was a 1949 syndicated, black and white television special narrated by Vincent Price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZpP3uMq9LPXzHdLRSbTu1PGFZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229056'),
  ('1027493496218358549', 'The Christmas Charade', 2024, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Corey Sevier, Stephen Chandler Whitehead, Darien Gomez', 'Kate Pragnell', 'Rachel Skarsten, Corey Sevier, Kristin Booth, Rob Stewart, Jefferson Brown, Cynthia Dale, Matt Wells, Tamara Almeida', null, 'A cautious librarian raised by home security experts finds herself in a real-life adventure when a blind date mix-up leads her into an undercover FBI operation. Forced to pose as the girlfriend of Special Agent Josh, she helps him track down an art thief targeting the Saint Nicholas Ruby at a Christmas Eve charity ball.', 'A cautious librarian raised by home security experts finds herself in a real-life adventure when a blind date mix-up leads her into an undercover FBI operation. Forced to pose as the girlfriend of Special Agent Josh, she helps him track down an art thief targeting the Saint Nicholas Ruby at a Christmas Eve charity ball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jgFIqG7haKpxXnckzTw9pzlG4v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1359867'),
  ('78695018901565603', 'The Christmas Chronicles', 2018, 'Comedy, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Clay Kaytis, Don Burgess', 'Matt Lieberman', 'Darby Camp, Judah Lewis, Kurt Russell, Martin Roach, Lamorne Morris, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Oliver Hudson, Tony Nappo', 'PG', 'Siblings Kate and Teddy try to prove Santa Claus is real, but when they accidentally cause his sleigh to crash, they have to save Christmas.', 'Siblings Kate and Teddy try to prove Santa Claus is real, but when they accidentally cause his sleigh to crash, they have to save Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Il2EMSF2KecrUKZPuen6BZmaCP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527435'),
  ('735982779714739796', 'The Christmas Chronicles: Part Two', 2020, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Don Burgess, Chris Columbus, Oliver Ferguson', 'Matt Lieberman, Chris Columbus', 'Kurt Russell, Goldie Hawn, Darby Camp, Judah Lewis, Julian Dennison, Jahzir Bruno, Darlene Love, Tyrese Gibson', 'PG', 'Kate Pierce is reluctantly spending Christmas with her mom’s new boyfriend and his son Jack. But when the North Pole and Christmas are threatened to be destroyed, Kate and Jack are unexpectedly pulled into a new adventure with Santa Claus.', 'Kate Pierce is reluctantly spending Christmas with her mom’s new boyfriend and his son Jack. But when the North Pole and Christmas are threatened to be destroyed, Kate and Jack are unexpectedly pulled into a new adventure with Santa Claus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sG0kbEvAi3RRLcGGU5h8l3qAPa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654028'),
  ('39441017049775292', 'The Christmas Clause', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'George Erschbamer', 'Sheri Elwood', 'Lea Thompson, Andrew Airlie, Rachel Hayward, Christina Jastrzembska, Rick Ravanello, Richard Ian Cox, Fiona Martinelli, Jill Morrison', null, 'A stressed out lawyer and mother of three gets her yuletide wish when she wishes to see what her life would be like if she had chosen to pursue her career in Law rather than marrying and becoming a working mother.', 'A stressed out lawyer and mother of three gets her yuletide wish when she wishes to see what her life would be like if she had chosen to pursue her career in Law rather than marrying and becoming a working mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8niEXuTI5tkplBvWTTqg7udmy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52687'),
  ('435877171616594943', 'The Christmas Contest', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Paula Elle, Tyler Walzak', null, 'Candace Cameron Bure, John Brotherton, Barbara Niven, BJ Harrison, Jennifer Higgin, Doron Bell, Keenan Tracey, Matteus Lunot', 'G', 'Exes Lara and Ben compete in a Christmas contest to win money for the charity of their choosing. The city watches them battle and choose what is more important, victory or love.', 'Exes Lara and Ben compete in a Christmas contest to win money for the charity of their choosing. The city watches them battle and choose what is more important, victory or love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qcRGnqeCyYFekRNAK4A366cbNF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874144'),
  ('498240200724205557', 'The Christmas Contract', 2018, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Matt S. Bell, Monika Mitchell, Joe Kirkpatrick', 'Cassie Doyle', 'Hilarie Burton, Robert Buckley, Danneel Ackles, Cheryl Ladd, Jordan Ladd, Bruce Boxleitner, Jason London, Teri Wyble', null, 'It’s Jolie’s first time going back home to Louisiana since her devastating break-up with Foster Burke. Seeing him is inevitable as their parents run the town’s annual Christmas Market together, but when she discovers Foster is bringing home a new girlfriend, Jolie cannot bear the thought of going home alone and seeing them together. Her best friend Naomi suggests that Jolie bring her flaky brother, Jack, home for Christmas as he has no plans this year. Jolie, a professional web designer, is hesitant; so, Naomi, a lawyer, creates a Christmas contract to give them both something they want—a buffer for those awkward moments around Jolie’s ex and a website to help sell Jack’s upcoming novel. Unbeknownst to them, the Christmas contract proves to be so much more than what they signed up for.', 'It’s Jolie’s first time going back home to Louisiana since her devastating break-up with Foster Burke. Seeing him is inevitable as their parents run the town’s annual Christmas Market together, but when she discovers Foster is bringing home a new girlfriend, Jolie cannot bear the thought of going home alone and seeing them together. Her best friend Naomi suggests that Jolie bring her flaky brother, Jack, home for Christmas as he has no plans this year. Jolie, a professional web designer, is hesitant; so, Naomi, a lawyer, creates a Christmas contract to give them both something they want—a buffer for those awkward moments around Jolie’s ex and a website to help sell Jack’s upcoming novel. Unbeknownst to them, the Christmas contract proves to be so much more than what they signed up for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmDrqhmb6lBytw7HepNfHOMdKiG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550655'),
  ('129496318411773558', 'The Christmas Cottage', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul A. Kaufman, Paul Mitchnick', 'Claudia Grazioso', 'Merritt Patterson, Steve Lund, Brittney Wilson, Carey Feehan, Victor Zinck, Jr., P. Lynn Johnson, Laurie Paton, Wendy Abbott', null, 'When Lacey takes a rare break from work for her friend Ava''s Christmas Eve wedding, she reconnects with her former flame, Ean. The two decorate the cottage where the newlyweds will spend their honeymoon – a cottage said to bring true love to anyone who stays there – and feel their chemistry return.', 'When Lacey takes a rare break from work for her friend Ava''s Christmas Eve wedding, she reconnects with her former flame, Ean. The two decorate the cottage where the newlyweds will spend their honeymoon – a cottage said to bring true love to anyone who stays there – and feel their chemistry return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qx2FnjqJGlw8BgIYRGVyid7rJ18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480626'),
  ('865200391388851033', 'The Christmas Cure', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'John Bradshaw, Russ Goozee', 'Marcy Holland', 'Brooke Nevin, Steve Byers, Patrick Duffy, Kathleen Laskey, Dale Whibley, Jocelyn Hudon, Charlie Boyle, Vanessa Burns', 'G', 'A doctor returns home for Christmas to find that her father has decided to retire from his own practice. After reuniting with her high school sweetheart, she wonders if she should stay and take over her father''s practice.', 'A doctor returns home for Christmas to find that her father has decided to retire from his own practice. After reuniting with her high school sweetheart, she wonders if she should stay and take over her father''s practice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5lRVUm0qFUUP4Ffo7z6kAHflBL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465501'),
  ('474952256485728513', 'The Christmas Doctor', 2020, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Kevin Fair', 'Neal H. Dobrofsky, Tippi Dobrofsky', 'Holly Robinson Peete, Adrian Holmes, Fred Henderson, Bronwen Smith, Nicole Anthony, Marlie Collins, Rhinnan Payne, Colleen Winton', null, 'A week before Christmas, Dr. Alicia Wright is offered an assignment away from home. A mysterious man from her past journeys to find her before Christmas and brings with him a revelation that could change Alicia’s life forever.', 'A week before Christmas, Dr. Alicia Wright is offered an assignment away from home. A mysterious man from her past journeys to find her before Christmas and brings with him a revelation that could change Alicia’s life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccKVfjFudH4SM16Svyab5fwBYcS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746040'),
  ('455321762440681642', 'The Christmas Dream', 1900, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'The entire story of Christmastide is here depicted. The scene opens in a large boudoir of an apparently wealthy man''s home. His children, assisted by their governess, are about to retire. Before lying down they hang up their stockings on the edge of the bed. The picture changes and night appears. We see the housetops of the town and angels are flying about depositing packages in each of the chimneys. (Edison Catalog)', 'The entire story of Christmastide is here depicted. The scene opens in a large boudoir of an apparently wealthy man''s home. His children, assisted by their governess, are about to retire. Before lying down they hang up their stockings on the edge of the bed. The picture changes and night appears. We see the housetops of the town and angels are flying about depositing packages in each of the chimneys. (Edison Catalog)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lyYATrYIo8RfbcadyvpnRt4J1A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106806'),
  ('278784416893453042', 'The Christmas Games', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Salvador Suárez Obregón, Daniel Anguiano', 'Constanza Boquet', 'Harold Azuara, Regina Pavón, Jesús Zavala, Francisco De La Reguera, Ligia Uriarte, Martín Barba, Esmeralda Soto, Yuriria del Valle', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsF67uKoerYgnevLej5Vo9xlGF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1054864'),
  ('214282808514295508', 'The Christmas Gift', 1986, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Michael Pressman, John Coquillon', 'Christopher Grabenstein', 'John Denver, Jane Kaczmarek, Edward Winter, Gennie James, Pat Corley, Mary Wickes, James T. Callahan, Kurtwood Smith', null, 'A widowed New York City architect and his young daughter take a Christmas vacation and end up in a small mystical town in Colorado where everyone believes in Santa Claus.', 'A widowed New York City architect and his young daughter take a Christmas vacation and end up in a small mystical town in Colorado where everyone believes in Santa Claus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTDsf98X0KHRUiZiiFqP36Rgjee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99914'),
  ('1109058674752779666', 'The Christmas House', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'William McKnight, Michael Grossman', null, 'Robert Buckley, Ana Ayora, Treat Williams, Sharon Lawrence, Jonathan Bennett, Brad Harder, Celeste ''Coco'' Conn, Nathan Parrott', null, 'Working through some difficult decisions, Mitchell family matriarch Phylis and patriarch Bill, have summoned their two grown sons – TV stars Mike Mitchell and Brandon Mitchell – home for the holidays. It is their hope that bringing the family together to recreate the Christmas house, will help them find resolution and make a memorable holiday for the entire family and community.', 'Working through some difficult decisions, Mitchell family matriarch Phylis and patriarch Bill, have summoned their two grown sons – TV stars Mike Mitchell and Brandon Mitchell – home for the holidays. It is their hope that bringing the family together to recreate the Christmas house, will help them find resolution and make a memorable holiday for the entire family and community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jDe1ExYjyCSpRNRpk9fFvh5SWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746042'),
  ('779234330926314941', 'The Christmas House 2: Deck Those Halls', 2021, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Rich Newey, William McKnight', 'Erin Rodman', 'Robert Buckley, Ana Ayora, Jonathan Bennett, Brad Harder, Treat Williams, Sharon Lawrence, Michelle Harrison, Matthew James Dowden', 'G', 'The Mitchell brothers compete to see who can create the best Christmas House.', 'The Mitchell brothers compete to see who can create the best Christmas House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWccc2GZL0w4IUiW2d4o81c8A28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874196'),
  ('607735165476893259', 'The Christmas List', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Charles Jarrott, Charles Jarrott, Henry Chan', 'Marie Weiss', 'Mimi Rogers, Stella Stevens, Rob Stewart, Enuka Okuma, Bill Switzer, Jano Frandsen, Madison Graie, Andrew Johnston', 'PG', 'Perfume saleslady Melody Parris feels like her life is in neutral. Her stick-in-the mud boyfriend won''t commit and she gets passed over for a promotion at the store where she works. She decides to make a Christmas list. After it''s deposited in Santa''s mailbox at the store, she starts getting everything she wanted, but it doesn''t always turn out as she expected.', 'Perfume saleslady Melody Parris feels like her life is in neutral. Her stick-in-the mud boyfriend won''t commit and she gets passed over for a promotion at the store where she works. She decides to make a Christmas list. After it''s deposited in Santa''s mailbox at the store, she starts getting everything she wanted, but it doesn''t always turn out as she expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pvPGlQORmNBROfkYDolJrDVjH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82375'),
  ('597639573985059782', 'The Christmas Miracle of Jonathan Toomey', 2007, 'Family', 'Bill Clark, Emmanuel Kadosh, Simon Morris', 'Bill Clark', 'Tom Berenger, Joely Richardson, Luke Ward-Wilkinson, Saoirse Ronan, Aran Bell, Sarah Wildor, Thomas Briggs, Clare Burt', null, 'When a broken hearted boy loses the treasured wooden nativity set that links him to his dead father, his worried mother persuades a lonely ill-tempered woodcarver to create a replacement, and to allow her son to watch him work on it.', 'When a broken hearted boy loses the treasured wooden nativity set that links him to his dead father, his worried mother persuades a lonely ill-tempered woodcarver to create a replacement, and to allow her son to watch him work on it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQT3V3hGrkeedhygz7DH7iIyN4M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15964'),
  ('876398767084156241', 'The Christmas Parade', 2014, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Wright, Russ Goozee', 'Carley Smale, Robert Vaughn', 'AnnaLynne McCord, Jefferson Brown, Drew Scott, Jennifer Gibson, Christian Martyn, Katherine Forrester, Jack Fulton, Devon Soltendieck', null, 'A popular network morning host finds herself humiliated on the air by her fiancé and disappears to a small town. While there, she helps a budding artist save a community art center for the town''s kids, by helping them with their float for the annual Christmas Parade.', 'A popular network morning host finds herself humiliated on the air by her fiancé and disappears to a small town. While there, she helps a budding artist save a community art center for the town''s kids, by helping them with their float for the annual Christmas Parade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbFcTozizElEXP9uAxtTXbQa8mn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299591'),
  ('395969338223838562', 'The Christmas Promise', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Fred Gerber, Geoff Wallace', 'Kathy Kloves', 'Torrey DeVitto, Dylan Bruce, Patrick Duffy, Giles Panton, Matthew James Dowden, Karen Holness, Jarod Joseph, Tara Wilson', 'G', 'Nicole learns to deal with grief, with the help of her grandfather and a carpenter she hires to renovate the home that was once meant for her and her fiancé.', 'Nicole learns to deal with grief, with the help of her grandfather and a carpenter she hires to renovate the home that was once meant for her and her fiancé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXLcwofSyioqmFdgya4utrt0zsd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874147'),
  ('240819262389444919', 'The Christmas Quest', 2024, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Dustin Rikert, Tómas Örn Tómasson', 'Marcy Holland', 'Lacey Chabert, Kristoffer Polaha, Derek Riddell, Aldís Amah Hamilton, Jóel Sæmundsson, Hanna María Karlsdóttir, Thor Tulinius, Isla McRae', null, 'An archaeologist, her ex-husband who is a Norse language expert, search for legendary treasure in Iceland during Christmas. Others join the hunt, leading to a thrilling race to secure the treasure before the wrong people obtain it.', 'An archaeologist, her ex-husband who is a Norse language expert, search for legendary treasure in Iceland during Christmas. Others join the hunt, leading to a thrilling race to secure the treasure before the wrong people obtain it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWdCr0xFWQP2ei05pFpduyrTxwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1325912'),
  ('215413548818146536', 'The Christmas Retreat', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Jason Bourque', 'Erica Deutschman', 'Rhiannon Fish, Clayton James, Lynn Whyte, Marc Gaudet, Jonathan Purvis, Vincent Ross, Carly Fawcett', null, 'When Kim''s boyfriend breaks up with her instead of proposing, Kim''s mom takes her away to a Christmas Retreat to reconnect with the spirit of the holiday. There she meets newly unemployed Mark.', 'When Kim''s boyfriend breaks up with her instead of proposing, Kim''s mom takes her away to a Christmas Retreat to reconnect with the spirit of the holiday. There she meets newly unemployed Mark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ree44r29HUs5GArlkKsMAPv2ZbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003485'),
  ('494593931661927155', 'The Christmas Ring', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Troy Scott, Mike Kam', 'Anna White', 'Nazneen Contractor, David Alpay, Chelsey Reist, Colleen Wheeler, Kazumi Evans, Veronika Hadravá, Casey Manderson, Milo Shandel', null, 'A reporter searches for the love story behind an antique engagement ring. With the help of the ring’s owner’s grandson, they learn the legacy his grandparent’s left behind.', 'A reporter searches for the love story behind an antique engagement ring. With the help of the ring’s owner’s grandson, they learn the legacy his grandparent’s left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qG6kfgzZyekumMjM9oxRNNIeYoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746035'),
  ('444347226148684507', 'The Christmas Secret', 2014, 'Romance, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Norma Bailey', null, 'Bethany Joy Lenz, John Reardon, Jaeda Lily Miller, William Ainscough, Nicola Cavendish, Tasya Teles, Michael Hogan, Susan Hogan', null, 'While her life is falling apart, single mother Christine finds a magical family heirloom that leads to love and good fortune during Christmas.', 'While her life is falling apart, single mother Christine finds a magical family heirloom that leads to love and good fortune during Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCaU7Hl9d7Ey3X9OokZoPsq7WfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310972'),
  ('36116452238413909', 'The Christmas Setup', 2020, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Pat Mills, Russ Goozee', 'Michael J. Murray', 'Ben Lewis, Blake Lee, Fran Drescher, Ellen Wong, Chad Connell, Pedro Miguel Arce, Glen Grant, Jaime “Lucinda Miu” Lujan', null, 'Follows the story of New York lawyer Hugo who heads to Milwaukee with his best friend Madelyn to spend the holidays with his brother Aiden and his mom Kate, who is also in charge of the local Christmas celebrations. Ever the matchmaker, Kate arranges for Hugo to run into Patrick, Hugo’s high school friend and secret crush, who has recently returned after a successful stint in Silicon Valley. As they enjoy the local holiday festivities together, Hugo and Patrick’s attraction to each other is undeniable and it looks as though Kate’s Santa-style matchmaking is a success. But as Hugo receives word of a big promotion requiring a move to London, he must decide what is most important to him.', 'Follows the story of New York lawyer Hugo who heads to Milwaukee with his best friend Madelyn to spend the holidays with his brother Aiden and his mom Kate, who is also in charge of the local Christmas celebrations. Ever the matchmaker, Kate arranges for Hugo to run into Patrick, Hugo’s high school friend and secret crush, who has recently returned after a successful stint in Silicon Valley. As they enjoy the local holiday festivities together, Hugo and Patrick’s attraction to each other is undeniable and it looks as though Kate’s Santa-style matchmaking is a success. But as Hugo receives word of a big promotion requiring a move to London, he must decide what is most important to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7QD0hOSQuvsZFRyu9LsvNkiYmF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744952'),
  ('543608494036691083', 'The Christmas Shoes', 2002, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Andy Wolk, John Berrie', null, 'Rob Lowe, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Max Morrow, Maria del Mar, Hugh Thompson, Dorian Harewood, Shirley Douglas, Amber Marshall', 'NR', 'Two separate stories mesh - in the first, a young music teacher, Maggie Andrews, begins dying of a heart condition and her son Nathan tries to get a pair of Christmas shoes for her before she dies. In the second, lawyer Robert Layton and his wife Kate are slowly drifting apart and the matter comes to a head during Christmas when Kate takes over for Maggie for the school choir.', 'Two separate stories mesh - in the first, a young music teacher, Maggie Andrews, begins dying of a heart condition and her son Nathan tries to get a pair of Christmas shoes for her before she dies. In the second, lawyer Robert Layton and his wife Kate are slowly drifting apart and the matter comes to a head during Christmas when Kate takes over for Maggie for the school choir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDuFMPcx64Tbd46CvPLjsxWoJrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30768'),
  ('134519960100054092', 'The Christmas Star', 1986, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Alan Shapiro, Paul Lohmann', 'Carol Dysinger, Alan Shapiro', 'Ed Asner, René Auberjonois, Jim Metzler, Susan Tyrrell, Alan North, Fred Gwynne, Frank C. Turner, Karen Landry', null, 'A counterfeiter finds the true meaning of the holidays.', 'A counterfeiter finds the true meaning of the holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35Nl23IwBrw4MUZhQ03808ixJEC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13705'),
  ('282893665932505176', 'The Christmas That Almost Wasn''t', 1966, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Rossano Brazzi, Alvaro Mancori', 'Rossano Brazzi, Paul Tripp', 'Paul Tripp, Lydia Brazzi, Alberto Rabagliati, Rossano Brazzi, Sonny Fox, Mischa Auer, John Karlsen, Salvatore Furnari', 'G', 'Sam Whipple, an attorney in once-upon-a-time-land, is startled to receive a visit from Santa Claus shortly before Christmas. It seems that when he was a child, Sam wrote a letter thanking Santa for the presents he''d received, and offering to return the favor someday. That day is now - a mean old soul named Phineas Prune, who holds the deed to the North Pole, is demanding back rent. Otherwise, he''s going to evict Santa, Mrs. Claus and the elves and take all the Christmas toys. It''s up to Sam and Santa to find a way to pay off Prune and prevent Christmas from being canceled.', 'Sam Whipple, an attorney in once-upon-a-time-land, is startled to receive a visit from Santa Claus shortly before Christmas. It seems that when he was a child, Sam wrote a letter thanking Santa for the presents he''d received, and offering to return the favor someday. That day is now - a mean old soul named Phineas Prune, who holds the deed to the North Pole, is demanding back rent. Otherwise, he''s going to evict Santa, Mrs. Claus and the elves and take all the Christmas toys. It''s up to Sam and Santa to find a way to pay off Prune and prevent Christmas from being canceled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlryLOsibRwYjQh8s3fWodJjNt4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128780'),
  ('231361499295742049', 'The Christmas Toy', 1986, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy, Music, TV Movie', 'Eric Till', 'Laura Phillips', 'Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire, Kathryn Mullen, Jerry Nelson, Richard Hunt, Camille Bonora, Brian Henson, Rob Mills', 'NR', 'It''s Christmas Eve and the playroom is alive with excitement for the new toys that will arrive the next day. Balthazar, the old and wise bear, explains to the other toys that they must welcome the newcomers even though each of them may be replaced as one of the children''s new favorite toys.', 'It''s Christmas Eve and the playroom is alive with excitement for the new toys that will arrive the next day. Balthazar, the old and wise bear, explains to the other toys that they must welcome the newcomers even though each of them may be replaced as one of the children''s new favorite toys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6vCW5OxKD7HyH77rCBiBHi8BvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47670'),
  ('1082060836133252984', 'The Christmas Train', 2017, 'Family, TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Adam Sliwinski, Ron Oliver', 'Neal H. Dobrofsky, Tippi Dobrofsky', 'Dermot Mulroney, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Danny Glover, Joan Cusack, Holly Dignard, Kirsten Zien, Anthony Konechny, Karen Holness', 'G', 'Forced to take the intercontinental trip to Los Angeles by train, and determined to chronicle his adventure, disillusioned journalist Tom Langdon finds himself westbound with a variety of characters. While all passengers on the Christmas train appear to be headed for the same destination, Tom has no idea that the rugged locomotives taking him across America will instead detour straight into his heart.', 'Forced to take the intercontinental trip to Los Angeles by train, and determined to chronicle his adventure, disillusioned journalist Tom Langdon finds himself westbound with a variety of characters. While all passengers on the Christmas train appear to be headed for the same destination, Tom has no idea that the rugged locomotives taking him across America will instead detour straight into his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HNkp0zCLTeQuPR5xARkZM1KFVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474982'),
  ('154063888899392349', 'The Christmas Tree', 1969, 'Drama', 'Terence Young, Henri Alekan', 'Terence Young', 'William Holden, Virna Lisi, Bourvil, Brook Fuller, Madeleine Damien, Mario Feliciani, Friedrich von Ledebur, Georges Douking', 'G', 'A French-American millionaire, his girlfriend and his war buddy try to grant his dying son''s every wish.', 'A French-American millionaire, his girlfriend and his war buddy try to grant his dying son''s every wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oII9YeBtGkqsTh2mlzBEdV47pKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74403'),
  ('1000624077455686136', 'The Christmas Tree', 1991, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Flamarion Ferreira', 'Nels Christianson', 'William Duff-Griffin, Ayal Kleinman, Elly Drygas, Karen Drygas, Paul Whyte, Helen Quinn', null, 'Heartless Mrs. Mavilda runs an orphanage where kids live in miserable conditions because she keeps all of the donation money for herself. She hires a new assistant who, along with Santa, helps children finally have a merry Christmas.', 'Heartless Mrs. Mavilda runs an orphanage where kids live in miserable conditions because she keeps all of the donation money for herself. She hires a new assistant who, along with Santa, helps children finally have a merry Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8X1PftzXzFqg9RBxiB9zIiud7YR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308794'),
  ('977737006288732589', 'The Christmas Wish', 1998, 'Family, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Ian Barry, John Newby, Chris Edmonds', null, 'Neil Patrick Harris, Debbie Reynolds, Naomi Watts, Alexandra Wilson, Beverly Archer, Ian Meltzer, Gary Bayer, James Greene', 'G', 'Returning to his home town after the death of the grandfather who raised him, slick and cynical Wall Street trader Will Martin feels decidedly out of place, and not at all in tune with the Christmas preparations being made by the local citizenry. But Will isn''t really taking a sentimental journey at all: He''s merely in town to modernize and streamline his family''s real-estate company. While going through his grandfather''s effects, Will and his grandmother come across the old man''s diary--which reveals a lengthy relationship with a woman named Lillian.', 'Returning to his home town after the death of the grandfather who raised him, slick and cynical Wall Street trader Will Martin feels decidedly out of place, and not at all in tune with the Christmas preparations being made by the local citizenry. But Will isn''t really taking a sentimental journey at all: He''s merely in town to modernize and streamline his family''s real-estate company. While going through his grandfather''s effects, Will and his grandmother come across the old man''s diary--which reveals a lengthy relationship with a woman named Lillian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlWWf9lWA5iKjfgoCxZxoX4iVfS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44349'),
  ('1068197116099228716', 'The Chronicles of Evil', 2015, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Park Jong-cheol, Baek Woon-hak, Lee Sang-yong', 'Baek Woon-hak', 'Son Hyun-joo, Don Lee, Park Seo-jun, Choi Daniel, Lee Sang-won, Jeong Joon-won, Lee Jun-hyeok, Woo Jung-kook', null, 'A detective accidentally kills a man and disposes of the body to protect his career. The next day he sees that someone has hanged the corpse from a crane for all to see. He takes charge of the murder investigation to protect himself and find out who did it.', 'A detective accidentally kills a man and disposes of the body to protect his career. The next day he sees that someone has hanged the corpse from a crane for all to see. He takes charge of the murder investigation to protect himself and find out who did it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frVgs4psaZXITGK0gvCStUCW7Zx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340746'),
  ('795150365021831122', 'The Chronicles of Libidoists', 2024, 'Drama', 'Yang Ya-che, Chen Ko-chin, Lien Wan-ning', 'Yang Ya-che, Yu-Chu Chiang', 'Wu Kang-ren, Chu-Ping Liu, Alisia Liang, Will Or Wai-Lam, Eleven Yao, Alex Kao, Chloe Xiang, Alex Chou', null, 'The story unfolds with an allegorical inspiration from the well-known fairy tale, The Little Mermaid, in which the mermaid princess falls in love with the prince it saves from drowning, with a surprising twist of the mermaid being a young boy…', 'The story unfolds with an allegorical inspiration from the well-known fairy tale, The Little Mermaid, in which the mermaid princess falls in love with the prince it saves from drowning, with a surprising twist of the mermaid being a young boy…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lj60EOZ1LvEmN42Vcl1WAncwJ0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029244'),
  ('677814878830261511', 'The Chronicles of Narnia: Prince Caspian', 2008, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Andrew Adamson, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Jakub Dvorak', 'Andrew Adamson, Christopher Markus, Stephen McFeely', 'William Moseley, Anna Popplewell, Skandar Keynes, Georgie Henley, Ben Barnes, Tilda Swinton, Peter Dinklage, Sergio Castellitto', 'PG', 'One year after their incredible adventures in the Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe, Peter, Edmund, Lucy and Susan Pevensie return to Narnia to aid a young prince whose life has been threatened by the evil King Miraz. Now, with the help of a colorful cast of new characters, including Trufflehunter the badger and Nikabrik the dwarf, the Pevensie clan embarks on an incredible quest to ensure that Narnia is returned to its rightful heir.', 'One year after their incredible adventures in the Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe, Peter, Edmund, Lucy and Susan Pevensie return to Narnia to aid a young prince whose life has been threatened by the evil King Miraz. Now, with the help of a colorful cast of new characters, including Trufflehunter the badger and Nikabrik the dwarf, the Pevensie clan embarks on an incredible quest to ensure that Narnia is returned to its rightful heir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxz3WIyjZiSKUhaTIEJ3c1GcC9z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2454'),
  ('744697496910880669', 'The Chronicles of Narnia: Prince Caspian & The Voyage of the Dawn Treader', 1989, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family, TV Movie', 'Alex Kirby', null, 'Jean-Marc Perret, Sophie Wilcox, Jonathan R. Scott, Richard Dempsey, Sophie Cook, Robert Lang, Angela Barlow, Henry Woolf', 'NR', 'Young Prince Caspian of Narnia wonders and dreams about the old days of Narnia when animals talked, and there were mythical creatures and four rulers in Cair Paravel. But his uncle and aunt don’t like to hear him thinking of such things, and plan to murder him and take his throne. Caspian’s tutor, Dr. Cornelius manages to save him, and not only teach him about the old ways, but bring him into the real Narnia and introduce him to the real Narnia. But Caspian’s plight is desperate, and he must use the legendary horn to call help from another world: Peter, Susan, Edmund, and Lucy. Then, Lucy and Edmund are sent back to Narnia, along with their cousin Eustace, to assist Caspian on a voyage. Along their journey the children battle dragons and sea serpents, and sail across a golden lake to reach the edge of the world.', 'Young Prince Caspian of Narnia wonders and dreams about the old days of Narnia when animals talked, and there were mythical creatures and four rulers in Cair Paravel. But his uncle and aunt don’t like to hear him thinking of such things, and plan to murder him and take his throne. Caspian’s tutor, Dr. Cornelius manages to save him, and not only teach him about the old ways, but bring him into the real Narnia and introduce him to the real Narnia. But Caspian’s plight is desperate, and he must use the legendary horn to call help from another world: Peter, Susan, Edmund, and Lucy. Then, Lucy and Edmund are sent back to Narnia, along with their cousin Eustace, to assist Caspian on a voyage. Along their journey the children battle dragons and sea serpents, and sail across a golden lake to reach the edge of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wK7Sn9z7Hq3CYMezbePkDyYvz85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693737'),
  ('902725951115289774', 'The Chronicles of Narnia: The Lion, the Witch & the Wardrobe', 1988, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family, TV Movie', 'Jimmy T. Murakami, Chris Townsend, Marilyn Fox', null, 'Sophie Wilcox, Jonathan R. Scott, Richard Dempsey, Sophie Cook, Jeffrey Perry, Barbara Kellerman, Maureen Morris, Michael Aldridge', null, 'Four kids travel to the magical land of Narnia where they must battle an evil queen with the direction of the lion, Aslan.', 'Four kids travel to the magical land of Narnia where they must battle an evil queen with the direction of the lion, Aslan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LUwgYymfy3OrzUV9OD6e4S7RUz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925380'),
  ('89152445877185672', 'The Chronicles of Narnia: The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe', 2005, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Donald McAlpine, Andrew Adamson, Sarah Rose', 'Andrew Adamson, Ann Peacock, Stephen McFeely', 'William Moseley, Anna Popplewell, Skandar Keynes, Georgie Henley, Liam Neeson, Tilda Swinton, James McAvoy, Jim Broadbent', 'PG', 'Siblings Lucy, Edmund, Susan and Peter step through a magical wardrobe and find the land of Narnia. There, they discover a charming, once peaceful kingdom that has been plunged into eternal winter by the evil White Witch, Jadis. Aided by the wise and magnificent lion, Aslan, the children lead Narnia into a spectacular, climactic battle to be free of the Witch''s glacial powers forever.', 'Siblings Lucy, Edmund, Susan and Peter step through a magical wardrobe and find the land of Narnia. There, they discover a charming, once peaceful kingdom that has been plunged into eternal winter by the evil White Witch, Jadis. Aided by the wise and magnificent lion, Aslan, the children lead Narnia into a spectacular, climactic battle to be free of the Witch''s glacial powers forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iREd0rNCjYdf5Ar0vfaW32yrkm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411'),
  ('694902993211702251', 'The Chronicles of Narnia: The Voyage of the Dawn Treader', 2010, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Michael Apted, Dante Spinotti, Brendan Campbell', 'Michael Petroni, Christopher Markus, Stephen McFeely', 'Georgie Henley, Skandar Keynes, Ben Barnes, Will Poulter, Anna Popplewell, Tilda Swinton, William Moseley, Simon Pegg', 'PG', 'This time around Edmund and Lucy Pevensie, along with their pesky cousin Eustace Scrubb find themselves swallowed into a painting and on to a fantastic Narnian ship headed for the very edges of the world.', 'This time around Edmund and Lucy Pevensie, along with their pesky cousin Eustace Scrubb find themselves swallowed into a painting and on to a fantastic Narnian ship headed for the very edges of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pP27zlm9yeKrCeDZLFLP2HKELot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10140'),
  ('1003590990358757198', 'The Chronicles of Riddick', 2004, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'David Twohy, Hugh Johnson, John S. Bartley', 'David Twohy', 'Vin Diesel, Colm Feore, Thandiwe Newton, Judi Dench, Karl Urban, Alexa Davalos, Linus Roache, Yorick van Wageningen', 'PG-13', 'After years of outrunning ruthless bounty hunters, escaped convict Riddick suddenly finds himself caught between opposing forces in a fight for the future of the human race. Now, waging incredible battles on fantastic and deadly worlds, this lone, reluctant hero will emerge as humanity''s champion - and the last hope for a universe on the edge of annihilation.', 'After years of outrunning ruthless bounty hunters, escaped convict Riddick suddenly finds himself caught between opposing forces in a fight for the future of the human race. Now, waging incredible battles on fantastic and deadly worlds, this lone, reluctant hero will emerge as humanity''s champion - and the last hope for a universe on the edge of annihilation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVO1r90diKfFLzvZ5D3qK6Z558O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2789'),
  ('435500849926181428', 'The Chronicles of Riddick: Dark Fury', 2004, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Peter Chung', 'Brett Matthews', 'Vin Diesel, Rhiana Griffith, Keith David, Tress MacNeille, Roger L. Jackson, Nick Chinlund, Dwight Schultz, Julia Fletcher', 'NR', 'After their narrow escape at the end of "Pitch Black," Riddick, Jack and the Imam find themselves at the mercy of a madwoman who intends to entomb Riddick forever as part of a twisted art exhibit. With little but a shiv and Riddick''s innate viciousness to aid them, Riddick and his allies must find a way to escape from their captor and her band of mercenaries.', 'After their narrow escape at the end of "Pitch Black," Riddick, Jack and the Imam find themselves at the mercy of a madwoman who intends to entomb Riddick forever as part of a twisted art exhibit. With little but a shiv and Riddick''s innate viciousness to aid them, Riddick and his allies must find a way to escape from their captor and her band of mercenaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfNOl21lDRyqTeORYp4PiBlsW1t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2791'),
  ('441340151261223508', 'The Chronology of Water', 2025, 'Drama', 'Kristen Stewart, Corey C. Waters, Svetlana Punte', 'Kristen Stewart', 'Imogen Poots, Thora Birch, Jim Belushi, Tom Sturridge, Earl Cave, Michael Epp, Charlie Carrick, Susannah Flood', 'R', 'Plagued by an abusive childhood, a woman finds escape in competitive swimming, sexual experimentation, toxic relationships, and addiction before ultimately finding her voice through writing.', 'Plagued by an abusive childhood, a woman finds escape in competitive swimming, sexual experimentation, toxic relationships, and addiction before ultimately finding her voice through writing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pU3GZI6C9lxzxUnBccIQLThDLVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524635'),
  ('350195516529470609', 'The ChubbChubbs!', 2002, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Eric Armstrong', 'Jeff Wolverton', 'Bradford Simonsen, Jeff Wolverton, Dustin Adair, Eric Armstrong, Yakov Baytler, Mary Biondo, Sumit Das, Layne Friedman', null, 'A janitor at an alien night-club gets his wish to be a singer.', 'A janitor at an alien night-club gets his wish to be a singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MtQFiKWSlr5D8jUqYtfDVTld6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27042'),
  ('729008913397800638', 'The Chump Champ', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery, Jack Stevens', null, 'Daws Butler, Frank Graham, Bill Thompson', null, 'Droopy and Gorgeous Gorillawitz (Spike) are competing for the title of King of Sports and for a kiss from the Queen of Sports. Spike cheats as much as possible but can never seem to beat Droopy.', 'Droopy and Gorgeous Gorillawitz (Spike) are competing for the title of King of Sports and for a kiss from the Queen of Sports. Spike cheats as much as possible but can never seem to beat Droopy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMKDawV7Uzpb1WpElog4qU2vObh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87202'),
  ('984022688447012206', 'The Chumscrubber', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Arie Posin, Lawrence Sher, Kirill Davidoff', 'Zac Stanford, Arie Posin', 'Jamie Bell, Camilla Belle, Justin Chatwin, Glenn Close, Kathi Copeland, Rory Culkin, Thomas Curtis, Tim DeKay', 'R', 'The Chumscrubber is a dark comedy about the lives of people who live in upper-class suburbia. It all begins when Dean Stiffle finds the body of his friend, Troy. He doesn''t bother telling any of the adults because he knows they won''t care. Everyone in town is too self consumed to worry about anything else than themselves. And everybody is on some form of drug just to get through their days.', 'The Chumscrubber is a dark comedy about the lives of people who live in upper-class suburbia. It all begins when Dean Stiffle finds the body of his friend, Troy. He doesn''t bother telling any of the adults because he knows they won''t care. Everyone in town is too self consumed to worry about anything else than themselves. And everybody is on some form of drug just to get through their days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMb26IjDgdq8p4H3XNO1CAsjT4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13919'),
  ('1106456051413316244', 'The Church', 1989, 'Horror', 'Michele Soavi, Renato Tafuri, Filiberto Fiaschi', 'Dario Argento, Michele Soavi, Franco Ferrini', 'Hugh Quarshie, Tomas Arana, Feodor Chaliapin Jr., Barbara Cupisti, Antonella Vitale, Giovanni Lombardo Radice, Asia Argento, Roberto Caruso', 'R', 'In a Gothic cathedral built on the mass grave of a Teutonic purge, an ancient discovery by the new librarian will release an unholy maelstrom of madness, violence, and demonic vengeance.', 'In a Gothic cathedral built on the mass grave of a Teutonic purge, an ancient discovery by the new librarian will release an unholy maelstrom of madness, violence, and demonic vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i44N7Es8ei8glNwTO0Sjx9rL51k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40364'),
  ('1087359043162735735', 'The Ciambra', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jonas Carpignano, Diana Occorsio, Gwyn Sannia', 'Jonas Carpignano', 'Pio Amato, Koudous Seihon, Damiano Amato, Iolanda Amato, Patrizia Amato, Rocco Amato, Susanna Amato, Francesco Pio Amato', null, 'Pio Amato, a 14 year-old member of a small Romani community in southern Italian town of Gioia Tauro in Calabria, is in a hurry to grow up. Pio follows his older brother Cosimo everywhere and from him he learns how to hustle and how to navigate the streets of his hometown. One night Pio sets out to prove to his brother that he is as good or better than him but, when things go wrong, a series of events will forever change the way he sees the world.', 'Pio Amato, a 14 year-old member of a small Romani community in southern Italian town of Gioia Tauro in Calabria, is in a hurry to grow up. Pio follows his older brother Cosimo everywhere and from him he learns how to hustle and how to navigate the streets of his hometown. One night Pio sets out to prove to his brother that he is as good or better than him but, when things go wrong, a series of events will forever change the way he sees the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIkDmCWDIWyHAQgKCZpuD5d8kKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453270'),
  ('581604062920722330', 'The Cider House Rules', 1999, 'Drama', 'Lasse Hallström, Oliver Stapleton, Stephen P. Dunn', 'John Irving', 'Tobey Maguire, Charlize Theron, Michael Caine, Delroy Lindo, Paul Rudd, Jane Alexander, Kathy Baker, Erykah Badu', 'PG-13', 'Homer is an orphan who was never adopted, becoming the favorite of orphanage director Dr. Larch. Dr. Larch imparts his full medical knowledge on Homer, who becomes a skilled, albeit unlicensed, physician. But Homer yearns for a self-chosen life outside the orphanage. What will Homer learn about life and love in the cider house? What of the destiny that Dr. Larch has planned for him?', 'Homer is an orphan who was never adopted, becoming the favorite of orphanage director Dr. Larch. Dr. Larch imparts his full medical knowledge on Homer, who becomes a skilled, albeit unlicensed, physician. But Homer yearns for a self-chosen life outside the orphanage. What will Homer learn about life and love in the cider house? What of the destiny that Dr. Larch has planned for him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAECAgqjSFRVZzEEGbFAZqZNiDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1715'),
  ('956582582314753350', 'The Cigarette', 1919, 'Drama', 'Germaine Dulac, Louis Chaix', 'Jacques de Baroncelli', 'Andrée Brabant, Gabriel Signoret, Jules Raucourt, Genevieve Williams', null, 'A Parisian museum director believes his wife is cheating on him and so places a poisoned cigarette in the box on his desk, thus allowing chance to decide the moment of his death.', 'A Parisian museum director believes his wife is cheating on him and so places a poisoned cigarette in the box on his desk, thus allowing chance to decide the moment of his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9zFRvx5yzgMM00NDuxWJR2IO55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282232'),
  ('382744407130556382', 'The Cimarron Kid', 1952, 'Western', 'Budd Boetticher, Charles P. Boyle, Joseph Gershenson', 'Louis Stevens', 'Audie Murphy, Beverly Tyler, James Best, Yvette Duguay, John Hudson, Hugh O''Brian, Roy Roberts, David Bauer', 'NR', 'Audie Murphy comes into his own as a Western star in this story. Wrongly accused by crooked railroad officials of aiding a train heist by his old friends the Daltons, he joins their gang and becomes an active participant in other robberies. Betrayed by a fellow gang member, Murphy becomes a fugitive in the end. Seeking refuge at the ranch of a reformed gang member, he hopes to flee with the man''s daughter to South America, but he''s captured in the end and led off to jail. The girl promises to wait.', 'Audie Murphy comes into his own as a Western star in this story. Wrongly accused by crooked railroad officials of aiding a train heist by his old friends the Daltons, he joins their gang and becomes an active participant in other robberies. Betrayed by a fellow gang member, Murphy becomes a fugitive in the end. Seeking refuge at the ranch of a reformed gang member, he hopes to flee with the man''s daughter to South America, but he''s captured in the end and led off to jail. The girl promises to wait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3D3E0sRkRI7r3OMO77mjIHiacj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60539'),
  ('133349901801702173', 'The Cincinnati Kid', 1965, 'Drama', 'Philip H. Lathrop, Norman Jewison', 'Ring Lardner, Jr., Terry Southern', 'Steve McQueen, Edward G. Robinson, Ann-Margret, Karl Malden, Tuesday Weld, Joan Blondell, Rip Torn, Jack Weston', 'NR', 'An up-and-coming poker player tries to prove himself in a high-stakes match against a long-time master of the game.', 'An up-and-coming poker player tries to prove himself in a high-stakes match against a long-time master of the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4Apy8FcF6a0lR1Qay1atpfwAv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:886'),
  ('655908698048920978', 'The Cinderella Addiction', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hayato Kawai, Ryohei Watanabe, Akiyoshi Yoshida', 'Ryohei Watanabe', 'Tao Tsuchiya, Kei Tanaka, Coco, Ryo Ishibashi, Anna Yamada, Gin Pun Chou, Bokuzo Masana, Wako Ando', null, 'Fukuura Koharu works at a child welfare office and plunges into despair overnight. Then she meets Daigo, a private-practice doctor raising his 8-year-old daughter on his own. She resolves to build a happy household, but things don''t go as expected.', 'Fukuura Koharu works at a child welfare office and plunges into despair overnight. Then she meets Daigo, a private-practice doctor raising his 8-year-old daughter on his own. She resolves to build a happy household, but things don''t go as expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKYFtRilK08MqyfuhXW484Daz1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724904'),
  ('403958862682013694', 'The Cinderelo Trapalhão', 1979, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Adriano Stuart, Dedé Santana', 'Wilson Vaz, Renato Aragão, Carlos Alberto de Nóbrega', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Sílvia Salgado, Maurício do Valle, Francisco Dantas, Christina Rocha', null, 'Cinderelo is a quiet young man from a small town, looked down upon by his peers for being dirty and cowardly. In truth, he is very brave and shows his strength when a family of devout people asks the group for help against a powerful landowner, Colonel Dourado. The colonel covets the family’s land, which is located in an oil-rich area. Dona Ivete, the landowner’s niece, assists the Trapalhões in fighting against the henchmen led by Souza.', 'Cinderelo is a quiet young man from a small town, looked down upon by his peers for being dirty and cowardly. In truth, he is very brave and shows his strength when a family of devout people asks the group for help against a powerful landowner, Colonel Dourado. The colonel covets the family’s land, which is located in an oil-rich area. Dona Ivete, the landowner’s niece, assists the Trapalhões in fighting against the henchmen led by Souza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7rTd4fzL9NgrslkYOZBGKAhja1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172497'),
  ('686258512674999059', 'The Circle', 1925, 'Comedy', 'Frank Borzage, Chester A. Lyons', 'Kenneth B. Clarke', 'Eleanor Boardman, Malcolm McGregor, Alec B. Francis, Eugenie Besserer, George Fawcett, Creighton Hale, Otto Hoffman, Eulalie Jensen', null, 'Elizabeth Cheney has a wealthy husband, social prominence and everything she could want in life . . . except Ted Lutton, the man she loves. She must decide whether to give everything up to follow her heart and run off with Ted.', 'Elizabeth Cheney has a wealthy husband, social prominence and everything she could want in life . . . except Ted Lutton, the man she loves. She must decide whether to give everything up to follow her heart and run off with Ted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5xpUdYx7osVHw0qXebzpPM77MK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120676'),
  ('480011150216249542', 'The Circle', 2000, 'Drama', 'Jafar Panahi, Bahram Badakshani, Fereshteh Sadr Orafai', 'Kambuzia Partovi', 'Nargess Mamizadeh, Maryiam Palvin Almani, Mojgan Faramarzi, Elham Saboktakin, Monir Arab, Maede Tahmasbi, Maryam Shayegan, Fereshteh Sadr Orafaee', null, 'Various women struggle to function in the oppressively sexist society of contemporary Iran.', 'Various women struggle to function in the oppressively sexist society of contemporary Iran.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTiRBOZ2iI4i26A0qNaEkqmZBpO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13898'),
  ('529195736004287260', 'The Circle', 2014, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Stefan Haupt, Tobias Dengler', 'Urs Frey, Ivan Madeo, Stefan Haupt', 'Matthias Hungerbühler, Sven Schelker, Babett Arens, Aaron Hitz, Martin Hug, Peter Jecklin, Ueli Jäggi, Sebastian Ledesma', null, 'A young teacher in Zurich in the 1950s falls in love with a transvestite star but is torn between his bourgeois existence and his commitment to homosexuality. He joins a gay organization that is eventually seen as the pioneer of gay emancipation in Europe.', 'A young teacher in Zurich in the 1950s falls in love with a transvestite star but is torn between his bourgeois existence and his commitment to homosexuality. He joins a gay organization that is eventually seen as the pioneer of gay emancipation in Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhnq72LZG1pXbHEGwHVvWDpleNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255890'),
  ('99171600658467468', 'The Circle', 2015, 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Levan Akin, Neus Ollé', 'Levan Akin, Sara Bergmark Elfgren', 'Josefin Asplund, Helena Engström, Miranda Frydman, Irma von Platen, Hanna Asp, Leona Axelsen, Ruth Vega Fernandez, Sebastian Hiort af Ornäs', null, 'An otherworldly evil is slipping into a small town in Sweden. Six unrelated girls have been chosen to fight this evil. Together they must overcome their differences in order to save themselves and the world.', 'An otherworldly evil is slipping into a small town in Sweden. Six unrelated girls have been chosen to fight this evil. Together they must overcome their differences in order to save themselves and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/az01atPxEdKdI1ZvgMp3iF2D0nn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272634'),
  ('550384908847340612', 'The Circle', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'James Ponsoldt, Matthew Libatique, Nicolas Harvard', 'James Ponsoldt, Dave Eggers', 'Emma Watson, Tom Hanks, John Boyega, Karen Gillan, Ellar Coltrane, Patton Oswalt, Glenne Headly, Bill Paxton', 'PG-13', 'A young tech worker takes a job at a powerful Internet corporation, quickly rises up the company''s ranks, and soon finds herself in a perilous situation concerning privacy, surveillance and freedom. She comes to learn that her decisions and actions will determine the future of humanity.', 'A young tech worker takes a job at a powerful Internet corporation, quickly rises up the company''s ranks, and soon finds herself in a perilous situation concerning privacy, surveillance and freedom. She comes to learn that her decisions and actions will determine the future of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQVqd5rWrx5GbXhJNuvKy4Viz6j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339988'),
  ('637208548919950346', 'The Circuit', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Family, TV Movie', 'Neil Roach, Peter Werner', 'Quinton Peeples', 'Michelle Trachtenberg, Billy Campbell, Drew Fuller, Paul Rae, Tommy Lioutas, Maurice Dean Wint, Kristina Nicoll, Hollis McLaren', null, 'Al Shines, former king of the US race car track circuit, has a hard time starting his own team, once he''s fired by his sponsor Robin Cates. Robin hired Al''s immature daughter Kylie Shines instead. She resents Al''s inevitable ''absence'' as a widowed father, as well as the reigning champion, equally young but professionally vetted Kid Walker. Kylie tries to prove herself against Kid while having an on-off affair with him. Cates''s marketing strategy dictates his intentions to manipulate Walker and both Shines racers.', 'Al Shines, former king of the US race car track circuit, has a hard time starting his own team, once he''s fired by his sponsor Robin Cates. Robin hired Al''s immature daughter Kylie Shines instead. She resents Al''s inevitable ''absence'' as a widowed father, as well as the reigning champion, equally young but professionally vetted Kid Walker. Kylie tries to prove herself against Kid while having an on-off affair with him. Cates''s marketing strategy dictates his intentions to manipulate Walker and both Shines racers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCJy5vtYouRCDbut05pVcI8Ks18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71907'),
  ('1002859699073804455', 'The Circus Princess', 1982, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Svetlana Druzhinina, Anatoliy Mukasey', 'Svetlana Druzhinina', 'Natalya Belokhvostikova, Igor Keblušek, Nikolay Trofimov, Yuriy Moroz, Yelena Shanina, Lyudmila Kasatkina, Vladimir Basov, Aleksandr Shirvindt', null, 'The whole city is rushing to the circus to see the deadly act of the famous masked artist, the mysterious Mr. X. Among the guests is a rich widow, Countess Palinskaya, for whom any man is ready to perform a feat. But only the mysterious X is able to ignite the flame of love in the heart of the inflexible Countess...', 'The whole city is rushing to the circus to see the deadly act of the famous masked artist, the mysterious Mr. X. Among the guests is a rich widow, Countess Palinskaya, for whom any man is ready to perform a feat. But only the mysterious X is able to ignite the flame of love in the heart of the inflexible Countess...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luzFwwigX6tD0c0scfe4Rw8rKJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245280'),
  ('755924469367518044', 'The Cisco Kid', 1994, 'Comedy, Western, TV Movie', 'Luis Valdez, Guillermo Navarro, Iris Grossman', 'Michael Kane, Luis Valdez', 'Jimmy Smits, Cheech Marin, Sadie Frost, Bruce Payne, Ron Perlman, Tony Amendola, Tim Thomerson, Pedro Armendáriz Jr.', null, 'This update of the 1950 western TV series changes Cisco and Pancho from wandering heroes of the old west to somewhat anti-"gringo" Mexican revolutionaries.', 'This update of the 1950 western TV series changes Cisco and Pancho from wandering heroes of the old west to somewhat anti-"gringo" Mexican revolutionaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AbEGDjCQ4uvuAb0soTKEwf9zSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179376'),
  ('1105670064981216263', 'The Citadel', 1938, 'Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, Harry Stradling Sr., Pen Tennyson', 'Frank Wead, Ian Dalrymple, Elizabeth Hill', 'Robert Donat, Rosalind Russell, Ralph Richardson, Rex Harrison, Emlyn Williams, Penelope Dudley-Ward, Francis L. Sullivan, Mary Clare', 'NR', 'Andrew Manson, a young, idealistic, newly qualified Scottish doctor arrives in Wales takes his first job in a mining town, and begins to wonder at the persistent cough many of the miners have. When his attempts to prove its cause are thwarted, he moves to London. His new practice does badly. But when a friend shows him how to make a lucrative practice from rich hypochondriacs, it will take a great shock to show him what the truth of being a doctor really is.', 'Andrew Manson, a young, idealistic, newly qualified Scottish doctor arrives in Wales takes his first job in a mining town, and begins to wonder at the persistent cough many of the miners have. When his attempts to prove its cause are thwarted, he moves to London. His new practice does badly. But when a friend shows him how to make a lucrative practice from rich hypochondriacs, it will take a great shock to show him what the truth of being a doctor really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyGS36ZBJmp9RY9zFfX1arralxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84090'),
  ('630716212582809636', 'The City', 1939, 'Documentary', 'Willard Van Dyke, Ralph Steiner, Ralph Steiner', 'Pare Lorentz, Henwar Rodakiewicz, Lewis Mumford', 'Morris Carnovsky', null, 'A prescient documentary about city planning, which presents idyllic suburbs and nuclear families as a solution to the chaos, poverty and social decay of industrialized inner cities.', 'A prescient documentary about city planning, which presents idyllic suburbs and nuclear families as a solution to the chaos, poverty and social decay of industrialized inner cities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tmX2VcgEJpGNycljDpk0sq78Xf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163093'),
  ('76896776947860412', 'The City', 1977, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Harvey Hart, Jacques R. Marquette', null, 'Robert Forster, Don Johnson, Ward Costello, Jimmy Dean, Mark Hamill, Susan Sullivan, Paul Fix, Felton Perry', null, 'Matt and Scott are two detectives trying to catch a crazy guy who has a beef with a country singer. Banks'' problem with country singer, Wes Collins, is that Wes punched him in the face when he was a baby. Banks is now intent on getting revenge for this by killing Wes. Only Matt and Scott can stop him. Written by Josh Pasnak', 'Matt and Scott are two detectives trying to catch a crazy guy who has a beef with a country singer. Banks'' problem with country singer, Wes Collins, is that Wes punched him in the face when he was a baby. Banks is now intent on getting revenge for this by killing Wes. Only Matt and Scott can stop him. Written by Josh Pasnak', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qZ1vT5xo93hYheo4aMMwqJ5QWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214996'),
  ('1055971207222930637', 'The City', 1999, 'Drama', 'David Riker, Harlan Bosmajian', 'David Riker', 'Anthony Rivera, Joseph Rigano, Miguel Maldonado, Cipriano García, Leticia Herrera, José Rabelo', null, 'The stories of four Hispanic immigrants living in New York City.', 'The stories of four Hispanic immigrants living in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFZVYRZCpDcXZEQUKlzUIeXHLDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46798'),
  ('330340129614148876', 'The City and the Dogs', 1985, 'Drama', 'Francisco J. Lombardi', 'José Watanabe', 'Gustavo Bueno, Pablo Serra, Luis Álvarez, Juan Manuel Ochoa, Eduardo Adrianzén, Liliana Navarro, Miguel Iza, Aristóteles Picho', null, 'Four angry cadets have formed an inner circle in an attempt to beat the system and ward off the boredom and stifling confinement of the military academy, set off a chain of events that starts with a theft and leads to murder.', 'Four angry cadets have formed an inner circle in an attempt to beat the system and ward off the boredom and stifling confinement of the military academy, set off a chain of events that starts with a theft and leads to murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezGe6ghKqogUGjZKW6o9uQAUsJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40380'),
  ('253305852905880438', 'The City Below', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Christoph Hochhäusler, Bernhard Keller', 'Christoph Hochhäusler, Ulrich Peltzer', 'Nicolette Krebitz, Robert Hunger-Bühler, Mark Waschke, Corinna Kirchhoff, Lâm Vissay, Wolfgang Böck, Paul Faßnacht, Oliver Broumis', null, 'A man and a woman at an art exhibition share a fleeting moment of attraction, which neither can act upon. Days later, a chance second meeting leads to an innocent coffee and the two strangers – both married - toy with their unexplainable fascination for each other. Svenja is curious and finds herself in a hotel room with Roland, but she does not consummate an affair. A powerful executive at the large bank where Svenja''s husband works, Roland is used to getting what he wants. He manipulates the transfer of her husband to Indonesia to replace a recently murdered bank manager. Unaware of Roland’s actions, Svenja now ceases to resist...', 'A man and a woman at an art exhibition share a fleeting moment of attraction, which neither can act upon. Days later, a chance second meeting leads to an innocent coffee and the two strangers – both married - toy with their unexplainable fascination for each other. Svenja is curious and finds herself in a hotel room with Roland, but she does not consummate an affair. A powerful executive at the large bank where Svenja''s husband works, Roland is used to getting what he wants. He manipulates the transfer of her husband to Indonesia to replace a recently murdered bank manager. Unaware of Roland’s actions, Svenja now ceases to resist...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGipzKdiBhaIHeNc2H4fU4Fa9oO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78400'),
  ('619302111999987051', 'The City Defends Itself', 1951, 'Crime, Drama', 'Pietro Germi, Marcello Giannini, Ottorino Vidotto', 'Giuseppe Mangione, Pietro Germi', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Renato Baldini, Cosetta Greco, Paul Müller, Fausto Tozzi, Tamara Lees, Emma Baron, Patrizia Manca', null, 'Four criminals commit a robbery at a soccer stadium, and then split up to try to hide separately from the police.', 'Four criminals commit a robbery at a soccer stadium, and then split up to try to hide separately from the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvF4BFYHnkFLz3JRTuxjZR57AME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211561'),
  ('143607016135150273', 'The City of Lost Children', 1995, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Marc Caro, Darius Khondji', 'Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Gilles Adrien, Marc Caro', 'Ron Perlman, Dominique Pinon, Judith Vittet, Daniel Emilfork, Jean-Claude Dreyfus, Geneviève Brunet, Odile Mallet, Mireille Mossé', null, 'A scientist in a surrealist society kidnaps children to steal their dreams, hoping that they slow his aging process.', 'A scientist in a surrealist society kidnaps children to steal their dreams, hoping that they slow his aging process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whwT3Q9JxbAYzEc3t7uYYcCbTMf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:902'),
  ('841150645356023372', 'The City of Lost Souls', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Takashi Miike, Naosuke Imaizumi', 'Toshiki Kimura, Seishu Hase', 'Teah, Michele Reis, Patricia Manterola, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Koji Kikkawa, Ren Osugi, Akaji Maro, Anatoli Krasnov', null, 'Brazilian-Japanese gangster Mario rescues his Chinese girlfriend Kei as she''s about to be deported from Japan. Desperate to escape, he hides in Tokyo''s booming Japanese-Portuguese community and seeks passage from the country from a Russian mobster. To meet his price, they hold up a bigtime drug deal between the Chinese Mafia and the local Yakuza.', 'Brazilian-Japanese gangster Mario rescues his Chinese girlfriend Kei as she''s about to be deported from Japan. Desperate to escape, he hides in Tokyo''s booming Japanese-Portuguese community and seeks passage from the country from a Russian mobster. To meet his price, they hold up a bigtime drug deal between the Chinese Mafia and the local Yakuza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TajLnUCAWlAgl47qcmg28rAaZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36273'),
  ('1094955649437830519', 'The City of Masters', 1965, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Vladimir Bychkov, Aleksandr Knyazhinsky, Mikhail Ardabyevsky', 'Nikolay Erdman', 'Marianna Vertinskaya, Georgi Lapeto, Lev Lemke, Pavel Shpringfeld, Savely Kramarov, Yelizaveta Uvarova, Zinoviy Gerdt, Igor Yasulovich', null, 'After their town is occupied the citizens are trying to fight the enemy. Based on Tamara Gabbe fairy tale.', 'After their town is occupied the citizens are trying to fight the enemy. Based on Tamara Gabbe fairy tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hayhu4e0s1W32zSOkboPWhN79VC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284687'),
  ('541041961611309401', 'The City of No Limits', 2002, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Antonio Hernández', 'Antonio Hernández, Enrique Brasó', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Geraldine Chaplin, Ana Fernández, Adriana Ozores, Leticia Brédice', null, 'Victor is a man who gets to Paris to join his family around their seriously ill father, Max. Victor is desperately asked for help by Max. What seems in the beginning mere delusions of an old man losing his mind, begin to show traces of some sort of real ''secret'' that is troubling Max''s last days. Victor decide to help his father to find that he is searching for.', 'Victor is a man who gets to Paris to join his family around their seriously ill father, Max. Victor is desperately asked for help by Max. What seems in the beginning mere delusions of an old man losing his mind, begin to show traces of some sort of real ''secret'' that is troubling Max''s last days. Victor decide to help his father to find that he is searching for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDbWt7X1rJmv9HQiJ1ykDZ7MkBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20316'),
  ('471519783791781859', 'The City of the Dead', 1960, 'Mystery, Horror', 'John Llewellyn Moxey, Desmond Dickinson', 'George Baxt', 'Dennis Lotis, Christopher Lee, Patricia Jessel, Tom Naylor, Betta St. John, Venetia Stevenson, Valentine Dyall, Ann Beach', 'NR', 'In Whitewood, Massachusetts, a presumed witch places a curse on the town before she is burned at the stake. 300 years later, a college student arrives and checks into the mysterious Raven''s Inn to research the town''s history with witchcraft.', 'In Whitewood, Massachusetts, a presumed witch places a curse on the town before she is burned at the stake. 300 years later, a college student arrives and checks into the mysterious Raven''s Inn to research the town''s history with witchcraft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdM3QYjzzjuMy0cqlDNfet1BQhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39890'),
  ('442134199019494393', 'The City of Violence', 2006, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Kwon Hyeok-jae, Kim Yeong-cheol', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Kim Jeong-min, Lee Won-jae', 'Jung Doo-hong, Ryoo Seung-wan, Lee Beom-soo, Jeong Seok-yong, An Kil-kang, Kim Seo-hyung, Lee Joo-sil, Kim Byeong-ok', null, 'Tae-su, a detective fighting organized crime, returns to his hometown for his high school friend Wang-jae''s funeral. There, he meets his old friends Pil-ho, Dong-hwan and Seok-hwan and they reminisce. Suspecting something fishy about Wang-jae''s death, Tae-su and Seok-hwan start investigating it, each in his own way. Their investigations lead to a land development project that Pil-ho is directing.', 'Tae-su, a detective fighting organized crime, returns to his hometown for his high school friend Wang-jae''s funeral. There, he meets his old friends Pil-ho, Dong-hwan and Seok-hwan and they reminisce. Suspecting something fishy about Wang-jae''s death, Tae-su and Seok-hwan start investigating it, each in his own way. Their investigations lead to a land development project that Pil-ho is directing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2W7qEQejWlclNixeG8pbnnekkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20605'),
  ('212571860778313778', 'The City of Wild Beasts', 2021, 'Drama', 'Camilo Monsalve, Henry Rincón Orozco', 'Henry Rincón Orozco', 'Bryan Córdoba, Oscar Atehortúa, Joel Mosquera, Héctor García, Valeria Perez, Ferney Alexander Mesa Alvarez', null, 'Trouble on the mean streets of Medellín, Colombia, leads a teen to the country and the grandfather he’s never known.', 'Trouble on the mean streets of Medellín, Colombia, leads a teen to the country and the grandfather he’s never known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ud7UwHhJ4nHe8eCR6hgiajXBVbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764530'),
  ('608224640423473310', 'The City of Your Final Destination', 2009, 'Drama', 'James Ivory, Javier Aguirresarobe, Steve Simmonds', 'Ruth Prawer Jhabvala', 'Omar Metwally, Anthony Hopkins, Laura Linney, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Alexandra Maria Lara, Hiroyuki Sanada, Norma Aleandro, Nicholas Blandullo', 'PG-13', '28-year-old Kansas University doctoral student Omar Razaghi wins a grant to write a biography of Latin American writer Jules Gund. Omar must get through to three people who were close to Gund – his brother, widow, and younger mistress – so he can get authorization to write the biography.', '28-year-old Kansas University doctoral student Omar Razaghi wins a grant to write a biography of Latin American writer Jules Gund. Omar must get through to three people who were close to Gund – his brother, widow, and younger mistress – so he can get authorization to write the biography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZnLXkvocKkB2FVBNycouH5AopG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42819'),
  ('346169492721907073', 'The City Tramp', 1966, 'Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Josef Jung, Michael Fengler', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Christoph Roser, Susanne Schimkus, Irm Hermann, Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Fengler, Thomas Fengler', null, 'A tramp finds a gun lying in the street.', 'A tramp finds a gun lying in the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6DM9q0mrDGsR7qmvqfKJJyZvNP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127142'),
  ('490697873449351676', 'The City without Jews', 1924, 'Drama', 'H.K. Breslauer', 'Ida Jenbach, H.K. Breslauer', 'Johannes Riemann, Hans Moser, Karl Tema, Anny Miletty, Eugen Neufeld, Ferdinand Mayerhofer, Mizi Griebl, Hans Effenberger', null, 'In the Republic of Utopia, because of the bad economic crisis ailing the nation, the Jews are made the scapegoats for the economic and social ills affecting the population; therefore, the government decides to expel them. Leo Strakosch is among the exiled. He is engaged to Counsellor''s Linder''s daughter. He gets into the Republic, in a clandestine way, to show to the society the wrongness of their anti-semitic prejudice. Bettauer''s novel differs essentially from the film version. "Vienna" was named "Utopia." Even a happy ending was provided.', 'In the Republic of Utopia, because of the bad economic crisis ailing the nation, the Jews are made the scapegoats for the economic and social ills affecting the population; therefore, the government decides to expel them. Leo Strakosch is among the exiled. He is engaged to Counsellor''s Linder''s daughter. He gets into the Republic, in a clandestine way, to show to the society the wrongness of their anti-semitic prejudice. Bettauer''s novel differs essentially from the film version. "Vienna" was named "Utopia." Even a happy ending was provided.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iEb9qQuQuuoRh8Op3WroHMvuLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80881'),
  ('919275610227981526', 'The Claim', 2000, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'Michael Winterbottom, Alwin H. Küchler, Nick Laws', 'Frank Cottrell Boyce', 'Peter Mullan, Milla Jovovich, Wes Bentley, Nastassja Kinski, Sarah Polley, Shirley Henderson, Julian Richings, Sean McGinley', 'R', 'A prospector sells his wife and daughter to another gold miner for the rights to a gold mine. Twenty years later, the prospector is a wealthy man who owns much of the old west town named Kingdom Come. But changes are brewing and his past is coming back to haunt him. A surveyor and his crew scouts the town as a location for a new railroad line and a young woman suddenly appears in the town and is evidently the man''s daughter.', 'A prospector sells his wife and daughter to another gold miner for the rights to a gold mine. Twenty years later, the prospector is a wealthy man who owns much of the old west town named Kingdom Come. But changes are brewing and his past is coming back to haunt him. A surveyor and his crew scouts the town as a location for a new railroad line and a young woman suddenly appears in the town and is evidently the man''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drpLBTmnMOzDUVAd3jqeLjdolcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44853'),
  ('244493856962719256', 'The Clairvoyant', 1935, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Maurice Elvey, Glen MacWilliams', 'Charles Bennett, Bryan Edgar Wallace', 'Claude Rains, Fay Wray, Mary Clare, Jane Baxter, Ben Field, Athole Stewart, C. Denier Warren, Felix Aylmer', null, 'A fake psychic suddenly turns into the real thing when he meets a young beauty. (TCM)', 'A fake psychic suddenly turns into the real thing when he meets a young beauty. (TCM)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuJbyNH0aKYwbV3oW6V3NWPHLPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43692'),
  ('468064524205981064', 'The Clairvoyant', 1982, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery, Fantasy, Crime', 'Armand Mastroianni, Larry Pizer', 'B. Jonathan Ringkamp', 'Perry King, Norman Parker, Elizabeth Kemp, Kenneth McMillan, Jon Polito, Joe Morton, Barbara Quinn, Antone Pagán', null, 'Two uneasy friends, a police officer and a TV talk show host, each pursue the mysterious "handcuff killer" with the aid of an artist who sees - and draws - the killer''s crimes before they''re committed.', 'Two uneasy friends, a police officer and a TV talk show host, each pursue the mysterious "handcuff killer" with the aid of an artist who sees - and draws - the killer''s crimes before they''re committed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hv7Of8WowRQEDD3UQY346RgtwBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69163'),
  ('993743918098288703', 'The Clan', 2005, 'Comedy, Music', 'Christian De Sica, Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Denitza Daverova', 'Fausto Brizzi, Christian De Sica, Marco Martani', 'Christian De Sica, Paolo Conticini, Sebastien Torkia, Andrea Osvárt, Max Tortora, Anna Longhi, Hristo Dimitrov, Natali Adetukundo', null, 'Dino and Franco, two mechanics in Rome, unrepentant bachelor and friends to the skin, leave for Las Vegas to attend the international gathering of Harley-Davidson, one of the great passions they have in common ...', 'Dino and Franco, two mechanics in Rome, unrepentant bachelor and friends to the skin, leave for Las Vegas to attend the international gathering of Harley-Davidson, one of the great passions they have in common ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWvIkdJCYiiDu7FUzRb0I4CiCIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102475'),
  ('965378667919457743', 'The Clan', 2015, 'Drama, History, Crime', 'Fabiana Tiscornia, Florencia Momo, Marcello Pozzo', 'Pablo Trapero, Julian Loyola, Esteban Student', 'Guillermo Francella, Peter Lanzani, Gastón Cocchiarale, Franco Masini, Giselle Motta, Antonia Bengoechea, Liliana Popovich, Stefanía Koessl', 'R', 'In Argentina, between 1982 and 1985, the Puccios, a well-established family of San Isidro, an upper-class suburb of Buenos Aires, kidnap several people and hold them as hostages for a ransom.', 'In Argentina, between 1982 and 1985, the Puccios, a well-established family of San Isidro, an upper-class suburb of Buenos Aires, kidnap several people and hold them as hostages for a ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6iPqGhtIAgGRQcfqxSYbRrlK3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352161'),
  ('1113361131394322188', 'The Clan of the Cave Bear', 1986, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Michael Chapman, Jan de Bont', 'John Sayles', 'Daryl Hannah, Pamela Reed, James Remar, Thomas G. Waites, John Doolittle, Curtis Armstrong, Martin Doyle, Nicole Eggert', 'R', 'Natural changes have the clans moving. Iza, medicine woman of the "Clan of the Cave Bear" finds little Ayla from the "others"'' clan - tradition would have the clan kill Ayla immediately, but Iza insists on keeping her. When the little one finds a most needed new cave, she''s allowed to stay - and thrive.', 'Natural changes have the clans moving. Iza, medicine woman of the "Clan of the Cave Bear" finds little Ayla from the "others"'' clan - tradition would have the clan kill Ayla immediately, but Iza insists on keeping her. When the little one finds a most needed new cave, she''s allowed to stay - and thrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbftdduVujKeoib5fwDBbEMamdj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13853'),
  ('1033472515312497026', 'The Clan: Tale of the Frogs', 1984, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Aki Kaurismäki', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Aki Kaurismäki', 'Markku Halme, Minna Soisalo, Sakari Rouvinen, Juhani Niemelä, Antti Litja, Kari Väänänen, Matti Pellonpää, Mikko Majanlahti', null, 'Young Alex Sammakko has seen his brothers defy the law in a series of deeds that first land them in jail, and then, after they escape and return to their rural home, land them back in the lap of their locally notorious family. Alex wants nothing to do with them. He is in love with Mirja, whose family is not that different from the Sammakko''s, but who shares Alex''s viewpoints and feelings. Not helping matters is a police department convinced that all Sammakkos are bad, and the family itself, pressuring Alex to follow in their murky footsteps.', 'Young Alex Sammakko has seen his brothers defy the law in a series of deeds that first land them in jail, and then, after they escape and return to their rural home, land them back in the lap of their locally notorious family. Alex wants nothing to do with them. He is in love with Mirja, whose family is not that different from the Sammakko''s, but who shares Alex''s viewpoints and feelings. Not helping matters is a police department convinced that all Sammakkos are bad, and the family itself, pressuring Alex to follow in their murky footsteps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIdJlHaLdGbTJqznXPijp1Db8WO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44589'),
  ('1150989701571274061', 'The Clapper', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Dito Montiel, Michael Barrett', 'Dito Montiel', 'Ed Helms, Amanda Seyfried, Tracy Morgan, Adam Levine, Russell Peters, P.J. Byrne, Leah Remini, James Ransone', 'R', 'Eddie Krumble works as a paid audience member for infomercials and experiences a whirlwind of overnight fame after a late-night talk show host publicizes his frequent infomercial appearances.', 'Eddie Krumble works as a paid audience member for infomercials and experiences a whirlwind of overnight fame after a late-night talk show host publicizes his frequent infomercial appearances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2BUFjFsulpdjiaTcl2ArleuQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422615'),
  ('1045928361688836758', 'The Clash: Westway To The World', 1999, 'Documentary, Music', 'Don Letts', null, 'Joe Strummer, Mick Jones, Paul Simonon, Topper Headon, Terry Chimes, Tony Parsons, John Lydon, Keith Levene', null, 'A 2000 documentary film about the British punk rock band The Clash. In 2003 it won the Grammy Awards for the best long form music video. Directed by Don Letts, the film combines old footage from the band''s personal collection filmed in 1982 when The Clash went to New York with new interviews conducted for the film by Mal Peachey of members Mick Jones, Paul Simonon, Topper Headon, and Joe Strummer and other people associated with the group.', 'A 2000 documentary film about the British punk rock band The Clash. In 2003 it won the Grammy Awards for the best long form music video. Directed by Don Letts, the film combines old footage from the band''s personal collection filmed in 1982 when The Clash went to New York with new interviews conducted for the film by Mal Peachey of members Mick Jones, Paul Simonon, Topper Headon, and Joe Strummer and other people associated with the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugly3tnKz8FslNnX3E9nI2AQWaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41449'),
  ('292983631419940199', 'The Class', 2007, 'Drama', 'Ilmar Raag, Kristjan-Jaak Nuudi, Margus Karu', 'Ilmar Raag, Lauri Pedaja, Mikk Mägi', 'Vallo Kirs, Pärt Uusberg, Lauri Pedaja, Paula Solvak, Mikk Mägi, Riina Ries, Joonas Paas, Kadi Metsla', null, 'An average guy of an Estonian high-school decides to defend his bullied classmate. This starts a war between him and the informal leader of the class.', 'An average guy of an Estonian high-school decides to defend his bullied classmate. This starts a war between him and the informal leader of the class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AogHMwGObAqXgXoqtj2Zg90fX5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28205'),
