  ('1075855595512827713', 'The Client', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Joel Schumacher, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Yudi Bennett', 'Akiva Goldsman, Robert Getchell', 'Brad Renfro, Susan Sarandon, Tommy Lee Jones, Mary-Louise Parker, Anthony LaPaglia, Bradley Whitford, Will Patton, Anthony Edwards', 'PG-13', 'A street-wise kid, Mark Sway, sees the suicide of Jerome Clifford, a prominent Louisiana lawyer, whose current client is Barry ''The Blade'' Muldano, a Mafia hit-man. Before Jerome shoots himself, he tells Mark where the body of a Senator is buried. Clifford shoots himself and Mark is found at the scene, and both the FBI and the Mafia quickly realize that Mark probably knows more than he says.', 'A street-wise kid, Mark Sway, sees the suicide of Jerome Clifford, a prominent Louisiana lawyer, whose current client is Barry ''The Blade'' Muldano, a Mafia hit-man. Before Jerome shoots himself, he tells Mark where the body of a Senator is buried. Clifford shoots himself and Mark is found at the scene, and both the FBI and the Mafia quickly realize that Mark probably knows more than he says.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLdkJ4ZjxPtFSUChdjDQvHM9l75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10731'),
