  ('436153103802863430', 'The Clock Store', 1931, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, null, 'NR', 'The various clocks and watches in a clock store dance, ring alarms musically, and otherwise entertain us in an after hours presentation.', 'The various clocks and watches in a clock store dance, ring alarms musically, and otherwise entertain us in an after hours presentation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjX45qp2MQfLZ6LjerMqJ8Te4vS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67586'),
