  ('1027475139655284572', 'The Clockmaker''s Dream', 1904, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A weary clock-maker dozes off in a chair. While he is asleep, three women suddenly appear in the midst of his shop. They proceed to show the sleeping clock-maker some new kinds of clocks that they know how to make.', 'A weary clock-maker dozes off in a chair. While he is asleep, three women suddenly appear in the midst of his shop. They proceed to show the sleeping clock-maker some new kinds of clocks that they know how to make.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hb4wqXbm1hfGzhT2pUdhNXlbHOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196127'),
  ('769397633886177296', 'The Clone Returns Home', 2008, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Kanji Nakajima, Hideho Urata, Hiroyasu Kitagawa', 'Kanji Nakajima', 'Hiromi Nagasaku, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Kyūsaku Shimada, Eri Shida, Tōru Shinagawa, Kenichi Yajima, Kozo Sato, Chieko Ichikawa', 'NR', 'Kohei Takahara, an astronaut who dies in the line of duty, is legally resurrected as a clone: however, contrary to the scientists'' expectations, he reverts to his childhood memories when his twin brother drowned sacrificing his life for Kohei. Kohei''s clone discovers the body of his former self mistakenly believing that it is his deceased twin. Reliving his tragic past, he sets off carrying his corpse body to the beautiful hometown where he lived with his now dead mother.', 'Kohei Takahara, an astronaut who dies in the line of duty, is legally resurrected as a clone: however, contrary to the scientists'' expectations, he reverts to his childhood memories when his twin brother drowned sacrificing his life for Kohei. Kohei''s clone discovers the body of his former self mistakenly believing that it is his deceased twin. Reliving his tragic past, he sets off carrying his corpse body to the beautiful hometown where he lived with his now dead mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1C8ZNHD7WuOBIUIZy5tuPN8Lcxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42938'),
  ('275117392250958193', 'The Clones of Bruce Lee', 1980, 'Action', 'Joseph Kong Hung, Godfrey Ho, Yim Jin-hwan', 'Joseph Kong Hung', 'Dragon Lee, Huang Kin-Lung, Francis Kwok Si-Chi, Leung Siu-Wah, Andy Hannah, Jon T. Benn, Chiang Tao, Bolo Yeung', null, 'Bruce Lee has just died, but the BSI is swinging into action to salvage the situation. Aided by the brilliant Professor Lucas, cells from the martial arts master''s body are removed and grown into three adult Bruce Lee clones. After undergoing training to bring their skills up to the level of their ''father'', the three are sent out to battle crime, with one sent to take on a gold smuggler, and the other two teaming up to shut down an evil mad scientist.', 'Bruce Lee has just died, but the BSI is swinging into action to salvage the situation. Aided by the brilliant Professor Lucas, cells from the martial arts master''s body are removed and grown into three adult Bruce Lee clones. After undergoing training to bring their skills up to the level of their ''father'', the three are sent out to battle crime, with one sent to take on a gold smuggler, and the other two teaming up to shut down an evil mad scientist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnQLZe0arj8cKO2creVk45Si0z5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77061'),
  ('456344193612955296', 'The Closed Circuit', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ryszard Bugajski, Piotr Sobociński Jr., Bartosz Paduch', 'Michał S. Pruski, Mirosław Piepka', 'Janusz Gajos, Kazimierz Kaczor, Wojciech Żołądkowicz, Robert Olech, Przemysław Sadowski, Magdalena Kumorek, Monika Kwiatkowska, Beata Ścibakówna', 'NR', 'The film is set in the Tricity in 2003, ten years after the end of communism in Poland. The plot, apparently based on the real-life experiences of Kraków businessmen Lech Jerzorny and Paweł Rey, is about three young, talented businessmen who open a high-tech factory. This comes to the attention of the local state ‘mafia’, the local Prosecutor, played by Janusz Gajos, and tax office boss, played by Kasimierz Kaczor, who are both jealous and would like to make money for themselves. We are in Poland, so success must be punished.', 'The film is set in the Tricity in 2003, ten years after the end of communism in Poland. The plot, apparently based on the real-life experiences of Kraków businessmen Lech Jerzorny and Paweł Rey, is about three young, talented businessmen who open a high-tech factory. This comes to the attention of the local state ‘mafia’, the local Prosecutor, played by Janusz Gajos, and tax office boss, played by Kasimierz Kaczor, who are both jealous and would like to make money for themselves. We are in Poland, so success must be punished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ie0imHnQ1X5WNfQQx7RpZPvCvl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226702'),
  ('527623579880193515', 'The Closet', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Francis Veber, Luciano Tovoli', 'Francis Veber', 'Daniel Auteuil, Gérard Depardieu, Thierry Lhermitte, Michèle Laroque, Michel Aumont, Jean Rochefort, Alexandra Vandernoot, Edgar Givry', null, 'A man spreads the rumor of his fake homosexuality with the aid of his neighbor, to prevent his imminent firing at his work.', 'A man spreads the rumor of his fake homosexuality with the aid of his neighbor, to prevent his imminent firing at his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNm5Jxr3iulG8tfYHqDD0ahODCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11444'),
  ('998374427652856631', 'The Closet', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Lee Sang-hun, Kim Kwang-bin, Choi Chan-min', 'Kim Kwang-bin', 'Ha Jung-woo, Kim Nam-gil, Heo Yool, Kim Si-a, Shin Hyun-been, Kim Soo-jin, Park Sung-woong, Kwak Ja-hyung', null, 'After moving into a new house, a young girl begins displaying strange and disturbing behavior until, one day, she disappears behind a closet. While the devastated father is left with no clue about his daughter''s disappearance, an exorcist shows up to help.', 'After moving into a new house, a young girl begins displaying strange and disturbing behavior until, one day, she disappears behind a closet. While the devastated father is left with no clue about his daughter''s disappearance, an exorcist shows up to help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/W2tus8EwEagKCCCPqqocHEM9F2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571625'),
  ('130807125897568659', 'The Cloud', 2006, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Gregor Schnitzler', 'Marco Kreuzpaintner', 'Paula Kalenberg, Franz Dinda, Hans-Laurin Beyerling, Carina Wiese, Jennifer Ulrich, Claire Oelkers, Tom Wlaschiha, Karl Kranzkowski', null, 'DIE WOLKE (The Cloud) is about a breakdown of a nuclear power station in Germany and the story of two teenager-lovers Hannah and Elmar who take refuge. 38.000 people die and Hannah unfortunately becomes contaminated.', 'DIE WOLKE (The Cloud) is about a breakdown of a nuclear power station in Germany and the story of two teenager-lovers Hannah and Elmar who take refuge. 38.000 people die and Hannah unfortunately becomes contaminated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwep9xu87p5hXrCXEO3iDmuuwmo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7456'),
  ('601989800058970568', 'The Cloud Door', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mani Kaul, Anil Mehta', 'Mani Kaul', 'Anu Aggarwal, Murad Ali, Vasadeva Bhait, Shashi, Yusuf Khurram, Shambhavi, Bahauddin Dagar, Irrfan Khan', null, 'A very clever parrot lives in a Hindu palace, surrounded by many beautiful girls, but the parrot escapes, and is trapped far from the palace. One day, when its new owner is sleeping, the bird convinces a young boy to open the cage door. In return, it shows the boy a secret passage to get into the palace.', 'A very clever parrot lives in a Hindu palace, surrounded by many beautiful girls, but the parrot escapes, and is trapped far from the palace. One day, when its new owner is sleeping, the bird convinces a young boy to open the cage door. In return, it shows the boy a secret passage to get into the palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOlvgAffA3q3EcBP4ymvmgChaqs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261421'),
  ('716488879073423783', 'The Cloud in Her Room', 2021, 'Drama', 'Zheng Lu Xinyuan, Matthias Delvaux', 'Zheng Lu Xinyuan', 'Jin Jing, Liu Dan, Zhou Chen, Ye Hongming, Dong Kangning', null, 'Muzi, 22, comes home to Hangzhou for Chinese New Year, where she plays her roles as a daughter, a half-sister, and a girlfriend. Roaming in this city that feels so familiar yet distant, Muzi searches for a place where she belongs.', 'Muzi, 22, comes home to Hangzhou for Chinese New Year, where she plays her roles as a daughter, a half-sister, and a girlfriend. Roaming in this city that feels so familiar yet distant, Muzi searches for a place where she belongs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrORLi4BFj1EA6L8EFVcvEqJg7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576352'),
  ('87496210928312991', 'The Cloud-Capped Star', 1960, 'Drama', 'Ritwik Ghatak, Dinen Gupta', 'Ritwik Ghatak', 'Supriya Choudhury, Anil Chatterjee, Gyanesh Mukhopadhyay, Bijon Bhattacharya, Gita Dey, Gita Ghatak, Dwiju Bhawal, Niranjan Ray', null, 'A selfless young woman, the daughter of a middle-class refugee family from East Pakistan, sacrifices her own happiness for her unappreciative family.', 'A selfless young woman, the daughter of a middle-class refugee family from East Pakistan, sacrifices her own happiness for her unappreciative family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIlt1x2eBMzuQHwyU54CNPTSK6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59239'),
  ('782990697667415010', 'The Clouded Yellow', 1950, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Geoffrey Unsworth, Ralph Thomas', 'Janet Green', 'Jean Simmons, Trevor Howard, Sonia Dresdel, Barry Jones, Kenneth More, Geoffrey Keen, André Morell, Michael Brennan', 'NR', 'After leaving the British Secret Service, David Somers finds work catalouging butterflies at the country house of Nicholas and Jess Fenton. After the murder of a local gamekeeper, suspicion falls on their niece, Sophie Malraux. Somers helps Sophie to escape arrest and they go on the run together.', 'After leaving the British Secret Service, David Somers finds work catalouging butterflies at the country house of Nicholas and Jess Fenton. After the murder of a local gamekeeper, suspicion falls on their niece, Sophie Malraux. Somers helps Sophie to escape arrest and they go on the run together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64jzVWF9RRFSG3l6Z19kYJVNA6Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38103'),
  ('758273154792729169', 'The Clovehitch Killer', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Duncan Skiles, Luke McCoubrey', 'Christopher Ford', 'Dylan McDermott, Charlie Plummer, Samantha Mathis, Madisen Beaty, Brenna Sherman, Lance Chantiles-Wertz, Emma Jones, Jonathan Riggs', 'NR', 'A picture-perfect family is torn apart after Tyler finds a cache of disturbing images in his father''s possession. He begins to suspect that the man he trusts most in the world may be responsible for the murder of 13 women ten years prior.', 'A picture-perfect family is torn apart after Tyler finds a cache of disturbing images in his father''s possession. He begins to suspect that the man he trusts most in the world may be responsible for the murder of 13 women ten years prior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NmsbUJqnopbnLun2E4KvtVNj8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544431'),
  ('1077274292174496305', 'The Cloverfield Paradox', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Julius Onah, Mark Anthony Little, Christopher T. Sadler', 'Oren Uziel, Doug Jung', 'Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Daniel Brühl, Chris O''Dowd, David Oyelowo, John Ortiz, Elizabeth Debicki, Zhang Ziyi, Aksel Hennie', 'PG-13', 'Orbiting above a planet on the brink of war, scientists test a device to solve an energy crisis and end up face-to-face with a dark alternate reality.', 'Orbiting above a planet on the brink of war, scientists test a device to solve an energy crisis and end up face-to-face with a dark alternate reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJi2ExTcWdJR3150VPKqqtdGxsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384521'),
  ('12784969993166531', 'The Clown', 1953, 'Drama', 'Robert Z. Leonard', 'Martin Rackin', 'Red Skelton, Jane Greer, Tim Considine, Loring Smith, Philip Ober, Lou Lubin, Fay Roope, Walter Reed', 'NR', 'Once a famous Ziegfeld star, Dodo Delwyn is reduced to playing clowns in burlesque and amusement parks as a result of his drinking. His son Little Dink idolizes Dodo and faithfully believes in a comeback. He persuades "Uncle" Goldie, Dodo''s agent in the good old days, to find a booking for Dodo. He can''t, and Dink is sent to live with his remarried-and-wealthy mother, Paula. The unhappy Dink runs back to his father. His welcome return gives Dodo the courage needed to try a knockabout TV show offered by Goldie', 'Once a famous Ziegfeld star, Dodo Delwyn is reduced to playing clowns in burlesque and amusement parks as a result of his drinking. His son Little Dink idolizes Dodo and faithfully believes in a comeback. He persuades "Uncle" Goldie, Dodo''s agent in the good old days, to find a booking for Dodo. He can''t, and Dink is sent to live with his remarried-and-wealthy mother, Paula. The unhappy Dink runs back to his father. His welcome return gives Dodo the courage needed to try a knockabout TV show offered by Goldie', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deoWb53uSwssDLTHrFeT3oICoDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87983'),
  ('92210697553278425', 'The Clown', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Selton Mello, Adrian Teijido, Luciana Baptista', 'Selton Mello, Marcelo Vindicato', 'Selton Mello, Paulo José, Larissa Manoela, Danton Mello, Giselle Motta, Teuda Bara, Álamo Facó, Cadu Fávero', null, 'The life of the owners of Circus Esperança, Puro Sangue e Pangaré, father and son, who plays two clowns. At a certain point, Pangaré starts showing tiredness and sadness for being an unhappy clown.', 'The life of the owners of Circus Esperança, Puro Sangue e Pangaré, father and son, who plays two clowns. At a certain point, Pangaré starts showing tiredness and sadness for being an unhappy clown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2SKEIl8PxRHZGHhrLCIxRKb0UN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79934'),
  ('804569694821615209', 'The Clown at Midnight', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jean Pellerin, Barry Gravelle', 'Kenneth J. Hall', 'Sarah Lassez, James Duval, Tatyana Ali, Ryan Bittle, Margot Kidder, Christopher Plummer, Liz Crawford, Melissa Galianos', 'R', 'Upon the reopening of the opera house where her mother was murdered, a teen and her friends become the targets of a deranged killer dressed in a clown costume.', 'Upon the reopening of the opera house where her mother was murdered, a teen and her friends become the targets of a deranged killer dressed in a clown costume.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ng8VJLgquIl5PNnHzslK5C7VZk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85230'),
  ('983575638389893961', 'The Clowns', 1970, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Federico Fellini, Maurizio Mein, Liliana Betti', 'Federico Fellini, Bernardino Zapponi', 'Riccardo Billi, Gigi Reder, Tino Scotti, Valentini, Fanfulla, Merli, Carlo Rizzo, Alberto Colombaioni', 'G', 'Fellini exposes his great attraction for the clowns and the world of the circus first recalling a childhood experience when the circus arrives nearby his home. Then he joins his crew and travel from Italy to Paris chasing the last greatest European clowns still live in these countries. He also meets Anita Ekberg trying to buy a panther in a circus.', 'Fellini exposes his great attraction for the clowns and the world of the circus first recalling a childhood experience when the circus arrives nearby his home. Then he joins his crew and travel from Italy to Paris chasing the last greatest European clowns still live in these countries. He also meets Anita Ekberg trying to buy a panther in a circus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uS7GdwTpn5c1bcRkjL5bbE4m8Fl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42590'),
  ('584999293217759916', 'The Club', 1980, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bruce Beresford, Donald McAlpine, Scott Hicks', 'David Williamson', 'Jack Thompson, Graham Kennedy, Frank Wilson, John Howard, Harold Hopkins, Alan Cassell, Maggie Doyle, Lou Richards', null, 'The club buys a talented young player, Geoff, for a record sum of money. The team members do not like their new star and friction develops immediately. Game after game is lost until Geoff begins to realize that there is more at stake than just his own career.', 'The club buys a talented young player, Geoff, for a record sum of money. The team members do not like their new star and friction develops immediately. Game after game is lost until Geoff begins to realize that there is more at stake than just his own career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cg3WeX4Fq9Ide76xSd0NR7WODGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38920'),
  ('57937376651531129', 'The Club', 1994, 'Horror', 'Roman Buchok, M. Anton T., Filomena Guarasci', 'Robert C. Cooper', 'J. H. Wyman, Andrea Roth, Rino Romano, Zack Ward, Kelli Taylor, Matthew Ferguson, Kim Coates, Paul Popowich', null, 'Time stops at midnight at the Senior Prom for five students, one murderous counselor, and John. They must find the courage to face themselves or, when time starts again, they may find that they are joining John''s Club. All you have to do is commit murder... or suicide.', 'Time stops at midnight at the Senior Prom for five students, one murderous counselor, and John. They must find the courage to face themselves or, when time starts again, they may find that they are joining John''s Club. All you have to do is commit murder... or suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhz4OgYZflrz3QxDqFxr0iR2cHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107781'),
  ('968902764626431569', 'The Club', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Pablo Larraín, Sergio Armstrong, Oscar Godoy', 'Daniel Villalobos, Pablo Larraín, Guillermo Calderón', 'Alfredo Castro, Roberto Farías, Antonia Zegers, Marcelo Alonso, Jaime Vadell, Alejandro Goic, Alejandro Sieveking, José Soza', null, 'In a secluded house in a small seaside town live four unrelated men and the woman who tends to the house and their needs. All former priests, they have been sent to this quiet exile to purge the sins of their pasts, the separation from their communities the worst form of punishment by the Church. They keep to a strict daily schedule devoid of all temptation and spontaneity, each moment a deliberate effort to atone for their wrongdoings.', 'In a secluded house in a small seaside town live four unrelated men and the woman who tends to the house and their needs. All former priests, they have been sent to this quiet exile to purge the sins of their pasts, the separation from their communities the worst form of punishment by the Church. They keep to a strict daily schedule devoid of all temptation and spontaneity, each moment a deliberate effort to atone for their wrongdoings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSLJxkNyKLnfNtyR16bzlHKBQW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319995'),
  ('902267127213672525', 'The Club of the Big Deed', 1927, 'Drama, History', 'Andrey Moskvin, Grigori Kozintsev, Leonid Trauberg', 'Yury Tynyanov, Julian Oxman', 'Pyotr Sobolevsky, Sergei Gerasimov, Oleg Zhakov, Yanina Zheymo, Andrei Kostrichkin, Sofiya Magarill, Nikolai Michurin, Konstantin Khokhlov', null, 'The film tells about the Decembrists’ revolt in the south of Russia. Right before the Decembrist Revolt 1825 a chevalier of fortune decides that it''s time for a game. But on whom to make a bet? He asks the cards. But he''s not the only one who makes the choice.', 'The film tells about the Decembrists’ revolt in the south of Russia. Right before the Decembrist Revolt 1825 a chevalier of fortune decides that it''s time for a game. But on whom to make a bet? He asks the cards. But he''s not the only one who makes the choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVaMG2ssySx7G0ZseO8jt3L1pf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189675'),
  ('868246941604561039', 'The Clue to Love', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Graeme Campbell, Ryan Knight, Kristina Small', 'Aimee Pitta', 'Rachel Bles, Travis Milne, Kyra Harper, Richard Fitzpatrick, Tanisha Thammavongsa, Sophie Van Bastelaer, Anthony Sherwood, Karn Kalra', 'G', 'Ambitious journalist Audrey Harper heads to Hope Cove to write an article on the town’s local newspaper – if she does well, she’s up for a big promotion. While there, she meets the charming and handsome Editor in Chief Morgan Cooper, who helps her as she uncovers the true identity of the paper’s beloved love advice columnist Ask Aunt Hope, famous in the town for healing broken hearts.', 'Ambitious journalist Audrey Harper heads to Hope Cove to write an article on the town’s local newspaper – if she does well, she’s up for a big promotion. While there, she meets the charming and handsome Editor in Chief Morgan Cooper, who helps her as she uncovers the true identity of the paper’s beloved love advice columnist Ask Aunt Hope, famous in the town for healing broken hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYlb8UoMTdxxFaotkuYdwtvdg0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793442'),
  ('508459690763460930', 'The Coach', 2018, 'Drama', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Vladimir Kanareykin, Olga Dubovitskaya', 'Pavel Ruminov, Danila Kozlovsky, Andrey Zolotarev', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Irina Gorbacheva, Vladimir Ilin, Andrey Smolyakov, Viktor Verzhbitskiy, Aleksandr Ilyin Jr, Dmitry Chebotarev, Masha Koshina', null, 'Contemporary Russia. After he flubs a penalty kick, a humiliated national soccer player quits the game. He flees to a small town, where he decides to coach their local team.', 'Contemporary Russia. After he flubs a penalty kick, a humiliated national soccer player quits the game. He flees to a small town, where he decides to coach their local team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYL9BXeV1WdjxvZvkesIqmhAYta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497722'),
  ('1040817569106906674', 'The Coast Guard', 2002, 'Drama, War', 'Kim Ki-duk, Baek Dong-hyeon, Han Ki-eop', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Jang Dong-gun, Kim Jung-hak, Park Ji-a, Yoo Hai-jin, Jung Jin, Kim Koo-taek, Kim Kang-woo, Park Yoon-jae', null, 'A member of Coast Guard Platoon 23, Private Kang monitors a high-infiltration stretch of beach lined with barbed-wire fencing. Driven by the belief that killing a spy is the highest honor, he waits for a chance to prove his worth.', 'A member of Coast Guard Platoon 23, Private Kang monitors a high-infiltration stretch of beach lined with barbed-wire fencing. Driven by the belief that killing a spy is the highest honor, he waits for a chance to prove his worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezHR68DZeyKgRraAZd3eGCgmIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1416'),
  ('986439021323093878', 'The Cobbler', 2014, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Stephen Apicella, Matt Power, Tom McCarthy', 'Paul Sado, Tom McCarthy', 'Adam Sandler, Method Man, Dustin Hoffman, Steve Buscemi, Melonie Díaz, Ellen Barkin, Dan Stevens, Elli', 'PG-13', 'Max Simkin repairs shoes in the same New York shop that has been in his family for generations. Disenchanted with the grind of daily life, Max stumbles upon a magical heirloom that allows him to step into the lives of his customers and see the world in a new way. Sometimes walking in another man''s shoes is the only way one can discover who they really are.', 'Max Simkin repairs shoes in the same New York shop that has been in his family for generations. Disenchanted with the grind of daily life, Max stumbles upon a magical heirloom that allows him to step into the lives of his customers and see the world in a new way. Sometimes walking in another man''s shoes is the only way one can discover who they really are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMgBX4uqF1VIz95tD4iJggz6Ceh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238215'),
  ('563209165471976556', 'The Cobweb', 1955, 'Drama', 'Vincente Minnelli, George J. Folsey, William Shanks', 'John Paxton', 'Richard Widmark, Lauren Bacall, Charles Boyer, Gloria Grahame, Lillian Gish, John Kerr, Susan Strasberg, Oscar Levant', null, 'Patients and staff at a posh psychiatric clinic clash over who chooses the clinic’s new drapes – but drapes are the least of their problems.', 'Patients and staff at a posh psychiatric clinic clash over who chooses the clinic’s new drapes – but drapes are the least of their problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duT2743CkNIKvrwch5CqmB7Xmta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94123'),
  ('963052652580218151', 'The Cobweb Hotel', 1936, 'Horror, Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer', 'Bill Turner', 'Jack Mercer, Mae Questel', null, 'A spider runs a hotel for flies where he keeps his guests captive. A pair of fly newlyweds arrive and check in. Fortunately, the husband is "flyweight champion". After a pitched battle featuring arrows (fountain pen nibs) and a machine-gun (aspirins shot from a perfume atomizer), the spider winds up in a bottle of library paste.', 'A spider runs a hotel for flies where he keeps his guests captive. A pair of fly newlyweds arrive and check in. Fortunately, the husband is "flyweight champion". After a pitched battle featuring arrows (fountain pen nibs) and a machine-gun (aspirins shot from a perfume atomizer), the spider winds up in a bottle of library paste.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aeae33Ng1ZUIcVgbuosFxsxVt0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147087'),
  ('548310953360383329', 'The Coca-Cola Kid', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Dušan Makavejev, Stephan Elliott, Ian Page', 'Frank Moorhouse', 'Eric Roberts, Greta Scacchi, Bill Kerr, Chris Haywood, Kris McQuade, Max Gillies, Tony Barry, Paul Chubb', 'R', 'An eccentric marketing guru visits a Coca-Cola subsidiary in Australia to try and increase market penetration. He finds zero penetration in a valley owned by an old man who makes his own soft drinks, and visits the valley to see why. After "the Kid''s" persistence is tested he''s given a tour of the man''s plant, and they begin talking of a joint venture. Things get more complicated when the Coca-Cola man begins falling in love with his temporary secretary, who seems to have connections to the valley.', 'An eccentric marketing guru visits a Coca-Cola subsidiary in Australia to try and increase market penetration. He finds zero penetration in a valley owned by an old man who makes his own soft drinks, and visits the valley to see why. After "the Kid''s" persistence is tested he''s given a tour of the man''s plant, and they begin talking of a joint venture. Things get more complicated when the Coca-Cola man begins falling in love with his temporary secretary, who seems to have connections to the valley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBfZ52KgC3gnt8UrBULVRp43liC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42048'),
