  ('834271979317654109', 'The Cocoanuts', 1929, 'Comedy, Music', 'George J. Folsey, Robert Florey, Joseph Santley', 'George S. Kaufman', 'Groucho Marx, Harpo Marx, Chico Marx, Zeppo Marx, Oscar Shaw, Mary Eaton, Cyril Ring, Kay Francis', 'NR', 'During the Florida land boom, the Marx Brothers run a hotel, auction off some land and thwart a jewel robbery.', 'During the Florida land boom, the Marx Brothers run a hotel, auction off some land and thwart a jewel robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfiyCaWDfftKHzft2MKxAFFwHYL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20625'),
  ('524105261439226611', 'The Code', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Hannu Puttonen', null, 'Eric Allman, Miguel de Icaza, Jon ''maddog'' Hall, Ari Lemmke, David S. Miller, Eric S. Raymond, Richard M. Stallman, Linus Torvalds', null, 'The Code is a Finnish-made documentary about Linux, featuring some of the most influential people of the free software movement.', 'The Code is a Finnish-made documentary about Linux, featuring some of the most influential people of the free software movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvIEpbgUS45JLZg6OZpq6ke9wOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45049'),
  ('978800505432290941', 'The Code', 2002, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Manuel Boursinhac', null, 'Samy Naceri, Samuel Le Bihan, Clotilde Courau, Michel Duchaussoy, Philippe Nahon, Francis Renaud, Marie Guillard, Bibi Naceri', null, 'Dris is an ex-con, living in the borderline between a decent and a criminal life. He has a regular and simple work and lives a simple life with his wife Lise and loves his family. However, his childhood friends from his Arab community, including his best friend Yanis, are mobsters and his brother is a small time delinquent. Yanis tries to bring Dris back to his gang, and uses his former lover Nina to seduce him, taking him to expensive places to feel the importance of big money. Dris fights against the temptation, but an event will route him back to Yanis'' gang and in a fight between gangs with tragic consequences for the whole community.', 'Dris is an ex-con, living in the borderline between a decent and a criminal life. He has a regular and simple work and lives a simple life with his wife Lise and loves his family. However, his childhood friends from his Arab community, including his best friend Yanis, are mobsters and his brother is a small time delinquent. Yanis tries to bring Dris back to his gang, and uses his former lover Nina to seduce him, taking him to expensive places to feel the importance of big money. Dris fights against the temptation, but an event will route him back to Yanis'' gang and in a fight between gangs with tragic consequences for the whole community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTgmKMRyVMKmj4Tw0jlC39boYU6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54045'),
  ('645277023542025386', 'The Codes of War', 2025, 'Action, War', 'Paul Anderson, Joshua DeFour, Marielle Woods', 'Paul Anderson, Joshua DeFour, Marielle Woods', 'Noah Gray-Cabey, Michael Grant', null, 'War stories about family, ethics and honor include the true story of two U.S. Marines who in a span of six seconds, must stand their ground to stop a suicide truck bomb, a Navy Corpsman who attempts to hold on to his humanity, and a WW2 soldier who gets separated from his squad and is forced to re-evaluate his code.', 'War stories about family, ethics and honor include the true story of two U.S. Marines who in a span of six seconds, must stand their ground to stop a suicide truck bomb, a Navy Corpsman who attempts to hold on to his humanity, and a WW2 soldier who gets separated from his squad and is forced to re-evaluate his code.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXeiQAfRK90pxxhP5iKPXQqAIN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1373723'),
  ('537339849801876528', 'The Coed and the Zombie Stoner', 2014, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Glenn Miller, Laura Beth Love, Antonio Bardales', 'Scotty Mullen', 'Catherine Annette, Jamie Noel, Grant O''Connell, Dora Pereli, Lena Young, Louis Dezseran, Ben Whalen, Andrew Clements', 'NR', 'When a sorority girl falls in love with a zombie, it''s only a matter of time before a zombie apocalypse is unleashed on campus. The sorority girl discovers that weed is the cure. Now, she must smoke out the whole school before it''s too late.', 'When a sorority girl falls in love with a zombie, it''s only a matter of time before a zombie apocalypse is unleashed on campus. The sorority girl discovers that weed is the cure. Now, she must smoke out the whole school before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPuhlG7h6bovUnSs9ce3yxjvkgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275985'),
  ('534136061272171623', 'The Coffee Reader (Kafetzou)', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Stelios Zografakis', 'Giorgos Asimakopoulos', 'Georgia Vasileiadou, Mimis Fotopoulos, Vasilis Avlonitis, Smaroula Giouli, Eleni Zafeiriou, Periklis Hristoforidis, Yorgos Damasiotis, Bety Moshona', null, 'In a poor neighborhood of Athens, next to the coffee shop of Spyros (Mimis Fotopoulos) is a coffee shop that has gained a great reputation and is preparing to move to Kolonaki as it has made a lot of money by telling the cup. In the same neighborhood is a laundress, Kalliopi (Georgia Vassiliadou), who makes a living by force. One day, after an incident in which a customer (Kostas Mentis) humiliates Kalliopi and Spyros intervenes, he comes up with an idea: for Kalliopi to run the coffee shop, since the other one has left.', 'In a poor neighborhood of Athens, next to the coffee shop of Spyros (Mimis Fotopoulos) is a coffee shop that has gained a great reputation and is preparing to move to Kolonaki as it has made a lot of money by telling the cup. In the same neighborhood is a laundress, Kalliopi (Georgia Vassiliadou), who makes a living by force. One day, after an incident in which a customer (Kostas Mentis) humiliates Kalliopi and Spyros intervenes, he comes up with an idea: for Kalliopi to run the coffee shop, since the other one has left.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4okPieaj56vIe0lrKih5Dpdxdl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331953'),
  ('1081048038989385992', 'The Coffee Table', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama, Comedy', 'Caye Casas, Coque Serrano, Frankie De Leonardis', 'Caye Casas, Cristina Borobia', 'David Pareja, Estefanía de los Santos, Josep Maria Riera, Claudia Riera, Eduardo Antuña, Gala Flores, Cristina Dilla, Itziar Castro', null, 'Jesus and María are a couple going through a difficult time in their relationship. Nevertheless, they have just become parents. To shape their new life, they decide to buy a new coffee table. A decision that will change their existence.', 'Jesus and María are a couple going through a difficult time in their relationship. Nevertheless, they have just become parents. To shape their new life, they decide to buy a new coffee table. A decision that will change their existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8S7cc676EfgfUDVQKPrqRlbRFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056380'),
  ('231737915598817681', 'The Coffin', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Choochart Nantitanyatada, Ekachai Uekrongtham, Naradol Liaopairoj', 'Ekachai Uekrongtham', 'Ananda Everingham, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Florence Faivre, Napakpapha Nakprasitte, Andrew Lin Hoi, Suchao Pongwilai, Micheal Pupart, Tassawan Seneewongse', null, 'Following the Thai custom to cheat death and rid oneself of bad luck, a man who lays in a coffin for an evening subsequently experiences a series of terrifying incidents.', 'Following the Thai custom to cheat death and rid oneself of bad luck, a man who lays in a coffin for an evening subsequently experiences a series of terrifying incidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZUI9SSzbSChQK0a6StP5FF4M8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22422'),
  ('890371016326514712', 'The Coke', 2026, 'Short, Crime', 'Vino Buckendahl', 'Vino Buckendahl', 'Jeffrey Mendez, Metellus, Ryan Jackson, Vino Buckendahl', 'TV-MA', 'When White Boy discovers his brother has been using him in a cocaine operation, he decides to take control of the business himself, stepping into a violent world of crime, loyalty, and survival.', 'When White Boy discovers his brother has been using him in a cocaine operation, he decides to take control of the business himself, stepping into a violent world of crime, loyalty, and survival.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMDc2MjJhY2YtMWE3ZS00MjdlLTljMjctODRjMzU4NTg1YTNhXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-coke'),
  ('765350562736821716', 'The Cokeville Miracle', 2015, 'Mystery, Drama, History, Family, Thriller', 'T.C. Christensen', 'T.C. Christensen', 'Nathan Stevens, Jasen Wade, Caitlin E.J. Meyer, Mason D. Davis, Joshua Cooper, Paul D. Hunt, Anson Bagley, Channon Voyce', 'PG-13', 'On May 9, 1986, a small ranching community in Wyoming experiences a divine intervention when a couple detonates a bomb inside a crowded classroom.', 'On May 9, 1986, a small ranching community in Wyoming experiences a divine intervention when a couple detonates a bomb inside a crowded classroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRQziSNSDTOIhBnxzkPYDT2DgCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339060'),
