  ('518334866790282039', 'The Cold Equations', 1996, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Peter Geiger, Christopher Walling', 'Stephen Berger, Peter Geiger, Norman Plotkin', 'Billy Campbell, Poppy Montgomery, Daniel Roebuck, William R. Moses, John Prosky, Albert Hall, Heidi Swedberg, Derk Cheetwood', null, 'Lieutenant John Barton is sent on a special mission to deliver a special vaccine to a distant mining colony. He is infuriated to find Lee, a stowaway aboard his spacecraft. Barton has only enough fuel to carry himself and his precious cargo, and Lee''s added weight insures that they will crash if she stays on board. They have gone too far to turn back, and Barton''s superiors make it clear: the mission takes precedence and Lee has to be dumped into space. But she won''t go quietly.', 'Lieutenant John Barton is sent on a special mission to deliver a special vaccine to a distant mining colony. He is infuriated to find Lee, a stowaway aboard his spacecraft. Barton has only enough fuel to carry himself and his precious cargo, and Lee''s added weight insures that they will crash if she stays on board. They have gone too far to turn back, and Barton''s superiors make it clear: the mission takes precedence and Lee has to be dumped into space. But she won''t go quietly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gea8Ms3ukmnCiNIfKqPSt29E2qa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42824'),
  ('1000086265473467473', 'The Cold Front Brought by the Rain', 2016, 'Drama', 'Neville D''Almeida, Tamur Aimara, Stella Zimmerman', 'Michel Melamed', 'Bruna Linzmeyer, Johnny Massaro, Chay Suede, Michel Melamed, Mario Bortolotto, Flávio Bauraqui, Juliana Lohmann, Marina Provenzzano', null, 'A group of playboys organizes the last party of the year in a slum before the change in weather. And for this night, beyond the usual drugs, alcohol and sex, they will receive special guests: an addict that uses and is used by the group, a country singer who was raised around the slum, a strange security guard and the owner of the place.', 'A group of playboys organizes the last party of the year in a slum before the change in weather. And for this night, beyond the usual drugs, alcohol and sex, they will receive special guests: an addict that uses and is used by the group, a country singer who was raised around the slum, a strange security guard and the owner of the place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym3FmTIqGmTcPrJ6Zn1tXrFxygl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360141'),
  ('901940700144970668', 'The Cold Light of Day', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rudolf van den Berg, Igor Luther', 'Doug Magee', 'Richard E. Grant, Lynsey Baxter, Perdita Weeks, Simon Cadell, Thom Hoffman, James Laurenson, Heathcote Williams, Roger Sloman', null, 'A troubled detective befriends a single woman and her daughter with the intention of using them as bait for a serial killer.', 'A troubled detective befriends a single woman and her daughter with the intention of using them as bait for a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAOaxJhs8o2Sj2Hxm0wybRiuNUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48118'),
  ('155538017936354713', 'The Cold Light of Day', 2012, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Remi Adefarasin, Mabrouk El Mechri', 'Scott Wiper, John Petro', 'Henry Cavill, Bruce Willis, Sigourney Weaver, Verónica Echegui, Joseph Mawle, Caroline Goodall, Rafi Gavron, Emma Hamilton', 'PG-13', 'After his family is kidnapped during their sailing trip in Spain, a young Wall Street trader is confronted by the people responsible: intelligence agents looking to recover a mysterious briefcase.', 'After his family is kidnapped during their sailing trip in Spain, a young Wall Street trader is confronted by the people responsible: intelligence agents looking to recover a mysterious briefcase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLmKMhibZjHUYtsHQLIa5UBwqcc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77948'),
  ('924866089103354812', 'The Cold Summer of 1953', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Aleksandr Proshkin, Boris Brozhovsky, Aleksandr Tsygankov', 'Edgar Dubrovsky', 'Valeriy Priyomykhov, Anatoliy Papanov, Viktor Stepanov, Nina Usatova, Zoya Buryak, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Vladimir Kashpur, Sergey Vlasov', null, 'In 1953, the year Stalin died, many prisoners (some political, but mostly common criminals) were released from the Soviet Gulags. This is the story of a remote settlement which was under attack by a bunch of these recently-released blood-thirsty thugs in the summer of 1953, and the townspeople, along with a two political prisoners, who try to stop them.', 'In 1953, the year Stalin died, many prisoners (some political, but mostly common criminals) were released from the Soviet Gulags. This is the story of a remote settlement which was under attack by a bunch of these recently-released blood-thirsty thugs in the summer of 1953, and the townspeople, along with a two political prisoners, who try to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVSvsoYiyyiHyn0o5KRbph7breW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71393'),
  ('777860841639713541', 'The Coldest Game', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Paweł Edelman, Michał Fojcik, Łukasz Kośmicki', 'Łukasz Kośmicki, Marcel Sawicki', 'Bill Pullman, Lotte Verbeek, James Bloor, Robert Więckiewicz, Aleksey Serebryakov, Corey Johnson, Nicholas Farrell, Evgeniy Sidikhin', null, 'Warsaw, Poland, during the Cuban Missile Crisis, 1962. Josh Mansky, a troubled math genius and former US chess champion, is recruited to hold a dangerous public match against the Soviet champion, while playing the deadly game of espionage hidden in the darkest shadows of a hostile territory.', 'Warsaw, Poland, during the Cuban Missile Crisis, 1962. Josh Mansky, a troubled math genius and former US chess champion, is recruited to hold a dangerous public match against the Soviet champion, while playing the deadly game of espionage hidden in the darkest shadows of a hostile territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YRO2Jamqb6ck5vJqrwWgMFWuPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585759'),
  ('6999884091814091', 'The Colditz Story', 1955, 'War, Drama', 'Guy Hamilton, Ted Sturgis, Gordon Dines', 'Guy Hamilton, Ivan Foxwell, William Douglas-Home', 'John Mills, Eric Portman, Frederick Valk, Denis Shaw, Lionel Jeffries, Christopher Rhodes, Richard Wattis, Ian Carmichael', null, 'The Germans believed that no man could escape from Colditz Castle, set as it was in the heart of the Reich, 400 miles from any neutral frontier. This film, based on Pat Reid''s epic novel, tells the story of how the British, French, Dutch and Polish prisoners of war who were incarcerated in Colditz set out to prove their captors wrong.', 'The Germans believed that no man could escape from Colditz Castle, set as it was in the heart of the Reich, 400 miles from any neutral frontier. This film, based on Pat Reid''s epic novel, tells the story of how the British, French, Dutch and Polish prisoners of war who were incarcerated in Colditz set out to prove their captors wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLeEVpgapcRBzUdeZdSWAe3fYLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16912'),
  ('687622488049160873', 'The Collection', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mary Beth Chambers, Alisa Fredericks, Scott Thomas', 'Marcus Dunstan, Patrick Melton', 'Josh Stewart, Emma Fitzpatrick, Christopher McDonald, Johanna Braddy, Lee Tergesen, Navi Rawat, Andre Royo, Erin Way', 'R', 'Arkin escapes with his life from the vicious grips of "The Collector" during an entrapment party where he adds beautiful Elena to his "Collection." Instead of recovering from the trauma, Arkin is suddenly abducted from the hospital by mercenaries hired by Elena''s wealthy father. Arkin is blackmailed to team up with the mercenaries and track down The Collector''s booby trapped warehouse and save Elena.', 'Arkin escapes with his life from the vicious grips of "The Collector" during an entrapment party where he adds beautiful Elena to his "Collection." Instead of recovering from the trauma, Arkin is suddenly abducted from the hospital by mercenaries hired by Elena''s wealthy father. Arkin is blackmailed to team up with the mercenaries and track down The Collector''s booby trapped warehouse and save Elena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbhJiXi48fRQevHf56i2JmYqyJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134597'),
  ('1020846975377497120', 'The Collective', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Tom DeNucci', 'Jason James, Matthew Rogers', 'Lucas Till, Ruby Rose, Tyrese Gibson, Don Johnson, Mercedes Varnado, Paul Ben-Victor, John Fiore, Levon Panek', null, 'A group of righteous assassins called The Collective take aim at a highly sophisticated human trafficking ring backed by a network of untouchable billionaires. With their backs against the wall, The Collective has no choice but to put their most important mission in the hands of rookie assassin, Sam Alexander.', 'A group of righteous assassins called The Collective take aim at a highly sophisticated human trafficking ring backed by a network of untouchable billionaires. With their backs against the wall, The Collective has no choice but to put their most important mission in the hands of rookie assassin, Sam Alexander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ah9H6Sj434nJiZpTPQrovHaEePV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1060090'),
  ('65416097683905416', 'The Collector', 1965, 'Thriller', 'William Wyler, Robert Krasker, Robert Surtees', 'Stanley Mann, John Kohn', 'Terence Stamp, Samantha Eggar, Mona Washbourne, Maurice Dallimore, Edina Ronay, Kenneth More, Allyson Ames, David Haviland', null, 'A man kidnaps a woman and holds her hostage just for the pleasure of having her there.', 'A man kidnaps a woman and holds her hostage just for the pleasure of having her there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMiih5FGHwpUCAaJAIkYKl5Hffi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42740'),
