  ('1047649512241662159', 'The Collector', 2002, 'Thriller', 'Jean Beaudin', 'Jean Beaudin', 'Luc Picard, Maude Guérin, Lawrence Arcouette, Charles-André Bourassa, Yves Jacques, Julie Ménard, Yvan Ponton, Christian Bégin', null, 'The detective Maud Graham hides her sensibility behind the image of a strong and independant woman. She frequently offers her hospitality to a 16-year-old prostitute, Grégoire, a young man who became her friend. But when the teenager decides to invite a 12-year-old boy who is running away from home, Maud is near illegality. In addition, the detective has to deal with a serial killer who had already killed and mutilated many women. When she understands that the killer is very intelligent and organized, she elaborates a strategy to arrest him. There starts a dangerous game where the two teenagers that Graham is protecting will be implied. The killer is getting closer, revealing more and more of his madness.', 'The detective Maud Graham hides her sensibility behind the image of a strong and independant woman. She frequently offers her hospitality to a 16-year-old prostitute, Grégoire, a young man who became her friend. But when the teenager decides to invite a 12-year-old boy who is running away from home, Maud is near illegality. In addition, the detective has to deal with a serial killer who had already killed and mutilated many women. When she understands that the killer is very intelligent and organized, she elaborates a strategy to arrest him. There starts a dangerous game where the two teenagers that Graham is protecting will be implied. The killer is getting closer, revealing more and more of his madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pndMldqdFk1AufbzFeWrZDbvURo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42774'),
  ('116695749779448752', 'The Collector', 2005, 'Drama', 'Feliks Falk, Bartosz Prokopowicz', 'Grzegorz Łoszewski', 'Andrzej Chyra, Małgorzata Kożuchowska, Kinga Preis, Grzegorz Wojdon, Jan Frycz, Sławomir Orzechowski, Marian Dziędziel, Marian Opania', null, 'Lucjan Bohme is a ruthless debt collector working in a post-industrial Silesian town. In the land of unemployment and misery, he''s got a lot of work and no mercy at all. Until something happens.', 'Lucjan Bohme is a ruthless debt collector working in a post-industrial Silesian town. In the land of unemployment and misery, he''s got a lot of work and no mercy at all. Until something happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16SkV2qUXJjMdWdSBtJhO9QX6Gx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31021'),
  ('71087655485143471', 'The Collector', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Marcus Dunstan, Alisa Fredericks, Tom Gulager', 'Patrick Melton, Marcus Dunstan', 'Josh Stewart, Juan Fernández, Michael Reilly Burke, Madeline Zima, Andrea Roth, Karley Scott Collins, Robert Wisdom, Daniella Alonso', 'R', 'Desperate to repay his debt to his ex-wife, an ex-con plots a heist at his new employer''s country home, unaware that a second criminal has also targeted the property, and rigged it with a series of deadly traps.', 'Desperate to repay his debt to his ex-wife, an ex-con plots a heist at his new employer''s country home, unaware that a second criminal has also targeted the property, and rigged it with a series of deadly traps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e33HSokiAxhj8ptpAr2xAU4jnd8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21407'),
  ('165542057765222506', 'The College Girl Murders', 1967, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Alfred Vohrer, Karl Löb, Eva Ebner', 'Herbert Reinecker, Harald G. Petersson', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Uschi Glas, Grit Boettcher, Siegfried Schürenberg, Konrad Georg, Harry Riebauer, Tilly Lauenstein, Ilse Pagé', null, 'Police try to track down a hooded serial killer who murders his victims with a combination of acid and poison gas.', 'Police try to track down a hooded serial killer who murders his victims with a combination of acid and poison gas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rV5PWXg6nh6ZABJkeJnr4GxBAlY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9632'),
  ('359963933032171282', 'The Collingswood Story', 2002, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Michael Costanza', 'Michael Costanza', 'Stephanie Dees, Johnny Burton, Diane Behrens, Grant Edmonds, Glenn Hoeffner, Ron Ige', 'NR', 'When Rebecca went away to college, her boyfriend John thought video chatting would help them stay in touch. But idle curiosity leads to a dark secret when Rebecca and John video chat with Vera Madeline, an online psychic, who initiates a deadly reign of terror over their lives.', 'When Rebecca went away to college, her boyfriend John thought video chatting would help them stay in touch. But idle curiosity leads to a dark secret when Rebecca and John video chat with Vera Madeline, an online psychic, who initiates a deadly reign of terror over their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7h2cTowUiPr79NqC0HNlqOX4iu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54511'),
  ('696585152789059963', 'The Collini Case', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Marco Kreuzpaintner, Jakub Bejnarowicz', 'Robert Gold, Christian Zübert, Jens-Frederik Otto', 'Elyas M''Barek, Heiner Lauterbach, Alexandra Maria Lara, Jannis Niewöhner, Rainer Bock, Catrin Striebeck, Franco Nero, Pia Stutzenstein', null, 'A young lawyer stumbles upon a vast conspiracy while investigating a brutal murder case.', 'A young lawyer stumbles upon a vast conspiracy while investigating a brutal murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crfpuX2d6TAGxQl3lnV2t3FIWmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570661'),
  ('400073080841220917', 'The Colonel', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, History, War', 'Laurent Herbiet, Patrick Blossier', 'Laurent Herbiet, Jean-Claude Grumberg', 'Olivier Gourmet, Robinson Stévenin, Cécile de France, Charles Aznavour, Bruno Solo, Éric Caravaca, Guillaume Gallienne, Georges Siatidis', null, '''Reformed Colonel'' Raoul Duplan is found dead in Paris, a couple of decades after Algeria''s struggle for independence was won from France. Assigned to investigate, Lieutenant Galois receives the diary of Lieutenent Guy Rossi, who served under Duplan in Algeria in 1956, and has been reported as MIA since 1957. The revelations in Rossi''s diary far surpass Duplan''s actions in Algeria, and give insight on how dirty Algeria''s War for Independence really was.', '''Reformed Colonel'' Raoul Duplan is found dead in Paris, a couple of decades after Algeria''s struggle for independence was won from France. Assigned to investigate, Lieutenant Galois receives the diary of Lieutenent Guy Rossi, who served under Duplan in Algeria in 1956, and has been reported as MIA since 1957. The revelations in Rossi''s diary far surpass Duplan''s actions in Algeria, and give insight on how dirty Algeria''s War for Independence really was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7uzNau9xUsoNuYBNEytFsSSotA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76099'),
  ('1100110312955898784', 'The Colonel''s Account', 1907, 'Action, Comedy', 'Louis Feuillade', null, 'Alice Tissot, Maurice Vinot, Renée Carl', null, 'This short film consists of a crazy old colonel being asked to entertain party guests about his exploits of daring. However, being a totally insane old coot, he runs amok acting out his war-time heroics--smashing and throwing everything in the room!', 'This short film consists of a crazy old colonel being asked to entertain party guests about his exploits of daring. However, being a totally insane old coot, he runs amok acting out his war-time heroics--smashing and throwing everything in the room!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFnNks4IL1llsDVUNcucz9g6i9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196533'),
  ('702525804818175861', 'The Colonel''s Shower Bath', 1902, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A colonel in the military receives an unorthodox shower, an unorthodox shower indeed!', 'A colonel in the military receives an unorthodox shower, an unorthodox shower indeed!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKblQW9Mhk8tWxvNzxYAkpFb4NY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108262'),
  ('523585772291725861', 'The Colony', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Aric Dupere, Jeff Renfroe, Pierre Gill', 'Jeff Renfroe, Patrick Tarr, Pascal Trottier', 'Kevin Zegers, Laurence Fishburne, Bill Paxton, Charlotte Sullivan, John Tench, Atticus Mitchell, Dru Viergever, Romano Orzari', 'NR', 'Forced underground by the next ice age, a struggling outpost of survivors must fight to preserve humanity against a threat even more savage than nature.', 'Forced underground by the next ice age, a struggling outpost of survivors must fight to preserve humanity against a threat even more savage than nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppTqHex38Jkpg9fhPzDcYJuxqhR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178809'),
  ('317642912557947154', 'The Colony', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Markus Förderer, Tim Fehlbaum', 'Mariko Minoguchi, Tim Fehlbaum, Jo Rogers', 'Nora Arnezeder, Iain Glen, Sarah-Sofie Boussnina, Ṣọpẹ́ Dìrísù, Sebastian Roché, Joel Basman, Kotti Yun, Bella Bading', 'R', 'In the not-too-distant future: after a global catastrophe has wiped out nearly all of humanity on Earth, an elite astronaut from Space Colony Kepler must make a decision that will seal the fate of the people on both planets.', 'In the not-too-distant future: after a global catastrophe has wiped out nearly all of humanity on Earth, an elite astronaut from Space Colony Kepler must make a decision that will seal the fate of the people on both planets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nX7ZUYwgGOCe5nXXwpNg4hAf1xB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760873'),
  ('173930043705756830', 'The Color of Friendship', 2000, 'Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Kevin Hooks, David Herrington', 'Paris Qualles', 'Carl Lumbly, Penny Johnson Jerald, Shadia Simmons, Anthony Burnett, Travis Kyle Davis, Lindsey Haun, Susan Danford, Melanie Nicholls-King', 'PG', 'Mahree Bok lives on a farm in South Africa. Her father is a policeman who cannot hide his joy when activist Steve Biko is caught by the South African authorities. Piper Dellums is the daughter of a US congressman from California and who lives in a nice home in Washington DC. When Mahree is chosen to spend a semester at the Dellums'' house, she doesn''t expect that her host family would be black. Nor do her hosts suspect that she is not a black South African.', 'Mahree Bok lives on a farm in South Africa. Her father is a policeman who cannot hide his joy when activist Steve Biko is caught by the South African authorities. Piper Dellums is the daughter of a US congressman from California and who lives in a nice home in Washington DC. When Mahree is chosen to spend a semester at the Dellums'' house, she doesn''t expect that her host family would be black. Nor do her hosts suspect that she is not a black South African.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ELrXrBXvMiURWVkYKaZBnxgMTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92620'),
  ('142675435273698344', 'The Color of Lies', 1999, 'Crime, Drama', 'Claude Chabrol, Eduardo Serra, Cyrille Bray', 'Odile Barski, Claude Chabrol', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Jacques Gamblin, Antoine de Caunes, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Bernard Verley, Bulle Ogier, Pierre Martot, Noël Simsolo', null, 'In a small Breton town, a 10-year-old girl is found murdered. René, her art teacher, a professional painter, is the last person to have seen her alive. The inspector in charge of the investigation immediately questions him. In this small provincial town where people all know each other and regularly meet at the Bar des Amis, René is increasingly unsettled by the other inhabitants'' suspicions and by the inspector''s investigation. Children stop coming to him for lessons. His wife, Viviane, a district nurse, protects him and supports him with her love. However, a self-centred media-star writer adds to René''s confusion...', 'In a small Breton town, a 10-year-old girl is found murdered. René, her art teacher, a professional painter, is the last person to have seen her alive. The inspector in charge of the investigation immediately questions him. In this small provincial town where people all know each other and regularly meet at the Bar des Amis, René is increasingly unsettled by the other inhabitants'' suspicions and by the inspector''s investigation. Children stop coming to him for lessons. His wife, Viviane, a district nurse, protects him and supports him with her love. However, a self-centred media-star writer adds to René''s confusion...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqwy4AUMEHCdeJRz4GCMT4c3Pea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45515'),
  ('1076753419398045829', 'The Color of Money', 1986, 'Drama', 'Martin Scorsese, Michael Ballhaus, Phil Marco', 'Richard Price', 'Paul Newman, Tom Cruise, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Helen Shaver, John Turturro, Bill Cobbs, Forest Whitaker, Keith McCready', 'R', 'Former pool hustler "Fast Eddie" Felson decides he wants to return to the game by taking a pupil. He meets talented but green Vincent Lauria and proposes a partnership. As they tour pool halls, Eddie teaches Vincent the tricks of scamming, but he eventually grows frustrated with Vincent''s showboat antics, leading to an argument and a falling-out. Eddie takes up playing again and soon crosses paths with Vincent as an opponent.', 'Former pool hustler "Fast Eddie" Felson decides he wants to return to the game by taking a pupil. He meets talented but green Vincent Lauria and proposes a partnership. As they tour pool halls, Eddie teaches Vincent the tricks of scamming, but he eventually grows frustrated with Vincent''s showboat antics, leading to an argument and a falling-out. Eddie takes up playing again and soon crosses paths with Vincent as an opponent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVdnHmdQu3JtLAAksjTmTEF76gD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11873'),
  ('223684677043507513', 'The Color of Paradise', 1999, 'Family, Drama', 'Majid Majidi, Mohammad Davudi', 'Majid Majidi', 'Hossein Mahjoub, Mohsen Ramezani, Salameh Feyzi, Farahnaz Safari, Elham Sharifi, Behzad Rafi, Mohamad Rahmani, Morteza Fatemi', 'PG', 'Mohammad joyfully returns to his tiny village on summer vacation from the Institute for the Blind, unaware of his widowed father''s intentions to disown him in order to win the hand—and dowry—of a local woman. With the wedding swiftly approaching, Mohammad''s future hangs precariously in the balance as his father struggles against his destiny, unable to see the wonder of life and love that''s so clear to his son.', 'Mohammad joyfully returns to his tiny village on summer vacation from the Institute for the Blind, unaware of his widowed father''s intentions to disown him in order to win the hand—and dowry—of a local woman. With the wedding swiftly approaching, Mohammad''s future hangs precariously in the balance as his father struggles against his destiny, unable to see the wonder of life and love that''s so clear to his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQ1t23NAGJDv9oNfHEAsxhuiAOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17078'),
  ('559662696145510655', 'The Color of Pomegranates', 1969, 'Drama, History', 'Sergei Parajanov, Rom. Zhamharyan, Aram Samvelyan', 'Sergei Parajanov', 'Spartak Bagashvili, Sofiko Chiaureli, Medea Japaridze, Vilen Galstyan, Gogi Gegechkori, Melkon Alekyan, Hovhannes Minasyan, Onik Minasyan', null, 'The life of the revered 18th-century Armenian poet and musician Sayat-Nova. Portraying events in the life of the artist from childhood up to his death, the movie addresses in particular his relationships with women, including his muse. The production tells Sayat-Nova''s dramatic story by using both his poems and largely still camerawork, creating a work hailed as revolutionary by Mikhail Vartanov.', 'The life of the revered 18th-century Armenian poet and musician Sayat-Nova. Portraying events in the life of the artist from childhood up to his death, the movie addresses in particular his relationships with women, including his muse. The production tells Sayat-Nova''s dramatic story by using both his poems and largely still camerawork, creating a work hailed as revolutionary by Mikhail Vartanov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMUbQf7RgsYgQ47AFf1wpoSt4dX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26302'),
  ('297678495128923752', 'The Color of the Wind', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre', null, 'Élisabeth Bourgine, Philippe Léotard, Fabrice Luchini, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Jean-Pierre Bisson, Anna Massey, Caroline Chaniolleau, Christine Pascal', null, 'Louise, literary advisor to the Cercle Editions, receives a large manuscript from the United States. Upset by the reading of this book, she begins an epistolary relationship with Paul, the author.', 'Louise, literary advisor to the Cercle Editions, receives a large manuscript from the United States. Upset by the reading of this book, she begins an epistolary relationship with Paul, the author.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piXCI8nUnto46BgLV5mCoZgxOle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67551'),
  ('1085790540836904994', 'The Color Out of Space', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Huan Vu, Martin Kolbert', 'Huan Vu', 'Marco Leibnitz, Michael Kausch, Erik Rastetter, Ingo Heise, Ralf Lichtenberg, Friedrich Schilha, Léon Schröder, Jonas Zumdohme', null, 'Arkham, 1975: Jonathan Davis'' father has disappeared. His tracks lead to Germany, to the Swabian-Franconian Forest where he was stationed after the Second World War. Jonathan sets out to find him and bring him home, but deep in the woods he discovers a dark mystery from the past. Based on H.P. Lovecraft''s short novel "The Colour Out of Space".', 'Arkham, 1975: Jonathan Davis'' father has disappeared. His tracks lead to Germany, to the Swabian-Franconian Forest where he was stationed after the Second World War. Jonathan sets out to find him and bring him home, but deep in the woods he discovers a dark mystery from the past. Based on H.P. Lovecraft''s short novel "The Colour Out of Space".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEmgt2dLFSQy7jX3g2dIn7ECsuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109463'),
  ('283795492732492227', 'The Color Purple', 2023, 'Drama', 'Dan Laustsen, Rory Bruen, Mark Anthony Little', 'Menno Meyjes', 'Fantasia Barrino, Taraji P. Henson, Danielle Brooks, Colman Domingo, Corey Hawkins, Phylicia Pearl Mpasi, Halle Bailey, Ciara', 'PG-13', 'A decades-spanning tale of love and resilience and of one woman''s journey to independence. Celie faces many hardships in her life, but ultimately finds extraordinary strength and hope in the unbreakable bonds of sisterhood.', 'A decades-spanning tale of love and resilience and of one woman''s journey to independence. Celie faces many hardships in her life, but ultimately finds extraordinary strength and hope in the unbreakable bonds of sisterhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5bqIxM8GO4TewJ0u6Rzkg58ssJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:558915'),
  ('958624246041066700', 'The Color Wheel', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alex Ross Perry, Sean Price Williams', 'Carlen Altman, Alex Ross Perry', 'Carlen Altman, Alex Ross Perry, Bob Byington, Kate Lyn Sheil, Anna Bak-Kvapil, Ry Russo-Young, Craig Butta, C. Mason Wells', 'NR', 'JR, an aspiring news-anchor, forces her younger brother Colin to embark on a road trip to move her belongings out of her professor-turned-lover’s place. Traveling through New England, they uncomfortably run into old school-mates or revisit familial history from which they have long since diverged.', 'JR, an aspiring news-anchor, forces her younger brother Colin to embark on a road trip to move her belongings out of her professor-turned-lover’s place. Traveling through New England, they uncomfortably run into old school-mates or revisit familial history from which they have long since diverged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAIq1n0LjePYFLwJlHrGih58bVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83125'),
  ('503212598627305331', 'The Colors of Fire', 2022, 'History, Drama', 'Thierry Pouget, Leonard Gaultier, Johann Lorillon', 'Pierre Lemaitre', 'Léa Drucker, Benoît Poelvoorde, Alice Isaaz, Fanny Ardant, Clovis Cornillac, Olivier Gourmet, Alban Lenoir, Jérémy Lopez', null, 'February 1927. The funeral of Marcel Péricourt, the most powerful banker in Paris. His daughter Madeleine must take the helm of the financial empire of which she is the heiress. But she has a son, Paul, who with an unexpected and tragic gesture will place her on the path to ruin.', 'February 1927. The funeral of Marcel Péricourt, the most powerful banker in Paris. His daughter Madeleine must take the helm of the financial empire of which she is the heiress. But she has a son, Paul, who with an unexpected and tragic gesture will place her on the path to ruin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiAymbgADFKnJMu1NSJhLOvb4SM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785980'),
  ('873744534868053449', 'The Colors of Iris', 1974, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Nikos Panayotopoulos, Lefteris Haronitis, Dinos Mavroeidis', 'Nikos Panayotopoulos', 'Nikitas Tsakiroglou, Vangelis Kazan, Elena Kyrana, George Dialegmenos, Takis Voulalas, Angelos Theodoropoulos, Giorgos Moshidis, Alekos Deligiannis', null, 'A mysterious disappearance takes place during the shooting of a commercial on the beach in the early morning hours. An unknown man suddenly comes into the shot, then walks into the sea holding an umbrella and seizes to exist, before the bewildered eyes of the whole crew. After the police are notified, a confusing array of red tape manoeuvers begins, revealing the close affiliations of the Authorities with the advertising company manager and the whole mechanism of Mass Media, all of which are trying not to investigate the event but to conceal or even exploit it in their own interest. Only the musician involved in that commercial is trying to figure out what really happened.', 'A mysterious disappearance takes place during the shooting of a commercial on the beach in the early morning hours. An unknown man suddenly comes into the shot, then walks into the sea holding an umbrella and seizes to exist, before the bewildered eyes of the whole crew. After the police are notified, a confusing array of red tape manoeuvers begins, revealing the close affiliations of the Authorities with the advertising company manager and the whole mechanism of Mass Media, all of which are trying not to investigate the event but to conceal or even exploit it in their own interest. Only the musician involved in that commercial is trying to figure out what really happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tigsAkkZPSzYikE967y2rKNXhCe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396551'),
  ('1075129330854038969', 'The Colors of the Mountain', 2011, 'Drama', 'Carlos César Arbeláez, Oscar Jimenez, Andrés Gurisatti', null, 'Hernán Mauricio Ocampo, Nolberto Sánchez, Genaro Aristizábal, Hernán Méndez, Carmen Torres, Antonio Galeano, Natalia Cuéllar', null, 'A motley crew of young boys in Colombia lives only for one passion: soccer. But when their precious new ball rolls into a minefield, their dreams are suddenly on hold. Even as the village becomes the center of a tug-of-war between right-wing paramilitary groups and leftist guerrillas, the idea of a rescue attempt is too tempting to resist.', 'A motley crew of young boys in Colombia lives only for one passion: soccer. But when their precious new ball rolls into a minefield, their dreams are suddenly on hold. Even as the village becomes the center of a tug-of-war between right-wing paramilitary groups and leftist guerrillas, the idea of a rescue attempt is too tempting to resist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vM2QgWSdl7Lrqw2x0cesQsorLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81623'),
  ('583276129982493864', 'The Colors Within', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Music', 'Naoko Yamada, Takashi Kojima, Kensuke Ushio', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Sayu Suzukawa, Akari Takaishi, Taisei Kido, Yui Aragaki, Aoi Yuuki, Yasuko, Minako Kotobuki, Keiko Toda', 'PG', 'Totsuko is a high school student with the ability to see the ''colors'' of others. Colors of bliss, excitement, and serenity, plus a color she treasures as her favorite. Kimi, a classmate at her school, gives off the most beautiful color of all. Although she doesn''t play an instrument, Totsuko forms a band with Kimi and Rui, a quiet music enthusiast they meet at a used bookstore in a far corner of town. As they practice at an old church on a remote island, music brings them together, forming friendships and stirring affections.', 'Totsuko is a high school student with the ability to see the ''colors'' of others. Colors of bliss, excitement, and serenity, plus a color she treasures as her favorite. Kimi, a classmate at her school, gives off the most beautiful color of all. Although she doesn''t play an instrument, Totsuko forms a band with Kimi and Rui, a quiet music enthusiast they meet at a used bookstore in a far corner of town. As they practice at an old church on a remote island, music brings them together, forming friendships and stirring affections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOWDvzglcQZOQPqGfVF6hfOhMNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056444'),
  ('235475194245529690', 'The Colossus of New York', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Eugène Lourié, John F. Warren, Ralph Axness', 'Thelma Schnee', 'John Baragrey, Mala Powers, Otto Kruger, Robert Hutton, Ross Martin, Ed Wolff, Charles Herbert, Dick Nelson', 'NR', 'A brilliant surgeon encases his dead son''s brain in a large robot body, with unintended results...', 'A brilliant surgeon encases his dead son''s brain in a large robot body, with unintended results...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kSws2eCyBOFgu0JCYZpmFEgZ9u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56767'),
  ('529764937426607824', 'The Colossus of Rhodes', 1961, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Sergio Leone, Antonio L. Ballesteros, Jorge Grau', 'Ennio De Concini, Sergio Leone, Cesare Seccia', 'Rory Calhoun, Lea Massari, Georges Marchal, Conrado San Martín, Ángel Aranda, Mabel Karr, Mimmo Palmara, Roberto Camardiel', null, 'While on holiday in Rhodes, Athenian war hero Darios becomes involved in two different plots to overthrow the tyrannical king, one from Rhodian patriots and the other from sinister Phoenician agents.', 'While on holiday in Rhodes, Athenian war hero Darios becomes involved in two different plots to overthrow the tyrannical king, one from Rhodian patriots and the other from sinister Phoenician agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DlzluRh0OAstkMbP3MXwzKDaDY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43020'),
  ('299936222646975336', 'The Colour Room', 2021, 'Drama', 'Claire McCarthy, Nanw Rowlands, Paul Morris', 'Claire Peate', 'Phoebe Dynevor, Matthew Goode, David Morrissey, Kerry Fox, Luke Norris, Rachel Shenton, Darci Shaw, Bronwyn James', null, 'A pioneering ceramic artist Clarice Cliff rises to prominence in the 1920s while working in Britain’s Stoke-on-Trent pottery industry.', 'A pioneering ceramic artist Clarice Cliff rises to prominence in the 1920s while working in Britain’s Stoke-on-Trent pottery industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yo9XO3yUCqvu1XF7hm72s3JWzZR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807351'),
  ('386540488175666833', 'The Colours', 1976, 'Documentary, Family', 'Abbas Kiarostami, Mostafa Hajji, Morteza Rastegar', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Shahin Amir Arjomand', null, 'By showing a series of different-coloured objects, the film aims to familiarize very young children with the various colours.', 'By showing a series of different-coloured objects, the film aims to familiarize very young children with the various colours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Wq97c34d2lUYd3SyJXMT9HrDYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201650'),
  ('63076632137428511', 'The Column', 1968, 'Drama, History', 'Mircea Drăgan, Nicu Stan', 'Titus Popovici', 'Richard Johnson, Antonella Lualdi, Ilarion Ciobanu, Ștefan Ciubotărașu, Amedeo Nazzari, Amza Pellea, Emil Botta, Franco Interlenghi', null, 'The end of Trajan''s Dacian Wars (106 AD), when south western Dacia was transformed into a Roman province: Roman Dacia.', 'The end of Trajan''s Dacian Wars (106 AD), when south western Dacia was transformed into a Roman province: Roman Dacia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBfuI14tYV5R86q3677s2L7v5jJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262984'),
  ('465673398316766512', 'The Columnist', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror, TV Movie', 'Martijn Cousijn, Ivo van Aart', 'Daan Windhorst', 'Katja Herbers, Bram Van Der Kelen, Claire Porro, Genio de Groot, Rein Hofman, Harry van Rijthoven, Medina Schuurman, Achraf Koutet', null, 'An opinion columnist and author, subjected to constant misogynistic abuse on social media, snaps and goes on a killing spree against her online abusers.', 'An opinion columnist and author, subjected to constant misogynistic abuse on social media, snaps and goes on a killing spree against her online abusers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCPSdas3h9osgHiNhWGjCOYU5Bb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656770'),
  ('316215501711976305', 'The Comancheros', 1961, 'Western', 'Michael Curtiz, William H. Clothier', 'James Edward Grant, Clair Huffaker', 'John Wayne, Stuart Whitman, Ina Balin, Nehemiah Persoff, Lee Marvin, Michael Ansara, Patrick Wayne, Bruce Cabot', 'PG', 'Texas Ranger Jake Cutter arrests gambler Paul Regret, but soon finds himself teamed with his prisoner in an undercover effort to defeat a band of renegade arms merchants and thieves known as Comancheros.', 'Texas Ranger Jake Cutter arrests gambler Paul Regret, but soon finds himself teamed with his prisoner in an undercover effort to defeat a band of renegade arms merchants and thieves known as Comancheros.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awFLQbAuddc9atznFrdFZTeuhRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30462'),
  ('499787902816180202', 'The Comb', 1991, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Timothy Quay, Stephen Quay, Kim Brandstrup', 'Stephen Quay, Timothy Quay', 'Joy Constaninides, Witold Schejbal', null, 'A porcelain doll’s explorations of a dreamer’s imagination.', 'A porcelain doll’s explorations of a dreamer’s imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mFqhDNXaeoAGUcoDvfRE4FunPC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59360'),
  ('910525839767440465', 'The ComDads', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Francis Veber, Claude Agostini, Francis de Gueltzl', 'Francis Veber', 'Pierre Richard, Gérard Depardieu, Anny Duperey, Michel Aumont, Stéphane Bierry, Philippe Khorsand, Jean-Jacques Scheffer, Roland Blanche', null, 'Unable to find her runaway son, a woman deceives two of her ex-lovers from her youth, a mild-mannered teacher and a tough journalist, that each is the real father in order to obtain their help.', 'Unable to find her runaway son, a woman deceives two of her ex-lovers from her youth, a mild-mannered teacher and a tough journalist, that each is the real father in order to obtain their help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkFslveTXi5vIIGX0Icys8Hz8Zc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10484'),
  ('293670189424747371', 'The Come On', 1956, 'Crime, Drama', 'Russell Birdwell, Ernest Haller', 'Warren Douglas', 'Anne Baxter, Sterling Hayden, John Hoyt, Jesse White, Wally Cassell, Alex Gerry, Paul Picerni, Theodore Newton', 'NR', 'A con woman tries to swindle her partner-in-crime husband with the help of one of her former marks. But is she to be trusted?', 'A con woman tries to swindle her partner-in-crime husband with the help of one of her former marks. But is she to be trusted?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sv0qut5RmxGCIKCICeDUuMeq9N6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46056'),
  ('625707720870417134', 'The Comeback', 1978, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Pete Walker, Peter Jessop', 'Murray Smith', 'Jack Jones, Pamela Stephenson, David Doyle, Richard Johnson, Holly Palance, Sheila Keith, Bill Owen, Peter Turner', null, 'A singer holes up at a sinister estate to write new songs for his act. His ex-wife is brutally murdered, and the killer may be stalking him next.', 'A singer holes up at a sinister estate to write new songs for his act. His ex-wife is brutally murdered, and the killer may be stalking him next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEt3xNDng7mYhIMGWdkJxrVFkx3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106682'),
  ('525731092939937532', 'The Comeback', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Chris Huo Suiqiang, Zhao Long, Ma Erkang', null, 'Simon Yam, Andy On Chi-Kit, Yuen Wah, Jiang Peiyao, Lei Mu, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung', null, 'Uncle Hua, an esteemed antique dealer, stands against the Green Dragon Gang to protect his neighborhood from forced demolition.', 'Uncle Hua, an esteemed antique dealer, stands against the Green Dragon Gang to protect his neighborhood from forced demolition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNnrtEEcDE0kHnUzzUmEGzY2eny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1152306'),
  ('342188038918473344', 'The Comeback Kid', 1980, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Peter Levin, Ric Waite, Kevin G. Cremin', 'Joe S. Landon', 'John Ritter, Susan Dey, Doug McKeon, James Gregory, Jeremy Licht, Dick O''Neill, Rod Gist, Michael Lembeck', 'NR', 'A down-on his-luck baseball pitcher finds a new set of rewards coaching a gang of underprivileged youngsters and romancing a career-oriented playground supervisor who, against her better judgment, put the kids in his charge.', 'A down-on his-luck baseball pitcher finds a new set of rewards coaching a gang of underprivileged youngsters and romancing a career-oriented playground supervisor who, against her better judgment, put the kids in his charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYQ38IIjseEPpmTmUPNga9Sfroi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284918'),
  ('307593926148232532', 'The Comeback Trail', 2020, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Lucas Bielan, George Gallo', 'Josh Posner, George Gallo', 'Robert De Niro, Morgan Freeman, Tommy Lee Jones, Zach Braff, Emile Hirsch, Kate Katzman, Patrick Muldoon, Malcolm Barrett', 'R', 'Two movie producers who owe money to the mob set up their aging movie star for an insurance scam to try and save themselves. But they wind up getting more than they ever imagined.', 'Two movie producers who owe money to the mob set up their aging movie star for an insurance scam to try and save themselves. But they wind up getting more than they ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ublJIJbc2NZ30ptXj4O2d2apo1t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650783'),
  ('368235453777275129', 'The Comebacks', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Tom Brady, Anthony B. Richmond, Allan Graf', null, 'Carl Weathers, David Koechner, Melora Hardin, Matthew Lawrence, Brooke Nevin, Nick Searcy, Robert Ri''chard, George Back', 'PG-13', 'Out-of-luck coach Lambeau Fields takes a rag-tag bunch of college misfits and drives them towards the football championships. In the process, this life-long loser discovers that he is a winner after all by redeeming himself, saving his relationship with his family and friends, and finding that there is indeed, no "I" in "team"!', 'Out-of-luck coach Lambeau Fields takes a rag-tag bunch of college misfits and drives them towards the football championships. In the process, this life-long loser discovers that he is a winner after all by redeeming himself, saving his relationship with his family and friends, and finding that there is indeed, no "I" in "team"!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eY9cDrjSIzsLeMpMRJ0b6dm4oDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10759'),
  ('875107061166595291', 'The Comedian', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Taylor Hackford, Oliver Stapleton, Steve Apicella', 'Jeff Ross, Richard LaGravenese, Lewis Friedman', 'Robert De Niro, Leslie Mann, Danny DeVito, Edie Falco, Harvey Keitel, Charles Grodin, Patti LuPone, Cloris Leachman', 'R', 'An aging comic icon, Jackie Burke, has seen better days. Despite his efforts to reinvent himself and his comic genius, the audience only wants to know him as the former television character he once played. Already a strain on his younger brother and his wife, Jackie is forced to serve out a sentence doing community service for accosting an audience member. While there, he meets Harmony, the daughter of a sleazy Florida real estate mogul, and the two find inspiration in one another, resulting in surprising consequences.', 'An aging comic icon, Jackie Burke, has seen better days. Despite his efforts to reinvent himself and his comic genius, the audience only wants to know him as the former television character he once played. Already a strain on his younger brother and his wife, Jackie is forced to serve out a sentence doing community service for accosting an audience member. While there, he meets Harmony, the daughter of a sleazy Florida real estate mogul, and the two find inspiration in one another, resulting in surprising consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jR7PZd7K0dFT6oL9qhbSsiJXDsR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369524'),
  ('249229481520831240', 'The Comedians', 1967, 'Drama', 'Peter Glenville, Henri Decaë, Jean-Michel Lacor', 'Graham Greene', 'Richard Burton, Elizabeth Taylor, Alec Guinness, Peter Ustinov, Paul Ford, Lillian Gish, Georg Stanford Brown, Roscoe Lee Browne', 'NR', 'American and British tourists get caught up in political unrest in Haiti.', 'American and British tourists get caught up in political unrest in Haiti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlFWqgh0Uyyn21kIaDlRgJk0YYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86059'),
  ('427249493946265839', 'The Comedians of Comedy', 2005, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Michael Blieden', 'Patton Oswalt, Brian Posehn, Maria Bamford', 'Patton Oswalt, Brian Posehn, Maria Bamford, Zach Galifianakis', null, 'The Comedians of Comedy is an occasional stand-up comedy tour featuring Patton Oswalt, Zach Galifianakis, Brian Posehn and Maria Bamford that was documented in a 2005 film and 2005 Comedy Central television series of the same name, both directed by Michael Blieden.', 'The Comedians of Comedy is an occasional stand-up comedy tour featuring Patton Oswalt, Zach Galifianakis, Brian Posehn and Maria Bamford that was documented in a 2005 film and 2005 Comedy Central television series of the same name, both directed by Michael Blieden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2iX8rxrFL3HAr8dWTbISJXZqM4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16452'),
  ('519658161213640185', 'The Comedy', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rick Alverson, Mark Schwartzbard', 'Rick Alverson, Colm O''Leary, Robert Donne', 'Tim Heidecker, Eric Wareheim, James Murphy, Kate Lyn Sheil, Adam Scarimbolo, Gregg Turkington, Alexia Rasmussen, Grace Rex', 'R', 'Indifferent to the notion of inheriting his father''s estate, a restless, aging New Yorker passes time with his friends in games of mock sincerity, irreverence, and recreational cruelty towards those around them.', 'Indifferent to the notion of inheriting his father''s estate, a restless, aging New Yorker passes time with his friends in games of mock sincerity, irreverence, and recreational cruelty towards those around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uw8z9e3x0wFuRguDMuA75ipkEsx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84187'),
  ('449782999835740799', 'The Comedy of Terrors', 1964, 'Comedy, Horror, Crime', 'Jacques Tourneur, Floyd Crosby, Robert Agnew', 'Richard Matheson', 'Vincent Price, Peter Lorre, Boris Karloff, Joyce Jameson, Joe E. Brown, Beverly Powers, Basil Rathbone, Alan DeWitt', null, 'An undertaker who hasn''t had any ''customers'' in a long time is forced to pay one year''s back-rent. To get money he starts to kill people, which brings absurd results.', 'An undertaker who hasn''t had any ''customers'' in a long time is forced to pay one year''s back-rent. To get money he starts to kill people, which brings absurd results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r33eBrYYJphzny0jPJ9sRFYoxev.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29486'),
  ('592253147105294259', 'The Comeuppance', 1970, 'Drama, Crime', 'Claude Bernard-Aubert', null, 'Salvatore Adamo, Michel Constantin, Elisabeth Wiener, Jess Hahn, Simone Valère, Jean Desailly, Max Amyl', null, 'Philippe, Théo and Bob share the same cell in the prison of La Santé. Philippe, a young student, known as "Sciences-Po", is planning revenge against those who sent him to prison. He offers his two fellow prisoners, seasoned mobsters, to help him recover an important document from a diamond dealer in Le Havre. This paper would rehabilitate his father, his two comrades being able to keep the diamonds contained in the safe... But the coup does not go as planned.', 'Philippe, Théo and Bob share the same cell in the prison of La Santé. Philippe, a young student, known as "Sciences-Po", is planning revenge against those who sent him to prison. He offers his two fellow prisoners, seasoned mobsters, to help him recover an important document from a diamond dealer in Le Havre. This paper would rehabilitate his father, his two comrades being able to keep the diamonds contained in the safe... But the coup does not go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Fj9tLfrcPsGde3YCJiecgfDpa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418017'),
  ('890191606778918457', 'The Comfort of Strangers', 1990, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, Fantasy', 'Paul Schrader, Dante Spinotti, Giacomo Lesina', 'Harold Pinter', 'Christopher Walken, Rupert Everett, Natasha Richardson, Helen Mirren, Manfredi Aliquò, David Ford, Daniel Franco, Rossana Canghiari', 'R', 'An Italian diplomat''s son follows and seduces English lovers in Venice.', 'An Italian diplomat''s son follows and seduces English lovers in Venice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMhWT5wdVLnDiz4hUEAOYcTqbGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41925'),
  ('381469495372986830', 'The Comic', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carl Reiner, W. Wallace Kelley, Donald C. Glouner', 'Aaron Ruben', 'Dick Van Dyke, Michele Lee, Mickey Rooney, Cornel Wilde, Nina Wayne, Pert Kelton, Steve Allen, Barbara Heller', 'PG', 'An account of the rise and fall of a silent film comic, Billy Bright. The movie begins with his funeral, as he speaks from beyond the grave in a bitter tone about his fate, and takes us through his fame, as he ruins it with womanizing and drink, and his fall, as a lonely, bitter old man unable to reconcile his life''s disappointments. The movie is based loosely on the life of Buster Keaton.', 'An account of the rise and fall of a silent film comic, Billy Bright. The movie begins with his funeral, as he speaks from beyond the grave in a bitter tone about his fate, and takes us through his fame, as he ruins it with womanizing and drink, and his fall, as a lonely, bitter old man unable to reconcile his life''s disappointments. The movie is based loosely on the life of Buster Keaton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjYGI1Ezf51Pq089setvW3Nr8gY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84839'),
  ('457433610916888555', 'The Comics', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Roberto Gerardi, Sandro Tamborra', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, Domenico Saverni', 'Paolo Villaggio, Renato Pozzetto, Enzo Cannavale, Alessandra Casella, Fabio Traversa, Tiziana Pini, Gian, Renato D''Amore', null, 'Two silent movie actors escape from their film. Forced to find a way to survive in the real world, they will only cause troubles to the people they will meet along the way.', 'Two silent movie actors escape from their film. Forced to find a way to survive in the real world, they will only cause troubles to the people they will meet along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJ4IFom4EL8hC2H5VKmm8hLxbJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43646'),
  ('72036129735394933', 'The Comics 2', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Alessandro D''Eva, Maria Pia Rocco', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, Domenico Saverni', 'Paolo Villaggio, Renato Pozzetto, Roberto Della Casa, Paul Müller, Loredana Romito, Angelo Pellegrino, Alfiero Toppetti, Antonio Allocca', null, 'Paolo Villaggio and Renato Pozzetto are the protagonists of various misadventures, first as nurses of a crazy ambulance, then as night guards of a shopping center and later as a pilot and stewardess of an air taxi. Next, they enlist in the foreign legion and then work as a Santa Claus in a Department Store.', 'Paolo Villaggio and Renato Pozzetto are the protagonists of various misadventures, first as nurses of a crazy ambulance, then as night guards of a shopping center and later as a pilot and stewardess of an air taxi. Next, they enlist in the foreign legion and then work as a Santa Claus in a Department Store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIhoGGxL8flbYQPTt7F1xeSxEKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43648'),
  ('67958176058790250', 'The Coming Days', 2010, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Lars Kraume, Sonja Rom', 'Lars Kraume', 'Bernadette Heerwagen, Daniel Brühl, Johanna Wokalek, August Diehl, Susanne Lothar, Ernst Stötzner, Vincent Redetzki, Mehdi Nebbou', null, 'Welcome to 2020: The European Union has collapsed following the fourth Gulf War and massive barricades keep illegal immigrants out of cities that are barely functioning. In the middle of this highly volatile environment is the family of Walter Kuper, an energy conglomerate executive. Walter’s daughter, Cecilia, has joined the Black Storm terrorist group. Her sister Laura must choose between motherhood and the man she loves; their brother Philip has been called up to fight for Germany in a hopeless war to secure the last remaining oil fields. Starring leading actors Daniel Brühl, Johanna Wokalek and Jürgen Vogel, "The Days to Come" asks provocative questions about the current state of things as it depicts personal and political realities in a scarily believable near–future.', 'Welcome to 2020: The European Union has collapsed following the fourth Gulf War and massive barricades keep illegal immigrants out of cities that are barely functioning. In the middle of this highly volatile environment is the family of Walter Kuper, an energy conglomerate executive. Walter’s daughter, Cecilia, has joined the Black Storm terrorist group. Her sister Laura must choose between motherhood and the man she loves; their brother Philip has been called up to fight for Germany in a hopeless war to secure the last remaining oil fields. Starring leading actors Daniel Brühl, Johanna Wokalek and Jürgen Vogel, "The Days to Come" asks provocative questions about the current state of things as it depicts personal and political realities in a scarily believable near–future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3m3IsSCCo5FpaGTQvGmbNP0Up3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63077'),
  ('553367172944919333', 'The Coming of Sin', 1978, 'Thriller, Drama', 'José Ramón Larraz, Fernando Arribas', 'Monique Pastrynn', 'Patricia Granada, Lidia Zuazo, Rafael Machado, Lea Candle, Daisy Jules, Claude Bellot, Montserrat Julió, Patricia Lorne', null, 'A superstitious servant girl - who has foreboding nightmares about a naked man on horseback - comes to live with a solitary female artist at her country chateau. As the artist takes the girl under her wing, a sensuous relationship develops between them.', 'A superstitious servant girl - who has foreboding nightmares about a naked man on horseback - comes to live with a solitary female artist at her country chateau. As the artist takes the girl under her wing, a sensuous relationship develops between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ochA71smYq0mNuoHUvDdjycCclx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30888'),
  ('49622477079393873', 'The Command', 1954, 'Western', 'David Butler, Wilfrid M. Cline, Oren Haglund', 'Samuel Fuller, Russell S. Hughes', 'Guy Madison, Joan Weldon, James Whitmore, Carl Benton Reid, Harvey Lembeck, Ray Teal, Robert Nichols, Don Shelton', 'NR', 'Once the commanding officer of a cavalry patrol is killed, the ranking officer who must take command is an army doctor.', 'Once the commanding officer of a cavalry patrol is killed, the ranking officer who must take command is an army doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhfYxJHlWftZqLkvFWOpwwVnlot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108345'),
  ('339645001139481082', 'The Commandant', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro D''Eva, Paolo Heusch, Mario Castellani', 'Rodolfo Sonego', 'Totò, Andreina Pagnani, Britt Ekland, Franco Fabrizi, Isa Crescenzi, Linda Sini, Carlotta Barilli, Alberto De Amicis', null, 'The retired general Antonio Cavalli is a nuisance to his family: to his wife Francesca who still works, to his son and to his daughter-in-law. Then he finds a job in a building firm. Only by chance Cavalli finds out that his salary is paid by his wife to keep him busy. But the general is well known as a very reliable man, and Sandrelli, the firm''s owner, uses him and his name to win a valuable contract. When Sandrelli is arrested, the general finds the money to honour his debt but he is robbed while he is going to the bank...', 'The retired general Antonio Cavalli is a nuisance to his family: to his wife Francesca who still works, to his son and to his daughter-in-law. Then he finds a job in a building firm. Only by chance Cavalli finds out that his salary is paid by his wife to keep him busy. But the general is well known as a very reliable man, and Sandrelli, the firm''s owner, uses him and his name to win a valuable contract. When Sandrelli is arrested, the general finds the money to honour his debt but he is robbed while he is going to the bank...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dV8Toob0yWSEyCxXgpEjGgHLYjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73068'),
  ('378431711010342291', 'The Commandant''s Shadow', 2024, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Daniela Völker, Rob Goldie, Piotr Trela', 'Daniela Völker', 'Hans-Jürgen Höss, Kai Höss, Anita Lasker-Wallfisch, Maya Lasker-Wallfisch, Rudolf Höss, Adolf Hitler', 'PG-13', 'While Hans Jurgen Höss enjoyed a happy childhood in the family villa at Auschwitz, Jewish prisoner Anita Lasker-Wallfisch was trying to survive the notorious concentration camp. At the heart of this film is the historic and inspiring moment – eight decades later – when the two come face-to-face. This is the first time the descendant of a major war criminal meets a survivor in such a private and intimate setting, Anita’s London living room. Together with their children, Kai Höss and Maya Lasker-Wallfisch, the four protagonists explore their very different hereditary burdens.', 'While Hans Jurgen Höss enjoyed a happy childhood in the family villa at Auschwitz, Jewish prisoner Anita Lasker-Wallfisch was trying to survive the notorious concentration camp. At the heart of this film is the historic and inspiring moment – eight decades later – when the two come face-to-face. This is the first time the descendant of a major war criminal meets a survivor in such a private and intimate setting, Anita’s London living room. Together with their children, Kai Höss and Maya Lasker-Wallfisch, the four protagonists explore their very different hereditary burdens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSrYAggl17tsY8rOakfZQurneNP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1277783'),
  ('664963018934002949', 'The Commander', 1988, 'Action, War', 'Antonio Margheriti, Peter Baumgartner', 'Tito Carpi', 'Lewis Collins, Lee Van Cleef, Donald Pleasence, Brett Halsey, Manfred Lehmann, Bobby Rhodes, John Steiner, Romano Puppo', null, 'Lewis Collins is back to leading mercenaries on the move in Southeast Asia. This time the cast is unusually good including Lee Van Cleef, Brett Halsey (Cop Game), Romano Puppo (Robowar), Mike Monty (Raiders of Atlantis), Bobby Rhodes (The Great Alligator), etc. Anyway, Van Cleef has Collins go on some random mission to locate a disc with all sorts of valuable crazy intelligence data on it. It just happens that Donald Pleasence, a random government official, hires another mercenary-for-hire Manfred Lehman to tag along and make sure the data ends up in the right hands. Van Cleef isn''t taking any chances, and since he is crooked and murders Collins''s other bosses quickly, he places Romano Puppo in the group as well to make sure the operation runs smoothly. Collins may not be too expressive but at least he seems to figure out quickly who''s out to get him, so the mission continues with lots of double-crosses, twists and turns, and of course lots of explosions!', 'Lewis Collins is back to leading mercenaries on the move in Southeast Asia. This time the cast is unusually good including Lee Van Cleef, Brett Halsey (Cop Game), Romano Puppo (Robowar), Mike Monty (Raiders of Atlantis), Bobby Rhodes (The Great Alligator), etc. Anyway, Van Cleef has Collins go on some random mission to locate a disc with all sorts of valuable crazy intelligence data on it. It just happens that Donald Pleasence, a random government official, hires another mercenary-for-hire Manfred Lehman to tag along and make sure the data ends up in the right hands. Van Cleef isn''t taking any chances, and since he is crooked and murders Collins''s other bosses quickly, he places Romano Puppo in the group as well to make sure the operation runs smoothly. Collins may not be too expressive but at least he seems to figure out quickly who''s out to get him, so the mission continues with lots of double-crosses, twists and turns, and of course lots of explosions!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJVvqNe46gmsoRMCCFkGWXB1GLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154397'),
  ('673821616006228058', 'The Commander', 2023, 'War, History, Drama', 'Edoardo De Angelis, Ferran Paredes, Gabriella Giannattasio', 'Edoardo De Angelis, Sandro Veronesi', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Massimiliano Rossi, Johan Heldenbergh, Silvia D''Amico, Arturo Muselli, Giuseppe Brunetti, Gianluca Di Gennaro, Johannes Wirix', null, 'One dark night during the early phases of WWII, the Italian Royal Navy submarine Cappellini sinks an armed merchant ship sailing with lights out. At that moment, its commander Salvatore Todaro makes a decision that was destined to go down in history: to save the 26 shipwrecked Belgians who otherwise would have drowned in the middle of the Atlantic Ocean and disembark them at the nearest safe harbor. To make room for them on board his submarine, he is forced to navigate on the surface of the water for three days, visible to the enemy forces and endangering his life and that of his men.', 'One dark night during the early phases of WWII, the Italian Royal Navy submarine Cappellini sinks an armed merchant ship sailing with lights out. At that moment, its commander Salvatore Todaro makes a decision that was destined to go down in history: to save the 26 shipwrecked Belgians who otherwise would have drowned in the middle of the Atlantic Ocean and disembark them at the nearest safe harbor. To make room for them on board his submarine, he is forced to navigate on the surface of the water for three days, visible to the enemy forces and endangering his life and that of his men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyTsyp5EwmLQTIU38nFKo4fEx46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047016'),
  ('391432238291903123', 'The Commando', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Philip Tan, Asif Akbar, Jorge Gómez', 'Koji Steven Sakai', 'Michael Jai White, Mickey Rourke, Jeff Fahey, Brendan Fehr, Aris Mejias, Gianni Capaldi, Donald Cerrone, John Enos III', 'R', 'An elite DEA agent returns home after a failed mission when his family makes an unexpected discovery in their house – a stash of money worth $3 million. They soon face the danger and threat of a newly released criminal and his crew, who will do whatever it takes to retrieve the money, including kidnap the agent’s daughters. Stakes are high and lives are at risk in this head-to-head battle as the agent stops at nothing to protect his family against the money-hungry criminals.', 'An elite DEA agent returns home after a failed mission when his family makes an unexpected discovery in their house – a stash of money worth $3 million. They soon face the danger and threat of a newly released criminal and his crew, who will do whatever it takes to retrieve the money, including kidnap the agent’s daughters. Stakes are high and lives are at risk in this head-to-head battle as the agent stops at nothing to protect his family against the money-hungry criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mn1GYIQ1tvFuuu0YBNZBvrHyrkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753232'),
  ('447909744077337825', 'The Commissar', 1967, 'Drama, War', 'Aleksandr Askoldov, Valeriy Ginzburg, Vasili Levin', 'Aleksandr Askoldov', 'Nonna Mordyukova, Rolan Bykov, Rayisa Nedashkivska, Vasiliy Shukshin, Lyudmila Volynskaya, Sergey Nikonenko, Otar Koberidze, Leonid Reutov', null, 'Klavdia Vavilova, a Red Army cavalry commissar, is waylaid by an unexpected pregnancy. She stays with a Jewish family to give birth and is softened somewhat by the experience of family life.', 'Klavdia Vavilova, a Red Army cavalry commissar, is waylaid by an unexpected pregnancy. She stays with a Jewish family to give birth and is softened somewhat by the experience of family life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpCKri2vdKDLkGEFLTOZNrD4bwv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71336'),
  ('76019518827212644', 'The Commissioner', 1998, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'George Sluizer, Bruno de Keyzer, Witold Stok', 'George Sluizer, Christina Kallas', 'John Hurt, Rosana Pastor, Alice Krige, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Johan Leysen, Simon Chandler, David Morrissey, James Faulkner', null, 'John Hurt stars as a scandal-hit member of parliament, dispatched to the political backwaters of the European Commission in Brussels as penance for his failures. However, once there he stumbles upon a chemical weapons outrage that points to a sinister political-industrial conspiracy.', 'John Hurt stars as a scandal-hit member of parliament, dispatched to the political backwaters of the European Commission in Brussels as penance for his failures. However, once there he stumbles upon a chemical weapons outrage that points to a sinister political-industrial conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvj97wCBpGIixJWu3ZaywHQTOyn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12512'),
  ('409825927321301186', 'The Commitments', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Alan Parker, Gale Tattersall, Cliff Lanning', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais, Roddy Doyle', 'Robert Arkins, Michael Aherne, Angeline Ball, Maria Doyle Kennedy, Dave Finnegan, Bronagh Gallagher, Félim Gormley, Glen Hansard', 'R', 'Jimmy Rabbitte, just a thick-ya out of school, gets a brilliant idea: to put a soul band together in Barrytown, his slum home in north Dublin. First he needs musicians and singers: things slowly start to click when he finds three fine-voiced females virtually in his back yard, a lead singer (Deco) at a wedding, and, responding to his ad, an aging trumpet player, Joey "The Lips" Fagan.', 'Jimmy Rabbitte, just a thick-ya out of school, gets a brilliant idea: to put a soul band together in Barrytown, his slum home in north Dublin. First he needs musicians and singers: things slowly start to click when he finds three fine-voiced females virtually in his back yard, a lead singer (Deco) at a wedding, and, responding to his ad, an aging trumpet player, Joey "The Lips" Fagan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iccBDq9aS1gwi6b8aJjBgPU4t2D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11663'),
  ('695431354597577364', 'The Common Law', 1931, 'Drama', 'Paul L. Stein', null, 'Constance Bennett, Joel McCrea, Lew Cody, Hedda Hopper, Walter Walker, Robert Williams, Marion Shilling, Paul Ellis', 'NR', 'When a woman models for an artist they fall in love. Can the artist overcome the beauty''s recent past as another man''s mistress?', 'When a woman models for an artist they fall in love. Can the artist overcome the beauty''s recent past as another man''s mistress?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cjaH3eqQU2EMWSwfJOad5NnkX9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153168'),
  ('968753574370585316', 'The Common Man', 1975, 'Drama', 'Yves Boisset, Jacques Loiseleux', 'Michel Martens, Jean-Pierre Bastid, Jean Curtelin', 'Jean Carmet, Pascale Roberts, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Mohamed Zinet, Jacques Villeret, Ginette Garcin, Jean Bouise, Isabelle Huppert', null, 'Georges Lajoie is a Parisian café owner. As every summer, Georges, his wife Ginette and grown-up son Léon go on holiday to Loulou''s campsite, where they meet up with the Schumacher family (whose father is a bailiff) and the Colin family (who sells bras in the markets). This year, their peace is slightly disturbed by the proximity of a construction site where foreign workers are employed. Xenophobic comments are made. One evening at the ball, a fight breaks out between Lajoie, Albert Schumacher and two algerian immigrant workers...', 'Georges Lajoie is a Parisian café owner. As every summer, Georges, his wife Ginette and grown-up son Léon go on holiday to Loulou''s campsite, where they meet up with the Schumacher family (whose father is a bailiff) and the Colin family (who sells bras in the markets). This year, their peace is slightly disturbed by the proximity of a construction site where foreign workers are employed. Xenophobic comments are made. One evening at the ball, a fight breaks out between Lajoie, Albert Schumacher and two algerian immigrant workers...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Yo9YU2bHI0ujOWxgi1koeSMuqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5602'),
  ('529617134534164867', 'The Commune', 2016, 'Drama', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Jesper Tøffner', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Tobias Lindholm', 'Ulrich Thomsen, Trine Dyrholm, Helene Reingaard Neumann, Lars Ranthe, Julie Agnete Vang, Fares Fares, Magnus Millang, Martha Sofie Wallstrøm Hansen', null, 'A funny and moving story of family and free love set in a freewheeling 1970s commune. When Anna and Erik inherit a huge house, they gather a motley crew of cohabitants to reinvigorate their lives, forcing them to reconcile their new values with old habits.', 'A funny and moving story of family and free love set in a freewheeling 1970s commune. When Anna and Erik inherit a huge house, they gather a motley crew of cohabitants to reinvigorate their lives, forcing them to reconcile their new values with old habits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evGoMMVXiIOQ1KwSMVnbzHBfX6I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308409'),
  ('2061741552170646', 'The Communion Girl', 2023, 'Horror', 'Víctor García, José Luis Bernal', 'Guillem Clua', 'Carla Campra, Aina Quiñones, Marc Soler, Carlos Oviedo, Olimpia Roch, María Molins, Xavi Lite, Anna Alarcón', null, 'May, 1987. While returning from a nightclub and after having taken drugs, new girl in town Sara and her friend Rebe find a doll wearing a communion dress. From that moment, their lives will become a living hell.', 'May, 1987. While returning from a nightclub and after having taken drugs, new girl in town Sara and her friend Rebe find a doll wearing a communion dress. From that moment, their lives will become a living hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7h5qQErebTkp5YfbDxcu9sPxc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008005'),
  ('147006848877062498', 'The Communist', 1958, 'Drama, History', 'Yuli Raizman, Aleksandr Shelenkov, Yu-Lan Chen', 'Yevgeni Gabrilovich', 'Evgeniy Urbanskiy, Sofya Pavlova, Boris Smirnov, Yevgeni Shutov, Sergei Yakovlev, Valentin Zubkov, Viktor Kolpakov, Vladimir Adlerov', null, 'A young ordinary communist, Vasiliy Gubanov, was among many who took part in the construction of the most important facility for the young republic, the power plant. He did his job in a way that was beyond human ability. He could love, too, with a passion and a passion for self, but his life was cut short very early.', 'A young ordinary communist, Vasiliy Gubanov, was among many who took part in the construction of the most important facility for the young republic, the power plant. He did his job in a way that was beyond human ability. He could love, too, with a passion and a passion for self, but his life was cut short very early.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRnW9yfa7SQNp9AiI2zHsHYmg6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142881'),
  ('1025488681318808688', 'The Commuter', 2018, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Thibaut Breton, Tom Mulberge, Bryn Lawrence', 'Byron Willinger, Philip de Blasi, Ryan Engle', 'Liam Neeson, Patrick Wilson, Sam Neill, Jonathan Banks, Vera Farmiga, Elizabeth McGovern, Killian Scott, Shazad Latif', 'PG-13', 'A businessman, on his daily commute home, gets unwittingly caught up in a criminal conspiracy that threatens not only his life but the lives of those around him.', 'A businessman, on his daily commute home, gets unwittingly caught up in a criminal conspiracy that threatens not only his life but the lives of those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDeGK6FIUfVcXmuBdEORPAGPMNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399035'),
  ('1135956181214761565', 'The Companion', 1994, 'Science Fiction, Romance, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Gary Fleder, Rick Bota, Matt Hinkley', 'Ian Seeberg', 'Kathryn Harrold, Bruce Greenwood, Talia Balsam, Brion James, Joely Fisher, James Karen, Earl Boen, Courtney Taylor', 'R', 'In the near-distant future, a female romance writer is planning to write her next book in a remote mountain cabin. A friend convinces her to bring along a "companion", a nearly-human android to cook and clean. She settles on a male companion named "Geoffrey." Bored with some of Geoffrey''s behavior, she tinkers with his programming -- first his personality, then his sexuality. Real trouble comes when she gives his mind access to "random data."', 'In the near-distant future, a female romance writer is planning to write her next book in a remote mountain cabin. A friend convinces her to bring along a "companion", a nearly-human android to cook and clean. She settles on a male companion named "Geoffrey." Bored with some of Geoffrey''s behavior, she tinkers with his programming -- first his personality, then his sexuality. Real trouble comes when she gives his mind access to "random data."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyEX0MFUT0iFI8fNs2b6DB3fpZn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252316'),
  ('433082022091680712', 'The Companions', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'François Favrat', 'Johanne Bernard, François Favrat', 'Najaa Bensaid, Agnès Jaoui, Pio Marmaï, Louis Cristiani, Mouad Habrani, Kevin Boudeau, Hédia Fatnassi, Elyssa Tomescu', null, 'At 19, passionate about street art, Naëlle (Najaa Bensaid) is forced to follow a reintegration project with other young people, her last chance to avoid being separated from her loved ones. Touched by the young girl, Hélène (Agnès Jaoui), the site manager and her instructor, introduces her one day to the Maison des Compagnons de Nantes, a world of traditions that promotes craftsmanship excellence and transmission between generations. Alongside Paul (Pio Marmai), a companion stained glass artist who agrees to take her for training in his studio, Naëlle discovers a universe with codes very different from hers that could give new meaning despite her difficulties in life. Naëlle will carve a place for herself in the fascinating world of stained glass and will realize that the Companions'' values are not just empty words.', 'At 19, passionate about street art, Naëlle (Najaa Bensaid) is forced to follow a reintegration project with other young people, her last chance to avoid being separated from her loved ones. Touched by the young girl, Hélène (Agnès Jaoui), the site manager and her instructor, introduces her one day to the Maison des Compagnons de Nantes, a world of traditions that promotes craftsmanship excellence and transmission between generations. Alongside Paul (Pio Marmai), a companion stained glass artist who agrees to take her for training in his studio, Naëlle discovers a universe with codes very different from hers that could give new meaning despite her difficulties in life. Naëlle will carve a place for herself in the fascinating world of stained glass and will realize that the Companions'' values are not just empty words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uad2QFENfs7d3ausRsAia1xunrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:827168'),
  ('885964438176312085', 'The Company', 2003, 'Romance, Music, Drama', 'Robert Altman, Andrew Dunn, Jennifer Deigl', 'Barbara Turner', 'Neve Campbell, Malcolm McDowell, James Franco, Barbara E. Robertson, William Dick, Susie Cusack, Marilyn Dodds Frank, John Lordan', 'PG-13', 'Ensemble drama centered around a group of ballet dancers, with a focus on one young dancer who''s poised to become a principal performer.', 'Ensemble drama centered around a group of ballet dancers, with a focus on one young dancer who''s poised to become a principal performer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZpURQjJuGvl2a0xI01J8uocCWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52036'),
  ('736743517389662281', 'The Company Men', 2010, 'Drama', 'John Wells, Roger Deakins', 'John Wells', 'Ben Affleck, Tommy Lee Jones, Chris Cooper, Kevin Costner, Maria Bello, Rosemarie DeWitt, Craig T. Nelson, Eamonn Walker', 'R', 'Bobby Walker lives the proverbial American dream: great job, beautiful family, shiny Porsche in the garage. When corporate downsizing leaves him and two co-workers jobless, the three men are forced to re-define their lives as men, husbands and fathers.', 'Bobby Walker lives the proverbial American dream: great job, beautiful family, shiny Porsche in the garage. When corporate downsizing leaves him and two co-workers jobless, the three men are forced to re-define their lives as men, husbands and fathers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKX6E1nOf4vZN903YbkjQe7x1fv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44129'),
  ('275357202461822042', 'The Company of Strangers', 1990, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Cynthia Scott, Gloria Demers, François Gingras', 'Gloria Demers, Cynthia Scott, Sally Bochner', 'Alice Diabo, Constance Garneau, Winifred Holden, Cissy Meddings, Beth Webber, Catherine Roche, Mary Meigs, Michelle Sweeney', null, 'A busload of women become stranded in an isolated part of the Canadian countryside. As they await rescue, they reflect on their lives through a mostly ad-libbed script.', 'A busload of women become stranded in an isolated part of the Canadian countryside. As they await rescue, they reflect on their lives through a mostly ad-libbed script.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlXFhekstIC0hsVjbhLjjC5EWBy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123778'),
  ('605609425739898849', 'The Company of Wolves', 1984, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Neil Jordan, Bryan Loftus, Paul Frift', 'Charles Perrault', 'Sarah Patterson, Angela Lansbury, David Warner, Graham Crowden, Brian Glover, Kathryn Pogson, Stephen Rea, Tusse Silberg', 'R', 'An adaptation of Angela Carter''s fairy tales. Young Rosaleen dreams of a village in the dark woods, where Granny tells her cautionary tales in which innocent maidens are tempted by wolves who are hairy on the inside. As Rosaleen grows into womanhood, will the wolves come for her too?', 'An adaptation of Angela Carter''s fairy tales. Young Rosaleen dreams of a village in the dark woods, where Granny tells her cautionary tales in which innocent maidens are tempted by wolves who are hairy on the inside. As Rosaleen grows into womanhood, will the wolves come for her too?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2g2YPws1MiEWTodUE8u3qOf78XS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11905'),
  ('862107593489925716', 'The Company She Keeps', 1951, 'Drama', 'John Cromwell, Nicholas Musuraca, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Ketti Frings', 'Lizabeth Scott, Jane Greer, Dennis O''Keefe, Fay Baker, John Hoyt, James Bell, Don Beddoe, Bert Freed', 'NR', 'A lady con artist sets out to steal her parole officer''s fiance.', 'A lady con artist sets out to steal her parole officer''s fiance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVqrRJdOhWs5Q870R2kkFvMeMlm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27544'),
  ('1022869679355655373', 'The Company You Keep', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Redford, Adriano Goldman, Amanda Petura', 'Lem Dobbs', 'Robert Redford, Shia LaBeouf, Nick Nolte, Brendan Gleeson, Terrence Howard, Susan Sarandon, Chris Cooper, Stanley Tucci', 'R', 'A former Weather Underground activist goes on the run from a journalist who discovers his identity.', 'A former Weather Underground activist goes on the run from a journalist who discovers his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvAyJbl7d0Gm0GRJlPPW8n4XrdT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87496'),
  ('121164588438161937', 'The Competition', 1980, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Joel Oliansky, Richard H. Kline', 'Joel Oliansky', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Amy Irving, Lee Remick, Sam Wanamaker, Joseph Cali, Ty Henderson, Vicki Kriegler, Bea Silvern', null, 'The movie centers on a piano competition whose winner is assured of success. It is Paul''s last chance to compete, but newcomer Heidi may be a better pianist. Can romance be far away? Will she take a dive despite the pressure to win from her teacher, Greta, or will she condemn Paul to obscurity?', 'The movie centers on a piano competition whose winner is assured of success. It is Paul''s last chance to compete, but newcomer Heidi may be a better pianist. Can romance be far away? Will she take a dive despite the pressure to win from her teacher, Greta, or will she condemn Paul to obscurity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14iMtdJY3HjwrmqPUZ55F4LzuCd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42158'),
  ('235443374600382638', 'The Competition', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Claire Simon', 'Claire Simon', 'Alain Bergala, Xanaë Bove, Emmanuel Chaumet, Claire Childeric, Michaël Dacheux, Joël Danet, Émilie Deleuze, Marie-Christine Desandré', null, 'An all-access tour behind the scenes at France’s premiere film school, La Fémis. Showing us how successful candidates get to follow in the footsteps of such luminaries as Louis Malle, François Ozon and Alain Resnais, all of whom attended this prestigious institution. Stumbling over their words, the often-nervous candidates seem vulnerable when confronted with the veterans of the industry, who have the difficult task of discovering true talent among all these eager young people.', 'An all-access tour behind the scenes at France’s premiere film school, La Fémis. Showing us how successful candidates get to follow in the footsteps of such luminaries as Louis Malle, François Ozon and Alain Resnais, all of whom attended this prestigious institution. Stumbling over their words, the often-nervous candidates seem vulnerable when confronted with the veterans of the industry, who have the difficult task of discovering true talent among all these eager young people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooGSIhWZlxKx5DFebGgnaO3mCKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413767'),
  ('987433858421604983', 'The Compleat Al', 1985, 'Comedy, Music', 'Jeff Rosen, Robert K. Weiss, Jay Levey', 'Robert K. Weiss, Jay Levey, Hamilton Cloud', '''Weird Al'' Yankovic, Barry Hansen, Dick Clark, Art Fleming, Don Pardo, Greg Kihn, Wally Burns, Tress MacNeille', 'NR', 'Fact and fiction are mingled in this mockumentary about the career of music parodist “Weird Al” Yankovic. In retelling his life story, the film includes eight "Weird Al" music video classics: "Ricky", "I Love Rocky Road", the award-winning "Eat It", "I Lost on Jeopardy", "This Is the Life", "Like a Surgeon", "One More Minute", and "Dare to Be Stupid"!', 'Fact and fiction are mingled in this mockumentary about the career of music parodist “Weird Al” Yankovic. In retelling his life story, the film includes eight "Weird Al" music video classics: "Ricky", "I Love Rocky Road", the award-winning "Eat It", "I Lost on Jeopardy", "This Is the Life", "Like a Surgeon", "One More Minute", and "Dare to Be Stupid"!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldvloL7huNfuhSku4I7e8Ay4s85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23496'),
  ('618713420114234202', 'The Compleat Beatles', 1982, 'Documentary, Music', 'Patrick Montgomery', 'David Silver', 'Malcolm McDowell, John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison, Ringo Starr, George Martin, Allan Williams, Gerry Marsden', null, 'Now, for the first time, you can re-live the Beatles legends with this stunning 2-hour musical “Rockumentary”. It’s all there from the wild exuberance of the early Cavern Club days through eight incredible years, to the grim finality of “Let It Be”. See John, Paul, George and Ringo in performance, on tour, in films, recording with George Martin and in rare footage never before seen. Narrated by Malcom McDowell.', 'Now, for the first time, you can re-live the Beatles legends with this stunning 2-hour musical “Rockumentary”. It’s all there from the wild exuberance of the early Cavern Club days through eight incredible years, to the grim finality of “Let It Be”. See John, Paul, George and Ringo in performance, on tour, in films, recording with George Martin and in rare footage never before seen. Narrated by Malcom McDowell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktaMtm19kVmgLpnuAANC69o8rp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42101'),
  ('158264053742059407', 'The Complex', 2013, 'Horror', 'Hideo Nakata, Ryuichi Saeki', 'Hideo Nakata, Junya Kato, Ryuta Miyake', 'Atsuko Maeda, Hiroki Narimiya, Masanobu Katsumura, Naomi Nishida, Sosei Tanaka, Masaya Takahashi, Satomi Tezuka, Shirô Namiki', null, 'Nursing student Asuka has just moved into an apartment complex with her parents and younger brother. On the first night in her new room, she is awoken by a strange scratching sound coming from the apartment of her neighbor, a reclusive old man who has refused all attempts at communication. Concerned over his well being, Asuka enters his home only to find him dead from malnutrition. Worse, it looks as if he had been trying to claw his way into her room. Asuka learns that there have been a number of strange deaths in the complex over the years from Shinobu, the handyman cleaning up the old man’s apartment. Even the girls at school whisper rumors of it being haunted.', 'Nursing student Asuka has just moved into an apartment complex with her parents and younger brother. On the first night in her new room, she is awoken by a strange scratching sound coming from the apartment of her neighbor, a reclusive old man who has refused all attempts at communication. Concerned over his well being, Asuka enters his home only to find him dead from malnutrition. Worse, it looks as if he had been trying to claw his way into her room. Asuka learns that there have been a number of strange deaths in the complex over the years from Shinobu, the handyman cleaning up the old man’s apartment. Even the girls at school whisper rumors of it being haunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRGypGRXaTS6lGh1qkkplSMIRiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153750'),
  ('694347156107620398', 'The Complexity of Happiness', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vladan Radović, Gianni Zanasi', 'Michele Pellegrini, Gianni Zanasi, Lorenzo Favella', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Hadas Yaron, Giuseppe Battiston, Filippo De Carli, Camilla Martini, Maurizio Donadoni, Teco Celio, Daniele De Angelis', null, 'Enrico is a corporate man whose job is to manipulate inexperienced scions into selling their flailing companies. His latest assignment proves more difficult than anticipated—since his target are two young siblings whose parents just died in a car accident.', 'Enrico is a corporate man whose job is to manipulate inexperienced scions into selling their flailing companies. His latest assignment proves more difficult than anticipated—since his target are two young siblings whose parents just died in a car accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xbCQ6ibmA8Nbx5QAq4kOdbl6gl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369245'),
  ('333848038641087837', 'The Computer Wore Tennis Shoes', 1969, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Robert Butler, Frank V. Phillips', 'Joseph L. McEveety', 'Kurt Russell, Cesar Romero, Joe Flynn, William Schallert, Alan Hewitt, Richard Bakalyan, Debbie Paine, Frank Welker', 'G', 'Some college students manage to persuade the town''s big businessman, A. J. Arno, to donate a computer to their college. When the problem- student, Dexter Riley, tries to fix the computer, he gets an electric shock and his brain turns to a computer; now he remembers everything he reads. Unfortunately, he also remembers information which was in the computer''s memory, like Arno''s illegal businesses..', 'Some college students manage to persuade the town''s big businessman, A. J. Arno, to donate a computer to their college. When the problem- student, Dexter Riley, tries to fix the computer, he gets an electric shock and his brain turns to a computer; now he remembers everything he reads. Unfortunately, he also remembers information which was in the computer''s memory, like Arno''s illegal businesses..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXfUKvAHTIifAU7IP17kl1ZBGh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29228'),
  ('454888738927095410', 'The Computer Wore Tennis Shoes', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Peyton Reed', 'Ryan Rowe, Joseph L. McEveety', 'Kirk Cameron, Larry Miller, Jason Bernard, Andrew Woodworth, Anne Tremko, Matthew McCurley, Jeff Maynard, Charles Lane', null, 'By accident, the content of a computer encyclopedia is transferred into the brain of Dexter Riley, a less than average college boy. Because of his newly acquired knowledge he competes in a quiz show between various universities, where he sweeps all the points. A wiz kid from another university finds out about his cheated wisdom and does everything to discredit Dexter.', 'By accident, the content of a computer encyclopedia is transferred into the brain of Dexter Riley, a less than average college boy. Because of his newly acquired knowledge he competes in a quiz show between various universities, where he sweeps all the points. A wiz kid from another university finds out about his cheated wisdom and does everything to discredit Dexter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiHGkezYgoNNBtJMAJm8tOMe8DP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177229'),
  ('199102559690651884', 'The Con', 1998, 'Romance, Comedy, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Steven Schachter, Courtney Wulfe, Jerram A. Swartz', 'William H. Macy, Steven Schachter', 'William H. Macy, Rebecca De Mornay, Mike Nussbaum, Angela Paton, Frances Sternhagen, Tony Frank, Don Harvey, Matt Hill', 'PG-13', 'A lonely gas station attendent in Mississippi falls in love with a con woman who wants to get her hands on an inheritance he doesn''t know about.', 'A lonely gas station attendent in Mississippi falls in love with a con woman who wants to get her hands on an inheritance he doesn''t know about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6mkrEYBBOMsoBNl0Jcs0hIBw0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131729'),
  ('620310690617476196', 'The Con Artists', 1976, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Sergio Corbucci, Giovanni Manganelli, Marcello Gatti', 'Sergio Corbucci, Dino Maiuri, Massimo De Rita', 'Adriano Celentano, Anthony Quinn, Capucine, Corinne Cléry, Renzo Marignano, Ugo Bologna, Sal Borgese, Attilio Dottesio', null, 'Belle Duke, in order to get revenge on her former lover Philip Bang, organize his jail break. But instead of Philip is the Italian Felice Brianza, AKAS Felix, to escape. Now Felix is obliged to help Philip to escape. He will succeeded and from that moment on the two will join to defraud Belle. The swindle plot become more complicate when Felix falls in love for Philip''s daughter.', 'Belle Duke, in order to get revenge on her former lover Philip Bang, organize his jail break. But instead of Philip is the Italian Felice Brianza, AKAS Felix, to escape. Now Felix is obliged to help Philip to escape. He will succeeded and from that moment on the two will join to defraud Belle. The swindle plot become more complicate when Felix falls in love for Philip''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4A35BCPL2bIEtvxONiE8FxqDm1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38362'),
  ('489462759601374151', 'The Con Artists', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Kim Hong-sun, Yun Ju-hwan, Jeon Byeong-yun', 'Kim Yang-Joong', 'Kim Woo-bin, Lee Hyun-woo, Kim Yeong-cheol, Jo Yoon-hee, Jeong Man-sik, Lim Ju-hwan, Shin Gu, Heo Joon-seok', null, 'A wily safecracker is forced to help a mob boss pull off a $150 million heist, but smells a double-cross in the works.', 'A wily safecracker is forced to help a mob boss pull off a $150 million heist, but smells a double-cross in the works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OMSjrkToOCBV7ikcz0LYax7m10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300433'),
  ('86028063003663836', 'The Con Is On', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime', 'James Oakley, Joseph White', 'Alex Michaelides, James Oakley', 'Uma Thurman, Tim Roth, Alice Eve, Parker Posey, Sofía Vergara, Maggie Q, Crispin Glover, Stephen Fry', 'R', 'In an effort to avoid paying off a massive gambling debt to a notorious mobster in England, a couple flees to Los Angeles and hatch a jewel theft plot.', 'In an effort to avoid paying off a massive gambling debt to a notorious mobster in England, a couple flees to Los Angeles and hatch a jewel theft plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4ZzzFOokK356jf6L6vUp3RKNvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353576'),
  ('253181556451904513', 'The Con-Heartist', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pacharaporn Hitanant, Korn Thitikorn Chongkongka, Mez Tharatorn', 'Thodsapon Thiptinnakorn, Mez Tharatorn, Pattaranad Bhiboonsawade', 'Nadech Kugimiya, Pimchanok Luevisadpaibul, Thiti Mahayotaruk, Kathaleeya McIntosh, Pongsatorn Jongwilas, Chantavit Dhanasevi, Tanachporn Rakharutai, Natthachai Sirinanthachot', null, 'Ina, whose ex-boyfriend runs off, leaving her in debt, manages to catch on a cunning con artist who tries to con her. But instead of turning him to the police, she hires this con artist to swindle her ex-boyfriend to get revenge.', 'Ina, whose ex-boyfriend runs off, leaving her in debt, manages to catch on a cunning con artist who tries to con her. But instead of turning him to the police, she hires this con artist to swindle her ex-boyfriend to get revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GFHtWpnMfxjZ1HCTkyXoyQWI6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:771257'),
  ('30521757051194052', 'The Conceited General', 1956, 'Animation', 'Te Wei', null, null, null, 'After a victorious military campaign, a general returns home to glory and prosperity. The king rewards him and claims that all enemies will be intimidated by the general. From then on, the general no longer practice martial arts. He eats, drinks, lives the glamorous life, and didn''t bother anymore with sharpening his weapons. When the enemy one day returns, his own arrogance led to his defeat and eventually to the downfall of whole nation.', 'After a victorious military campaign, a general returns home to glory and prosperity. The king rewards him and claims that all enemies will be intimidated by the general. From then on, the general no longer practice martial arts. He eats, drinks, lives the glamorous life, and didn''t bother anymore with sharpening his weapons. When the enemy one day returns, his own arrogance led to his defeat and eventually to the downfall of whole nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwdzoViY19QXvGw3QogBhqFgz6M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342442'),
  ('1071871784940838796', 'The Concert', 1967, 'Animation', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Francis Pronier', 'Walerian Borowczyk', null, null, 'A short film by Walerian Borowczyk. Ostensibly a film of a concert given by the round, unassuming Monsieur Kabal and his spiky, terrifying wife, it''s actually a cover for their frequent attempts at causing each other extreme physical harm.', 'A short film by Walerian Borowczyk. Ostensibly a film of a concert given by the round, unassuming Monsieur Kabal and his spiky, terrifying wife, it''s actually a cover for their frequent attempts at causing each other extreme physical harm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HiNLKJahpSLTQ8lD7cRB6Ls9E1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291352'),
  ('167368640909818099', 'The Concert', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Radu Mihăileanu, Laurent Dailland', 'Radu Mihăileanu, Matthew Robbins, Alain-Michel Blanc', 'Aleksey Guskov, Mélanie Laurent, Dmitri Nazarov, François Berléand, Miou-Miou, Lionel Abelanski, Valeriy Barinov, Sara Martins', 'G', 'A former world-famous conductor of the Bolshoï orchestra, known as "The Maëstro", Andreï Filipov had seen his career publicly broken by Leonid Brezhnev for hiring Jewish musicians and now works cleaning the concert hall where he once directed. One day, he intercepts an official invitation from the prestigious Théâtre du Châtelet. Through a series of mad antics, he reunites his old orchestra, now composed of old alcoholic musicians, and flies to perform in Paris and complete the Tchaikovsky concerto interrupted 30 years earlier. For the concerto, he engages a young violin soloist with whom he has an unexpected connection.', 'A former world-famous conductor of the Bolshoï orchestra, known as "The Maëstro", Andreï Filipov had seen his career publicly broken by Leonid Brezhnev for hiring Jewish musicians and now works cleaning the concert hall where he once directed. One day, he intercepts an official invitation from the prestigious Théâtre du Châtelet. Through a series of mad antics, he reunites his old orchestra, now composed of old alcoholic musicians, and flies to perform in Paris and complete the Tchaikovsky concerto interrupted 30 years earlier. For the concerto, he engages a young violin soloist with whom he has an unexpected connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMIDVIq7p2mcvolG93FH4Ku3aYJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25205'),
  ('383277991292840815', 'The Concert for Bangladesh', 1972, 'Music, Documentary', 'Saul Swimmer', null, 'Eric Clapton, Bob Dylan, Leon Russell, Billy Preston, George Harrison, Ravi Shankar, Ringo Starr, Klaus Voormann', 'G', 'A film about the first benefit rock concert when major musicians performed to raise relief funds for the poor of Bangladesh. The Concert for Bangladesh was a pair of benefit concerts organised by former Beatles guitarist George Harrison and Indian sitar player Ravi Shankar. The shows were held at 2:30 and 8:00 pm on Sunday, 1 August 1971, at Madison Square Garden in New York City, to raise international awareness of, and fund relief for refugees from East Pakistan, following the Bangladesh Liberation War-related genocide.', 'A film about the first benefit rock concert when major musicians performed to raise relief funds for the poor of Bangladesh. The Concert for Bangladesh was a pair of benefit concerts organised by former Beatles guitarist George Harrison and Indian sitar player Ravi Shankar. The shows were held at 2:30 and 8:00 pm on Sunday, 1 August 1971, at Madison Square Garden in New York City, to raise international awareness of, and fund relief for refugees from East Pakistan, following the Bangladesh Liberation War-related genocide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSJBmsAwYJXqKPuWoGHGJVZhyLJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59414'),
  ('683177769763832579', 'The Concierge', 2023, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Hiromi Kikuta, Yoshimi Itazu', 'Satomi Oshima', 'Natsumi Kawaida, Takeo Otsuka, Kenjiro Tsuda, Nobuo Tobita, Megumi Han, Natsumi Fujiwara, Eiji Yoshitomi, Jun Fukuyama', null, 'Welcome to the Hokkyoku Department Store! This unusual shop caters exclusively to animals, furry and feathered alike. Akino is a new concierge in training and she''s quickly realizing the high demands of her customers—especially those on the extinct species list. From a sea mink searching for a special gift to a laughing owl looking to please his wife, can she fulfill every request?', 'Welcome to the Hokkyoku Department Store! This unusual shop caters exclusively to animals, furry and feathered alike. Akino is a new concierge in training and she''s quickly realizing the high demands of her customers—especially those on the extinct species list. From a sea mink searching for a special gift to a laughing owl looking to please his wife, can she fulfill every request?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cjjcsljYjqk5W4V7qpiQ0dmsxe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1117609'),
  ('27644764072660886', 'The Conclave', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Christoph Schrewe, Mathias Neumann, Rob Cotterill', 'Paul Donovan', 'Brian Blessed, James Faulkner, Rolf Kanies, Manu Fullola, Dominic Boeer, Nora Tschirner, Holger Kunkel, Nicholas Irons', null, 'In 1458, five years after the fall of Constantinople to the Turk, eighteen cardinals meet to elect a new pope. Rodrigo Borgia, a 27 year old cardinal learns to play a very dangerous game.', 'In 1458, five years after the fall of Constantinople to the Turk, eighteen cardinals meet to elect a new pope. Rodrigo Borgia, a 27 year old cardinal learns to play a very dangerous game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKm4NcukUzUyRKesDakTORFMSHR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19039'),
  ('983563564148316206', 'The Concorde... Airport ''79', 1979, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'David Lowell Rich, Philip H. Lathrop, Katy Emde', 'Eric Roth', 'Robert Wagner, Susan Blakely, Alain Delon, Sylvia Kristel, George Kennedy, David Warner, Eddie Albert, Sybil Danning', 'PG', 'Aviation disaster-prone Joe Patroni must contend with nuclear missiles, the French Air Force and the threat of the plane splitting in two over the Alps.', 'Aviation disaster-prone Joe Patroni must contend with nuclear missiles, the French Air Force and the threat of the plane splitting in two over the Alps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQ6NhOGYOHfgccDdRLh7N6vOgw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29723'),
  ('593521477058685737', 'The Concrete Jungle', 1982, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tom DeSimone, Andrew W. Friend, Nancy King', 'Alan J. Adler', 'Jill St. John, Tracey E. Bregman, BarBara Luna, June Barrett, Aimée Eccles, Sondra Currie, Peter Brown, Susan Mechsner', 'R', 'An unfortunate and naive girl is set up by her boyfriend and convicted of drug smuggling. She is sent to a women''s correctional facility where she must constantly struggle to survive.', 'An unfortunate and naive girl is set up by her boyfriend and convicted of drug smuggling. She is sent to a women''s correctional facility where she must constantly struggle to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnJ82f7ulMfFFM7x5S6WzhRTeNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39457'),
  ('210148636711746279', 'The Concubine', 2012, 'Drama', 'Kang Dae-hui, Kim Dae-seung, Hwang Ki-suk', 'Kim Dae-seung, Kim Mee-jeung, Hwang Yoon-jung', 'Cho Yeo-jeong, Kim Dong-wook, Kim Min-jun, Park Ji-young, Cho Eun-ji, Lee Kyung-young, Ahn Suk-hwan, Park Cheol-min', null, 'Living a torturous life of poverty and barely able to survive, Hwa-yeon decides to offer herself as one of the king’s concubines. Once inside the royal palace, two men are immediately seized by the woman - the Grand Prince Seong-won, a megalomaniacal ruler drunk with power and lust, and Kwon-yoo, who has everything to lose if his desire for Hwa-yeon is exposed.', 'Living a torturous life of poverty and barely able to survive, Hwa-yeon decides to offer herself as one of the king’s concubines. Once inside the royal palace, two men are immediately seized by the woman - the Grand Prince Seong-won, a megalomaniacal ruler drunk with power and lust, and Kwon-yoo, who has everything to lose if his desire for Hwa-yeon is exposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLT2eYXoDSXWkqJQcDqVinxIkf0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122126'),
  ('828793238015632364', 'The Condemned', 2007, 'Action, Thriller', 'Darwin Brooks, Jamie Crooks, Mark Wareham', 'Scott Wiper, Rob Hedden', 'Steve Austin, Vinnie Jones, Robert Mammone, Tory Mussett, Madeleine West, Rick Hoffman, Sullivan Stapleton, Manu Bennett', 'R', 'Jack Conrad is awaiting the death penalty in a corrupt Central American prison. He is "purchased" by a wealthy television producer and taken to a desolate island where he must fight to the death against nine other condemned killers from all corners of the world, with freedom going to the sole survivor.', 'Jack Conrad is awaiting the death penalty in a corrupt Central American prison. He is "purchased" by a wealthy television producer and taken to a desolate island where he must fight to the death against nine other condemned killers from all corners of the world, with freedom going to the sole survivor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uC50pDHgQQtoDFNh9bBNDAvpsqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14636'),
  ('151150325755215499', 'The Condemned 2', 2015, 'Action', 'Chemen A. Ochoa, Liv Selinger, Roel Reiné', 'Alan B. McElroy', 'Randy Orton, Eric Roberts, Wes Studi, Steven Michael Quezada, Monique Candelaria, Dylan Kenin, Alex Knight, Stafford Douglas', 'R', 'A former bounty hunter who finds himself on the run as part of a revamped Condemned tournament, in which convicts are forced to fight each other to the death as part of a game that''s broadcast to the public.', 'A former bounty hunter who finds himself on the run as part of a revamped Condemned tournament, in which convicts are forced to fight each other to the death as part of a game that''s broadcast to the public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXySxn7QUaBhPlJ2pzT1HViQzZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353610'),
  ('652592498885213071', 'The Condemned of Altona', 1962, 'Drama', 'Luisa Alessandri, Beppe Menegatti, Vittorio De Sica', 'Cesare Zavattini, Abby Mann', 'Sophia Loren, Maximilian Schell, Fredric March, Robert Wagner, Françoise Prévost, Gabriele Tinti, Rolf Tasna, Michela Ricciardi', null, 'A dying German magnate invites his youngest son and daughter-in-law home to discuss the future of the family''s shipbuilding empire. There, the daughter-in-law stumbles upon a secret of the family''s Nazi past.', 'A dying German magnate invites his youngest son and daughter-in-law home to discuss the future of the family''s shipbuilding empire. There, the daughter-in-law stumbles upon a secret of the family''s Nazi past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mgwdGp9WbDM77jueLl3BDOXbqs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166888'),
  ('862709392736758894', 'The Condor Conspiracy', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'André Sturm', 'André Sturm, Victor Bonini', 'Mel Lisboa, Dan Stulbach, Pedro Bial, Ana Rita Bueno, Maria Manoella', null, 'After the death of former Brazilian president Juscelino Kubitschek in a car accident in August 1976, a journalist decides to investigate the case. The death of another former president, João Goulart, in December of the same year, heightens her suspicions of a conspiracy.', 'After the death of former Brazilian president Juscelino Kubitschek in a car accident in August 1976, a journalist decides to investigate the case. The death of another former president, João Goulart, in December of the same year, heightens her suspicions of a conspiracy.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fqeo4rOcJOt30rCIrGRSxghOoKqp.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-conspiracao-condor-2026'),
  ('497066627194253735', 'The Conductor', 1980, 'Drama, Music', 'Andrzej Wajda, Andrzej Kazanecki, Jolanta Jedynak', 'Andrzej Kijowski', 'John Gielgud, Krystyna Janda, Andrzej Seweryn, Jan Ciecierski, Tadeusz Czechowski, Marek Dąbrowski, Józef Fryźlewicz, Janusz Gajos', null, 'A violinist in a provincial Polish orchestra, whose husband is the director of the ensemble, on a visit to the US ties up with the world- renowned symphony conductor. As it turns out he was once in love with violinist''s mother. The conductor, a slightly unstable hypochondriac, returns to Poland to lead the provincial orchestra. He also tries to revive old love affair using the violinist as a surrogate of her mother. Her husband is resentful of the conductor for both personal and professional reasons.', 'A violinist in a provincial Polish orchestra, whose husband is the director of the ensemble, on a visit to the US ties up with the world- renowned symphony conductor. As it turns out he was once in love with violinist''s mother. The conductor, a slightly unstable hypochondriac, returns to Poland to lead the provincial orchestra. He also tries to revive old love affair using the violinist as a surrogate of her mother. Her husband is resentful of the conductor for both personal and professional reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjWuMZg54MBnbZTjKHFVvdfVemb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95269'),
  ('660723735795810470', 'The Conductor', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Maria Peters, Rolf Dekens', 'Maria Peters', 'Christanne de Bruijn, Benjamin Wainwright, Scott Turner Schofield, Seumas F. Sargent, Annet Malherbe, Raymond Thiry, Gijs Scholten van Aschat, Richard Sammel', null, 'United States, 1926: Dutch 24-year-old Willy Wolters has immigrated to the American continent with her parents as a child. She dreams of becoming a conductor, but this is an ambition that no one takes seriously. Unbeknownst to her, she''ll also become Antonia Brico.', 'United States, 1926: Dutch 24-year-old Willy Wolters has immigrated to the American continent with her parents as a child. She dreams of becoming a conductor, but this is an ambition that no one takes seriously. Unbeknownst to her, she''ll also become Antonia Brico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMND7RVCyke2m2TCZeTviKbBIki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541611'),
  ('1019988632785164616', 'The Coneheads', 1983, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr., Tsuguyuki Kubo', 'Al Franken, Tom Davis', 'Dan Aykroyd, Jane Curtin, Laraine Newman, Bob McFadden, Cynthia Adler, Tom Davis', 'NR', 'In this animated pilot based on the SNL sketch, The Coneheads come to conquer Earth but they soon find themselves becoming domesticated.', 'In this animated pilot based on the SNL sketch, The Coneheads come to conquer Earth but they soon find themselves becoming domesticated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djSxIZ9xIdqbea8G0bxVmRslt9O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404100'),
  ('393672886833686328', 'The Conference', 2022, 'History, War, Drama', 'Matti Geschonneck, Theo Bierkens, Simone Bär', 'Paul Mommertz, Magnus Vattrodt', 'Philipp Hochmair, Johannes Allmayer, Maximilian Brückner, Matthias Bundschuh, Fabian Busch, Jakob Diehl, Lilli Fichtner, Godehard Giese', null, 'On January 20, 1942, the Wannsee Conference takes place in Berlin, a meeting that had only one item on the agenda: The Final Solution, the organization of the systematic mass murder of eleven million European Jews.', 'On January 20, 1942, the Wannsee Conference takes place in Berlin, a meeting that had only one item on the agenda: The Final Solution, the organization of the systematic mass murder of eleven million European Jews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uOdIP7GowDMroxy1zSmBBaRCJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:910365'),
  ('303982701923317364', 'The Confession', 1970, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Costa-Gavras, Raoul Coutard, Alain Corneau', 'Jorge Semprún', 'Yves Montand, Simone Signoret, Gabriele Ferzetti, Michel Vitold, Jean Bouise, Michel Beaune, Jacques Rispal, Antoine Vitez', null, 'In 1950s communist Czechoslovakia, a government minister, a war veteran long a loyal party man, leads a relatively comfortable life with his wife. However, he soon finds himself under surveillance, then under arrest. Unclear what his offense is, agents for the totalitarian regime interrogate and torture him, aiming to use their unending power to gain a false confession for these supposed crimes against the state.', 'In 1950s communist Czechoslovakia, a government minister, a war veteran long a loyal party man, leads a relatively comfortable life with his wife. However, he soon finds himself under surveillance, then under arrest. Unclear what his offense is, agents for the totalitarian regime interrogate and torture him, aiming to use their unending power to gain a false confession for these supposed crimes against the state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m44QZwZKLq8HqAxhb6VibYj32bC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60859'),
  ('1071466151687813689', 'The Confession', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David Hugh Jones, Mike Fash', 'David Black', 'Ben Kingsley, Amy Irving, Ryan Marsini, Alec Baldwin, Boyd Gaines, Anne Twomey, Lázaro Pérez, Becky Ann Baker', 'R', 'After his young son dies from the negligence at a hospital, Harry Fertig takes matters into his own hands and kills the doctor, nurse and clerk responsible. Slick lawyer Roy Bleakie, looking only to win a case and not caring of the matters involved, is asked by Fertig''s boss to defend him. Shocked to hear that his client wants to plead guilty, the case causes Bleakie to question his own morals by defending an honorable man.', 'After his young son dies from the negligence at a hospital, Harry Fertig takes matters into his own hands and kills the doctor, nurse and clerk responsible. Slick lawyer Roy Bleakie, looking only to win a case and not caring of the matters involved, is asked by Fertig''s boss to defend him. Shocked to hear that his client wants to plead guilty, the case causes Bleakie to question his own morals by defending an honorable man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRGb8CyMYRmjHhQhqSdFdJvk1nW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30998'),
  ('350402547870927142', 'The Confession', 2001, 'Drama', 'Zeki Demirkubuz, Zeki Demirkubuz, Filiz Peksen', 'Zeki Demirkubuz', 'Taner Birsel, Başak Köklükaya, İskender Altın, Miraç Eronat, Gülgün Kutlu, Sinan Adiyaman, Apo Demirkubuz, Bal Ertürk', null, 'A man suspects his wife of being unfaithful, but he''s not prepared for what her confession will do to him.', 'A man suspects his wife of being unfaithful, but he''s not prepared for what her confession will do to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2D7za33UtEJzYpHhmmY4kgGd8WV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79084'),
  ('405778575020250904', 'The Confession', 2011, 'Crime, Drama', 'Brad Mirman, Joe Arcidiacono', 'Brad Mirman', 'John Hurt, Kiefer Sutherland, Max Casella, Michael Badalucco, Daniel London', 'PG', 'A unique story of redemption and an exploration of good and evil featuring a hit man and a priest.', 'A unique story of redemption and an exploration of good and evil featuring a hit man and a priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVt2hqL756YeA6TShMqlOdXJNmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97481'),
  ('727079939560065986', 'The Confession', 2017, 'Drama', 'Manuel Dacosse, Nicolas Boukhrief', 'Nicolas Boukhrief', 'Romain Duris, Marine Vacth, Anne Le Ny, Solène Rigot, Amandine Dewasmes, Lucie Debay, Marie-Jeanne Maldague, Charlie Lefebvre', null, 'Under the German occupation, in a small French town, the arrival of a new priest arouses the interest of all women... Barny, a young communist and atheist woman, can not however be more indifferent. Driven by curiosity, the young skeptic went to the church in order to challenge this.', 'Under the German occupation, in a small French town, the arrival of a new priest arouses the interest of all women... Barny, a young communist and atheist woman, can not however be more indifferent. Driven by curiosity, the young skeptic went to the church in order to challenge this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlycTqUoGGi3PJErvQTfogLb8ZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426825'),
  ('1044863093110835003', 'The Confession', 2026, 'Horror', 'Will Canon, John W. Rutland, Neely Eisenstein', 'Will Canon', 'Italia Ricci, Scott Mechlowicz, Zachary Golinger, Terence Rosemore, Justin Matthew Smith, Allie McCulloch, Ron Fallica, Jay DeVon Johnson', 'NR', 'A woman finds her late father’s tape confessing to murder tied to an evil force—now her son shows the same darkness, and she must fight to stop it.', 'A woman finds her late father’s tape confessing to murder tied to an evil force—now her son shows the same darkness, and she must fight to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tmMQwSVVbijKV4lquYpBld3P9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1454741'),
  ('701331140151594359', 'The Confessional', 1995, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Robert Lepage, Alain Dostie', 'Robert Lepage', 'Lothaire Bluteau, Patrick Goyette, Jean-Louis Millette, Kristin Scott Thomas, Ron Burrage, Richard Fréchette, François Papineau, Marie Gignac', null, 'Pierre Lamontagne has returned to Quebec to attend his father''s funeral. He meets up with his adopted brother, Marc, who has begun questioning his identity and has embarked on a quest for his roots that would lead them to the Quebec of the 1950s. Past and present converge in a complex web of intrigue where the answer to the mystery lies.', 'Pierre Lamontagne has returned to Quebec to attend his father''s funeral. He meets up with his adopted brother, Marc, who has begun questioning his identity and has embarked on a quest for his roots that would lead them to the Quebec of the 1950s. Past and present converge in a complex web of intrigue where the answer to the mystery lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ApR0PwQdlnvc76NmlbUWkeAK9i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99040'),
  ('224906556992807544', 'The Confessions', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Maurizio Calvesi, Roberto Andò', 'Roberto Andò, Angelo Pasquini', 'Toni Servillo, Pierfrancesco Favino, Daniel Auteuil, Connie Nielsen, Moritz Bleibtreu, Richard Sammel, Marie-Josée Croze, Lambert Wilson', 'R', 'A G8 meeting is being held at a luxury hotel on the German coast. The world''s most powerful economists are gathered to enact important provisions that will deeply influence the world economy. One of the guests is a mysterious Italian monk, invited by Daniel Rochè, the director of the International Monetary Fund. He wants the monk to receive his confession, that night, in secret. The next morning, Rochè is found dead...', 'A G8 meeting is being held at a luxury hotel on the German coast. The world''s most powerful economists are gathered to enact important provisions that will deeply influence the world economy. One of the guests is a mysterious Italian monk, invited by Daniel Rochè, the director of the International Monetary Fund. He wants the monk to receive his confession, that night, in secret. The next morning, Rochè is found dead...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcxQxrFk2gijj0vpeloUb8tIzNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393857'),
  ('667616307615573162', 'The Confidence Man JP - Episode of the Hero -', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Yoko Itakura, Akira Tanaka', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Masami Nagasawa, Fumiyo Kohinata, Masahiro Higashide, Shinya Kote, Yutaka Matsushige, Koji Seto, Yu Shirota, Erika Ikuta', null, 'Dako, Boku-chan and Richard commit their next con on Malta Island.', 'Dako, Boku-chan and Richard commit their next con on Malta Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izcRLyMmKciwJEye80br5UZ65jJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:930432'),
  ('593183067523227813', 'The Confidence Man JP - The Movie -', 2019, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Toshiyuki Mihashi, Yoko Itakura, Akira Tanaka', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Masami Nagasawa, Masahiro Higashide, Fumiyo Kohinata, Shinya Kote, Yuko Takeuchi, Haruma Miura, Yosuke Eguchi, Lisa Oda', null, 'In Hong Kong, Dako, Boku-chan and Richard take a huge amount of money from people who are greedy.', 'In Hong Kong, Dako, Boku-chan and Richard take a huge amount of money from people who are greedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nKsVaIODBXYA26mhynZ9KvEL3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554801'),
  ('1082983018858216941', 'The Confidence Man JP – Episode of the Princess –', 2020, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Yoko Itakura, Akira Tanaka, Masayuki Yamamoto', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Masami Nagasawa, Masahiro Higashide, Fumiyo Kohinata, Shinya Kote, Lisa Oda, Nagisa Sekimizu, Eiji Takigawa, Atsuko Maeda', null, 'Set in Langkawi, Malaysia, professional scammers Dako (Masami Nagasawa), Boku-chan (Masahiro Higashide), and Richard (Fumiyo Kohinata) target the Fuu Family for their next heist. Raymond Fuu, who was the head of the Fuu Family, passed away and he left behind 10 trillion yen. Dako, Boku-chan and Richard scheme to gain the inordinate inheritance. --asianwiki', 'Set in Langkawi, Malaysia, professional scammers Dako (Masami Nagasawa), Boku-chan (Masahiro Higashide), and Richard (Fumiyo Kohinata) target the Fuu Family for their next heist. Raymond Fuu, who was the head of the Fuu Family, passed away and he left behind 10 trillion yen. Dako, Boku-chan and Richard scheme to gain the inordinate inheritance. --asianwiki', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEC96EpLgYBsyn1B1p2AJquQLxx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:657350'),
  ('19968268271333937', 'The Confidence Man JP: Fortune', 2019, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Akira Tanaka', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Masami Nagasawa, Masahiro Higashide, Fumiyo Kohinata, Kazuki Kitamura, Hirosue Ryoko, Miho Nakayama, Lisa Oda, Shinya Kote', null, 'How much of a role does luck play in a person''s life? Some people believe you create your own luck. Kingpin Akutsu Akira relies only on himself to get what he wants. Dako gets a taste of her own medicine when Akutsu cheats her of her money to avenge his friend, who was a victim of Dako''s scam. Will Dako give in to her fate? How will she climb out of the rut this time?', 'How much of a role does luck play in a person''s life? Some people believe you create your own luck. Kingpin Akutsu Akira relies only on himself to get what he wants. Dako gets a taste of her own medicine when Akutsu cheats her of her money to avenge his friend, who was a victim of Dako''s scam. Will Dako give in to her fate? How will she climb out of the rut this time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbNF8dMIceAElejs74BrlPcVDcT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607465'),
  ('453026440320731195', 'The Confirmation', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bob Nelson, Terry Stacey', 'Bob Nelson', 'Clive Owen, Jaeden Martell, Maria Bello, Tim Blake Nelson, Patton Oswalt, Matthew Modine, Stephen Tobolowsky, Robert Forster', 'PG-13', 'A divorced father reconnects with his son when they track down a stolen toolbox over the course of a weekend.', 'A divorced father reconnects with his son when they track down a stolen toolbox over the course of a weekend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FTN4G64s2hfZ9uvpXCeipt4khZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347881'),
  ('1090364840211381130', 'The Confused Groom', 1975, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Zeki Ökten', null, 'Kemal Sunal, Meral Zeren, Bülent Kayabaş, Ayfer Feray, Ali Şen, Adile Naşit, Kahraman Kıral, Elif Pektaş', null, 'While Serpil pretends to be a religious village girl to his rich uncle she gets cought at an erotic party. Her uncle sees what she actually is than he forces her to marry simpleton Apti or she and her family cannot inherit his fortune.', 'While Serpil pretends to be a religious village girl to his rich uncle she gets cought at an erotic party. Her uncle sees what she actually is than he forces her to marry simpleton Apti or she and her family cannot inherit his fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvU08DuD4Gowz1TPRTyRwvrb38F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111795'),
  ('529227098383840955', 'The Congo Tribunal', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Milo Rau', 'Milo Rau', null, null, 'The war in Congo has caused more than six million deaths over the last twenty years. The population is suffering, but the offenders stay with impunity. Many people see this conflict as one of globalisation''s crucial econimic distribution battles because the country has major deposits of many high-tech raw materials. Milo Rau, one of Europe''s most acclaimed theatre directors, succeeds in gathering victims, perpetrators, observes and analysts of the conflict for a unique civil tribunal in eastern Congo. The documentary film brings these spectacular court trials to life on the big screen and creates an unvarnished portrait of the largest and bloodiest economic wars in human history.', 'The war in Congo has caused more than six million deaths over the last twenty years. The population is suffering, but the offenders stay with impunity. Many people see this conflict as one of globalisation''s crucial econimic distribution battles because the country has major deposits of many high-tech raw materials. Milo Rau, one of Europe''s most acclaimed theatre directors, succeeds in gathering victims, perpetrators, observes and analysts of the conflict for a unique civil tribunal in eastern Congo. The documentary film brings these spectacular court trials to life on the big screen and creates an unvarnished portrait of the largest and bloodiest economic wars in human history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vy3FHNnMc1nyfjhWsPZ0FY9OvbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467666'),
  ('687474210795222135', 'The Congress', 2013, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Ari Folman, Yoni Goodman, Michał Englert', 'Ari Folman', 'Robin Wright, Harvey Keitel, Jon Hamm, Kodi Smit-McPhee, Danny Huston, Sami Gayle, Michael Stahl-David, Paul Giamatti', 'NR', 'An aging, out-of-work actress accepts one last job, though the consequences of her decision affect her in ways she didn''t consider.', 'An aging, out-of-work actress accepts one last job, though the consequences of her decision affect her in ways she didn''t consider.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeT9rwfCBayxgVoUn1yZGmkZlUq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152795'),
  ('39041789463400892', 'The Conjugal Bed', 1963, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marco Ferreri, Ennio Guarnieri, Giancarlo Santi', 'Rafael Azcona, Marco Ferreri, Diego Fabbri', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Marina Vlady, Walter Giller, Linda Sini, Riccardo Fellini, Gian Luigi Polidoro, Nino Vingelli, Achille Majeroni', null, 'A forty-year-old employee marries a seemingly quiet girl who turns into a mantis after the wedding.', 'A forty-year-old employee marries a seemingly quiet girl who turns into a mantis after the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Tpl6sQJPR83uXANWnynfdWZP21.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67378'),
  ('280460814614425794', 'The Conjuring', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jeff Bilger, Albert Cho, Brian Avery Galligan', 'Carey Hayes, Chad Hayes', 'Vera Farmiga, Patrick Wilson, Lili Taylor, Ron Livingston, Hayley McFarland, Sterling Jerins, Shanley Caswell, Mackenzie Foy', 'R', 'Paranormal investigators Ed and Lorraine Warren work to help a family terrorized by a dark presence in their farmhouse. Forced to confront a powerful entity, the Warrens find themselves caught in the most terrifying case of their lives.', 'Paranormal investigators Ed and Lorraine Warren work to help a family terrorized by a dark presence in their farmhouse. Forced to confront a powerful entity, the Warrens find themselves caught in the most terrifying case of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVYREutTvI2tmxr6ujrHT704wGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138843'),
  ('678242785631333902', 'The Conjuring 2', 2016, 'Horror', 'Albert Cho, Conte Mark Matal, James Wan', 'Chad Hayes, Carey Hayes, James Wan', 'Vera Farmiga, Patrick Wilson, Madison Wolfe, Frances O''Connor, Lauren Esposito, Benjamin Haigh, Patrick McAuley, Sterling Jerins', 'R', 'Lorraine and Ed Warren travel to north London to help a single mother raising four children alone in a house plagued by malicious spirits.', 'Lorraine and Ed Warren travel to north London to help a single mother raising four children alone in a house plagued by malicious spirits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEqyD0SBt6HL7W9JQoWwtd5Do1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259693'),
  ('1143587551496029747', 'The Conjuring: Last Rites', 2025, 'Horror', 'Michael Chaves, Rose Wicksteed, Sophie Kingston-Smith', 'Ian B. Goldberg, Richard Naing, David Leslie Johnson-McGoldrick', 'Patrick Wilson, Vera Farmiga, Mia Tomlinson, Ben Hardy, Rebecca Calder, Tilly Walker, Elliot Cowan, Shannon Kook', 'R', 'Paranormal investigators Ed and Lorraine Warren take on one last terrifying case involving mysterious entities they must confront.', 'Paranormal investigators Ed and Lorraine Warren take on one last terrifying case involving mysterious entities they must confront.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byWgphT74ClOVa8EOGzYDkl8DVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1038392'),
  ('432293749745630017', 'The Conjuring: The Devil Made Me Do It', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Michael Chaves, Michael Burgess, Peter Borck', 'David Leslie Johnson-McGoldrick', 'Vera Farmiga, Patrick Wilson, Sterling Jerins, Sarah Catherine Hook, Ruairí O''Connor, Julian Hilliard, Charlene Amoia, John Noble', 'R', 'Paranormal investigators Ed and Lorraine Warren encounter what would become one of the most sensational cases from their files. The fight for the soul of a young boy takes them beyond anything they''d ever seen before, to mark the first time in U.S. history that a murder suspect would claim demonic possession as a defense.', 'Paranormal investigators Ed and Lorraine Warren encounter what would become one of the most sensational cases from their files. The fight for the soul of a young boy takes them beyond anything they''d ever seen before, to mark the first time in U.S. history that a murder suspect would claim demonic possession as a defense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQfX2xx8TUoNvyk892yKWNikJaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423108'),
  ('402710694113598461', 'The Conman', 1998, 'Action, Comedy', 'Wong Jing, Ko Chiu-Lam, Aman Chang Man', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Athena Chu Yan, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Jack Kao, Emotion Cheung Kam-Ching, Angie Cheung Wai-Yee, Bonnie Law Ming-Chu', null, 'A man kills an assassin by accident and when he gets out of prison, the victim''s brother attempts to avenge his death.', 'A man kills an assassin by accident and when he gets out of prison, the victim''s brother attempts to avenge his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1b4Mw1bG6aN12qOZjwLqgRTY7Ax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75465'),
  ('468778299161314483', 'The Conmen in Vegas', 1999, 'Action, Comedy', 'Wong Jing, Bosco Lam Tsz-Ho, Sharon Lam Suk-Ching', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei, Yu Fang, Alex Man Chi-Leung, Li Fei, Nam Yin', null, 'Three conmen are assigned to help the Chinese government capture a legendary swindler in Las Vegas and they will not be arrested in return for their aid.', 'Three conmen are assigned to help the Chinese government capture a legendary swindler in Las Vegas and they will not be arrested in return for their aid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTqhpkiNiU8PLQb7OMqa3jyp5tL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208210'),
  ('496442141898989389', 'The Connection', 1962, 'Drama', 'Shirley Clarke, Arthur J. Ornitz', 'Jack Gelber', 'Warren Finnerty, Jerome Raphael, Garry Goodrow, Carl Lee, Barbara Winchester, Henry Proach, Roscoe Lee Browne, William Redfield', null, 'Eight drug addicts are waiting for their connection in a New York apartment while a two-man documentary team films the proceedings. Things go out of control as the men grow increasingly nervous and the cameraman keeps recording.', 'Eight drug addicts are waiting for their connection in a New York apartment while a two-man documentary team films the proceedings. Things go out of control as the men grow increasingly nervous and the cameraman keeps recording.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWhDxfoEUoBQitVnC2LIrqpyYeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58227'),
  ('185346505213607694', 'The Connection', 2014, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Laurent Tangy, Fabien Vergez, Cédric Jimenez', 'Audrey Diwan, Cédric Jimenez', 'Jean Dujardin, Gilles Lellouche, Céline Sallette, Mélanie Doutey, Benoît Magimel, Guillaume Gouix, Bruno Todeschini, Féodor Atkine', 'R', 'Newly transferred to the bustling port city of Marseille to assist with a crackdown on organized crime, energetic young magistrate Pierre Michel is given a rapid-fire tutorial on the ins and outs of an out-of-control drug trade. Pierre''s wildly ambitious mission is to take on the French Connection, a highly organized operation that controls the city''s underground heroin economy and is overseen by the notorious —and reputedly untouchable— Gaetan Zampa. Fearless, determined and willing to go the distance, Pierre plunges into an underworld world of insane danger and ruthless criminals.', 'Newly transferred to the bustling port city of Marseille to assist with a crackdown on organized crime, energetic young magistrate Pierre Michel is given a rapid-fire tutorial on the ins and outs of an out-of-control drug trade. Pierre''s wildly ambitious mission is to take on the French Connection, a highly organized operation that controls the city''s underground heroin economy and is overseen by the notorious —and reputedly untouchable— Gaetan Zampa. Fearless, determined and willing to go the distance, Pierre plunges into an underworld world of insane danger and ruthless criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIkmaZATFP4RkQSiWgyL6KGOTq6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197950'),
  ('698891973097206381', 'The Conquering Power', 1921, 'Romance, Drama', 'Rex Ingram, John F. Seitz', 'June Mathis', 'Rudolph Valentino, Alice Terry, Ralph Lewis, Carrie Daumery, Bridgetta Clark, Mark Fenton, Ward Wing, Eric Mayne', 'NR', 'Young playboy Charles Grandet is sent to live with his miserly uncle after his father loses his fortune. He and his cousin Eugenie fall in love, but his uncle sends him away and tries to arrange a marriage more to his liking (and profit!). Will true love triumph?', 'Young playboy Charles Grandet is sent to live with his miserly uncle after his father loses his fortune. He and his cousin Eugenie fall in love, but his uncle sends him away and tries to arrange a marriage more to his liking (and profit!). Will true love triumph?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTY04P11V2kWfrBqnz3EvFxHk41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175346'),
  ('748618591340017740', 'The Conqueror', 1956, 'Adventure, Romance, History, War, Drama', 'Dick Powell, Cliff Lyons, Edward Killy', 'Oscar Millard', 'John Wayne, Susan Hayward, Pedro Armendáriz, Agnes Moorehead, Thomas Gomez, John Hoyt, William Conrad, Ted de Corsia', null, 'Mongol chief Temujin battles against Tartar armies and for the love of the Tartar princess Bortai. Temujin becomes the emperor Genghis Khan.', 'Mongol chief Temujin battles against Tartar armies and for the love of the Tartar princess Bortai. Temujin becomes the emperor Genghis Khan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gGtujS4opJIUbAgS9j3g4EtiVo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24751'),
  ('543849512888143931', 'The Conquest', 1996, 'History', 'Gábor Koltay, Sándor Csukás', 'István Nemeskürty', 'Franco Nero, Imre Sinkovits, György Dörner, Tibor Bitskey, László Csendes, László Csurka, Géza Kaszás, Zsolt Körtvélyessy', null, 'Filmed in commemoration of Hungary''s 1100th anniversary and on the sites of the actual events, a cast of thousands authentically recreates the 896 AD arrival of the Magyar chief Arpad (Nero) and his seven tribes into the Carpathian basin from the steppes.', 'Filmed in commemoration of Hungary''s 1100th anniversary and on the sites of the actual events, a cast of thousands authentically recreates the 896 AD arrival of the Magyar chief Arpad (Nero) and his seven tribes into the Carpathian basin from the steppes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trBsXoZNssWpxSxeXNYdrBGfn8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80205'),
  ('772622895919024353', 'The Conquest', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Xavier Durringer', 'Patrick Rotman', 'Denis Podalydès, Florence Pernel, Bernard Le Coq, Michèle Moretti, Samuel Labarthe, Emmanuel Noblet, Hippolyte Girardot, Mathias Mlekuz', null, 'A look at French president Nicolas Sarkozy''s rise to power.', 'A look at French president Nicolas Sarkozy''s rise to power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUFMMPjImAtKyVqP2uSqwKAraJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65233'),
  ('739084495967039600', 'The Conquest of Everest', 1953, 'Documentary, Drama, History', 'George Lowe', 'Louis MacNeice', 'Meredith Edwards, Edmund Hillary, Tenzing Norgay', null, 'A documentary of the first successful expedition to the summit of Mount Everest. New Zealand''s Edmund Hillary and Sherpa Tenzing Norgay climb Mount Everest in 1953.', 'A documentary of the first successful expedition to the summit of Mount Everest. New Zealand''s Edmund Hillary and Sherpa Tenzing Norgay climb Mount Everest in 1953.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDVEzpEZngamnUGXcSQyQjDjz20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75901'),
  ('719336070665917787', 'The Conquest of Mycenae', 1963, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Giancarlo Romitelli, Giorgio Ferroni', 'Remigio Del Grosso, Arrigo Equini, Giorgio Ferroni', 'Gordon Scott, Alessandra Panaro, Rosalba Neri, Arturo Dominici, Michel Lemoine, Jany Clair, Nerio Bernardi, Nello Pazzafini', null, 'Gordon Scott plays Glaucus, the prince of Tiryns, a powerful warrior who goes undercover in Mycenae to infiltrate the evil cult of Moloch, which is exacting tribute from neighboring kingdoms in the form of attractive young hostages, both male and female. Calling himself "Hercules," Glaucus defeats Mycenae''s champions and gains the favor of the voluptuous Queen Demetra (Rosalba Neri) whose son, covered in a dog''s head mask, has been raised as the living embodiment of the dark god Moloch and receives sacrifices in his sprawling underground grotto.', 'Gordon Scott plays Glaucus, the prince of Tiryns, a powerful warrior who goes undercover in Mycenae to infiltrate the evil cult of Moloch, which is exacting tribute from neighboring kingdoms in the form of attractive young hostages, both male and female. Calling himself "Hercules," Glaucus defeats Mycenae''s champions and gains the favor of the voluptuous Queen Demetra (Rosalba Neri) whose son, covered in a dog''s head mask, has been raised as the living embodiment of the dark god Moloch and receives sacrifices in his sprawling underground grotto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opCw2B2wjJysgHIpj3cUQG2ZxJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187633'),
  ('736916059913615921', 'The Conquest of Siberia', 2019, 'History, Action, Drama', 'Igor Zaytsev, Yury Korobeynikov', 'Alexey Permyakov, Igor Zaytsev', 'Ilya Malanin, Dmitriy Dyuzhev, Agata Mutsenietse, Dmitri Nazarov, Pavel Tabakov, Andrey Burkovskiy, Ekaterina Guseva, Ivan Kolesnikov', 'R', 'Ivan Demarin, a young officer of Peter the First’s new guards, follows the Tsar’s order and goes to the frontier town of Tobolsk, deep in the Siberian forest. There Ivan falls in love for the first time and he and his regiment happen to be involved in conspiracy of local princes who hunt for gold in the town of Yarkand. His fort is surrounded by hordes of wild Dzungars and there is no one to call for help…', 'Ivan Demarin, a young officer of Peter the First’s new guards, follows the Tsar’s order and goes to the frontier town of Tobolsk, deep in the Siberian forest. There Ivan falls in love for the first time and he and his regiment happen to be involved in conspiracy of local princes who hunt for gold in the town of Yarkand. His fort is surrounded by hordes of wild Dzungars and there is no one to call for help…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7D1uPIaPu25xx9KxmdmKsh0eXY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520552'),
  ('136092362208663981', 'The Conquest of the Pole', 1912, 'Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Georges Méliès, Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès, Fernande Albany', null, 'A science fantasy film that deals with an extraordinary race to the north pole by rival parties of balloonists. Based on the novel "The Adventures of Captain Hatteras" by Jules Verne.', 'A science fantasy film that deals with an extraordinary race to the north pole by rival parties of balloonists. Based on the novel "The Adventures of Captain Hatteras" by Jules Verne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3EeYMSE4VSUkCNQdx0FodnFEFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114146'),
  ('601694189068274229', 'The Conquest Of The Ruins', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Eduardo Gómez, Eduardo Gómez', 'Eduardo Gómez', 'Juan Cuevas Bañez, Mayko Crispin Mendez, Sebastián Apesteguía, Reinaldo Roa, Santiago Chara', null, 'Quarry workers and construction sites. Private neighborhoods. Paleontological digs. The earth unites and separates all of them, and everyone has an interpretation of how this world should be inhabited. The documentary follows their interests to build a story about the expansion of the city and its consequences.', 'Quarry workers and construction sites. Private neighborhoods. Paleontological digs. The earth unites and separates all of them, and everyone has an interpretation of how this world should be inhabited. The documentary follows their interests to build a story about the expansion of the city and its consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwta0o8M8sRHUwjTE9m0QwTioTe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:731629'),
  ('770322577282521468', 'The Conrad Boys', 2006, 'Drama', 'Justin Lo, Oktay Ortabasi', 'Justin Lo', 'Justin Lo, Booboo Stewart, Nick Bartzen, Barry Shay, Bart Shattuck, Bruce Blauer, Katelyn Ann Clark, Dorian Frankel', null, 'After his mother dies, 19-year-old Charlie Conrad skips college to raise his 9-year-old brother, Ben, in this moving drama. But the heavy responsibility soon causes Charlie to yearn for a normal life. Things start to look up when he embarks on a passionate romance with a free-spirited drifter named Jordan -- until the return of Charlie''s estranged father changes everything.', 'After his mother dies, 19-year-old Charlie Conrad skips college to raise his 9-year-old brother, Ben, in this moving drama. But the heavy responsibility soon causes Charlie to yearn for a normal life. Things start to look up when he embarks on a passionate romance with a free-spirited drifter named Jordan -- until the return of Charlie''s estranged father changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTFxyioRVLduD6QICYgbJjpEs6U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39041'),
  ('755987395990136709', 'The Consequence', 1977, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Wolfgang Petersen, Jörg-Michael Baldenius', 'Alexander Ziegler, Wolfgang Petersen', 'Jürgen Prochnow, Ernst Hannawald, Werner Schwuchow, Hans-Michael Rehberg, Hans Putz, jr., Elisabeth Fricker, Walo Lüönd, Edith Volkmann', null, 'Thomas, the son of a prison warden, falls for Martin, one of the prison inmates. After Martin is released, they try to build a relationship and a life together but, no one will leave them alone.', 'Thomas, the son of a prison warden, falls for Martin, one of the prison inmates. After Martin is released, they try to build a relationship and a life together but, no one will leave them alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3C0yGsPJ4oM7z6l73aqi98amP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6511'),
  ('608069307663828841', 'The Consequences', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Claudia Pinto Emperador, Gabo Guerra', 'Claudia Pinto Emperador, Eduardo Sánchez Rugeles', 'Juana Acosta, Alfredo Castro, María Romanillos, Carme Elias, Sonia Almarcha, Christian Checa, Héctor Alterio, Enrique Gimeno', null, 'Since Fabiola saw her husband die in a diving accident, nothing has been the same again. Tired of not getting better, she decides to self-prescribe an unconventional therapy: together with her dad and her teenage daughter, she travels to a house her family owns in a small volcanic island. During this time of coexistence, each of them tries to protect their own privacy, and to safeguard their secrets. But all this secrecy triggers Fabiola’s paranoia. She has neither evidence nor certainty, but something tells her that things are not what they seem.', 'Since Fabiola saw her husband die in a diving accident, nothing has been the same again. Tired of not getting better, she decides to self-prescribe an unconventional therapy: together with her dad and her teenage daughter, she travels to a house her family owns in a small volcanic island. During this time of coexistence, each of them tries to protect their own privacy, and to safeguard their secrets. But all this secrecy triggers Fabiola’s paranoia. She has neither evidence nor certainty, but something tells her that things are not what they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3ES94NIqbpMXaHZIYEb6CUMjom.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833043'),
  ('425289784343619039', 'The Consequences of Feminism', 1906, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, 'It''s a society in which gender roles are switched. Will men stand to be unequal?', 'It''s a society in which gender roles are switched. Will men stand to be unequal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZzPyv5g4ohGcPbbmkF2ZYMe02N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120026'),
  ('962412984809716712', 'The Consequences of Love', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bruno Memoli, Paolo Sorrentino, Luca Bigazzi', 'Paolo Sorrentino', 'Toni Servillo, Olivia Magnani, Adriano Giannini, Antonio Ballerio, Gianna Paola Scaffidi, Nino D''Agata, Vincenzo Vitagliano, Diego Ribon', null, 'Lugano, Switzerland. Titta Di Girolamo is a discreet and sullen man who has been living for almost a decade in a modest hotel room, a prisoner of an atrocious routine, apparently without purpose. His past is a mystery, nobody knows what he does for a living, he answers indiscreet questions evasively. What secrets does this enigmatic man hide?', 'Lugano, Switzerland. Titta Di Girolamo is a discreet and sullen man who has been living for almost a decade in a modest hotel room, a prisoner of an atrocious routine, apparently without purpose. His past is a mystery, nobody knows what he does for a living, he answers indiscreet questions evasively. What secrets does this enigmatic man hide?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ubdrvMHcRTFzkUdmSIuvupLqRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24653'),
  ('66697564131182351', 'The Consolation', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Magaly Richard-Serrano, Pénélope Pourriat', 'Flavie Flament, Magaly Richard-Serrano', 'Lou Gable, Émilie Dequenne, Philip Schurer, Léa Drucker, Xavier Mathieu, Patrick Préjean, Hugo Chalan Marchio, Hervé Pierre', null, 'Victim of vertigo and unexplained discomfort, Flavie, a television host, resolves to consult a psychiatrist. The latter suggests a test of the past that she would have concealed and proposes to browse together a photo-album of her childhood. The cliché of a teenager with a sad look will wake up buried memories ...', 'Victim of vertigo and unexplained discomfort, Flavie, a television host, resolves to consult a psychiatrist. The latter suggests a test of the past that she would have concealed and proposes to browse together a photo-album of her childhood. The cliché of a teenager with a sad look will wake up buried memories ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QZ38CMcuxNo1ReGbuZaCLNTj7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481819'),
  ('30500614893594996', 'The Conspiracists', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Michael Perrie Jr.', 'Lacy Reily, Michael Perrie Jr.', 'Terrie Lynne, Christopher Murray, Carly Otte, Valarie Perez-Schere, Brian Ray', null, 'When two siblings’ dreams of building an all-inclusive conspiracy convention begin to shatter, its up to one of them to put the pieces back together while the other strives to uncover a bigger conspiracy at play.', 'When two siblings’ dreams of building an all-inclusive conspiracy convention begin to shatter, its up to one of them to put the pieces back together while the other strives to uncover a bigger conspiracy at play.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F6%2Fgracenote%2F6e68fd47f8b8c463baaf823f1ff4f92b.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-conspiracists-2026'),
  ('394169488599210619', 'The Conspiracy', 2012, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Christopher MacBride', 'Christopher MacBride', 'Aaron Poole, James Gilbert, Ian Anderson, Peter Apostolopoulos, A.C. Peterson, Roger Beck, Bruce Clayton, Angela Besharah', 'NR', 'A documentary about conspiracy theories takes a horrific turn after the filmmakers uncover an ancient and dangerous secret society.', 'A documentary about conspiracy theories takes a horrific turn after the filmmakers uncover an ancient and dangerous secret society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0tpJXx8i4jTVMKAUIoXYb7Hv8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133369'),
  ('67100108107735164', 'The Conspiracy of Torture', 1969, 'Drama', 'Lucio Fulci, Erico Menczer, Tiziano Cortini', 'Lucio Fulci, Roberto Gianviti', 'Adrienne La Russa, Tomas Milian, Georges Wilson, Mavie Bardanzellu, Antonio Casagrande, Ignazio Spalla, Steffen Zacharias, Raymond Pellegrin', null, 'In 1599 Italy, Beatrice Cenci is the teenage daughter of the crazed landowner and nobleman Francesco Cenci who keeps her locked up in the dungeon of his castle where he sexually abuses her. Beatrice plots with her stepmother, her besotted servant Olimpio, as well as a local bandit, named Catalano to plan Francesco’s murder.', 'In 1599 Italy, Beatrice Cenci is the teenage daughter of the crazed landowner and nobleman Francesco Cenci who keeps her locked up in the dungeon of his castle where he sexually abuses her. Beatrice plots with her stepmother, her besotted servant Olimpio, as well as a local bandit, named Catalano to plan Francesco’s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qarGydiRQfj6UwayEybuBJwOr7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46768'),
  ('483684024686185577', 'The Conspirator', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Eric Sherman, Richard Graves, Michael Epple', 'Gregory Bernstein, James D. Solomon', 'James McAvoy, Robin Wright, Evan Rachel Wood, Kevin Kline, Alexis Bledel, Danny Huston, Justin Long, Colm Meaney', 'PG-13', 'Mary Surratt is the lone female charged as a co-conspirator in the assassination trial of Abraham Lincoln. As the whole nation turns against her, she is forced to rely on her reluctant lawyer to uncover the truth and save her life.', 'Mary Surratt is the lone female charged as a co-conspirator in the assassination trial of Abraham Lincoln. As the whole nation turns against her, she is forced to rely on her reluctant lawyer to uncover the truth and save her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2ubkGUjGYeKRN1C2Tib0rmjuWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60309'),
  ('971252429208177652', 'The Conspirators', 1944, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Arthur Edeson, Jean Negulesco, Ridgeway Callow', 'Vladimir Pozner, Leo Rosten', 'Hedy Lamarr, Paul Henreid, Sydney Greenstreet, Peter Lorre, Victor Francen, Joseph Calleia, Carol Thurston, Vladimir Sokoloff', null, 'A guerilla leader falls in love with a mysterious woman in World War II Lisbon.', 'A guerilla leader falls in love with a mysterious woman in World War II Lisbon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIxpGK6EAmnfjW5csdD1Tgko4Cj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34945'),
  ('701059368987615785', 'The Conspirators', 1969, 'History, Comedy, Drama', 'Luigi Magni, Silvano Ippoliti, Roberto Pariante', 'Luigi Magni', 'Nino Manfredi, Enrico Maria Salerno, Claudia Cardinale, Robert Hossein, Renaud Verley, Alberto Sordi, Stelvio Rosi, Ugo Tognazzi', null, 'Rome, 1825. Bishop Rivarola and Colonel Nardoni are in charge of suppressing the liberal revolution. Shoemaker Cornacchia got the information that the liberal Filippo Spada is a spy and is going to denounce his revolutionary companions.', 'Rome, 1825. Bishop Rivarola and Colonel Nardoni are in charge of suppressing the liberal revolution. Shoemaker Cornacchia got the information that the liberal Filippo Spada is a spy and is going to denounce his revolutionary companions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pktyl7FhmEQUApKT7SFnotcVB7g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57601'),
  ('1063075484618375238', 'The Conspirators', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade, Pedro de Moraes, Gilberto Loureiro', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade, Eduardo Escorel, Cecília Meireles', 'José Wilker, Luiz Linhares, Paulo César Peréio, Fernando Torres, Carlos Kroeber, Nelson Dantas, Carlos Gregório, Fábio Sabag', null, 'The real story of the failed attempt of an independence coup by a group of intellectuals and rich men during Brazil''s colonial days, from its beginning to the execution of Tiradentes.', 'The real story of the failed attempt of an independence coup by a group of intellectuals and rich men during Brazil''s colonial days, from its beginning to the execution of Tiradentes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncP6jWDPqjstvI5WMpN4PPB4l83.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74441'),
  ('716483130410031164', 'The Constant Factor', 1980, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Sławomir Idziak', 'Krzysztof Zanussi', 'Tadeusz Bradecki, Zofia Mrozowska, Małgorzata Zajączkowska, Witold Pyrkosz, Cezary Morawski, Ewa Lejczak, Jan Jurewicz, Juliusz Machulski', null, 'A young man is confronted with corrupt and vindictive colleagues at work and negligent officials at the hospital where his mother is dying. As he searches quixotically for a steadfast moral code by which to live, he suffers from the knowledge of human frailty and our darker inclinations to do harm.', 'A young man is confronted with corrupt and vindictive colleagues at work and negligent officials at the hospital where his mother is dying. As he searches quixotically for a steadfast moral code by which to live, he suffers from the knowledge of human frailty and our darker inclinations to do harm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXvxXOt7UgH9h4ptWysM0lS8zNO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198500'),
  ('197407816104955892', 'The Constant Gardener', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Fernando Meirelles, César Charlone, Richard Styles', 'Jeffrey Caine', 'Ralph Fiennes, Rachel Weisz, Danny Huston, Bill Nighy, Pete Postlethwaite, Richard McCabe, Donald Sumpter, Juliet Aubrey', 'R', 'Justin Quayle is a low-level British diplomat who has always gone about his work very quietly, not causing any problems. But after his radical wife Tessa is killed he becomes determined to find out why, thrusting himself into the middle of a very dangerous conspiracy.', 'Justin Quayle is a low-level British diplomat who has always gone about his work very quietly, not causing any problems. But after his radical wife Tessa is killed he becomes determined to find out why, thrusting himself into the middle of a very dangerous conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkXq7V7mmJVbvwZGr3nxkHo7HkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1985'),
  ('55857952525979487', 'The Constant Husband', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Edward Scaife, Percy Hermes, Douglas Hermes', 'Val Valentine, Sidney Gilliat', 'Rex Harrison, Kay Kendall, Margaret Leighton, George Cole, Raymond Huntley, Cecil Parker, Sally Lahee, Nicole Maurey', null, 'Charles Hathaway wakes up in West Wales with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. With the help of a Cardiff specialist he traces his life back to his gorgeous wife and their large London house, so all seems well with the world. But more detective work starts to uncover an alarming chain of further stunning wives and a way of going on that the new Charles finds pretty unacceptable.', 'Charles Hathaway wakes up in West Wales with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. With the help of a Cardiff specialist he traces his life back to his gorgeous wife and their large London house, so all seems well with the world. But more detective work starts to uncover an alarming chain of further stunning wives and a way of going on that the new Charles finds pretty unacceptable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiZ55QzzLY1Xj1qHyDHdYG3f9nk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59397'),
  ('941834979066869240', 'The Constant Nymph', 1943, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edmund Goulding, Tony Gaudio, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Kathryn Scola', 'Charles Boyer, Joan Fontaine, Alexis Smith, Brenda Marshall, Charles Coburn, May Whitty, Peter Lorre, Joyce Reynolds', 'NR', 'The daughter of a musical mentor adores a promising composer, who is quite fond of the adolescent. When her father dies, an uncle arrives with his own grown daughter, who begins a romance with the composer which culminates in marriage but creates an emotional rivalry that affects the three.', 'The daughter of a musical mentor adores a promising composer, who is quite fond of the adolescent. When her father dies, an uncle arrives with his own grown daughter, who begins a romance with the composer which culminates in marriage but creates an emotional rivalry that affects the three.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GGP7QOVwcAcNtg775FKB4GDRd5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85677'),
  ('440905890344808696', 'The Consul of Sodom', 2009, 'Drama', 'José David Montero, Sigfrid Monleón', 'Sigfrid Monleón, Joaquín Górriz, Miguel Ángel Fernández', 'Jordi Mollà, Bimba Bosé, Àlex Brendemühl, Josep Linuesa, Isaac de los Reyes, Isabelle Stoffel, Vicky Peña, Marc Martínez', 'NR', 'Fascinating journey through the life and work of the prestigious Catalan poet Jaime Gil de Biedma, both marked by sexuality and eroticism. Charismatic and somewhat eccentric, brilliant intellectual with extraordinary sensitivity and member of Barcelona''s ''gauche divine'' in the 60s, Gil de Biedma liked to describe himself as a ''poet of experience'' while he suffered dreadfully from the dichotomy strangling him: bourgeois and executive for a multinational by day, communist and homosexual poet by night.', 'Fascinating journey through the life and work of the prestigious Catalan poet Jaime Gil de Biedma, both marked by sexuality and eroticism. Charismatic and somewhat eccentric, brilliant intellectual with extraordinary sensitivity and member of Barcelona''s ''gauche divine'' in the 60s, Gil de Biedma liked to describe himself as a ''poet of experience'' while he suffered dreadfully from the dichotomy strangling him: bourgeois and executive for a multinational by day, communist and homosexual poet by night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1W5SHzPqdBb6c2I9XADKbAyM9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74342'),
  ('505370021506852290', 'The Contact', 1997, 'Romance, Drama', 'Chang Youn-hyun, Kim Sung-bok, Lim Jae-young', 'Cho Myeong-ju, Kim Eun-jeong, Chang Youn-hyun', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Han Suk-kyu, Kim Tae-woo, Chu Sang-mi, Park Yong-su, Choi Cheol-ho, Son Min-seok, Lee Beom-soo', null, 'The male radio presenter Dong-hyun and the female TV home shopping phone operator Soo-hyun are both lonely. While Dong-hyun is focused on getting back to his ex-girl-friend Young-hae who has sent him a special LP, Soo-hyun is crazy for her friend''s boy-friend. Via Internet and music Soo-hyun and Dong-hyun get together in a special way.', 'The male radio presenter Dong-hyun and the female TV home shopping phone operator Soo-hyun are both lonely. While Dong-hyun is focused on getting back to his ex-girl-friend Young-hae who has sent him a special LP, Soo-hyun is crazy for her friend''s boy-friend. Via Internet and music Soo-hyun and Dong-hyun get together in a special way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOcwRDDi7yQy3a2B9BN3Rb8jHZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183507'),
  ('436053420732355831', 'The Containment', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jack Zagha Kababie, Yossy Zagha, Antonio Riestra', 'Jack Zagha Kababie, Yossy Zagha, David Desola', 'Gia Hunter, Jack Gouldbourne, Fernanda Romero, Alice Coulthard, Roger Cudney, Edmund Dehn, Isabel Aerenlund, Darren Clarke', null, 'A girl is possessed by a dark and mysterious entity. She will fight with all the elements at her disposal to get rid of it. Neither her mother, nor traditional medicine, nor a supposed expert in exorcisms, will be able to make the demon disappear, until a nun gets involved in the case and sows a doubt more terrible than the possession itself.', 'A girl is possessed by a dark and mysterious entity. She will fight with all the elements at her disposal to get rid of it. Neither her mother, nor traditional medicine, nor a supposed expert in exorcisms, will be able to make the demon disappear, until a nun gets involved in the case and sows a doubt more terrible than the possession itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozd7UIGxuDrzYj3t3PD8RnQktS4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568770'),
  ('992969939125986828', 'The Contender', 2000, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rod Lurie, Denis Maloney', 'Rod Lurie', 'Joan Allen, Gary Oldman, Jeff Bridges, Christian Slater, Sam Elliott, William Petersen, Saul Rubinek, Philip Baker Hall', 'R', 'The vice president is dead, and as the president makes his choice for a replacement, a secret contest of wills is being waged by a formidable rival. When Senator Laine Hanson is nominated as the first woman in history to hold the office, hidden agendas explode into a battle for power.', 'The vice president is dead, and as the president makes his choice for a replacement, a secret contest of wills is being waged by a formidable rival. When Senator Laine Hanson is nominated as the first woman in history to hold the office, hidden agendas explode into a battle for power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duRe0F2GYHIDvqe2bqIAMP4gWeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6521'),
  ('300700619867386612', 'The Contestant', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Susana García Díez, Rodrigo Cortés', 'Rodrigo Cortés', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Chete Lera, Miryam Gallego, Fernando Cayo, Myriam De Maeztu, Luis Zahera', null, 'Martín''s lucky hit when he wins the most lucrative prize in television history puts his life upside down.', 'Martín''s lucky hit when he wins the most lucrative prize in television history puts his life upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCkAaDWTwrkUDZUORKcTpuxUVYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48453'),
  ('502762437847065501', 'The Contestant', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Mikul Eriksson, Clair Titley', 'Clair Titley', 'Nasubi, Toshio Tsuchiya, Kazuko Hamatsu, Seiichi Hirai, Harutaro Kagawa, Juliet Hindell, Ikuyo Hamatsu, Jun Anzai', 'R', 'The incredible true story of a man who lived for 15 months trapped inside a small room, naked, starving and alone... and completely unaware that his life was being broadcast on national TV in Japan, to over 15 million viewers a week.', 'The incredible true story of a man who lived for 15 months trapped inside a small room, naked, starving and alone... and completely unaware that his life was being broadcast on national TV in Japan, to over 15 million viewers a week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6jHYpie6VEW68mnxfHVRZo0Xm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156638'),
  ('281391005509238351', 'The Continent', 2014, 'Drama', 'Liao Ni, Han Han', 'Han Han', 'William Feng, Chen Bolin, Wallace Chung, Joe Chen, Wang Luodan, Yuan Quan, Jia Zhangke, White-K', null, 'Three men living in the Eastern most island of China go on a road trip to the Western most end of the country, and facing crises of love, friendship, and faith on their journey to the West.', 'Three men living in the Eastern most island of China go on a road trip to the Western most end of the country, and facing crises of love, friendship, and faith on their journey to the West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDAQEq5uLeTJoY2ID4MUZeeVGIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272875'),
  ('886591542019897080', 'The Contract', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Tom Lau Moon-Tong', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Sam Hui, Ricky Hui Koon-Ying, Tiffany Bao Chui-Ling, Ellen Lau Guen-Guen, Yeung Wai, Cheng Fu-Hung, Russell Cawthorne', null, 'Struggling actor Chih-Wen (Michael Hui) got a raw deal from his company, MTV Studios. He signed a binding 8-year contract with the studio and was only given one opportunity to perform live thus far. Soon, he received a better deal with a rival company, who promised a 5-year contract and better opportunities to perform and make money. Since he cannot start working for the new company because of his current 8-year contract with MTV, he and his scientist-aspiring brother (Ricky Hui), with the help of magician Shih-Chieh (Sam Hui), attempt to steal the contract from his ruthless manager.', 'Struggling actor Chih-Wen (Michael Hui) got a raw deal from his company, MTV Studios. He signed a binding 8-year contract with the studio and was only given one opportunity to perform live thus far. Soon, he received a better deal with a rival company, who promised a 5-year contract and better opportunities to perform and make money. Since he cannot start working for the new company because of his current 8-year contract with MTV, he and his scientist-aspiring brother (Ricky Hui), with the help of magician Shih-Chieh (Sam Hui), attempt to steal the contract from his ruthless manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2E2EGCqWrqwbEzUdT0qD88OBcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198549'),
  ('550317003861334142', 'The Contract', 1982, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Sławomir Idziak', 'Krzysztof Zanussi', 'Maja Komorowska, Tadeusz Łomnicki, Magdalena Jarosz, Krzysztof Kolberger, Nina Andrycz, Zofia Mrozowska, Beata Tyszkiewicz, Janusz Gajos', null, 'Bearing traces of the old Anton Chekhov play The Wedding, The Contract is set during an "arranged" ceremony. The bride and groom barely know each other, but this matters not at all to their tradition-bound families. At the last minute, the bride balks. Only slightly nonplused, the groom''s father, a status-seeking doctor, decides to go ahead with the expensive reception anyway. Polish director Krzysz Zanussi uses this scenario to stick it to capitalist corruption, and to society''s destruction of the individual spirit. Leslie Caron, the one recognizable member of the cast, is outstanding as a wealthy, over-the-hill ballerina who happens to be a kleptomaniac.', 'Bearing traces of the old Anton Chekhov play The Wedding, The Contract is set during an "arranged" ceremony. The bride and groom barely know each other, but this matters not at all to their tradition-bound families. At the last minute, the bride balks. Only slightly nonplused, the groom''s father, a status-seeking doctor, decides to go ahead with the expensive reception anyway. Polish director Krzysz Zanussi uses this scenario to stick it to capitalist corruption, and to society''s destruction of the individual spirit. Leslie Caron, the one recognizable member of the cast, is outstanding as a wealthy, over-the-hill ballerina who happens to be a kleptomaniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJW1vsCZ1lxHedR1rgHg5TItwcu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204169'),
  ('820799964072647485', 'The Contract', 2006, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Dante Spinotti, Bruce Beresford, Richard Cowan', 'Stephen Katz, John Darrouzet', 'Morgan Freeman, John Cusack, Alice Krige, Megan Dodds, Corey Johnson, Jonathan Hyde, Bill Smitrovich, Anthony Warren', 'R', 'Attempting to recover from a recent family trauma by escaping into the woods for a peaceful hiking trip, an ex-lawman and his young son stumble across a dangerous contract killer.', 'Attempting to recover from a recent family trauma by escaping into the woods for a peaceful hiking trip, an ex-lawman and his young son stumble across a dangerous contract killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sU2yzV3T1LetBdQPAeBRDb4YwLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1441'),
  ('249195099467558527', 'The Contractor', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Josef Rusnak, Scott Bates, Dominic Fysh', 'Joshua Michael Stern, Robert Foster', 'Wesley Snipes, Eliza Bennett, Lena Headey, Ralph Brown, Charles Dance, Gemma Jones, Richard Harrington, Iain Robertson', 'R', 'Former CIA Operative James Dial is coaxed back into action to kill a terrorist in London, but it all goes wrong and he is forced into hiding, where he meets and befriends a 12 year old girl.', 'Former CIA Operative James Dial is coaxed back into action to kill a terrorist in London, but it all goes wrong and he is forced into hiding, where he meets and befriends a 12 year old girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udf7WGMqLeq4C91a4xEoS7WAh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15071'),
  ('834612346654296227', 'The Contractor', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Pierre Aïm, Grigore Purcariu, Jack Gill', 'J.P. Davis', 'Chris Pine, Kiefer Sutherland, Ben Foster, Gillian Jacobs, Sander Thomas, Toby Dixon, Dean Ashton, Dustin Lewis', 'R', 'After being involuntarily discharged from the U.S. Special Forces, James Harper decides to support his family by joining a private contracting organization alongside his best friend and under the command of a fellow veteran. Overseas on a covert mission, Harper must evade those trying to kill him while making his way back home.', 'After being involuntarily discharged from the U.S. Special Forces, James Harper decides to support his family by joining a private contracting organization alongside his best friend and under the command of a fellow veteran. Overseas on a covert mission, Harper must evade those trying to kill him while making his way back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJPGPZ5soaG27MK90oKpioSiJE2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628900'),
  ('707675708237072507', 'The Convent', 1995, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Mário Barroso', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Agustina Bessa-Luís', 'Catherine Deneuve, John Malkovich, Luis Miguel Cintra, Leonor Silveira, João Bénard da Costa, Heloísa Miranda, Gilberto Gonçalves', null, 'The journey of Michael Padovic, an American professor who arrives with his wife, Helene, at a Portuguese convent where he expects to find the documents needed to prove his theory: Shakespeare was born in Spain; not in England.', 'The journey of Michael Padovic, an American professor who arrives with his wife, Helene, at a Portuguese convent where he expects to find the documents needed to prove his theory: Shakespeare was born in Spain; not in England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRo6ETYSdSW98u8SmCvKrG57jTG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124614'),
  ('183877243880644099', 'The Convent', 2000, 'Horror, Action, Comedy', 'Mike Mendez, Jason Lowe', 'Chaton Anderson', 'Adrienne Barbeau, Joanna Canton, Richard Trapp, Megahn Perry, Liam Kyle Sullivan, Dax Miller, Renée Graham, Jim Golden', 'R', 'A group of college students break into an abandoned convent and become possessed by demonic spirits.', 'A group of college students break into an abandoned convent and become possessed by demonic spirits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehDQuLqA0Lj03k4uM5MKzphbi0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12724'),
  ('800706937389344110', 'The Convent', 2018, 'History, Horror', 'Paul Hyett, Neil Oseman', 'Paul Hyett, Conal Palmer', 'Michael Ironside, Hannah Arterton, Clare Higgins, Dilan Gwyn, Sian Breckin, Ciarán McMenamin, Katie Sheridan, Ryan Oliva', null, 'During the 17th century, a young woman is saved from execution and led to a priory to repent her sins but discovers a greater evil lies within.', 'During the 17th century, a young woman is saved from execution and led to a priory to repent her sins but discovers a greater evil lies within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/or9QoOcHfsaypC7UiCEIFtls48N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448432'),
  ('6870254668812879', 'The Conversation', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Bill Butler, Haskell Wexler', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Gene Hackman, John Cazale, Allen Garfield, Frederic Forrest, Cindy Williams, Michael Higgins, Elizabeth MacRae, Teri Garr', 'PG', 'A paranoid, secretive surveillance expert has a crisis of conscience when he suspects that the couple he is spying on will be murdered.', 'A paranoid, secretive surveillance expert has a crisis of conscience when he suspects that the couple he is spying on will be murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHqVBwcv1SGymOpUueRoKzcmdes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592'),
  ('325736241956153089', 'The Conversation Is Over', 1982, 'Drama', 'João Botelho, Acácio de Almeida, Carlos Ferreiro', 'João Botelho', 'Fernando Cabral Martins, André Gomes, Juliet Berto, Jorge Silva Melo, Manoel de Oliveira, Isabel Ruth, João Perry, Francisco Pinhão Botelho', null, 'The film was to be a documentary, but evolved during production to a fictional film. It nevertheless adheres strictly to the poems and letters exchanged by two of the most outstanding names of the Modernist Movement, Fernando Pessoa (in Lisbon) and Mário de Sá-Carneiro (in Paris). Their endless conversation was dramatically and suddenly terminated.', 'The film was to be a documentary, but evolved during production to a fictional film. It nevertheless adheres strictly to the poems and letters exchanged by two of the most outstanding names of the Modernist Movement, Fernando Pessoa (in Lisbon) and Mário de Sá-Carneiro (in Paris). Their endless conversation was dramatically and suddenly terminated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkrSmwoVuUvsT00K6j3uuIc5j4o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215256'),
  ('1033677406642168331', 'The Convert', 2024, 'Drama, Action', 'Lee Tamahori, Gin Loane, Gene Keelan', 'Lee Tamahori, Shane Danielsen', 'Guy Pearce, Tioreore Ngatai-Melbourne, Antonio Te Maioha, Jacqueline McKenzie, Te Kohe Tuhaka, Lawrence Makoare, Dean O''Gorman, Jared Turner', 'NR', 'Munro, a soldier turned lay preacher, comes to New Zealand to minister to the first British colonists, but he is converted by the powerful chief Maianui to serve a different purpose.', 'Munro, a soldier turned lay preacher, comes to New Zealand to minister to the first British colonists, but he is converted by the powerful chief Maianui to serve a different purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44frNIZUfL8kYhxOGHeBJsyXUbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1066262'),
  ('715359952828135495', 'The Convict Killer', 1980, 'Action, Drama, Mystery', 'Chor Yuen, Chang Chuan-tsan, Chan Fen', 'Chor Yuen', 'Ti Lung, Jason Pai Piao, Tony Liu Tian-jue, Ching Li, Ching Miao, Mannor Chan Man-Na, Ai Fei, Walter Tso Tat-Wah', null, 'Teng Piao went to jail for fifteen years on a frame up for drug smuggling. Now that he''s out, along with his iron chain, Teng Piao is hungry for revenge. The man he wants to beat with his chain is Black Leopard Lam Fei. The problem for Teng Piao is that he doesn''t know who he is, only that he has a picture of a black leopard tattooed on his chest.', 'Teng Piao went to jail for fifteen years on a frame up for drug smuggling. Now that he''s out, along with his iron chain, Teng Piao is hungry for revenge. The man he wants to beat with his chain is Black Leopard Lam Fei. The problem for Teng Piao is that he doesn''t know who he is, only that he has a picture of a black leopard tattooed on his chest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKMVXo68oKUbO8r1eNFecJ8kSz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74270'),
  ('754104751926731079', 'The Conviction', 1991, 'Drama', 'Marco Bellocchio, Giuseppe Lanci', 'Marco Bellocchio, Massimo Fagioli', 'Vittorio Mezzogiorno, Claire Nebout, Andrzej Seweryn, Grażyna Szapołowska, Paolo Graziosi, Maria Schneider, Tatiana Winteler, Antonio Marziantonio', null, 'A girl and her art professor get trapped inside a castle-museum after it closes at night. After a little resistance she agrees to have sex with him, but then she sues the professor for rape. The professor will have to prove his innocence.', 'A girl and her art professor get trapped inside a castle-museum after it closes at night. After a little resistance she agrees to have sex with him, but then she sues the professor for rape. The professor will have to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yHaJngTlPQHB8eZEqGogTcuQZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175956'),
