  ('617869918531109777', 'The Corrupted', 2019, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ron Scalpello, Sophie Kenny', 'Nick Moorcroft', 'Sam Claflin, Charlie Murphy, Timothy Spall, Hugh Bonneville, Noel Clarke, David Hayman, Alan McKenna, Shaun Dooley', null, 'Set ahead of the 2012 London Olympics, the film follows Liam, an ex-con trying to win back the love and trust of his family. He has lost everything at the hands of a local crime syndicate run by Clifford Cullen, who has high-level connections in politics, finance and the police force. Liam''s drive for redemption sees him caught up in a web of conspiracy, crime, and corruption.', 'Set ahead of the 2012 London Olympics, the film follows Liam, an ex-con trying to win back the love and trust of his family. He has lost everything at the hands of a local crime syndicate run by Clifford Cullen, who has high-level connections in politics, finance and the police force. Liam''s drive for redemption sees him caught up in a web of conspiracy, crime, and corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elf6HOIOAwMlxc4ZBsprEc5VQHc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512239'),
