  ('596589466730903800', 'The Count of Monte Cristo', 1953, 'Adventure', 'León Klimovsky, Alberto Etchebehere', 'León Klimovsky', 'Jorge Mistral, Elina Colomer, Santiago Gómez Cou, Daniel Tedeschi, Nelly Meden, Ernesto Bianco, Nathán Pinzón, Fina Basser', null, 'Edmundo Dantes is betrayed by his best friend, who has him killed to keep his property and his love. But after a few years, a certain Count appears to mortify the life of the traitorous friend.', 'Edmundo Dantes is betrayed by his best friend, who has him killed to keep his property and his love. But after a few years, a certain Count appears to mortify the life of the traitorous friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtGUQ47J2OTZfwiGD8cfivq1ZOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224385'),
  ('455010937704720374', 'The Count of Monte Cristo', 1954, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Vernay, Édouard Molinaro, Paul Feyder', 'Georges Neveux, Robert Vernay', 'Jean Marais, Lia Amanda, Daniel Ivernel, Folco Lulli, Louis Seigner, Paolo Stoppa, Claude Génia, Simone Paris', 'NR', 'Edmond Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmond of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of. After many years in prison, the old Abbe dies, and Edmond escapes disguised as the dead body. Now free, Edmond must find the treasure the Abbe told him of, so he can use the new-found wealth to exact revenge on those who have wronged him...', 'Edmond Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmond of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of. After many years in prison, the old Abbe dies, and Edmond escapes disguised as the dead body. Now free, Edmond must find the treasure the Abbe told him of, so he can use the new-found wealth to exact revenge on those who have wronged him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9h1aCqb0lOtvh8BLDsVUhDu4Fxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82046'),
  ('725702615466331883', 'The Count of Monte Cristo', 1961, 'History', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Jean Isnard, Jacques Natteau', 'Jean Halain', 'Louis Jourdan, Yvonne Furneaux, Pierre Mondy, Yves Rénier, Claudine Coster, Bernard Dhéran, Jean-Claude Michel, Marie Mergey', null, 'Edmund Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmund of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of. After many years in prison, the old Abbe dies, and Edmund escapes disguised as the dead body. Now free, Edmund must find the treasure the Abbe told him of, so he can use the new-found wealth to exact revenge on those who have wronged him.', 'Edmund Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmund of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of. After many years in prison, the old Abbe dies, and Edmund escapes disguised as the dead body. Now free, Edmund must find the treasure the Abbe told him of, so he can use the new-found wealth to exact revenge on those who have wronged him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUxOIbeN2CR8lUTl0F7KzuKir6o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4528'),
  ('434057630335717590', 'The Count of Monte Cristo', 2002, 'Adventure, Drama, History, Action, Thriller', 'Kevin Reynolds, Andrew Dunn, Robert Huberman', 'Jay Wolpert', 'Jim Caviezel, Guy Pearce, Richard Harris, James Frain, Dagmara Dominczyk, Michael Wincott, Luis Guzmán, Christopher Adamson', 'PG-13', 'Edmond Dantés''s life and plans to marry the beautiful Mercedes are shattered when his best friend, Fernand, deceives him. After spending 13 miserable years in prison, Dantés escapes with the help of a fellow inmate and plots his revenge, cleverly insinuating himself into the French nobility.', 'Edmond Dantés''s life and plans to marry the beautiful Mercedes are shattered when his best friend, Fernand, deceives him. After spending 13 miserable years in prison, Dantés escapes with the help of a fellow inmate and plots his revenge, cleverly insinuating himself into the French nobility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifMgDAUXVQLY4DeOu3VTTi55jSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11362'),
  ('141975649148630229', 'The Count of Monte Cristo', 2024, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Neige de la Patellière, Daniel Dittmann, Justine Arrestier', 'Alexandre de La Patellière, Matthieu Delaporte', 'Pierre Niney, Bastien Bouillon, Anaïs Demoustier, Laurent Lafitte, Pierfrancesco Favino, Patrick Mille, Vassili Schneider, Julien de Saint Jean', 'NR', 'Edmond Dantès becomes the target of a sinister plot and is arrested on his wedding day for a crime he did not commit. After 14 years in the island prison of Château d’If, he manages a daring escape. Now rich beyond his dreams, he assumes the identity of the Count of Monte-Cristo and exacts his revenge on the three men who betrayed him.', 'Edmond Dantès becomes the target of a sinister plot and is arrested on his wedding day for a crime he did not commit. After 14 years in the island prison of Château d’If, he manages a daring escape. Now rich beyond his dreams, he assumes the identity of the Count of Monte-Cristo and exacts his revenge on the three men who betrayed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAT1P3FGhtJ68anUyJScnMu8t1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084736'),
  ('939223613036689840', 'The Count of Monte Cristo Part 1 - The Prisoner of Kastell', 1943, 'Adventure, Drama, History, Action', 'Ferruccio Cerio, Robert Vernay, Victor Arménise', 'Guglielmo Santangelo, Charles Spaak, Pietro Solari', 'Pierre Richard-Willm, Michèle Alfa, Aimé Clariond, Marcel Herrand, Ermete Zacconi, Alexandre Rignault, Henri Bosc, Jacques Baumer', null, 'Edmond Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmond of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of. After many years in prison, the old Abbe dies, and Edmond escapes disguised as the dead body. Now free, Edmond must find the treasure the Abbe told him of, so he can use the new-found wealth to exact revenge on those who have wronged him.', 'Edmond Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmond of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of. After many years in prison, the old Abbe dies, and Edmond escapes disguised as the dead body. Now free, Edmond must find the treasure the Abbe told him of, so he can use the new-found wealth to exact revenge on those who have wronged him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxskhpJptj5kFzPdoEwBWBKeHVO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194226'),
  ('5130690307497399', 'The Count of Monte Cristo Part 2 - The Retaliation', 1943, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Robert Vernay, Ferruccio Cerio, Victor Arménise', 'Charles Spaak, Guglielmo Santangelo, Pietro Solari', 'Pierre Richard-Willm, Michèle Alfa, Aimé Clariond, Lise Delamare, Marcel Herrand, Alexandre Rignault, Henri Bosc, Jean Chaduc', null, 'Having found the fabulous treasure of which Abbé Faria had spoken to him, Dantès has only one idea left: revenge. He will succeed patiently, but will not however have the heart to break the poor Mercedes. Then he will leave for the East, accompanied by a lovely Levantine, Haydé, who served him to accomplish his revenge.', 'Having found the fabulous treasure of which Abbé Faria had spoken to him, Dantès has only one idea left: revenge. He will succeed patiently, but will not however have the heart to break the poor Mercedes. Then he will leave for the East, accompanied by a lovely Levantine, Haydé, who served him to accomplish his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6qYITQwACjiYppC8AaqNPyETe2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194230'),
  ('526332992152735416', 'The Count of Monte-Cristo', 1975, 'Adventure, Drama, TV Movie', 'David Greene, Aldo Tonti', 'Sidney Carroll', 'Richard Chamberlain, Trevor Howard, Louis Jourdan, Donald Pleasence, Tony Curtis, Kate Nelligan, Angelo Infanti, Harold Bromley', null, 'A TV adaptation of the classic Alexandre Dumas novel. Edmond Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmond of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of. After many years in prison, the old Abbe dies, and Edmond escapes disguised as the dead body. Now free, Edmond must find the treasure the Abbe told him of, so he can use the new-found wealth to exact revenge on those who have wronged him.', 'A TV adaptation of the classic Alexandre Dumas novel. Edmond Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmond of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of. After many years in prison, the old Abbe dies, and Edmond escapes disguised as the dead body. Now free, Edmond must find the treasure the Abbe told him of, so he can use the new-found wealth to exact revenge on those who have wronged him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbXO1lV54yWLGyzpOxQjzBxMfLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4546'),
  ('954844698509019059', 'The Count of the Old Town', 1935, 'Crime, Comedy, Romance', 'Edvin Adolphson, Sigurd Wallén, Åke Dahlqvist', 'Gösta Stevens', 'Valdemar Dalquist, Julia Cæsar, Sigurd Wallén, Tollie Zellman, Edvin Adolphson, Ingrid Bergman, Eric Abrahamsson, Weyler Hildebrand', null, 'A police inspector tracks a notorious jewel thief, ''Diamond-Lasse,'' to a hotel filled with eccentrics.', 'A police inspector tracks a notorious jewel thief, ''Diamond-Lasse,'' to a hotel filled with eccentrics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NXxRDqTEtIMHTHznY4kpxtiQL4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78018'),
  ('1069635253708432689', 'The Counterfeit Cat', 1949, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Tex Avery', 'Jack Cosgriff, Rich Hogan', 'Bill Thompson, Colleen Collins', null, 'A cat steals the headpiece of a dog to deceive the bulldog Spike and get a chance to eat the canary Spike is guarding.', 'A cat steals the headpiece of a dog to deceive the bulldog Spike and get a chance to eat the canary Spike is guarding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iM1bjUdFPYg2wROJnggcC6Y3Sk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187320'),
  ('1076586717838060074', 'The Counterfeit Coin', 1955, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Yorgos Tzavellas, Napoleon Eleftheriou', 'Yorgos Tzavellas', 'Vasilis Logothetidis, Ilia Livykou, Mimis Fotopoulos, Sperantza Vrana, Orestis Makris, Ellie Lambeti, Dimitris Horn, Dimitris Myrat', null, 'Four stories, humorous, romantic or dramatic, are linked by a counterfeit gold sovereign. It is made by the honest engraver in the first story, seduced by the charms of a young widow, and it subsequently passes into the hands of a beggar and a prostitute, a wealthy miser and a newly married couple where the husband is a poor artist.', 'Four stories, humorous, romantic or dramatic, are linked by a counterfeit gold sovereign. It is made by the honest engraver in the first story, seduced by the charms of a young widow, and it subsequently passes into the hands of a beggar and a prostitute, a wealthy miser and a newly married couple where the husband is a poor artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yEk0HpclVv2PBnHqLVv9hLdbya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47713'),
  ('146589589885721043', 'The Counterfeit Constable', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Robert Dhéry, Pierre Tchernia', 'Jean L''Hôte, Pierre Tchernia, Robert Dhéry', 'Robert Dhéry, Ronald Fraser, Colette Brosset, Bernard Cribbins, Mark Lester, Catherine Sola, Diana Dors, Percy Herbert', null, 'An extremely funny film about a group of French rugby supporters who go to see a match at Twickenham and one of them inadvertently receives a blow in the mouth from someone else''s elbow. In the process he loses some front teeth and needs to see a dentist urgently ... this is only the beginning of a long series of adventures befalling our poor friend who doesn''t speak a word of English and who nevertheless needs to return urgently to France to get married in the following days sporting a decent mouth !', 'An extremely funny film about a group of French rugby supporters who go to see a match at Twickenham and one of them inadvertently receives a blow in the mouth from someone else''s elbow. In the process he loses some front teeth and needs to see a dentist urgently ... this is only the beginning of a long series of adventures befalling our poor friend who doesn''t speak a word of English and who nevertheless needs to return urgently to France to get married in the following days sporting a decent mouth !', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTdcNWfSxADvOZFcEOSGpPPqs8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27325'),
  ('665216005646342263', 'The Counterfeit Contessa', 1994, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Ron Lagomarsino, Brian R.R. Hebb', 'Scott Davis Jones', 'Téa Leoni, D.W. Moffett, David Beecroft, Karla Tamburrelli, Susan Walters, Molly Price, Nicole De Boer, Holland Taylor', 'PG', 'Gina Nardino, a young saleswoman at the food counter of a posh department store, falls hard for a society stud, and, through a series of accidents, impresses him by taking on the false identity of an Italian contessa. But the masquerade begins to get out of hand when the stud''s brother sees through her disguise...and likes what he sees.', 'Gina Nardino, a young saleswoman at the food counter of a posh department store, falls hard for a society stud, and, through a series of accidents, impresses him by taking on the false identity of an Italian contessa. But the masquerade begins to get out of hand when the stud''s brother sees through her disguise...and likes what he sees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xrQNxqJ38cBQU4inuyZk3rjSg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84961'),
  ('1094270054872946255', 'The Counterfeit Traitor', 1962, 'War, Thriller, Drama', 'George Seaton, Jean Bourgoin', 'George Seaton', 'William Holden, Lilli Palmer, Hugh Griffith, Carl Raddatz, Ernst Schröder, Charles Regnier, Ingrid van Bergen, Wolfgang Preiss', 'NR', 'Blacklisted in modern day WW2, a Swedish oil trader opts to assist British Allies, by means of infiltrating and surveying Nazi Germany.', 'Blacklisted in modern day WW2, a Swedish oil trader opts to assist British Allies, by means of infiltrating and surveying Nazi Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKppEJWQZpf6VY9hqYYqsR5IEaq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43013'),
  ('649710052480092322', 'The Counterfeiters', 2007, 'Drama, War', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky, Anton Maria Aigner, Timon Modersohn', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky', 'Karl Markovics, August Diehl, Devid Striesow, Martin Brambach, August Zirner, Veit Stübner, Sebastian Urzendowsky, Andreas Schmidt', null, 'The story of Jewish counterfeiter Salomon Sorowitsch, who was coerced into assisting the Nazi operation of the Sachsenhausen concentration camp during World War II.', 'The story of Jewish counterfeiter Salomon Sorowitsch, who was coerced into assisting the Nazi operation of the Sachsenhausen concentration camp during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Af6I9RZF0SIPeNnp8hAleGDTnKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7862'),
  ('1064027131268450003', 'The Counterfeiters', 2010, 'War, TV Movie', 'Benoît Jacquot', 'Benoît Jacquot', 'Melvil Poupaud, Patrick Mille, Jules-Angelo Bigarnet, Maxime Berger, Laurence Cordier, Sandrine Dumas, Dolores Chaplin, Anne Bennent', null, 'The plot revolves around Bernard – a schoolfriend of Olivier''s who is preparing for his bac – discovering he is a bastard and taking this as a welcome pretext for running away from home. He spends a night in Olivier''s bed (where Olivier describes a recent visit to a prostitute and how he did not find the experience very enjoyable). After Bernard steals the suitcase belonging to Edouard, Olivier''s uncle, and the ensuing complications, he is made Edouard''s secretary. Olivier is jealous and ends up in the hands of the cynical and downright diabolical Comte de Passavant, who travels with him to the Mediterranean.', 'The plot revolves around Bernard – a schoolfriend of Olivier''s who is preparing for his bac – discovering he is a bastard and taking this as a welcome pretext for running away from home. He spends a night in Olivier''s bed (where Olivier describes a recent visit to a prostitute and how he did not find the experience very enjoyable). After Bernard steals the suitcase belonging to Edouard, Olivier''s uncle, and the ensuing complications, he is made Edouard''s secretary. Olivier is jealous and ends up in the hands of the cynical and downright diabolical Comte de Passavant, who travels with him to the Mediterranean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3J71vYxHShZTqogwfgk4xUHeQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147503'),
  ('624348084006341713', 'The Counterfeiters of Paris', 1961, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Gilles Grangier, Louis Page', 'Gilles Grangier', 'Jean Gabin, Bernard Blier, Maurice Biraud, Frank Villard, Antoine Balpêtré, Martine Carol, Ginette Leclerc, Françoise Rosay', 'NR', '"Le Dabe" retired many years ago and now he lives in the Tropics where he owns stables and horses. He is a very rich man. He was the king of all money counterfeiters. He is contacted from Paris to organize a new job. He says no. But when he finds out the the currency that should be counterfeited is the Dutch florin, he accepts immediately. He retired after having counterfeited 100 florin notes just before the Queen Wilhelmina retired them from circulation. He flies to Paris. But the gang is not to be trusted, at least not all of them.', '"Le Dabe" retired many years ago and now he lives in the Tropics where he owns stables and horses. He is a very rich man. He was the king of all money counterfeiters. He is contacted from Paris to organize a new job. He says no. But when he finds out the the currency that should be counterfeited is the Dutch florin, he accepts immediately. He retired after having counterfeited 100 florin notes just before the Queen Wilhelmina retired them from circulation. He flies to Paris. But the gang is not to be trusted, at least not all of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8yMOVojgPug4zYQZqHedZKGN6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59434'),
  ('859986088861921344', 'The Countess', 2009, 'Drama, History, Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Martin Ruhe, Julie Delpy, Thorne Mutert', 'Julie Delpy', 'Julie Delpy, Daniel Brühl, William Hurt, Anamaria Marinca, Maria Simon, Sebastian Blomberg, Adriana Altaras, Charly Hübner', null, 'Kingdom of Hungary, 17th century. As she gets older, powerful Countess Erzsébet Báthory (1560-1614), blinded by the passion that she feels for a younger man, succumbs to the mad delusion that blood will keep her young and beautiful forever.', 'Kingdom of Hungary, 17th century. As she gets older, powerful Countess Erzsébet Báthory (1560-1614), blinded by the passion that she feels for a younger man, succumbs to the mad delusion that blood will keep her young and beautiful forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnksbKPiwDZS5x9O64OU94hJ15g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8316'),
  ('558970545426065817', 'The Countess of Corfu', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Giorgos Arvanitis, Markos Zervas', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Rena Vlahopoulou, Alekos Alexandrakis, Nonika Galinea, Makis Demiris, Orfeas Zahos, Vangelis Ploios, Babis Anthopoulos, Manos Destounis', null, 'A businnesman, Sotiris Karelis, is presented to the piano teacher and twice a widow, Antzolina, and asks her to sell her mansion in order to convert it into a hotel. The same time, an Italian music group arrive in Corfu, which has been abandoned by Alinda Ritsi singer. Antzolina is persuaded not only to host her home but also to replace the singer. However, there is a lot of confusion because the singer of the group Alinda Ritsi comes in Corfu with her fiancée, and everyone is starting to look for their real identities.', 'A businnesman, Sotiris Karelis, is presented to the piano teacher and twice a widow, Antzolina, and asks her to sell her mansion in order to convert it into a hotel. The same time, an Italian music group arrive in Corfu, which has been abandoned by Alinda Ritsi singer. Antzolina is persuaded not only to host her home but also to replace the singer. However, there is a lot of confusion because the singer of the group Alinda Ritsi comes in Corfu with her fiancée, and everyone is starting to look for their real identities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXg8BByfbgWkPs4yBEK408sA0Pq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220835'),
  ('542732742456298456', 'The Country Bears', 2002, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Peter Hastings, Bruce Hendricks, Mitchell Amundsen', 'Mark Perez', 'Christopher Walken, Stephen Tobolowsky, Daryl Mitchell, M.C. Gainey, Diedrich Bader, Alex Rocco, Meagen Fay, Eli Marienthal', 'G', 'For Beary Barrington, The Country Bears'' young #1 fan, fitting in with his all-too-human family is proving im-paws-ible. When he runs away to find Country Bear Hall and his heroes, he discovers the venue that made them famous is near foreclosure. Beary hightails it over the river and through the woods to get the Bears in the Band back together for an all-out reunion concert to save Country Bear Hall.', 'For Beary Barrington, The Country Bears'' young #1 fan, fitting in with his all-too-human family is proving im-paws-ible. When he runs away to find Country Bear Hall and his heroes, he discovers the venue that made them famous is near foreclosure. Beary hightails it over the river and through the woods to get the Bears in the Band back together for an all-out reunion concert to save Country Bear Hall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6mm3z7Wf4y1rJGHxqjVTTHl217.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18357'),
  ('743533543194288974', 'The Country Boy', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Castellano, Pipolo, Danilo Desideri', 'Castellano, Pipolo', 'Renato Pozzetto, Massimo Boldi, Donna Osterbuhr, Clara Colosimo, Sandra Ambrosini, Renato D''Amore, Franco Diogene, Enzo Cannavale', null, 'A man is forced to completely change his habits when he decides to move from the country to the city.', 'A man is forced to completely change his habits when he decides to move from the country to the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7Krc9fQqTQSKXpgldSOjvNBg89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38285'),
  ('319349070112281363', 'The Country Cousin', 1936, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson, Graham Heid', null, null, 'NR', 'Monty Citymouse invites his cousin Abner Countrymouse for a visit and shows him the ways of the big city, including traps, eating quietly, and busy traffic.', 'Monty Citymouse invites his cousin Abner Countrymouse for a visit and shows him the ways of the big city, including traps, eating quietly, and busy traffic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEYHGahoIQ1oJriICmaIaqKYfof.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80927'),
  ('564659963477589756', 'The Country Doctor', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Thomas Lilti, Nicolas Gaurin, Guillaume Plumejeau', 'Thomas Lilti, Baya Kasmi, Shérazade Khalladi', 'François Cluzet, Marianne Denicourt, Isabelle Sadoyan, Félix Moati, Christophe Odent, Patrick Descamps, Guy Faucher, Margaux Fabre', null, 'All the people in this countryside area, can count on Jean-Pierre, the doctor who auscultates them, heals and reassures them day and night, 7 days a week. Now Jean-Pierre is sick, so he sees Natalie, a young doctor, coming from the hospital to assist him. But will she adapt to this new life and be able to replace the man that believed to be irreplaceable?', 'All the people in this countryside area, can count on Jean-Pierre, the doctor who auscultates them, heals and reassures them day and night, 7 days a week. Now Jean-Pierre is sick, so he sees Natalie, a young doctor, coming from the hospital to assist him. But will she adapt to this new life and be able to replace the man that believed to be irreplaceable?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaXvqkLZlSZIiSb6d3bc81jTb6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375950'),
  ('1071692427880013565', 'The Country Girl', 1954, 'Drama', 'George Seaton, John F. Warren, Francisco Day', 'George Seaton', 'Bing Crosby, Grace Kelly, William Holden, Anthony Ross, Gene Reynolds, Jacqueline Fontaine, Eddie Ryder, Robert Kent', 'NR', 'An actor on the skids is given one more chance to regain his stardom, as well as his self-respect, yet his alcoholism may prevent that from happening.', 'An actor on the skids is given one more chance to regain his stardom, as well as his self-respect, yet his alcoholism may prevent that from happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LdXybdZcTdZo7lkkrFQKf7byZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2438'),
  ('973788008643342811', 'The Country Teacher', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bohdan Sláma, Diviš Marek, Petr Samec', 'Bohdan Sláma', 'Pavel Liška, Zuzana Bydžovská, Marek Daniel, Cyril Drozda, Miroslav Krobot, Zuzana Kronerová, Tereza Ramba, Ladislav Šedivý', null, 'A gifted and well-qualified young teacher takes a job teaching natural sciences at a grammar school in the country. Here he makes the acquaintance of a woman and her troubled 17-year old son. The teacher has no romantic interest in the woman but they quickly form a strong friendship, each recognizing the other''s uncertainties, hopes and longing for love.', 'A gifted and well-qualified young teacher takes a job teaching natural sciences at a grammar school in the country. Here he makes the acquaintance of a woman and her troubled 17-year old son. The teacher has no romantic interest in the woman but they quickly form a strong friendship, each recognizing the other''s uncertainties, hopes and longing for love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0QMtYSN1SDo93IrUcuIWZ06HLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16439'),
  ('602910382055250278', 'The Couple Across the Street', 2026, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Anjali Nayar', 'Peter McLeod', 'Ellen David, William MacDonald, Presley Allard', 'TV-14', 'When a family seeks refuge with their "doomsday prepper" neighbors during a community lockdown, they start to suspect their hosts have dangerous intentions, until a shocking twist reveals the real threat was far closer than they imagined.', 'When a family seeks refuge with their "doomsday prepper" neighbors during a community lockdown, they start to suspect their hosts have dangerous intentions, until a shocking twist reveals the real threat was far closer than they imagined.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F0%2Fgracenote%2F05e0568b3818df414237b22823852606.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-couple-across-the-street-2026'),
  ('459971921228063265', 'The Couple''s Sponsor', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hwang Seong-wook', null, 'Jeong Neom-chyeo, Kim Jin-seon, Lee Hae-jin, Lee Sin-woo', null, 'The section heads of a planning office Ji Hyeon-woo and Jang Myeong-soo get told by Director Han that one of them will have to leave the office if they fail to get promoted. Rumor starts to spread that Jang will lobby Han into his promotion by using his weakness of women. Hyeon-woo is anxious. He tries hard to appeal to Han but doesn''t really cause much influence so he calls up his ex-girlfriend Ji-hyeon. He calls Han to his house and introduces him to her. Han is completely head over heels for the sexy and seductive Ji-hyeon. Meanwhile, Hyeon-woo''s wife is upset because he blamed her for not getting his promotion, so she goes to ''talk to'' Han herself...', 'The section heads of a planning office Ji Hyeon-woo and Jang Myeong-soo get told by Director Han that one of them will have to leave the office if they fail to get promoted. Rumor starts to spread that Jang will lobby Han into his promotion by using his weakness of women. Hyeon-woo is anxious. He tries hard to appeal to Han but doesn''t really cause much influence so he calls up his ex-girlfriend Ji-hyeon. He calls Han to his house and introduces him to her. Han is completely head over heels for the sexy and seductive Ji-hyeon. Meanwhile, Hyeon-woo''s wife is upset because he blamed her for not getting his promotion, so she goes to ''talk to'' Han herself...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zZr0lD26VxcnadkcmZ4UbHglB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471564'),
  ('1033073509033230403', 'The Couples', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Sordi, Mario Monicelli, Vittorio De Sica', null, 'Alberto Sordi, Monica Vitti, Enzo Jannacci, Rossana Di Lorenzo, Luigi Bonos, Kalam Shamsuddin', null, 'Three episodes. Episode 1 - The Refrigerator (Monicelli). A married couple of two poor emigrant workers spend almost all their money to buy a refrigerator (a must in the ''70s). The purchase is too expensive for their family balance sheet. To earn some money they decide to go for prostitution. The wife is not so unhappy to the perspective. Episode 2 - The Room (Sordi). To celebrate ten years of marriage a couple decides to spend a quick holiday in top luxury hotels in Sardinia. But the fashion luxury VIP world is too hard to enter; they soon will end in prison. Episode 3 - The Lion (De Sica). Two adulterous, Antonio and Giulia, are blocked by a lion, staying on the exit in the place they met. They both have to come back home, but couldn''t move because of the lion’s presence. The critical situation soon drives them to their limit, revealing their real essence.', 'Three episodes. Episode 1 - The Refrigerator (Monicelli). A married couple of two poor emigrant workers spend almost all their money to buy a refrigerator (a must in the ''70s). The purchase is too expensive for their family balance sheet. To earn some money they decide to go for prostitution. The wife is not so unhappy to the perspective. Episode 2 - The Room (Sordi). To celebrate ten years of marriage a couple decides to spend a quick holiday in top luxury hotels in Sardinia. But the fashion luxury VIP world is too hard to enter; they soon will end in prison. Episode 3 - The Lion (De Sica). Two adulterous, Antonio and Giulia, are blocked by a lion, staying on the exit in the place they met. They both have to come back home, but couldn''t move because of the lion’s presence. The critical situation soon drives them to their limit, revealing their real essence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DI5mfS6whSbybDdh4wdnpO3Ctr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146132'),
  ('1102917580598554794', 'The Courage of the People', 1971, 'Drama, History', 'Jorge Sanjinés', 'Óscar Soria', 'Domitila de Chungara, Eusebio Gironda, Federico Vallejo, Felicidad Coca García', null, 'A documentary reenactment of the government-ordered massacre of striking tin miners and their families at the Siglo XX Mines in 1967 in Bolivia.', 'A documentary reenactment of the government-ordered massacre of striking tin miners and their families at the Siglo XX Mines in 1967 in Bolivia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VSGORcC1Rn1k9SVADaPp4rvIYH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255797'),
  ('588574380710028551', 'The Courageous', 2026, 'Drama', 'Jasmin Gordon, Andi Widmer', 'Jasmin Gordon, Julien Bouissoux', 'Ophélia Kolb, Paul Besnier, Arthur Devaux, Jasmine Kalisz Saurer, Sabine Timoteo', null, 'In a small town on the edge of wild country, an eccentric and delinquent mother has had enough of the rules. Crushed by her mistakes and by a society that doesn''t give a damn - or a second chance - to people like her, she''ll do anything to prove to her children, and to herself, that she still is a good person.', 'In a small town on the edge of wild country, an eccentric and delinquent mother has had enough of the rules. Crushed by her mistakes and by a society that doesn''t give a damn - or a second chance - to people like her, she''ll do anything to prove to her children, and to herself, that she still is a good person.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fd%2Fgracenote%2Fd8a1beffc6fa7a177c5702559037504f.jpg', 'plex:movie:les-courageux'),
  ('861687443795072916', 'The Courageous Heart of Irena Sendler', 2009, 'Drama, War', 'John Kent Harrison, Jerzy Zieliński', 'John Kent Harrison, Larry Spagnola', 'Anna Paquin, Goran Višnjić, Michelle Dockery, Danuta Stenka, Maja Ostaszewska, Krzysztof Pieczyński, Jerzy Nowak, Rebecca Windheim', 'NR', 'Irena Sendler is a Catholic social worker who has sympathized with the Jews since her childhood, when her physician father died of typhus contracted while treating poor Jewish patients. When she initially proposes saving Jewish children from the Warsaw Ghetto, her idea is met with skepticism by fellow workers, her parish priest, and even her own mother Janina.', 'Irena Sendler is a Catholic social worker who has sympathized with the Jews since her childhood, when her physician father died of typhus contracted while treating poor Jewish patients. When she initially proposes saving Jewish children from the Warsaw Ghetto, her idea is met with skepticism by fellow workers, her parish priest, and even her own mother Janina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfvvws0sCNbNNxY9llsBqmeERxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31169'),
  ('5810481008106036', 'The Courier', 2012, 'Action, Crime', 'Chad Rosen, Brian Heller, Hany Abu-Assad', 'Pete Dris, Brannon Coombs', 'Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Josie Ho, Til Schweiger, Miguel Ferrer, Lili Taylor, Mark Margolis, Mickey Rourke, David Jensen', 'R', 'A shady FBI agent recruits a courier to deliver a mysterious package to a vengeful master criminal who has recently resurfaced with a diabolical plan.', 'A shady FBI agent recruits a courier to deliver a mysterious package to a vengeful master criminal who has recently resurfaced with a diabolical plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie2CLC0GC9mHL4rS8ADpX8uINIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97512'),
  ('801228637750644487', 'The Courier', 2019, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure, Crime', 'Zackary Adler, Adam Hall, Michel Abramowicz', 'Nicky Tate, Andy Conway, Zackary Adler', 'Olga Kurylenko, Gary Oldman, Dermot Mulroney, William Moseley, Alicia Agneson, Amit Shah, Craig Conway, Lee Charles', 'R', 'Ezekiel Mannings, a vicious crime boss, is out to kill Nick, the lone witness set to testify against him. He hires a mysterious female motorcycle courier to unknowingly deliver a poison-gas bomb to slay Nick, but after she rescues Nick from certain death, the duo must confront an army of ruthless hired killers in order to survive the night.', 'Ezekiel Mannings, a vicious crime boss, is out to kill Nick, the lone witness set to testify against him. He hires a mysterious female motorcycle courier to unknowingly deliver a poison-gas bomb to slay Nick, but after she rescues Nick from certain death, the duo must confront an army of ruthless hired killers in order to survive the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jE6QFRd48IzAxAubOE9HKB8sTjP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611914'),
