  ('693396094071759428', 'The Courtyard of the Ballads', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Leonel Vieira', 'Pedro Varela', 'Miguel Guilherme, César Mourão, Dânia Neto, Sara Matos, Rui Unas, Anabela Moreira, Oceana Basílio, Cristovão Campos', null, 'A New age remake of a portguese classic, Pátio das Cantigas shows the lives of a neighbourhood in the Old Lisbon, including their desires, happiness and sadness, always with a good humour.', 'A New age remake of a portguese classic, Pátio das Cantigas shows the lives of a neighbourhood in the Old Lisbon, including their desires, happiness and sadness, always with a good humour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqI3Ih94XuxHAbwhKzBtN7n9gxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335602'),
  ('694655477720080654', 'The Cousin', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aldo Lado', 'Ercole Patti, Massimo Franciosa', 'Massimo Ranieri, Dayle Haddon, Christian De Sica, Laura Betti, Luigi Casellato, Stefania Casini, Loredana Martínez, Francesca Romana Coluzzi', null, 'Italian coming of age story about two cousins, Enzo and Agata, told in three stages.', 'Italian coming of age story about two cousins, Enzo and Agata, told in three stages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EGglGdHpMdDX6w07t6Ns6gidrx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253350'),
  ('646793055943341588', 'The Cousin', 1997, 'Crime', 'Alain Corneau, Michel Amathieu', 'Alain Corneau, Michel Alexandre', 'Patrick Timsit, Alain Chabat, Samuel Le Bihan, Caroline Proust, Mehdi El Glaoui, Christophe Peyroux, Marie Trintignant, Agnès Jaoui', null, 'Nounours is the nickname of a "cousin" an informer with a special arrangement with the police: he gets 10% of the drugs seized thanks to his help. When his personal contact, inspector Maurin, commits suicide, inspector Gérard Delvaux takes over. Meanwhile, judge Lambert is uncovering the illegal practices of the policemen. Her persistent investigations, which had cornered Maurin, are leading to Gérard, and also to Nounours as the source of heroin that led to recent cases of deadly overdoses. Nounours promises Gérard increasingly bigger catches which he is intent on realising before he is forced to reveal who Nounours is to judge Lambert.', 'Nounours is the nickname of a "cousin" an informer with a special arrangement with the police: he gets 10% of the drugs seized thanks to his help. When his personal contact, inspector Maurin, commits suicide, inspector Gérard Delvaux takes over. Meanwhile, judge Lambert is uncovering the illegal practices of the policemen. Her persistent investigations, which had cornered Maurin, are leading to Gérard, and also to Nounours as the source of heroin that led to recent cases of deadly overdoses. Nounours promises Gérard increasingly bigger catches which he is intent on realising before he is forced to reveal who Nounours is to judge Lambert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzqzpOelUkcpChoo3g4tDlet1PF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84644'),
  ('375982669433421672', 'The Cousin', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Víctor Ugalde', 'Vicente Leñero', 'Mark Tacher, Natasha Esca, Jesús Ochoa, María Rojo, Angélica Aragón, Alejandro Camacho, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Marta Aura', null, 'A married woman, who''s husband leaves her alone way too many times, is seduced by a junior spoiled young man, leading her into the fullfillment of her unsatisfied needs.', 'A married woman, who''s husband leaves her alone way too many times, is seduced by a junior spoiled young man, leading her into the fullfillment of her unsatisfied needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MQfTjw3WP8YvSJLzVSb9Kqnmjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387806'),
  ('1054415379860682099', 'The Cousins', 1959, 'Drama', 'Claude Chabrol, Henri Decaë', 'Claude Chabrol', 'Gérard Blain, Jean-Claude Brialy, Juliette Mayniel, Guy Decomble, Geneviève Cluny, Michèle Méritz, Corrado Guarducci, Stéphane Audran', null, 'Young provincial Charles arrives in Paris to stay with his cousin Paul while studying law. Paul is a decadent, bohemian pleasure-seeker who shows the meek, diligent Charles the thrills of city life. When Charles falls for Florence, one of Paul''s acquaintances, relationships begin to shift.', 'Young provincial Charles arrives in Paris to stay with his cousin Paul while studying law. Paul is a decadent, bohemian pleasure-seeker who shows the meek, diligent Charles the thrills of city life. When Charles falls for Florence, one of Paul''s acquaintances, relationships begin to shift.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0p1ps8j2l8pVRw3GModHPdCIBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2363'),
  ('198883407276486520', 'The Cove', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Louie Psihoyos, Brook Aitken', 'Mark Monroe', 'Hayden Panettiere, Joe Chisholm, Mandy-Rae Cruikshank, Charles Hambleton, Simon Hutchins, Kirk Krack, Isabel Lucas, Richard O''Barry', 'PG-13', 'The Cove tells the amazing true story of how an elite team of individuals, films makers and free divers embarked on a covert mission to penetrate the hidden cove in Japan, shining light on a dark and deadly secret. The shocking discoveries were only the tip of the iceberg.', 'The Cove tells the amazing true story of how an elite team of individuals, films makers and free divers embarked on a covert mission to penetrate the hidden cove in Japan, shining light on a dark and deadly secret. The shocking discoveries were only the tip of the iceberg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miodcVtQv2YxpKjjHJWcV0EDfSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23128'),
  ('802940459069198454', 'The Covenant', 2006, 'Fantasy, Horror, Adventure, Action', 'Renny Harlin, Pierre Gill, Sean Dwyer', 'J.S. Cardone', 'Chace Crawford, Taylor Kitsch, Toby Hemingway, Sebastian Stan, Steven Strait, Laura Ramsey, Jessica Lucas, Kyle Schmid', 'PG-13', 'Four young men who belong to a supernatural legacy are forced to battle a fifth power long thought to have died out. Another great force they must contend with is the jealousy and suspicion that threatens to tear them apart.', 'Four young men who belong to a supernatural legacy are forced to battle a fifth power long thought to have died out. Another great force they must contend with is the jealousy and suspicion that threatens to tear them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skHRXm3m0BDp2E2uHkAWKT6OlQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9954'),
  ('298201497124506426', 'The Cover', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Secun de la Rosa, Angie Paul Risque, Johnny Yebra', 'Secun de la Rosa', 'Àlex Monner, Marina Salas, Carolina Yuste, María Hervás, Lander Otaola, Juan Diego, Marco D''Almeida, Carmen Machi', null, 'In Benidorm, a mecca for impersonators of live singers, Dani doesn''t want to be just a cover. He will meet Sandra and discover authenticity, love and what it means not to be one more.', 'In Benidorm, a mecca for impersonators of live singers, Dani doesn''t want to be just a cover. He will meet Sandra and discover authenticity, love and what it means not to be one more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3cB8J1ntlrCfrVJEJaOOOlhF5c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826733'),
  ('1045892791500065949', 'The Covered Wagon', 1923, 'Adventure, Western, Romance', 'James Cruze, Karl Brown', 'Jack Cunningham', 'Lois Wilson, Alan Hale, Ernest Torrence, Tully Marshall, Charles Ogle, J. Warren Kerrigan, Ethel Wales, Guy Oliver', 'NR', 'Two wagon caravans converge at what is now Kansas City, and combine for the westward push to Oregon. On their quest the pilgrims will experience desert heat, mountain snow, hunger, and Indian attack. To complicate matters further, a love triangle develops, as pretty Molly must chose between Sam, a brute, and Will, the dashing captain of the other caravan. Can Will overcome the skeleton in his closet and win Molly''s heart?', 'Two wagon caravans converge at what is now Kansas City, and combine for the westward push to Oregon. On their quest the pilgrims will experience desert heat, mountain snow, hunger, and Indian attack. To complicate matters further, a love triangle develops, as pretty Molly must chose between Sam, a brute, and Will, the dashing captain of the other caravan. Can Will overcome the skeleton in his closet and win Molly''s heart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6aJMPTCXnHh5CDvaI9hnZX2e3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110341'),
  ('377913209561040922', 'The Cow', 1969, 'Drama', 'Dariush Mehrjui, Fereydoun Ghovanloo', 'Dariush Mehrjui', 'Ezzatollah Entezami, Mahin Shahabi, Ali Nasirian, Jamshid Mashayekhi, Firouz Behjat-Mohamadi, Jafar Vali, Khosrow Shojazadeh, Esmat Safavi', null, 'An old villager deeply in love with his cow goes to the capital for a while. While he''s there, the cow dies and now the villagers are afraid of his possible reaction to it when he returns.', 'An old villager deeply in love with his cow goes to the capital for a while. While he''s there, the cow dies and now the villagers are afraid of his possible reaction to it when he returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MVUDF3o1ihrWSgGSvkF7IPesF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43984'),
  ('914194246601720154', 'The Cow', 1989, 'Animation, Drama', 'Aleksandr Petrov', 'Aleksandr Petrov', 'Nikolai Gusarov, Lyubov Teplova, Kostya Panov', null, 'A boy recalls the story of how his family lost its cow. Based on a short story by Andrei Platonov.', 'A boy recalls the story of how his family lost its cow. Based on a short story by Andrei Platonov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLuwNjef9OoFIkh0EfQn2kz3rIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118794'),
