  ('1029172586756651025', 'The Coward', 1965, 'Drama, Romance', 'Amiya Sanyal, Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Soumitra Chatterjee, Madhabi Mukherjee, Haradhan Bandyopadhyay, Santi Chatterjee, Satish Haldar, Deochand Lal', null, 'Amitabha Roy is a Calcutta-based scriptwriter, driving around in the country to collect material for a film. His vehicle breaks down in a small town. A tea planter, Bimal Gupta, offers hospitality for the night. Amitabha is forced to accept the offer as he has no alternative.', 'Amitabha Roy is a Calcutta-based scriptwriter, driving around in the country to collect material for a film. His vehicle breaks down in a small town. A tea planter, Bimal Gupta, offers hospitality for the night. Amitabha is forced to accept the offer as he has no alternative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJFvRbIQ4xx5AQGvsJBnimNtf6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138030'),
  ('296474235485714201', 'The Cowards Who Looked to the Sky', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yuki Tanada, Kato Fumiaki, Ryo Otsuka', 'Kosuke Mukai', 'Kento Nagayama, Tomoko Tabata, Mieko Harada, Takahiro Miura, Masataka Kubota, Ena Koshino, Rie Minemura, Miharu Tanaka', null, 'Based on the award-winning novel of the same name, this boldly erotic yet movingly tender portrait of a group of vulnerable, variously wounded people — a depressed housewife, her high-school-aged lover, and his best friend, who is struggling to provide for himself and his senile grandmother — whose intersecting lives yield both sorrow and a fragile, yet enduring, hope for a brighter future. (TIFF)', 'Based on the award-winning novel of the same name, this boldly erotic yet movingly tender portrait of a group of vulnerable, variously wounded people — a depressed housewife, her high-school-aged lover, and his best friend, who is struggling to provide for himself and his senile grandmother — whose intersecting lives yield both sorrow and a fragile, yet enduring, hope for a brighter future. (TIFF)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJzzkS1g12QyEv4rdHVcUftw28r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127887'),
  ('350980986212417255', 'The Cowboy and the Frenchman', 1988, 'Comedy, Western', 'David Lynch, Frederick Elmes, Scott Cameron', 'David Lynch', 'Harry Dean Stanton, Frederic Golchan, Tracey Walter, Jack Nance, Michael Horse, Rick Guillory, Marie Laurin, Patrick Houser', null, 'A grizzled, hard-of-hearing cowboy, Slim, and his two friends, Dusty and Pete, capture a mysterious, well-dressed Frenchman.', 'A grizzled, hard-of-hearing cowboy, Slim, and his two friends, Dusty and Pete, capture a mysterious, well-dressed Frenchman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WJ0C04DfJSN5c7HmPMuNJCFrIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94295'),
  ('104811704045014784', 'The Cowboy and the Lady', 1938, 'Comedy, Romance, Western', 'James Basevi, Alfred Newman, Edmond F. Bernoudy', 'Sonya Levien, S. N. Behrman', 'Gary Cooper, Merle Oberon, Patsy Kelly, Walter Brennan, Fuzzy Knight, Mabel Todd, Henry Kolker, Harry Davenport', 'NR', 'Mary Smith decides after a lifetime of being a shut-in to do something wild while her father is out campaigning for the presidency, so she takes off for the family''s home in West Palm Beach and inadvertently becomes romantically entangled with earnest cowboy Stretch Willoughby. Neither the dalliance nor the cowboy fit with the upper class image projected by her esteemed father, forcing her to choose.', 'Mary Smith decides after a lifetime of being a shut-in to do something wild while her father is out campaigning for the presidency, so she takes off for the family''s home in West Palm Beach and inadvertently becomes romantically entangled with earnest cowboy Stretch Willoughby. Neither the dalliance nor the cowboy fit with the upper class image projected by her esteemed father, forcing her to choose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IFK76jpZPHlxRBquQSViQERzP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112674'),
  ('891957737132973464', 'The Cowboy Way', 1994, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller, Western', 'Gregg Champion, Dean Semler', 'William D. Wittliff', 'Woody Harrelson, Kiefer Sutherland, Dylan McDermott, Ernie Hudson, Marg Helgenberger, Luis Guzmán, Angel Caban, Joaquín Martínez', 'PG-13', 'Two championship rodeo partners travel to New York to find their missing friend, Nacho Salazar who went missing there.', 'Two championship rodeo partners travel to New York to find their missing friend, Nacho Salazar who went missing there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oBVSzbWD85zRCKIWm0KvhypUZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19176'),
  ('99303304263034461', 'The Cowboys', 1972, 'Western, Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Mark Rydell, Robert Surtees', 'Irving Ravetch, William Dale Jennings, Harriet Frank Jr.', 'John Wayne, Roscoe Lee Browne, Bruce Dern, Colleen Dewhurst, Alfred Barker Jr., Nicolas Beauvy, Steve Benedict, Robert Carradine', 'PG', 'When his cattlemen abandon him for the gold fields, rancher Wil Andersen is forced to take on a collection of young boys as his cowboys in order to get his herd to market in time to avoid financial disaster. The boys learn to do a man''s job under Andersen''s tutelage, however, neither he nor the boys know that a gang of cattle thieves is stalking them.', 'When his cattlemen abandon him for the gold fields, rancher Wil Andersen is forced to take on a collection of young boys as his cowboys in order to get his herd to market in time to avoid financial disaster. The boys learn to do a man''s job under Andersen''s tutelage, however, neither he nor the boys know that a gang of cattle thieves is stalking them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srdRiGV9tYFzWd2C4IjPJNtLrmr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15573'),
  ('295624547058848470', 'The Coyote', 1955, 'Drama, Western', 'Joaquín Romero Marchent, José Luis de la Torre, Jesús Franco', 'Jesús Franco', 'Abel Salazar, Gloria Marín, Manuel Monroy, Santiago Rivero, Rafael Bardem, Carlos Otero, Julio Goróstegui, Lis Rogi', null, 'California, 1848. An invading army has defeated the few opposing forces and the territory has become part of the United States. Don César de Echagüe, an old gentleman, begs his son César to return from Europe, confident that he will know how to confront the oppressor.', 'California, 1848. An invading army has defeated the few opposing forces and the territory has become part of the United States. Don César de Echagüe, an old gentleman, begs his son César to return from Europe, confident that he will know how to confront the oppressor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32twUMFmdw0O7ofi6f3kJUn2KW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60507'),
