  ('153683281496774659', 'The Craft', 1996, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Alexander Gruszynski, Andrew Fleming, Barbara M. Ravis', 'Peter Filardi, Andrew Fleming', 'Robin Tunney, Fairuza Balk, Neve Campbell, Rachel True, Skeet Ulrich, Christine Taylor, Breckin Meyer, Nathaniel Marston', 'R', 'A Catholic school newcomer falls in with a clique of teen witches who wield their powers against all who dare to cross them -- be they teachers, rivals or meddlesome parents.', 'A Catholic school newcomer falls in with a clique of teen witches who wield their powers against all who dare to cross them -- be they teachers, rivals or meddlesome parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bW2RdRkloYtEPhbQZN4wcdmJP4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9100'),
