  ('1043157673578800654', 'The Crater Lake Monster', 1977, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Hal Scharn, William R. Stromberg, Paul Gentry', 'William R. Stromberg, Richard Cardella', 'Richard Cardella, Glen Roberts, Mark Siegel, Bob Hyman, Richard Garrison, Kacey Cobb, Michael F. Hoover, Suzanne Lewis', 'PG', 'The heat of a meteor crashing into the lake incubates a prehistoric egg, which grows into a plesiosaur-like monster that terrifies the community.', 'The heat of a meteor crashing into the lake incubates a prehistoric egg, which grows into a plesiosaur-like monster that terrifies the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEpdGQaagHhpJDBsLemMF5EGolB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37901'),
