  ('625648996953611964', 'The Crazy Capo Affair', 1973, 'Crime', 'Patrick Jamain, Daniel Diot', null, 'Maurice Ronet, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Jean Servais, Antonio Cantafora, Alice Sapritch, Marika Green, Michel Peyrelon, Charles Millot', null, 'Jean Diserens has a double life: he''s a property developer and... drug dealer. He''s looking for a new way to sell it. But his superior, Crazy Capo, doesn''t see things the same way.', 'Jean Diserens has a double life: he''s a property developer and... drug dealer. He''s looking for a new way to sell it. But his superior, Crazy Capo, doesn''t see things the same way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DqW3jOw3woYAFj0R5o7wY1cavj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318672'),
