  ('97431438304110372', 'The Crazy Family', 1984, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Masaki Tamura', 'Yoshinori Kobayashi', 'Katsuya Kobayashi, Mitsuko Baisho, Youki Kudoh, Yoshiki Arizono, Hitoshi Ueki, Kazuhiko Kishino, Akira Ogata, Toyoko Koumi', null, 'Shortly after moving to the suburbs, the Kobayashis start to come undone. Convinced a family curse is at the root of their erratic behavior, the man of the house takes it upon himself to course-correct before it takes the last of their sanity.', 'Shortly after moving to the suburbs, the Kobayashis start to come undone. Convinced a family curse is at the root of their erratic behavior, the man of the house takes it upon himself to course-correct before it takes the last of their sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MlayGlNRFGr3uH4J4zpkjuurYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67255'),
  ('459667899760831930', 'The Crazy Fifty', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Kostas Karagiannis, Pantelis Filippides', 'Costas Pretederis', 'Labros Konstadaras, Rika Dialina, Giorgos Moshidis, Athinodoros Prousalis, Kostas Fyssoun, Nikos Papahristos, Alekos Tzanetakos, Vicky Vanita', null, 'Andreas Tependris, the director of a mannequin school, meets again with an old friend who has returned from America. He proposes to get him a partner in his business, provided that he has grown up and changed his way of life. So, a new life begins for him by pretending the big businessman. But when he meet a wealthy American woman, he loses his mind and even renounces his fiancé. She, with the help of her daughter and his friends, sets him up for a trap to convince him...', 'Andreas Tependris, the director of a mannequin school, meets again with an old friend who has returned from America. He proposes to get him a partner in his business, provided that he has grown up and changed his way of life. So, a new life begins for him by pretending the big businessman. But when he meet a wealthy American woman, he loses his mind and even renounces his fiancé. She, with the help of her daughter and his friends, sets him up for a trap to convince him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCev2LOYPZD3Z5ZDtSPzpvTrsqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398721'),
  ('1101096182129753652', 'The Crazy Life', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Christian Poveda', null, 'José Roberto Martínez, Silvia Portillo López, Ana Burgos Arévalo, José Luis Rosales, Jeaneth Ramírez Villacorta, Erik Palacio López, Cinthya Cuéllar López, Melvin Bonilla Hernández', null, 'A documentary about the rival gangs Mara 18 and Mara Salvatrucha, originating in Los Angeles but terrorizing El Salvador. It explores their origins as possible founding myths of organized crime in a globalized world.', 'A documentary about the rival gangs Mara 18 and Mara Salvatrucha, originating in Los Angeles but terrorizing El Salvador. It explores their origins as possible founding myths of organized crime in a globalized world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTkDaWINi3RtB8FlJ6s8ytJKfTH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25168'),
  ('72455558201830862', 'The Crazy Ray', 1925, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'René Clair, Claude Autant-Lara, Maurice Desfassiaux', 'René Clair', 'Henri Rollan, Madeleine Rodrigue, Albert Préjean, Charles Martinelli, Marcel Vallée, Louis Pré Fils, Myla Seller, Antoine Stacquet', null, 'A night watchman on the Eiffel Tower wakes up to find the entire population of the city frozen in place.', 'A night watchman on the Eiffel Tower wakes up to find the entire population of the city frozen in place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEoZcxj2Zi5P7A5ayPXHy457tlB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47579'),
  ('685397434740089646', 'The Crazy Stranger', 1998, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Éric Guichard, Tony Gatlif', 'Tony Gatlif', 'Romain Duris, Rona Hartner, Izidor Serban, Ovidiu Balan, Angela Serban, Aurica Ursan, Vasile Serban, Ioan Serban', null, 'A man is looking for a singer he had heard on cassette. He finds much more.', 'A man is looking for a singer he had heard on cassette. He finds much more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eM8RuoymwDaMRhR33wWTR1wXijf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5071'),
  ('1149497998350200486', 'The Crazy Westerners', 1967, 'Western', 'Ferdinando Baldi, Enzo Barboni, Bruno Del Gaizo', 'Franco Rossetti, Ferdinando Baldi', 'Rita Pavone, Terence Hill, Lucio Dalla, Teddy Reno, Nina Larker, Pinuccio Ardia, Kirk Morris, Gordon Mitchell', null, 'Little Rita has a dream: she dreams of a better world and she believes that all the evil in the world originates from gold. So she has decided to blow up all the gold she can put her hands on. In her mission she is assisted by the Indian Chief Bisonte Seduto and by her friend Francis. Little Rita kills Ringo and Django, but she is taken prisoner by the Mexican bandit Sancho who wants to steal her gold. Black Star rescues her and seems determined to help her, but does he?', 'Little Rita has a dream: she dreams of a better world and she believes that all the evil in the world originates from gold. So she has decided to blow up all the gold she can put her hands on. In her mission she is assisted by the Indian Chief Bisonte Seduto and by her friend Francis. Little Rita kills Ringo and Django, but she is taken prisoner by the Mexican bandit Sancho who wants to steal her gold. Black Star rescues her and seems determined to help her, but does he?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DeWAKJdbnHdsFi1hz4VlBXjTga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46568'),
  ('865799133585524227', 'The Crazysitter', 1994, 'Comedy, Family', 'Michael McDonald, Christopher Baffa, Mike Mickens', 'Michael McDonald', 'Beverly D''Angelo, Ed Begley Jr., Carol Kane, Brady Bluhm, Rachel Duncan, Phil Hartman, Nell Carter, Lisa Kudrow', 'PG-13', 'When a petty criminal escapes from jail, she lays low by posing as a babysitter for two seemingly precious children. But when she decides to sell them for a quick profit, she gets more than she bargained for.', 'When a petty criminal escapes from jail, she lays low by posing as a babysitter for two seemingly precious children. But when she decides to sell them for a quick profit, she gets more than she bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZN7usPfQPkW3tcE1qnGHZa9ox5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206729'),
  ('409904769541877132', 'The Creation of the Humanoids', 1962, 'Science Fiction', 'Wesley Barry, Hal Mohr', 'Jay Simms', 'Don Megowan, Erica Elliott, Don Doolittle, George Milan, Dudley Manlove, Frances McCann, David Cross, Malcolm Smith', null, 'Many years after a nuclear war, the human survivors have created a new society where much of the work is done by androids, referred to derisively by humans as "clickers". A police official who is concerned that his sister has become involved with an android is sent to investigate a larger rumor that the androids are developing reason and emotion.', 'Many years after a nuclear war, the human survivors have created a new society where much of the work is done by androids, referred to derisively by humans as "clickers". A police official who is concerned that his sister has become involved with an android is sent to investigate a larger rumor that the androids are developing reason and emotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6le9I3KKS3XxAwHMZ06ZrTFla5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69292'),
  ('436490606905887806', 'The Creation of the World', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Eduard Hofman, Zdena Hajdová, Josef Kábrt', 'Adolf Hoffmeister, Eduard Hofman', 'Jan Werich, Georges Aminel, François Périer, Martine Sarcey, André Vessières', null, 'La Création du Monde is among the first animated feature films made in France. But to be exact, the film was animated in Czechoslovakia and directed by Eduard Hofman. It is adapted from a series of five books by Jean Effel, a French caricaturist and illustrator. The visual style is adapted from his drawings. The film is a comedy about the creation of the universe in six days, with the devil messing around and contributing in his own way.', 'La Création du Monde is among the first animated feature films made in France. But to be exact, the film was animated in Czechoslovakia and directed by Eduard Hofman. It is adapted from a series of five books by Jean Effel, a French caricaturist and illustrator. The visual style is adapted from his drawings. The film is a comedy about the creation of the universe in six days, with the devil messing around and contributing in his own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwx1jxQ15pDazvy75bF9atNp8Hi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132225'),
  ('869851627721883494', 'The Creator', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Chalee Sankhavesa, Oren Soffer, Greig Fraser', 'Chris Weitz, Gareth Edwards', 'John David Washington, Madeleine Yuna Voyles, Gemma Chan, Allison Janney, Ken Watanabe, Sturgill Simpson, Amar Chadha-Patel, Marc Menchaca', 'PG-13', 'Amid a future war between the human race and the forces of artificial intelligence, a hardened ex-special forces agent grieving the disappearance of his wife, is recruited to hunt down and kill the Creator, the elusive architect of advanced AI who has developed a mysterious weapon with the power to end the war—and mankind itself.', 'Amid a future war between the human race and the forces of artificial intelligence, a hardened ex-special forces agent grieving the disappearance of his wife, is recruited to hunt down and kill the Creator, the elusive architect of advanced AI who has developed a mysterious weapon with the power to end the war—and mankind itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dSivDtOuyxLDxPH4v2tcNG1fP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670292'),
  ('1080710749717533705', 'The Creature Walks Among Us', 1956, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'John Sherwood, Maury Gertsman', 'Arthur A. Ross', 'Rex Reason, Jeff Morrow, Leigh Snowden, Gregg Palmer, Maurice Manson, James Rawley, David McMahon, Paul Fierro', null, 'Scientists surgically transform the Creature into an air-breather, but being able to live on land is not enough to make him comfortable with humans. Enraged, he turns his wrath on anyone who comes near as he desperately tries to return to the deep-water world where he truly belongs.', 'Scientists surgically transform the Creature into an air-breather, but being able to live on land is not enough to make him comfortable with humans. Enraged, he turns his wrath on anyone who comes near as he desperately tries to return to the deep-water world where he truly belongs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lygDmTXJgynNuHkXH0PjJidXQ0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39408'),
  ('544536619028168764', 'The Creatures', 1966, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Agnès Varda, William Lubtchansky, Willy Kurant', 'Agnès Varda', 'Catherine Deneuve, Michel Piccoli, Eva Dahlbeck, Marie-France Mignal, Britta Pettersson, Ursula Vian-Kübler, Jeanne Allard, Joëlle Gozzi', 'NR', 'A writer decides to use the strange inhabitants of a small island as a basis for characters in his new book.', 'A writer decides to use the strange inhabitants of a small island as a basis for characters in his new book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Au7UmEA1gnUPIljLFPwb180WOkh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53026'),
  ('613375772748689538', 'The Creeper', 1948, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Jean Yarbrough, George Robinson', 'Maurice Tombragel', 'Eduardo Ciannelli, Onslow Stevens, June Vincent, Ralph Morgan, Janis Wilson, John Baragrey, Richard Lane, Philip Ahn', 'NR', 'Dr. Morgan and Dr. Cavigny star as a brace of scientists who return from the West Indies with a potent, phosphorescent serum that allegedly changes human beings into cats.', 'Dr. Morgan and Dr. Cavigny star as a brace of scientists who return from the West Indies with a potent, phosphorescent serum that allegedly changes human beings into cats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcUla9Mf5b1Hh90bvwI5BcSshAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263554'),
  ('725969820928035727', 'The Creeping', 2022, 'Horror', null, null, 'Riann Steele, Sophie Thompson, Jane Lowe, Taliyah Blair, Jonathan Nyati, David Horovitch, Peter MacQueen, Phillipa Peak', null, 'Due to a traumatic childhood experience Anna is estranged from her family and hasn’t returned home for many years. With her ailing grandmother and only living relative, Lucy, suffering from increasingly worse symptoms of dementia, Anna moves home to look after her. Soon after, strange things begin happening. Though benign at first, events soon escalate into a nightmarish fight for her life against a malevolent presence. She discovers the ordeal is linked to a dark family secret, a tragic past that’s haunted Anna her whole life… and Lucy’s fading memories could be the key to solving the mystery and surviving the nightmare.', 'Due to a traumatic childhood experience Anna is estranged from her family and hasn’t returned home for many years. With her ailing grandmother and only living relative, Lucy, suffering from increasingly worse symptoms of dementia, Anna moves home to look after her. Soon after, strange things begin happening. Though benign at first, events soon escalate into a nightmarish fight for her life against a malevolent presence. She discovers the ordeal is linked to a dark family secret, a tragic past that’s haunted Anna her whole life… and Lucy’s fading memories could be the key to solving the mystery and surviving the nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFcvY2tVKz9hfsopbZhTxvDbjkh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:969725'),
  ('742326114401620977', 'The Creeping Flesh', 1973, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Freddie Francis, Norman Warwick', 'Peter Spenceley, Jonathan Rumbold', 'Peter Cushing, Lorna Heilbron, Christopher Lee, George Benson, Catherine Finn, Hedger Wallace, Duncan Lamont, Kenneth J. Warren', 'PG', 'A Victorian scientist returns to London with his paleontological bag-of-bones discovery from Papua New Guinea. Unfortunately, when exposed to water, flesh returns to the bones, unleashing a malevolent entity on the scientist''s family and friends.', 'A Victorian scientist returns to London with his paleontological bag-of-bones discovery from Papua New Guinea. Unfortunately, when exposed to water, flesh returns to the bones, unleashing a malevolent entity on the scientist''s family and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tC6nxcNqXOcp10JbFI2cGZkXhjL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42469'),
  ('520415098445510497', 'The Creeping Terror', 1964, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Vic Savage, Andrew Janczak', null, 'Vic Savage, Shannon O''Neil, John Caresio, William Thourlby, Brendon Boone, Larry Burrell, Jack King, Pierre Kopp', null, 'A newlywed sheriff tries to stop a shambling monster that has emerged from a spaceship to eat people.', 'A newlywed sheriff tries to stop a shambling monster that has emerged from a spaceship to eat people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j42kpHXElHEfr4Cqb1YDQmWDndV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31275'),
  ('357944612388155961', 'The Creeps', 1997, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Charles Band, Adolfo Bartoli', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'Rhonda Griffin, Justin Lauer, Bill Moynihan, Kristin Norton, Jon Simanton, Joe Smith, Thomas Wellington, Phil Fondacaro', 'PG-13', 'Mad scientist brings Dracula, the Wolfman, the Mummy, and Frankenstein''s Monster to life... but there''s a problem and they end up three feet tall.', 'Mad scientist brings Dracula, the Wolfman, the Mummy, and Frankenstein''s Monster to life... but there''s a problem and they end up three feet tall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yE4naOilLTXxBCo2ZKDjA8UmPgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73303'),
  ('409251184867940092', 'The Cremator', 1969, 'Horror, Drama, Comedy', 'Juraj Herz, Květa Lehovcová, Vladimír Blažek', 'Juraj Herz, Ladislav Fuks', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Vlasta Chramostová, Jana Stehnová, Miloš Vognič, Ilja Prachař, Zora Božinová, Eduard Kohout, Jiří Lír', null, 'In 1930s Prague, a Czech cremator who firmly believes cremation relieves one from earthly suffering is drawn inexorably to Nazism.', 'In 1930s Prague, a Czech cremator who firmly believes cremation relieves one from earthly suffering is drawn inexorably to Nazism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9or2Jzw9HOE4gp9niwXBkZdpTVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18352'),
  ('584655125064713481', 'The Cremators', 1972, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Harry Essex, Robert Caramico', 'Harry Essex', 'Maria De Aragon, Marvin Howard, Eric Sinclair, Mason Caulfield, R.N. Bullard, Cecil Reddick, Tim Frawley, Jax Jason Carroll', 'PG', 'An alien life form, resembling glowing rocks, summons forth a huge, rolling ball of fire, whenever threatened, that incinerates people.', 'An alien life form, resembling glowing rocks, summons forth a huge, rolling ball of fire, whenever threatened, that incinerates people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lOox9krlgwCcIr8IaCNmYiybHk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188628'),
  ('919533219866267118', 'The Crew', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Carl Colpaert, Geza Sinkovics', 'Carl Colpaert, Lance Smith', 'Viggo Mortensen, Donal Logue, Jeremy Sisto, Pamela Gidley, Laura del Sol, John Philbin, Sam Sorbo, Grace Zabriskie', null, 'Still depressed over the suicide of his mother, Bill has no idea that he''s in for a wild ride when he and his wife Jennifer board the yacht owned by her bigoted lawyer brother. Along for the trip: a rock musician and his wife, as well as the newly sex-changed Tim, and the woman he''s smuggling into the U.S.', 'Still depressed over the suicide of his mother, Bill has no idea that he''s in for a wild ride when he and his wife Jennifer board the yacht owned by her bigoted lawyer brother. Along for the trip: a rock musician and his wife, as well as the newly sex-changed Tim, and the woman he''s smuggling into the U.S.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xx6d3kt6YZzcYkRQLP84h3kpevP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250610'),
  ('666174362397043402', 'The Crew', 2000, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Juan Ruiz Anchía, Michael Dinner', 'Michael Dinner', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Burt Reynolds, Dan Hedaya, Seymour Cassel, Carrie-Anne Moss, Jennifer Tilly, Lainie Kazan, Miguel Sandoval', 'PG-13', 'Four retired mobsters plan one last crime to save their retirement home.', 'Four retired mobsters plan one last crime to save their retirement home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdQOz5enVVz113zZQcuoqh3oACy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19150'),
  ('1018856090092967247', 'The Crew', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Adrian Vitoria', 'Ian Brady', 'Scot Williams, Kenny Doughty, Rory McCann, Stephen Graham, Rosie Fellner, Philip Olivier, Tim Dantay, Raza Jaffrey', 'R', 'Hoping to raise enough capital to finance a legitimate business and leave behind his life of crime, Liverpool underworld boss Ged Brennan sends his brother Ratter and a crew to pull a daring final heist. But when Ratter kills a drug kingpin during the job, Brennan must turn to rival crook Franner to avert an all-out gangland war.', 'Hoping to raise enough capital to finance a legitimate business and leave behind his life of crime, Liverpool underworld boss Ged Brennan sends his brother Ratter and a crew to pull a daring final heist. But when Ratter kills a drug kingpin during the job, Brennan must turn to rival crook Franner to avert an all-out gangland war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDSuRzCRM9a2N8L6nDC5KQFoHRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14575'),
  ('604152762512209502', 'The Crew', 2016, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Julien Leclercq, Philip Lozano, James Canal', 'Julien Leclercq, Simon Moutaïrou', 'Sami Bouajila, Guillaume Gouix, Youssef Hajdi, Redouane Behache, Kahina Carina, David Saracino, Alice de Lencquesaing, Baya Belal', null, 'One of the members of a gang of thieves commits a serious mistake that force them to work for a ruthless gang of drug dealers, endangering the future of the team, their lives and those of their families.', 'One of the members of a gang of thieves commits a serious mistake that force them to work for a ruthless gang of drug dealers, endangering the future of the team, their lives and those of their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zq4QUvbPS2bf6mesCPW04awrBoJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393717'),
  ('268536098911523197', 'The Cricket', 1980, 'Drama', 'Alberto Lattuada, Danilo Desideri', 'Franco Ferrini, Alberto Lattuada', 'Virna Lisi, Anthony Franciosa, Renato Salvatori, Clio Goldsmith, Barbara De Rossi, Antonio Cantafora, Aristide Caporale, Antonello Fassari', null, 'An impressionable young woman''s relationship with an aging prostitute leads to a job as a maid at a brothel.', 'An impressionable young woman''s relationship with an aging prostitute leads to a job as a maid at a brothel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/os72UaQjE0EiDnWGT0fbQ5VCwze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42154'),
  ('1061596643805344526', 'The Crime Is Mine', 2023, 'Crime, Comedy, Mystery, Drama', 'François Ozon, Manuel Dacosse, Marion Dehaene', 'François Ozon', 'Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Rebecca Marder, Isabelle Huppert, Fabrice Luchini, Dany Boon, André Dussollier, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Édouard Sulpice', null, 'In 1930s Paris, Madeleine, a pretty, young, penniless, and talentless actress, is accused of murdering a famous producer. Helped by her best friend, Pauline, a young, unemployed lawyer, she is acquitted on the grounds of self-defense. A new life of fame and success begins, until the truth comes out.', 'In 1930s Paris, Madeleine, a pretty, young, penniless, and talentless actress, is accused of murdering a famous producer. Helped by her best friend, Pauline, a young, unemployed lawyer, she is acquitted on the grounds of self-defense. A new life of fame and success begins, until the truth comes out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcvhE2JWsidOxHL7yXk3MXs4vyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977506'),
  ('967836205729630416', 'The Crime of Bordadores Street', 1946, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Enrique Barreyre, Enrique F. Sagaseta, Edgar Neville', 'Edgar Neville', 'Manuel Luna, Mary Delgado, Antonia Plana, Julia Lajos, Rafael Calvo, José Prada, José Franco, Julia Pachelo', null, 'Madrid, late 19th century. A wealthy woman is found murdered in her home and her maid seems to be the main suspect; but her statement further entangles the case.', 'Madrid, late 19th century. A wealthy woman is found murdered in her home and her maid seems to be the main suspect; but her statement further entangles the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTy8J7rshwP93k90XPKKh2HAwEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138644'),
  ('177237608356771870', 'The Crime of Cacaro Gumaro', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Emilio Portes', 'Armando Vega Gil, Andrés Bustamante, Emilio Portes', 'Carlos Corona, Alejandro Calva, Andrés Bustamante, Ana de la Reguera, Eduardo Manzano, Jesús Ochoa, María Rojo, Xavier López', null, 'After their fathers death, two brothers dispute the inheritance: the local movie theater known as Linterna Mújica. Their dispute may or not bring the town to its apocalypse, but it will for sure turn it upside-down.', 'After their fathers death, two brothers dispute the inheritance: the local movie theater known as Linterna Mújica. Their dispute may or not bring the town to its apocalypse, but it will for sure turn it upside-down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2hUnS67DPzWV5OyLcXpHfRvlmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250193'),
  ('694291494206862091', 'The Crime of Cuenca', 1981, 'Drama, History', 'Pilar Miró, Miguel Ángel Díez, Hans Burmann', 'Lola Salvador, Pilar Miró', 'Amparo Soler Leal, Héctor Alterio, Daniel Dicenta, José Manuel Cervino, Mary Carrillo, Francisco Casares, Eduardo Calvo, José Vivó', null, 'Osa de la Vega, Cuenca, Spain, 1913. Gregorio and León, employees on the estate of the village''s mayor, a powerful landowner, are arrested and accused of the murder of José María el Cepa, a shepherd who mysteriously disappeared three years earlier.', 'Osa de la Vega, Cuenca, Spain, 1913. Gregorio and León, employees on the estate of the village''s mayor, a powerful landowner, are arrested and accused of the murder of José María el Cepa, a shepherd who mysteriously disappeared three years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmfZkB8HrYv7HAZK2gVLRkUqbJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105419'),
  ('269445141815295617', 'The Crime of Doctor Crespi', 1935, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery', 'John H. Auer, Larry Williams', 'Lou Goldberg, John H. Auer, Edward Olmstead', 'Erich von Stroheim, Dwight Frye, Paul Guilfoyle, Geraldine Kay, Harriet Russell, Jean Brooks, John Bohn, Patsy Berlin', 'NR', 'A crazed scientist invents a serum that induces a catatonic state in anyone who gets the injection. He uses the serum to paralyze his enemies, in order to bury them alive.', 'A crazed scientist invents a serum that induces a catatonic state in anyone who gets the injection. He uses the serum to paralyze his enemies, in order to bury them alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPflUQKHuEckH2c5Ipb2gKkQSl0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177232'),
  ('862911676792148029', 'The Crime of Father Amaro', 2005, 'Drama', 'Carlos Coelho da Silva, Mário Castanheira, Inês Carvalho', 'Vera Sacramento', 'Jorge Corrula, Soraia Chaves, Nicolau Breyner, Glória Férias , Ana Bustorff, Cláudia Semedo, Nuno Melo, Margarida Miranda', null, 'A young priest commits a crime when he falls in love with a beautiful and troubled woman. Based on O Crime do Padre Amaro ("The Crime of Father Amaro"), a novel by the 19th-century Portuguese writer José Maria de Eça de Queiroz. It was first published in 1875 to great controversy.', 'A young priest commits a crime when he falls in love with a beautiful and troubled woman. Based on O Crime do Padre Amaro ("The Crime of Father Amaro"), a novel by the 19th-century Portuguese writer José Maria de Eça de Queiroz. It was first published in 1875 to great controversy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b100qiTWwnPEQCLy14U5L1W09Tw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32925'),
  ('1086612831658360110', 'The Crime of Monsieur Lange', 1936, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Jean Bachelet, Jean Renoir', 'Jean Renoir', 'René Lefèvre, Florelle, Jules Berry, Marcel Lévesque, Odette Talazac, Nadia Sibirskaïa, Henri Guisol, Maurice Baquet', null, 'Mild-mannered novelist of Western fiction, Amédée Lange, and his colleagues take over a publishing house after their exploitative boss disappears, only for the superior to return and try to reclaim the profits from their successful cooperative.', 'Mild-mannered novelist of Western fiction, Amédée Lange, and his colleagues take over a publishing house after their exploitative boss disappears, only for the superior to return and try to reclaim the profits from their successful cooperative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCGunDNK9UGecWF5d1vEKkLbVuE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52677'),
  ('198052850599671357', 'The Crime of Padre Amaro', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Guillermo Granillo, Carlos Carrera', 'Vicente Leñero', 'Gael García Bernal, Ana Claudia Talancón, Sancho Gracia, Angélica Aragón, Luisa Huertas, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Gastón Melo, Damián Alcázar', 'R', 'Sent to Mexico to help take care of aging Father Benito, young Father Amaro faces a moral challenge when he meets a 16-year-old girl who he starts an affair with. Likewise, the girl''s mother had been having an affair with Father Benito. Father Amaro must choose between a holy or sinful life.', 'Sent to Mexico to help take care of aging Father Benito, young Father Amaro faces a moral challenge when he meets a 16-year-old girl who he starts an affair with. Likewise, the girl''s mother had been having an affair with Father Benito. Father Amaro must choose between a holy or sinful life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqwt2DKcQV6EeSwXuYTk7pkLFii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542'),
  ('309570820625605691', 'The Crime of the Century', 1933, 'Crime, Mystery', 'William Beaudine, David Abel', 'Florence Ryerson, Brian Marlow', 'Jean Hersholt, Wynne Gibson, Stuart Erwin, Frances Dee, Gordon Westcott, Robert Elliott, David Landau, William Janney', 'NR', 'Driven to desperation by his young and extravagant wife, alienist Dr. Emil Brandt has arranged a perfect crime; now he begs the police to lock him up before he can commit it.', 'Driven to desperation by his young and extravagant wife, alienist Dr. Emil Brandt has arranged a perfect crime; now he begs the police to lock him up before he can commit it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54wU2Gt25VRubF0QIh8Gu1hIlzh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120930'),
  ('150124554430782761', 'The Crimes of Stephen Hawke', 1936, 'Horror, Mystery', 'George King, Ronald Kinnoch', 'Jack Celestin, H.F. Maltby, Paul White', 'Tod Slaughter, Marjorie Taylor, D.J. Williams, Eric Portman, Graham Soutten, Gerald Barry, George M. Slater, Charles Penrose', null, 'The film begins in a BBC studio with the 100th edition of "In Town Tonight". Flotsam and Jetsom open with a "topical number". Then there is an interview with a distinguished actor, which dissolves into a performance of one of his famous melodramas about a wicked moneylender etc.', 'The film begins in a BBC studio with the 100th edition of "In Town Tonight". Flotsam and Jetsom open with a "topical number". Then there is an interview with a distinguished actor, which dissolves into a performance of one of his famous melodramas about a wicked moneylender etc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6xSK3LQTVOKrE1Xo9eiy3hrN4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126451'),
  ('806797469341312462', 'The Crimes of the Black Cat', 1972, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Sergio Pastore, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Sergio Pastore, Giovanni Simonelli, Sandro Continenza', 'Anthony Steffen, Sylva Koscina, Giovanna Lenzi, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Shirley Corrigan, Renato De Carmine, Umberto Raho, Annabella Incontrera', 'R', 'In Copenhagen, a blind pianist hunts the culprit in string of murders, each linked by the presence of a yellow shawl and a black cat.', 'In Copenhagen, a blind pianist hunts the culprit in string of murders, each linked by the presence of a yellow shawl and a black cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2RBt72s9iJxLf0S44PSBkzGNYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29165'),
  ('771842509342039167', 'The Crimes That Bind', 2018, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Katsuo Fukuzawa', 'Jeong-mi Lee', 'Hiroshi Abe, Nanako Matsushima, Junpei Mizobata, Rena Tanaka, Fumiyo Kohinata, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Ran Ito, Hiyori Sakurada', null, 'Michiko Oshitani, who lived in Shiga Prefecture, is found dead at an apartment in Tokyo. She was strangled to death. Mutsuo Koshikawa is the owner of the apartment and he goes missing. Detectives including Yuhei Matsumiya who is a cousin of Detective Kyoichiro Kaga , have difficulties in solving the case. They can''t find a connection between Michiko Oshitani and Mutsuo Koshikawa. They soon learn that Michiko Oshitani came to Tokyo to visit Hiromi Asai . They graduated from the same school, but there isn''t a connection between Hiromi Asai and Mutsuo Koshikawa. Detective Yuhei Matsumiya finds something near Michiko Oshitani''s body. That something has the names of 12 bridges surrounding the Nihonbashi area of Tokyo. Detective Kyoichiro Kaga learns of the clue and becomes agitated. There''s a connection with his late mother', 'Michiko Oshitani, who lived in Shiga Prefecture, is found dead at an apartment in Tokyo. She was strangled to death. Mutsuo Koshikawa is the owner of the apartment and he goes missing. Detectives including Yuhei Matsumiya who is a cousin of Detective Kyoichiro Kaga , have difficulties in solving the case. They can''t find a connection between Michiko Oshitani and Mutsuo Koshikawa. They soon learn that Michiko Oshitani came to Tokyo to visit Hiromi Asai . They graduated from the same school, but there isn''t a connection between Hiromi Asai and Mutsuo Koshikawa. Detective Yuhei Matsumiya finds something near Michiko Oshitani''s body. That something has the names of 12 bridges surrounding the Nihonbashi area of Tokyo. Detective Kyoichiro Kaga learns of the clue and becomes agitated. There''s a connection with his late mother', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpFc6yyIUQnpqONMkAIaNT1a6yz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479034'),
  ('4113291887952285', 'The Crimes That Bind', 2020, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Sebastián Schindel, Julián Apezteguia', 'Pablo Del Teso, Sebastián Schindel', 'Cecilia Roth, Miguel Ángel Solá, Benjamín Amadeo, Sofía Gala Castiglione, Yanina Ávila, Marcelo Subiotto, Paola Barrientos, Diego Cremonesi', null, 'When her son is accused of raping and trying to murder his ex-wife, Alicia embarks on a journey that will change her life forever.', 'When her son is accused of raping and trying to murder his ex-wife, Alicia embarks on a journey that will change her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bw4Sk7pXeZOw65mDWuOIy2oKYdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632618'),
  ('237508644901462464', 'The Criminal', 1960, 'Crime', 'Joseph Losey, Buddy Booth, Robert Krasker', 'Alun Owen', 'Stanley Baker, Sam Wanamaker, Grégoire Aslan, Margit Saad, Jill Bennett, Rupert Davies, Laurence Naismith, John Van Eyssen', null, 'When a robbery at a racetrack goes wrong ex-con Johnny Bannion is caught and sent back to prison. He won''t tell the rest of the gang where he has stashed the loot leading to violent consequences.', 'When a robbery at a racetrack goes wrong ex-con Johnny Bannion is caught and sent back to prison. He won''t tell the rest of the gang where he has stashed the loot leading to violent consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbBJuVwx47pFifrdBnmHWxlCSf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30784'),
  ('840350819004234474', 'The Criminal Code', 1931, 'Crime, Drama', 'Howard Hawks, James Wong Howe, Ted Tetzlaff', null, 'Walter Huston, Phillips Holmes, Constance Cummings, Boris Karloff, DeWitt Jennings, Mary Doran, Ethel Wales, Clark Marshall', null, 'After young Robert Graham commits a murder while drunk and defending his girlfriend, he is prosecuted by ambitious Mark Brady and sentenced to 10 years. Six years later, Brady becomes the prison warden and offers the beleaguered Robert a job as his chauffeur. Robert cleans up his act, but, on the eve of his pardon, his cellmate drags him back into the world of violence, and he faces a difficult choice that could return him to prison.', 'After young Robert Graham commits a murder while drunk and defending his girlfriend, he is prosecuted by ambitious Mark Brady and sentenced to 10 years. Six years later, Brady becomes the prison warden and offers the beleaguered Robert a job as his chauffeur. Robert cleans up his act, but, on the eve of his pardon, his cellmate drags him back into the world of violence, and he faces a difficult choice that could return him to prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nshRsmnw7wpE2fsRkVrCED7uCcI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42815'),
  ('1080245345652385463', 'The Criminal Life of Archibaldo de la Cruz', 1955, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Luis Buñuel, Luis Abadié, Agustín Jiménez', 'Luis Buñuel, Eduardo Ugarte', 'Ernesto Alonso, Miroslava, Rita Macedo, Andrea Palma, Rodolfo Landa, Ariadna Welter, José María Linares Rivas, Leonor Llausás', null, 'A bizarre black comedy about a man whose overwhelming ambition in life is to be a renowned serial killer of women, and will stop at nothing to achieve it - but not everything goes according to plan...', 'A bizarre black comedy about a man whose overwhelming ambition in life is to be a renowned serial killer of women, and will stop at nothing to achieve it - but not everything goes according to plan...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqXjXse7cFbQyyA4dGinvZ3krjk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37628'),
  ('277706840202025197', 'The Criminals', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Tudor Mircea, Serhat Karaaslan, Esat Ekinci', 'Serhat Karaaslan', 'Deniz Altan, Lorin Merhart, Ercan Kesal, Erdem Şenocak, Cem Baza, Banu Fotocan, S. Emrah Özdemir', null, 'Late at night in a small Turkish town, a young couple tries to find a hotel room to spend the night together. They are rejected from all hotels for not having a marriage certificate. Once they believe they’ve found a trick to use, the situation gets out of hand.', 'Late at night in a small Turkish town, a young couple tries to find a hotel room to spend the night together. They are rejected from all hotels for not having a marriage certificate. Once they believe they’ve found a trick to use, the situation gets out of hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pyGuzxwdmqd5fJ9Tsg7e94Tuuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:775140'),
  ('317102708380785030', 'The Crimson Curtain', 1953, 'Drama', 'Alexandre Astruc, Eugen Schüfftan', 'Alexandre Astruc', 'Anouk Aimée, Jean-Claude Pascal, Marguerite Garcya, Jim Gérald, Yves Furet', null, 'A twenty year old Anouk Aimée stars as Albertine, the daughter of a bourgeois couple who house a young officer during the Napoleonic wars. Newly promoted, the officer (Jean-Claude Pascal) is quartered by a dull bourgeois couple who treat him with a cold politeness bordering on indifference.', 'A twenty year old Anouk Aimée stars as Albertine, the daughter of a bourgeois couple who house a young officer during the Napoleonic wars. Newly promoted, the officer (Jean-Claude Pascal) is quartered by a dull bourgeois couple who treat him with a cold politeness bordering on indifference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/769TYu5UmfVFHCNO5uBuXcXEoz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258430'),
  ('981741590055859029', 'The Crimson Ghost', 1946, 'Adventure, Action, Crime', 'Fred C. Brannon, William Witney, Bud Thackery', 'Jesse Duffy, Albert DeMond, Sol Shor', 'Charles Quigley, Linda Stirling, Clayton Moore, I. Stanford Jolley, Kenne Duncan, Forrest Taylor, Emmett Vogan, Sam Flint', 'NR', 'A criminal mastermind known as The Crimson Ghost is out to steal a device called the Cyclotrode, which can short-circuit all electrical current on the planet.', 'A criminal mastermind known as The Crimson Ghost is out to steal a device called the Cyclotrode, which can short-circuit all electrical current on the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPeOOojYGCqPs1QWN3XtXUmRDjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230762'),
  ('255079653521109447', 'The Crimson Kimono', 1959, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Samuel Fuller, Sam Leavitt, Floyd Joyer', 'Samuel Fuller', 'Victoria Shaw, James Shigeta, Glenn Corbett, Anna Lee, Paul Dubov, Jaclynne Greene, Neyle Morrow, Gloria Pall', 'NR', 'Two detectives clash over the hunt for a burlesque dancer’s killer in Los Angeles’ Japanese district.', 'Two detectives clash over the hunt for a burlesque dancer’s killer in Los Angeles’ Japanese district.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRliO7Rg1C2zSXtWOhMWOAzuzFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27045'),
  ('224994286469809193', 'The Crimson Permanent Assurance', 1983, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Terry Gilliam, Roger Pratt, Gary White', 'Terry Gilliam', 'Sydney Arnold, Guy Bertrand, Andrew Bicknell, Ross Davidson, Myrtle Devenish, Tim Douglas, Matt Frewer, Billy John', 'PG', 'A group of down-and-out accountants mutiny against their bosses and sail their office building onto the high seas in search of a pirate''s life.', 'A group of down-and-out accountants mutiny against their bosses and sail their office building onto the high seas in search of a pirate''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j275i2tKPDXpvpo5gWTGGcPxczc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39005'),
  ('765936322894535791', 'The Crimson Pirate', 1952, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Otto Heller, Robert Siodmak, Gus Agosti', 'Roland Kibbee', 'Burt Lancaster, Nick Cravat, Eva Bartok, Torin Thatcher, James Hayter, Leslie Bradley, Margot Grahame, Noel Purcell', 'NR', 'Burt Lancaster plays a pirate with a taste for intrigue and acrobatics who involves himself in the goings on of a revolution in the Caribbean in the late 1700s. A light hearted adventure involving prison breaks, an oddball scientist, sailing ships, naval fights and tons of swordplay.', 'Burt Lancaster plays a pirate with a taste for intrigue and acrobatics who involves himself in the goings on of a revolution in the Caribbean in the late 1700s. A light hearted adventure involving prison breaks, an oddball scientist, sailing ships, naval fights and tons of swordplay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOSqs9ntb2wB7gveCx2l7cqC1nG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11570'),
  ('371249071174374509', 'The Crimson Rivers', 2000, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Thierry Arbogast', 'Jean-Christophe Grangé', 'Jean Reno, Vincent Cassel, Nadia Farès, Dominique Sanda, Karim Belkhadra, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Didier Flamand, Philippe Nahon', 'R', 'Two French policemen, one investigating a grisly murder at a remote mountain college, the other working on the desecration of a young girl''s grave by skinheads, are brought together by the clues from their respective cases. Soon after they start working together, more murders are committed, and the pair begin to discover just what dark secrets are behind the killings.', 'Two French policemen, one investigating a grisly murder at a remote mountain college, the other working on the desecration of a young girl''s grave by skinheads, are brought together by the clues from their respective cases. Soon after they start working together, more murders are committed, and the pair begin to discover just what dark secrets are behind the killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npvDhiKkpQBuTaQ8cbWRT2iEfkE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60670'),
  ('221167655845322856', 'The Crimson Wing: Mystery of the Flamingos', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Matthew Aeberhard, Leander Ward, Matthew Aeberhard', 'Melanie Finn', 'Mariella Frostrup, Zabou Breitman, Karoline Herfurth', 'G', 'In the remote and forgotten wilderness of Lake Natron, in northern Tanzania, one of nature''s last great mysteries unfolds: the birth, life and death of a million crimson-winged flamingos.', 'In the remote and forgotten wilderness of Lake Natron, in northern Tanzania, one of nature''s last great mysteries unfolds: the birth, life and death of a million crimson-winged flamingos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zq3vC7rimcP74BwofNJCjyNce8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36569'),
  ('892920036376361230', 'The Crippled Masters', 1979, 'Action', 'Law Chi, Chin Chang-Tung', null, 'Shun Chung-Chuen, Thomas Hong Chiu-Ming, He Jiu, Chen Mu-Chuan, Li Chung-Chien, Hsiang Mei-Lung, Ma Chang, Chang Chung-Kui', 'R', 'Two men, one a lowly peon and the other a dutiful nobleman, are betrayed by their master and crippled for life-- One left with no arms and the other with paralyzed legs. Despite their obvious disadvantages, they strive to seek revenge against their evil master. The two men endeavor to track down the fabled Eight Jade Horses, said to hold the key to special martial arts techniques.', 'Two men, one a lowly peon and the other a dutiful nobleman, are betrayed by their master and crippled for life-- One left with no arms and the other with paralyzed legs. Despite their obvious disadvantages, they strive to seek revenge against their evil master. The two men endeavor to track down the fabled Eight Jade Horses, said to hold the key to special martial arts techniques.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRzJWB0DfwE54tzEwKS2SBNbfSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54858'),
  ('107783829983528223', 'The Crisis', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Coline Serreau, Robert Alazraki, Élisabeth Parnière', 'Coline Serreau', 'Vincent Lindon, Patrick Timsit, Zabou Breitman, Maria Pacôme, Yves Robert, Annick Alane, Gilles Privat, Michèle Laroque', null, 'Victor is a legal advisor who finds himself abandoned by his wife and fired the same day. He tries to seek comfort from different friends and family members, but everyone he meets is concerned with their own problems. His morale begins to falter when he realizes that no one cares about him.', 'Victor is a legal advisor who finds himself abandoned by his wife and fired the same day. He tries to seek comfort from different friends and family members, but everyone he meets is concerned with their own problems. His morale begins to falter when he realizes that no one cares about him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vheQJA6yatNQh0lytjtucmhxkdP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56947'),
  ('844030111762796758', 'The Critic', 1963, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ernest Pintoff', 'Mel Brooks', 'Mel Brooks', null, 'Mel Brooks is an old man watching abstract animations.', 'Mel Brooks is an old man watching abstract animations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uKFxH9nyDLVgZ4rDNvQsALKRl5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146320'),
  ('1038328611178284875', 'The Critic', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Javier Morales Pérez, Juan Zavala, Eduardo Mangada', null, 'Carlos Boyero, Álex de la Iglesia, Enrique López Lavigne, Carles Francino, Jesús Ruiz Mantilla, Pedro Vallín, Domingo Corral, Nuria Vidal', null, 'A portrait of film critic Carlos Boyero, one of the most followed and feared figures in Spanish cinema, surrounded by controversy and both love and hate.', 'A portrait of film critic Carlos Boyero, one of the most followed and feared figures in Spanish cinema, surrounded by controversy and both love and hate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfO5Z7eIirFHMXF1ImNltvr8q7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018931'),
  ('704183634072679304', 'The Critic', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Anand Tucker, David Higgs', 'Patrick Marber', 'Ian McKellen, Gemma Arterton, Mark Strong, Lesley Manville, Ben Barnes, Romola Garai, Alfred Enoch, Ron Cook', 'R', 'Jimmy Erskine is the most feared theatre critic of the age. He lives as flamboyantly as he writes and takes pleasure in savagely taking down any actor who fails to meet his standards. When the owner of the Daily Chronicle dies, and his son takes over, Jimmy quickly finds himself at odds with his new boss and his position under threat. In an attempt to preserve the power and influence he holds so sacred, Jimmy strikes a Faustian pact with a struggling actress, entangling them and the boss in a thrilling but deadly web of desire, blackmail, and betrayal.', 'Jimmy Erskine is the most feared theatre critic of the age. He lives as flamboyantly as he writes and takes pleasure in savagely taking down any actor who fails to meet his standards. When the owner of the Daily Chronicle dies, and his son takes over, Jimmy quickly finds himself at odds with his new boss and his position under threat. In an attempt to preserve the power and influence he holds so sacred, Jimmy strikes a Faustian pact with a struggling actress, entangling them and the boss in a thrilling but deadly web of desire, blackmail, and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVdN99IPZgQSUKVkAPWb9ZnCkhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:992940'),
  ('218968882583038288', 'The Crocodile Hunter: Collision Course', 2002, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, Action', 'John Stainton, Daniel Ardilley, David Burr', 'John Stainton, Holly Goldberg Sloan', 'Steve Irwin, Terri Irwin, Magda Szubanski, David Wenham, Lachy Hulme, Aden Young, Kenneth Ransom, Kate Beahan', 'PG', 'Steve Irwin, AKA The Crocodile Hunter, has avoided the death-roll and saved a croc from poachers. But what he doesn''t know is that the crocodile has swallowed a top secret U.S. satellite beacon, and the poachers are actually American special agents sent to retrieve it.', 'Steve Irwin, AKA The Crocodile Hunter, has avoided the death-roll and saved a croc from poachers. But what he doesn''t know is that the crocodile has swallowed a top secret U.S. satellite beacon, and the poachers are actually American special agents sent to retrieve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfgvfuce0SqF1IolIJYYBxteof0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17043'),
  ('237139955066069831', 'The Crocodiles', 2009, 'Adventure, Family', 'Christian Ditter, Christian Rein', 'Martin Ritzenhoff', 'Nick Romeo Reimann, Leonie Tepe, Fabian Halbig, Manuel Steitz, David Hürten, Javidan Imani, Robin Walter, Nicolas Schinseck', null, 'Ten-year-old Hannes, growing up with his young, poor and single mother wants to join the coolest gang in the area, the Vorstadtkrokodile. When the ‘entry test’ goes wrong, Hannes’s life is saved by Kai, who is desperate to join too but is wheelchair bound and unable to even run away when things get hot. Hannes would accept Kai but the other gang members don’t seem happy to accept a handicapped member...', 'Ten-year-old Hannes, growing up with his young, poor and single mother wants to join the coolest gang in the area, the Vorstadtkrokodile. When the ‘entry test’ goes wrong, Hannes’s life is saved by Kai, who is desperate to join too but is wheelchair bound and unable to even run away when things get hot. Hannes would accept Kai but the other gang members don’t seem happy to accept a handicapped member...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZJIGpVj1j3oeSfwT7S3eYomroX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12137'),
  ('502797098674966985', 'The Crocodiles Strike Back', 2010, 'Family, Adventure', 'Christian Ditter, Christian Rein', null, 'Nick Romeo Reimann, Leonie Tepe, Fabian Halbig, Manuel Steitz, Nicolas Schinseck, Robin Walter, Ella-Maria Gollmer, Nora Tschirner', null, 'New summer adventure of the Crocodiles, who set up their detective skills to find out who is behind the accidents of the factory where Ollie and Mary''s parents work , which could mean the closure of the plant, the move of the family and the dissolution of the gang.', 'New summer adventure of the Crocodiles, who set up their detective skills to find out who is behind the accidents of the factory where Ollie and Mary''s parents work , which could mean the closure of the plant, the move of the family and the dissolution of the gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRwtmNgjumBwFzE8Gc7Cze2soc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36085'),
  ('578261984225139916', 'The Crocodiles: All for One', 2011, 'Action, Family, Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Wolfgang Groos, Bernhard Jasper', 'Simon Hauschild, Peter Thorwarth', 'Nick Romeo Reimann, Nora Tschirner, Maria Schrader, Axel Stein, Jacob Matschenz, Fabian Halbig, Leonie Tepe, Manuel Steitz', null, '“The Crocodiles” are back and they are in for quite an adventure! Frank is seriously hurt and needs a liver donation. In order to save him, the gang needs to get Frank’s brother out of prison. Their plan is risky and the stakes are high.', '“The Crocodiles” are back and they are in for quite an adventure! Frank is seriously hurt and needs a liver donation. In order to save him, the gang needs to get Frank’s brother out of prison. Their plan is risky and the stakes are high.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrSGPGLeWkihZn9VJySpOnvELwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53136'),
  ('915988421471676228', 'The Crone', 2013, 'Horror', 'Eisuke Naito', 'Eisuke Naito', 'Honoka Yahagi, Shiori, Kaoru Gotô, Aimi Nakamura, Yoshinori Okada', null, 'Ayane, Nanami, and Mayuko are members of a new 3-member idol group called “Jersey Girl”. One day they’re invited to appear on a television show about the paranormal where they’ll visit an abandoned nursing home in the mountains to see which one of them is the bravest and document their experiences. However, as soon as the girls arrive, they begin to have strange paranormal experiences. Before long, they begin to turn on each other as the stress of the situation overtakes them.', 'Ayane, Nanami, and Mayuko are members of a new 3-member idol group called “Jersey Girl”. One day they’re invited to appear on a television show about the paranormal where they’ll visit an abandoned nursing home in the mountains to see which one of them is the bravest and document their experiences. However, as soon as the girls arrive, they begin to have strange paranormal experiences. Before long, they begin to turn on each other as the stress of the situation overtakes them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkpLluqNGmqvqk8WzQJPfC2RrO4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232526'),
  ('199795105199045999', 'The Croods', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Kirk DeMicco, Chris Sanders, Yong Duk Jhun', 'Chris Sanders, Kirk DeMicco', 'Nicolas Cage, Emma Stone, Ryan Reynolds, Catherine Keener, Cloris Leachman, Clark Duke, Chris Sanders, Randy Thom', 'PG', 'The prehistoric Croods family live in a particularly dangerous moment in time. Patriarch Grug, his mate Ugga, teenage daughter Eep, son Thunk, and feisty Gran gather food by day and huddle together in a cave at night. When a more evolved caveman named Guy arrives on the scene, Grug is distrustful, but it soon becomes apparent that Guy is correct about the impending destruction of their world.', 'The prehistoric Croods family live in a particularly dangerous moment in time. Patriarch Grug, his mate Ugga, teenage daughter Eep, son Thunk, and feisty Gran gather food by day and huddle together in a cave at night. When a more evolved caveman named Guy arrives on the scene, Grug is distrustful, but it soon becomes apparent that Guy is correct about the impending destruction of their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27zvjVOtOi5ped1HSlJKNsKXkFH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49519'),
  ('835762105624078156', 'The Croods: A New Age', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Joel Crawford, Lisa Curtis Saunders', 'Dan Hageman, Kevin Hageman, Paul Fisher', 'Nicolas Cage, Emma Stone, Ryan Reynolds, Catherine Keener, Cloris Leachman, Clark Duke, Leslie Mann, Peter Dinklage', 'PG', 'Searching for a safer habitat, the prehistoric Crood family discovers an idyllic, walled-in paradise that meets all of its needs. Unfortunately, they must also learn to live with the Bettermans -- a family that''s a couple of steps above the Croods on the evolutionary ladder. As tensions between the new neighbors start to rise, a new threat soon propels both clans on an epic adventure that forces them to embrace their differences, draw strength from one another, and survive together.', 'Searching for a safer habitat, the prehistoric Crood family discovers an idyllic, walled-in paradise that meets all of its needs. Unfortunately, they must also learn to live with the Bettermans -- a family that''s a couple of steps above the Croods on the evolutionary ladder. As tensions between the new neighbors start to rise, a new threat soon propels both clans on an epic adventure that forces them to embrace their differences, draw strength from one another, and survive together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbVZ3Sq88dZaCANlUcewQuHQOaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529203'),
  ('367171078393791858', 'The Crook', 1970, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Claude Lelouch, Claude Pinoteau, Claude Lelouch', 'Claude Pinoteau, Claude Lelouch, Pierre Uytterhoeven', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Danièle Delorme, Judith Magre, Aldo Maccione, Yves Robert, Amidou, Christine Lelouch, Charles Denner', 'G', 'A thief known as Simon the Swiss faces up and downs in his criminal profession.', 'A thief known as Simon the Swiss faces up and downs in his criminal profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ue4iFAWTPBDMBsTn0octSZpgkE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120100'),
  ('202083164689905033', 'The Crooked Way', 1949, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Florey, John Alton', 'Richard H. Landau', 'John Payne, Sonny Tufts, Ellen Drew, Rhys Williams, Percy Helton, John Doucette, Charles Evans, Greta Granstedt', 'NR', 'A war veteran suffering from amnesia, returns to Los Angeles from a San Francisco veterans hospital hoping to learn who he is and discovers his criminal past.', 'A war veteran suffering from amnesia, returns to Los Angeles from a San Francisco veterans hospital hoping to learn who he is and discovers his criminal past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l91wMZ5B4dtodl2EOiLKR0fQ9mg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37482'),
  ('100027543609374072', 'The Crooked Web', 1955, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nathan Juran, Henry Freulich', 'Lou Breslow', 'Frank Lovejoy, Mari Blanchard, Richard Denning, John Mylong, Harry Lauter, Steven Ritch, Louis Merrill, Vince Barnett', 'NR', 'Following WWII, ex-G.I. Stan opened up a drive-in restaurant. His girlfriend, Joanie, is one of the car hops. They want to get married someday, but the less-than-stellar business the restaurant takes in puts a hold on that plan. One day, Joanie''s ne’er-do-well brother Frank blows into town with a money-making scheme. She''s against it, but Stan - an inveterate gambler - finds the promise of riches too seductive to resist…', 'Following WWII, ex-G.I. Stan opened up a drive-in restaurant. His girlfriend, Joanie, is one of the car hops. They want to get married someday, but the less-than-stellar business the restaurant takes in puts a hold on that plan. One day, Joanie''s ne’er-do-well brother Frank blows into town with a money-making scheme. She''s against it, but Stan - an inveterate gambler - finds the promise of riches too seductive to resist…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfIVsRcEBo8bhSglTV9112hBBAN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49498'),
  ('13411035137784171', 'The Cross and the Switchblade', 1970, 'Drama', 'Don Murray', 'James Bonnet, Don Murray', 'Pat Boone, Erik Estrada, Jacqueline Giroux, Don Blakely, Don Lamond, Sam Capuano, Alex Colon, Hechter Ubarry', 'PG', 'David Wilkerson''s first five years in New York City, where he ministered to disillusioned youth, encouraging them to turn away from the drugs and gang violence they were involved with.', 'David Wilkerson''s first five years in New York City, where he ministered to disillusioned youth, encouraging them to turn away from the drugs and gang violence they were involved with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCBVNIYd7WQ7VygTVTrQsomSpcX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56776'),
  ('1044251759178213111', 'The Cross of Lorraine', 1943, 'War, Drama', 'Tay Garnett, Sidney Wagner', 'Ring Lardner, Jr., Michael Kanin, Robert Hardy Andrews', 'Jean-Pierre Aumont, Gene Kelly, Cedric Hardwicke, Peter Lorre, Hume Cronyn, Richard Whorf, Joseph Calleia, Wallace Ford', null, 'French soldiers surrender to lying Nazis and are herded into a barbaric prison of war camp. From there they plan an uprising.', 'French soldiers surrender to lying Nazis and are herded into a barbaric prison of war camp. From there they plan an uprising.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lxIDocpVEQcWU2PYSQwzk3Dsfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78315'),
  ('21888050850824259', 'The Crossing', 2000, 'TV Movie, Drama, History, War', 'Robert Harmon, Rene Ohashi', 'Howard Fast', 'Jeff Daniels, Roger Rees, Sebastian Roché, Steven McCarthy, John Henry Canavan, Ned Vukovic, David Ferry, Karl Pruner', 'NR', 'A made-for-TV dramatization of George Washington''s perilous gamble of crossing the Delaware River and attacking the British forces at Trenton.', 'A made-for-TV dramatization of George Washington''s perilous gamble of crossing the Delaware River and attacking the British forces at Trenton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LuskivFVMBaUf1RFfqUwE8KNwG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40878'),
  ('515016333779138493', 'The Crossing', 2004, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Martin Asphaug', 'Eirik Ildahl', 'Trond Fausa Aurvåg, Stine Hoel Varvin, Svante Martin, Sverre Anker Ousdal, Harald Dal, Mats Mogeland, Marit Andreassen, Martin Asphaug', null, 'Andreas has everything a man can wish for – a wonderful wife, a big house in the country, and a great job. But a sudden car accident puts him in a wheelchair, leaving him paralysed below the waste and impotent. Will his marriage work?', 'Andreas has everything a man can wish for – a wonderful wife, a big house in the country, and a great job. But a sudden car accident puts him in a wheelchair, leaving him paralysed below the waste and impotent. Will his marriage work?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/em4HjgnGRMc6hy6OiIJewNfMRRC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36959'),
  ('1134956737418172277', 'The Crossing', 2010, 'Drama, Crime', 'Selim Demirdelen', 'Selim Demirdelen', 'Güven Kıraç, Sezin Akbaşoğulları, Cengiz Bozkurt, Umut Kurt, Yücel Erten, Başay Okay, Nihal Koldaş, Mete Horozoğlu', null, 'The story follows Güven, who works as a manager at an accounting firm in Kavşak. Güven, who has a happy marriage, sees his routine life begin to unravel when the new department manager, Arzu, moves into his office. Meanwhile, the landlord''s son is trying to reach an agreement with a contractor to demolish the house they are living in, and accounting clerk Haydar is embezzling company funds. A small slip-up in Güven''s life, combined with Arzu''s uncontrollable curiosity, causes events to unfold like a snowball effect, leaving Güven cornered.', 'The story follows Güven, who works as a manager at an accounting firm in Kavşak. Güven, who has a happy marriage, sees his routine life begin to unravel when the new department manager, Arzu, moves into his office. Meanwhile, the landlord''s son is trying to reach an agreement with a contractor to demolish the house they are living in, and accounting clerk Haydar is embezzling company funds. A small slip-up in Güven''s life, combined with Arzu''s uncontrollable curiosity, causes events to unfold like a snowball effect, leaving Güven cornered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CxYDIrxy3vR9MetKB6gvLEF5e9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54426'),
  ('1050585281650295759', 'The Crossing', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jean-Paul de Zaetijd, Jérôme Cornuau', 'Jérôme Cornuau, Alexandra Deman', 'Michaël Youn, Fanny Valette, Pauline Haugness, Émilie Dequenne, Jules Werner, Jean-François Wolff, Michel Kacenelenbogen, Alain Fryns', null, 'Lola Arendt, 8, vanishes while on vacation on a wild Scottish island. Shattered by her disappearance, her parents, Sarah and Martin, separate. Two years later, Lola is found at the exact same spot. Martin returns to the island to bring her home. His delight at being reunited with Lola soon gives way to suspicion and fear. Why won''t Lola talk? Who are these men watching them? What did Sarah know about Lola''s disappearance? And who is beautiful and mysterious Norah Kross? When the weather conspires to stop them leaving, Martin and Lola embark on a journey across the island with Norah, headed for a tragic discovery...', 'Lola Arendt, 8, vanishes while on vacation on a wild Scottish island. Shattered by her disappearance, her parents, Sarah and Martin, separate. Two years later, Lola is found at the exact same spot. Martin returns to the island to bring her home. His delight at being reunited with Lola soon gives way to suspicion and fear. Why won''t Lola talk? Who are these men watching them? What did Sarah know about Lola''s disappearance? And who is beautiful and mysterious Norah Kross? When the weather conspires to stop them leaving, Martin and Lola embark on a journey across the island with Norah, headed for a tragic discovery...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2u7YHcX8DEL8utQLLXSGvfmQVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139743'),
  ('1012648541549998190', 'The Crossing', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Bai Xue, Piao Songri, Carman Wong Ka Man', 'Yan Sun', 'Huang Yao, Sunny Sun, Carmen Tong Ka-Man, Ni Hongjie, Elena Kong Mei-Yee, Liu Kai-Chi, Jiao Gang, Chan Kin-Long', null, 'Studying in Hong Kong but living in Shenzhen, Peipei has spent 16 years in her life travelling between these two cities. To realize the dream of seeing snow in Japan with her bestie, Peipei joins a smuggling gang and uses her student identity to smuggle iPhones from Hong Kong to Mainland. Her family life and friendships begin to fall apart. The daily life of Peipei starts to get out of control.', 'Studying in Hong Kong but living in Shenzhen, Peipei has spent 16 years in her life travelling between these two cities. To realize the dream of seeing snow in Japan with her bestie, Peipei joins a smuggling gang and uses her student identity to smuggle iPhones from Hong Kong to Mainland. Her family life and friendships begin to fall apart. The daily life of Peipei starts to get out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDQdqS0qJ1ADj1WJlEHLiFfrGuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543762'),
  ('417325882043574658', 'The Crossing', 2020, 'Family, War, Thriller', 'John-Erling Holmenes Fredriksen, Johanne Helgeland', 'Maja Lunde', 'Anna Sofie Skarholt, Bo Lindquist-Ellingsen, Samson Steine, Bianca Ghilardi-Hellesten, Henrik Siger Woldene, Luke Neite, Julius Robin Weigel, Kari Simonsen', null, 'One day, just before Christmas in 1942, Gerda''s and Otto''s parents are arrested for being part of the Norwegian resistance movement during the Second World War, leaving the siblings on their own. Following the arrest, they discover two Jewish children, Sarah and Daniel, hidden in a secret cupboard in their basement at home. It is now up to Gerda and Otto to finish what their parents started: To help Sarah and Daniel flee from the Nazis cross the border to neutral Sweden and reunite them with their parents.', 'One day, just before Christmas in 1942, Gerda''s and Otto''s parents are arrested for being part of the Norwegian resistance movement during the Second World War, leaving the siblings on their own. Following the arrest, they discover two Jewish children, Sarah and Daniel, hidden in a secret cupboard in their basement at home. It is now up to Gerda and Otto to finish what their parents started: To help Sarah and Daniel flee from the Nazis cross the border to neutral Sweden and reunite them with their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dz8IBmxEu4h40OZwtlar5f5oruu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646106'),
  ('247938975499502308', 'The Crossing', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Adventure', 'Jaroslav Fišer, Soline Fauconnier, Guillaume Hoenig', 'Florence Miailhe, Marie Desplechin', 'Emilie Lan Dürr, Florence Miailhe, Maxime Gémin, Arthur Pereira, Serge Avédikian, Axel Auriant, Jocelyne Desverchère, Marc Brunet', null, 'In a small town plunged into darkness, two children, Kyona and Adriel, are separated from their parents and, facing the path of exile alone, embark on a heroic journey that will take them from childhood to adolescence, in search of refuge, peace and the hope of finding their family.', 'In a small town plunged into darkness, two children, Kyona and Adriel, are separated from their parents and, facing the path of exile alone, embark on a heroic journey that will take them from childhood to adolescence, in search of refuge, peace and the hope of finding their family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHKLW2vQIRizejw67EM791TuWMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586945'),
  ('429494256578142575', 'The Crossing Guard', 1995, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Sean Penn, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Sean Penn', 'Jack Nicholson, David Morse, Anjelica Huston, Robin Wright, Piper Laurie, Richard Bradford, Priscilla Barnes, David Baerwald', 'R', 'Unable to move on from the loss of his daughter, Freddy, now a shell of the person he was before, swears to kill the man responsible for her death.', 'Unable to move on from the loss of his daughter, Freddy, now a shell of the person he was before, swears to kill the man responsible for her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WOfl9LN4gqpjwWZjGSHW8fCgSZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27526'),
  ('719142847275339649', 'The Crossing I', 2014, 'Drama', 'John Woo, Yang Zhenyu, Zhao Fei', 'Wang Huiling', 'Huang Xiaoming, Song Hye-kyo, Takeshi Kaneshiro, Tong Dawei, Zhang Ziyi, Masami Nagasawa, Yu Zhen, Miura Kenichi', null, 'At the end of the World War II and the middle of the Chinese Revolution, three couples from different backgrounds with different nationalities flee from China to the island of Taiwan.', 'At the end of the World War II and the middle of the Chinese Revolution, three couples from different backgrounds with different nationalities flee from China to the island of Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrSAgSQsMHXmsd4tmdKUuyegwmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264264'),
  ('441348255480048287', 'The Crossing II', 2015, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'John Woo, Yang Zhenyu, Zhao Fei', 'Wang Huiling', 'Zhang Ziyi, Takeshi Kaneshiro, Song Hye-kyo, Huang Xiaoming, Tong Dawei, Masami Nagasawa, Qin Hailu, Yang Kuei-mei', null, 'A story of three couples and their intertwining love stories set in 1940s Taiwan and Shanghai, centered around the 1949 sinking of Taiping.', 'A story of three couples and their intertwining love stories set in 1940s Taiwan and Shanghai, centered around the 1949 sinking of Taiping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kv4l5HBIlvthqyNOoShpmCwMJuh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295273'),
  ('1056611505840497511', 'The Crossing of the Andes', 2011, 'Drama, War, History, Adventure', 'Dolly Pussi, Leandro Ipiña, Mariana Cavagnaro Rouge', 'Leandro Ipiña, Andrés Maino', 'Rodrigo de la Serna, Juan Ciancio, León Dogodny, Lautaro Delgado Tymruk, Víctor Hugo Carrizo, Pablo Ribba, Alberto Morle, Guillermo Kuchen', null, 'Buenos Aires, 1880. A journalist interviews Manuel Esteban Corvalán, one of the last living men who crossed the Andes in 1817 with José de San Martín, during the Argentinian and Chilean wars of independence, as one of his secretaries, when he was only 15 years old.', 'Buenos Aires, 1880. A journalist interviews Manuel Esteban Corvalán, one of the last living men who crossed the Andes in 1817 with José de San Martín, during the Argentinian and Chilean wars of independence, as one of his secretaries, when he was only 15 years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DSby397uEBhG8ifd1MYKqYv4T1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70744'),
  ('959191942647965278', 'The Crossroads Crash', 1973, null, null, null, null, null, 'A parody of Bonnie and Clyde leads into a ''how to drive safely'' film. Not to be confused with another 1973 film with the same title.', 'A parody of Bonnie and Clyde leads into a ''how to drive safely'' film. Not to be confused with another 1973 film with the same title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KN368zsDM0NiWMeG6EYFB4Hvvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127989'),
  ('461502016678804054', 'The Crow', 1994, 'Fantasy, Action, Thriller', 'Alex Proyas, Dariusz Wolski, Andrew Mason', 'David J. Schow, John Shirley', 'Brandon Lee, Rochelle Davis, Ernie Hudson, Michael Wincott, Bai Ling, Sofia Shinas, Anna Thomson, David Patrick Kelly', 'R', 'Exactly one year after young rock guitarist Eric Draven and his fiancée are brutally killed by a ruthless gang of criminals, Draven, watched over by a hypnotic crow, returns from the grave to exact revenge.', 'Exactly one year after young rock guitarist Eric Draven and his fiancée are brutally killed by a ruthless gang of criminals, Draven, watched over by a hypnotic crow, returns from the grave to exact revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMMB3v6jYHjsvXRNJYESacoTD7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9495'),
  ('240481867355873260', 'The Crow', 2024, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Rupert Sanders, Guy Bradley, Brett Hodgkinson', 'William Josef Schneider, Zach Baylin', 'Bill Skarsgård, FKA twigs, Danny Huston, Josette Simon, Laura Birn, Sami Bouajila, Karel Dobrý, Jordan Bolger', 'R', 'Soulmates Eric and Shelly are brutally murdered when the demons of her dark past catch up with them. Given the chance to save his true love by sacrificing himself, Eric sets out to seek merciless revenge on their killers, traversing the worlds of the living and the dead to put the wrong things right.', 'Soulmates Eric and Shelly are brutally murdered when the demons of her dark past catch up with them. Given the chance to save his true love by sacrificing himself, Eric sets out to seek merciless revenge on their killers, traversing the worlds of the living and the dead to put the wrong things right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8TbOXrNMuqq7AaKqdvqS2oG4ob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957452'),
  ('722367216006455011', 'The Crow: City of Angels', 1996, 'Action, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Tim Pope, Jean-Yves Escoffier, Doug Coleman', 'David S. Goyer', 'Vincent Perez, Mia Kirshner, Iggy Pop, Thomas Jane, Richard Brooks, Thuy Trang, Vincent Castellanos, Tracey Ellis', 'R', 'A murder victim is brought back to life by a mysterious crow. With the help of a beautiful woman, he exacts revenge on his killers – only to realize his enemy has discovered the one weakness that can destroy him forever.', 'A murder victim is brought back to life by a mysterious crow. With the help of a beautiful woman, he exacts revenge on his killers – only to realize his enemy has discovered the one weakness that can destroy him forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppOoLiO2JY0BJQdixs08xrQuAA6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10546'),
