  ('660540575606327731', 'The Crow: Wicked Prayer', 2005, 'Action, Horror, Fantasy', 'Kurt Brabbee, Lance Mungia, Horst Steiner', 'Jeff Most, Lance Mungia, Sean Hood', 'Edward Furlong, Tara Reid, David Boreanaz, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Dennis Hopper, Marcus Chong, Tito Ortiz, Yuji Okumoto', 'R', 'After ex-con Jimmy and his girlfriend are brutally murdered by a biker gang, he is resurrected by the power of The Crow to avenge their deaths and reunite with her in the afterlife.', 'After ex-con Jimmy and his girlfriend are brutally murdered by a biker gang, he is resurrected by the power of The Crow to avenge their deaths and reunite with her in the afterlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6TfZVVzvrlGjxDlZK3CoHwaccc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16456'),
  ('112047848976885531', 'The Crowd', 1928, 'Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, Henry Sharp', 'King Vidor, John V.A. Weaver', 'Eleanor Boardman, James Murray, Bert Roach, Estelle Clark, Daniel G. Tomlinson, Dell Henderson, Lucy Beaumont, Freddie Burke Frederick', 'NR', 'John, an ambitious but undisciplined New York City office worker, meets and marries Mary. They start a family, struggle to cope with marital stress, financial setbacks, and tragedy, all while lost amid the anonymous, pitiless throngs of the big city.', 'John, an ambitious but undisciplined New York City office worker, meets and marries Mary. They start a family, struggle to cope with marital stress, financial setbacks, and tragedy, all while lost amid the anonymous, pitiless throngs of the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jftzHLCZLE2DOLQWY0mENOIPjxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3061'),
  ('323380359254084691', 'The Crowd Roars', 1932, 'Drama, Action', 'Howard Hawks, Sidney Hickox, John Stumar', 'John Bright, Kubec Glasmon, Niven Busch', 'James Cagney, Joan Blondell, Ann Dvorak, Eric Linden, Guy Kibbee, Frank McHugh, Leo Nomis, Billy Arnold', 'NR', 'Famous auto racing champion Joe Greer returns to his hometown to compete in a local race, discovering that his younger brother has aspirations to become a racing champion.', 'Famous auto racing champion Joe Greer returns to his hometown to compete in a local race, discovering that his younger brother has aspirations to become a racing champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8uxqjQuAIZ4PbBkdqtEmC7pGBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125736'),
  ('119389186461480027', 'The Crowded Sky', 1960, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Joseph Pevney, Chuck Hansen, Harry Stradling Sr.', 'Charles Schnee', 'Dana Andrews, Rhonda Fleming, Efrem Zimbalist Jr., John Kerr, Anne Francis, Keenan Wynn, Troy Donahue, Joe Mantell', 'NR', 'When Navy pilot Dale Heath takes off, he doesn''t expect his navigational equipment to fail and must adapt when it goes out along with his radio. Heading straight for a commercial jet piloted by Dick Barnett, whose plane is full of passengers, Heath can''t tell which way to turn in order to avoid a catastrophe.', 'When Navy pilot Dale Heath takes off, he doesn''t expect his navigational equipment to fail and must adapt when it goes out along with his radio. Heading straight for a commercial jet piloted by Dick Barnett, whose plane is full of passengers, Heath can''t tell which way to turn in order to avoid a catastrophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNNgoIvNpbAS4EN0CNPND7SGil1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94510'),
  ('1121226715008962221', 'The Crown Witness', 2007, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Jarosław Sypniewski, Tomasz Augustynek, Jan Holoubek', 'Wojciech Tomczyk', 'Paweł Małaszyński, Robert Więckiewicz, Artur Żmijewski, Małgorzata Foremniak, Urszula Grabowska, Alicja Dąbrowska, Szymon Bobrowski, Andrzej Grabowski', null, 'Blacha, an ex-middleman in the criminal underground, is the key witness in an enormous Pruszkow mafia bust. As such he is kept under lock and key hidden away from the world. Intent on getting an interview with the ex-gangster is Marcin Kruk, whose pregnant wife was collateral damage in a mafia car-bomb several years back with Blacha being his main suspect. Fortunately Blacha holds Marcin''s journalistic work in very high regard, hence agrees to an exclusive interview in a secluded hotel in the Hel peninsula. There he retreads his criminal life...', 'Blacha, an ex-middleman in the criminal underground, is the key witness in an enormous Pruszkow mafia bust. As such he is kept under lock and key hidden away from the world. Intent on getting an interview with the ex-gangster is Marcin Kruk, whose pregnant wife was collateral damage in a mafia car-bomb several years back with Blacha being his main suspect. Fortunately Blacha holds Marcin''s journalistic work in very high regard, hence agrees to an exclusive interview in a secluded hotel in the Hel peninsula. There he retreads his criminal life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jc1jiqPU2P2U8t0205sBA1KK5EU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64212'),
  ('919925063385938994', 'The Crows', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Edzard Onneken, Jochen Stäblein', 'Holger Badura, Sven Böttcher', 'Susanna Simon, Stefan Jürgens, Doris Kunstmann, Nike Fuhrmann, Silke Matthias, Thomas Meinhardt, Anton Rattinger, Hans-Peter Burkhardt', null, 'After a truck accident, Lab crows escape, and provoke a panic in the neighborhood. Alexandra, a young pregnant lady will go to every length to escape the mayhem and raise her neighbors'' awareness about the danger.', 'After a truck accident, Lab crows escape, and provoke a panic in the neighborhood. Alexandra, a young pregnant lady will go to every length to escape the mayhem and raise her neighbors'' awareness about the danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kIApmO3MnQcUfW9UogH2HHttNi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6222'),
  ('797080236476934925', 'The Crucible', 1996, 'Drama, History', 'Nicholas Hytner, Mike Topoozian, Bob Wagner', 'Arthur Miller', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Winona Ryder, Paul Scofield, Joan Allen, Bruce Davison, Rob Campbell, Jeffrey Jones, Peter Vaughan', 'PG-13', 'A Salem resident attempts to frame her ex-lover''s wife for being a witch in the middle of the 1692 witchcraft trials.', 'A Salem resident attempts to frame her ex-lover''s wife for being a witch in the middle of the 1692 witchcraft trials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zv69Rev43me5gQ68x7fk1mQzhHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20539'),
