  ('950097009123023824', 'The Culpable', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Gerd Schneider', 'Gerd Schneider', 'Sebastian Blomberg, Kai Schumann, Jan Messutat, Hartmut Becker, Anna Maria Bergold, Sandra Borgmann, Oskar Bökelmann, Anne Düe', null, 'Jakob, Dominik and Oliver are best friends, they play soccer and work as priests. They are united in their belief that the catholic church can make the world a better place. But when Dominik is confronted with allegations that he abused a boy, Jakob''s world collapses. Torn between his beliefs and the friendship to Dominik, he''s committed to finding the truth.', 'Jakob, Dominik and Oliver are best friends, they play soccer and work as priests. They are united in their belief that the catholic church can make the world a better place. But when Dominik is confronted with allegations that he abused a boy, Jakob''s world collapses. Torn between his beliefs and the friendship to Dominik, he''s committed to finding the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umTUgeDhbkuCSUd9PPdr0Wrh3QA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322467'),
  ('593102131029624732', 'The Culpepper Cattle Co.', 1972, 'Western', 'Dick Richards, Ralph Woolsey, Lawrence Edward Williams', 'Eric Bercovici, Gregory Prentiss', 'Gary Grimes, Billy Green Bush, Luke Askew, Bo Hopkins, Geoffrey Lewis, Wayne Sutherlin, John McLiam, Matt Clark', null, 'Working as an assistant on a long cattle drive, the young Ben Mockridge contends between his dream of being a cowboy and the harsh truth of the Old West.', 'Working as an assistant on a long cattle drive, the young Ben Mockridge contends between his dream of being a cowboy and the harsh truth of the Old West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOs56PTFKa5ZjPLPeXsAOkG3v9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42490'),
  ('558645850636937592', 'The Culprit', 2019, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Kim Dong-cheon, Koh Jung-wook, Lee Yong-chul', 'Koh Jung-wook', 'Song Sae-byuk, Yu Seon, Jang Hyuk-jin, Oh Min-suk, Han Soo-yeon, Jung Hae-kyun, Lee Soi, Woo Mi-hwa', null, 'Someone brutally murders Young-hoon’s wife. A hair sample was found on his wife’s body and the detectives use it to trace it back to his friend Joon-sung and locks him up. Seemingly becoming a murder’s wife overnight, Da-yeon asks Young-hoon to testify on his behalf but when he doesn’t show up for the trial, she goes to visit him at his house.', 'Someone brutally murders Young-hoon’s wife. A hair sample was found on his wife’s body and the detectives use it to trace it back to his friend Joon-sung and locks him up. Seemingly becoming a murder’s wife overnight, Da-yeon asks Young-hoon to testify on his behalf but when he doesn’t show up for the trial, she goes to visit him at his house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNyosJcytSD18yAhdiFzm4azRLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572158'),
  ('1146667976096728635', 'The Cunning Brothers', 1973, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Zeki Ökten', null, 'Kartal Tibet, Kadir İnanır, Meral Zeren, Turgut Özatay', null, 'Ali and Veli are two brothers, one of whom is a taxi driver and the other a porter. However, the two brothers do not get along well. Through a game played by their father, the two brothers finally make peace and decide to work together. Meanwhile, Seyid Abdullah, the head of an Arab mafia, sends two of his men to Habip Nizamettin to buy drugs. As Abdullah''s men pass by Ali and Veli, they drop their suitcase. Inside the suitcase is a note explaining how to make the transaction. After finding the note, the two brothers decide to disguise themselves and seize the money.', 'Ali and Veli are two brothers, one of whom is a taxi driver and the other a porter. However, the two brothers do not get along well. Through a game played by their father, the two brothers finally make peace and decide to work together. Meanwhile, Seyid Abdullah, the head of an Arab mafia, sends two of his men to Habip Nizamettin to buy drugs. As Abdullah''s men pass by Ali and Veli, they drop their suitcase. Inside the suitcase is a note explaining how to make the transaction. After finding the note, the two brothers decide to disguise themselves and seize the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctnnzVltQpn87hW6rV0UaWKRlkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177288'),
  ('1006364709216008800', 'The Cup', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Khyentse Norbu', 'Khyentse Norbu', 'Orgyen Tobgyal, Neten Chokling, Jamyang Lodro, Lama Chonjor, Lama Godhi, Jamyang Nyima, Tracy Mann', 'G', 'While the World Cup is being played in France, two young Tibetan refugees arrive at a monastery in India. The atmosphere of serene contemplation is soon disrupted by soccer fever, as the two students desperately seek a TV to watch the final.', 'While the World Cup is being played in France, two young Tibetan refugees arrive at a monastery in India. The atmosphere of serene contemplation is soon disrupted by soccer fever, as the two students desperately seek a TV to watch the final.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yh2Pj4o92sF4ceTvzB5qP9szUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14521'),
  ('1025049373173475436', 'The Cupboard Was Bare', 1948, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Carlo Rim, Nicolas Hayer, Bernard Borderie', 'Carlo Rim', 'Fernandel, Berthe Bovy, Germaine Kerjean, Albert Dinan, Annette Poivre, Robert Pizani, Marcel Pérès, Marcelle Monthil', null, 'The aunt of Alfred Puc, a meek tax-collector in Paris, dies while riding in a moving van. The driver, not wishing to be bothered by a police interrogation, hides her corpse in a cupboard before notifying Alfred. But the van is stolen. Alfred, being the heir of a rich lady, begins a frantic search to locate the missing van and the cupboard because one can''t claim an inheritance if there is no ''corpus delecti.'' In his search, he gets caught up in an underworld web and finds the body of a murdered gangster in his room. He finally locates the cupboard but promptly loses it again. But, wait, it isn''t "finis'' time, yet.', 'The aunt of Alfred Puc, a meek tax-collector in Paris, dies while riding in a moving van. The driver, not wishing to be bothered by a police interrogation, hides her corpse in a cupboard before notifying Alfred. But the van is stolen. Alfred, being the heir of a rich lady, begins a frantic search to locate the missing van and the cupboard because one can''t claim an inheritance if there is no ''corpus delecti.'' In his search, he gets caught up in an underworld web and finds the body of a murdered gangster in his room. He finally locates the cupboard but promptly loses it again. But, wait, it isn''t "finis'' time, yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h24rzBhMOqGDyWUpZ6HOrX9riKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95315'),
  ('202535177648826222', 'The Cure', 1917, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin, William C. Foster, Roland Totheroh', 'Maverick Terrell, Vincent Bryan', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Eric Campbell, Henry Bergman, John Rand, James T. Kelley, Albert Austin, Frank J. Coleman', null, 'An alcoholic checks into a health spa and his antics promptly throw the establishment into chaos.', 'An alcoholic checks into a health spa and his antics promptly throw the establishment into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ky8fheImTrT2OLH8PajaH7b4nIb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53420'),
  ('467141270670556057', 'The Cure', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Nancy Leopardi', 'Jonathan Bernstein, James Greer', 'David Dastmalchian, Ashley Greene, Samantha Cochran, Sydney Taylor, Tyler Lawrence Gray', null, 'Ally Braun, a 16-year-old adopted girl with a mysterious illness, discovers her biotech billionaire parents are harvesting her blood for sinister reasons.', 'Ally Braun, a 16-year-old adopted girl with a mysterious illness, discovers her biotech billionaire parents are harvesting her blood for sinister reasons.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FenxF32km4P9gXYhAUXWgoVfQqg5.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-cure-2026'),
  ('8154948979362010', 'The Cured', 2017, 'Horror, Drama, Science Fiction', 'David Freyne, Piers McGrail', 'David Freyne', 'Elliot Page, Sam Keeley, Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Stuart Graham, Paula Malcomson, Lesley Conroy, Natalia Kostrzewa, Hilda Fay', 'R', 'What happens when the undead return to life? In a world ravaged for years by a virus that turns the infected into zombie-like cannibals, a cure is at last found and the wrenching process of reintegrating the survivors back into society begins.', 'What happens when the undead return to life? In a world ravaged for years by a virus that turns the infected into zombie-like cannibals, a cure is at last found and the wrenching process of reintegrating the survivors back into society begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qheJcFjQ3hAMroE8y6FpCg6jNeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469721'),
  ('964628661283907979', 'The Curiosity of Chance', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Russell P. Marleau, Jack Messitt', 'Russell P. Marleau', 'Tad Hilgenbrink, Brett Chukerman, Chris Mulkey, Aldevina Da Silva, Pieter Van Nieuwenhuyze, Maxim Maes, Danny Calander, Colleen Cameron', null, 'It’s the ‘80s once again, new wave angst and genderbending fashion are all the rage, but new kid at school, Chance Marquis, is trying to find new ways to stand out. Being an odd and somewhat awkward teenager makes him the target of the school bully. To deal with this dilemma, Chance turns to the opposite ends of the high school spectrum for help. On one side is the flamboyant drag queen and at the other, the varsity jock, Levi Sparks with whom Chance develops a unique friendship.', 'It’s the ‘80s once again, new wave angst and genderbending fashion are all the rage, but new kid at school, Chance Marquis, is trying to find new ways to stand out. Being an odd and somewhat awkward teenager makes him the target of the school bully. To deal with this dilemma, Chance turns to the opposite ends of the high school spectrum for help. On one side is the flamboyant drag queen and at the other, the varsity jock, Levi Sparks with whom Chance develops a unique friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyxqgHEuryzwE0pJYqwJGDo98Cr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12839'),
  ('954406974627190341', 'The Curious Adventures of Mr. Wonderbird', 1953, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Paul Grimault, Paul Grimault, Antoine Archimbaud', 'Jacques Prévert, Paul Grimault', 'Pierre Brasseur, Serge Reggiani, Anouk Aimée, Fernand Ledoux, Etienne Decroux, Roger Blin, Yves Deniaud, Marcel Pérès', null, 'A chimney sweep and his beloved shepherdess are aided by Wonderbird in their escape from a ruthless dictator', 'A chimney sweep and his beloved shepherdess are aided by Wonderbird in their escape from a ruthless dictator', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knjZ1oEbR3XpqEWS2211T9q3b4G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122946'),
  ('233924848040183282', 'The Curious Birth of Benjamin Button', 2009, 'Documentary', 'David Prior', null, 'David Fincher, Kathleen Kennedy, Frank Marshall, Joshua Donen, Eric Roth, Brad Pitt, Cate Blanchett, William Doyle', null, 'A documentary about the making of David Fincher''s 2008 film THE CURIOUS CASE OF BENJAMIN BUTTON. Virtually every element in the evolution of the Fincher''s film is documented here, from the project''s attachment to numerous other directors during the 1990s, to its shoot in 2006 and 2007 in New Orleans, to its complex, CGI-intensive postproduction process.', 'A documentary about the making of David Fincher''s 2008 film THE CURIOUS CASE OF BENJAMIN BUTTON. Virtually every element in the evolution of the Fincher''s film is documented here, from the project''s attachment to numerous other directors during the 1990s, to its shoot in 2006 and 2007 in New Orleans, to its complex, CGI-intensive postproduction process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rb0tqV7FxHECv2cRW8H8DJ5RhtP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585240'),
  ('845624598983476743', 'The Curious Case of Benjamin Button', 2008, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'David Fincher, Carl Kouri, Bob Wagner', 'Eric Roth', 'Brad Pitt, Cate Blanchett, Taraji P. Henson, Julia Ormond, Jason Flemyng, Tilda Swinton, Mahershala Ali, Jared Harris', 'PG-13', 'Born under unusual circumstances, Benjamin Button springs into being as an elderly man in a New Orleans nursing home and ages in reverse. Twelve years after his birth, he meets Daisy, a child who flits in and out of his life as she grows up to be a dancer. Though he has all sorts of unusual adventures over the course of his life, it is his relationship with Daisy, and the hope that they will come together at the right time, that drives Benjamin forward.', 'Born under unusual circumstances, Benjamin Button springs into being as an elderly man in a New Orleans nursing home and ages in reverse. Twelve years after his birth, he meets Daisy, a child who flits in and out of his life as she grows up to be a dancer. Though he has all sorts of unusual adventures over the course of his life, it is his relationship with Daisy, and the hope that they will come together at the right time, that drives Benjamin forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26wEWZYt6yJkwRVkjcbwJEFh9IS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4922'),
  ('714994045115570442', 'The Curious Dr. Humpp', 1969, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Emilio Vieyra, Jerald Intrator, Aníbal González Paz', 'Emilio Vieyra', 'Ricardo Bauleo, Gloria Prat, Aldo Barbero, Susana Beltrán, Justin Martin, Michel Angel Olmos, Mary Albano, Al Bugatti', null, 'A doctor—on orders from a sentient brain—kidnaps intimate couples and takes them to his mansion as prisoners. He injects his subjects with a substance to ''enhance'' their sexual abilities. The curious doctor then forces his hostages to have sex. While they are making love, he drains a fluid from them, which he needs to prevent himself from transforming into a monster.', 'A doctor—on orders from a sentient brain—kidnaps intimate couples and takes them to his mansion as prisoners. He injects his subjects with a substance to ''enhance'' their sexual abilities. The curious doctor then forces his hostages to have sex. While they are making love, he drains a fluid from them, which he needs to prevent himself from transforming into a monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/poLnDWsmxBq2sIZQlVPYpTUBMW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39020'),
  ('1149245479222387717', 'The Curious Female', 1970, 'Science Fiction', 'Paul Rapp, Donald H. Birnkrant', 'Winston R. Paul', 'Angelique Pettyjohn, Charlene Jones, Bunny Allister, David Westberg, Julie Conners, Michael Greer, Sebastian Brook, Elaine Edwards', 'R', 'In the year 2177, the world is under the control of a master computer. For recreation, however, people are allowed to view sex tapes.', 'In the year 2177, the world is under the control of a master computer. For recreation, however, people are allowed to view sex tapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqtUenQUGVAUQGGnaADZkKKKNQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251369'),
  ('370976818334538327', 'The Current Occupant', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Julius Ramsay', 'Alston Ramsay', 'Barry Watson, Sonita Henry, Marvin Jones III, Lilli Birdsell, Kate Cobb, Ezra Buzzington, Joshua Burge, Dean Sharpe', 'NR', 'Trapped in a mysterious psychiatric ward, a man with no memory comes to believe that he’s the President of the United States and the subject of a diabolical political conspiracy. As the asylum’s soul-crushing forces bear down on him, he fights to preserve his sanity and escape so that he can return to power.', 'Trapped in a mysterious psychiatric ward, a man with no memory comes to believe that he’s the President of the United States and the subject of a diabolical political conspiracy. As the asylum’s soul-crushing forces bear down on him, he fights to preserve his sanity and escape so that he can return to power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zl2oCYmEB0iKWZIVQWOH5Ao5Mo4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:711715'),
  ('363161132041949616', 'The Current War', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Alfonso Gomez-Rejon, Chung Chung-hoon, Mark Scruton', 'Michael Mitnick', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Michael Shannon, Nicholas Hoult, Katherine Waterston, Tom Holland, Matthew Macfadyen, Tuppence Middleton, Stanley Townsend', 'PG-13', 'Electricity titans Thomas Edison and George Westinghouse compete to create a sustainable system and market it to the American people.', 'Electricity titans Thomas Edison and George Westinghouse compete to create a sustainable system and market it to the American people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqTjO8yTaPRSKWj7i6Qnr7R5cls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418879'),
  ('467828694012946726', 'The Curse', 1987, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Keith, Roberto Forges Davanzati', 'David Chaskin', 'Wil Wheaton, Claude Akins, Malcolm Danare, Cooper Huckabee, John Schneider, Steve Carlisle, Kathleen Jordon Gregory, Hope North', 'R', 'Nathan Hayes is a religious man trying to hold onto his farm and keep his family in line. A real estate developer is trying to buy most of the farm property in the area, including Mr. Hayes family farm, in the hope that the Tennesse Valley Authority will choose the town for the site of a new dam and recreational area. The night of a terrible storm, an unidentified, glowing object crashes on the Hayes farm and with it comes a horrible curse for the Hayes family and the members of the community.', 'Nathan Hayes is a religious man trying to hold onto his farm and keep his family in line. A real estate developer is trying to buy most of the farm property in the area, including Mr. Hayes family farm, in the hope that the Tennesse Valley Authority will choose the town for the site of a new dam and recreational area. The night of a terrible storm, an unidentified, glowing object crashes on the Hayes farm and with it comes a horrible curse for the Hayes family and the members of the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTvk4P1JJLE7amgXSFse8sIBT6s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74747'),
  ('109450949089221114', 'The Curse', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Ken''ichi Ugana, Moritada Iju', 'Ken''ichi Ugana', 'Yukino Kaizu, YU, Yutaka Kyan', null, 'Riko, a beauty salon receptionist, notices her friend Shu-fen''s strange social media posts. As horrific deaths occur, she travels to Taiwan and unravels community horrors and desire with her ex and Shu-fen''s sister.', 'Riko, a beauty salon receptionist, notices her friend Shu-fen''s strange social media posts. As horrific deaths occur, she travels to Taiwan and unravels community horrors and desire with her ex and Shu-fen''s sister.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FrZRiL3rp2EKkKTU5aDTj825saoB.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-curse-2026'),
  ('339257779847071022', 'The Curse of Audrey Earnshaw', 2020, 'Horror, Drama', 'Nick Thomas, Thomas Robert Lee', 'Thomas Robert Lee', 'Catherine Walker, Jared Abrahamson, Hannah Emily Anderson, Geraldine O''Rawe, Don McKellar, Sean McGinley, Jessica Reynolds, Tom Carey', null, 'A devout community suffering from a plague is torn apart by a beautiful young woman and the forces of witchcraft, black magic, and possession.', 'A devout community suffering from a plague is torn apart by a beautiful young woman and the forces of witchcraft, black magic, and possession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMVxPRyDuod7479mTykw4SPHMQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:688343'),
  ('46861831414047561', 'The Curse of Bridge Hollow', 2022, 'Adventure, Comedy, Horror, Family', 'Jeff Wadlow, Raylin Sabo, Mary Vernieu', 'Robert Rugan, Todd Berger', 'Marlon Wayans, Priah Ferguson, Kelly Rowland, John Michael Higgins, Lauren Lapkus, Rob Riggle, Nia Vardalos, Abi Monterey', 'PG-13', 'A Halloween-hating dad reluctantly teams up with his teenage daughter when an evil spirit wreaks havoc by making their town''s decorations come to life.', 'A Halloween-hating dad reluctantly teams up with his teenage daughter when an evil spirit wreaks havoc by making their town''s decorations come to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6P9l6tcVnWLS1ADUAfkUCGQhm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:864959'),
  ('951531860699247190', 'The Curse of Buckout Road', 2017, 'Horror', 'Rudolf Blahacek, Matthew Currie Holmes', 'Shahin Chandrasoma', 'Evan Ross, Henry Czerny, Dominique Provost-Chalkley, Danny Glover, Colm Feore, Mayko Nguyen, Jim Watson, Kyle Mac', null, 'A college class project on creation and destruction of modern myth, turns terrifying when a trio of young people come to realize the urban legends surrounding the famed Buckout Road may, in fact, be REAL.', 'A college class project on creation and destruction of modern myth, turns terrifying when a trio of young people come to realize the urban legends surrounding the famed Buckout Road may, in fact, be REAL.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jS47NI9UqtO17TvW6KTjiAT5Fd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467615'),
  ('232833570370884427', 'The Curse of Downers Grove', 2015, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror, Drama', 'Derick Martini, Frank Godwin', 'Bret Easton Ellis, Derick Martini', 'Bella Heathcote, Lucas Till, Helen Slater, Penelope Mitchell, Mark L. Young, Zane Holtz, Tom Arnold, Kevin Zegers', null, 'The town of Downers Grove looks like your average suburban neighborhood -- but Downers Grove has a disturbing secret.... For the past eight years, one senior from every high school graduating class has met a bizarre death right before graduation day. And this year, Chrissie Swanson has a terrible feeling that she is going to be the one to die. Can Chrissie survive the curse of Downers Grove or will she, like those seniors before her, fall prey to the town''s deadly secret?', 'The town of Downers Grove looks like your average suburban neighborhood -- but Downers Grove has a disturbing secret.... For the past eight years, one senior from every high school graduating class has met a bizarre death right before graduation day. And this year, Chrissie Swanson has a terrible feeling that she is going to be the one to die. Can Chrissie survive the curse of Downers Grove or will she, like those seniors before her, fall prey to the town''s deadly secret?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTpYTV0a23Diw344tE199bIHo7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309919'),
  ('912024889630184415', 'The Curse of El Charro', 2005, 'Horror', 'Rich Ragsdale, Jacques Haitkin', 'Ryan R. Johnson', 'Andrew Bryniarski, Danny Trejo, Drew Mia, Kathryn Taylor Smith, Heidi Androl, KellyDawn Malloy, Philip Boyd, Matthew Prater', null, 'In California, Maria has awful nightmares and visions of her sister who committed suicide one year ago. Her roommate Chris invites Maria to travel with her and her friends Tanya and Rose on vacation to her uncle''s house in Saguaro, Arizona, to relax. When the group arrives in the house, they immediately go to a night-club to have fun and chase some local guys for sex; however, the evil El Charro is seeking Maria, killing her friends with his machete.', 'In California, Maria has awful nightmares and visions of her sister who committed suicide one year ago. Her roommate Chris invites Maria to travel with her and her friends Tanya and Rose on vacation to her uncle''s house in Saguaro, Arizona, to relax. When the group arrives in the house, they immediately go to a night-club to have fun and chase some local guys for sex; however, the evil El Charro is seeking Maria, killing her friends with his machete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbgnb2tYY5fdPKPseowAw4JPimE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89376'),
  ('1054299015096616202', 'The Curse of Frankenstein', 1957, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Terence Fisher, Jack Asher', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Peter Cushing, Hazel Court, Robert Urquhart, Christopher Lee, Melvyn Hayes, Valerie Gaunt, Paul Hardtmuth, Noel Hood', 'NR', 'Baron Victor Frankenstein has discovered life''s secret and unleashed a blood-curdling chain of events resulting from his creation: a cursed creature with a horrid face — and a tendency to kill.', 'Baron Victor Frankenstein has discovered life''s secret and unleashed a blood-curdling chain of events resulting from his creation: a cursed creature with a horrid face — and a tendency to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9PDkqKhzdo54aqnOL88wUJY49B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3079'),
  ('1050214108564185634', 'The Curse of Greed', 1914, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Léonce Perret', null, 'Adrien Petit, Maurice Luguet, Louis Leubas, Armand Dutertre, Émile André, Armand Numès, Paul Manson, Bernard Derigal', null, 'A moneylender kidnaps the young son of a rich widow as part of a plot to cheat her of her fortune. The boy is sent away on a fishing boat with the intention of drowning him, but a kindly old fisherman intervenes.', 'A moneylender kidnaps the young son of a rich widow as part of a plot to cheat her of her fortune. The boy is sent away on a fishing boat with the intention of drowning him, but a kindly old fisherman intervenes.', null, 'tmdb:movie:286307'),
  ('660688417621416739', 'The Curse of Her Flesh', 1968, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Findlay, Roberta Findlay', 'Michael Findlay, Roberta Findlay', 'Eve Bork, Michael Findlay, Ron Skideri, Linda Boyce, Sally Farb, John Amero, Jane Bond, Vivian Del Rio', null, 'Continuing his quest to rid the world of sex-crazed females, Richard ups the ante - and bodycount, devising an array of increasingly gruesome methods of dispatching his victims all while planning the ultimate revenge against his wife''s lover, Steve.', 'Continuing his quest to rid the world of sex-crazed females, Richard ups the ante - and bodycount, devising an array of increasingly gruesome methods of dispatching his victims all while planning the ultimate revenge against his wife''s lover, Steve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24oFJ4vtmNpxPupSIPBhWttEHd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94737'),
  ('454074113528096175', 'The Curse of Hobbes House', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Juliane Block, Simon Haveland, Marcus Schwemin', 'Wolf-Peter Arand', 'Mhairi Calvey, Makenna Guyler, Waleed Elgadi, Kevin Leslie, Jo Price, Emma Spurgin Hussey', null, 'After the death of her Grandmother, Jane Dormant travels to the family’s remote, ancestral home hoping to receive a large inheritance. When Jane’s estranged, half-sister Jennifer arrives at Hobbes House to claim her part of the estate, the sisters’ simmering hate breaks out completely. But then a violent, unexpected storm cuts the estate off from outside help and a wave of bloodthirsty zombies lays siege. Now the sisters have to learn how to fight back together.', 'After the death of her Grandmother, Jane Dormant travels to the family’s remote, ancestral home hoping to receive a large inheritance. When Jane’s estranged, half-sister Jennifer arrives at Hobbes House to claim her part of the estate, the sisters’ simmering hate breaks out completely. But then a violent, unexpected storm cuts the estate off from outside help and a wave of bloodthirsty zombies lays siege. Now the sisters have to learn how to fight back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUqVRo00JwAcsERppkciuQf3oVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719106'),
  ('264009999581333613', 'The Curse of Humpty Dumpty', 2021, 'Horror', 'Scott Chambers, Antonia Johnstone', 'Scott Chambers, Sam Ashurst', 'Nicola Wright, Sian Altman, Kate Sandison, Danielle Scott, Antonia Whillans, Antonia Johnstone, Kate Milner Evans, Chris Cordell', null, 'An old doll seemingly returns to life to wreak havoc.', 'An old doll seemingly returns to life to wreak havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdoNC9sRYa4sv4iOikMfDe8RiUk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823594'),
  ('661455624751020187', 'The Curse of Inferno', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime', 'John Warren, Mike Dempsey, Nancy Schreiber', 'John Warren', 'Pauly Shore, Janine Turner, Ned Beatty, Max Perlich, Stephen Tobolowsky, Blue Deckert, John Pleshette, Weasel Forshaw', 'R', 'A rather dull minded bank robber suddenly suffers from a change of heart and decides to give the money back. However, he then learns that getting the money back into the bank is much more difficult than taking it out.', 'A rather dull minded bank robber suddenly suffers from a change of heart and decides to give the money back. However, he then learns that getting the money back into the bank is much more difficult than taking it out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WoKGhTWWUocz9bsho17B13I7yQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92943'),
  ('178018280350231095', 'The Curse of Kazuo Umezu', 1990, 'Animation, Horror', 'Etsuji Yamada, Junko Abe, Naoko Omi', 'Shiira Shimazaki', 'Ikuya Sawaki, Shinobu Adachi, Ai Orikasa, Naoko Watanabe, Rei Sakuma, Eken Mine, Hidetoshi Nakamura, Miki Narahashi', null, '"Do not toy with the supernatural." Two stories of the consequences that descend upon humans who venture beyond the safe confines of their ordinary worlds.', '"Do not toy with the supernatural." Two stories of the consequences that descend upon humans who venture beyond the safe confines of their ordinary worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VPT2owbaHTprcMbPN8ZykeiyUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172133'),
  ('975495618351534025', 'The Curse of King Tut''s Tomb', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Thriller, Horror', 'Russell Mulcahy, Christopher Manley', 'David N. Titcher', 'Casper Van Dien, Leonor Varela, Malcolm McDowell, Jonathan Hyde, Steven Waddington, Niko Nicotera, Tat Whalley, Brendan Patricks', 'NR', 'Thousands of years ago, the great Child King Tutankhamen ruled. Few know the details of his life -- No one knows the secrets of his death. All that is about to change.Free -spirited archaeologist Danny Fremont (Casper Van Dien, Sleepy Hollow) is certain that if found, King Tut''s Emerald Tablet would hold the power to control the world. Unfortunately, the only one who believes Fremont is his nemesis archaeologist Morgan Sinclair (Jonathan Hyde, Titanic), a member of a secret society who wants the tablet to harness unspeakable evil on the world and will stop at nothing to get it.', 'Thousands of years ago, the great Child King Tutankhamen ruled. Few know the details of his life -- No one knows the secrets of his death. All that is about to change.Free -spirited archaeologist Danny Fremont (Casper Van Dien, Sleepy Hollow) is certain that if found, King Tut''s Emerald Tablet would hold the power to control the world. Unfortunately, the only one who believes Fremont is his nemesis archaeologist Morgan Sinclair (Jonathan Hyde, Titanic), a member of a secret society who wants the tablet to harness unspeakable evil on the world and will stop at nothing to get it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lS8HiWOO7YcezktLKFmBJmitAzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15056'),
  ('19733678844877371', 'The Curse of La Llorona', 2019, 'Horror', 'Jeffrey Wetzel, Marc Newland, Aaron A. Goffman', 'Mikki Daughtry, Tobias Iaconis', 'Linda Cardellini, Raymond Cruz, Patricia Velásquez, Roman Christou, Jaynee-Lynne Kinchen, Marisol Ramirez, Sean Patrick Thomas, Tony Amendola', 'R', 'In 1970s Los Angeles, the legendary ghost La Llorona is stalking the night -- and the children. Ignoring the eerie warning of a troubled mother, a social worker and her own kids are drawn into a frightening supernatural realm. Their only hope of surviving La Llorona''s deadly wrath is a disillusioned priest who practices mysticism to keep evil at bay.', 'In 1970s Los Angeles, the legendary ghost La Llorona is stalking the night -- and the children. Ignoring the eerie warning of a troubled mother, a social worker and her own kids are drawn into a frightening supernatural realm. Their only hope of surviving La Llorona''s deadly wrath is a disillusioned priest who practices mysticism to keep evil at bay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hETrPpoKs6BwoilK64YJ7Z5GcRT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480414'),
  ('1152579098594579449', 'The Curse of Robert the Doll', 2016, 'Horror', 'Jonathan McLaughlin, Andrew Jones', 'Andrew Jones', 'Nigel Barber, Tiffany Ceri, Suzie Frances Garton, Lee Bane, Chris Bell, Steven Dolton, Jason Homewood, Clare Gollop', null, 'A cash strapped student who starts working the night shift at a Museum suspects that one of the exhibits, a creepy vintage doll named Robert, is alive and wreaking havoc after hours.', 'A cash strapped student who starts working the night shift at a Museum suspects that one of the exhibits, a creepy vintage doll named Robert, is alive and wreaking havoc after hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTWfR2YTsKqOhwgIvUxgoN3wa2x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404461'),
  ('430075931274724338', 'The Curse of Robert the Doll', 2022, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Brian Knappmiller', null, 'Quinn Aune, Jenna Sue Berry, Shaun Boylan, Alexandra Weaver, Jennifer Dunn Green, Eloise Eastland, Lander Eastland, Aaron Feder', null, 'Considered the most haunted doll in the world, Robert the Doll lives behind glass in a museum in Key West, Florida, where every year thousands of visitors who fail to follow his rules find themselves cursed. Victims have experienced illness, injury, accidents and even death. But what makes Robert curse his victims? What evil entity lives inside this doll? This latest Shock Docs installment explores the true origin of Robert the Doll, uncovers the story of Robert''s first owners in 1905, and seeks to find out why this doll is so nefarious.', 'Considered the most haunted doll in the world, Robert the Doll lives behind glass in a museum in Key West, Florida, where every year thousands of visitors who fail to follow his rules find themselves cursed. Victims have experienced illness, injury, accidents and even death. But what makes Robert curse his victims? What evil entity lives inside this doll? This latest Shock Docs installment explores the true origin of Robert the Doll, uncovers the story of Robert''s first owners in 1905, and seeks to find out why this doll is so nefarious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhkzbOsnrhE6COA5mT3XLd5swKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033801'),
  ('468646830723072353', 'The Curse of Sleeping Beauty', 2016, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Pearry Reginald Teo, Christopher C. Pearson', 'Josh Nadler, Pearry Reginald Teo', 'Ethan Peck, India Eisley, Natalie Hall, Bruce Davison, James Adam Lim, Scott Alan Smith, Zack Ward, Cyd Strittmatter', null, 'Thomas Kaiser inherits an ancestral mansion that has been in his family for generations — only to learn that he has also inherited an ancient curse stemming back to the Crusades. Forced into his new role as “protector” — the guardian appointed to keep the evil demons in the house at bay — Thomas teams with an ambitious local realtor and paranormal cleric to unravel the mystery of the house, while struggling to awaken the beautiful Briar Rose, held captive in a terrifying netherworld seen previously in his dreams.', 'Thomas Kaiser inherits an ancestral mansion that has been in his family for generations — only to learn that he has also inherited an ancient curse stemming back to the Crusades. Forced into his new role as “protector” — the guardian appointed to keep the evil demons in the house at bay — Thomas teams with an ambitious local realtor and paranormal cleric to unravel the mystery of the house, while struggling to awaken the beautiful Briar Rose, held captive in a terrifying netherworld seen previously in his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUyVUMVaZyEauIjjdkcEx4AU9p2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388440'),
  ('548501701546718055', 'The Curse of Snake Valley', 1988, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Marek Piestrak, Wojciech Jagielski, Airi Kasera', 'Marek Piestrak, Vladimir Valutskiy, Wojciech Niżyński', 'Krzysztof Kolberger, Roman Wilhelmi, Ewa Sałacka, Zbigniew Lesień, Leon Niemczyk, Igor Przegrodzki, Zygmunt Bielawski, Henryk Bista', null, 'The trio of adventurous pals, a man who is a scientist, a fine lady and a former military pilot are in the Indochina jungles looking for some mysterious vase that holds a metal container that is of no mundane origin.', 'The trio of adventurous pals, a man who is a scientist, a fine lady and a former military pilot are in the Indochina jungles looking for some mysterious vase that holds a metal container that is of no mundane origin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNTU6oHALG52CIbs2NZFbSJT12u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81324'),
  ('569188792361123174', 'The Curse of the Aztec Mummy', 1957, 'Horror', 'Rafael Portillo, Enrique Wallace', 'Alfredo Salazar, Guillermo Calderón', 'Ramón Gay, Rosita Arenas, Crox Alvarado, Luis Aceves Castañeda, Jorge Mondragón, Arturo Martínez, Emma Roldán, Julián de Meriche', null, 'The evil Dr. Krupp, once again trying to get possession of the Aztec princess Xochitl''s jewels, hypnotizes her current reincarnation, Flor, to get her to reveal the jewels'' location - Xochitl''s tomb. Confusion reigns as Krupp and his thugs are opposed by Flor''s lover, Dr. Almada, his assistant, and wrestling superhero, El Angel. Krupp finally meets his match, however, when he comes up against Popoca, the warrior mummy who guards Xochitl''s tomb.', 'The evil Dr. Krupp, once again trying to get possession of the Aztec princess Xochitl''s jewels, hypnotizes her current reincarnation, Flor, to get her to reveal the jewels'' location - Xochitl''s tomb. Confusion reigns as Krupp and his thugs are opposed by Flor''s lover, Dr. Almada, his assistant, and wrestling superhero, El Angel. Krupp finally meets his match, however, when he comes up against Popoca, the warrior mummy who guards Xochitl''s tomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aYCcHypT2rjPvdAN94oivxZ1Tp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136852'),
  ('416100129960943142', 'The Curse of the Cat People', 1944, 'Fantasy, Drama, Horror', 'Gunther von Fritsch, Nicholas Musuraca, Robert Wise', 'DeWitt Bodeen', 'Simone Simon, Kent Smith, Jane Randolph, Ann Carter, Eve March, Julia Dean, Elizabeth Russell, Erford Gage', null, 'Amy, the young, friendless daughter of Oliver and Alice Reed, befriends her father''s late first wife and an aging, reclusive actress.', 'Amy, the young, friendless daughter of Oliver and Alice Reed, befriends her father''s late first wife and an aging, reclusive actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2KedIReZYiPLjy1Ib89OSYo8Iv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28436'),
  ('119161192345653353', 'The Curse of the Clown Motel', 2023, 'Horror, Action', 'Istvan Lettang, Asif Akbar, Lance Kawas', 'James Tamburino', 'Tobin Bell, Randy Couture, Romeo, Juliana Destefano, James Chalke, Robert Gillings, Doreen Calderon, Bleona', null, 'When Alma returns home to help her family get their Native American heritage recognized, all she finds is the World-Famous Clown Motel that has been erected on their land.', 'When Alma returns home to help her family get their Native American heritage recognized, all she finds is the World-Famous Clown Motel that has been erected on their land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gOO4ot0iJDCWbDaksGOmfqMJbd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114743'),
  ('601332476883206916', 'The Curse of the Crying Woman', 1963, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Rafael Baledón, José Ortiz Ramos', 'Rafael Baledón', 'Rosita Arenas, Abel Salazar, Rita Macedo, Carlos López Moctezuma, Enrique Lucero, Mario Sevilla, Julissa', null, 'A young woman inherits a mansion, only to discover that it is haunted by witches and evil spirits.', 'A young woman inherits a mansion, only to discover that it is haunted by witches and evil spirits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnLEUZglSQwq1iWaDx1vwjwUvvj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62932'),
  ('143148301958056489', 'The Curse of the Doll People', 1961, 'Horror', 'Benito Alazraki, Enrique Wallace', null, 'Elvira Quintana, Ramón Gay, Roberto G. Rivera, Quintín Bulnes, Nora Veryán, Luis Aragón, Jorge Mondragón, Salvador Lozano', 'NR', 'Four men are cursed by a voodoo priest for stealing a sacred idol from his temple. Soon a band of murderous "doll men" are after the men and their families.', 'Four men are cursed by a voodoo priest for stealing a sacred idol from his temple. Soon a band of murderous "doll men" are after the men and their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozJ6FD9bDIC8R3VzS8xWNilpZk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147889'),
  ('711650256559897233', 'The Curse of the Dragon', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Fred Weintraub, Tom Kuhn', 'Davis Miller', 'George Takei, Kareem Abdul-Jabbar, Shelton Chow, Alex Ben Block, James Coburn, Hayward Nishioka, Robert Lee Jan-Fai, Jesse Glover', 'R', 'A 1993 documentary film about Bruce Lee. The film includes interviews from some of his fellow students and opponents who worked alongside him in his movies.', 'A 1993 documentary film about Bruce Lee. The film includes interviews from some of his fellow students and opponents who worked alongside him in his movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gffJgLXQJUGAhIodvzormubuLHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72680'),
  ('231542665197438725', 'The Curse of the Hidden Vault', 1964, 'Crime', 'Richard Angst, Franz Josef Gottlieb', 'Robert A. Stemmle, Franz Josef Gottlieb', 'Harald Leipnitz, Judith Dornys, Rudolf Forster, Werner Peters, Ernst Fritz Fürbringer, Klaus Kinski, Eddi Arent, Harry Meyen', null, 'Mobsters conspire to loot another criminal''s treasure secured in an enormous booby-trapped vault.', 'Mobsters conspire to loot another criminal''s treasure secured in an enormous booby-trapped vault.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIX2KbwGFZj8MYZzA1CFWWJsEzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70248'),
  ('700163486355973148', 'The Curse of the Jade Scorpion', 2001, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Woody Allen, Mark Bachman, Hinju Kim', 'Woody Allen', 'Dan Aykroyd, Helen Hunt, Woody Allen, Charlize Theron, David Ogden Stiers, Brian Markinson, John Tormey, John Schuck', 'PG-13', 'CW Briggs is a veteran insurance investigator, with many successes. Betty Ann Fitzgerald is a new employee in the company he works for, with the task of reorganizing the office. They don''t like each other - or at least that''s what they think. During a night out with the rest of the office employees, they go to watch Voltan, a magician who secretly hypnotizes both of them.', 'CW Briggs is a veteran insurance investigator, with many successes. Betty Ann Fitzgerald is a new employee in the company he works for, with the task of reorganizing the office. They don''t like each other - or at least that''s what they think. During a night out with the rest of the office employees, they go to watch Voltan, a magician who secretly hypnotizes both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfvWefUp09oaLLxb8KhsvUYi7mX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2779'),
  ('669775475896432309', 'The Curse of the Komodo', 2004, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jim Wynorski, Andrea V. Rossotto, Christopher C. Miller', 'Steve Latshaw', 'Gail Harris, Paul Logan, Tim Abell, Daryl Haney, Melissa Brasselle, Glori-Anne Gilbert, George Buck Flower, Robert Donavan', 'PG-13', 'Genetically-engineered Komodo dragons have become ginormous creatures hunting people on a remote tropical island. A small group of scientists must stop the dragons before they escape the island and destroy the rest of the world.', 'Genetically-engineered Komodo dragons have become ginormous creatures hunting people on a remote tropical island. A small group of scientists must stop the dragons before they escape the island and destroy the rest of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coGnsZETIQTNwKPGBdhnVFLEPyk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27895'),
  ('631581669863461591', 'The Curse of the Living Corpse', 1964, 'Horror', 'Richard Hilliard, Del Tenney', 'Margot Hartman', 'Roy Scheider, Helen Warren, Robert Milli, Margot Hartman, Hugh Franklin, Linda Donovan, Dino Narizzano, Candace Hilligoss', 'NR', 'The wealthy patriarch of the Sinclair family lives in mortal fear of being buried alive due to a rare condition that causes him to sometimes appear lifeless. After his death, relatives learn that his will stipulates a strict series of orders that must be followed in order to receive their inheritance. The family refuses to comply and the patriarch returns from the grave to exact revenge by killing each of them in the way they fear most.', 'The wealthy patriarch of the Sinclair family lives in mortal fear of being buried alive due to a rare condition that causes him to sometimes appear lifeless. After his death, relatives learn that his will stipulates a strict series of orders that must be followed in order to receive their inheritance. The family refuses to comply and the patriarch returns from the grave to exact revenge by killing each of them in the way they fear most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72mgSBm1bc4rq7X3uJDBheJIWr8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30991'),
  ('686206973578396929', 'The Curse of the Mummy''s Tomb', 1964, 'Horror', 'Otto Heller, Michael Carreras, Bert Batt', 'Michael Carreras', 'Terence Morgan, Ronald Howard, Fred Clark, Jeanne Roland, George Pastell, Jack Gwillim, John Paul, Dickie Owen', 'NR', 'Those who have interfered with the Tomb of Ra-Antef are in terrible danger. Against expert advice, American showman and financial backer of the expedition, Alexander King, plans a world tour exhibiting this magnificent discovery from the ancient world but on the opening night the sarcophagus is void of its contents. The mummy has escaped to fulfill the dreadful prophesy and exact a violent and bloody revenge on all those who defiled his final resting place.', 'Those who have interfered with the Tomb of Ra-Antef are in terrible danger. Against expert advice, American showman and financial backer of the expedition, Alexander King, plans a world tour exhibiting this magnificent discovery from the ancient world but on the opening night the sarcophagus is void of its contents. The mummy has escaped to fulfill the dreadful prophesy and exact a violent and bloody revenge on all those who defiled his final resting place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DdEHgHmitZN2dfXoqE4IUgnQx2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39044'),
  ('481460809994413176', 'The Curse of the Necklace', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Juan Pablo Arias Munoz, Reuben Steinberg', 'John Ducey', 'Violet McGraw, Madeleine McGraw, Henry Thomas, Sarah Lind, Jacob Moran, Roma Maffia, Felix Solis, Christina Moore', 'R', 'After separating due to his unpredictable alcohol infused temper, Frank try to win his wife Laura back by giving her a beautiful antique necklace he finds in an old 1938 evidence bag at the station. Unfortunately, the necklace is a conduit for the tormented soul of an evil boy from long ago, and Laura and her daughters find themselves in terrible danger from a little boy who no longer exists.', 'After separating due to his unpredictable alcohol infused temper, Frank try to win his wife Laura back by giving her a beautiful antique necklace he finds in an old 1938 evidence bag at the station. Unfortunately, the necklace is a conduit for the tormented soul of an evil boy from long ago, and Laura and her daughters find themselves in terrible danger from a little boy who no longer exists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWrYpICZChiPwRnc8SkvxBFBE3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1293263'),
  ('142487821586128766', 'The Curse of the Werewolf', 1961, 'Horror', 'Arthur Grant, Terence Fisher', 'Anthony Hinds', 'Clifford Evans, Oliver Reed, Yvonne Romain, Catherine Feller, Anthony Dawson, Josephine Llewellyn, Richard Wordsworth, Hira Talfrey', 'NR', 'A child conceived by a mute servant girl transforms from an innocent youth to a killer beast at night with uncontrollable urges.', 'A child conceived by a mute servant girl transforms from an innocent youth to a killer beast at night with uncontrollable urges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKQ6kovQVp2I7g1hJegOo8vRBhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28752'),
  ('204154516009847489', 'The Curse of the Yellow Snake', 1963, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Franz Josef Gottlieb, Siegfried Hold, Eva Ebner', 'Janne Furch, Franz Josef Gottlieb', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Brigitte Grothum, Pinkas Braun, Doris Kirchner, Charles Regnier, Claus Holm, Fritz Tillmann, Eddi Arent', null, 'A Chinese cult bent on taking over the world uses an idol called The Golden Reptile that they believe can give them the power to achieve their goal.', 'A Chinese cult bent on taking over the world uses an idol called The Golden Reptile that they believe can give them the power to achieve their goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8Hjc9yIj9RD9LsqpKQPAW1NoET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146996'),
  ('953659770681092811', 'The Curse of Turandot', 2021, 'Action, Fantasy, Romance', 'Xiaolong Zheng, Ng Man-Ching', 'Dean Georgaris', 'Guan Xiaotong, Dylan Sprouse, Hu Jun, Jiang Wen, Collin Chou, Sophie Marceau, Vincent Perez, Lin Siyi', null, 'The plot follows Princess Turandot who is cursed by a mysterious power emanating from three Mazovian bracelets that were given to her as birthday gifts. These bracelets’ life-draining effects cause the princess to becomes cruel, and gradually she loses her humanity.', 'The plot follows Princess Turandot who is cursed by a mysterious power emanating from three Mazovian bracelets that were given to her as birthday gifts. These bracelets’ life-draining effects cause the princess to becomes cruel, and gradually she loses her humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6sZFTvDNuJWGNjfmdWWZlgzb7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527169'),
  ('163723325564897123', 'The Cursed', 2021, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Patrick Schmitt, Sean Ellis, Sean Ellis', 'Sean Ellis', 'Boyd Holbrook, Kelly Reilly, Alistair Petrie, Roxane Duran, Nigel Betts, Stuart Bowman, Simon Kunz, Amelia Crouch', 'R', 'In the late 19th century, a brutal land baron slaughters a Roma clan, unleashing a curse on his family and village. In the days that follow, the townspeople are plagued by nightmares, the baron''s son goes missing, and a boy is found murdered. The locals suspect a wild animal, but a visiting pathologist warns of a more sinister presence lurking in the woods.', 'In the late 19th century, a brutal land baron slaughters a Roma clan, unleashing a curse on his family and village. In the days that follow, the townspeople are plagued by nightmares, the baron''s son goes missing, and a boy is found murdered. The locals suspect a wild animal, but a visiting pathologist warns of a more sinister presence lurking in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bewmBcjJxHeipS1PNu9Lfyvt3zY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630392'),
  ('220697432460275507', 'The Cursed Land', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Chankit Chamnivikaipong, Panu Aree, Apitorn Aruntanatip', 'Kong Rithdee', 'Ananda Everingham, Bront Palarae, Jennis Oprasert, Firdaus Karim, Han Zalini, Seeda Puapimon, Priya Sangkhachinda, Yok Sirimat', null, 'A widower and his daughter travel''s to Thailand''s deep south to seek help from a Muslim doctor after unleashing a djinn in a rundown house.', 'A widower and his daughter travel''s to Thailand''s deep south to seek help from a Muslim doctor after unleashing a djinn in a rundown house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2xI8LpnleyWzIrjtgBLrE3fc13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1143959'),
  ('904997614635698000', 'The Cursed Lesson', 2020, 'Horror', 'Lee Du-hoon, Kim Tae-hun, Juhn Jai-hong', 'Juhn Jai-hong', 'Lee Chae-young, Choi Cheol-ho, Jo Jung-min, Kan Mi-youn, Han Se-min, Kim In-seo, Bae Soo-kyung, Chae Won-been', null, 'Online fashion model Hyo-jeong faces imminent threat of being unemployed because of the younger and more fashionable generation coming after her. While relying on surgical procedures and treatments, Hyo-jeong hears about a mysterious yoga class that helps make perfect body shape from her old high school classmate, Ga-yeong. Hyo-jeong eventually attends the yoga class with three classmates: Mi-yeon, a boxer who failed to keep her body fit, Ji-won, who has unstable mental condition, and Ye-na, a movie star who is morbidly obsessed with her appearance. Meanwhile, police start to investigate the enigma behind this yoga class after finding out that a murder in the neighborhood was committed by a woman named Bo-ra, a former yoga class student.', 'Online fashion model Hyo-jeong faces imminent threat of being unemployed because of the younger and more fashionable generation coming after her. While relying on surgical procedures and treatments, Hyo-jeong hears about a mysterious yoga class that helps make perfect body shape from her old high school classmate, Ga-yeong. Hyo-jeong eventually attends the yoga class with three classmates: Mi-yeon, a boxer who failed to keep her body fit, Ji-won, who has unstable mental condition, and Ye-na, a movie star who is morbidly obsessed with her appearance. Meanwhile, police start to investigate the enigma behind this yoga class after finding out that a murder in the neighborhood was committed by a woman named Bo-ra, a former yoga class student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lWDGJwLRQv5mzbN9MGvHrpHxJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759917'),
  ('274604847068333834', 'The Cursed Village', 1930, 'Drama', 'Alberto Arroyo, Florián Rey', 'Florián Rey', 'Carmen Viance, Pedro Larrañaga, Amelia Muñoz, Pilar Torres, Ramón Meca, Víctor Pastor, Antonio Mata, Modesto Rivas', null, 'Region of Castilla La Vieja, Spain, early 20th century. In Luján, a village ravaged by drought, Juan, a humble farmer who survives with his wife and son, confronts a local loan shark and is imprisoned as a result.', 'Region of Castilla La Vieja, Spain, early 20th century. In Luján, a village ravaged by drought, Juan, a humble farmer who survives with his wife and son, confronts a local loan shark and is imprisoned as a result.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tP5ocgHQwjweeUwaDo2Zo0Z62De.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403838'),
  ('211778656165185989', 'The Cursed: Dead Man''s Prey', 2021, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Lee Ji-hoon, Moon Il-ho, Lee Ju-won', 'Yeon Sang-ho', 'Uhm Ji-won, Jung Zi-so, Jung Moon-sung, Kim In-kwon, Ko Kyu-pil, Oh Yoon-ah, Kwon Hae-hyo, Lee Sul', null, 'Following a brutal murder case, the police are baffled to find out that the assailant, whose body was found on the scene with the victim, had already been dead for three months. Meanwhile, journalist Jin-hee sets up a live interview with an anonymous caller claiming he is the true killer behind the mysterious murder. When the man announces three more murders will occur in the hands of the undead, Jin-hee must face the sinister forces beyond understanding.', 'Following a brutal murder case, the police are baffled to find out that the assailant, whose body was found on the scene with the victim, had already been dead for three months. Meanwhile, journalist Jin-hee sets up a live interview with an anonymous caller claiming he is the true killer behind the mysterious murder. When the man announces three more murders will occur in the hands of the undead, Jin-hee must face the sinister forces beyond understanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Bvbaztl8M2kn3vjfveaMQhcWk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724885'),
  ('1142688499165263424', 'The Cursed: Insatiable Desires', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Hong Won-ki, Park Jong-cheol, Ok Sung-jun', 'Yoo Young-seon', 'You Chea-myung, Moon Chae-won, Seo Young-hee, Won Hyun-jun, Solar, Cha Sun-woo, Sumin, Seo Ji-soo', null, 'An old man attempting to harm the village''s mystical guardian tree. An office worker, obsessed with beauty, tampering with her neighbor''s packages. A mother making deals with ghosts to secure her daughter''s place in medical school. A senior police officer insisting on handling a case alone, despite his junior''s objections. A college student seeking fame on social media through horror content. These seemingly unrelated incidents are eerily linked by their intertwined relationships and a shared undercurrent of wrong choices driven by desire. At the heart of it all lies a sinister dark market. Once its true nature is revealed, there’s no turning back.', 'An old man attempting to harm the village''s mystical guardian tree. An office worker, obsessed with beauty, tampering with her neighbor''s packages. A mother making deals with ghosts to secure her daughter''s place in medical school. A senior police officer insisting on handling a case alone, despite his junior''s objections. A college student seeking fame on social media through horror content. These seemingly unrelated incidents are eerily linked by their intertwined relationships and a shared undercurrent of wrong choices driven by desire. At the heart of it all lies a sinister dark market. Once its true nature is revealed, there’s no turning back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mU48A2SXrWTak6GlsFPn4uulN0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1420733'),
  ('1106481412621950708', 'The Curtain Rises', 1938, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marc Allégret, Christian Matras, Ernest Bourreaud', 'Marc Allégret, André Cayatte', 'Louis Jouvet, Claude Dauphin, Janine Darcey, Odette Joyeux, Bernard Blier, Robert Pizani, Madeleine Lambert, Roger Blin', null, '1938, France, Paris, at the Superior Conservatory of Dramatic Art ("Conservatoire Supérieur d''Art Dramatique"). The first-year entrance exams are in full swing. Many applicants, few accepted. Isabelle (Janine Darcey) is one of the few chosen. She joins former students from the second and third years, including François (Claude Dauphin) and Cécilia (Odette Joyeux). They attend the drama class run by Professor Lambertin (Louis Jouvet). The young people, passionate and eager to become comedians, clash in tumultuous love affairs, because by dint of acting, they imagine that life is a farce. François, for example, is in love with Isabelle, who also loves him, but is pursued by Cecilia, his former mistress... "Put art in your life and life in your art!"', '1938, France, Paris, at the Superior Conservatory of Dramatic Art ("Conservatoire Supérieur d''Art Dramatique"). The first-year entrance exams are in full swing. Many applicants, few accepted. Isabelle (Janine Darcey) is one of the few chosen. She joins former students from the second and third years, including François (Claude Dauphin) and Cécilia (Odette Joyeux). They attend the drama class run by Professor Lambertin (Louis Jouvet). The young people, passionate and eager to become comedians, clash in tumultuous love affairs, because by dint of acting, they imagine that life is a farce. François, for example, is in love with Isabelle, who also loves him, but is pursued by Cecilia, his former mistress... "Put art in your life and life in your art!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQq1sjEpnHzhVjzd0nLJ1JOvJQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64294'),
  ('775437835822167455', 'The Curve', 1998, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Dan Rosen, Joey Forsyte', 'Dan Rosen', 'Matthew Lillard, Michael Vartan, Randall Batinkoff, Keri Russell, Tamara Marie Watson, Anthony Griffith, Bo Dietl, Kevin Ruf', 'R', 'Two roommates plan to kill a third to take advantage of college policy giving a 4.0 grade to a suicide''s roommates.', 'Two roommates plan to kill a third to take advantage of college policy giving a 4.0 grade to a suicide''s roommates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4Ql4swnnosHQoOSObHiHToPKOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44625'),
  ('948667292915990115', 'The Curve', 1999, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Edwige Shaki', 'Edwige Shaki', 'Edwige Shaki, François Rauscher, André Del Debbio', null, 'A featurette directed by French actress Edwige Shaki where Eric Rohmer worked as a technical adviser, THE CURVE is a movie that has the inimitable Rohmer stamp. Talky, it makes its fifteen minutes seem a little longer. However, it''s a playful little thing, where an art student meets his grandfather, a sculptor, and both exchange ideas about that part of the woman that is so alluring -- the curve of her back.', 'A featurette directed by French actress Edwige Shaki where Eric Rohmer worked as a technical adviser, THE CURVE is a movie that has the inimitable Rohmer stamp. Talky, it makes its fifteen minutes seem a little longer. However, it''s a playful little thing, where an art student meets his grandfather, a sculptor, and both exchange ideas about that part of the woman that is so alluring -- the curve of her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zbAjpUnXsU0cvxyJlqpfAh8fbX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75448'),
  ('382099527497845781', 'The Custodian', 2007, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo Moreno, Bárbara Álvarez, Rodrigo Moreno', 'Rodrigo Moreno', 'Julio Chávez, Osmar Núñez, Marcelo D''Andrea, Elvira Onetto, Cristina Villamor, Luciana Lifschitz, Osvaldo Djeredjian, Julieta Vallina', null, 'Living the mundane existence of a professional bodyguard, always in the shadows of his clients, Ruben decides to make a change that will finally give him a personal connection outside of his solitary world.', 'Living the mundane existence of a professional bodyguard, always in the shadows of his clients, Ruben decides to make a change that will finally give him a personal connection outside of his solitary world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0HZG9FMoIYid5sa1dAIvJ7FEfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99896'),
  ('582850892108009421', 'The Customer Is Always Right', 2006, 'Thriller', 'Jang Seong-baek, Oh Gi-hyeon', 'Oh Gi-hyeon', 'Dong Bang-woo, Sung Ji-ru, Sung Hyun-ah, Lee Sun-kyun, Park Cheol-min, Lee Myeong-jin, Lee Choon-yun, Lee Jae-seok', null, 'In a peaceful barbershop, a timid barber confronts a stranger who has started to send blackmail notes. Whenever the stranger comes to the barbershop, the amount of money he demands becomes greater and greater. Driven to desperation, the barber hires a detective, who discovers a shocking truth about the blackmailer.', 'In a peaceful barbershop, a timid barber confronts a stranger who has started to send blackmail notes. Whenever the stranger comes to the barbershop, the amount of money he demands becomes greater and greater. Driven to desperation, the barber hires a detective, who discovers a shocking truth about the blackmailer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blCri7QsdwN5HyDa8d7NSUkPslv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230883'),
  ('84087186056135934', 'The Cut', 2014, 'History, Drama', 'Fatih Akin, Rainer Klausmann, Nenad Pečur', 'Fatih Akin, Mardik Martin', 'Tahar Rahim, Simon Abkarian, Makram J. Khoury, Hindi Zahra, Kevork Malikyan, Bartu Küçükçağlayan, Trine Dyrholm, Moritz Bleibtreu', null, 'In 1915 a man survives the Armenian genocide in the Ottoman Empire, but loses his family, speech and faith. One night he learns that his twin daughters may be alive, and goes on a quest to find them.', 'In 1915 a man survives the Armenian genocide in the Ottoman Empire, but loses his family, speech and faith. One night he learns that his twin daughters may be alive, and goes on a quest to find them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QGmH2wYtZWyrFZ2T9VFOJntsfR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250230'),
  ('1108093009321075549', 'The Cut', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Sean Ellis, Sean Ellis', 'Justin Bull', 'Orlando Bloom, Caitríona Balfe, John Turturro, Gary Beadle, Clare Dunne, Ed Kear, Mohammed Mansaray, Oliver Trevena', 'R', 'A retired boxer intends to return to the ring for one last shot at the title, but first he must make the weight. Holed up in a room in Las Vegas with an unscrupulous trainer, he embarks on an intensive and illegal weight-cutting program.', 'A retired boxer intends to return to the ring for one last shot at the title, but first he must make the weight. Holed up in a room in Las Vegas with an unscrupulous trainer, he embarks on an intensive and illegal weight-cutting program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iseyProRsPyu3rOCzsXDDnDGrl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1215798'),
  ('671116692035683258', 'The Cut-Throats', 1969, 'Action, War, Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'John Hayes, David Chase, Paul Hipp', 'John Hayes', 'Jay Scott, E.J. Walsh, William Guhl, Janice Douglas, Marland Proctor, John Keith, Michael Pataki, Uschi Digard', null, 'Captain Kohler recruits an outfit of five American soldiers besides himself (dubbed "The Cut-Throats,") to attack a German stronghold to capture battle plans... although his real motive is to steal a cache of jewels that is Nazi plunder. After the enemy soldiers are gunned down, the beautiful women in the compound treat The Dirty Half-Dozen to a stage show and, later, themselves.', 'Captain Kohler recruits an outfit of five American soldiers besides himself (dubbed "The Cut-Throats,") to attack a German stronghold to capture battle plans... although his real motive is to steal a cache of jewels that is Nazi plunder. After the enemy soldiers are gunned down, the beautiful women in the compound treat The Dirty Half-Dozen to a stage show and, later, themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7c2cfpNxrFQE6gQ2v0iWanFav3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104531'),
  ('477537355326022742', 'The Cut-Ups', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Antony Balch', null, 'William S. Burroughs, Brion Gysin', null, 'Essentially a dizzying montage of quirky shots of legendary Beat Generation writer William S. Burroughs and noted surrealist artist Brion Gysin, this nearly 20 minute avant-garde short features repeated articulations of such random things as "Hello," "Where are we now?," and "Look at that picture" instead of music or standard dialogue. The narrative is decidedly nonlinear and perplexing, with no discernible plot whatsoever as we see images of Gysin working on his paintings and calligraphic designs and Burroughs rummaging through draws, packing a suitcase, giving a young man a physical, making a call in a phone booth, and waiting on a platform for a subway train.', 'Essentially a dizzying montage of quirky shots of legendary Beat Generation writer William S. Burroughs and noted surrealist artist Brion Gysin, this nearly 20 minute avant-garde short features repeated articulations of such random things as "Hello," "Where are we now?," and "Look at that picture" instead of music or standard dialogue. The narrative is decidedly nonlinear and perplexing, with no discernible plot whatsoever as we see images of Gysin working on his paintings and calligraphic designs and Burroughs rummaging through draws, packing a suitcase, giving a young man a physical, making a call in a phone booth, and waiting on a platform for a subway train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZnMPR0JKPESNzryH0vLcrQBDGR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143497'),
  ('1110613864090263102', 'The Cutlass', 1973, 'Adventure, Family', 'Nikolai Kalinin', 'Anatoli Rybakov', 'Sergei Shevkunenko, Vladimir Dichkovsky, Emmanuil Vitorgan, Viktor Sergachyov, Natalya Chemodurova, Zoya Fyodorova, Leonid Kmit, Mikhail Golubovich', null, 'A Red Army officer Polevoy possesses a navy dirk with a secret message encrypted in its handle. The second part of a message belongs to a White army officer Nikitskiy. It''s up to three young friends of Polevoy to uncover the mystery.', 'A Red Army officer Polevoy possesses a navy dirk with a secret message encrypted in its handle. The second part of a message belongs to a White army officer Nikitskiy. It''s up to three young friends of Polevoy to uncover the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5PFohePArudNqBz6pyze7L8o6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77051'),
  ('65709288588334132', 'The Cutter', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'William Tannen, Peter Moss', 'Bruce Haskett', 'Chuck Norris, Joanna Pacula, Daniel Bernhardt, Bernie Kopell, Todd Jensen, John T. Woods, Marshall R. Teague, Aaron Norris', 'R', 'A former cop turned Los Angeles P.I. takes on a case of a missing diamond cutter that leads him on an adventure of love and villainy spanning of mob to the present day Jewelry District.', 'A former cop turned Los Angeles P.I. takes on a case of a missing diamond cutter that leads him on an adventure of love and villainy spanning of mob to the present day Jewelry District.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pwUWFRmjsOtzvS4y4xY0bApWwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20499'),
  ('733344446941496046', 'The Cutting Edge', 1992, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Michael Glaser, Elliot Davis', 'Tony Gilroy', 'D. B. Sweeney, Moira Kelly, Roy Dotrice, Terry O''Quinn, Dwier Brown, Chris Benson, Kevin Peeks, Barry Flatman', 'PG', 'Two former Olympians, one a figure skater and the other a hockey player, pin their hopes of one last shot at Olympic glory on one another. That is, of course, if they can keep from killing each other in the process...', 'Two former Olympians, one a figure skater and the other a hockey player, pin their hopes of one last shot at Olympic glory on one another. That is, of course, if they can keep from killing each other in the process...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sx4qf2XoW0xaLITQLpajsYc4mcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16562'),
  ('499160802653212985', 'The Cutting Edge: Chasing the Dream', 2008, 'Romance, Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Stuart Gillard, Pierre Jodoin', 'Randall M. Badat', 'Matt Lanter, Francia Raísa, Sarah Gadon, Stefano DiMatteo, Benjamin Hollingsworth, Luis Oliva, Alycia Purrott, Christy Carlson Romano', null, 'A world class ice skater eager to take the top prize in the biggest competition around finds his dreams going up in flames after his partner suffers a debilitating injury in this romantic sports drama starring Matt Lanter, Francia Rosa, and Christy Carlson Romano. Zack (Lanter) was headed for the gold when his partner suffered an injury that made competing impossible, but could a feisty female hockey player prove the key to keeping his illustrious career on track? Alexandra is an amateur Latina hockey player who has never skated professionally and doesn''t much care for Zack, though a little determination goes a long way in helping Zack convince her to join him on the ice. Now, as this unlikely pair begins the arduous training process that could make them both bona-fide superstars, the girl with the icy attitude finds her handsome partner''s warmth and charm bringing about a most unexpected thaw.', 'A world class ice skater eager to take the top prize in the biggest competition around finds his dreams going up in flames after his partner suffers a debilitating injury in this romantic sports drama starring Matt Lanter, Francia Rosa, and Christy Carlson Romano. Zack (Lanter) was headed for the gold when his partner suffered an injury that made competing impossible, but could a feisty female hockey player prove the key to keeping his illustrious career on track? Alexandra is an amateur Latina hockey player who has never skated professionally and doesn''t much care for Zack, though a little determination goes a long way in helping Zack convince her to join him on the ice. Now, as this unlikely pair begins the arduous training process that could make them both bona-fide superstars, the girl with the icy attitude finds her handsome partner''s warmth and charm bringing about a most unexpected thaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwhDGNlBplpLxnZsI1x3SbnZb5q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15088'),
  ('718137286782908849', 'The Cutting Edge: Fire & Ice', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Stephen Herek, Pierre Jodoin', 'Holly Brix', 'Francia Raísa, Brendan Fehr, Russell Yuen, Zhenhu Han, Stephen Amell, Marcela Pizarro, Anthony Lemke, Dan Jeannotte', null, 'After her partner''s career-ending injury, a former figure skater shifts gears to become an instructor. Later, she finds the strength to return to competitive skating by partnering with an unconventional and notorious speed skater.', 'After her partner''s career-ending injury, a former figure skater shifts gears to become an instructor. Later, she finds the strength to return to competitive skating by partnering with an unconventional and notorious speed skater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHhTXggQ1umVRvzeSGrOlZ9qFX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40080'),
  ('211028989573055530', 'The Cutting Edge: Going for the Gold', 2006, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mark Doering-Powell, Sean McNamara, Aaron Penn', 'Dan Berendsen', 'Christy Carlson Romano, Ross Thomas, Scott Thompson Baker, Kim Kindrick, Faune Chambers Watkins, Christine Lakin, Oksana Baiul, Kayla Carlson', 'PG-13', 'Two ice skaters develop a love-hate relationship while dreaming of Olympic glory.', 'Two ice skaters develop a love-hate relationship while dreaming of Olympic glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDF8zGixn3WVWSKc2usVGjPWc7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14872'),
  ('175960677414974870', 'The Cutting Edge: The Magic of Movie Editing', 2004, 'Documentary, History', 'John Bailey, Wendy Apple', 'Mark Jonathan Harris, Gary Scott Thompson', 'Kathy Bates, Martin Scorsese, Quentin Tarantino, Jodie Foster, Steven Spielberg, James Cameron, Sean Penn, Wes Craven', null, 'Documentary about the art of film editing. Clips are shown from many groundbreaking films with innovative editing styles.', 'Documentary about the art of film editing. Clips are shown from many groundbreaking films with innovative editing styles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiMCb4qnOvbIdKjW91S1pdAuSl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44345'),
  ('187159297162994503', 'The Cycle', 2026, 'Documentary, Short, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Tyler Knowles, DesmondGN, WildAndCrazy', 'Tyler Knowles, nightenday', 'pixelatedart3495, Gary Knowles, Lily Saunders, Sara homsey, Athen walker', 'R', 'In the near future a new drug outlawed by the government called time that once taken makes you immortal but the catch is every time you die you go back to the same spot you were killed but on the same day you took the drug. We follow Curio a mysterious loner that has to complete a mission no matter how many times he dies.', 'In the near future a new drug outlawed by the government called time that once taken makes you immortal but the catch is every time you die you go back to the same spot you were killed but on the same day you took the drug. We follow Curio a mysterious loner that has to complete a mission no matter how many times he dies.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fj1a30FaS7mFFhsnAzd9mP8oTrUN.jpg', 'plex:movie:fiestas-madrilenas'),
  ('963071211813987007', 'The Cycle Savages', 1969, 'Drama, Action', 'Bill Brame, Frank Ruttencutter', 'Bill Brame', 'Bruce Dern, Melody Patterson, Chris Robinson, Maray Ayres, Karen Ciral, Mick Mehas, Jack Konzal, Walter Robles', 'R', 'The leader of a biker gang takes exception to an artist sketching them, so he makes plans to crush the artist''s hands.', 'The leader of a biker gang takes exception to an artist sketching them, so he makes plans to crush the artist''s hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4ObAJszCgOtVFxvqBc6zNTpFfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69151'),
  ('192472132890914870', 'The Cyclist', 1989, 'Drama', 'Mohsen Makhmalbaf, Ali Reza Zarrindast, Morteza Masa''eli', 'Mohsen Makhmalbaf', 'Mahshid Afsharzadeh, Firouz Kiani, Samira Makhmalbaf, Mohammadreza Maleki, Esmail Soltanian, Moharram Zaynalzadeh', null, 'The wife of Nasim, an Afghan immigrant in Iran, is gravely ill. He needs money to pay for her care, but his day labor digging wells does not pay enough. A friend connects Nasim to a two-bit promoter who sells tickets to watch Nasim ride a bicycle continuously for a week. The promoter brings in sick and aged spectators, haranguing them to find hope in Nasim''s strength. Aided by his son, who feeds him as he rides, Nasim grinds out the days and shivering nights. Local officials believe this may be a plot and Nasim may be a spy; they try to sabotage him as do those who bet he won''t finish the week. Will desperation alone get Nasim the money? Is any triumph an illusion?', 'The wife of Nasim, an Afghan immigrant in Iran, is gravely ill. He needs money to pay for her care, but his day labor digging wells does not pay enough. A friend connects Nasim to a two-bit promoter who sells tickets to watch Nasim ride a bicycle continuously for a week. The promoter brings in sick and aged spectators, haranguing them to find hope in Nasim''s strength. Aided by his son, who feeds him as he rides, Nasim grinds out the days and shivering nights. Local officials believe this may be a plot and Nasim may be a spy; they try to sabotage him as do those who bet he won''t finish the week. Will desperation alone get Nasim the money? Is any triumph an illusion?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46PrHGTqvm5KVXzeSDuRRBmAZNY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44072'),
  ('508409393700562044', 'The Cyclone', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Roberto Forza, Marco Limberti', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Lorena Forteza, Barbara Enrichi, Massimo Ceccherini, Sergio Forconi, Tosca D''Aquino, Patrizia Corti, Benedetta Mazzini', null, 'The everyday life of accountant Levante, his family and the other people of a small town in the Tuscan countryside is taken by storm by the serendipitous arrival of five gorgeous Spanish flamenco dancers.', 'The everyday life of accountant Levante, his family and the other people of a small town in the Tuscan countryside is taken by storm by the serendipitous arrival of five gorgeous Spanish flamenco dancers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyIO4UfPiJgnugMtg754dL3izcy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38366'),
  ('244920738720598502', 'The Cyclops', 1957, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bert I. Gordon, Ray Taylor Jr., Harry L. Fraser', 'Bert I. Gordon', 'James Craig, Gloria Talbott, Lon Chaney Jr., Tom Drake, Duncan ''Dean'' Parkin, Vicente Padula, Marlene Kloss, Manuel López', 'NR', 'A test pilot is missing and a search party is sent out in the jungles of Mexico; however, while searching they uncover a monster in the jungle who became this way due to a dose of radioactivity.', 'A test pilot is missing and a search party is sent out in the jungles of Mexico; however, while searching they uncover a monster in the jungle who became this way due to a dose of radioactivity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7D3PRSvAJ9ml1Li2dL4bkIR5Wy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43249'),
  ('121406610955331545', 'The Cynic, the Rat & the Fist', 1977, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Umberto Lenzi, Filiberto Fiaschi, Federico Zanni', 'Ernesto Gastaldi, Umberto Lenzi, Dardano Sacchetti', 'Maurizio Merli, John Saxon, Tomas Milian, Gabriella Lepori, Renzo Palmer, Claudio Undari, Bruno Corazzari, Gabriella Giorgelli', null, 'A vengeful criminal targets the inspector who put him away, but the inspector survives and fakes his death. Ignoring orders to flee, he sets out to bring the fugitive back to justice.', 'A vengeful criminal targets the inspector who put him away, but the inspector survives and fakes his death. Ignoring orders to flee, he sets out to bring the fugitive back to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnKKiGULec4PsE0Udo23SEdGXk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52810'),
  ('289260700232016323', 'The Czech Year', 1947, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'Jiří Trnka, Vladimír Novotný, Emanuel Franek', 'Jiří Trnka', null, null, 'The first full-length puppet film made by Jiri Trnka. Like the painter Ales who illustrated the national songs, Trnka depicts the traditional customs and tales of the Czech village in six separate sequences: Shrovetide, Spring, Legend About St. Prokop, The Fair, The Feast and Bethlehem." A Treasury of Fairy-tales" made Trnka famous all over the world and it is a masterpiece of Czech and world animation.', 'The first full-length puppet film made by Jiri Trnka. Like the painter Ales who illustrated the national songs, Trnka depicts the traditional customs and tales of the Czech village in six separate sequences: Shrovetide, Spring, Legend About St. Prokop, The Fair, The Feast and Bethlehem." A Treasury of Fairy-tales" made Trnka famous all over the world and it is a masterpiece of Czech and world animation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84eZWKbyeCvwkrSMDJd9Myy7fJx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308387'),
  ('426520449003488397', 'The D Train', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jarrad Paul, Andrew Mogel, Giles Nuttgens', 'Andrew Mogel, Jarrad Paul', 'Jack Black, James Marsden, Kathryn Hahn, Jeffrey Tambor, Mike White, Kyle Bornheimer, Henry Zebrowski, Corrina Lyons', 'R', 'With his 20th reunion looming, Dan can’t shake his high school insecurities. In a misguided mission to prove he’s changed, Dan rekindles a friendship with the popular guy from his class and is left scrambling to protect more than just his reputation when a wild night takes an unexpected turn.', 'With his 20th reunion looming, Dan can’t shake his high school insecurities. In a misguided mission to prove he’s changed, Dan rekindles a friendship with the popular guy from his class and is left scrambling to protect more than just his reputation when a wild night takes an unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34sJQxmJT42jioSiabF5QobG0NC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308638'),
  ('228474555783548518', 'The D.I.', 1957, 'Drama', 'Jack Webb', 'James Lee Barrett', 'Jack Webb, Don Dubbins, Jackie Loughery, Lin McCarthy, Monica Lewis, Virginia Gregg, Jeannie Beacham, Lou Tobin', null, 'Gunnery Sergeant Jim Moore is one of the toughest Drill Instructors on Parris Island. But he''s got a thorn in his side: Pvt. Owens, who always seems to foul up when the pressure''s on. Convinced that "there''s a man underneath that baby powder," Sgt. Moore drives Owens to the point of desertion. Making things worse, Capt. Anderson has given Moore three days to make the scared private into Marine material, "or I''ll personally cut the lace off his panties and ship him out!" Adding to the pressure, Moore also juggles a budding romance with a shop girl.', 'Gunnery Sergeant Jim Moore is one of the toughest Drill Instructors on Parris Island. But he''s got a thorn in his side: Pvt. Owens, who always seems to foul up when the pressure''s on. Convinced that "there''s a man underneath that baby powder," Sgt. Moore drives Owens to the point of desertion. Making things worse, Capt. Anderson has given Moore three days to make the scared private into Marine material, "or I''ll personally cut the lace off his panties and ship him out!" Adding to the pressure, Moore also juggles a budding romance with a shop girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcIRjXxlLVFsxrSoHEKaqq815D1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23525'),
  ('1112268003350272681', 'The Dacians', 1967, 'War, Drama, History', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, Ion Năstase, Nicolae Corjos', 'Jacques Rémy, Titus Popovici', 'Pierre Brice, Marie-José Nat, Georges Marchal, Amza Pellea, Mircea Albulescu, Alexandru Herescu, György Kovács, Ion Apahideanu', null, 'The great King of Dacia, Decebal (Decebalus), is disposed to make the ultimate sacrifice in order to keep the integrity of his people. His own son, Cotyso, is given to the god Zamolxis to the dismay of the King and his daughter Meda. Septimius Severus, a young Roman devoted to his adopted country, must make the choice between his blood origins and the culture he was introduced to.', 'The great King of Dacia, Decebal (Decebalus), is disposed to make the ultimate sacrifice in order to keep the integrity of his people. His own son, Cotyso, is given to the god Zamolxis to the dismay of the King and his daughter Meda. Septimius Severus, a young Roman devoted to his adopted country, must make the choice between his blood origins and the culture he was introduced to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7MoNpvg0ZUvNrrpw4arcNHaWKf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36662'),
  ('127974206818283895', 'The Dad Quest', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Salvador Espinosa, Andrés León Becker', 'Tato Alexander', 'Michel Brown, Martino Leonardi, Mayra Hermosillo, Fernanda Castillo, Julieta Egurrola, Angélica Vale, Erik Rubín, Arath de la Torre', 'PG-13', 'When a father-son duo learns that they may not be biologically related, the two embark on a wild adventure through Mexico to find the truth.', 'When a father-son duo learns that they may not be biologically related, the two embark on a wild adventure through Mexico to find the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YxF7mW7vp6ETRYznnlkWIsauem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1446943'),
  ('735596571295409951', 'The Daffy Doc', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert Clampett, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Sara Berner', null, 'After being thrown out of the operating room as Dr. Quack''s assistant, Dr. Daffy Duck makes Porky Pig his own - unwilling - patient.', 'After being thrown out of the operating room as Dr. Quack''s assistant, Dr. Daffy Duck makes Porky Pig his own - unwilling - patient.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rt7w9MhLhG24ReCU5rYvMngaAjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178113'),
  ('182411712726406066', 'The Daffy Duckaroo', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Norm McCabe', null, 'Mel Blanc, Sara Berner', null, 'Singing cowboy Daffy retires to the Painted Desert (still wet). He falls for an Indian maiden with a Brooklyn accent, but her very large boyfriend catches them. Daffy dresses in drag, which fools him for a while until Daffy''s wig falls off. The boyfriend chases Daffy into the Petrified Forest (where Daffy freezes and breaks tomahawks). The Indian sends smoke signals from a phone booth and his tribe attacks Daffy, trapping him under his house trailer.', 'Singing cowboy Daffy retires to the Painted Desert (still wet). He falls for an Indian maiden with a Brooklyn accent, but her very large boyfriend catches them. Daffy dresses in drag, which fools him for a while until Daffy''s wig falls off. The boyfriend chases Daffy into the Petrified Forest (where Daffy freezes and breaks tomahawks). The Indian sends smoke signals from a phone booth and his tribe attacks Daffy, trapping him under his house trailer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3MsqXIGzqvC9xCwkzdmO7y7CXD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236636'),
  ('1113331203353741740', 'The Dagger of Kamui', 1985, 'Animation, Action, Adventure', 'Rintaro, Takuo Noda', 'Mori Masaki', 'Hiroyuki Sanada, Taro Ishida, Yuriko Yamamoto, Kaneto Shiozawa, Takeshi Aono, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Takashi Ebata, Takashi Toyama', null, 'A young boy named Jiro finds his mother and sister murdered in his home. Falsely accused of the crime, he flees from his village and meets a priest named Tenkai, who has him kill a rogue ninja named Tarouza. After fulfilling that task, Jiro undergoes training to become a master assassin. Many years later, Jiro finds out that he was an orphan and his real father was Tarouza, who had worked for Tenkai until he aborted his mission when he fell in love with an Ainu woman. The young ninja discovers that the Shogunate was to retrieve the lost treasure of Captain Kidd and use it to once again isolate Japan from the rest of the world. Using the clues that Tarouza had kept secret, Jiro - along with the female ninja Oyuki and a slave named Sam - travels to Russia and America to search for the treasure in hopes of using it to extract revenge from Tenkai.', 'A young boy named Jiro finds his mother and sister murdered in his home. Falsely accused of the crime, he flees from his village and meets a priest named Tenkai, who has him kill a rogue ninja named Tarouza. After fulfilling that task, Jiro undergoes training to become a master assassin. Many years later, Jiro finds out that he was an orphan and his real father was Tarouza, who had worked for Tenkai until he aborted his mission when he fell in love with an Ainu woman. The young ninja discovers that the Shogunate was to retrieve the lost treasure of Captain Kidd and use it to once again isolate Japan from the rest of the world. Using the clues that Tarouza had kept secret, Jiro - along with the female ninja Oyuki and a slave named Sam - travels to Russia and America to search for the treasure in hopes of using it to extract revenge from Tenkai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKc4PsZxhEcRTTFCBI6M2dftjCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48215'),
  ('84597669515115940', 'The Daisy Chain', 2008, 'Horror, Drama', 'Aisling Walsh, Simon Kossoff', 'Lauren Mackenzie', 'Samantha Morton, Steven Mackintosh, Mhairi Anderson, David Bradley, Eva Birthistle, Brendan McCormack, Zoe Sheridan, Flora Montgomery', null, 'A grieving couple move to a remote Irish village in the wake of their baby daughter''s death. They soon take in an orphaned autistic girl, only to become involved in a series of strange occurrences.', 'A grieving couple move to a remote Irish village in the wake of their baby daughter''s death. They soon take in an orphaned autistic girl, only to become involved in a series of strange occurrences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MXgVuSfeGOHZjRb0cTqXclypXE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37196'),
  ('1133164821180284783', 'The Dallas Connection', 1994, 'Action', 'Christian Drew Sidaris, Mark Morris, Ed Barham', 'Christian Drew Sidaris', 'Bruce Penhall, Mark Barriere, Julie Strain, Rodrigo Obregón, Samantha Phillips, Julie K. Smith, Wendy Hamilton, Gerald Okamura', 'R', 'Assassins led by Black Widow are out to kill Antonio Morales to prevent him from handing a computer chip over to IWAR headquarters. It''s up to secret agents Chris Cannon, Mark Austin, and Samantha Maxx to stop them.', 'Assassins led by Black Widow are out to kill Antonio Morales to prevent him from handing a computer chip over to IWAR headquarters. It''s up to secret agents Chris Cannon, Mark Austin, and Samantha Maxx to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHrd3gMBi5VgZZEpxixtQpbNZEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67398'),
  ('123388572124097753', 'The Dalton Gang', 2020, 'Western', 'Christopher Forbes', 'Micah Lyons', 'William Adams, Jezibell Anat, Gunner Bridger, Meghan Bridgers, Jerry Chesser, Alan Cope II, Judy DeLoach, William DeLoach', 'R', 'When their brother Frank is killed by an outlaw, brothers Bob Dalton, Emmett Dalton and Gray Dalton join their local sheriff''s department. When they are cheated by the law, they turn to crime, robbing trains and anything else they can steal from over the course of two years in the early 1890''s. Trying to out do Jesse James, they attempt to rob two banks at once in October of 1892, and things get ugly', 'When their brother Frank is killed by an outlaw, brothers Bob Dalton, Emmett Dalton and Gray Dalton join their local sheriff''s department. When they are cheated by the law, they turn to crime, robbing trains and anything else they can steal from over the course of two years in the early 1890''s. Trying to out do Jesse James, they attempt to rob two banks at once in October of 1892, and things get ugly', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OeGqp18oZucUGziMIRNhLouZ75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729648'),
  ('149478869569498406', 'The Dam Busters', 1955, 'Drama, Action, History, Thriller, War', 'Erwin Hillier, Michael Anderson, Robert Lennard', 'R.C. Sherriff', 'Richard Todd, Michael Redgrave, Ursula Jeans, Basil Sydney, Patrick Barr, Ernest Clark, Derek Farr, Charles Carson', 'NR', 'The story of the conception of a new British weapon for smashing the German dams in the Ruhr industrial complex and the execution of the raid by 617 Squadron ''The Dam Busters''.', 'The story of the conception of a new British weapon for smashing the German dams in the Ruhr industrial complex and the execution of the raid by 617 Squadron ''The Dam Busters''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kClSzyjQ7VGsmwIMw0AHBmSQP18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13210'),
  ('58533879789867353', 'The Damned', 1947, 'Drama, War, Thriller', 'René Clément, Henri Alekan', 'René Clément, Henri Jeanson, Jacques Rémy', 'Henri Vidal, Florence Marly, Fosco Giachetti, Paul Bernard, Jo Dest, Michel Auclair, Anne Campion, Jean Didier', null, 'A group of Nazis and sympathizers board a submarine bound for South America in the hopes of finding shelter.', 'A group of Nazis and sympathizers board a submarine bound for South America in the hopes of finding shelter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzlRzlHXp4WtlHjkCEu730Xk4P8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87245'),
  ('1086886435687766954', 'The Damned', 1962, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Joseph Losey, Arthur Grant, John Peverall', 'Evan Jones', 'Macdonald Carey, Shirley Anne Field, Viveca Lindfors, Alexander Knox, Oliver Reed, Walter Gotell, James Villiers, Tom Kempinski', 'NR', 'An American tourist and a troubled young woman are chased by her gang leader brother to a top secret British government facility that conducts experiments on children.', 'An American tourist and a troubled young woman are chased by her gang leader brother to a top secret British government facility that conducts experiments on children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngQlrgkqQe67nL6GvvsjY0kdG4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71701'),
  ('675080708781802210', 'The Damned', 1969, 'Drama, History', 'Luchino Visconti, Albino Cocco, Fanny Wessling', 'Luchino Visconti, Nicola Badalucco, Enrico Medioli', 'Dirk Bogarde, Ingrid Thulin, Helmut Griem, Helmut Berger, Renaud Verley, Umberto Orsini, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Albrecht Schoenhals', 'R', 'In the early days of Nazi Germany, a powerful noble family must adjust to life under the new dictatorship regime.', 'In the early days of Nazi Germany, a powerful noble family must adjust to life under the new dictatorship regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncrB07xLfGzbw10JE1vjQ7gQIT8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41876'),
  ('836302618953849437', 'The Damned', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Víctor García, Alejandro Moreno', 'Richard D''Ovidio', 'Peter Facinelli, Sophia Myles, Nathalia Ramos, Carolina Guerra, Sebastián Martínez, Gustavo Angarita, Juan Pablo Gamboa, Julieta Salazar', 'R', 'After suffering the recent loss of his wife, David Reynolds decides to take his family on a cathartic trip to her home village in Columbia. While en route, they get into a car accident and seek refuge in a secluded inn. While there they find a mysterious young girl, Ana Maria, locked up with cryptic symbols painted on the walls of her cell. Shocked by the treatment of her caretaker, the family sets Ana free only to realize that she is possessed by an evil spirit from centuries past. What’s worse, the spirit can jump from person to person, creating a deadly dynamic amongst the once loving family. Now, David must figure out a way to lock the spirit up for good before it destroys him and his family.', 'After suffering the recent loss of his wife, David Reynolds decides to take his family on a cathartic trip to her home village in Columbia. While en route, they get into a car accident and seek refuge in a secluded inn. While there they find a mysterious young girl, Ana Maria, locked up with cryptic symbols painted on the walls of her cell. Shocked by the treatment of her caretaker, the family sets Ana free only to realize that she is possessed by an evil spirit from centuries past. What’s worse, the spirit can jump from person to person, creating a deadly dynamic amongst the once loving family. Now, David must figure out a way to lock the spirit up for good before it destroys him and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtTlnB7jOfEBiK5eVSLUMWR6aKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258086'),
  ('103442233122604441', 'The Damned', 2024, 'Drama, War, History', 'Roberto Minervini, Carlos Alfonso Corral', 'Roberto Minervini', 'Duncan Vezain, René W. Solomon, Chris Hoffert, Jeremiah Knupp, Cuyler Ballenger, Noah Carlson, Timothy Carlson, Judah Carlson', null, 'Winter 1862. In the midst of the Civil War, the US Army sends a company of volunteer soldiers to the western territories, with the task of patrolling the unchartered borderlands. As their mission ultimately changes course, the meaning behind their engagement begins to elude them.', 'Winter 1862. In the midst of the Civil War, the US Army sends a company of volunteer soldiers to the western territories, with the task of patrolling the unchartered borderlands. As their mission ultimately changes course, the meaning behind their engagement begins to elude them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sG9edsvCAK3a4VIKHQI7TZXFFxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1059010'),
  ('244090387691149462', 'The Damned', 2025, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'Thordur Palsson, Eli Arenson, Willem Quarles van Ufford', 'Jamie Hannigan', 'Odessa Young, Joe Cole, Siobhan Finneran, Rory McCann, Turlough Convery, Lewis Gribben, Francis Magee, Mícheál Óg Lane', 'R', 'A 19th-century widow has to make an impossible choice when, during an especially cruel winter, a foreign ship sinks off the coast of her Icelandic fishing village.', 'A 19th-century widow has to make an impossible choice when, during an especially cruel winter, a foreign ship sinks off the coast of her Icelandic fishing village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAXDQny8kEquc1BImiQHhYMGSsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850439'),
  ('730040510368638142', 'The Damned Don''t Cry', 1950, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ted D. McCord, Vincent Sherman, Ray Heindorf', 'Harold Medford, Jerome Weidman', 'Joan Crawford, David Brian, Steve Cochran, Kent Smith, Hugh Sanders, Selena Royle, Jacqueline deWit, Morris Ankrum', 'NR', 'Fed up with her small-town marriage, a woman goes after the big time and gets mixed up with the mob.', 'Fed up with her small-town marriage, a woman goes after the big time and gets mixed up with the mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kIZMJuGDEag4QWSlY1v8jQIDdQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36656'),
  ('751981284820422007', 'The Damned House of Hajn', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Jiří Svoboda, Hana Hanušová, Georgi Ivanov', 'Václav Šašek, Jiří Svoboda', 'Emil Horváth, Petra Vančíková, Radoslav Brzobohatý, Petr Čepek, Valerie Kaplanová, Evelyna Steimarová, František Řehák, František Husák', null, 'Sonya is the heiress to the riches of a Czech noble family—the Hajns. Petr, a social climber marries her, ignoring some shady goings-on—in particular, an insane uncle who prowls the mansion believing himself invisible, a peccadillo the family indulges. The uncle’s stalking every corner of the house, popping out of cupboards and out from behind curtains slowly takes its toll on the young bride.', 'Sonya is the heiress to the riches of a Czech noble family—the Hajns. Petr, a social climber marries her, ignoring some shady goings-on—in particular, an insane uncle who prowls the mansion believing himself invisible, a peccadillo the family indulges. The uncle’s stalking every corner of the house, popping out of cupboards and out from behind curtains slowly takes its toll on the young bride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KFpXDyGkrGNv8ML41O6zLgQgs7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113428'),
  ('264877079155730527', 'The Damned Rib', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Juan José Jusid, Alfredo Mayo', 'Marcos Carnevale', 'Susana Giménez, Luis Brandoni, Betiana Blum, Rossy de Palma, Loles León, Guillermo Nimo, Fabián Gianola, Rodolfo Ranni', null, 'Four women decide to go together to have fun at a men''s strip show. On the trip, the taxi driver pays attention to their conversation where each one tells the others her ideal of a man. Since then, he decides to pass himself off as the ideal man.', 'Four women decide to go together to have fun at a men''s strip show. On the trip, the taxi driver pays attention to their conversation where each one tells the others her ideal of a man. Since then, he decides to pass himself off as the ideal man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jm2tWfY6RldRrHqdJJ3Fyzlkd0e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370686'),
  ('979480239288731360', 'The Damned Thing', 2006, 'Horror, TV Movie, Drama', 'Tobe Hooper, Jon Joffin', null, 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Marisa Coughlan, Brendan Fletcher, Alex Ferris, Brent Stait, Georgia Craig, Ryan Drescher, Ted Raimi', null, 'Sheriff Reddle thinks there''s a connection between a mysterious, invisible force that made his father kill his mother back in 1981. He sets out to uncover and stop the so-called "dammed thing" before it decimates the whole town by forcing the residents to kill each other and then finally... themselves.', 'Sheriff Reddle thinks there''s a connection between a mysterious, invisible force that made his father kill his mother back in 1981. He sets out to uncover and stop the so-called "dammed thing" before it decimates the whole town by forcing the residents to kill each other and then finally... themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDRAeqepWtoXkfQGKJtpnkYbi0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319311'),
  ('728203228990097062', 'The Damned United', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Ben Smithard, Tom Hooper, Tom Rye', 'Peter Morgan', 'Michael Sheen, Timothy Spall, Colm Meaney, Jim Broadbent, Maurice Roëves, Stephen Graham, Henry Goodman, Mark Bazeley', 'R', 'Taking over Leeds United, Brian Clough''s abrasive approach and his clear dislike of the players'' dirty style of play make it certain there is going to be friction. Glimpses of his earlier career help explain both his hostility to previous manager Don Revie and how much he is missing right-hand man Peter Taylor.', 'Taking over Leeds United, Brian Clough''s abrasive approach and his clear dislike of the players'' dirty style of play make it certain there is going to be friction. Glimpses of his earlier career help explain both his hostility to previous manager Don Revie and how much he is missing right-hand man Peter Taylor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftlbCma6QoRiZgiflVmLuPKHrkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21641'),
  ('918677145348660636', 'The Dance of Life', 1929, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'A. Edward Sutherland, John Cromwell, J. Roy Hunt', 'Benjamin Glazer', 'Hal Skelly, Nancy Carroll, Dorothy Revier, Ralph Theodore, Charles D. Brown, Al St. John, May Boley, Oscar Levant', null, 'A vaudeville comic and a pretty young dancer aren''t having much luck in their separate careers, so they decide to combine their acts. In order to save money on the road, they get married. Soon their act begins to catch on, and they find themselves booked onto Broadway. They also realize that they actually are in love with each other, but just when things are starting to look up, the comic starts to let success go to his head.', 'A vaudeville comic and a pretty young dancer aren''t having much luck in their separate careers, so they decide to combine their acts. In order to save money on the road, they get married. Soon their act begins to catch on, and they find themselves booked onto Broadway. They also realize that they actually are in love with each other, but just when things are starting to look up, the comic starts to let success go to his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moaU5Uv16hqmeQJhrL6I6VEpiZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105852'),
  ('913833524914500441', 'The Dance of Reality', 2013, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jean-Marie Dreujou, Alejandro Jodorowsky, Cristóbal Valderrama', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky', 'Brontis Jodorowsky, Pamela Flores, Jeremias Herskovits, Alejandro Jodorowsky, Bastián Bodenhöfer, Andrés Cox, Adan Jodorowsky, Axel Jodorowsky', 'NR', '''Having broken away from my illusory self, I was desperately seeking a path and a meaning to life.'' This phrase perfectly sums up Alejandro Jodorowsky’s biographical project: reconstituting the incredible adventure of his life. He was born in 1929 Tocopilla, a coastal town on edge of the Chilean desert, where he discovered the fundamentals of reality, as he underwent an unhappy and alienated childhood as part of an uprooted family.', '''Having broken away from my illusory self, I was desperately seeking a path and a meaning to life.'' This phrase perfectly sums up Alejandro Jodorowsky’s biographical project: reconstituting the incredible adventure of his life. He was born in 1929 Tocopilla, a coastal town on edge of the Chilean desert, where he discovered the fundamentals of reality, as he underwent an unhappy and alienated childhood as part of an uprooted family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qbsG9t943DciYTHITISzXQltqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137698'),
  ('855756142251378058', 'The Dance of the Paroxysms', 1929, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jorge Brum do Canto, Manuel Luís Vieira', 'Jorge Brum do Canto', 'Jorge Brum do Canto, Machado Correia, Maria do Carmo, Maria Emília Vilas, Maria Manuela Varela', null, 'This film tells the story of Gonthramm, a young knight who sought in vain for the Holy Grail and, on the way back to join his bride, Galeswithe, is met by Queen Banschi in the nightmarish realm of the Sylphs. Brum do Canto based the story on Charles-Marie Leconte de Lisle''s Les Elfes.', 'This film tells the story of Gonthramm, a young knight who sought in vain for the Holy Grail and, on the way back to join his bride, Galeswithe, is met by Queen Banschi in the nightmarish realm of the Sylphs. Brum do Canto based the story on Charles-Marie Leconte de Lisle''s Les Elfes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hs7p0FuXTglgUeXaJRqf17sk263.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145281'),
  ('289745968784392364', 'The Dancer', 2000, 'Drama', 'Frédéric Garson', 'Luc Besson, Jessica Kaplan', 'Mia Frye, Rodney Eastman, Garland Whitt, Féodor Atkine, Sarah Pratt, Josh Lucas, Jarrod Bunch, Cut Killer', null, 'A mute female dancer who wows audiences in club competitions but can''t get Broadway jobs because of her handicap, develops a "voice" when a young scientist invents a device that allows her to make music via her dance movements.', 'A mute female dancer who wows audiences in club competitions but can''t get Broadway jobs because of her handicap, develops a "voice" when a young scientist invents a device that allows her to make music via her dance movements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJis6aQ1JApDpCFxBwrqaDMPaQr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28745'),
  ('1090651717228710819', 'The Dancer', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Stéphanie Di Giusto, Benoît Debie, Pascale Jeanniard', 'Thomas Bidegain', 'Soko, Gaspard Ulliel, Mélanie Thierry, Lily-Rose Depp, François Damiens, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Denis Ménochet, Amanda Plummer', null, 'A young woman from the American Midwest, Loïe Fuller became the toast of the Folies Bergère at the turn of the 20th century and an icon of the Belle Epoque. Inventor of the breathtaking Serpentine Dance, she was a pioneer of modern dance and lighting techniques. It was her complicated relationship to her protégé - Isadora Duncan – that precipitated the downfall of this early 20th century icon.', 'A young woman from the American Midwest, Loïe Fuller became the toast of the Folies Bergère at the turn of the 20th century and an icon of the Belle Epoque. Inventor of the breathtaking Serpentine Dance, she was a pioneer of modern dance and lighting techniques. It was her complicated relationship to her protégé - Isadora Duncan – that precipitated the downfall of this early 20th century icon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EpquN12mGRHDtbTUt3UI4YVO4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392794'),
  ('237167134678552385', 'The Dancer and the Thief', 2009, 'Drama', 'Fernando Trueba, María José Droguett, Waldo Salgado', 'Fernando Trueba, Antonio Skármeta', 'Ricardo Darín, Abel Ayala, Miranda Bodenhöfer, Ariadna Gil, Julio Jung, Mario Guerra, Marcia Haydée, Luis Dubó', null, 'Present day. Chile. Legendary bank robber Vergara Grey is getting out of prison after 5 long years and is looking forward to a quiet, uneventful life together with his wife and son whom oddly he hasn''t heard from in years. But soon his resolve is tested when he meets 19 year old Angel a young thief who insists the two join up to score the biggest heist of all time. Though tempted, he resists until he finds out that his beloved wife has gone off with a millionaire and his son wants to change his last name. Then Victoria, a graceful and mysteriously mute dancer living in a conservatory, steps into the picture. She captivates Vergara and Angel, as well as all others that cross her path, drastically changing their lives.', 'Present day. Chile. Legendary bank robber Vergara Grey is getting out of prison after 5 long years and is looking forward to a quiet, uneventful life together with his wife and son whom oddly he hasn''t heard from in years. But soon his resolve is tested when he meets 19 year old Angel a young thief who insists the two join up to score the biggest heist of all time. Though tempted, he resists until he finds out that his beloved wife has gone off with a millionaire and his son wants to change his last name. Then Victoria, a graceful and mysteriously mute dancer living in a conservatory, steps into the picture. She captivates Vergara and Angel, as well as all others that cross her path, drastically changing their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlPNrTEsaIGnzBpfRM2YLQ7SJzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35411'),
  ('448001299990859885', 'The Dancer Upstairs', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'John Malkovich, José Luis Alcaine', 'Nicholas Shakespeare', 'Javier Bardem, Juan Diego Botto, Laura Morante, Elvira Mínguez, Alexandra Lencastre, Oliver Cotton, Luis Miguel Cintra, Javier Manrique', 'R', 'A police detective in a South American country is dedicated to hunting down a revolutionary guerilla leader.', 'A police detective in a South American country is dedicated to hunting down a revolutionary guerilla leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jG662jKzEf63fhcbbN3WiLlz5MX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20689'),
  ('1109490690928544452', 'The Dancing Detective: A Deadly Tango', 2023, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Russ Goozee, Stefan Scaini', 'Aubrey Day', 'Lacey Chabert, Will Kemp, Bettina Paris, Nataša Babić, Diego Wallraff, Peter Galea, Michela Farrugia, Clare Agius', 'PG', 'Constance Bailey is a no-nonsense detective who prefers to work alone. When a high-profile CEO is murdered on the eve of his company’s corporate event in Malta – a high-stakes ballroom competition between senior executives – Detective Bailey is sent undercover as one of the contestants. The only problem? She can’t dance. To convincingly compete, she must team up with charismatic and free-spirited performer Sebastian Moore. But with a killer on the loose and a growing list of suspects, it’s going to take more than a little fancy footwork to solve this case.', 'Constance Bailey is a no-nonsense detective who prefers to work alone. When a high-profile CEO is murdered on the eve of his company’s corporate event in Malta – a high-stakes ballroom competition between senior executives – Detective Bailey is sent undercover as one of the contestants. The only problem? She can’t dance. To convincingly compete, she must team up with charismatic and free-spirited performer Sebastian Moore. But with a killer on the loose and a growing list of suspects, it’s going to take more than a little fancy footwork to solve this case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYm3UlMTQHDFC5LXekGFbBbYALV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093760'),
  ('329657661565803313', 'The Dancing Masters', 1943, 'Comedy', 'Malcolm St. Clair', 'Scott Darling', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Trudy Marshall, Robert Bailey, Matt Briggs, Margaret Dumont, Allan Lane, Brooks Benedict', null, 'The Dancing Masters is a 1943 Laurel and Hardy feature film. The plot involves the team running a ballet school, and getting involved with an inventor. A young Robert Mitchum has an uncredited cameo role as a fraudulent insurance salesman.', 'The Dancing Masters is a 1943 Laurel and Hardy feature film. The plot involves the team running a ballet school, and getting involved with an inventor. A young Robert Mitchum has an uncredited cameo role as a fraudulent insurance salesman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhiZUKH1lANPf2CMTOoVg8Hn6ef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69017'),
  ('304162722179329404', 'The Dancing Pig', 1907, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Odéo', null, 'This short burlesque film presents an anthropomorphic pig in elegant dress flirting and dancing with a woman, before being humiliated and compelled to perform for her amusement. The film is a screen adaptation of "Le cochon mondain," a successful Paris music-hall act, likely performed by its creator Odéo using the same custom-designed costume.', 'This short burlesque film presents an anthropomorphic pig in elegant dress flirting and dancing with a woman, before being humiliated and compelled to perform for her amusement. The film is a screen adaptation of "Le cochon mondain," a successful Paris music-hall act, likely performed by its creator Odéo using the same custom-designed costume.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1t3EmYUMFCbqbyt6eRwuZfUkz6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142026'),
  ('623206550366026962', 'The Dancing Skeleton', 1898, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'A skeleton dances joyously, often collapsing into a heap of bones and quickly putting itself back together.', 'A skeleton dances joyously, often collapsing into a heap of bones and quickly putting itself back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fancFxvdCvQ9E2cg45fS5vivhiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127391'),
  ('912985877685972494', 'The Dandelions', 2012, 'Family, Comedy', 'Carine Tardieu, Antoine Monod', 'Carine Tardieu', 'Agnès Jaoui, Denis Podalydès, Isabelle Carré, Isabella Rossellini, Juliette Gombert, Anna Lemarchand, Elsa Lepoivre, Judith Magre', null, 'A young girl is frustrated by her over-protective mom. At school, she meets another fearless little girl that is going to have a big influence on her.', 'A young girl is frustrated by her over-protective mom. At school, she meets another fearless little girl that is going to have a big influence on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgCTKXDoq6VWIm4hT0FKPbm46IE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128592'),
  ('994062961409740248', 'The Dangerous Lives of Altar Boys', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Care, Lance Acord, Gary Jensen', 'Jeff Stockwell, Michael Petroni', 'Kieran Culkin, Emile Hirsch, Jena Malone, Jake Richardson, Jodie Foster, Vincent D''Onofrio, Melissa McBride, Michael Harding', 'R', 'A group of Catholic school friends, after being caught drawing an obscene comic book, plan a heist that will outdo their previous prank and make them local legends.', 'A group of Catholic school friends, after being caught drawing an obscene comic book, plan a heist that will outdo their previous prank and make them local legends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uTWXZ2Rvizl3ycMHtODfRjks4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16857'),
  ('1130467624528635574', 'The Dangerous Sex Date', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Maria Martinelli, Federico Schlatter', 'Claudia Salvatori, Maria Martinelli', 'Rocco Siffredi, Stefania Bonafede, Davide Devenuto, Pietro Bontempo, Alberto Alemanno, Loretta Rossi Stuart, Pietro Ragusa, Michele La Stella', null, 'The librarian of the university Xenia schedules a S&M blind date with the masochist Ghost to satisfy her fantasies and sexual desires. They spend the night in his apartment having kinky sex and on the next morning Ghost is dead with slashed throat. Xenia cleans her evidences and leaves the place, but Ghost''s friend Silver investigates the murder of Ghost and finds her files in a CD.', 'The librarian of the university Xenia schedules a S&M blind date with the masochist Ghost to satisfy her fantasies and sexual desires. They spend the night in his apartment having kinky sex and on the next morning Ghost is dead with slashed throat. Xenia cleans her evidences and leaves the place, but Ghost''s friend Silver investigates the murder of Ghost and finds her files in a CD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9fGg2ZDCoyQr4Hn204DkCOXcjx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72118'),
  ('882393221660703173', 'The Danish Experience', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Samih El-Nakash, Ahmed Abd El Aziz, Nehad Kamal', 'Youssef Maaty', 'Adel Emam, Nicole Saba, Magdy Kamel, Tamer Hagras, Khaled Sarhan, Ahmed El Tohami, Ahmad Rateb, Sami Sarhan', null, 'When Kadry El Meniawy becomes the minister of Youth and sports, the attractive woman Anita from Denmark comes to Egypt for cultural exchange between the two countries. As she stays at the minister''s villa, his sons try to get close to her while he also falls for her.', 'When Kadry El Meniawy becomes the minister of Youth and sports, the attractive woman Anita from Denmark comes to Egypt for cultural exchange between the two countries. As she stays at the minister''s villa, his sons try to get close to her while he also falls for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCLPq2NHoScjOs4f5SNsduxkLQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418319'),
  ('54400725078896162', 'The Danish Girl', 2015, 'Drama', 'Tom Hooper, Danny Cohen', 'Lucinda Coxon', 'Eddie Redmayne, Alicia Vikander, Matthias Schoenaerts, Ben Whishaw, Sebastian Koch, Pip Torrens, Nicholas Woodeson, Amber Heard', 'R', 'When Gerda Wegener asks her husband Einar to fill in as a portrait model, Einar discovers the person she''s meant to be and begins living her life as Lili Elbe. Having realized her true self and with Gerda''s love and support, Lili embarks on a groundbreaking journey as a transgender pioneer.', 'When Gerda Wegener asks her husband Einar to fill in as a portrait model, Einar discovers the person she''s meant to be and begins living her life as Lili Elbe. Having realized her true self and with Gerda''s love and support, Lili embarks on a groundbreaking journey as a transgender pioneer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXZZIacI5FC8thzSC0lgQBQ2uAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306819'),
  ('921284710935171018', 'The Danish Poet', 2006, 'Animation', 'Torill Kove', 'Torill Kove', 'Liv Ullmann', null, 'A woman ponders over the strange coincidences that made her forefathers and -mothers meet and create the premises for her becoming the person that she is.', 'A woman ponders over the strange coincidences that made her forefathers and -mothers meet and create the premises for her becoming the person that she is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZ40Z4BAHLiNVjZI28nY0xU9IAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38635'),
  ('1051111989642425784', 'The Dante Quartet', 1987, 'Animation', 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'A visual representation, in four parts, of one man''s internalization of "The Divine Comedy." Hell is a series of multicolored brush strokes against a white background; the speed of the changing images varies. "Hell Spit Flexion," or springing out of Hell, is on smaller film stock, taking the center of the frame. Montages of color move rapidly with a star and the edge of a lighted moon briefly visible. Purgation is back to full frame; blurs of color occasionally slow down then freeze. From time to time, an image, such as a window or a face, is distinguishable for a moment. In "existence is song," colors swirl then flash in and out of view. Behind the vivid colors are momentary glimpses of volcanic activity.', 'A visual representation, in four parts, of one man''s internalization of "The Divine Comedy." Hell is a series of multicolored brush strokes against a white background; the speed of the changing images varies. "Hell Spit Flexion," or springing out of Hell, is on smaller film stock, taking the center of the frame. Montages of color move rapidly with a star and the edge of a lighted moon briefly visible. Purgation is back to full frame; blurs of color occasionally slow down then freeze. From time to time, an image, such as a window or a face, is distinguishable for a moment. In "existence is song," colors swirl then flash in and out of view. Behind the vivid colors are momentary glimpses of volcanic activity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Bl7aXAbv1peLt8NkmUr5vfkVCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126194'),
  ('536625654057755665', 'The Dare', 1965, 'Drama', 'Paulo César Saraceni, Guido Cosulich, Paulo Bastos Martins', 'Paulo César Saraceni, Oduvaldo Vianna Filho', 'Isabella Cerqueira Campos, Oduvaldo Vianna Filho, Sérgio Britto, Luiz Linhares, Joel Barcellos, Hugo Carvana, Gianina Singulani, Marilu Fiorani', null, 'Passively facing the repression imposed by military dictatorship in 1960s Brazil, a journalist enters a personal crisis, aggravated by his affair with an industrialist''s wife, who doesn''t want to leave her home because of her son.', 'Passively facing the repression imposed by military dictatorship in 1960s Brazil, a journalist enters a personal crisis, aggravated by his affair with an industrialist''s wife, who doesn''t want to leave her home because of her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eH04bAeCBVMaXVY86r9fHbEQlw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194980'),
  ('439888467557201878', 'The Dare', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Giles Alderson, Andrew Rodger, Yana Viktorova', 'Jonny Grant, Giles Alderson', 'Bart Edwards, Richard Brake, Richard Short, Alexandra Evans, Robert Maaser, Harry Jarvis, Mitchell Norman, Devora Wilde', 'R', 'A rare family night for Jay takes a brutal twist when he awakens in a basement with three other prisoners. As their vengeful captor runs riot, Jay engages in a twisted battle to solve the puzzle to his past and save his family''s future.', 'A rare family night for Jay takes a brutal twist when he awakens in a basement with three other prisoners. As their vengeful captor runs riot, Jay engages in a twisted battle to solve the puzzle to his past and save his family''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJYPBa2EA6UIsXdrlOXkpnqbeQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623521'),
  ('218438804875194685', 'The Darjeeling Limited', 2007, 'Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Adam Stockhausen, Sahira Nair, Rebecca Strickland', 'Wes Anderson, Roman Coppola, Jason Schwartzman', 'Owen Wilson, Adrien Brody, Jason Schwartzman, Amara Karan, Wallace Wolodarsky, Waris Ahluwalia, Irrfan Khan, Barbet Schroeder', 'R', 'Three American brothers who have not spoken to each other in a year set off on a train voyage across India with a plan to find themselves and bond with each other -- to become brothers again like they used to be. Their "spiritual quest", however, veers rapidly off-course (due to events involving over-the-counter pain killers, Indian cough syrup, and pepper spray).', 'Three American brothers who have not spoken to each other in a year set off on a train voyage across India with a plan to find themselves and bond with each other -- to become brothers again like they used to be. Their "spiritual quest", however, veers rapidly off-course (due to events involving over-the-counter pain killers, Indian cough syrup, and pepper spray).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSW5OVXTulaIXcoNwJAp5YEKpbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4538'),
  ('480622647230680413', 'The Dark', 1979, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'John "Bud" Cardos, John Arthur Morrill', 'Stanford Whitmore', 'William Devane, Cathy Lee Crosby, Richard Jaeckel, Keenan Wynn, Warren J. Kemmerling, Biff Elliot, Jacquelyn Hyde, Casey Kasem', 'R', 'At night the Mangler stalks the streets of Los Angeles, killing and mutilating random victims. On the trail are a TV reporter, the father of one of the victims, and a police detective, but despite their efforts only the mysterious psychic DeRenzy knows what the killer is and how to stop it.', 'At night the Mangler stalks the streets of Los Angeles, killing and mutilating random victims. On the trail are a TV reporter, the father of one of the victims, and a police detective, but despite their efforts only the mysterious psychic DeRenzy knows what the killer is and how to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZygDHDL6FAzYJCqhINtYwCR7oK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87706'),
  ('1138024819100597639', 'The Dark', 1993, 'Horror', 'Craig Pryce, John Lawson', 'Robert C. Cooper', 'Stephen McHattie, Brion James, Neve Campbell, Desmond Campbell, Scott Wickware, Dennis O''Connor, Jaimz Woolvett, Cynthia Belliveau', 'R', 'Something is alive beneath the surface of the graveyard. Something with the power to destroy and the power to heal. One man, a cop, is determined to kill this mysterious creature. Another, a scientist, is determined to capture and save this miraculous being. Stalking the creature in it''s subterranean habitat, neither man is aware of the battle they are about to start. A battle for science, survival and revenge.', 'Something is alive beneath the surface of the graveyard. Something with the power to destroy and the power to heal. One man, a cop, is determined to kill this mysterious creature. Another, a scientist, is determined to capture and save this miraculous being. Stalking the creature in it''s subterranean habitat, neither man is aware of the battle they are about to start. A battle for science, survival and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xpPdHL2x9szS9RsFA2TqGGKv8e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137707'),
  ('1148001145412248343', 'The Dark', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Christian Sebaldt, John Fawcett, Sam Stokes', 'Stephen Massicotte', 'Maria Bello, Sean Bean, Abigail Stone, Richard Elfyn, Maurice Roëves, Sophie Stuckey, Casper Harvey, Eluned Jones', 'R', 'In an attempt to pull her family together, Adèlle travels with her young daughter Sarah to Wales to visit her father. The morning after they arrive, Sarah mysteriously vanishes in the ocean. Not long after, a little girl bearing a striking resemblance to their missing daughter reveals that she has retuned from the dead — and that Sarah has been taken to the Welsh underworld.', 'In an attempt to pull her family together, Adèlle travels with her young daughter Sarah to Wales to visit her father. The morning after they arrive, Sarah mysteriously vanishes in the ocean. Not long after, a little girl bearing a striking resemblance to their missing daughter reveals that she has retuned from the dead — and that Sarah has been taken to the Welsh underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6gCVAzjFLhzkffv2VZO1RgVCBt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17'),
  ('784980779332773232', 'The Dark', 2018, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Klemens Hufnagl, Jeremy Doiron, Klemens Hufnagl', 'Justin P. Lange', 'Nadia Alexander, Toby Nichols, Karl Markovics, Margarethe Tiesel, Dylan Trowbridge, Chris Farquhar, Scott Beaudin, Dan Beirne', null, 'A murderous, flesh-eating undead young girl haunting the remote stretch of woods where she was murdered decades earlier, discovers a kidnapped and abused boy hiding in the trunk of one of her victim’s cars. Her decision to let the boy live throws her aggressively solitary existence into upheaval, and ultimately forces her to re-examine just how much of her humanity her murderer was able to destroy.', 'A murderous, flesh-eating undead young girl haunting the remote stretch of woods where she was murdered decades earlier, discovers a kidnapped and abused boy hiding in the trunk of one of her victim’s cars. Her decision to let the boy live throws her aggressively solitary existence into upheaval, and ultimately forces her to re-examine just how much of her humanity her murderer was able to destroy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ju0L6Wy5QrW6XJOGvaLjVCDwtZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463322'),
  ('873030873039847894', 'The Dark and the Wicked', 2020, 'Horror', 'Bryan Bertino, Tristan Nyby, Colin Blankenship', 'Bryan Bertino', 'Marin Ireland, Michael Abbott Jr., Xander Berkeley, Lynn Andrews, Julie Oliver-Touchstone, Tom Nowicki, Ella Ballentine, Michael Zagst', 'NR', 'On a secluded farm in a nondescript rural town, a man is slowly dying. His family gathers to mourn, and soon a darkness grows, marked by waking nightmares and a growing sense that something evil is taking over the family.', 'On a secluded farm in a nondescript rural town, a man is slowly dying. His family gathers to mourn, and soon a darkness grows, marked by waking nightmares and a growing sense that something evil is taking over the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DB9VFVTp0IQEWFEIf9f3f2z3t5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680593'),
  ('74918673562110585', 'The Dark Angel', 1935, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sidney Franklin, Gregg Toland', 'Lillian Hellman, Mordaunt Shairp', 'Fredric March, Merle Oberon, Herbert Marshall, Janet Beecher, John Halliday, Henrietta Crosman, Frieda Inescort, Claud Allister', 'NR', 'Kitty Vane, Alan Trent, and Gerald Shannon have been inseparable friends since childhood. Kitty has always known she would marry one of them, but has waited until the beginning of World War I before finally choosing Alan. Gerald graciously gives them his blessing. Then, Gerald and Alan go to war. Angered over a misunderstanding involving Alan and Kitty, Gerald sends Alan on a dangerous mission that will change all their lives forever.', 'Kitty Vane, Alan Trent, and Gerald Shannon have been inseparable friends since childhood. Kitty has always known she would marry one of them, but has waited until the beginning of World War I before finally choosing Alan. Gerald graciously gives them his blessing. Then, Gerald and Alan go to war. Angered over a misunderstanding involving Alan and Kitty, Gerald sends Alan on a dangerous mission that will change all their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3wi7lWEWVhbENCBOrEx7RnWqQl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120977'),
  ('54359565133211186', 'The Dark at the Top of the Stairs', 1960, 'Drama', 'Delbert Mann, Harry Stradling Sr.', 'Harriet Frank Jr., Irving Ravetch', 'Robert Preston, Dorothy McGuire, Eve Arden, Angela Lansbury, Shirley Knight, Lee Kinsolving, Frank Overton, Penny Parker', 'NR', 'In Oklahoma in the 1920s, Rubin Flood loses his job as a traveling salesman when the company goes bankrupt. This adds to his worries at home. His wife Cora is frigid because of trying to make ends meet. His teenage daughter Reenie is afraid of going out on dates, but eventually makes friends with a troubled Jewish boy Sammy Golden, and his son is a mama''s boy. He finally storms out of the house when Cora falsely accuses him of having an affair with Mavis Pruitt.', 'In Oklahoma in the 1920s, Rubin Flood loses his job as a traveling salesman when the company goes bankrupt. This adds to his worries at home. His wife Cora is frigid because of trying to make ends meet. His teenage daughter Reenie is afraid of going out on dates, but eventually makes friends with a troubled Jewish boy Sammy Golden, and his son is a mama''s boy. He finally storms out of the house when Cora falsely accuses him of having an affair with Mavis Pruitt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dGQvC8qsIjZNli8tSJmeIo7YqA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114875'),
  ('857085410741902904', 'The Dark Backward', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Adam Rifkin, Joey Forsyte', 'Adam Rifkin', 'Judd Nelson, Bill Paxton, Wayne Newton, Lara Flynn Boyle, James Caan, Rob Lowe, Claudia Christian, Billy Bob Thornton', 'R', 'A man pursues stand-up comedy encouraged by his fellow garbage man. Though his friend, who accompanies him on accordion, continues to tell him how great he is, he actually stinks. When the "comedian" grows a third arm out of his back, the friend uses this twist to get him signed up with a sleazy talent agent, and it begins to look like his career is on the move, even though his girlfriend has left him.', 'A man pursues stand-up comedy encouraged by his fellow garbage man. Though his friend, who accompanies him on accordion, continues to tell him how great he is, he actually stinks. When the "comedian" grows a third arm out of his back, the friend uses this twist to get him signed up with a sleazy talent agent, and it begins to look like his career is on the move, even though his girlfriend has left him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zF5tYnF62hfsZiKXHuACrAHfQE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69342'),
  ('790694917377767139', 'The Dark Corner', 1946, 'Crime, Drama', 'Henry Hathaway, Emil Newman, David Silver', 'Bernard C. Schoenfeld, Jay Dratler', 'Mark Stevens, Lucille Ball, Clifton Webb, William Bendix, Kurt Kreuger, Cathy Downs, Reed Hadley, Constance Collier', 'NR', 'Ex-con turned private investigator Bradford Galt suspects someone is following him and maybe even trying to kill him. With the assistance of his spunky secretary, Kathleen Stewart, he dives deep into a mystery in search of answers.', 'Ex-con turned private investigator Bradford Galt suspects someone is following him and maybe even trying to kill him. With the assistance of his spunky secretary, Kathleen Stewart, he dives deep into a mystery in search of answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3DNBjWxeZZAGrv2jCks5PyyZ22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21336'),
  ('366282680062131158', 'The Dark Crystal', 1982, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Oswald Morris', 'David Odell', 'Jim Henson, Kathryn Mullen, Frank Oz, Dave Goelz, Steve Whitmire, Louise Gold, Brian Meehl, Stephen Garlick', 'PG', 'On another planet in the distant past, a Gelfling embarks on a quest to find the missing shard of a magical crystal and restore order to his world, before the grotesque race of Skeksis find and use the crystal for evil.', 'On another planet in the distant past, a Gelfling embarks on a quest to find the missing shard of a magical crystal and restore order to his world, before the grotesque race of Skeksis find and use the crystal for evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZPxRaa6gvCyGCh9Xk5kyPqz7fp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11639'),
  ('506822542970509928', 'The Dark Dancer', 1995, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Robert Burge, Eric Scott', 'Robert Burge, Terry Chambers', 'Shannon Tweed, Jason Carter, Lisa Pescia, Francesco Quinn, Andrew Prine, Kevin Wickham, Amy Lindsay, Terri Harrel', null, 'A psychologist decides to try life as a stripper to gain insight into the psyche of a stripper and finds she enjoys the freedom she feels with her body...', 'A psychologist decides to try life as a stripper to gain insight into the psyche of a stripper and finds she enjoys the freedom she feels with her body...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHOGdgwhvXOaCTGJF9grSkZ8HHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112470'),
