  ('1036253260674708053', 'The Dark Glow of the Mountain', 1985, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Werner Herzog, Jorge Vignati, Rainer Klausmann', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Reinhold Messner, Hans Kammerlander', null, 'Werner Herzog follows mountaineers Hans Kammerlander and Reinhold Messner during their expedition into climbing the Gasherbrum mountains, which has some of the most difficult peaks to be conquered, and they''ll do it without the use of oxygen tanks. Herzog also takes some time to hear about their past experiences with other mountains, their personal tragedies and the reasons why they are so involved with such activity.', 'Werner Herzog follows mountaineers Hans Kammerlander and Reinhold Messner during their expedition into climbing the Gasherbrum mountains, which has some of the most difficult peaks to be conquered, and they''ll do it without the use of oxygen tanks. Herzog also takes some time to hear about their past experiences with other mountains, their personal tragedies and the reasons why they are so involved with such activity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8ISYTosbDEYNEgml7lPhbr8Etw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139945'),
  ('440536794371913403', 'The Dark Half', 1993, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Tony Pierce-Roberts, George A. Romero, Drew Ann Rosenberg', 'George A. Romero', 'Timothy Hutton, Amy Madigan, Michael Rooker, Julie Harris, Robert Joy, Kent Broadhurst, Beth Grant, Rutanya Alda', 'R', 'Following the public''s realization that Thad Beaumont and George Stark are one and the same, the former stages a mock funeral, only for a series of gruesome murders to begin occurring as in his books.', 'Following the public''s realization that Thad Beaumont and George Stark are one and the same, the former stages a mock funeral, only for a series of gruesome murders to begin occurring as in his books.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTzi0no438AjKELtJgTbipNxWGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10349'),
  ('820626716797137743', 'The Dark Horse', 2014, 'Drama, History', 'James Napier Robertson, Denson Baker, Luke Robinson', 'James Napier Robertson', 'Cliff Curtis, James Rolleston, Kirk Torrance, Sia Trokenheim, Andrew Grainger, Xavier Horan, Roseanne Liang, Miriama McDowell', null, 'One-time Maori speed-chess champ, Genesis Potini, lives with a bi-polar disorder and must overcome prejudice and violence in the battle to save his struggling chess club, his family and ultimately, himself.', 'One-time Maori speed-chess champ, Genesis Potini, lives with a bi-polar disorder and must overcome prejudice and violence in the battle to save his struggling chess club, his family and ultimately, himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaYROTCUIYYfHLU6ClzXygychzu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276496'),
  ('289969030387096381', 'The Dark Hour', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ángel Luis Fernández, Elio Quiroga', 'Elio Quiroga', 'Silke, Omar Muñoz, Pepo Oliva, Carola Manzanares, Jorge Casalduero, Julio Perillán, Sergio Villanueva, Pablo Scola', null, 'The eight years boy Jesús has been living in a crumbling underground facility since he was born with eight survivors of an apocalyptical war: the leader Maria and her lover Pablo; the gays Lucas and Mateo; the astronomer Magdalena and the teenager Ana; the soldier Pedro and the lonely Judas. They are permanently is state of surveillance, threatened by the contaminated mutants The Strangers and once a day they have to lock themselves in their rooms without heating to protect against the dangerous ghosts The Invisibles that attack in the Cold Hour. They cannot go to the surface, destroyed by a nuclear war. When they need supplies, medications and ammunitions, they organize expeditions to a store. When the menace of The Invisibles affects the safety of the group of survivors, they need to reach the surface. Written by Claudio Carvalho, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil', 'The eight years boy Jesús has been living in a crumbling underground facility since he was born with eight survivors of an apocalyptical war: the leader Maria and her lover Pablo; the gays Lucas and Mateo; the astronomer Magdalena and the teenager Ana; the soldier Pedro and the lonely Judas. They are permanently is state of surveillance, threatened by the contaminated mutants The Strangers and once a day they have to lock themselves in their rooms without heating to protect against the dangerous ghosts The Invisibles that attack in the Cold Hour. They cannot go to the surface, destroyed by a nuclear war. When they need supplies, medications and ammunitions, they organize expeditions to a store. When the menace of The Invisibles affects the safety of the group of survivors, they need to reach the surface. Written by Claudio Carvalho, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7plpd2fK9pgrxprjecADaSpjjY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58432'),
  ('1121826579117417559', 'The Dark Hours', 2005, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Paul Fox, Steve Cosens', 'Wil Zmak', 'Kate Greenhouse, Aidan Devine, Gordon Currie, Iris Graham, Dov Tiefenbach, David Calderisi, Jeff Seymour, Trevor Hayes', 'R', 'Dr. Samantha Goodman is a beautiful, young psychiatrist. Burnt out, she drives to the family’s winter cottage to spend time with her husband and sister. A relaxing weekend is jarringly interrupted when a terrifying and unexpected guest arrives. What follows is an extraordinary night of terror and evil mind games where escape is not an option.', 'Dr. Samantha Goodman is a beautiful, young psychiatrist. Burnt out, she drives to the family’s winter cottage to spend time with her husband and sister. A relaxing weekend is jarringly interrupted when a terrifying and unexpected guest arrives. What follows is an extraordinary night of terror and evil mind games where escape is not an option.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOYCpZ7jsMedfkHQpXQJw83F3GL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18045'),
  ('954900801348257689', 'The Dark House', 2009, 'Thriller, Crime, History', 'Wojtek Smarzowski, Krzysztof Ptak', 'Wojtek Smarzowski, Łukasz Kośmicki', 'Arkadiusz Jakubik, Marian Dziędziel, Bartłomiej Topa, Katarzyna Cynke, Robert Wabich, Robert Więckiewicz, Krzysztof Czeczot, Eryk Lubos', null, 'Poland, 1978. Edward Srodon, a zootechnician, makes an accidental stop at the Dziabas family farm, located in the remote area of the Bieszczady Mountains. Years later, on a winter day during Martial Law, a People''s Militia investigation team examines a crime scene.', 'Poland, 1978. Edward Srodon, a zootechnician, makes an accidental stop at the Dziabas family farm, located in the remote area of the Bieszczady Mountains. Years later, on a winter day during Martial Law, a People''s Militia investigation team examines a crime scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLMUrJkPDZbcO0TQ5uNoPiM2RKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36142'),
  ('380990520749424827', 'The Dark Kingdom', 2018, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'Jonathan Siddall, Simon Wells', 'Ben Loyd-Holmes, Aston Benoit', 'Ross O''Hennessy, Ben Loyd-Holmes, Rebecca Dyson-Smith, Zara Phythian, Jemma Moore, Mike Mitchell, Jon-Paul Gates, Yolanda Lynes', null, 'To save their Kingdom from an army of undead, a group of warriors must travel through the forbidden lands fighting the fearsome beasts that call The Dark Kingdom their home.', 'To save their Kingdom from an army of undead, a group of warriors must travel through the forbidden lands fighting the fearsome beasts that call The Dark Kingdom their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kWGZYrTqBRsPIsnZmV3DzJtTi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566810'),
  ('424928232690808977', 'The Dark Knight', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Wally Pfister, Ashley Winter, Neal Callow', 'Christopher Nolan, Jonathan Nolan', 'Christian Bale, Heath Ledger, Aaron Eckhart, Michael Caine, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Gary Oldman, Morgan Freeman, Monique Gabriela Curnen', 'PG-13', 'Batman raises the stakes in his war on crime. With the help of Lt. Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to dismantle the remaining criminal organizations that plague the streets. The partnership proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a reign of chaos unleashed by a rising criminal mastermind known to the terrified citizens of Gotham as the Joker.', 'Batman raises the stakes in his war on crime. With the help of Lt. Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to dismantle the remaining criminal organizations that plague the streets. The partnership proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a reign of chaos unleashed by a rising criminal mastermind known to the terrified citizens of Gotham as the Joker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ2tW6WMUDux911r6m7haRef0WH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155'),
  ('301391757852641932', 'The Dark Knight Rises', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Wally Pfister, Steve Koster, Hans Bjerno', 'Jonathan Nolan, Christopher Nolan', 'Christian Bale, Gary Oldman, Tom Hardy, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Anne Hathaway, Marion Cotillard, Morgan Freeman, Michael Caine', 'PG-13', 'Following the death of District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman assumes responsibility for Dent''s crimes to protect the late attorney''s reputation and is subsequently hunted by the Gotham City Police Department. Eight years later, Batman encounters the mysterious Selina Kyle and the villainous Bane, a new terrorist leader who overwhelms Gotham''s finest. The Dark Knight resurfaces to protect a city that has branded him an enemy.', 'Following the death of District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman assumes responsibility for Dent''s crimes to protect the late attorney''s reputation and is subsequently hunted by the Gotham City Police Department. Eight years later, Batman encounters the mysterious Selina Kyle and the villainous Bane, a new terrorist leader who overwhelms Gotham''s finest. The Dark Knight resurfaces to protect a city that has branded him an enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hr0L2aueqlP2BYUblTTjmtn0hw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49026'),
  ('599889244169315432', 'The Dark Knight''s First Night', 1992, 'Animation, Action', 'Bruce Timm, Eric Radomski', 'Bruce Timm', null, null, 'The Dark Knight''s first night marks the beginning, the first time the Caped Crusader fought crime, which ultimately led to the greatest superhero cartoon of all time: Batman: The Animated Series. Experience it, experience the beginning.', 'The Dark Knight''s first night marks the beginning, the first time the Caped Crusader fought crime, which ultimately led to the greatest superhero cartoon of all time: Batman: The Animated Series. Experience it, experience the beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdb9S54f3oCBikIgZbv5v3sARKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266996'),
  ('140480683463559667', 'The Dark Maidens', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Saiji Yakumo, Kôichi Nakayama, Hiroyasu Kitagawa', 'Mari Okada', 'Marie Iitoyo, Yoshiko Sengen, Nana Seino, Riria Kojima, Tina Tamashiro, Yuna Taira, Yudai Chiba, Miyu Kobayashi', null, 'Set in an academy for daughters of the rich and powerful, this murder mystery involves six girls with a dark secret. Literature club chairman Itsumi Shiraishi, has fallen to her death from the school roof. Rumours soon circulate that one of the members of the literature club is the culprit. New chairman and friend of the victim, Sayuri Sumikawa, holds a meeting and asks each member to recount their whereabouts at the time of Itsumi’s death. Who is telling a lie and what really happened to Itsumi?', 'Set in an academy for daughters of the rich and powerful, this murder mystery involves six girls with a dark secret. Literature club chairman Itsumi Shiraishi, has fallen to her death from the school roof. Rumours soon circulate that one of the members of the literature club is the culprit. New chairman and friend of the victim, Sayuri Sumikawa, holds a meeting and asks each member to recount their whereabouts at the time of Itsumi’s death. Who is telling a lie and what really happened to Itsumi?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsymDwOeRqCNHAcXYJ9t1WQJYcA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448514'),
  ('338346036701422189', 'The Dark Mirror', 1946, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Milton Krasner, Robert Siodmak', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Olivia de Havilland, Lew Ayres, Thomas Mitchell, Richard Long, Charles Evans, Garry Owen, Lela Bliss, Lester Allen', null, 'A sister and her disturbed twin are implicated in a murder and a police detective must figure out which one''s the killer.', 'A sister and her disturbed twin are implicated in a murder and a police detective must figure out which one''s the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGo43zFcIugVmdQ1L6snrYHU3Dq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44041'),
  ('516760118673502417', 'The Dark Night of the Soul', 1989, 'War, Drama', 'Carlos Saura, Teo Escamilla, Carlos Saura Medrano', 'Carlos Saura', 'Juan Diego, Julie Delpy, Fernando Guillén, Manuel de Blas, Francisco Casares, Fermí Reixach, Abel Vitón, María Elena Flores', null, 'Pantheon filmmaker Carlos Saura bounced back from a handful of failures with 1989''s La Noche Oscura (The Dark Night). Juan Diego stars as San Juan de la Cruz (St. John of the Cross), the legendary 16th-century poet-prophet. Galvanized into action by the spirit of Santa Teresa de Jesus, San Juan fought to install reforms in the Carmelite Order. Like many another visionary, he was regarded as a heretic, and promptly subjected to the most appalling of tortures. Writer-director Saura manages to draw several parallels between the religious persecution of the 1700s and the political despotism of Fascist Spain.', 'Pantheon filmmaker Carlos Saura bounced back from a handful of failures with 1989''s La Noche Oscura (The Dark Night). Juan Diego stars as San Juan de la Cruz (St. John of the Cross), the legendary 16th-century poet-prophet. Galvanized into action by the spirit of Santa Teresa de Jesus, San Juan fought to install reforms in the Carmelite Order. Like many another visionary, he was regarded as a heretic, and promptly subjected to the most appalling of tortures. Writer-director Saura manages to draw several parallels between the religious persecution of the 1700s and the political despotism of Fascist Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5Hv9CUI8SO0NDVjuL0gFkAjnyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189325'),
  ('120859430689677907', 'The Dark Past', 1948, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Rudolph Maté, Joseph Walker', 'Philip MacDonald, Michael Blankfort, Albert Duffy', 'William Holden, Nina Foch, Lee J. Cobb, Adele Jergens, Stephen Dunne, Lois Maxwell, Berry Kroeger, Steven Geray', 'NR', 'A gang hold a family hostage in their own home. The leader of the escaped cons is bothered by a recurring dream that the doctor of the house may be able to analyze.', 'A gang hold a family hostage in their own home. The leader of the escaped cons is bothered by a recurring dream that the doctor of the house may be able to analyze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAwloinfuRVbLsFChZqTt7qJtL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43453'),
  ('616508907312063999', 'The Dark Power', 1985, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Phil Smoot, Paul Hughen', 'Phil Smoot', 'Lash LaRue, Anna Lane Tatum, Cynthia Bailey, Mary Dalton, Paul Holman, Cynthia Farbman, Marc Matney, Tony Shaw', null, 'The spirits of dead Indians are haunting a couple''s house, and they call in an exorcist, whose trademark is a black whip, to get rid of them.', 'The spirits of dead Indians are haunting a couple''s house, and they call in an exorcist, whose trademark is a black whip, to get rid of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9S1HpFqN2ptLZWaYZ9komnRy8JQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67691'),
