  ('109345457839281067', 'The Dark Sea', 2006, 'Drama', 'Roberta Torre, Stefania Valestro, Fabio Lombardelli', 'Massimo D''Anolfi, Andrea Di Stefano, Heidrun Schleef', 'Luigi Lo Cascio, Anna Mouglalis, Maurizio Donadoni, Massimo Popolizio, Andrea Osvárt, Monica Samassa, Rossella D''Andrea, Bruno Tramice', null, 'While investigating the murder of a woman that occurred in the sado-masochistic club scene, Inspector Luca Moccia discovers fantasies that threaten his relationship. Will he overcome them?', 'While investigating the murder of a woman that occurred in the sado-masochistic club scene, Inspector Luca Moccia discovers fantasies that threaten his relationship. Will he overcome them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SMNfy81fC1AlJYsFrKc34sFKhM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28144'),
  ('39543795799265465', 'The Dark Side of Love', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Salvatore Samperi, Dante Spinotti, Filiberto Fiaschi', 'Riccardo Ghione, Edith Bruck, Salvatore Samperi', 'Monica Guerritore, Lorenzo Lena, Saverio Vallone, Gilla Novak, Gianfranco Manfredi, Svevo Samperi, Raffaele Fornaro, Emanuele Fornaro', 'R', 'The sexual relationship between a successful woman and her brother, an introvert, hypochondriacal youth, who is also a pornophile.', 'The sexual relationship between a successful woman and her brother, an introvert, hypochondriacal youth, who is also a pornophile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWJxzTY14iUyub6LbEMJ6m3LxxH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80752'),
  ('108932128532830782', 'The Dark Side of the Heart', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Eliseo Subiela, Hugo Colace, Carlos Abbate', 'Juan Gelman, Mario Benedetti, Oliverio Girondo', 'Darío Grandinetti, Sandra Ballesteros, Nacha Guevara, André Melançon, Jean Pierre Reguerraz, Mónica Galán, Inés Vernengo, Tito Haas', 'R', 'Oliveiro is a young poet living in Buenos Aires where sometimes he has to sell his ideas to an advertising agency to make a living or exchange his poems for a steak. In Montevideo, he meets a prostitute, Ana, with whom he falls in love. Back in Buenos Aires, he accepts a contract with a publicity agency to get the money for three days of love with her. Will he get what he''s searching for when his ideal of love''s pleasure is literally going in levitation while making love?', 'Oliveiro is a young poet living in Buenos Aires where sometimes he has to sell his ideas to an advertising agency to make a living or exchange his poems for a steak. In Montevideo, he meets a prostitute, Ana, with whom he falls in love. Back in Buenos Aires, he accepts a contract with a publicity agency to get the money for three days of love with her. Will he get what he''s searching for when his ideal of love''s pleasure is literally going in levitation while making love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sGolviXy0GUJ5OzDuxcv61k2UX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74938'),
  ('453930109681164808', 'The Dark Side of the Heart 2', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Teo Delgado, Eliseo Subiela', 'Eliseo Subiela, Federico García Lorca', 'Darío Grandinetti, Ariadna Gil, Sandra Ballesteros, Manuel Bandera, Nacha Guevara, Santiago Ramos, Pepe Novoa, Carolina Peleritti', null, 'The sequel to the blockbuster Argentinean smash hit. After ten years, Oliverio is still intrigued by the works of great poets and continues to search for true love. When he meets the beautiful Miranda, she suggests that they both move in together and find jobs. Oliviero, however, leaves Miranda in search of his first love Ana who he met ten years prior. Once in Barcelona, he realizes that Ana''s life has drastically changed and their love is in the past. Soon, he meets poet and circus performer, Alejandra. Oliviero becomes smitten and desperately tries bond with her, but she makes things a little more difficult that he ever imagined.', 'The sequel to the blockbuster Argentinean smash hit. After ten years, Oliverio is still intrigued by the works of great poets and continues to search for true love. When he meets the beautiful Miranda, she suggests that they both move in together and find jobs. Oliviero, however, leaves Miranda in search of his first love Ana who he met ten years prior. Once in Barcelona, he realizes that Ana''s life has drastically changed and their love is in the past. Soon, he meets poet and circus performer, Alejandra. Oliviero becomes smitten and desperately tries bond with her, but she makes things a little more difficult that he ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iylw77DpdyvTyVDXJNRogTvlSp6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240133'),
  ('87120311572717975', 'The Dark Side of the Moon', 1990, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'D.J. Webster, Russ T. Alsobrook', 'Chad Hayes, Carey Hayes', 'Robert Sampson, Will Bledsoe, Joe Turkel, Camilla More, Wendy MacDonald, Alan Blumenfeld, Ken Lesco, John Diehl', 'R', 'It is the year 2022. A mysterious systems failure causes the crew of a spaceship to be stranded on the dark side of the moon, while rapidly running out of fuel and oxygen. They are surprised to discover a NASA space shuttle floating in space, and board it in the hope of salvaging some supplies. One by one, the crew is possessed and killed, and it is up to Paxton Warner to find the links between the dark side of the moon, the Bermuda Triangle, and the Devil himself.', 'It is the year 2022. A mysterious systems failure causes the crew of a spaceship to be stranded on the dark side of the moon, while rapidly running out of fuel and oxygen. They are surprised to discover a NASA space shuttle floating in space, and board it in the hope of salvaging some supplies. One by one, the crew is possessed and killed, and it is up to Paxton Warner to find the links between the dark side of the moon, the Bermuda Triangle, and the Devil himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etnsPUDbgbMGna2hiuRvHDx0xyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2154'),
  ('195128614241472000', 'The Dark Side of the Moon', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Stephan Rick, Felix Cramer, Stefan Ciupek', 'Catharina Junk, Stephan Rick', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Jürgen Prochnow, Nora Waldstätten, Doris Schretzmayer, André Hennicke, Luc Feit, Sabine Rossbach, Nickel Bösenberg', null, 'A psychedelic mushroom trip turns a successful lawyer into a wanted man.', 'A psychedelic mushroom trip turns a successful lawyer into a wanted man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cexWwKvPgFaNTLdZCvNGPuQcBTr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361854'),
  ('648750509388495187', 'The Dark Side of the Sun', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Božidar ''Bota'' Nikolić, Božidar ''Bota'' Nikolić', 'Željko Mijanović, Andrew Horton', 'Brad Pitt, Guy Boyd, Cheryl Pollak, Constantin Nitchoff, Milena Dravić, Gorica Popović, Sonja Savić, Nikola Jovanović', 'R', 'Traveling in search of a cure for a rare skin disease, a man finds freedom and love along the way.', 'Traveling in search of a cure for a rare skin disease, a man finds freedom and love along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxSwmSeoEIJL5BhDEUmURGx38qQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26642'),
  ('586783236721927309', 'The Dark Sun', 1990, 'Drama', 'Sebastiano Celeste, Damiano Damiani, Giuseppe Giglietti', 'Damiano Damiani, Ennio De Concini', 'Michael Paré, Jo Champa, Phyllis Logan, Luciano Catenacci, Leopoldo Trieste, Erland Josephson, Sal Borgese, Tano Cimarosa', null, 'After the death of his mother a man returns to his hometown Palermo in southern Italy in order to get hold of the legacy. Once there he is forced to participate in various crimes commited by the mafia.', 'After the death of his mother a man returns to his hometown Palermo in southern Italy in order to get hold of the legacy. Once there he is forced to participate in various crimes commited by the mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWx9n1av9nvilts1UGUVXVJamNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385833'),
