  ('466692842864247504', 'The Dark Tower', 2017, 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Felix Bucella, Sebastian Elsner, Lukas Mehl', 'Nikolaj Arcel, Akiva Goldsman, Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Idris Elba, Matthew McConaughey, Tom Taylor, Claudia Kim, Fran Kranz, Abbey Lee, Jackie Earle Haley, Katheryn Winnick', 'PG-13', 'A boy haunted by visions of a parallel world aids its disillusioned guardian in preventing the destruction of the nexus of universes known as the Dark Tower.', 'A boy haunted by visions of a parallel world aids its disillusioned guardian in preventing the destruction of the nexus of universes known as the Dark Tower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9GUSgddIqrroubiLsvvMRYyRy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353491'),
  ('398209760782459434', 'The Dark Valley', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Andreas Prochaska, Thomas W. Kiennast, Andrea Inreiter-Aust', 'Martin Ambrosch, Andreas Prochaska', 'Sam Riley, Tobias Moretti, Paula Beer, Thomas Schubert, Carmen Gratl, Clemens Schick, Helmuth Häusler, Martin Leutgeb', 'NR', 'The Alps, late 19th century. Greider, a mysterious lone rider who claims to be a photographer, arrives at an isolated lumber village, despotically ruled by a family clan, asking for winter accommodation.', 'The Alps, late 19th century. Greider, a mysterious lone rider who claims to be a photographer, arrives at an isolated lumber village, despotically ruled by a family clan, asking for winter accommodation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8s59L4YCmDNyQAkSrlkvc3Vc3fp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248933'),
  ('798878489698408544', 'The Darker the Lake', 2022, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Lok Kwan Woo, Alexander Aigner', 'Z Zoccolante', 'Elyse Levesque, Veronica Ferres, Gina Stiebitz, Vladimir Burlakov, Hsu Wei-ning, Tsao Yu-ning, Lü Yulai, Ludger Bökelmann', null, 'When strange, supernatural murders suddenly become the talk a peaceful town, two detectives must solve a deadly game, but will the myth of this game reveal secrets too close to home.', 'When strange, supernatural murders suddenly become the talk a peaceful town, two detectives must solve a deadly game, but will the myth of this game reveal secrets too close to home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haNCTHYAYWFwvwYCeAee96Z8WHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934957'),
  ('853469487067412616', 'The Darkest Dawn', 2016, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Drew Casson', 'Jess Cleverly, Drew Casson', 'Bethan Mary Leadley, Cherry Wallis, Stuart Ashen, Drew Casson, Jamie Paul, Mawaan Rizwan, Georgia Bradley, Tom Scarlett', null, 'Evacuated from their home, two teenage sisters unite with fellow survivors and escape London by river to embark on an odyssey across the badlands of Britain.', 'Evacuated from their home, two teenage sisters unite with fellow survivors and escape London by river to embark on an odyssey across the badlands of Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fb9u8R85glg0nEsszQXGrhG5LAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423733'),
  ('662562288664697034', 'The Darkest Hour', 2011, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Chris Gorak, K.C. Colwell, Jan Menšík', 'Jon Spaihts', 'Emile Hirsch, Rachael Taylor, Olivia Thirlby, Joel Kinnaman, Max Minghella, Veronika Vernadskaya, Dato Bakhtadze, Gosha Kutsenko', 'PG-13', 'In Moscow, five young people lead the charge against an alien race which has attacked Earth via our power supply.', 'In Moscow, five young people lead the charge against an alien race which has attacked Earth via our power supply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ao4qAFbjP7fcFOOdMNvQEnl0Yr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71469'),
  ('56726600774917834', 'The Darkest Minds', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Jack Gill, Kristen Ploucha, Shanalyna C. Palmer', 'Chad Hodge', 'Amandla Stenberg, Harris Dickinson, Patrick Gibson, Skylan Brooks, Mandy Moore, Miya Cech, Mark O''Brien, Gwendoline Christie', 'PG-13', 'After a disease kills 98% of America''s children, the surviving 2% develop superpowers and are placed in internment camps. A 16-year-old girl escapes her camp and joins a group of other teens on the run from the government.', 'After a disease kills 98% of America''s children, the surviving 2% develop superpowers and are placed in internment camps. A 16-year-old girl escapes her camp and joins a group of other teens on the run from the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NdQneXBYVbBKt81bFhXiyThe0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445651'),
  ('185733273646386597', 'The Darkest Web', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Sam Piranty, David McIlveen', null, 'Liz Gibbons, Adam Dolniak, Nayantara Gauba, Susan Grandison, Helga Farhadian', null, 'For US agent Greg Squire and a dedicated network of specialist undercover investigators around the world, the mission is clear: track and catch serial paedophiles who operate across the dark web with the same sophistication and secrecy as international organised crime syndicates. Increasingly, these offenders are far younger than the stereotypical image of a paedophile - tech-savvy young adults who exploit digital anonymity with alarming ease.', 'For US agent Greg Squire and a dedicated network of specialist undercover investigators around the world, the mission is clear: track and catch serial paedophiles who operate across the dark web with the same sophistication and secrecy as international organised crime syndicates. Increasingly, these offenders are far younger than the stereotypical image of a paedophile - tech-savvy young adults who exploit digital anonymity with alarming ease.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fqsz94c9ZQzAZ9MYcniWiwMaDMIB.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-darkest-web-2026'),
  ('829116119678106205', 'The Darkness', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Daniel Castro Zimbrón, Diego García', 'Daniel Castro Zimbrón, David Pablos', 'Brontis Jodorowsky, Fernando Álvarez Rebeil, Aliocha Sotnikoff, Camila Robertson Glennie, Meraqui Pradis, Alejandro Villeli', null, 'A family lives in a cabin in the middle of a submerged forest in the mist and shrouded in perpetual twilight after an undefined global catastrophe. The father keeps his children locked in the basement into believing that a wild beast roams outside.', 'A family lives in a cabin in the middle of a submerged forest in the mist and shrouded in perpetual twilight after an undefined global catastrophe. The father keeps his children locked in the basement into believing that a wild beast roams outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x58BdDUnPzz8nWZu54SBh7lpwzU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275229'),
  ('237057091290151506', 'The Darkness within La Luz del Mundo', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Carlos Pérez Osorio, Carlos Correa, Camila Pardo Cerezo', 'Carlos Pérez Osorio', 'Elias Argentiere, Nassón Joaquín García', null, 'For the first time, complainants against La Luz del Mundo megachurch leaders expose the abuses they suffered through exclusive interviews.', 'For the first time, complainants against La Luz del Mundo megachurch leaders expose the abuses they suffered through exclusive interviews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg1LwZgPKcvxaIgWauX8F5Cs6HS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1168814'),
  ('228727937870863473', 'The Darwin Awards', 2007, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Finn Taylor, Hiro Narita, Dick Ziker', 'Finn Taylor', 'Joseph Fiennes, Winona Ryder, David Arquette, Juliette Lewis, Ty Burrell, Josh Charles, Kevin Dunn, Nora Dunn', 'R', 'After botching the capture of a notorious serial killer, idiosyncratic detective Michael Burrows loses his job with the San Francisco Police. He becomes an investigator for an insurance company and joins forces with a cynical field agent to probe suspicious and unusual deaths.', 'After botching the capture of a notorious serial killer, idiosyncratic detective Michael Burrows loses his job with the San Francisco Police. He becomes an investigator for an insurance company and joins forces with a cynical field agent to probe suspicious and unusual deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6reChYRqaglz563iX2JgiK8eFS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18437'),
  ('1111134130290999437', 'The Darwinners', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jean-Paul Guigue, Julien Berjeaut, Dries De Clercq', 'Julien Berjeaut', 'Franck Ekinci, Camille Serceau, Noémie de Lattre, Fabien Limousin, Guillaume Gallienne, Michel Vuillermoz, Frédéric Pierrot, Clément Sibony', null, 'In a prehistory for operettas that is seemingly doomed never to evolve, a conflicted father and daughter disrupt the Stone Age routine. After a tragic-comedy round-trip to the future, they accidentally bring back an Ikea “bent key”, which will at last trigger Evolution, for better or for worse… Writing, religion, politics… who will be capable of putting an end to these disasters?', 'In a prehistory for operettas that is seemingly doomed never to evolve, a conflicted father and daughter disrupt the Stone Age routine. After a tragic-comedy round-trip to the future, they accidentally bring back an Ikea “bent key”, which will at last trigger Evolution, for better or for worse… Writing, religion, politics… who will be capable of putting an end to these disasters?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihzGweAdVtOFDXT56fOEd3gFqBA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214995'),
  ('848534916613115124', 'The Dashed Lines', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anxos Fazans', 'Anxos Fazans, Ian De La Rosa', 'Mara Sánchez, Adam Prieto', null, 'Bea, who''s going through divorce, meets Denis when he breaks into her home intent on robbery. Rather than turning him into the police, she starts talking with him.', 'Bea, who''s going through divorce, meets Denis when he breaks into her home intent on robbery. Rather than turning him into the police, she starts talking with him.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FAu8axA8yCnQk7x16nSHjsQyKhKi.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-dashed-lines'),
  ('396100160963464986', 'The Dating App Killer: The Monica White Story', 2026, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Drama', 'Elisabeth Röhm', 'Miriam Van Emst, David Weaver', 'Jarod Joseph, Shyinne Anastacio, Princess Davis, Shanna Giannozio, Spencer Graham', null, 'A divorcee reenters the dating pool by creating an online profile, but when her match displays unsettling behavior and a series of women from the same dating site go missing, she must save herself from becoming the next victim.', 'A divorcee reenters the dating pool by creating an online profile, but when her match displays unsettling behavior and a series of women from the same dating site go missing, she must save herself from becoming the next victim.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fwyu5CdFptyz7ZxmgwcHMMhR5tt0.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-dating-app-killer-the-monica-white-story'),
  ('361833084403219586', 'The Dating List', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'David I. Strasser, Alyssa Mack-Lee, Ryan Petey', 'Amy Katherine Taylor, Kelly Peters', 'Natalie Dreyfuss, Andrew Dunbar, Carmel Amit, Nathan Witte, Matt Hamilton, Hannah Levien, Rady Panov, Christian Sloan', 'G', 'Career driven Abby agrees to help her busy boss find the man of her dreams, but she encounters a dilemma when she starts falling for the same man her boss approves of dating.', 'Career driven Abby agrees to help her busy boss find the man of her dreams, but she encounters a dilemma when she starts falling for the same man her boss approves of dating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WgV9KjTGvkCExb9op9JCpnQzMD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626036'),
  ('612059947353144024', 'The Daughter', 2015, 'Drama', 'Simon Stone, Andrew Commis, Deborah Antoniou', 'Simon Stone', 'Geoffrey Rush, Sam Neill, Paul Schneider, Ewen Leslie, Miranda Otto, Anna Torv, Odessa Young, Kate Box', null, 'In the last days of a dying logging town, Christian returns to his family home for his father Henry’s wedding. While home, Christian reconnects with his childhood friend Oliver, who has stayed in town working at Henry’s timber mill and is now out of a job. As Christian gets to know Oliver’s wife Charlotte, daughter Hedvig, and father Walter, he discovers a secret that could tear Oliver’s family apart.', 'In the last days of a dying logging town, Christian returns to his family home for his father Henry’s wedding. While home, Christian reconnects with his childhood friend Oliver, who has stayed in town working at Henry’s timber mill and is now out of a job. As Christian gets to know Oliver’s wife Charlotte, daughter Hedvig, and father Walter, he discovers a secret that could tear Oliver’s family apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdHe8nyuvn67XBq0JQEwkNGUQ9I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292010'),
  ('1107102528444734866', 'The Daughter', 2016, 'Drama', 'Luis Sampieri, Francisco Domínguez', 'Luis Sampieri', 'Gloria Berbuc, Julia Carcheti, Daniel Elías, Maria Laura Carhuavilca, Maria del Pilar Fiad, Santiago Paz Posse, Carolina Paz, Harry Havilio', null, 'The Amado''s decide to spend a weekend at the family''s country home, but the plan is disrupted when Dominga, the Amado''s cleaning woman, gives birth to a baby in the middle of a family gathering.', 'The Amado''s decide to spend a weekend at the family''s country home, but the plan is disrupted when Dominga, the Amado''s cleaning woman, gives birth to a baby in the middle of a family gathering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jB4rfHNSHbOhK0j4SjUuODzbpq3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422343'),
  ('983437820769639158', 'The Daughter', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Marc Gómez del Moral, Manuel Martín Cuenca', 'Félix Vidal, Manuel Martín Cuenca, Alejandro Hernández', 'Javier Gutiérrez, Patricia López Arnaiz, Irene Virgüez, Juan Carlos Villanueva, María Morales, Sofian El Benaissati, Arturo de la Torre del Pino, Atenea Torres Herrera', null, 'Irene is a fifteen-year-old who lives in a center for juvenile offenders. She just got pregnant and is determined to turn her life around with the help of Javier, an educator at the center. Javier offers her to secretly come live with him and his wife Adela in the house they have in a remote and rugged spot in the mountains so she can hide and comfortably carry out her pregnancy. The only condition is that in exchange, she agrees to give them the baby she is carrying in her womb. This feeble pact will be put in jeopardy when Irene starts to feel like the life growing inside her belongs to her.', 'Irene is a fifteen-year-old who lives in a center for juvenile offenders. She just got pregnant and is determined to turn her life around with the help of Javier, an educator at the center. Javier offers her to secretly come live with him and his wife Adela in the house they have in a remote and rugged spot in the mountains so she can hide and comfortably carry out her pregnancy. The only condition is that in exchange, she agrees to give them the baby she is carrying in her womb. This feeble pact will be put in jeopardy when Irene starts to feel like the life growing inside her belongs to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86BwDaGCiPmvCsX86Z4qF3UDlL3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661931'),
  ('117614633658587881', 'The Daughter of Albino Rodrigue', 2023, 'Drama', 'Karine d''Hont, Stéphane Manaranche, Christine Dory', 'Lise Macheboeuf, Christine Dory', 'Galatea Bellugi, Émilie Dequenne, Philippe Duquesne, Samir Guesmi, Romane Bohringer, Matthieu Lucci, Elsa Hyvaert, Catherine Salée', null, 'Rosemay, 16, lives in a foster home and only joins her biological family for the vacations. One day, her father is not there to welcome her as planned. Moreover, he does not reappear and seems to have evaporated. Her questions are met with lies, and Rosemay can only rely on her intuition.', 'Rosemay, 16, lives in a foster home and only joins her biological family for the vacations. One day, her father is not there to welcome her as planned. Moreover, he does not reappear and seems to have evaporated. Her questions are met with lies, and Rosemay can only rely on her intuition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtC7bxM4uwDNgfEpWpEoL69Cf2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960380'),
  ('572314959150543776', 'The Daughter of Dawn', 1920, 'Western, Drama, Romance', 'Norbert A. Myles', 'Norbert A. Myles, Richard Banks', 'Esther LeBarre, White Parker, Wanada Parker, Hunting Horse, Belo Cozad, Oscar Yellow Wolf, Jack Sankadota, Alice Apekum', null, 'The Daughter of Dawn is a silent Western, and one of the few films of the silent era to have an entirely Native American cast. It tells the story of a Kiowa woman and her lover, his feats of bravery, and their trials at the hands of a jealous rival and Comanche warriors. Completed in 1920, it was only shown a few times before being considered lost. Five reels of the movie were found in 2005, and restored by the Oklahoma Historical Society in 2012.', 'The Daughter of Dawn is a silent Western, and one of the few films of the silent era to have an entirely Native American cast. It tells the story of a Kiowa woman and her lover, his feats of bravery, and their trials at the hands of a jealous rival and Comanche warriors. Completed in 1920, it was only shown a few times before being considered lost. Five reels of the movie were found in 2005, and restored by the Oklahoma Historical Society in 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiO4rwjFSSi2rptsXFxhjbTY2hN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114018'),
  ('171220746243855750', 'The daughter of Moctezuma', 2013, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Iván Lipkies, Julio Quezada Orozco', 'Iván Lipkies, Raúl S. Figueroa, Ivette Lipkies', 'María Elena Velasco, Ernesto Pape, Eduardo Manzano, Raquel Garza, Rafael Inclán, Alfredo Sevilla, Yekaterina Kiev, Dieter Koll', null, 'La India María must find at all costs in the recesses of a mountain the Magic Black Mirror of Tezcatlipoca, since the spirit of his great-grandfather Moctezuma II ordered her to find it in to prevent the destruction of Mexico. Alonso, a handsome Spanish archaeologist, Bianchi, an antiquities dealer and Brigida Troncoso - an ambitious governor, are aware of the existence of such mirror, of the mysterious treasure of Moctezuma and of María, so all undertake a frantic chase after her to seize the magic glass and the gold.', 'La India María must find at all costs in the recesses of a mountain the Magic Black Mirror of Tezcatlipoca, since the spirit of his great-grandfather Moctezuma II ordered her to find it in to prevent the destruction of Mexico. Alonso, a handsome Spanish archaeologist, Bianchi, an antiquities dealer and Brigida Troncoso - an ambitious governor, are aware of the existence of such mirror, of the mysterious treasure of Moctezuma and of María, so all undertake a frantic chase after her to seize the magic glass and the gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTjk5TtV1eDQK0uB6oqMiuo6i6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268471'),
  ('1098737795033790807', 'The Daughter of the Trapalhões', 1984, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Dedé Santana, Caxa Aragão', 'Renato Aragão, José Joffily, Emanuel Rodrigues', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Fernanda Brasil, Myrian Rios, Ronnie Von, Vera Gimenez', null, 'The Trapalhões live in a floating boat and have a miserable life. When they find an abandoned baby, they decide to raise it as if it were their own daughter. Later, when they begin to work in a circus, they discover that the child is in fact the daughter of the trapeze artist and that she was forced to surrender her daughter to a gang that negotiates children abroad. This gang finds them and tries to recover the girl who now, however, has the help of the Trapalhões to protect her.', 'The Trapalhões live in a floating boat and have a miserable life. When they find an abandoned baby, they decide to raise it as if it were their own daughter. Later, when they begin to work in a circus, they discover that the child is in fact the daughter of the trapeze artist and that she was forced to surrender her daughter to a gang that negotiates children abroad. This gang finds them and tries to recover the girl who now, however, has the help of the Trapalhões to protect her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgDl0lZlkvKfPFTuivnGtqi2AOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309310'),
  ('491114254793267757', 'The Daughter-in-Law', 1972, 'Drama', 'Khodzha Kuli Narliyev, Anatoliy Ivanov', 'Khodzha Durdy Narliyev, Khodzha Kuli Narliyev', 'Maya-Gozel Aimedova, Khodzhan Ovezgelenov, Khodzha Durdy Narliyev, Khommat Mullyk, Aynabat Amanliyeva, Ogulkurban Durdyyeva, Arslan Muradov, Baba Annanov', null, 'A woman whose husband has been killed in WWII lives with her father-in-law in the desert. She cannot leave and go back to her family, because that would mean the end of hope that her husband, a heroic pilot, might return one day.', 'A woman whose husband has been killed in WWII lives with her father-in-law in the desert. She cannot leave and go back to her family, because that would mean the end of hope that her husband, a heroic pilot, might return one day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYJJ1W3jjpVXaVgq6v3qzRX1O7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108526'),
  ('600577139300029608', 'The Daughters of Fire', 2018, 'Drama', 'Albertina Carri, Inés Duacastella, Mercedes Gaviria', 'Albertina Carri, Analía Couceyro', 'Rocío Zuviría, Mijal Katzowicz, Violeta Valiente, Rana Rzonscinsky, Canela M., Ivo Colonna Olsen, Mar Morales, Carla Morales Ríos', null, 'Three women meet by chance at the end of the world, in Argentinian Patagonia, and set out on a polyamorous journey, caught up in the search for new kinds of relationships, far from possession and pain. They become the Daughters of Fire, a band dedicated to helping those women who look for their own path to erotica.', 'Three women meet by chance at the end of the world, in Argentinian Patagonia, and set out on a polyamorous journey, caught up in the search for new kinds of relationships, far from possession and pain. They become the Daughters of Fire, a band dedicated to helping those women who look for their own path to erotica.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2w1f0Co3dgIKTSmNn13Y31ppPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518997'),
  ('1145972355649505903', 'The Dawn', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brandon Slagle, Lance Rand, David M. Brewer', 'Elliot Diviney', 'Teilor Grubbs, David Goryl, Jonathan Bennett, Punnavith Koy, Devanny Pinn, Brittany Benjamin, Ryan Kiser, Heather Wynters', 'R', 'Following the murder of her family at the hands of her father in the wake of World War I, a young woman is sent to live in a convent. However, the demons that plagued her father follow, reawakening the nightmares of her past.', 'Following the murder of her family at the hands of her father in the wake of World War I, a young woman is sent to live in a convent. However, the demons that plagued her father follow, reawakening the nightmares of her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gxznVkacYCFlaYTNbUBvyxg6bf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662821'),
  ('945658278276911252', 'The Dawn Patrol', 1930, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Howard Hawks, Ernest Haller, Erno Rapee', null, 'Richard Barthelmess, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Neil Hamilton, Frank McHugh, Clyde Cook, James Finlayson, Gardner James, William Janney', 'NR', 'World War I ace Dick Courtney derides the leadership of his superior officer, but he soon is promoted to squadron commander and learns harsh lessons about sending subordinates to their deaths.', 'World War I ace Dick Courtney derides the leadership of his superior officer, but he soon is promoted to squadron commander and learns harsh lessons about sending subordinates to their deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJQIJGOx1EMkPt0vkRGpEUuXvSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81847'),
  ('1052547949642863224', 'The Dawn Patrol', 1938, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Edmund Goulding, Leo F. Forbstein, Tony Gaudio', 'Dan Totheroh, Seton I. Miller', 'Errol Flynn, Basil Rathbone, David Niven, Donald Crisp, Melville Cooper, Barry Fitzgerald, Carl Esmond, Peter Willes', 'NR', 'In 1915 France, Major Brand commands the 39th Squadron of the Royal Flying Corps. The young airmen go up in bullet-riddled "crates" and the casualty rate is appalling, but Brand can''t make the "brass hats" at headquarters see reason. Insubordinate air ace Captain Courtney is another thorn in Brand''s side...but finds the smile wiped from his face when he rises to command the squadron himself. Everyone keeps a stiff upper lip.', 'In 1915 France, Major Brand commands the 39th Squadron of the Royal Flying Corps. The young airmen go up in bullet-riddled "crates" and the casualty rate is appalling, but Brand can''t make the "brass hats" at headquarters see reason. Insubordinate air ace Captain Courtney is another thorn in Brand''s side...but finds the smile wiped from his face when he rises to command the squadron himself. Everyone keeps a stiff upper lip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncrQ21mjMTznDZDTmAcT3j5berB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46688'),
  ('60511614155074953', 'The Dawn Rapists', 1978, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Ignacio F. Iquino, Francisco G. Siurana', 'Ignacio F. Iquino', 'Mireia Ros, Bernard Seray, Manuel de Benito, Linda Lay, Eva Lyberten, Daniel Medrán, César Sánchez, Joan Borràs', null, 'Crime drama centering on a gang of rapists, the aftermath of their crimes on the victims and the gang members being brought to justice.', 'Crime drama centering on a gang of rapists, the aftermath of their crimes on the victims and the gang members being brought to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BKCsCz2AYGU8SwVYCWGgS8hzPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229273'),
  ('11759738914229941', 'The Dawn Rider', 1935, 'Action, Western', 'Archie Stout, Robert N. Bradbury', 'Robert N. Bradbury', 'John Wayne, Marion Burns, Dennis Moore, Reed Howes, Joseph De Grasse, Earl Dwire, Nelson McDowell, Yakima Canutt', 'NR', 'When John Mason''s father is killed, John is wounded. Attracted to his nurse Alice, a conflict arises between him and his friend Ben who plans to marry Alice. John later finds the killer of his father but goes to face him not knowing Ben has removed the bullets from his gun.', 'When John Mason''s father is killed, John is wounded. Attracted to his nurse Alice, a conflict arises between him and his friend Ben who plans to marry Alice. John later finds the killer of his father but goes to face him not knowing Ben has removed the bullets from his gun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqYi6f2R2STpKNeahhYSc1dGXWT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53827'),
  ('840503992605320816', 'The Dawn Wall', 2017, 'Documentary, Adventure', 'Josh Lowell, Peter Mortimer, Brett Lowell', null, 'Tommy Caldwell, John Branch, Kevin Jorgeson, Beth Rodden, Becca Pietsch', 'NR', 'The definitive film on the climb that captured headlines and ignited imaginations worldwide. Tommy Caldwell and Kevin Jorgeson ascend the hardest big wall of all time: a 19 day ascent of The Dawn Wall, on the 3,000 foot vertical face of El Capitan, in Yosemite National Park. The film travels deeper than the climb, digging into the history of the climbers and painting an intimate portrait of Caldwell''s harrowing life experiences that culminated in a single-minded drive to complete this impossible climb. The Dawn Wall is a heart-warming and inspiring movie that celebrates perseverance, camaraderie, and the universal spirit of dreaming big, and never giving up.', 'The definitive film on the climb that captured headlines and ignited imaginations worldwide. Tommy Caldwell and Kevin Jorgeson ascend the hardest big wall of all time: a 19 day ascent of The Dawn Wall, on the 3,000 foot vertical face of El Capitan, in Yosemite National Park. The film travels deeper than the climb, digging into the history of the climbers and painting an intimate portrait of Caldwell''s harrowing life experiences that culminated in a single-minded drive to complete this impossible climb. The Dawn Wall is a heart-warming and inspiring movie that celebrates perseverance, camaraderie, and the universal spirit of dreaming big, and never giving up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZQCNGb1II5eWASBhEgJBGxOPUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489471'),
  ('428482364572415077', 'The Dawns Here Are Quiet', 1972, 'Drama, History, War', 'Stanislav Rostotsky, Vyacheslav Shumskiy, Zoya Kurdumova', 'Boris Vasilyev, Stanislav Rostotsky', 'Andrey Martynov, Irina Dolganova, Elena Drapeko, Ekaterina Markova, Olga Ostroumova, Irina Shevchuk, Lyudmila Zaytseva, Alla Meshcheryakova', null, 'In a remote village in Karelia, Sergeant Vaskov commands an anti-aircraft unit that protects a rail depot. While his men are transferred to the front line, he is reprimanded for their unruly behavior. He retorts that he wants replacements that aren''t drunks or womanizers. In response, he is assigned a unit made up entirely of young women, fresh from training.', 'In a remote village in Karelia, Sergeant Vaskov commands an anti-aircraft unit that protects a rail depot. While his men are transferred to the front line, he is reprimanded for their unruly behavior. He retorts that he wants replacements that aren''t drunks or womanizers. In response, he is assigned a unit made up entirely of young women, fresh from training.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3jXq6rahRFqNwvbOWUUN1iPL8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49106'),
  ('762467681424624956', 'The Dawns Here Are Quiet', 2015, 'Drama, War', 'Anatoly Belozerov, Sergey Bubenko, Andrey Peshekhodko', 'Dmitry Novoselov', 'Pyotr Fyodorov, Anastasiya Mikulchina, Evgenia Malakhova, Kristina Asmus, Sofia Lebedeva, Agniya Kuznetsova, Ekaterina Vilkova, Anatoliy Belyy', null, 'It is late spring of 1942, and the Great Patriotic War is in full swing. A long way off from the front-line, at some God-forgotten junction, the Germans make an air landing operation in an attempt to get through to the Kirov railway and the White Sea - the Baltic Sea Canal. These aren''t just ordinary paratroopers. This is a team of seasoned and highly trained infiltrators, the elite of the Waffen-SS, superhumans. The only thing in their way is an anti-aircraft artillery unit of corporal Vaskov and five young women in training. It may seem like a fight of local significance, but the countrys main strategic transportation artery is at stake. Can the corporal and his ''petite newbies'' prevent Nazi sabotage and at what cost? Television version: An extended version made out of four 45 minute episodes was released on Channel One Russia, on 9 May 2016. Available on PrimeVideo.', 'It is late spring of 1942, and the Great Patriotic War is in full swing. A long way off from the front-line, at some God-forgotten junction, the Germans make an air landing operation in an attempt to get through to the Kirov railway and the White Sea - the Baltic Sea Canal. These aren''t just ordinary paratroopers. This is a team of seasoned and highly trained infiltrators, the elite of the Waffen-SS, superhumans. The only thing in their way is an anti-aircraft artillery unit of corporal Vaskov and five young women in training. It may seem like a fight of local significance, but the countrys main strategic transportation artery is at stake. Can the corporal and his ''petite newbies'' prevent Nazi sabotage and at what cost? Television version: An extended version made out of four 45 minute episodes was released on Channel One Russia, on 9 May 2016. Available on PrimeVideo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPeYCHutYtsHibDiSDAfJ4SYedk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338517'),
  ('976523497772966104', 'The Day', 2011, 'Action, Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Douglas Aarniokoski, Boris Mojsovski, Joe Turner', 'Luke Passmore', 'Shawn Ashmore, Ashley Bell, Michael Eklund, Cory Hardrict, Dominic Monaghan, Shannyn Sossamon, Brianna Barnes, Steffi Hagel', 'R', 'Open war against humanity rages. For five survivors – lost and on the run – the pursuit is relentless, the bullets are dwindling and the battle is everywhere. This is a 24-hour look into their lives.', 'Open war against humanity rages. For five survivors – lost and on the run – the pursuit is relentless, the bullets are dwindling and the battle is everywhere. This is a 24-hour look into their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNFCkFmgI4Dnv3UpC0lLM7jWhYU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84226'),
  ('943592949144691659', 'The Day a Pig Fell Into the Well', 1996, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Cho Dong-kwan, Suh Shin-hye', 'Suh Shin-hye', 'Kim Eui-sung, Lee Eung-kyung, Park Jin-sung, Song Kang-ho, Cho Eun-sook, Bang Eun-hee, Son Min-seok, Jeon Hae-ryong', null, 'The lives of 4 interconnected South Koreans - a married couple, a novelist the wife is having an affair with, and a second woman the novelist is simultaneously involved with.', 'The lives of 4 interconnected South Koreans - a married couple, a novelist the wife is having an affair with, and a second woman the novelist is simultaneously involved with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DJ1veoay9Ugb7ve2NUZvQbdRUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86267'),
  ('593723851988337267', 'The Day After', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Drama, TV Movie', 'Gayne Rescher, Nicholas Meyer, Elie Cohn', 'Edward Hume', 'Jason Robards, JoBeth Williams, Steve Guttenberg, John Cullum, John Lithgow, Bibi Besch, Lori Lethin, Amy Madigan', 'NR', 'In the mid-1980s, the U.S. is poised on the brink of nuclear war. This shadow looms over the residents of a small town in Kansas as they continue their daily lives. Dr. Russell Oakes maintains his busy schedule at the hospital, Denise Dahlberg prepares for her upcoming wedding, and Stephen Klein is deep in his graduate studies. When the unthinkable happens and the bombs come down, the town''s residents are thrust into the horrors of nuclear winter.', 'In the mid-1980s, the U.S. is poised on the brink of nuclear war. This shadow looms over the residents of a small town in Kansas as they continue their daily lives. Dr. Russell Oakes maintains his busy schedule at the hospital, Denise Dahlberg prepares for her upcoming wedding, and Stephen Klein is deep in his graduate studies. When the unthinkable happens and the bombs come down, the town''s residents are thrust into the horrors of nuclear winter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brieV17D6R6HcubOqehLNYuxnvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7012'),
  ('930457109553080823', 'The Day After', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hong Sang-soo, Kim Hyung-koo, Shin Seok-ho', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Kwon Hae-hyo, Kim Min-hee, Kim Sae-byuk, Cho Yun-hee, Ki Joo-bong, Kang Tae-u, Park Ye-joo', null, 'On her first day at work, Areum replaces a woman who broke up with the boss. The wife of the boss finds a love note, bursts into the office, and mistakes Areum for the other woman.', 'On her first day at work, Areum replaces a woman who broke up with the boss. The wife of the boss finds a love note, bursts into the office, and mistakes Areum for the other woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjOe8RrgFOqWvHE5YuPcB0tl0pR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451957'),
  ('1105693757763611765', 'The Day After Tomorrow', 2004, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Adventure', 'Roland Emmerich, Ueli Steiger, Anna Foerster', 'Jeffrey Nachmanoff, Roland Emmerich', 'Dennis Quaid, Jake Gyllenhaal, Emmy Rossum, Dash Mihok, Jay O. Sanders, Sela Ward, Austin Nichols, Arjay Smith', 'PG-13', 'After paleoclimatologist Jack Hall is largely ignored by UN officials when presenting his environmental concerns about the beginning of a new Ice Age, his research proves true when a superstorm develops, setting off catastrophic natural disasters throughout the world. Trying to get to his son, Sam, who is trapped in New York City with his friend Laura and others, Jack and his crew must travel to get to Sam before it''s too late.', 'After paleoclimatologist Jack Hall is largely ignored by UN officials when presenting his environmental concerns about the beginning of a new Ice Age, his research proves true when a superstorm develops, setting off catastrophic natural disasters throughout the world. Trying to get to his son, Sam, who is trapped in New York City with his friend Laura and others, Jack and his crew must travel to get to Sam before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Wr4HeYQRvwVCxzOV5TmGE7UkXq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435'),
  ('1067978212587593426', 'The Day After Trinity', 1981, 'Documentary, History', 'Jon Else', 'Jon Else, David Webb Peoples, Janet Peoples', 'Paul Frees, Jon Else, J. Robert Oppenheimer, Hans Bethe, Frank Oppenheimer, Haakon Chevalier, Robert Serber, Holm Bursom', 'NR', 'Through interviews with Manhattan Project scientists and newly declassified archival footage, this documentary examines the life of physicist J. Robert Oppenheimer and his leadership of the Manhattan Project. The film traces the development and testing of the first atomic bomb and follows Oppenheimer’s later opposition to nuclear proliferation during the early years of the Cold War.', 'Through interviews with Manhattan Project scientists and newly declassified archival footage, this documentary examines the life of physicist J. Robert Oppenheimer and his leadership of the Manhattan Project. The film traces the development and testing of the first atomic bomb and follows Oppenheimer’s later opposition to nuclear proliferation during the early years of the Cold War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvNoCvCe4F52KumCuoUePsw7dsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59314'),
  ('150465714218512640', 'The Day and the Hour', 1963, 'Drama, Action, War', 'René Clément, Henri Decaë, Costa-Gavras', null, 'Simone Signoret, Stuart Whitman, Geneviève Page, Michel Piccoli, Reggie Nalder, Billy Kearns, Marcel Bozzuffi, Henri Virlogeux', null, 'It''s the spring of 1944 and Therese is in a hurry to get back to Paris. The trains aren''t running from the village where she has gone to visit her father''s grave and to fill two suitcases with food. Some British and American planes have been shot down and the Germans want to know where the pilots are hiding. An acquaintance has clearance to drive to Paris with a truckload of goats. After she is in the truck Therese discovers that two British pilots and an American pilot are back there with the goats. She must get the men on a train to Paris and to a safe house there, where there is no room for the American. Can she leave him at the Metro station trying to figure out the map?', 'It''s the spring of 1944 and Therese is in a hurry to get back to Paris. The trains aren''t running from the village where she has gone to visit her father''s grave and to fill two suitcases with food. Some British and American planes have been shot down and the Germans want to know where the pilots are hiding. An acquaintance has clearance to drive to Paris with a truckload of goats. After she is in the truck Therese discovers that two British pilots and an American pilot are back there with the goats. She must get the men on a train to Paris and to a safe house there, where there is no room for the American. Can she leave him at the Metro station trying to figure out the map?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RRn8yfqpNH5uzO6zcrIo6pVwh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78222'),
  ('714061217731575261', 'The Day Dorival Faced the Guard', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Jorge Furtado, José Pedro Goulart, Christian Lesage', 'Ana Luíza Azevedo, Giba Assis Brasil, José Pedro Goulart', 'João Acaiabe, Pedro Santos, José Adão Barbosa, Sirmar Antunes, Lui Strassburger, Vera Lúcia Lopes, Marcos Breda, Verlaine Pretto', null, 'Dorival, a man in jail, has only one wish: to take a bath. To achieve his objective, he defies the private, the corporal, the sargeant and, finally, the lieutenant in charge of the prison.', 'Dorival, a man in jail, has only one wish: to take a bath. To achieve his objective, he defies the private, the corporal, the sargeant and, finally, the lieutenant in charge of the prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMpSXzkgeDtOZ2oCL2L03WLVS7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191382'),
  ('376169425764214324', 'The Day He Arrives', 2011, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Kim Hyung-koo, Jeong Seokhee', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Yu Jun-sang, Kim Sang-joong, Song Sun-mi, Kim Bo-kyung, Kim Eui-sung, Baek Jong-hak, Ki Joo-bong, Bek Hyun-jin', null, 'A film director who no longer makes films arrives in Seoul to meet a close friend. When the friend doesn''t show up, he wanders the city aimlessly for three days, grabbing drinks and meeting women, with each day playing out like a version of the last.', 'A film director who no longer makes films arrives in Seoul to meet a close friend. When the friend doesn''t show up, he wanders the city aimlessly for three days, grabbing drinks and meeting women, with each day playing out like a version of the last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYgTNFSFKJMDQF4mq9vt3ieJ7eQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85525'),
  ('954689741623619555', 'The Day I Became a Woman', 2000, 'Drama', 'Marziyeh Meshkiny, Pouyan Tayefeh, Ebrahim Ghafori', 'Marziyeh Meshkiny, Mohsen Makhmalbaf', 'Fatemeh Cherag Akhar, Hassan Nebhan, Shahr Banou Sisizadeh, Ameneh Passand, Shabnam Toloui, Sirous Kahvarinegad, Mahram Zeinal Zadeh, Norieh Mahigiran', null, 'A girl reaches the age of nine and is supposed to act as a grown woman according to her family. A girl participates in a bike race against the will of her husband. An elderly woman decides she wants to buy all the things she always wanted but could never get.', 'A girl reaches the age of nine and is supposed to act as a grown woman according to her family. A girl participates in a bike race against the will of her husband. An elderly woman decides she wants to buy all the things she always wanted but could never get.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iB9Ky0Vr4edWA9eXdqGxfdGt2l1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44069'),
  ('664935881551492634', 'The Day I Bought a Star', 2006, 'Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Atsushi Okui, Ryosuke Kiyokawa', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Genzō Wakayama, Yo Oizumi, Kyoka Suzuki, Ryunosuke Kamiki', null, 'A young boy is tired of the city and escapes into the country. Two strangers trade him a strange seed. The boy accepts and the seed sprouts into a miniature planet, which continues to grow.', 'A young boy is tired of the city and escapes into the country. Two strangers trade him a strange seed. The boy accepts and the seed sprouts into a miniature planet, which continues to grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAZ9WRAQQHMdUjkGc1KuxBPZl9I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222661'),
  ('697956313960768754', 'The Day I Died: Unclosed Case', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Park Ji-wan, Cho Yong-kyu, Park Sang-wook', 'Park Ji-wan', 'Kim Hye-soo, Lee Jung-eun, Roh Jeong-eui, Kim Sun-young, Lee Sang-yeob, Moon Jeong-hee, Kim Jung-young, Park Ji-hoon', null, 'The detective Hyun-soo tries to track down a girl who disappeared off of a cliff during a stormy night.', 'The detective Hyun-soo tries to track down a girl who disappeared off of a cliff during a stormy night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1yoGrSWRQDi1At16tnkNTBVl89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609598'),
  ('694518874113545023', 'The Day I Lost Myself', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mich Zurita, Mich Zurita, Aarón Ramírez', 'Mich Zurita', 'Alicia Quiñonez, Carolina Rocha, Alejandro Belmonte, María Rojo, Eduardo Tanús, Julia Marco, Ximena Falcón, Sidney Robote', null, 'Xochil is a woman who must immerse in her past to find herself, opening the doors to a world that she thought was long forgotten.', 'Xochil is a woman who must immerse in her past to find herself, opening the doors to a world that she thought was long forgotten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moCnnkbzhMPp8YkxCakXDdi2Y5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768566'),
  ('67696670553172559', 'The Day I Saw Your Heart', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jennifer Devoldère, Laurent Tangy', 'Cécile Sellam, Romain Lévy, Jennifer Devoldère', 'Mélanie Laurent, Michel Blanc, Géraldine Nakache, Claude Perron, Camille Chamoux, Manu Payet, Guillaume Gouix, Sébastien Castro', null, 'Justine, struggles with commitment, listens to old David Bowie covers, and uses her employer’s private MRI machines to make “X-Ray Art” After a trail of boyfriends, Justine thinks she has found The One, a hunky shoe salesman, but her temporary happiness is thrown when her neurotic 60-year-old Jewish father (Michel Blanc) suffers a delayed midlife crisis and announces that his young second wife is expecting a baby. Justine and her half-sister Dom, who is trying to adopt, are rather annoyed at the news. Coupled with resentment about her father’s absence when she was growing up, causes her to spiral into self-doubt. Overflowing with French charm, Justine gets by with the help of her family, friends, and newly discovered muse.', 'Justine, struggles with commitment, listens to old David Bowie covers, and uses her employer’s private MRI machines to make “X-Ray Art” After a trail of boyfriends, Justine thinks she has found The One, a hunky shoe salesman, but her temporary happiness is thrown when her neurotic 60-year-old Jewish father (Michel Blanc) suffers a delayed midlife crisis and announces that his young second wife is expecting a baby. Justine and her half-sister Dom, who is trying to adopt, are rather annoyed at the news. Coupled with resentment about her father’s absence when she was growing up, causes her to spiral into self-doubt. Overflowing with French charm, Justine gets by with the help of her family, friends, and newly discovered muse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7poE5s3WEhYFMLoLpn7I9wbbkmD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74119'),
  ('47862820344947693', 'The Day I Was Not Born', 2010, 'Drama', 'Florian Cossen, Bruno Roberti, Matthias Fleischer', 'Florian Cossen, Elena von Saucken', 'Jessica Schwarz, Michael Gwisdek, Rafael Ferro, Beatriz Spelzini, Alfredo Castellani, Carlos Portaluppi', null, 'During a stopover in Buenos Aires on her way to Chile, 31-year-old Maria recognizes a nursery rhyme. Maria doesn''t speak a work of Spanish, but without understanding what she is singing, she remembers the Spanish lyrics. Disturbed and thrown off course, she decides to interrupt her journey and wander through the unfamiliar city.', 'During a stopover in Buenos Aires on her way to Chile, 31-year-old Maria recognizes a nursery rhyme. Maria doesn''t speak a work of Spanish, but without understanding what she is singing, she remembers the Spanish lyrics. Disturbed and thrown off course, she decides to interrupt her journey and wander through the unfamiliar city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGFc5f12jI1ijcnf9EJUtBeJp8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73889'),
  ('1029713817145634374', 'The Day Mars Invaded Earth', 1963, 'Science Fiction', 'Maury Dexter, John M. Nickolaus Jr., Clarence Eurist', 'Harry Spalding', 'Kent Taylor, Marie Windsor, William Mims, Betty Beall, Lowell Brown, Gregg Shank, Henrietta Moore, Troy Melton', 'NR', 'Martians replace scientist &amp; his family to pave way for invasion.', 'Martians replace scientist &amp; his family to pave way for invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tW3bGGYma4LesdXTj6aNBpxtOM1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118716'),
  ('919221733707459967', 'The Day of Destruction', 2020, 'Drama, Horror', 'Kenji Maki, Kenjiro Sou, Toshiaki Toyoda', 'Toshiaki Toyoda', 'Kiyohiko Shibukawa, MahiTo The People, Issey Ogata, Itsuki Nagasawa, Shima Onishi, Danko Iida, Rika Enami, Misa Wada', null, 'Seven years ago, a mysterious monster was found deep in a rural coal mine. Since then, rumors of a plague spread through the small town, and people experience an unexplainable mental illness. A young Shugendo practitioner goes missing only to resurface transformed, intent on exorcising the world from the monsters haunting it.', 'Seven years ago, a mysterious monster was found deep in a rural coal mine. Since then, rumors of a plague spread through the small town, and people experience an unexplainable mental illness. A young Shugendo practitioner goes missing only to resurface transformed, intent on exorcising the world from the monsters haunting it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdWwoixX0ivPKDgcMrK1FpPd7Up.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726343'),
  ('960718058899829551', 'The Day of Swapping', 2017, 'Romance', 'Myeong Seok Hwan', null, 'Joo Ye-bin, Baek Se-ri, Min Do-yoon, Ji Eun-seo, Jang Seok-min', null, 'Min-ho and Jeong-il end up working with each other''s wives one day. As time passes, the men feel attracted physically to their friend''s wives. In the end, Jeong-il suggests to Min-ho, "Let''s not take sides and just be happy as the four of us!" They start swapping each other.', 'Min-ho and Jeong-il end up working with each other''s wives one day. As time passes, the men feel attracted physically to their friend''s wives. In the end, Jeong-il suggests to Min-ho, "Let''s not take sides and just be happy as the four of us!" They start swapping each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bakeCMpKkoBZeHwVDjPT3sMolMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538751'),
  ('371735739153342992', 'The Day of the Beast', 1995, 'Horror, Comedy, Action', 'Álex de la Iglesia, Flavio Martínez Labiano, José María González Sinde', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría, Álex de la Iglesia', 'Álex Angulo, Santiago Segura, Armando De Razza, Terele Pávez, Nathalie Seseña, Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Saturnino García, Gianni Ippoliti', 'R', 'When a rogue priest discovers the exact date the Antichrist will be born, he enlists a Death Metal record store clerk and a cheesy TV psychic for an urban spree of gore, sacrilege and twisted humor to prevent the Apocalypse.', 'When a rogue priest discovers the exact date the Antichrist will be born, he enlists a Death Metal record store clerk and a cheesy TV psychic for an urban spree of gore, sacrilege and twisted humor to prevent the Apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEXhgACPIV4PmTgHT2HS3Ko2oS3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10722'),
  ('1152669825735736449', 'The Day of the Cat', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edwin Horak, Wolfgang Panzer', 'Claus Peter Hant, Dietmar Güntsche', 'Bruno Ganz, Ulrich Tukur, Marie Bäumer, Edgar Selge, Justus von Dohnányi, Antoine Monot Jr., Walo Lüönd, Christiane Paul', null, 'The Swiss President, called by all only "big hangover", is in trouble: the election is coming and according to surveys his chances are not very good. From a meeting with the Spanish royal couple, he hopes media attention and a popularity boost. He does not suspect that his closest confidant Pfiff, of all people, is intriguing against him in order to come to power himself. But he does not even shy away from misusing his family for his own purposes. Soon, the president has to fight not only for his political position, but also for his marriage.', 'The Swiss President, called by all only "big hangover", is in trouble: the election is coming and according to surveys his chances are not very good. From a meeting with the Spanish royal couple, he hopes media attention and a popularity boost. He does not suspect that his closest confidant Pfiff, of all people, is intriguing against him in order to come to power himself. But he does not even shy away from misusing his family for his own purposes. Soon, the president has to fight not only for his political position, but also for his marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AuMPf5FI2NL8TwcEz5swDDjxfT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66595'),
  ('325608789813799201', 'The Day of the Crows', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Jean-Christophe Dessaint', 'Amandine Taffin', 'Jean Reno, Lorànt Deutsch, Isabelle Carré, Claude Chabrol, Chantal Neuwirth, Bruno Podalydès', null, 'In a cabin of the deep of the forest, a child and his father lead a wild and hard life in utmost isolation. The child grows up fearing and admiring his father, with the ghosts haunting the forest as his only companions. Until the day he discovers the neighbouring village and meets a young girl there, Manon. At her side, he discovers that love exists. From then on he won''t cease to search for the place where his father''s love for him is hiding.', 'In a cabin of the deep of the forest, a child and his father lead a wild and hard life in utmost isolation. The child grows up fearing and admiring his father, with the ghosts haunting the forest as his only companions. Until the day he discovers the neighbouring village and meets a young girl there, Manon. At her side, he discovers that love exists. From then on he won''t cease to search for the place where his father''s love for him is hiding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkPuLais3EWSKME5bxjJ1Bzh4Sd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137193'),
  ('389831945220265722', 'The Day of the Dolphin', 1973, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller, Adventure', 'Mike Nichols, Michael Haley, William A. Fraker', 'Buck Henry', 'George C. Scott, Trish Van Devere, Paul Sorvino, Fritz Weaver, John Dehner, Severn Darden, Elizabeth Wilson, William Roerick', null, 'A marine biologist teaches his dolphins to communicate in English but shady characters plan to kidnap the trained mammals for a more sinister purpose.', 'A marine biologist teaches his dolphins to communicate in English but shady characters plan to kidnap the trained mammals for a more sinister purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLztqesi2Dj5Ny74u33GufVzKR6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42470'),
  ('87744426615695336', 'The Day of the Jackal', 1973, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jean Tournier, Fred Zinnemann, Edmond Séchan', 'Kenneth Ross', 'Edward Fox, Terence Alexander, Michel Auclair, Alan Badel, Tony Britton, Denis Carey, Cyril Cusack, Maurice Denham', 'PG', 'An international assassin known as ‘The Jackal’ is employed by disgruntled French generals to kill President Charles de Gaulle, with a dedicated gendarme on the assassin’s trail.', 'An international assassin known as ‘The Jackal’ is employed by disgruntled French generals to kill President Charles de Gaulle, with a dedicated gendarme on the assassin’s trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vThgcb3JOj99yETg8WChuci4LV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4909'),
  ('914749774870650801', 'The Day of the Locust', 1975, 'Drama', 'John Schlesinger, Conrad Hall, Tim Zinnemann', 'Waldo Salt', 'Donald Sutherland, Karen Black, Burgess Meredith, William Atherton, Geraldine Page, Richard Dysart, Bo Hopkins, Pepe Serna', 'R', 'Hollywood, 1930s. Tod Hackett, a young painter who tries to make his way as an art director in the lurid world of film industry, gets infatuated with his neighbor Faye Greener, an aspiring actress who prefers the life that Homer Simpson, a lone accountant, can offer her.', 'Hollywood, 1930s. Tod Hackett, a young painter who tries to make his way as an art director in the lurid world of film industry, gets infatuated with his neighbor Faye Greener, an aspiring actress who prefers the life that Homer Simpson, a lone accountant, can offer her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4T7R448djzbDbURK4eQgo5TllF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5122'),
  ('307470563464773302', 'The Day of the Lord', 2020, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Santiago Alvarado', 'Santiago Alvarado, Ramón Salas', 'Juli Fàbregas, Ximena Romo, Héctor Illanes, Dolores Heredia, Oscar Gordillo', null, 'In this horror movie, a retired priest haunted by his sins is pulled back into the darkness when a friend begs him to help his possessed daughter.', 'In this horror movie, a retired priest haunted by his sins is pulled back into the darkness when a friend begs him to help his possessed daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZQ88XFGKTTrOyeWM7wVKLTuC1N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676844'),
  ('842131765809350365', 'The Day of the Owl', 1968, 'Drama, Crime', 'Damiano Damiani, Tonino Delli Colli, Gianluigi Calderone', 'Ugo Pirro, Damiano Damiani', 'Franco Nero, Claudia Cardinale, Lee J. Cobb, Tano Cimarosa, Nehemiah Persoff, Serge Reggiani, Ennio Balbo, Ugo D''Alessio', null, 'Set in Sicily, this violent crime drama tells the tale of an Italian cop who heads to a small island town to look into the death of a construction supplier. Once there he is shocked by the influence the Mafia has over the people and even himself.', 'Set in Sicily, this violent crime drama tells the tale of an Italian cop who heads to a small island town to look into the death of a construction supplier. Once there he is shocked by the influence the Mafia has over the people and even himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QnOjIUR58Yficc6fuJtrJFPKOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58658'),
  ('329136711867790242', 'The Day Of the Siege: September Eleven 1683', 2012, 'History, Adventure, Drama, War', 'Renzo Martinelli, Fabio Cianchetti, Marcin Nowak', 'Renzo Martinelli, Valerio Massimo Manfredi', 'F. Murray Abraham, Enrico Lo Verso, Alicja Bachleda-Curuś, Jerzy Skolimowski, Piotr Adamczyk, Cristina Serafini, Antonio Cupo, Yorgo Voyagis', null, 'In the summer of 1683, 300 000 Ottoman Empire''s warriors begin the siege of Vienna. City''s fall, will open way to conquer the Europe. The Sept 11 is the day of main battle between Polish cavalry under the King Jan III Sobieski and Turks.', 'In the summer of 1683, 300 000 Ottoman Empire''s warriors begin the siege of Vienna. City''s fall, will open way to conquer the Europe. The Sept 11 is the day of main battle between Polish cavalry under the King Jan III Sobieski and Turks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wbaNzwhjyQBIg7aTax4fevcjDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166452'),
  ('324315869415940628', 'The Day of the Triffids', 1963, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Steve Sekely, Ted Moore', 'Bernard Gordon', 'Howard Keel, Janina Faye, Nicole Maurey, Janette Scott, Kieron Moore, Mervyn Johns, Ewan Roberts, Alison Leggatt', 'NR', 'After an unusual meteor shower leaves most of the human population blind, a merchant navy officer must find a way to conquer tall, aggressive plants which are feeding on people and animals.', 'After an unusual meteor shower leaves most of the human population blind, a merchant navy officer must find a way to conquer tall, aggressive plants which are feeding on people and animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6LYwbOzBl606vMXZtd6apxhcaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21143'),
  ('548505486805644727', 'The Day Shall Come', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Chris Morris, Andi Coldwell, Marcel Zyskind', 'Chris Morris, Jesse Armstrong', 'Marchánt Davis, Anna Kendrick, Pej Vahdat, Danielle Brooks, Rodney Richardson, Jim Gaffigan, Denis O''Hare, Calah Lane', null, 'An impoverished leader of a small religious commune in Miami is offered cash to save his family from eviction. He has no idea his sponsor works for an FBI agent, who plans to turn him into a criminal by fueling his madcap revolutionary dreams.', 'An impoverished leader of a small religious commune in Miami is offered cash to save his family from eviction. He has no idea his sponsor works for an FBI agent, who plans to turn him into a criminal by fueling his madcap revolutionary dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rk3Z0X5SnkwimBZj2AQjb5DHHI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492190'),
  ('581302107228073957', 'The Day Silence Died', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paolo Agazzi', 'Paolo Agazzi', 'Darío Grandinetti, Gustavo Angarita, Elías Serrano, Norma Merlo, María Laura García, Guillermo Granda, Blanca Morrison, Edgar Vargas', null, 'A handsome and mysterious stranger, played by Darío Grandinetti, walks into the town square of Villaserena one day and strategically places loudspeakers around the town, blaring a variety of musical tunes. Soon, he begins to sell airtime to the various locals, who broadcast their own personal love dedications and (more frequently) insults for all to hear. A subplot evolves between Abelardo (the stranger), Celeste (a young woman who is chained inside her father''s house to stop her running away), and José (a young man).', 'A handsome and mysterious stranger, played by Darío Grandinetti, walks into the town square of Villaserena one day and strategically places loudspeakers around the town, blaring a variety of musical tunes. Soon, he begins to sell airtime to the various locals, who broadcast their own personal love dedications and (more frequently) insults for all to hear. A subplot evolves between Abelardo (the stranger), Celeste (a young woman who is chained inside her father''s house to stop her running away), and José (a young man).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDrflEA0HGDWlBTWZvAWqp79wL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107587'),
  ('275169836938610789', 'The Day That Lasted 21 Years', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Camilo Tavares, Marcio Menezes, Andre Macedo', 'Camilo Tavares', 'João Goulart, Leonel Brizola, John F. Kennedy, Carlos Fico, Robert Bentley, James Green, Peter Kornbluh, Plinio de Arruda Sampaio', null, 'Stunning espionage documentary on the US conspiracy that led to the 1964 Brazilian coup d''état. John F. Kennedy and Lyndon Johnson original White House tapes, and CIA Top Secret documents reveal how the US government planned to overthrow Brazilian elected president João Goulart.', 'Stunning espionage documentary on the US conspiracy that led to the 1964 Brazilian coup d''état. John F. Kennedy and Lyndon Johnson original White House tapes, and CIA Top Secret documents reveal how the US government planned to overthrow Brazilian elected president João Goulart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dK1caRzRI7dXymJR9NdWTrJwrNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137221'),
  ('936306312775739325', 'The Day the Earth Blew Up: A Looney Tunes Movie', 2024, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Peter Browngardt, Joey Capps', 'Kevin Costello, Alex Kirwan, Andrew Dickman', 'Eric Bauza, Candi Milo, Peter MacNicol, Fred Tatasciore, Laraine Newman, Wayne Knight, Ruth Clampett, Andrew Kishino', 'PG', 'Porky and Daffy, the classic animated odd couple, turn into unlikely heroes when their antics at the local bubble gum factory uncover a secret alien mind control plot. Against all odds, the two are determined to save their town (and the world!)...that is if they don''t drive each other crazy in the process.', 'Porky and Daffy, the classic animated odd couple, turn into unlikely heroes when their antics at the local bubble gum factory uncover a secret alien mind control plot. Against all odds, the two are determined to save their town (and the world!)...that is if they don''t drive each other crazy in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2lB1kaYCdGSnZX5meQCiOR6HfX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:870360'),
  ('1102515042904223622', 'The Day the Earth Caught Fire', 1961, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Val Guest, Harry Waxman, Philip Shipway', 'Val Guest, Wolf Mankowitz', 'Janet Munro, Leo McKern, Edward Judd, Michael Goodliffe, Bernard Braden, Reginald Beckwith, Gene Anderson, Renée Asherson', null, 'British reporters suspect an international cover-up of a global disaster in progress... and they''re right. Hysterical panic has engulfed the world after the United States and the Soviet Union simultaneously detonate nuclear devices and have caused the orbit of the Earth to alter, sending it hurtling towards the sun.', 'British reporters suspect an international cover-up of a global disaster in progress... and they''re right. Hysterical panic has engulfed the world after the United States and the Soviet Union simultaneously detonate nuclear devices and have caused the orbit of the Earth to alter, sending it hurtling towards the sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0G0b528YVdrayoqmuuwKxRMXdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28430'),
  ('1141782115372604595', 'The Day the Earth Froze', 1959, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Ptushko, Viktor Yakushev, Gennadi Tsekavyi', 'Viktor Vitkovich, Grigori Yagdfeld', 'Andris Ošiņš, Eve Kivi, Anna Orochko, Ivan Voronov, Urho Somersalmi, Vladimir Boriskin, Ada Vojtsik, Anatoliy Barantsev', null, 'Based on Finnish mythology; Lemminkäinen woos the fair Annikki and battles the evil witch Louhi. Louhi kidnaps Annikki to compel her brother to build for her a Sampo, a magical device that creates salt, grain, and gold. When Lemminkäinen fails to recover the Sampo, Louhi steals the sun, plunging the world into frozen darkness.', 'Based on Finnish mythology; Lemminkäinen woos the fair Annikki and battles the evil witch Louhi. Louhi kidnaps Annikki to compel her brother to build for her a Sampo, a magical device that creates salt, grain, and gold. When Lemminkäinen fails to recover the Sampo, Louhi steals the sun, plunging the world into frozen darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8rSQPlqNv8W5TzvdEgfQJW15Xz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155399'),
  ('944277000356079036', 'The Day the Earth Stood Still', 1951, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Robert Wise, Leo Tover', 'Edmund H. North', 'Michael Rennie, Patricia Neal, Billy Gray, Sam Jaffe, Hugh Marlowe, Lock Martin, Freeman Lusk, Edith Evanson', 'G', 'An alien and a robot land on Earth after World War II and tell mankind to be peaceful or face destruction.', 'An alien and a robot land on Earth after World War II and tell mankind to be peaceful or face destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eslDNzf0LF1m9GsgUXlmyfTcC6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828'),
  ('920860419715625983', 'The Day the Earth Stood Still', 2008, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Scott Derrickson, Rachael Fortier, Matthew D. Smith', 'David Scarpa', 'Keanu Reeves, Jennifer Connelly, Jaden Smith, Jon Hamm, Kathy Bates, John Cleese, Kyle Chandler, Robert Knepper', 'PG-13', 'A representative of an alien race that went through drastic evolution to survive its own climate change, Klaatu comes to Earth to assess whether humanity can prevent the environmental damage they have inflicted on their own planet. When barred from speaking to the United Nations, he decides humankind shall be exterminated so the planet can survive.', 'A representative of an alien race that went through drastic evolution to survive its own climate change, Klaatu comes to Earth to assess whether humanity can prevent the environmental damage they have inflicted on their own planet. When barred from speaking to the United Nations, he decides humankind shall be exterminated so the planet can survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBgFSYmG5tb7GsZ3tHR0WNaWaxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10200'),
  ('515075213385351453', 'The Day the Earth Stopped', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'C. Thomas Howell, Adam Silver, William Morey', 'Edmund H. North', 'C. Thomas Howell, Bug Hall, Judd Nelson, Darren Dalton, Sinead McCafferty, Jake B. Miller, Patrick Ian Moore', 'R', 'Hundreds of massive intergalactic robots appear in all of the world''s major capitals with an ultimatum: Prove the value of human civilization or be destroyed.', 'Hundreds of massive intergalactic robots appear in all of the world''s major capitals with an ultimatum: Prove the value of human civilization or be destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rguwHbhfijkx0qf0eFR0fDJQPm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16102'),
  ('304565548563314613', 'The Day the Fish Came Out', 1967, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis, George P. Cosmatos, Walter Lassally', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis', 'Tom Courtenay, Candice Bergen, Colin Blakely, Sam Wanamaker, Ian Ogilvy, Dimitris Nikolaidis, Nikos Alexiou, Patricia Burke', null, 'A plane carrying a weapon more dangerous than a nuclear weapon goes down near Greece. To prevent panic, the officials go in dressed as tourists (who are dressed so casually that the pilots assume that they are all gay). The pilots are not to make themselves known and can''t contact the rescue team. The secrecy causes a comedy of errors including the desolate Greek Isle deciding that since tourists have now arrived, they have to become touristy.', 'A plane carrying a weapon more dangerous than a nuclear weapon goes down near Greece. To prevent panic, the officials go in dressed as tourists (who are dressed so casually that the pilots assume that they are all gay). The pilots are not to make themselves known and can''t contact the rescue team. The secrecy causes a comedy of errors including the desolate Greek Isle deciding that since tourists have now arrived, they have to become touristy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saLLEfLbqXIpdh5mrZoUcuGnT85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61111'),
  ('923932556257606459', 'The Day the Sky Exploded', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Paolo Heusch, Mario Bava, Mario Bava', 'Marcello Coscia, Sandro Continenza', 'Paul Hubschmid, Madeleine Fischer, Fiorella Mari, Ivo Garrani, Dario Michaelis, Sam Galter, Jean-Jacques Delbo, Peter Meersman', 'NR', 'Scientists discover that a group of meteors are hurtling on a collison course with Earth, and if they hit, the planet will be destroyed.', 'Scientists discover that a group of meteors are hurtling on a collison course with Earth, and if they hit, the planet will be destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txwSoTks8fmtonBPp2YKIcSRY3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70864'),
  ('294982725092628998', 'The Day the World Ended', 2001, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Terence Gross, Dirk Craft, Jessica W. Leung', 'Max Enscoe, Annie DeYoung', 'Nastassja Kinski, Bobby Edner, Randy Quaid, Stephen Tobolowsky, Harry Groener, Alexander Gould, Kate Fuglei, Olivia Marlow', null, 'A school psychologist investigates the death of a student''s mother and finds the boy believes he is the son of an alien being.', 'A school psychologist investigates the death of a student''s mother and finds the boy believes he is the son of an alien being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PFOqLdY6WlDoY38GLHbBN4Hrd8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49804'),
  ('303532247418071476', 'The Day They Robbed the Bank of England', 1960, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Guillermin, Georges Périnal, Charles Blair', 'Howard Clewes', 'Aldo Ray, Elizabeth Sellars, Peter O''Toole, Kieron Moore, Albert Sharpe, Joseph Tomelty, Wolf Frees, John Le Mesurier', 'NR', 'London at the turn of the century. Three men are on a mission from the IRA to steal all the gold in the vaults of the Bank of England. Norgate, their leader, discovers the bank''s weak spot: an old forgotten sewer straight under the vaults.', 'London at the turn of the century. Three men are on a mission from the IRA to steal all the gold in the vaults of the Bank of England. Norgate, their leader, discovers the bank''s weak spot: an old forgotten sewer straight under the vaults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkC6e4ROmCj0wnnz6psF2DtQkH1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86225'),
  ('464325696855102217', 'The Day Time Ended', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Horror', 'John Arthur Morrill, Jon Gobetti, Don Lalingo', 'Wayne Schmidt, J. Larry Carroll, David Schmoeller', 'Jim Davis, Christopher Mitchum, Dorothy Malone, Marcy Lafferty, Natasha Ryan, Scott C. Kolden, Roberto Contreras', null, 'Deep in the desert, a rural American family is forced to endure a night of inter-dimensional, extra terrestrial terror when a UFO appears over their home.', 'Deep in the desert, a rural American family is forced to endure a night of inter-dimensional, extra terrestrial terror when a UFO appears over their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4D5fgWAKmBLWllsdKEjF2y7NYeR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57949'),
  ('66888522529387395', 'The Day Will Come', 2016, 'Drama', 'Jesper W. Nielsen', 'Søren Sveistrup', 'Lars Mikkelsen, Sofie Gråbøl, Harald Kaiser Hermann, Albert Rudbeck Lindhardt, Lars Ranthe, Søren Sætter-Lassen, Solbjørg Højfeldt, Sonja Richter', null, 'Set in the blooming 1960s, the film centres on two young brothers who are instantly robbed of their lives when they are placed in a boy''s home forgotten by time. Armed only with a vivid imagination and a fickle hope, the boys engage in the frightening battle against Headmaster Heck and his lethal tyranny. The film is based on actual events.', 'Set in the blooming 1960s, the film centres on two young brothers who are instantly robbed of their lives when they are placed in a boy''s home forgotten by time. Armed only with a vivid imagination and a fickle hope, the boys engage in the frightening battle against Headmaster Heck and his lethal tyranny. The film is based on actual events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uhyTqMnbhKODsah5MA2AO0drPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348675'),
  ('103354711691251612', 'The Daydreamer', 1966, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Al Hirschfeld, Daniel Cavelli, Kizo Nagashima', 'Arthur Rankin, Jr.', 'Paul O''Keefe, Jack Gilford, Margaret Hamilton, Ray Bolger, Robert Harter, Tallulah Bankhead, Victor Borge, Patty Duke', 'G', 'A young Hans Christian Andersen goes in search of knowledge in the Garden of Paradise in order to make his studies easier. Each time he falls asleep, he experiences in his dreams the different characters he would later write about in fairy tales including The Little Mermaid, Thumbelina, and The Emperor''s New Clothes.', 'A young Hans Christian Andersen goes in search of knowledge in the Garden of Paradise in order to make his studies easier. Each time he falls asleep, he experiences in his dreams the different characters he would later write about in fairy tales including The Little Mermaid, Thumbelina, and The Emperor''s New Clothes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7RiyeB5NccB2NgXtVFJXFiwe6Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83811'),
  ('12540165579605705', 'The Days Between', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Maria Speth, Reinhold Vorschneider, Oliver Brzoska', 'Maria Speth', 'Sabine Timoteo, Hiroki Mano, Florian Müller-Mohrungen, Sabina Riedel, Nicole Marischka, Kim Andrzejewski, Guntram Brattia, Dieter Dost', null, 'Lynn is a cheerful 22-year-old who works at a cafe and lives with her brother. Though she has no real direction in life, she is happy. Conversely, her boyfriend, David, is a career-driven swimmer who seems to care only about his training. Then Lynn meets Japanese exchange student Koji, and, though they speak different languages and spend most of their time together in silence, the two soon become closer than she and David had ever been.', 'Lynn is a cheerful 22-year-old who works at a cafe and lives with her brother. Though she has no real direction in life, she is happy. Conversely, her boyfriend, David, is a career-driven swimmer who seems to care only about his training. Then Lynn meets Japanese exchange student Koji, and, though they speak different languages and spend most of their time together in silence, the two soon become closer than she and David had ever been.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sXhcjDZM7z1EYZfLEU6MtZgQOu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45949'),
  ('1035335020161671621', 'The Days of Abandonment', 2005, 'Drama', 'Maurizio Calvesi, Roberto Faenza', 'Roberto Faenza', 'Margherita Buy, Luca Zingaretti, Goran Bregović, Gaia Bermani Amaral, Alessia Goria, Gea Lionello, Sara Santostasi, Roberto Accornero', null, 'Olga''s life is shattered when her husband leaves her. This makes her fall into a period of self-degradation and self-destructive behaviors.', 'Olga''s life is shattered when her husband leaves her. This makes her fall into a period of self-degradation and self-destructive behaviors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGwT0MXls1se2wVCEsYLnv1qlTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62487'),
  ('1113754981925278694', 'The Days of Being Dumb', 1992, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Blackie Ko Sau-Leung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Tony Miu Kin-Fai', 'Joe Ma Wai-Ho, James Yuen Sai-Sang, Cheung Chi-Sing', 'Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Jamie Luk Kim-Ming, Chris Yeung Wan-King, Chu Tau', null, 'Two losers who''ll do anything to try and be successful in the Triad world, but all they''ve accomplished is having a bad luck reputation.', 'Two losers who''ll do anything to try and be successful in the Triad world, but all they''ve accomplished is having a bad luck reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91ucMMuoDkjIgLZxlKetu7WFIVf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111145'),
  ('1032928660325566252', 'The Daytime Doorman', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Fábio Leal, Tiago Calazans', 'Fábio Leal', 'Carlos Eduardo Ferraz, Edilson Silva, Fábio Leal, João Vigo', null, 'After exchanging glances between "good mornings" and "good afternoons", Marcelo realizes it''s time to try to go further with Márcio, the doorman in his building. Two worlds will collide through these men''s bodies.', 'After exchanging glances between "good mornings" and "good afternoons", Marcelo realizes it''s time to try to go further with Márcio, the doorman in his building. Two worlds will collide through these men''s bodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aftaqqjdAKze87HUWuPXWiFZZ8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430412'),
  ('906887487929271002', 'The Daytrippers', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Greg Mottola, Anthony Savini, Brian Lindstrom', 'Greg Mottola', 'Hope Davis, Pat McNamara, Anne Meara, Parker Posey, Liev Schreiber, Campbell Scott, Stanley Tucci, Marc Grapey', 'R', 'Eliza D''Amico thinks her marriage to Louis is going great until she finds a mysterious love note to her husband. Concerned, she goes to her mother for advice. Eliza, her parents, her sister Jo, and Jo''s boyfriend all pile into the station wagon and go to the city to confront Louis with the letter. On the way, the five explore their relations with each other and meet many interesting people.', 'Eliza D''Amico thinks her marriage to Louis is going great until she finds a mysterious love note to her husband. Concerned, she goes to her mother for advice. Eliza, her parents, her sister Jo, and Jo''s boyfriend all pile into the station wagon and go to the city to confront Louis with the letter. On the way, the five explore their relations with each other and meet many interesting people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDmconT9Fj0dnXdV5LaGAxXrVFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49806'),
  ('50402486024751544', 'The Dazzled', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sarah Suco, Claire Tavernier, Juliette Maillard', null, 'Camille Cottin, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Éric Caravaca, Céleste Brunnquell, Laurence Roy, Daniel Martin, Spencer Bogaert, Benjamin Gauthier', null, 'Camille, is the eldest of a large family. One day, her parents enter a religious community which gradually, regimentation becomes sectarian and Camille will have to fight to assert her freedom and save her brothers and sisters.', 'Camille, is the eldest of a large family. One day, her parents enter a religious community which gradually, regimentation becomes sectarian and Camille will have to fight to assert her freedom and save her brothers and sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hn106rcEHkO5IuWylzB9ccT4bLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582906'),
  ('708153145036852752', 'The Dead', 1960, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, 'Kenneth Anger', null, '"The Dead became my first work in which things that might very easily be taken as symbols were so photographed as to destroy all their symbolic potential. The action of making The Dead kept me alive." Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2013.', '"The Dead became my first work in which things that might very easily be taken as symbols were so photographed as to destroy all their symbolic potential. The action of making The Dead kept me alive." Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klykqvLWSOqf4Pss2XhQBPCGyau.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145033'),
  ('260987667217925963', 'The Dead', 1987, 'Drama', 'John Huston, Fred Murphy', 'Tony Huston', 'Anjelica Huston, Donal McCann, Dan O''Herlihy, Helena Carroll, Cathleen Delany, Ingrid Craigie, Donal Donnelly, Colm Meaney', 'PG', 'After a convivial holiday dinner party, things begin to unravel when a husband and wife address some prickly issues concerning their marriage.', 'After a convivial holiday dinner party, things begin to unravel when a husband and wife address some prickly issues concerning their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFLUqiwvvtcUqA5NZNejaaNpTv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39507'),
  ('944114346045997248', 'The Dead', 2010, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jonathan Ford, Jonathan Ford, Howard J. Ford', 'Howard J. Ford, Jonathan Ford', 'Julia Scott-Russell, Rob Freeman, Ben Crowe, Dan Morgan, Prince David Oseia, David Dontoh, Glenn Salvage, Howard J. Ford', 'R', 'When the last evacuation flight out of war-torn Africa crashes off the coast, American Air Force Engineer Lieutenant Brian Murphy emerges as the sole survivor in a land where the dead are returning to life and attacking the living.', 'When the last evacuation flight out of war-torn Africa crashes off the coast, American Air Force Engineer Lieutenant Brian Murphy emerges as the sole survivor in a land where the dead are returning to life and attacking the living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJAbF41N7ZvoTAhZTaQ85AYpLJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74471'),
  ('1077177018631705829', 'The Dead 2: India', 2013, 'Horror, Action, Drama', 'Howard J. Ford, Jonathan Ford, Jonathan Ford', 'Jonathan Ford', 'Joseph Millson, Meenu Mishra, Anand Krishna Goyal, Sandip Datta Gupta, Poonam Mathur, Niharika Singh', 'R', 'An infectious epidemic spreads through India as an American turbine engineer learns that his pregnant girlfriend is trapped near the slums of Mumbai. Now he must battle his way across a 300mile wasteland of the ravenous undead.', 'An infectious epidemic spreads through India as an American turbine engineer learns that his pregnant girlfriend is trapped near the slums of Mumbai. Now he must battle his way across a 300mile wasteland of the ravenous undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dF6AP6eo0EvKRZQu64uXOQzIRPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214464'),
  ('433440480000936631', 'The Dead and the Deadly', 1982, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy, Action', 'Wu Ma, Cheung Yiu-Cho, Chang Ching-Po', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Wu Ma, Lam Ching-Ying, Cherie Chung Cho-Hung, Hui Leung-Mei, Chin Yuet-Sang, To Siu-Ming, Chang Ching-Po', null, 'Wah Li, known as Fat Boy to his friends, lives with his great-uncle the priest (Uncle). Together with his oddball friends Lai Li and Momo, Wah Li helps Uncle to run the local funeral services. When the body Ma Lun Chio is brought back to the village by a new wife and her "brother", Wai Li is suspicious. He sets out to find out how his friend died, but things are not what they seem.', 'Wah Li, known as Fat Boy to his friends, lives with his great-uncle the priest (Uncle). Together with his oddball friends Lai Li and Momo, Wah Li helps Uncle to run the local funeral services. When the body Ma Lun Chio is brought back to the village by a new wife and her "brother", Wai Li is suspicious. He sets out to find out how his friend died, but things are not what they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVBL2043WUqezv9B7bFyovOpyqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67347'),
  ('499297470613351041', 'The Dead and the Living', 2012, 'Drama', 'Barbara Albert, Bogumił Godfrejów', 'Barbara Albert', 'Anna Fischer, August Zirner, Winfried Glatzeder, Wanja Mues, Daniel Sea, Hanns Schuschnig, Itay Tiran, Almut Zilcher', null, 'The personal journey of young Sita is not only an expedition into her family''s burdened past during World War 2. It is also a journey to the abyss of modern European society, a trip which takes her from Berlin to Romania via Vienna and Warsaw - about losing one''s homeland and discovering oneself, about hope and responsibility.', 'The personal journey of young Sita is not only an expedition into her family''s burdened past during World War 2. It is also a journey to the abyss of modern European society, a trip which takes her from Berlin to Romania via Vienna and Warsaw - about losing one''s homeland and discovering oneself, about hope and responsibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIvJwzE6DsmhBq0qNYYYCJjXcWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167424'),
  ('710483111232745415', 'The Dead and the Others', 2019, 'Drama', 'Renée Nader Messora, João Salaviza, Renée Nader Messora', 'Renée Nader Messora, João Salaviza', 'Henrique Ihjãc Krahô, Raene Kôtô Krahô, Douglas Tiepre Krahô, Iasmin Kropej Krahô, Osmar Kwycaké Krahô', null, 'Denying his duty and in order to escape a crucial process of becoming a shaman, Ihjãc runs away to the city. Far from his people and culture, he faces the reality of being an indigenous in contemporary Brazil.', 'Denying his duty and in order to escape a crucial process of becoming a shaman, Ihjãc runs away to the city. Far from his people and culture, he faces the reality of being an indigenous in contemporary Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bj4z6YTZHXph8I7K4sEQ6XLdXtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519241'),
  ('562315969578822909', 'The Dead Are Alive', 1972, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Armando Crispino, Erico Menczer, Victor Tourjansky', 'Armando Crispino, Lutz Eisholz, Lucio Battistrada', 'Alex Cord, Samantha Eggar, John Marley, Enzo Tarascio, Nadja Tiller, Horst Frank, Enzo Cerusico, Carlo De Mejo', 'R', 'A photographer on an archaeological expedition digging up Etruscan ruins in Italy begins to suspect that not all the Etruscans buried there are actually dead.', 'A photographer on an archaeological expedition digging up Etruscan ruins in Italy begins to suspect that not all the Etruscans buried there are actually dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UvohjIEOURIy1BPKew0adgmfxG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64725'),
  ('641851939140104055', 'The Dead Center', 2019, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Jeremy Childs, Billy Senese, Andy Duensing', 'Billy Senese', 'Shane Carruth, Poorna Jagannathan, Jeremy Childs, Bill Feehely, J. Thomas Bailey, Quinn Cooke, Josh Croft, Karen B. Greer', null, 'When a mysterious "John Doe" wakes up in a morgue and wanders into a psychiatric ward, a devoted doctor and curious medical examiner must slowly uncover dark and sinister secrets about the man that reveal a more horrifying truth than they could have ever imagined.', 'When a mysterious "John Doe" wakes up in a morgue and wanders into a psychiatric ward, a devoted doctor and curious medical examiner must slowly uncover dark and sinister secrets about the man that reveal a more horrifying truth than they could have ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMvuo4DianPqhp6rvuvTkiICTCS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549859'),
  ('997773904841034883', 'The Dead Come Home', 1989, 'Horror', 'James Riffel, Michelangelo Csaba Bolla, Mark Petersson', 'James Riffel', 'Mark Zobain, Victor Verhaeghe, Sarah Newhouse, Douglas Gibson, J.D. Cerna, Naomi Kooker, Eugene Sautner, Rob Moretti', 'NR', 'A group of friends decide to renovate an old house located in the middle of nowhere, in the hope of turning it into their crash pad, but shortly after arriving, a strange and seemingly senile old woman is found to be lurking around the premises.', 'A group of friends decide to renovate an old house located in the middle of nowhere, in the hope of turning it into their crash pad, but shortly after arriving, a strange and seemingly senile old woman is found to be lurking around the premises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHnVLQLYBhV1dj0OEBZpWaC5FX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69869'),
  ('540963832037885623', 'The Dead Don''t Die', 1975, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Curtis Harrington, James Crabe', 'Robert Bloch', 'George Hamilton, Ray Milland, Joan Blondell, Linda Cristal, Ralph Meeker, James McEachin, Reggie Nalder, Jerry Douglas', null, 'In the 1930s, a sailor trying to prove that his brother was wrongly executed for murder finds himself becoming drawn into the occult world.', 'In the 1930s, a sailor trying to prove that his brother was wrongly executed for murder finds himself becoming drawn into the occult world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPSB6B5duZIjF0QOBsP1aPBjNRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29489'),
  ('22538367349494435', 'The Dead Don''t Die', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Randall Balsmeyer, Alejandro Ramia, Will Rimmer', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Bill Murray, Adam Driver, Chloë Sevigny, Tilda Swinton, Caleb Landry Jones, Tom Waits, Danny Glover, Steve Buscemi', 'R', 'In the sleepy town of Centerville, the lives of a number of interconnected characters are disrupted by the undead.', 'In the sleepy town of Centerville, the lives of a number of interconnected characters are disrupted by the undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndvOjo7Nfk8ULnFLMXthPzhI62L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535581'),
  ('1008431835182011877', 'The Dead Don''t Hurt', 2024, 'Western, Drama', 'Victor ''Chore'' Sobrevals, Marcela Nava, Samanta Engberts', 'Viggo Mortensen', 'Vicky Krieps, Viggo Mortensen, Solly McLeod, Garret Dillahunt, Danny Huston, W. Earl Brown, Shane Graham, Rafel Plana', 'R', 'In the 1860s, fiercely independent French-Canadian Vivienne Le Coudy embarks on a journey with Danish immigrant Holger Olsen, attempting to forge a life together in the dusty town of Elk Flats, Nevada. When Holger decides to go fight for the Union in the burgeoning Civil War, Vivienne must fend for herself, which isn''t easy in a town controlled by a corrupt mayor.', 'In the 1860s, fiercely independent French-Canadian Vivienne Le Coudy embarks on a journey with Danish immigrant Holger Olsen, attempting to forge a life together in the dusty town of Elk Flats, Nevada. When Holger decides to go fight for the Union in the burgeoning Civil War, Vivienne must fend for herself, which isn''t easy in a town controlled by a corrupt mayor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5rP0l3n6y8GNMuPVrUANKnQkSY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032425'),
  ('562436531479985527', 'The Dead End', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Cao Baoping, Luo Pan', 'Cao Baoping', 'Deng Chao, Duan Yihong, Guo Tao, Wang Luodan, Jackie Lui Chung-Yin, Li Xiaochuan, Du Zhiguo, Xu Xihan', null, 'A "Chinese noir full of sublimated homoeroticism" . The story of three brothers raising a little girl they found as a baby. These sworn brothers are not related by blood, but by a long-standing acquaintance and a serious crime they committed seven years ago. The movie features a homosexual love scene that was handled in a relatively straightforward manner.', 'A "Chinese noir full of sublimated homoeroticism" . The story of three brothers raising a little girl they found as a baby. These sworn brothers are not related by blood, but by a long-standing acquaintance and a serious crime they committed seven years ago. The movie features a homosexual love scene that was handled in a relatively straightforward manner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arJkaMoHTy9h0oHflsWOVN9FLI3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344556'),
  ('113464598562541864', 'The Dead Girl', 2006, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Karen Moncrieff, Michael Grady', 'Karen Moncrieff', 'Brittany Murphy, Rose Byrne, Toni Collette, Marcia Gay Harden, Mary Beth Hurt, Piper Laurie, Kerry Washington, Josh Brolin', 'R', 'The clues to a young woman''s death come together as the lives of seemingly unrelated women begin to intersect.', 'The clues to a young woman''s death come together as the lives of seemingly unrelated women begin to intersect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBIn93ZY0Qd3BafjSJYvqgAZu88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13551'),
  ('199105850917105726', 'The Dead Girl in Apartment 03', 2022, 'Horror', 'Kurtis Spieler', 'Kurtis Spieler', 'Laura Dooling, Frank Wihbey, Brian Manley Davis, Adrienne King, Michael Schantz, Amy Holomakoff, Larry Dwyer', null, 'Shortly after discovering the dead body of her roommate, a young woman becomes embroiled in supernatural shenanigans.', 'Shortly after discovering the dead body of her roommate, a young woman becomes embroiled in supernatural shenanigans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8DN94XDIcnLo5CWpMjsLKhFV8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944323'),
  ('663577720379105907', 'The Dead Girl''s Feast', 2009, 'Drama', 'Matheus Nachtergaele, Kity Féo', 'Matheus Nachtergaele, Hilton Lacerda', 'Daniel de Oliveira, Dira Paes, Juliano Cazarré, Cássia Kis, Jackson Antunes, Paulo José, Conceição Camaroti, Francisco Mendes', null, 'The story of Santinho, a young man who has been exalted to the position of a saint in a remote riverine community of the upper Amazonas state, after performing a “miracle” upon the suicide of his own mother. The film seeks to be an intimate picture of those who are involved in this sect and of the infinite human capacity of “fabricating” faith and seeking some sense in the horrifying experience of death.', 'The story of Santinho, a young man who has been exalted to the position of a saint in a remote riverine community of the upper Amazonas state, after performing a “miracle” upon the suicide of his own mother. The film seeks to be an intimate picture of those who are involved in this sect and of the infinite human capacity of “fabricating” faith and seeking some sense in the horrifying experience of death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PWfoFg4pX8bMG8W5dIOzwZ2bsz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8925'),
  ('713951965939053000', 'The Dead Hate the Living!', 2000, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Thomas L. Callaway, Dave Parker', 'Dave Parker', 'Eric Clawson, Jamie Donahue, Brett Beardslee, Wendy Speake, Benjamin P. Morris, Rick Irwin, David Douglas, Kimberly Pullis', 'R', 'When a renegade band of young filmmakers break into an abandoned hospital to make their horror epic, they stumble upon a real dead body and decide to use it in their movie. They accidentally bring it back to life, open a portal to a dead world that releases dozens of other zombies, then struggle for their lives in a desperate attempt to flee from the creatures who apparently have them hopelessly trapped in the hospital.', 'When a renegade band of young filmmakers break into an abandoned hospital to make their horror epic, they stumble upon a real dead body and decide to use it in their movie. They accidentally bring it back to life, open a portal to a dead world that releases dozens of other zombies, then struggle for their lives in a desperate attempt to flee from the creatures who apparently have them hopelessly trapped in the hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shhtF3ceZOHuJvh07f4UTsZ6JzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28349'),
  ('975383776827655489', 'The Dead Lands', 2014, 'Adventure, Action', 'Toa Fraser, Leon Narbey', 'Glenn Standring', 'James Rolleston, Lawrence Makoare, Te Kohe Tuhaka, Xavier Horan, Raukura Turei, George Henare, Rena Owen, Pana Hema-Taylor', 'R', 'Hongi, a Maori chieftain’s teenage son, must avenge his father’s murder in order to bring peace and honour to the souls of his loved ones after his tribe is slaughtered through an act of treachery. Vastly outnumbered by a band of villains led by Wirepa, Hongi’s only hope is to pass through the feared and forbidden “Dead Lands” and forge an uneasy alliance with a mysterious warrior, a ruthless fighter who has ruled the area for years.', 'Hongi, a Maori chieftain’s teenage son, must avenge his father’s murder in order to bring peace and honour to the souls of his loved ones after his tribe is slaughtered through an act of treachery. Vastly outnumbered by a band of villains led by Wirepa, Hongi’s only hope is to pass through the feared and forbidden “Dead Lands” and forge an uneasy alliance with a mysterious warrior, a ruthless fighter who has ruled the area for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdlRuuA2CtS0KtaVzAikZxVHRIk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283322'),
  ('564534982138276873', 'The Dead Man and Being Happy', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Javier Rebollo, Dani Fontrodona, Santiago Racaj', 'Lola Mayo, Javier Rebollo, Salvador Roselli', 'José Sacristán, Roxana Blanco, Valeria Alonso, Jorge Jellinek, Carlos Lecuona, Lisa Caligaris, Vicky Peña, Fermí Reixach', null, 'A Spaniard in Argentina becomes aware of his approaching death while staying at a hospital, so he decides to run away from Buenos Aires and start a trip up North, heading nowhere in particular.', 'A Spaniard in Argentina becomes aware of his approaching death while staying at a hospital, so he decides to run away from Buenos Aires and start a trip up North, heading nowhere in particular.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsTgyIMwhBqaqZkMST7WV6dNpEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133082'),
  ('839247370157911424', 'The Dead Mother', 1993, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Juanma Bajo Ulloa, Javier Aguirresarobe, Txarly Llorente', 'Juanma Bajo Ulloa, Eduardo Bajo Ulloa', 'Karra Elejalde, Ana Álvarez, Lio, Silvia Marsó, Elena Irureta, Ramón Barea, Gregoria Mangas, Marisol Sáez', null, 'Ismael breaks into the house of a fine art restorer and shoots the homeowner dead, leaving her daughter orphaned and traumatized for life. Years later, Ismael is working in a bar where he sees the daughter again. Paranoid that she has recognised him and will report him, he kidnaps her and holds her hostage, demanding that her hospital pay a ransom for her release. As he spends more time with her, a strange bond develops that causes him to delay the ransom request or fulfil his threats of throwing her in front of a train. But he can’t delay forever…', 'Ismael breaks into the house of a fine art restorer and shoots the homeowner dead, leaving her daughter orphaned and traumatized for life. Years later, Ismael is working in a bar where he sees the daughter again. Paranoid that she has recognised him and will report him, he kidnaps her and holds her hostage, demanding that her hospital pay a ransom for her release. As he spends more time with her, a strange bond develops that causes him to delay the ransom request or fulfil his threats of throwing her in front of a train. But he can’t delay forever…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAvzP7zWN46dI1GO1TP5pirh0Mc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115470'),
  ('329418172533422581', 'The Dead Next Door', 1989, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'J.R. Bookwalter, Michael Tolochko', 'J.R. Bookwalter', 'Peter Ferry, Bogdan Pecic, Michael Grossi, Jolie Jackunas, Robert Kokai, Floyd Ewing Jr., Maria Markovic, Jon Killough', 'NR', 'The government sets up a zombie squad after an epidemic has made the world run rampant with living corpses. The team head off to Ohio to try and find a cure but soon run into a crazy cult of zombie lovers who are set on preserving the walking dead as they believe it''s God''s will.', 'The government sets up a zombie squad after an epidemic has made the world run rampant with living corpses. The team head off to Ohio to try and find a cure but soon run into a crazy cult of zombie lovers who are set on preserving the walking dead as they believe it''s God''s will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0YY0O4hnsd8fiJ3TnBOfZZR4hQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25028'),
  ('85301351955252550', 'The Dead One', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller, Romance', 'Brian Cox, Steve Yedlin', 'Brian Cox', 'Wilmer Valderrama, Angie Cepeda, Joel David Moore, Michael Parks, Tony Plana, E.J. Callahan, Tony Amendola, Alfonso Arau', 'PG-13', 'Trapped between the living and the dead, Diego de la Muerte fights to rescue his soul from the evil god of death that controls him. But a bigger battle awaits him when the Aztec god demands the soul of Maria, the girlfriend Diego left behind.', 'Trapped between the living and the dead, Diego de la Muerte fights to rescue his soul from the evil god of death that controls him. But a bigger battle awaits him when the Aztec god demands the soul of Maria, the girlfriend Diego left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yi5eJhCIDNOqVXw2Py6vK3dMGzT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45835'),
  ('811615055869991661', 'The Dead Outside', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kerry Anne Mullaney', 'Kris R. Bird', 'Sandra Louise Douglas, Alton Milne, Sharon Osdin, Vivienne Harvey', null, 'A neurological pandemic has consumed the population. Drug-resistance has mutated the virus into a ravaging psychological plague, rendering the ''the dying'' desperate, paranoid and violent', 'A neurological pandemic has consumed the population. Drug-resistance has mutated the virus into a ravaging psychological plague, rendering the ''the dying'' desperate, paranoid and violent', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VmiOxVqV391jpADc2zTFrPAEqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34195'),
  ('819336334174730494', 'The Dead Pit', 1989, 'Horror', 'Brett Leonard, Marty Collins', 'Gimel Everett, Brett Leonard', 'Jeremy Slate, Cheryl Lawson, Stephen Gregory Foster, Danny Gochnauer, Geha Getz, Joan Bechtel, Mara Everett, Jack A. Sunseri', 'R', 'The arrival of an amnesiac patient in a psychiatric hospital somehow frees a mad doctor, who was shot and entombed with his fiendish experiments in an abandoned wing of the asylum 20 years before.', 'The arrival of an amnesiac patient in a psychiatric hospital somehow frees a mad doctor, who was shot and entombed with his fiendish experiments in an abandoned wing of the asylum 20 years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1QVgIr9MzPxNcGYk7PPNywmzHA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40448'),
  ('243607584161668618', 'The Dead Pool', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Buddy Van Horn, Jack N. Green', 'Steve Sharon', 'Clint Eastwood, Patricia Clarkson, Liam Neeson, Evan C. Kim, Jim Carrey, David Hunt, Michael Currie, Ronnie Claire Edwards', 'R', 'Dirty Harry Callahan returns for his final film adventure. Together with his partner Al Quan, he must investigate the systematic murder of prominent figures. By the time Harry learns that the murders are part of a sick game to predict such deaths, it may be too late.', 'Dirty Harry Callahan returns for his final film adventure. Together with his partner Al Quan, he must investigate the systematic murder of prominent figures. By the time Harry learns that the murders are part of a sick game to predict such deaths, it may be too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krxLLDnFuDtjagN7KrCjuH6QrcW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10651'),
  ('186825444972138770', 'The Dead Room', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jason Stutter, Grant Atkinson', 'Jason Stutter, Kevin Stevens', 'Jed Brophy, Jeffrey Thomas, Laura Petersen, Carrie McLaughlin, Elliott Conlon, Justin B. Carter, Acushla-Tara Kupe, Cohen Holloway', 'R', 'When a terrified family flees a desolate southern New Zealand farmhouse, two cynical scientists and a young psychic are sent to investigate their claims of a haunting. There they encounter a powerful spirit that will protect the house''s secrets at all costs.', 'When a terrified family flees a desolate southern New Zealand farmhouse, two cynical scientists and a young psychic are sent to investigate their claims of a haunting. There they encounter a powerful spirit that will protect the house''s secrets at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptGTI1LbvvVKJToYxtzZpFfVyDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354924'),
  ('1086486320352004159', 'The Dead Season', 1968, 'War, Thriller', 'Savva Kulish, Aleksandr Chechulin, Galina Gavrilova', 'Aleksandr Shlepyanov, Vladimir Vaynshtok', 'Donatas Banionis, Rolan Bykov, Bruno Frejndlikh, Gennadiy Yukhtin, Jüri Järvet, Sergei Kurilov, Ants Eskola, Einari Koppel', null, 'Soviet spy Ladeynikov learns that in one of the pharmaceutical centers in a small resort town works a former German war criminal, Dr. Hass, who is finishing the creation of a deadly chemical gas RH development that he began during World War II, experimenting on POWs. Since Ladeynikov doesn''t know Dr. Hass''s appearance, Soviet intelligence recruits an actor, Ivan Savushkin, who, during the war, escaped from a prison camp where Hass was testing his gas. Together, they must identify and stop him before he finishes and unleashes his weapon of mass destruction.', 'Soviet spy Ladeynikov learns that in one of the pharmaceutical centers in a small resort town works a former German war criminal, Dr. Hass, who is finishing the creation of a deadly chemical gas RH development that he began during World War II, experimenting on POWs. Since Ladeynikov doesn''t know Dr. Hass''s appearance, Soviet intelligence recruits an actor, Ivan Savushkin, who, during the war, escaped from a prison camp where Hass was testing his gas. Together, they must identify and stop him before he finishes and unleashes his weapon of mass destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iGacTklLjLyXVv4nSNKOZKlFh7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134733'),
  ('871890505889670149', 'The Dead Talk Back', 1957, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Merle S. Gould', 'Merle S. Gould', 'Aldo Farnese, Scott Douglas, Laura Brock, Earl Sands, Myron Natwick, Kyle Stanton, Sammy Ray, Curtis Roberts', null, 'A psychic researcher attempts to solve a murder by using a radio that enables him to speak with the dead.', 'A psychic researcher attempts to solve a murder by using a radio that enables him to speak with the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ku4BfYVCfZtwY8DpMyU3a5Mf3Ci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92809'),
  ('574640062008720172', 'The Dead Zone', 1983, 'Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Cronenberg, Mark Irwin, Otta Hanus', 'Jeffrey Boam', 'Christopher Walken, Brooke Adams, Tom Skerritt, Herbert Lom, Anthony Zerbe, Colleen Dewhurst, Martin Sheen, Nicholas Campbell', 'R', 'Johnny Smith is a schoolteacher with his whole life ahead of him but, after leaving his fiancee''s home one night, is involved in a car crash which leaves him in a coma for 5 years. When he wakes, he discovers he has an ability to see into the past, present and future life of anyone with whom he comes into physical contact.', 'Johnny Smith is a schoolteacher with his whole life ahead of him but, after leaving his fiancee''s home one night, is involved in a car crash which leaves him in a coma for 5 years. When he wakes, he discovers he has an ability to see into the past, present and future life of anyone with whom he comes into physical contact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yTVaeS8eIkOpbwIycVFm7EQrgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11336'),
  ('800616804340999060', 'The Deadly Affair', 1967, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Sidney Lumet, Freddie Young, Ted Sturgis', 'Paul Dehn', 'James Mason, Simone Signoret, Maximilian Schell, Harriet Andersson, Harry Andrews, Kenneth Haigh, Roy Kinnear, Max Adrian', 'NR', 'Charles Dobbs is a British secret agent investigating the apparent suicide of Foreign Office official Samuel Fennan. Dobbs suspects that Fennan''s wife, Elsa, a survivor of a Nazi Germany extermination camp, might have some clues, but other officials want Dobbs to drop the case. So Dobbs hires a retiring inspector, Mendel, to quietly make inquiries. Dobbs isn''t at all sure as there are a number of anomalies that simply can''t be explained away. Dobbs is also having trouble at home with his errant wife, whom he very much loves, having frequent affairs. He''s also pleased to see an old friend, Dieter Frey, who he recruited after the war. With the assistance of a colleague and a retired policeman, Dobbs tries to piece together just who is the spy and who in fact assassinated Fennan.', 'Charles Dobbs is a British secret agent investigating the apparent suicide of Foreign Office official Samuel Fennan. Dobbs suspects that Fennan''s wife, Elsa, a survivor of a Nazi Germany extermination camp, might have some clues, but other officials want Dobbs to drop the case. So Dobbs hires a retiring inspector, Mendel, to quietly make inquiries. Dobbs isn''t at all sure as there are a number of anomalies that simply can''t be explained away. Dobbs is also having trouble at home with his errant wife, whom he very much loves, having frequent affairs. He''s also pleased to see an old friend, Dieter Frey, who he recruited after the war. With the assistance of a colleague and a retired policeman, Dobbs tries to piece together just who is the spy and who in fact assassinated Fennan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Av6mrgiizvdSC1Tl9cEvazjS9S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14755'),
  ('497645262686930230', 'The Deadly Bees', 1966, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Freddie Francis, John Wilcox, Anthony Waye', 'Robert Bloch, Anthony Marriott', 'Suzanna Leigh, Frank Finlay, Guy Doleman, Catherine Finn, John Harvey, Michael Ripper, Anthony Bailey, Tim Barrett', null, 'Pop singer Vicki Robbins collapses from exhaustion while shooting ta music video; her physician prescribes a respite on Seagull Island with beekeeper Ralph Hargrove. Initially finding the Hargroves'' bitter marital strife oddly relaxing, the arrival of specially-bred attack bees pushes Vicki to her survival instinct.', 'Pop singer Vicki Robbins collapses from exhaustion while shooting ta music video; her physician prescribes a respite on Seagull Island with beekeeper Ralph Hargrove. Initially finding the Hargroves'' bitter marital strife oddly relaxing, the arrival of specially-bred attack bees pushes Vicki to her survival instinct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePWorn3mWFdZNSlQbjBbymrAzFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47003'),
  ('627761811426577813', 'The Deadly Breaking Sword', 1979, 'Action, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Sun Chung', 'Ni Kuang', 'Ti Lung, Alexander Fu Sheng, Shih Szu, Ku Feng, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Lily Li, Shum Lo, Chan Shen', null, 'Leaving behind an inch of sword in the spent corpses of his opponents, Tuan Changqing is known as the Deadly Breaking Sword. After barely surviving a duel, one of his foes is treated by the diabolical Dr. Kuo, who uses his powers of mind control to transform the man into a somnambulistic killer. After Tuan Changqing teams up with Rabelaisian gambler Xiao Dao, the story proceeds as a comical kung fu buddy flick.', 'Leaving behind an inch of sword in the spent corpses of his opponents, Tuan Changqing is known as the Deadly Breaking Sword. After barely surviving a duel, one of his foes is treated by the diabolical Dr. Kuo, who uses his powers of mind control to transform the man into a somnambulistic killer. After Tuan Changqing teams up with Rabelaisian gambler Xiao Dao, the story proceeds as a comical kung fu buddy flick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBwNSSakV97sjm6ejy7XYRK4Xyy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61040'),
  ('352122907794959003', 'The Deadly Companions', 1961, 'Western', 'Sam Peckinpah, Lee Lukather, William H. Clothier', 'Albert Sidney Fleischman', 'Maureen O''Hara, Brian Keith, Steve Cochran, Chill Wills, Strother Martin, Will Wright, James O''Hara, Peter O''Crotty', 'NR', 'Ex-army officer accidentally kills a woman''s son, tries to make up for it by escorting the funeral procession through dangerous Indian territory.', 'Ex-army officer accidentally kills a woman''s son, tries to make up for it by escorting the funeral procession through dangerous Indian territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKViOlqMMdL7H51UgLuNyIMCtKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18449'),
  ('254351620030445698', 'The Deadly Duo', 1971, 'Action', 'Chang Cheh, Wang Yunhua, Godfrey Ho', 'Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Ku Feng, Wong Chung, Chan Sing, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Bruce Tong Yim-Chaan, Wang Kuang-Yu', null, 'The plot involves patriots during the Sung Dynasty and their attempts to rescue a kidnapped prince from Ching troops who have invaded the north of China. The patriots are led by Ti Lung who recruits a mysterious but seemingly superhuman fighter played by David Chiang to find a way to cross a perilous bridge to enter an impregnable fortress to locate and rescue the imprisoned prince.', 'The plot involves patriots during the Sung Dynasty and their attempts to rescue a kidnapped prince from Ching troops who have invaded the north of China. The patriots are led by Ti Lung who recruits a mysterious but seemingly superhuman fighter played by David Chiang to find a way to cross a perilous bridge to enter an impregnable fortress to locate and rescue the imprisoned prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUHLbk9cjLCZEvLTbzJ1IMLHLFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187897'),
  ('667739804451988029', 'The Deadly Intruder', 1985, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John McCauley, Tom Jewett', 'Tony Crupi', 'Stuart Whitman, Danny Bonaduce, Molly Cheek, Daniel Greene, Chris Holder, Tommy Ramone, David Schroeder, Santos Morales', null, 'A serial killer escapes from a mental hospital and hides out in a small town. A local cop must catch him before he starts on another killing spree.', 'A serial killer escapes from a mental hospital and hides out in a small town. A local cop must catch him before he starts on another killing spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvlExeRRcd47RYj1CuocnaVbYlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85003'),
  ('781909203126096738', 'The Deadly Little Mermaid', 2026, 'Horror', 'Cameron Uzoka, Daniel Sawyer, Nikhil Ranade', 'C.M. Wright', 'Elliott Eason, Sophia Carroll, Eleanor Mackenzie, Anastasia Nikolaeva, Maddy Baskerville, Sasha Van Reenen, Cameron Uzoka, Christian Ndonda', null, 'Some secrets are better left at the bottom of the ocean. Once she''s in your house, there is no escape. When a struggling artist pulls a beautiful, unconscious woman from the freezing coastal waters, he thinks he’s performed a miracle. But as she recovers within the walls of his secluded home, a series of unsettling events leads him to a terrifying realization: her presence is no coincidence. She is inextricably linked to the same watery grave that claimed his family years ago.', 'Some secrets are better left at the bottom of the ocean. Once she''s in your house, there is no escape. When a struggling artist pulls a beautiful, unconscious woman from the freezing coastal waters, he thinks he’s performed a miracle. But as she recovers within the walls of his secluded home, a series of unsettling events leads him to a terrifying realization: her presence is no coincidence. She is inextricably linked to the same watery grave that claimed his family years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uye25uG7k8r3NNPLyPiKOiRnFRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1572073'),
  ('887714597892426980', 'The Deadly Mantis', 1957, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Nathan Juran, Ellis W. Carter, William Holland', 'Martin Berkeley', 'Craig Stevens, William Hopper, Alix Talton, Donald Randolph, Florenz Ames, Paul Smith, Paul Campbell, Pat Conway', null, 'A giant prehistoric praying mantis, recently freed from the Arctic ice, voraciously preys on American military at the DEW Line and works its way south.', 'A giant prehistoric praying mantis, recently freed from the Arctic ice, voraciously preys on American military at the DEW Line and works its way south.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uMoRTAfHbPVaYl59xKbInSVD3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43715'),
  ('477478515372122046', 'The Deadly Organ', 1967, 'Horror', 'Emilio Vieyra, Aníbal González Paz', 'Antonio Rosso, Emilio Vieyra', 'Alberto Candeau, Eduardo Muñoz, Ricardo Bauleo, Mauricio De Ferraris, Susana Beltrán, Gloria Prat, Emilio Vieyra, Mary Albano', null, 'A masked killer prowls the beaches of Argentina, injecting beautiful girls with heroin, and then using weird organ music to make them his zombie slaves.', 'A masked killer prowls the beaches of Argentina, injecting beautiful girls with heroin, and then using weird organ music to make them his zombie slaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWWdOc8XrYhmdEJRgPXKSmWadL4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95113'),
  ('626069530680300736', 'The Deadly Spawn', 1983, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Douglas McKeown, Frank Balsamo, Harvey Birnbaum', 'Ted A. Bohus', 'Charles George Hildebrandt, Tom DeFranco, Richard Lee Porter, Jean Tafler, Karen Tighe, James Brewster, Elissa Neil, Ethel Michelson', 'R', 'When a meteorite touches down in the New Jersey woods carrying a monstrous alien slug, it’s up to four teens to stop it before it’s terrifying brood consumes all life on Earth!', 'When a meteorite touches down in the New Jersey woods carrying a monstrous alien slug, it’s up to four teens to stop it before it’s terrifying brood consumes all life on Earth!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hIBopqlH39aEvoIwyqCfHEzkl0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40059'),
  ('945126600287239675', 'The Deadly Tower', 1975, 'Drama, Thriller, Action, TV Movie', 'Jerry Jameson, John M. Poer, Robin S. Clark', null, 'Kurt Russell, Richard Yniguez, Ned Beatty, Pernell Roberts, Clifton James, John Forsythe, Gilbert Roland, Paul Carr', 'PG', 'The real-life story of Charles Whitman''s deadly shooting spree at the University of Texas is retold. In August 1966, after killing his wife and mother, Whitman climbed to the top of the school''s tower and opened fire on passers-by, killing 13 and wounding many others.', 'The real-life story of Charles Whitman''s deadly shooting spree at the University of Texas is retold. In August 1966, after killing his wife and mother, Whitman climbed to the top of the school''s tower and opened fire on passers-by, killing 13 and wounding many others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXdSO0BGue6c1iRWQ7XhiKDFWdj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83723'),
  ('1082720973887433815', 'The Deadly Trackers', 1973, 'Western', 'Barry Shear, Gabriel Torres', 'Lukas Heller', 'Richard Harris, Rod Taylor, Al Lettieri, Neville Brand, William Smith, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Paul Benjamin, Isela Vega', 'PG', 'Sheriff Sean Kilpatrick is a pacifist. Frank Brand is the leader of a band of killers. When their paths cross Kilpatrick is compelled to go against everything he has stood for to bring death to Brand and his gang. Through his hunt into Mexico he is challenged by a noble Mexican Sheriff interested only in carrying out the law - not vengeance.', 'Sheriff Sean Kilpatrick is a pacifist. Frank Brand is the leader of a band of killers. When their paths cross Kilpatrick is compelled to go against everything he has stood for to bring death to Brand and his gang. Through his hunt into Mexico he is challenged by a noble Mexican Sheriff interested only in carrying out the law - not vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spE5fZl9pMz0Ou9X0E3jjdbd49Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133328'),
  ('1074566794263018496', 'The Deadly Trap', 1971, 'Mystery, Drama', 'René Clément, Andréas Winding, Denis Amar', 'Eleanor Perry, Sidney Buchman', 'Faye Dunaway, Frank Langella, Barbara Parkins, Karen Blanguernon, Raymond Gérôme, Maurice Ronet, Michele Lourie, Patrick Vincent', 'PG', 'An industrial espionage group calls on a retired spy living with his wife and children in Paris.', 'An industrial espionage group calls on a retired spy living with his wife and children in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6pdwbQvAlJkDYCtHQEd7f6QvFx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140825'),
  ('89336241405295243', 'The Deadman', 1989, 'Drama', 'Keith Sanborn, Peggy Ahwesh', 'Georges Bataille', 'Jennifer Montgomery, Scott Shat, Leslie Singer, Kevin Barrett, Ben Polsky, Ramon Quanta la Gusta, Diane Torr, Beth Friedman', null, 'Made in collaboration with Keith Sanborn, The Deadman is based on a story by Bataille, charting "the adventures of a near-naked heroine who sets in motion a scabrous free-form orgy before returning to the house to die — a combination of elegance, raunchy defilement and barbaric splendor." — Jonathan Rosenbaum, Chicago Reader.', 'Made in collaboration with Keith Sanborn, The Deadman is based on a story by Bataille, charting "the adventures of a near-naked heroine who sets in motion a scabrous free-form orgy before returning to the house to die — a combination of elegance, raunchy defilement and barbaric splendor." — Jonathan Rosenbaum, Chicago Reader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iW6kXtmNZlxoRLXH1hHZKXUbIP0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151611'),
  ('587593125297286582', 'The Deal', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Stephen Frears, Alwin H. Küchler', 'Peter Morgan', 'David Morrissey, Matt Blair, Michael Sheen, Dexter Fletcher, Frank Kelly, Stuart McQuarrie, Ian Hanmore, Paul Rhys', null, 'It is approaching an election in the UK when the leader of the Labour party, John Smith, suffers another in a line of heart attacks and dies. With the leadership campaign about to start the clear choice appears to be Gordon Brown, a stanch Scotsman. However Tony Blair is also beginning to appear more likely as he will appeal to Southern voters who would be turned off by Brown. Blair rings Brown to arrange a meeting to discuss which will go for the job. The film flashbacks to the start of their relationship, sharing an office in Westminster on their first seats.', 'It is approaching an election in the UK when the leader of the Labour party, John Smith, suffers another in a line of heart attacks and dies. With the leadership campaign about to start the clear choice appears to be Gordon Brown, a stanch Scotsman. However Tony Blair is also beginning to appear more likely as he will appeal to Southern voters who would be turned off by Brown. Blair rings Brown to arrange a meeting to discuss which will go for the job. The film flashbacks to the start of their relationship, sharing an office in Westminster on their first seats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuV6TLg5xALrUeRLtKJwk5u8NVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43699'),
  ('942655512103309953', 'The Deal', 2005, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Adam Sliwinski, Harvey Kahn', 'Ruth Epstein', 'Christian Slater, Selma Blair, Robert Loggia, Colm Feore, Angie Harmon, John Heard, Kevin Tighe, Philip Granger', 'R', 'A political thriller steeped in illegal oil trading, the Russian Mafia, and governmental cover-ups.', 'A political thriller steeped in illegal oil trading, the Russian Mafia, and governmental cover-ups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WHzLfb9uGo9PgNu8IIiTSz1c6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10274'),
  ('839350765648501334', 'The Deal', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Steven Schachter, Eric Anderson, Paul Sarossy', 'William H. Macy, Steven Schachter', 'William H. Macy, Meg Ryan, Jason Ritter, Elliott Gould, LL Cool J, Kate Blumberg, David Hunt, Jeremy Crutchley', 'R', 'Charlie Berns is a veteran Hollywood movie producer who has given up on his career and life. That is until his idealistic screenwriter nephew comes bearing the script of a lifetime and Charlie decides to give his career one final shot. The only thing standing in his way is Diedre Hearn, a sharp-witted studio executive brought in to keep Charlie in line.', 'Charlie Berns is a veteran Hollywood movie producer who has given up on his career and life. That is until his idealistic screenwriter nephew comes bearing the script of a lifetime and Charlie decides to give his career one final shot. The only thing standing in his way is Diedre Hearn, a sharp-witted studio executive brought in to keep Charlie in line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFv4W2S7t3bygIYOweDd14FSRph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16511'),
  ('628653236558140040', 'The Deal', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Son Yong-ho, Jang Tae-hyeon', 'Son Yong-ho, An Young-jin', 'Kim Sang-kyung, Kim Sung-kyun, Park Sung-woong, Yoon Seung-ah, Kim Eui-sung, Jo Jae-yun, Ki Joo-bong, Hyun Sung', null, 'A cop catches a serial killer who murdered his sister but never finds her body. The lack of closure torments him and drives his brother-in-law insane, who makes a deal with the mafia for revenge.', 'A cop catches a serial killer who murdered his sister but never finds her body. The lack of closure torments him and drives his brother-in-law insane, who makes a deal with the mafia for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8JExMArmqnFNyv2NGxcg4zGHaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335640'),
  ('1027932822397588847', 'The Deal', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Orsi Nagypál', 'Sumalee Montano, Sean Presant', 'Sumalee Montano, Emma Fischer, Alastair Mackenzie, Pearl Mackie, Taz Skylar, Lisa Brenner', null, 'A mother fights to save her ailing daughter after a global pandemic worse than any seen before ravaged the planet, leaving resources so scarce you must pay for them with your life.', 'A mother fights to save her ailing daughter after a global pandemic worse than any seen before ravaged the planet, leaving resources so scarce you must pay for them with your life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeqn2t4aadIvd4sgb73IOqqkLIL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718919'),
  ('68881404847555397', 'The Death & Life of John F. Donovan', 2019, 'Drama', 'Xavier Dolan, André Turpin, Carmen Cuba', 'Xavier Dolan, Jacob Tierney', 'Kit Harington, Natalie Portman, Jacob Tremblay, Susan Sarandon, Kathy Bates, Ben Schnetzer, Thandiwe Newton, Jared Keeso', 'R', 'A decade after the death of an American TV star, a young actor reminisces about the written correspondence he once shared with the former, as well as the impact those letters had on both their lives.', 'A decade after the death of an American TV star, a young actor reminisces about the written correspondence he once shared with the former, as well as the impact those letters had on both their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bhI7Ivk7VmvUaJaDTxJUgOXp1E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291984'),
  ('23073484642905948', 'The Death and Life of Bobby Z', 2007, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'John Herzfeld, John Bailey', 'Bob Krakower, Allen Lawrence, Don Winslow', 'Paul Walker, Laurence Fishburne, Olivia Wilde, Jason Lewis, Michael Bowen, Richard Bairos, Jarrod Bunch, Shirly Brener', 'R', 'A DEA agent provides former Marine Tim Kearney with a way out of his prison sentence: impersonate Bobby Z, a recently deceased drug dealer, in a hostage switch with a crime lord. When the negotiations go awry, Kearney flees, with Z''s son in tow.', 'A DEA agent provides former Marine Tim Kearney with a way out of his prison sentence: impersonate Bobby Z, a recently deceased drug dealer, in a hostage switch with a crime lord. When the negotiations go awry, Kearney flees, with Z''s son in tow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgIthxRLUBTbaetVXvXwQEmbfn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10425'),
  ('216258899051680474', 'The Death and Life of Marsha P. Johnson', 2017, 'Documentary', 'David France, Tom Bergmann, Adam Uhl', 'David France, Mark Blane', 'Marsha P. Johnson, Victoria Cruz, Sylvia Rivera, Taylor Mead, Pat Bumgardner, Vito Russo', null, 'Describing herself as a ''street queen,'' Johnson was a legendary fixture in New York City’s gay ghetto and a tireless voice for LGBT pride since the days of Stonewall, who along with fellow trans icon Sylvia Rivera, founded Street Transvestites Action Revolutionaries (S.T.A.R.), a trans activist group based in the heart of NYC’s Greenwich Village. Her death in 1992 was declared a suicide by the NYPD, but friends never accepted that version of events. Structured as a whodunit, with activist Victoria Cruz cast as detective and audience surrogate, The Death and Life of Marsha P. Johnson celebrates the lasting political legacy of Johnson, while seeking to finally solve the mystery of her unexplained death.', 'Describing herself as a ''street queen,'' Johnson was a legendary fixture in New York City’s gay ghetto and a tireless voice for LGBT pride since the days of Stonewall, who along with fellow trans icon Sylvia Rivera, founded Street Transvestites Action Revolutionaries (S.T.A.R.), a trans activist group based in the heart of NYC’s Greenwich Village. Her death in 1992 was declared a suicide by the NYPD, but friends never accepted that version of events. Structured as a whodunit, with activist Victoria Cruz cast as detective and audience surrogate, The Death and Life of Marsha P. Johnson celebrates the lasting political legacy of Johnson, while seeking to finally solve the mystery of her unexplained death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omEz3bNE8mHyQGOWQHcmAgLFXZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448444'),
  ('606749535291541656', 'The Death Kiss', 1932, 'Mystery, Comedy, Horror', 'Edwin L. Marin, Val Burton, Norbert Brodine', 'Barry Barringer, Gordon Kahn', 'David Manners, Adrienne Ames, Bela Lugosi, John Wray, Vince Barnett, Alexander Carr, Edward Van Sloan, Harold Minjir', 'NR', 'When a movie actor is shot and killed during production, the true feelings about the actor begin to surface. As the studio heads worry about negative publicity, one of the writers tags along as the killing is investigated and clues begin to surface.', 'When a movie actor is shot and killed during production, the true feelings about the actor begin to surface. As the studio heads worry about negative publicity, one of the writers tags along as the killing is investigated and clues begin to surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jr9NNKQqSDGDR1wiinfrUFhHvpG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59158'),
  ('944176620671981998', 'The Death of "Superman Lives": What Happened?', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Jon Schnepp', 'Jon Schnepp', 'Jon Schnepp, Tim Burton, Kevin Smith, Jon Peters, Lorenzo di Bonaventura, Colleen Atwood, Rick Heinrichs, Steve Johnson', 'R', 'The Death of ''Superman Lives'': What Happened? feature film documents the process of development of the ill fated "Superman Lives" movie, that was to be directed by Tim Burton and star Nicolas Cage as the man of steel himself, Superman. The project went through years of development before the plug was pulled, and this documentary interviews the major filmmakers: Kevin Smith, Tim Burton, Jon Peters, Dan Gilroy, Colleen Atwood, Lorenzo di Bonaventura and many many more.', 'The Death of ''Superman Lives'': What Happened? feature film documents the process of development of the ill fated "Superman Lives" movie, that was to be directed by Tim Burton and star Nicolas Cage as the man of steel himself, Superman. The project went through years of development before the plug was pulled, and this documentary interviews the major filmmakers: Kevin Smith, Tim Burton, Jon Peters, Dan Gilroy, Colleen Atwood, Lorenzo di Bonaventura and many many more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oned45Htl78YYkf1ByyodDmLzZ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279144'),
  ('356955362679267415', 'The Death of David Cronenberg', 2021, 'Horror', 'Caitlin Cronenberg, Caitlin Cronenberg, David Cronenberg', 'David Cronenberg', 'David Cronenberg', null, 'David Cronenberg stands in a softly lit bedroom and looks deeply into the camera before his gaze shifts to a motionless figure in the bed...', 'David Cronenberg stands in a softly lit bedroom and looks deeply into the camera before his gaze shifts to a motionless figure in the bed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUqPIwr11iDdzMl09F9UEKqbfWk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875425'),
  ('950422359969748326', 'The Death of Dick Long', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Daniel Scheinert, Ashley Connor, Morgan Jon Fox', 'Billy Chew', 'Michael Abbott Jr., Virginia Newcomb, Andre Hyland, Sarah Baker, Jess Weixler, Poppy Cunningham, Roy Wood Jr., Sunita Mani', 'R', 'Dick died last night, and Zeke and Earl don’t want anybody finding out how. That’s too bad though, cause news travels fast in small-town Alabama.', 'Dick died last night, and Zeke and Earl don’t want anybody finding out how. That’s too bad though, cause news travels fast in small-town Alabama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vURitOcmtcH8Dr1bWryTvfkeyJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565383'),
  ('190935617795284138', 'The Death of Jaime Roldós', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Lisandra Rivera, Daniel Andrade, Manolo Sarmiento', 'Manolo Sarmiento, Daniel Andrade', 'Manolo Sarmiento, Lisandra Rivera', null, 'A portrait of Jaime Roldos, Ecuador''s first democratically elected president, who died with his family when their plane crashed in the mountains.', 'A portrait of Jaime Roldos, Ecuador''s first democratically elected president, who died with his family when their plane crashed in the mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLkakPvA9WMk8cChOlf78N2PK6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398830'),
  ('883026359764510184', 'The Death of Louis XIV', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Jonathan Ricquebourg, Albert Serra', 'Albert Serra, Thierry Lounas', 'Jean-Pierre Léaud, Patrick d''Assumçao, Marc Susini, Bernard Belin, Irène Silvagni, Vicenç Altaió, Jacques Henric, Alain Lajoinie', null, 'August 1715. After going for a walk, Louis XIV feels a pain in his leg. The next days, the king keeps fulfilling his duties and obligations, but his sleep is troubled and he has a serious fever. He barely eats and weakens increasingly. This is the start of the slow agony of the greatest king of France, surrounded by his relatives and doctors.', 'August 1715. After going for a walk, Louis XIV feels a pain in his leg. The next days, the king keeps fulfilling his duties and obligations, but his sleep is troubled and he has a serious fever. He barely eats and weakens increasingly. This is the start of the slow agony of the greatest king of France, surrounded by his relatives and doctors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEgmmAnz5qlW43XFeGbcjI1wrAz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371859'),
  ('861515744054014', 'The Death of Maria Malibran', 1972, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Werner Schroeter, Werner Schroeter', 'Werner Schroeter', 'Magdalena Montezuma, Christine Kaufmann, Candy Darling, Manuela Riva, Ingrid Caven, Anette Tirier, Einar Hanfstaengl, Gabor von Lessner', null, 'A series of tableaux illustrating the life and death of a celebrated 19th century German opera singer.', 'A series of tableaux illustrating the life and death of a celebrated 19th century German opera singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGusP8bIhDPSnAYFBCwREK4aFb1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137037'),
  ('239002626504590462', 'The Death of Mario Ricci', 1983, 'Drama', 'Claude Goretta', 'Claude Goretta, Georges Haldas', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Jean-Michel Dupuis, Heinz Bennent, Mimsy Farmer, Lucas Belvaux, Magali Noël, Michel Robin, Michael Hinz', null, 'A TV reporter and his assisstant go to a small Swiss village to do a programme with a reclusive scientist, an expert on world food shortages. During this time, an Italian immigrant worker is killed in a road crash and the reporter becomes involved in uncovering the truth about his death.', 'A TV reporter and his assisstant go to a small Swiss village to do a programme with a reclusive scientist, an expert on world food shortages. During this time, an Italian immigrant worker is killed in a road crash and the reporter becomes involved in uncovering the truth about his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikL16doDqaohLS0lWl3rnpAd2xO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133752'),
  ('965311628438177230', 'The Death of Mr. Lazarescu', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cristi Puiu, Andreea Păduraru, Oleg Mutu', 'Răzvan Rădulescu, Cristi Puiu', 'Ion Fiscuteanu, Luminița Gheorghiu, Doru Ana, Monica Bîrlădeanu, Alina Berzunțeanu, Alexandru Potocean, Dana Dogaru, Florin Zamfirescu', null, 'After suffering terrible headaches and stomach cramps, Mr. Lăzărescu, a lonely 63 year-old man, calls for an ambulance, beginning one man’s hellish journey through Bucharest hospitals in search of proper medical care. As the night unfolds, his health starts to deteriorate fast.', 'After suffering terrible headaches and stomach cramps, Mr. Lăzărescu, a lonely 63 year-old man, calls for an ambulance, beginning one man’s hellish journey through Bucharest hospitals in search of proper medical care. As the night unfolds, his health starts to deteriorate fast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3B7GwMYgNi15VMdcKZawgt6mf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31032'),
  ('228409396493835514', 'The Death of Pinochet', 2011, 'Documentary, History', 'Pablo Valdés, Bettina Perut, Iván Osnovikoff', null, null, null, 'On December 10th, 2006, General Pinochet dies unexpectedly at Santiago''s Military Hospital. His decease triggers a 24 hours revival of political divisions that marked with violence and death Chilean recent history. With high quality original footage and testimonies of four characters that deeply experienced a journey of strong contrasts and surrealistic nuances, the film narrates in an innovative, exciting way the ending of a key chapter in Chilean history.', 'On December 10th, 2006, General Pinochet dies unexpectedly at Santiago''s Military Hospital. His decease triggers a 24 hours revival of political divisions that marked with violence and death Chilean recent history. With high quality original footage and testimonies of four characters that deeply experienced a journey of strong contrasts and surrealistic nuances, the film narrates in an innovative, exciting way the ending of a key chapter in Chilean history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZQTNM0nkXoTMgscIXvUNStK0gJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117127'),
  ('83469831461569141', 'The Death of Richie', 1977, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Paul Wendkos, Robert B. Hauser, Foster H. Phinney', 'John McGreevey', 'Ben Gazzara, Eileen Brennan, Robby Benson, Lance Kerwin, Shirley O''Hara, Jennifer Rhodes, John Zaremba, Jesse Emmett', null, 'A sensitive but confused teenager feels pressure from all directions and turns to drugs, which causes problems for him in school and at home.', 'A sensitive but confused teenager feels pressure from all directions and turns to drugs, which causes problems for him in school and at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u69vS6OeJauY8W7XkS9rn1Iiqx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138551'),
  ('707235925515787504', 'The Death of Robin Hood', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Sarnoski, Pat Scola, Hauke Richter', 'Michael Sarnoski', 'Hugh Jackman, Jodie Comer, Bill Skarsgård, Murray Bartlett, Noah Jupe, Faith Delaney, Tabitha Smyth, Beau Thompson', 'R', 'Grappling with his past after a life of crime and murder, Robin Hood finds himself gravely injured after a battle he thought would be his last. In the hands of a mysterious woman, he is offered a chance at salvation.', 'Grappling with his past after a life of crime and murder, Robin Hood finds himself gravely injured after a battle he thought would be his last. In the hands of a mysterious woman, he is offered a chance at salvation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cD7KeABHyzeJmzdA6QKe36fp2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1284465'),
  ('269467496826566728', 'The Death of Stalin', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Armando Iannucci, Zac Nicholson, Martin Curry', 'Fabien Nury, David Schneider, Ian Martin', 'Steve Buscemi, Simon Russell Beale, Jeffrey Tambor, Jason Isaacs, Michael Palin, Rupert Friend, Andrea Riseborough, Dermot Crowley', 'R', 'When dictator Joseph Stalin dies, his parasitic cronies square off in a frantic power struggle to become the next Soviet leader. As they bumble, brawl and back-stab their way to the top, the question remains — just who is running the government?', 'When dictator Joseph Stalin dies, his parasitic cronies square off in a frantic power struggle to become the next Soviet leader. As they bumble, brawl and back-stab their way to the top, the question remains — just who is running the government?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqH7q89NxGRDAyRWKqsL3OBtYfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402897'),
  ('1072791074249587168', 'The Death of Stalinism in Bohemia', 1991, 'Animation', 'Jan Švankmajer, Svatopluk Malý', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'A bust of Stalin is cut open on an operating table, leading to an elaborate animated depiction of Czech history from 1948 (the Communist takeover) to 1989 (the Velvet Revolution).', 'A bust of Stalin is cut open on an operating table, leading to an elaborate animated depiction of Czech history from 1948 (the Communist takeover) to 1989 (the Velvet Revolution).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfsOPn3r4CTX503pgrnqFaoGRLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126282'),
  ('1111154045803318510', 'The Death of Superman', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action, Drama, Fantasy', 'Jake Castorena, Sam Liu', 'Peter Tomasi', 'Jerry O''Connell, Rebecca Romijn, Rainn Wilson, Rosario Dawson, Nathan Fillion, Christopher Gorham, Matt Lanter, Shemar Moore', 'PG-13', 'When a hulking monster arrives on Earth and begins a mindless rampage, the Justice League is quickly called in to stop it. But it soon becomes apparent that only Superman can stand against the monstrosity.', 'When a hulking monster arrives on Earth and begins a mindless rampage, the Justice League is quickly called in to stop it. But it soon becomes apparent that only Superman can stand against the monstrosity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0uxSHaSFmt6XaBJgjkeLqe7aM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487670'),
  ('546966020677942649', 'The Death of the Incredible Hulk', 1990, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Bill Bixby, Lee Knippelberg, Chuck Colwell', 'Gerald Di Pego', 'Bill Bixby, Lou Ferrigno, Elizabeth Gracen, Philip Sterling, Barbara Tarbuck, Anna Katarina, John Novak, Andreas Katsulas', 'NR', 'In his final attempt to free himself from the curse of the Hulk, Dr. David Banner becomes involved in a dangerous international espionage mission that may finally lead to a cure. As forces close in and the stakes rise, Banner faces an ultimate sacrifice, bringing his tragic journey to a definitive and emotional conclusion.', 'In his final attempt to free himself from the curse of the Hulk, Dr. David Banner becomes involved in a dangerous international espionage mission that may finally lead to a cure. As forces close in and the stakes rise, Banner faces an ultimate sacrifice, bringing his tragic journey to a definitive and emotional conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6q6CviMLR97ssODmKhxgyxQuoYp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19593'),
  ('330467527349291709', 'The Death Ray', 1925, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Lev Kuleshov, Vsevolod Pudovkin, Leonid Obolensky', 'Vsevolod Pudovkin', 'Porfiri Podobed, Vsevolod Pudovkin, Sergei Komarov, Vladimir Fogel, Alexandra Khokhlova, Sergey Khokhlov, Inna Stravinskaya, A. Strabinskaya', null, 'In a capitalist country, workers are heavily repressed but manage to get a "death ray" to fight back. (A part of the movie is lost.)', 'In a capitalist country, workers are heavily repressed but manage to get a "death ray" to fight back. (A part of the movie is lost.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jB97qClwdNDWFxKp0Ryi8KP6xgd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184465'),
