  ('1043659872956192039', 'The Death That Awaits', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Richard J. Lee', 'Rachel Kiley', 'Katya Martín, Megan Lawless, Allison Paige, Tim Gabriel, Sharon Gardner, Cooper Devaney, Ron Yuan, Paul Johansson', 'NR', 'A drifter searching for answers to a mystery from her past takes on a job looking after a sick teen who is undergoing a mysterious transformation her family will do anything to stop.', 'A drifter searching for answers to a mystery from her past takes on a job looking after a sick teen who is undergoing a mysterious transformation her family will do anything to stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hloUkIXB1Jc0xjSFlO4dcVfzdt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1297454'),
  ('653486400174924886', 'The Deathmaker', 1995, 'Drama', 'Fred Schuler, Romuald Karmakar', 'Michael Farin, Romuald Karmakar', 'Götz George, Jürgen Hentsch, Hans-Michael Rehberg, Pierre Franckh, Matthias Fuchs, Marek Harloff, Christian Honhold', null, 'Fritz Haarmann, who has killed at least 27 boys, is questioned by a psychology professor in order to find out whether he is sane and can be held responsible for his crimes. During this interrogation Haarmann reveals his motives and his killing methods.', 'Fritz Haarmann, who has killed at least 27 boys, is questioned by a psychology professor in order to find out whether he is sane and can be held responsible for his crimes. During this interrogation Haarmann reveals his motives and his killing methods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BaHXGZB7UTNWylELBz0DkjIs31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1484'),
  ('584256552382789036', 'The Deaths of Ian Stone', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dario Piana, Stefano Morcaldo, Martin Krauka', 'Brendan Hood', 'Mike Vogel, Michael Dixon, Christina Cole, Michael Feast, Jaime Murray, Charlie Anson, George Dillon, Andrew Buchan', 'R', 'Deaths tells the story of an all-American guy who is murdered each day by horrifying pursuers, only to wake up in slightly different lives to experience the terror of being murdered again.', 'Deaths tells the story of an all-American guy who is murdered each day by horrifying pursuers, only to wake up in slightly different lives to experience the terror of being murdered again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guhprfoix4DCKnbPeVQXuF08rHt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12171'),
  ('339935030070796043', 'The Debauched Life of Gerard Floque', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Georges Lautner', 'Christian Watton, Jean-Jacques Tarbès, Georges Lautner', 'Roland Giraud, Marie-Anne Chazel, Clémentine Célarié, Jacqueline Maillan, Gérard Rinaldi, Mathilda May, Christian Clavier, Michel Galabru', null, 'On the day he loses his job in advertising agency, Gérard Floque returns home to find that his infant daughter has been arrested for drugs trafficking and his wife is having an affair with a TV presenter. Gérard''s only comfort in this time of mid-life crisis is his colleague, a young punk girl named Martine.', 'On the day he loses his job in advertising agency, Gérard Floque returns home to find that his infant daughter has been arrested for drugs trafficking and his wife is having an affair with a TV presenter. Gérard''s only comfort in this time of mid-life crisis is his colleague, a young punk girl named Martine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LuCEAFY6FGHUhz1KNFnMQa9g8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76128'),
  ('653832481332012534', 'The Debt', 1999, 'Drama, Crime', 'Krzysztof Krauze, Bartosz Prokopowicz', 'Krzysztof Krauze', 'Robert Gonera, Jacek Borcuch, Andrzej Chyra, Cezary Kosiński, Joanna Szurmiej-Rzączyńska, Agnieszka Warchulska, Joanna Kurowska, Sławomira Łozińska', null, 'Based on true events, the movie tells the story of two men who want to start a scooter business but don''t have the required collateral for a bank loan. Then one of them runs into a former flat neighbour who offers to lend them the money. The guy turns out to be a thug and starts to extort them. Their life goes downhill from there.', 'Based on true events, the movie tells the story of two men who want to start a scooter business but don''t have the required collateral for a bank loan. Then one of them runs into a former flat neighbour who offers to lend them the money. The guy turns out to be a thug and starts to extort them. Their life goes downhill from there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57VzJyaO1HQxKaSAnBhfOaeqzl2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52666'),
  ('666356495897525990', 'The Debt', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'John Madden, Deborah Saban, Zsuzsa Gurban', 'Assaf Bernstein, Ido Rosenblum', 'Helen Mirren, Tom Wilkinson, Sam Worthington, Ciarán Hinds, Jessica Chastain, Marton Csokas, Jesper Christensen, Romi Aboulafia', 'R', 'Rachel Singer is a former Mossad agent who tried to capture a notorious Nazi war criminal – the Surgeon of Birkenau – in a secret Israeli mission that ended with his death on the streets of East Berlin. Now, 30 years later, a man claiming to be the doctor has surfaced, and Rachel must return to Eastern Europe to uncover the truth. Overwhelmed by haunting memories of her younger self and her two fellow agents, the still-celebrated heroine must relive the trauma of those events and confront the debt she has incurred.', 'Rachel Singer is a former Mossad agent who tried to capture a notorious Nazi war criminal – the Surgeon of Birkenau – in a secret Israeli mission that ended with his death on the streets of East Berlin. Now, 30 years later, a man claiming to be the doctor has surfaced, and Rachel must return to Eastern Europe to uncover the truth. Overwhelmed by haunting memories of her younger self and her two fellow agents, the still-celebrated heroine must relive the trauma of those events and confront the debt she has incurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlavkPAIzIIQppcU9vcQrKZjfmb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48289'),
  ('556618724166431230', 'The Debt Collector', 1999, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Anthony Neilson, Dick Pope', 'Anthony Neilson', 'Billy Connolly, Ken Stott, Francesca Annis, Iain Robertson, Annette Crosbie, Alastair Galbraith, Ronni Ancona, Jimmy Logan', null, 'Mean, gritty, dirty and low, and that''s just the policeman Gary Keltie, out for retribution for the horrendous crimes against the helpless people of Edinburgh during the 1970s, by notorious, torturous, and killer, debt collector Nickie Dryden.', 'Mean, gritty, dirty and low, and that''s just the policeman Gary Keltie, out for retribution for the horrendous crimes against the helpless people of Edinburgh during the 1970s, by notorious, torturous, and killer, debt collector Nickie Dryden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcnXFQQCqRTnz5CyRTxbpnRAeJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34713'),
  ('824829553270849687', 'The Debt Collector', 2018, 'Action, Comedy', 'Samantha Machado, Eldar Erlich, Max Schouweiler', 'Jesse V. Johnson, Stu Small', 'Scott Adkins, Louis Mandylor, Michael Paré, Tony Todd, Vladimir Kulich, Robert Rusler, Selina Lo, Nihan Gur', 'R', 'A classically-trained martial artist goes to work as a debt collector for the mob. The job seems easy enough, until one “client” pulls him into a situation deeper than could ever be expected.', 'A classically-trained martial artist goes to work as a debt collector for the mob. The job seems easy enough, until one “client” pulls him into a situation deeper than could ever be expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6psiAxHQ7dojUTzf34CqMYkzNns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513691'),
  ('266214272325760010', 'The Debussy Film', 1965, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Ken Russell, Ken Westbury', 'Ken Russell, Melvyn Bragg', 'Oliver Reed, Vladek Sheybal, Annette Robertson, Izabella Telezynska, Penny Service, Vernon Dobtcheff, Stephanie Randall, Jane Lumb', null, 'An actor is playing Claude Debussy in a film about the composer''s life, and finds himself identifying with his subject very closely.', 'An actor is playing Claude Debussy in a film about the composer''s life, and finds himself identifying with his subject very closely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bon7i5rX3MdFqxAES5jgZfpGVTp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341659'),
  ('497267111853150347', 'The Debut', 1977, 'Drama, Romance', 'Theo van de Sande, Hans Kemna, Nouchka van Brakel', 'Nouchka van Brakel, Carel Donck', 'Marina de Graaf, Gerard Cox, Pleuni Touw, Kitty Courbois, Dolf de Vries, Sandrien van Brakel, Wendy Ferwerda, Hans Kemna', null, 'The delicate story of the impossible love between an older married man and a fourteen-year old schoolgirl.', 'The delicate story of the impossible love between an older married man and a fourteen-year old schoolgirl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63rsVfGIbY9tbSx4Aww0Jjv73ba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96608'),
  ('1135373425212475140', 'The Decameron', 1971, 'History, Drama, Comedy', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Carlo Agate, Umberto Angelucci', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Franco Citti, Ninetto Davoli, Jovan Jovanović, Angela Luce, Vincenzo Amato, Giuseppe Zigaina, Maria Gabriella Maione, Vincenzo Cristo', 'R', 'A young Sicilian is swindled twice, but ends up rich; a man poses as a deaf-mute in a convent of curious nuns; a woman must hide her lover when her husband comes home early; a scoundrel fools a priest on his deathbed; three brothers take revenge on their sister''s lover; a young girl sleeps on the roof to meet her boyfriend at night; a group of painters wait for inspiration; a crafty priest attempts to seduce his friend''s wife; and two friends make a pact to find out what happens after death.', 'A young Sicilian is swindled twice, but ends up rich; a man poses as a deaf-mute in a convent of curious nuns; a woman must hide her lover when her husband comes home early; a scoundrel fools a priest on his deathbed; three brothers take revenge on their sister''s lover; a young girl sleeps on the roof to meet her boyfriend at night; a group of painters wait for inspiration; a crafty priest attempts to seduce his friend''s wife; and two friends make a pact to find out what happens after death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iL5mmuIL6fqFSWJeHE417WWrocz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33583'),
  ('1114788225874453630', 'The Deceased', 1965, 'Drama', 'Leon Hirszman, José Medeiros, Chico de Assis', 'Eduardo Coutinho, Leon Hirszman', 'Fernanda Montenegro, Ivan Cândido, Nelson Xavier, Paulo Gracindo, Dinorah Brillanti, Joel Barcellos, Hugo Carvana, Vanda Lacerda', null, 'After visiting a fortune teller, Zulmira is informed that a blonde woman will threaten her peace. After talking to her husband Toninho, she suspects that her cousin Glorinha may be that blonde.', 'After visiting a fortune teller, Zulmira is informed that a blonde woman will threaten her peace. After talking to her husband Toninho, she suspects that her cousin Glorinha may be that blonde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhNI3ldWsrj4YKTASOTjQoA14o1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258521'),
  ('699886853483661620', 'The Deceivers', 1988, 'Adventure', 'Nicholas Meyer, Walter Lassally', 'Michael Hirst', 'Pierce Brosnan, Shashi Kapoor, Saeed Jaffrey, Helena Michell, Keith Michell, David Robb, Tariq Yunus, Jalal Agha', null, 'India, 1825: the country lives in mortal fear of cult members known as the “Deceivers." They commit robbery and ritualistic murder. Appalled by their activities, an English military man, Captain William Savage, conceives a hazardous plot to stop them. In disguise, he plans to himself become a “Deceiver” and infiltrate their numbers. Ever present in Savage’s adventures is a sense of dread; he is in constant fear of betrayal and vengeance and also undergoes a disturbing psychological transformation as he experiences the cult’s blood lust firsthand.', 'India, 1825: the country lives in mortal fear of cult members known as the “Deceivers." They commit robbery and ritualistic murder. Appalled by their activities, an English military man, Captain William Savage, conceives a hazardous plot to stop them. In disguise, he plans to himself become a “Deceiver” and infiltrate their numbers. Ever present in Savage’s adventures is a sense of dread; he is in constant fear of betrayal and vengeance and also undergoes a disturbing psychological transformation as he experiences the cult’s blood lust firsthand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwno7eKJbzNZ2prc5wI1istvnyj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41968'),
  ('141523887207279813', 'The Decent One', 2014, 'Documentary, War', 'Vanessa Lapa, Jeremy Portnoi', 'Ori Weisbrod, Vanessa Lapa', 'Heinrich Himmler, Tobias Moretti, Sophie Rois, Lotte Ledl, Gudrun Himmler, Antonia Moretti, Florentin Groll, Pauline Knof', null, 'Through previously undiscovered private letters, photos and diaries that were found in the Himmler family house in 1945, the "The Decent One" exposes a unique and at times uncomfortable access to the life and mind of the merciless "Architect of the Final Solution" Heinrich Himmler.', 'Through previously undiscovered private letters, photos and diaries that were found in the Himmler family house in 1945, the "The Decent One" exposes a unique and at times uncomfortable access to the life and mind of the merciless "Architect of the Final Solution" Heinrich Himmler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9VOoligGIxpMa2siDjzVSSEamg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267310'),
  ('1006815015398755852', 'The Decks Ran Red', 1958, 'Thriller, Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Andrew L. Stone, Meredith M. Nicholson', 'Andrew L. Stone', 'James Mason, Dorothy Dandridge, Broderick Crawford, Stuart Whitman, Katharine Bard, Jack Kruschen, Hank Patterson, John Gallaudet', 'NR', 'A band of dishonest seamen plans a murderous mutiny aboard the S.S. Berwind.', 'A band of dishonest seamen plans a murderous mutiny aboard the S.S. Berwind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wv8G3cA8f3BndT8D1vtwzaMW05q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113144'),
  ('642130960100985854', 'The Decline', 1961, 'Drama', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Nikos Dimopoulos', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Zoe Laskari, Nikos Kourkoulos, Mirka Kalatzopoulou, Vagelis Voulgaridis, Nitsa Marouda, Kostas Voutsas, Pantelis Zervos, Eleni Zafeiriou', null, 'A weak before her lady-killer lover, a blond diva breaks up with the arrogant libertine to be with a kind friend. His ego demands appeasement, but the lethal revolver in her hand thirsts for retribution. Who is to blame for her downfall?', 'A weak before her lady-killer lover, a blond diva breaks up with the arrogant libertine to be with a kind friend. His ego demands appeasement, but the lethal revolver in her hand thirsts for retribution. Who is to blame for her downfall?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pq9wh4SzA2qJyW2q4w3cYWdnkmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336108'),
  ('483995703499437704', 'The Decline', 2020, 'Thriller, Action', 'Patrice Laliberté, Christophe Dalpé', 'Charles Dionne, Nicolas Krief, Patrice Laliberté', 'Réal Bossé, Marc-André Grondin, Guillaume Laurin, Marie-Evelyne Lessard, Marc Beaupré, Marilyn Castonguay, Guillaume Cyr, Isabelle Giroux', 'R', 'Anticipating a disaster, Antoine, a father, attends a survivalist training given by Alain in his autonomous hideout. In fear of a natural, economic or social crisis, the group trains to face the different possible apocalyptic scenarios. But the disaster they will experience will not be the one they predicted.', 'Anticipating a disaster, Antoine, a father, attends a survivalist training given by Alain in his autonomous hideout. In fear of a natural, economic or social crisis, the group trains to face the different possible apocalyptic scenarios. But the disaster they will experience will not be the one they predicted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIPNjDEf1iXOqULOXiRhqprllbz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674607'),
  ('305380943753793566', 'The Decline of the American Empire', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Denys Arcand, Monique Miranda, Jacques W. Benoit', 'Gabriel Arcand, Jean-Claude Lauzon, Catherine Ruelle', 'Dominique Michel, Dorothée Berryman, Louise Portal, Pierre Curzi, Rémy Girard, Yves Jacques, Geneviève Rioux, Daniel Brière', null, 'Four very different Montreal university teachers gather at a rambling country house to prepare a dinner. Remy (married), Claude (a homosexual), Pierre (involved with a girlfriend) and Alain (a bachelor) discuss sex, the female body and their affairs with them. Meanwhile, their four female guests, Louise (Remy''s wife of 15 years), Dominique (a spinster), Diane (a divorcée) and Danielle (Pierre''s girlfriend) are spending the time at a downtown health gym. They also discuss sex, the female body and, naturally, men. Later in the evening, they finally meet at the country house and have dinner. A ninth guest, named Mario, who used to know Diane, drops in on the group for some talk and has a surprise of his own.', 'Four very different Montreal university teachers gather at a rambling country house to prepare a dinner. Remy (married), Claude (a homosexual), Pierre (involved with a girlfriend) and Alain (a bachelor) discuss sex, the female body and their affairs with them. Meanwhile, their four female guests, Louise (Remy''s wife of 15 years), Dominique (a spinster), Diane (a divorcée) and Danielle (Pierre''s girlfriend) are spending the time at a downtown health gym. They also discuss sex, the female body and, naturally, men. Later in the evening, they finally meet at the country house and have dinner. A ninth guest, named Mario, who used to know Diane, drops in on the group for some talk and has a surprise of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5Bi5lr7Z2tr9fEJI0YuS0AS2iG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18499'),
  ('536879783530259917', 'The Decline of the Century: Testament L.Z.', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Lordan Zafranović', 'Lordan Zafranović, Vojdrag Berčić', 'Andrija Artuković, Lordan Zafranović', null, 'An epic documentary of rise and fall of Ustasha regime in Croatia.', 'An epic documentary of rise and fall of Ustasha regime in Croatia.', null, 'tmdb:movie:283126'),
  ('946824888780315457', 'The Decline of Western Civilization', 1981, 'Documentary, Music', 'Penelope Spheeris, Steve Conant, Peter Wiehl', 'Penelope Spheeris', 'Eugene Tatu, Alice Bag, Claude Bessy, Dinah Cancer, Exene Cervenka, Lorna Doom, Darby Crash, Don Bolles', 'NR', 'The Los Angeles punk music scene circa 1980 is the focus of this film. With Alice Bag Band, Black Flag, Catholic Discipline, Circle Jerks, Fear, Germs, and X.', 'The Los Angeles punk music scene circa 1980 is the focus of this film. With Alice Bag Band, Black Flag, Catholic Discipline, Circle Jerks, Fear, Germs, and X.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36YfDJQKZfoCn5NLJ7mcrekE511.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21137'),
  ('253661490109297826', 'The Decline of Western Civilization Part II: The Metal Years', 1988, 'Documentary, Music', 'Penelope Spheeris', null, 'Dave Mustaine, Ozzy Osbourne, Chris Holmes, Lemmy Kilmister, Paul Stanley, Gene Simmons, Steven Tyler, Joe Perry', 'R', 'An exploration of the heavy metal scene in Los Angeles, with particular emphasis on glam metal. It features concert footage and interviews of legendary heavy metal and hard rock bands and artists such as Aerosmith, Alice Cooper, Kiss, Megadeth, Motörhead, Ozzy Osbourne and W.A.S.P..', 'An exploration of the heavy metal scene in Los Angeles, with particular emphasis on glam metal. It features concert footage and interviews of legendary heavy metal and hard rock bands and artists such as Aerosmith, Alice Cooper, Kiss, Megadeth, Motörhead, Ozzy Osbourne and W.A.S.P..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XoeABOgfPzYIzv2UoGKAdZbbR7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36724'),
  ('864513273773992264', 'The Decline of Western Civilization Part III', 1998, 'Documentary, Music', 'Penelope Spheeris, Jamie Thompson', null, 'Rick Wilder, Flea, Stephen Chambers, Gary Fredo, Keith Morris, Eyeball, Myke Chambers, William A. Kirkley', null, 'A musical study of Los Angeles in the late 90s, where homeless teens roam the streets and profess to live a punk lifestyle of music, drugs, and flouting authority.', 'A musical study of Los Angeles in the late 90s, where homeless teens roam the streets and profess to live a punk lifestyle of music, drugs, and flouting authority.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZFYFv4YOFZGzbAHUVJFBFI2AUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44848'),
  ('456824357940178371', 'The Decoy Bride', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Sheree Folkson, Des Hamilton, Nanu Segal', 'Neil Jaworski, Sally Phillips', 'Kelly Macdonald, Alice Eve, David Tennant, Michael Urie, Federico Castelluccio, Maureen Beattie, Sally Phillips, Alisha Bailey', 'PG', 'A local woman is hired to draw paparazzi away from a Hollywood actress who has come to Scotland to get married.', 'A local woman is hired to draw paparazzi away from a Hollywood actress who has come to Scotland to get married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLFecF4VfzuVXjQBnoo9sCDuTqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40161'),
  ('893509435196755749', 'The Deep', 1977, 'Mystery, Thriller, Adventure', 'Peter Yates, Christopher Challis', 'Peter Benchley, Tracy Keenan Wynn', 'Robert Shaw, Jacqueline Bisset, Nick Nolte, Louis Gossett Jr., Eli Wallach, Robert Tessier, Dick Anthony Williams, Bob Minor', 'PG', 'A pair of young vacationers are involved in a dangerous conflict with treasure hunters when they discover a way into a deadly wreck in Bermuda waters.', 'A pair of young vacationers are involved in a dangerous conflict with treasure hunters when they discover a way into a deadly wreck in Bermuda waters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CbTHv23YLsQrvycL2ykyo8ttJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20416'),
  ('461648936485182572', 'The Deep', 2012, 'Drama', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Bergsteinn Björgúlfsson', 'Jón Atli Jónasson, Baltasar Kormákur', 'Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Joi Johannsson, Þorbjörg Helga Þorgilsdóttir, Theodór Júlíusson, María Sigurðardóttir, Björn Thors, Stefán Hallur Stefánsson, Þröstur Leó Gunnarsson', 'NR', 'Based on an astonishing true incident that took place on the frigid seas off Iceland in 1984, The Deep fashions a modern-day everyman myth about the sole survivor of a shipwreck, whose superhuman will to survive made him both an inexplicable scientific phenomenon and a genuine national hero.', 'Based on an astonishing true incident that took place on the frigid seas off Iceland in 1984, The Deep fashions a modern-day everyman myth about the sole survivor of a shipwreck, whose superhuman will to survive made him both an inexplicable scientific phenomenon and a genuine national hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fJZbHl3P9oaDhLEoJOaaOiX5EF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127913'),
  ('165769373913317803', 'The Deep Blue Sea', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anatole Litvak, Jack Hildyard, Adrian Pryce-Jones', 'Terence Rattigan', 'Vivien Leigh, Kenneth More, Eric Portman, Emlyn Williams, Moira Lister, Arthur Hill, Dandy Nichols, Alec McCowen', null, 'A woman is unhappy in her marriage to a boring, stiff judge, so she takes up with a wild-living RAF pilot, who ends up being more than she can handle.', 'A woman is unhappy in her marriage to a boring, stiff judge, so she takes up with a wild-living RAF pilot, who ends up being more than she can handle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98TFnJ8GZlbBnbCZ6v8IIcdCPsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193321'),
  ('566639282083147426', 'The Deep Blue Sea', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Terence Davies, David Hindle, Jane Arnell', 'Terence Davies', 'Rachel Weisz, Tom Hiddleston, Simon Russell Beale, Harry Hadden-Paton, Jolyon Coy, Karl Johnson, Ann Mitchell, Nicholas Amer', 'R', 'The wife of a British Judge is caught in a self-destructive love affair with a Royal Air Force pilot.', 'The wife of a British Judge is caught in a self-destructive love affair with a Royal Air Force pilot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZAXsFxxYWWSpEy5XQtdBaETYoc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51994'),
  ('711175000683556388', 'The Deep Dark', 2023, 'Adventure, Horror, Drama', 'Mathieu Turi, Alain Duplantier, Camille Mallecot', 'Mathieu Turi', 'Samuel Le Bihan, Amir el Kacem, Thomas Solivérès, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Marc Riso, Bruno Sanches, Diego Martín, Philippe Torreton', null, '1956, in the north of France. A group of underground miners is forced to take a professor to take samples a thousand meters underground. After a landslide that prevents them from going back up, they discover a crypt from another time, and unknowingly awaken a legendary bloodthirsty creature.', '1956, in the north of France. A group of underground miners is forced to take a professor to take samples a thousand meters underground. After a landslide that prevents them from going back up, they discover a crypt from another time, and unknowingly awaken a legendary bloodthirsty creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8hiMBkSpVaFQv35xUwNhPi07wK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976830'),
  ('417250190487593561', 'The Deep End', 2001, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Scott McGehee, David Siegel, Craig Borden', 'Scott McGehee, David Siegel', 'Tilda Swinton, Goran Višnjić, Jonathan Tucker, Josh Lucas, Peter Donat, Raymond J. Barry, Tamara Hope, Jordon Dorrance', 'R', 'With her husband Jack perpetually away at work, Margaret Hall raises her children virtually alone. Her teenage son is testing the waters of the adult world, and early one morning she wakes to find the dead body of his gay lover on the beach of their rural lakeside home. What would you do? What is rational and what do you do to protect your child? How far do you go and when do you stop?', 'With her husband Jack perpetually away at work, Margaret Hall raises her children virtually alone. Her teenage son is testing the waters of the adult world, and early one morning she wakes to find the dead body of his gay lover on the beach of their rural lakeside home. What would you do? What is rational and what do you do to protect your child? How far do you go and when do you stop?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWRTQpTb65Itp4bdNas3W4a1QHy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24936'),
  ('321577616405248188', 'The Deep End of the Ocean', 1999, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ulu Grosbard, Stephen Goldblatt', 'Stephen Schiff', 'Michelle Pfeiffer, Treat Williams, Jonathan Jackson, Ryan Merriman, Alexa PenaVega, Whoopi Goldberg, Cory Buck, Michael McGrady', 'PG-13', 'A three-year-old boy disappears during his mother''s high school reunion. Nine years later, by chance, he turns up in the town in which the family has just relocated.', 'A three-year-old boy disappears during his mother''s high school reunion. Nine years later, by chance, he turns up in the town in which the family has just relocated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Q8g9CfW7EiwxRCpLSDpOmcaEZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30943'),
  ('441013441409250754', 'The Deep House', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jacques Ballard, Alexandre Bustillo, Julien Maury', 'Julien Maury, Alexandre Bustillo', 'James Jagger, Camille Rowe, Éric Savin, Marie Bernard, Marie Caffier, Carolina Massey, Alexis Servaes, Anne Claessens', 'NR', 'While diving in a remote French lake, a couple of YouTubers who specialise in underwater exploration videos discover a house submerged in the deep waters. What was initially a unique finding soon turns into a nightmare when they discover that the house was the scene of atrocious crimes. Trapped, with their oxygen reserves falling dangerously, they realise the worst is yet to come: they are not alone in the house.', 'While diving in a remote French lake, a couple of YouTubers who specialise in underwater exploration videos discover a house submerged in the deep waters. What was initially a unique finding soon turns into a nightmare when they discover that the house was the scene of atrocious crimes. Trapped, with their oxygen reserves falling dangerously, they realise the worst is yet to come: they are not alone in the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52E0LGcMKHOO91P4j6hdHKVwITP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672582'),
  ('1089707230190805428', 'The Deep Ones', 2021, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Chad Ferrin', 'Chad Ferrin', 'Gina La Piana, Robert Miano, Johann Urb, Silvia Spross, Jackie Debatin, Nicolas Coster, Kelli Maroney, Timothy Muskatell', null, 'A married couple rents a beachside Airbnb, only to be surrounded by peculiar neighbors and occurrences. They soon discover they are in the grip of a mysterious cult and their ancient sea god.', 'A married couple rents a beachside Airbnb, only to be surrounded by peculiar neighbors and occurrences. They soon discover they are in the grip of a mysterious cult and their ancient sea god.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3K024gjdaLfaZb8ilbwWkgs9Hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674564'),
  ('140294295114057573', 'The Deep Red', 2005, null, 'Takashi Tsukinoki, Tatsuo Suzuki', null, 'Rina Uchiyama, Asami Mizukawa, Fumiyo Kohinata, Naoto Ogata, Asahi Uchida, Takashi Tsukamoto, Maki Horikita, Mitsuru Hirata', null, 'Shinku is a compelling drama that focuses on the strange relationship that develops between two people who find their lives irrevocably changed as a result of a horrible multiple homicide. The first person traumatized is the lone survivor of the terrible family bloodbath, a girl who grows up to be a pretty college student. The second person affected by this heinous crime is the daughter of the murderer, a young girl who ends up becoming a tattooed bartender. A full decade after the crime, the killer is finally going to be executed, and the surviving member of the massacre decides to reach out and befriend the murderer''s daughter. A tentative, odd sort of friendship blossoms between these two people, both of whom seem to have little in common personally, and every reason in the world for not wanting to meet. Yet they do, but not without reservations. And really, is this friendship quite what it seems? Or is it all part of some twisted plan for vengeance?', 'Shinku is a compelling drama that focuses on the strange relationship that develops between two people who find their lives irrevocably changed as a result of a horrible multiple homicide. The first person traumatized is the lone survivor of the terrible family bloodbath, a girl who grows up to be a pretty college student. The second person affected by this heinous crime is the daughter of the murderer, a young girl who ends up becoming a tattooed bartender. A full decade after the crime, the killer is finally going to be executed, and the surviving member of the massacre decides to reach out and befriend the murderer''s daughter. A tentative, odd sort of friendship blossoms between these two people, both of whom seem to have little in common personally, and every reason in the world for not wanting to meet. Yet they do, but not without reservations. And really, is this friendship quite what it seems? Or is it all part of some twisted plan for vengeance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3ELig6BF0DpwGNIIvShO36RM85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166539'),
  ('648397302584503293', 'The Deep Six', 1958, 'War, Drama', 'Rudolph Maté, John F. Seitz', 'Harry Brown', 'Alan Ladd, Dianne Foster, William Bendix, Keenan Wynn, James Whitmore, Efrem Zimbalist Jr., Joey Bishop, Barbara Eiler', 'NR', 'The conflict between duty and conscience is explored in the WWII drama The Deep Six. Alan Ladd stars as Naval gunnery officer Alec Austin, a Quaker whose sincere pacifist sentiments do not sit well with his crew members. When he refuses to fire upon an unidentified plane, the word spreads that Austin cannot be relied upon in battle (never mind that the plane turns out to be one of ours). To prove that he''s worthy of command, Austin volunteers for a dangerous mission: the rescue of a group of US pilots on a Japanese-held island. The ubiquitous William Bendix costars as Frenchy Shapiro (!), Austin''s Jewish petty officer and severest critic. If the film has a villain, it is Keenan Wynn as ambitious Lt. Commander Edge, who seems to despise anyone who isn''t a mainline WASP.', 'The conflict between duty and conscience is explored in the WWII drama The Deep Six. Alan Ladd stars as Naval gunnery officer Alec Austin, a Quaker whose sincere pacifist sentiments do not sit well with his crew members. When he refuses to fire upon an unidentified plane, the word spreads that Austin cannot be relied upon in battle (never mind that the plane turns out to be one of ours). To prove that he''s worthy of command, Austin volunteers for a dangerous mission: the rescue of a group of US pilots on a Japanese-held island. The ubiquitous William Bendix costars as Frenchy Shapiro (!), Austin''s Jewish petty officer and severest critic. If the film has a villain, it is Keenan Wynn as ambitious Lt. Commander Edge, who seems to despise anyone who isn''t a mainline WASP.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTfc5nEIhGw0YODxrgF6kaK9iJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102078'),
  ('186740101592929442', 'The Deep Web: Murdershow', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dan Zachary, Scot Proudfoot', 'Dan Zachary', 'Aiden Howard, Kimi Alexander, Brendan Fletcher, Josh Blacker, Lauren Jackson', null, 'A podcaster’s investigation of his sister’s death leads him to a grisly website, where the highest bidder decides how a chosen victim will be killed.', 'A podcaster’s investigation of his sister’s death leads him to a grisly website, where the highest bidder decides how a chosen victim will be killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TZsNLYUi2qGVS9NNy5XBUm6VON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146246'),
  ('464524002472939318', 'The Deeper You Dig', 2019, 'Horror, Drama', 'Zelda Adams, Toby Poser, Zelda Adams', 'Toby Poser, John Adams', 'John Adams, Toby Poser, Zelda Adams, Shawn Wilson, Joan Poser, Mike Childs, Izzy Figueredo', 'NR', '14-year old Echo and her mother Ivy, a tarot card reader, live a quiet life in a rural area. When reclusive Kurt moves down the road to restore an abandoned farmhouse, an accident leads to Echo’s murder, and suddenly three lives collide in mysterious and wicked ways. Kurt assumes he can hide his secret under the ground. But Echo burrows into his head until he can feel her in his bones. As she haunts his every move, trying to reach her mother from beyond, Ivy must dig deep to see the signs and prove that love won’t stay buried.', '14-year old Echo and her mother Ivy, a tarot card reader, live a quiet life in a rural area. When reclusive Kurt moves down the road to restore an abandoned farmhouse, an accident leads to Echo’s murder, and suddenly three lives collide in mysterious and wicked ways. Kurt assumes he can hide his secret under the ground. But Echo burrows into his head until he can feel her in his bones. As she haunts his every move, trying to reach her mother from beyond, Ivy must dig deep to see the signs and prove that love won’t stay buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciLziMBBQQfqwtQ5gmGAIROJRyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611640'),
  ('1087285014357869380', 'The Deepest Breath', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Laura McGann, Tim Cragg, Julie Gautier', 'Laura McGann', 'Alessia Zecchini, Stephen Keenan, Leigh Baker, Mahmoud Barracuda, Ilaria Boni, Kristof Coenen, Lily Crespy, Hanako Hirose', 'PG', 'Bonded by their love of freediving, a record-setting champion and a heroic safety diver try to make history with a remarkable feat, ready to risk it all.', 'Bonded by their love of freediving, a record-setting champion and a heroic safety diver try to make history with a remarkable feat, ready to risk it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gKAn4npGEBi0HZAbwFZ77reLBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058647'),
  ('47236408179002363', 'The Deer', 1976, 'Crime, Drama', 'Masoud Kimiai, Nemat Haghighi', 'Masoud Kimiai', 'Behrouz Vossoughi, Faramarz Gharibian, Parviz Fanizadeh, Nosrat Partovi, Garshasb Raoufi, Enayat Bakhshi, Nematollah Gorji, Mohammad Varshochi', null, 'An urban guerrilla, wounded after a bank robbery, seeks refuge with his childhood friend—only to discover that his friend has fallen into addiction. The guerrilla hides in his house and gradually begins to influence him, helping him regain his courage and strength. Eventually, he entrusts the stolen money to him…', 'An urban guerrilla, wounded after a bank robbery, seeks refuge with his childhood friend—only to discover that his friend has fallen into addiction. The guerrilla hides in his house and gradually begins to influence him, helping him regain his courage and strength. Eventually, he entrusts the stolen money to him…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVQ1pYXKWGJeWfqdZyAAVgEBr6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268028'),
  ('1028358169037619260', 'The Deer Hunter', 1978, 'Drama, War', 'Michael Cimino, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Deric Washburn', 'Robert De Niro, Christopher Walken, John Cazale, John Savage, Meryl Streep, George Dzundza, Rutanya Alda, Pierre Segui', 'R', 'Three steelworkers enlist in the army and are sent to Vietnam, one leaving behind a rushed marriage, the others a shared love. What they encounter during the war changes their lives forever.', 'Three steelworkers enlist in the army and are sent to Vietnam, one leaving behind a rushed marriage, the others a shared love. What they encounter during the war changes their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbGtogDZOg09bm42KIpCXUXICkh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11778'),
  ('789299468235362744', 'The Deer King', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Hiromi Kikuta, Masayuki Miyaji, Koji Tanaka', 'Taku Kishimoto', 'Shinichi Tsutsumi, Ryoma Takeuchi, Anne Watanabe, Hisui Kimura, Atsushi Abe, Yoshito Yasuhara, Toru Sakurai, Shinshu Fuji', 'R', 'Following a brutal war, former soldier Van toils in a mine controlled by the ruling empire. One day, his solitary existence is upended when a pack of wild dogs carrying a deadly and incurable disease attack, leaving only Van and a young girl named Yuna as survivors. Finally free, the pair seek out a simple existence in the countryside but are pursued by nefarious forces. Intent on protecting Yuna at all costs, Van must uncover the true cause of the plague ravaging the kingdom—and its possible cure.', 'Following a brutal war, former soldier Van toils in a mine controlled by the ruling empire. One day, his solitary existence is upended when a pack of wild dogs carrying a deadly and incurable disease attack, leaving only Van and a young girl named Yuna as survivors. Finally free, the pair seek out a simple existence in the countryside but are pursued by nefarious forces. Intent on protecting Yuna at all costs, Van must uncover the true cause of the plague ravaging the kingdom—and its possible cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tE6bhyMR973XcWr2gqeCmAgvvYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633844'),
  ('316604550153846037', 'The Deerslayer', 1957, 'Adventure, Western', 'Karl Struss, Kurt Neumann', 'Carroll Young, Dalton Trumbo, Kurt Neumann', 'Lex Barker, Rita Moreno, Forrest Tucker, Cathy O''Donnell, Jay C. Flippen, Carlos Rivas, Joseph Vitale, John Halloran', 'NR', 'After The Deerslayer, a white man reared by the Mohicans, and his blood brother Chingachgook, a Mohican chief, save trader Harry Marsh from the hostile Huron Indians, they learn that the Hurons will attack Old Tom Hutter and his two daughters, Hetty and Judith, who live on a floating raft fort on the river.', 'After The Deerslayer, a white man reared by the Mohicans, and his blood brother Chingachgook, a Mohican chief, save trader Harry Marsh from the hostile Huron Indians, they learn that the Hurons will attack Old Tom Hutter and his two daughters, Hetty and Judith, who live on a floating raft fort on the river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpIhudwG1OrCJt954eRUuktbmSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121959'),
  ('53621789440707164', 'The Defendant', 2020, 'Drama', 'Franco Lolli', 'Franco Lolli, Virginie Legeay, Marie Amachoukeli', 'Carolina Sanin, Leticia Gómez, Antonio R. Martínez, Alejandra Sarria, Vladimir Durán', null, 'Silvia, a single mother and a lawyer, is implicated in a corruption scandal. But in addition to trouble at work, she is also facing a more crippling problem: her mother’s cancer has returned. While she is forced to face up to her mother’s inconceivable yet inescapable death, Silvia embarks on a love story, her first in many years.', 'Silvia, a single mother and a lawyer, is implicated in a corruption scandal. But in addition to trouble at work, she is also facing a more crippling problem: her mother’s cancer has returned. While she is forced to face up to her mother’s inconceivable yet inescapable death, Silvia embarks on a love story, her first in many years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1SzivuW8Qb46y2i5bpDfJdIFxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585073'),
  ('331665245951430325', 'The Defender', 2004, 'Action, Thriller', 'Dolph Lundgren, Anatol Reghintovschi, Francesca Mauri', 'Douglas W. Miller', 'Dolph Lundgren, Jerry Springer, Shakara Ledard, Thomas Lockyer, Caroline Lee-Johnson, Gerald Kyd, Ian Porter, Howard Antony', 'R', 'The global war on terror rages on. When a government official goes missing, Lance, a man with an impressive record of service to his country, finds himself protecting the man who embodies everything he has dedicated his life to fight against.', 'The global war on terror rages on. When a government official goes missing, Lance, a man with an impressive record of service to his country, finds himself protecting the man who embodies everything he has dedicated his life to fight against.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DL4r94XsOTpO9UyVWXQ7LFWc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26125'),
  ('792732550155832557', 'The Defiant Ones', 1958, 'Crime, Drama, Adventure, Thriller', 'Stanley Kramer, Sam Leavitt, Paul Helmick', 'Harold Jacob Smith, Nedrick Young', 'Tony Curtis, Sidney Poitier, Theodore Bikel, Charles McGraw, Lon Chaney Jr., King Donovan, Claude Akins, Lawrence Dobkin', 'NR', 'Two convicts—one white, one black—escape while chained to each other.', 'Two convicts—one white, one black—escape while chained to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGGNyImEXgedDjrCORbC9cTJp0X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11414'),
