  ('694258775707765638', 'The Demon Disorder', 2024, 'Horror', 'Steven Boyle, Terry King', 'Steven Boyle, Toby Osborne', 'John Noble, Charles Cottier, Christian Willis, Dirk Hunter, Tobie Webster, Liam Wallace, Amy Ingram, Michael Tuahine', null, 'The pasts of three brothers and their deceased father collide when a deep, dark family secret is unearthed, leading to a case of revenge from beyond the grave.', 'The pasts of three brothers and their deceased father collide when a deep, dark family secret is unearthed, leading to a case of revenge from beyond the grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Oqlmo1bhDQWWBPrMxMauuHL7y7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128941'),
