  ('744315925905069412', 'The Demon of Mount Oe', 1960, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Tokuzō Tanaka, Hiroshi Imai', 'Fuji Yahiro', 'Kazuo Hasegawa, Raizō Ichikawa, Shintarō Katsu, Kōjirō Hongō, Ganjirō Nakamura II, Yutaka Nakamura, Ryūzō Shimada, Naritoshi Hayashi', null, 'A demon-faced monster seeking revenge appears in the forms of a gigantic ox and a huge spider! The young Genji warrior protects the Fujiwara Clan and the beautiful lady in tragic love! A grand visual epic told with mesmerizing extravagance!', 'A demon-faced monster seeking revenge appears in the forms of a gigantic ox and a huge spider! The young Genji warrior protects the Fujiwara Clan and the beautiful lady in tragic love! A grand visual epic told with mesmerizing extravagance!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsoUWK7Q4Uh1TtSZ1hVQLEIMbtE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295737'),
  ('172056626147621180', 'The Demon Wet Nurse', 1992, 'Drama', 'Hsia Tsu-hui', 'Chi-chih Shih', 'Ching-Ngo Gam, Pal Sinn Lap-Man, Hu Chin, Charlie Cho Cha-Lee, Cheung Ging-Fa, Ching-Wah Cheung', null, 'This Category III period drama featuring power struggles and naughty things within the imperial palace walls definitely has effort put forth but immense chunks of plot holes are nowhere near filled up. Much seem missing in the story of poor Ru Yee who applies to be the nurse maid of the Emperor’s son. She gets help to gain access by Wei (Tan Lap-Man) and soon they are both heavily involved inside the palace. She as the nurse maid and he as a eunuch in training. Wei also finds time to murder Ru Yee’s sick husband and child… a fact barely mentioned after it’s happened.', 'This Category III period drama featuring power struggles and naughty things within the imperial palace walls definitely has effort put forth but immense chunks of plot holes are nowhere near filled up. Much seem missing in the story of poor Ru Yee who applies to be the nurse maid of the Emperor’s son. She gets help to gain access by Wei (Tan Lap-Man) and soon they are both heavily involved inside the palace. She as the nurse maid and he as a eunuch in training. Wei also finds time to murder Ru Yee’s sick husband and child… a fact barely mentioned after it’s happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0z4npfVI7Xh6jDPbHYJ6RUeFpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406898'),
  ('197862084836209264', 'The Demon Within', 1985, 'Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Masayoshi Sukita, Motomu Shimada', 'Atsushi Yamatoya', 'Kazuyo Matsui, Kyōzō Nagatsuka, Ichirō Ogura, Yousuke Saito', null, 'A journalist becomes possessed by a gakidama, a spirit of the dead. Unknown to the man, a demon is now incubating in his stomach, and a mysterious stranger seem to know what afflicts him.', 'A journalist becomes possessed by a gakidama, a spirit of the dead. Unknown to the man, a demon is now incubating in his stomach, and a mysterious stranger seem to know what afflicts him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVwAxdCMA0Gjv36Qbz7UnPvHeCi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125143'),
  ('35178637575455505', 'The Demoniacs', 1974, 'Horror', 'Jean Rollin, Jean-Jacques Renon', 'Jean Rollin', 'Joëlle Cœur, John Rico, Willy Braque, Paul Bisciglia, Lieva Lone, Patricia Hermenier, Louise D''hour, Ben Zimet', null, 'A gang of pirates rape the two sole survivors of a ship wreck. The violated girls are rescued by the strange inhabitants of a supposedly haunted island, where they are granted supernatural powers to strike revenge against the pirates.', 'A gang of pirates rape the two sole survivors of a ship wreck. The violated girls are rescued by the strange inhabitants of a supposedly haunted island, where they are granted supernatural powers to strike revenge against the pirates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGyBRAxXeWmNMnPGmzA12SJhS9w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29130'),
  ('1117875644593127790', 'The Demons', 1973, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Raúl Artigot', 'Jesús Franco', 'Anne Libert, Carmen Yazalde, Doris Thomas, Karin Field, Jahangir Ghaffari, Luis Barboo, Howard Vernon, Alberto Dalbés', null, 'A group of nuns become possessed by demons and are then tortured in a dungeon of horrors during the Inquisition.', 'A group of nuns become possessed by demons and are then tortured in a dungeon of horrors during the Inquisition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDnfPwBPjuwUddvnZLxaaKPx9zj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86645'),
  ('1076417551355492248', 'The Demons', 2015, 'Drama', 'Philippe Lesage, Nicolas Canniccioni', 'Philippe Lesage', 'Édouard Tremblay-Grenier, Pier-Luc Funk, Vassili Schneider, Sarah Mottet, Laurent Lucas, Pascale Bussières, Victoria Diamond, Yannick Gobeil-Dugas', null, 'While Montreal is in the throes of a string of kidnappings targeting young boys, ten-year-old Felix is finishing his school year in the seemingly quiet suburb where he lives. A sensitive boy with a vivid imagination, Felix is afraid of everything. Little by little, his imaginary demons begin to mirror those of the truly disturbing world around him.', 'While Montreal is in the throes of a string of kidnappings targeting young boys, ten-year-old Felix is finishing his school year in the seemingly quiet suburb where he lives. A sensitive boy with a vivid imagination, Felix is afraid of everything. Little by little, his imaginary demons begin to mirror those of the truly disturbing world around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNY5V7DFVWYdADWbTlZj7YiVlEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361571'),
  ('853009859091544322', 'The Demons of Dorothy', 2022, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Alexis Langlois, Marine Atlan', 'Carlotta Coco, Alexis Langlois', 'Justine Langlois, Lio, Nana Benamer, Dustin Muchuvitz, Raya Martigny, Sonia Deville, Romy Alizée, Carlotta Coco', null, 'Dorothy’s a film director and a bit of a loser. One night, after a few beers, she lets loose on her script when a call from her producer kills her buzz: enough with the queer comedies, it’s time to start making mainstream films. To avoid sinking to the deepest depths of despair, Dorothy seeks comfort in her favorite TV show "Romy the Vampire Slayer". Unfortunately, her own demons show up.', 'Dorothy’s a film director and a bit of a loser. One night, after a few beers, she lets loose on her script when a call from her producer kills her buzz: enough with the queer comedies, it’s time to start making mainstream films. To avoid sinking to the deepest depths of despair, Dorothy seeks comfort in her favorite TV show "Romy the Vampire Slayer". Unfortunately, her own demons show up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mEJv7UbufbD5nJJBXlfRaqgFhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846818'),
  ('644712179879760755', 'The Demons of Ludlow', 1983, 'Horror', 'Bill Rebane, Bill Rebane, Barbara J. Rebane', 'William Arthur', 'Paul von Hausen, Stephanie Cushna, Carol Perry, C. Dave Davis, Debra Dulman, Patricia J. Statz, Mary Walden, Michael Accardo', null, 'A murderous demon lurks inside an antique piano in a picturesque coastal town.', 'A murderous demon lurks inside an antique piano in a picturesque coastal town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYdckkPeQqvEBe3GOzmiHMrJFHP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114619'),
  ('632679443737785043', 'The Demons of St. Petersburg', 2008, 'Drama', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Vera Pescarolo, Inti Carboni', 'Paolo Serbandini, Giuliano Montaldo, Monica Zapelli', 'Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Carolina Crescentini, Roberto Herlitzka, Anita Caprioli, Filippo Timi, Patrizia Sacchi, Sandra Ceccarelli, Giovanni Martorana', null, 'St. Petersburg, 1860. After a member of the imperial family is assassinated, Fyodor Dostoevsky meets one of the conspirators, who reveals that his comrades are planning another attack to the Tsar''s life. Plagued by debts and struggling to finish his latest novel, Dostoevsky must act fast to call off the plot.', 'St. Petersburg, 1860. After a member of the imperial family is assassinated, Fyodor Dostoevsky meets one of the conspirators, who reveals that his comrades are planning another attack to the Tsar''s life. Plagued by debts and struggling to finish his latest novel, Dostoevsky must act fast to call off the plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mB95v3VEFTZQukoLBkAB3AqXuez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63403'),
  ('669586252863828720', 'The Den', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Zachary Donohue, Bernard Hunt', 'Zachary Donohue, Lauren Thompson', 'Melanie Papalia, Matt Riedy, David Schlachtenhaufen, Adam Shapiro, Matt Lasky, Victoria Hanlin, Bill Oberst Jr., Katija Pevec', 'R', 'A young woman studying the habits of webcam chat users from the apparent safety of her apartment witnesses a brutal murder online and is quickly immersed in a nightmare in which she and her loved ones are targeted for the same grisly fate as the first victim.', 'A young woman studying the habits of webcam chat users from the apparent safety of her apartment witnesses a brutal murder online and is quickly immersed in a nightmare in which she and her loved ones are targeted for the same grisly fate as the first victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0cHa11nmOUaF4kYQ7vh1Xtssek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244610'),
  ('956528653185509722', 'The Den', 2022, 'Drama', 'Beatrice Baldacci, Ian Cardinali, Lorenzo Puntoni', 'Beatrice Baldacci, Edoardo Puma', 'Irene Vetere, Lorenzo Aloi, Elisa Di Eusanio, Helene Nardini, Paolo Ricci, Federico Rosati', null, 'In the summer of his nineteenth year, Giulio has decided not to go away: he will spend his vacation at home, helping his parents with their work in the vegetable garden. In the house next door, empty for some time, arrives Lia, a twenty-year-old girl. Giulio would like to get to know her, but she is sullen and introverted. One day Giulio is swimming in the lake and Lia plays at drowning him. Giulio is a regular guy, sensitive and polite to a fault. Attracted to her, he starts thinking about her day and night. Lia initiates him into strange and increasingly dangerous "games." The girl won''t talk about herself though. She has told him she came alone to spend her vacation in the old family home, where she hadn''t been since she was a child. But Lia has secrets to keep and won''t let anyone set foot in the old and abandoned house.', 'In the summer of his nineteenth year, Giulio has decided not to go away: he will spend his vacation at home, helping his parents with their work in the vegetable garden. In the house next door, empty for some time, arrives Lia, a twenty-year-old girl. Giulio would like to get to know her, but she is sullen and introverted. One day Giulio is swimming in the lake and Lia plays at drowning him. Giulio is a regular guy, sensitive and polite to a fault. Attracted to her, he starts thinking about her day and night. Lia initiates him into strange and increasingly dangerous "games." The girl won''t talk about herself though. She has told him she came alone to spend her vacation in the old family home, where she hadn''t been since she was a child. But Lia has secrets to keep and won''t let anyone set foot in the old and abandoned house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Bb8wmB3fVaQYTidjfebO2oAK5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854542'),
  ('946449354566711708', 'The Dentist', 1932, 'Comedy', 'Leslie Pearce, John W. Boyle', 'W.C. Fields', 'W.C. Fields, Marjorie Kane, Arnold Gray, Dorothy Granger, Elise Cavanna, Zedna Farley, Joseph Belmont, Billy Bletcher', null, 'An unconventional dentist deals with patients in slapstick fashion.', 'An unconventional dentist deals with patients in slapstick fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryimz3LIGtgzrhxLlUn3ukStaqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52279'),
  ('878108819402272183', 'The Dentist', 1996, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Brian Yuzna, Levie Isaacks', 'Stuart Gordon, Charles Finch, Dennis Paoli', 'Corbin Bernsen, Linda Hoffman, Michael Stadvec, Ken Foree, Tony Noakes, Molly Hagan, Christa Sauls, Lise Simms', 'R', 'Dr. Alan Feinstone has everything: a beautiful wife and a successful career in dentistry. However, when he discovers his wife''s affair, he realizes that behind every clean, white surface lies the stench of decay.', 'Dr. Alan Feinstone has everything: a beautiful wife and a successful career in dentistry. However, when he discovers his wife''s affair, he realizes that behind every clean, white surface lies the stench of decay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jKZXQy0OJW3B0tt8AdQ8epI9sU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9568'),
  ('5993539085498987', 'The Dentist 2', 1998, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Brian Yuzna, Jürgen Baum', 'Richard Dana Smith', 'Corbin Bernsen, Jillian McWhirter, Jeff Doucette, Susanne Wright, Jim Antonio, Lee Dawson, Wendy Robie, Ralph P. Martin', 'R', 'Dr. Feinstone escapes from the mental hospital where he has been held ever since his wife''s adultery sent him on a deranged killing spree. Hoping to resume a normal life, he makes his way to a quiet Midwestern town and establishes himself in a new practice under an assumed name. Things are starting to look up for Dr. ''Caine'' – that is, until the day he catches his new love in the arms of someone else. As before, the impact of romantic betrayal sends him over the edge into madness and murder, with his unfortunate patients once again bearing the brunt of his hostility.', 'Dr. Feinstone escapes from the mental hospital where he has been held ever since his wife''s adultery sent him on a deranged killing spree. Hoping to resume a normal life, he makes his way to a quiet Midwestern town and establishes himself in a new practice under an assumed name. Things are starting to look up for Dr. ''Caine'' – that is, until the day he catches his new love in the arms of someone else. As before, the impact of romantic betrayal sends him over the edge into madness and murder, with his unfortunate patients once again bearing the brunt of his hostility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJ399sCWAxEYa4SETUCBXlBLohZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37526'),
  ('245418614672953827', 'The Dentures', 1909, 'Comedy', 'Émile Cohl', null, 'Max Linder', null, 'Mother in law gets a new set of dentures. Despite being initially happy, the family soon discovers the teeth have a life of their own and jump from their owner''s mouth and bite everyone who comes near--from ladies to gentlemen to policemen.', 'Mother in law gets a new set of dentures. Despite being initially happy, the family soon discovers the teeth have a life of their own and jump from their owner''s mouth and bite everyone who comes near--from ladies to gentlemen to policemen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLOSMSzWdPLdQiLHQdzytfCRvng.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194039'),
  ('438609744588057411', 'The Departed', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Martin Scorsese, Michael Ballhaus, G.A. Aguilar', 'Felix Chong Man-Keung, Alan Mak Siu-Fai', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Matt Damon, Jack Nicholson, Mark Wahlberg, Martin Sheen, Ray Winstone, Vera Farmiga, Anthony Anderson', 'R', 'To take down South Boston''s Irish Mafia, the police send in one of their own to infiltrate the underworld, not realizing the syndicate has done likewise. While an undercover cop curries favor with the mob kingpin, a career criminal rises through the police ranks. But both sides soon discover there''s a mole among them.', 'To take down South Boston''s Irish Mafia, the police send in one of their own to infiltrate the underworld, not realizing the syndicate has done likewise. While an undercover cop curries favor with the mob kingpin, a career criminal rises through the police ranks. But both sides soon discover there''s a mole among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nT97ifVT2J1yMQmeq20Qblg61T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422'),
  ('874545660684297553', 'The Departure', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jerzy Skolimowski, Willy Kurant', 'Andrzej Kostenko, Jerzy Skolimowski', 'Jean-Pierre Léaud, Catherine-Isabelle Duport, Jacqueline Bir, Paul Roland, Paul Frère, Leon Dony, Lucien Charbonnier, Georges Aubrey', null, 'A young Belgian car nut and hairdresser''s apprentice attempts to get a Porsche by all means for his nearing debut race and meets a girl in the same time.', 'A young Belgian car nut and hairdresser''s apprentice attempts to get a Porsche by all means for his nearing debut race and meets a girl in the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1GStQbRRRoepV5R4aGJbxYe7D3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137726'),
  ('189475527679984712', 'The Departure', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Lana Wilson', 'Lana Wilson', null, null, 'An intimate character study of the complex figure Ittetsu Nemoto, an aimless and rebellious former punk rocker-turned-Buddhist priest. He is renowned in Japan for saving the lives of countless suicidal men and women through his wise and compassionate counsel. But Nemoto is now approaching middle-age with a wife and young boy of his own, when he learns his life is at risk from heart disease, compounded by the heavy emotional workload of supporting those who no longer want to live. When saving others takes such a toll, can he find the resiliency to save himself?', 'An intimate character study of the complex figure Ittetsu Nemoto, an aimless and rebellious former punk rocker-turned-Buddhist priest. He is renowned in Japan for saving the lives of countless suicidal men and women through his wise and compassionate counsel. But Nemoto is now approaching middle-age with a wife and young boy of his own, when he learns his life is at risk from heart disease, compounded by the heavy emotional workload of supporting those who no longer want to live. When saving others takes such a toll, can he find the resiliency to save himself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWFmuRqHgU6NgXUNNpgL9R5V8lA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454059'),
  ('806155768587582075', 'The Dependent', 1969, 'Drama', 'Aníbal Di Salvo, Leonardo Favio', 'Leonardo Favio, Roberto Irigoyen, Jorge Zuhair Jury', 'Walter Vidarte, Graciela Borges, Nora Cullen, Fernando «Tacholas» Iglesias, Martín Andrade, José E. Felicetti, Linda Peretz, Leonardo Favio', null, 'Fernandez is a lonely man leading a lonely life. All he does is work for an old man in a hardware store. But all that changes, when he meets the girl of his dreams... and her family.', 'Fernandez is a lonely man leading a lonely life. All he does is work for an old man in a hardware store. But all that changes, when he meets the girl of his dreams... and her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lnuHlF8Neer4qv7AHH9E4KY6RP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36785'),
  ('1010062723360299186', 'The Dependent Variables', 2022, 'Drama', 'Simone Rossi, Lorenzo Tardella', 'Lorenzo Tardella, Mara Fondacaro, Elisa Pulcini', 'Simone Evangelista, Mattia Rega, Francesco Ortolani, Lorenzo Robustelli, Silvia Venturi', null, 'In a dark, velvety theatre, there is a first kiss between Pietro and Tommaso. When the lights come back on, however, the two students have different expectations of what might follow. The chaos of awakening desire in its complexity and sensuality is told and made almost physically tangible through looks and gestures, approach and retreat, hope and fear.', 'In a dark, velvety theatre, there is a first kiss between Pietro and Tommaso. When the lights come back on, however, the two students have different expectations of what might follow. The chaos of awakening desire in its complexity and sensuality is told and made almost physically tangible through looks and gestures, approach and retreat, hope and fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2Cnchds8Sx56YN54AxUlIHrmgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927068'),
  ('961662956970032141', 'The Deponent', 2026, 'Crime', 'Daniel Cayarga', null, 'David Edwin, Chelsea Gilson, Andrea Figliomeni', null, 'A Legal Videographer stumbles into a deadly conspiracy while investigating the suspicious death of a reclusive bar owner, unraveling a tangled web of real estate scams, murder, and deceit-forcing him to confront his own moral limits as everyone around him plays their dangerous game for control and wealth.', 'A Legal Videographer stumbles into a deadly conspiracy while investigating the suspicious death of a reclusive bar owner, unraveling a tangled web of real estate scams, murder, and deceit-forcing him to confront his own moral limits as everyone around him plays their dangerous game for control and wealth.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:the-deponent'),
  ('887898354172462306', 'The Depot of the Dead', 1959, 'Drama', 'Kurt Weber, Czesław Petelski, Stanisław Zylewicz', null, 'Zygmunt Kęstowicz, Emil Karewicz, Teresa Iżewska, Leon Niemczyk, Aleksander Fogiel, Tadeusz Łomnicki, Roman Kłosowski, Adam Kwiatkowski', null, 'In the rugged mountain gorges and ravines of southeastern Poland, a new boss and his wife become a catalyst for violence.', 'In the rugged mountain gorges and ravines of southeastern Poland, a new boss and his wife become a catalyst for violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOt01TUdPG0gTc6tIdKlvOMZOZn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155519'),
