  ('245555207392091340', 'The Derby Stallion', 2005, 'Drama, Family', 'Craig Clyde, John Gunselman', 'Kimberly Gough', 'Zac Efron, Bill Cobbs, William R. Moses, Crystal Hunt, Charles Black, Sarah Blackman, Preston Wigasi Brant, K.C. Clyde', 'PG', 'An alcoholic former horse-trainer perceives in a fifteen-year-old boy a unique gift of horsemanship and makes it possible for the boy to conceive his dream and pursue it.', 'An alcoholic former horse-trainer perceives in a fifteen-year-old boy a unique gift of horsemanship and makes it possible for the boy to conceive his dream and pursue it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9HYV3P2bWp9twNKmLDumyPgRn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19183'),
  ('497133391224649123', 'The Descendants', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alexander Payne, Phedon Papamichael, Tracy Boyd', 'Alexander Payne, Jim Rash, Nat Faxon', 'George Clooney, Shailene Woodley, Amara Miller, Nick Krause, Patricia Hastie, Grace A. Cruz, Kim Gennaula, Karen Kuioka Hironaga', 'R', 'With his wife Elizabeth on life support after a boating accident, Hawaiian land baron Matt King takes his daughters on a trip from Oahu to Kauai to confront a young real estate broker, who was having an affair with Elizabeth before her misfortune.', 'With his wife Elizabeth on life support after a boating accident, Hawaiian land baron Matt King takes his daughters on a trip from Oahu to Kauai to confront a young real estate broker, who was having an affair with Elizabeth before her misfortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cDq5UlOPYeKm39okALCEOsZPxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65057'),
  ('827594221478101370', 'The Descent', 2005, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Neil Marshall, Sam McCurdy, Jack Ravenscroft', 'Neil Marshall', 'Shauna Macdonald, Natalie Mendoza, Alex Reid, MyAnna Buring, Saskia Mulder, Nora-Jane Noone, Leslie Simpson, Oliver Milburn', 'R', 'After a personal tragedy, Sarah joins her friends on a caving expedition in the Appalachian Mountains. But when a rockfall traps them deep underground, their adventure turns into a nightmare. As they search for a way out, the group discovers they are not alone—lurking in the darkness are savage, cave-dwelling creatures. With rising tension and dwindling trust, the women must fight to survive against both the predators and each other.', 'After a personal tragedy, Sarah joins her friends on a caving expedition in the Appalachian Mountains. But when a rockfall traps them deep underground, their adventure turns into a nightmare. As they search for a way out, the group discovers they are not alone—lurking in the darkness are savage, cave-dwelling creatures. With rising tension and dwindling trust, the women must fight to survive against both the predators and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxFPI4KYBk5ri9cPteIS8jiDFgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9392'),
  ('582230257091293412', 'The Descent: Part 2', 2009, 'Adventure, Horror, Thriller', 'Sam McCurdy, Jon Harris, Louise Begbie', 'James Watkins, James McCarthy, J Blakeson', 'Shauna Macdonald, Natalie Mendoza, Gavan O''Herlihy, Josh Dallas, Anna Skellern, Saskia Mulder, Douglas Hodge, Krysten Cummings', 'R', 'Distraught, confused, and half-wild with fear, Sarah Carter emerges alone from the Appalachian cave system where she encountered unspeakable terrors. Unable to plausibly explain to the authorities what happened - or why she''s covered in her friends'' blood - Sarah is forced back to the subterranean depths to help locate her five missing companions.', 'Distraught, confused, and half-wild with fear, Sarah Carter emerges alone from the Appalachian cave system where she encountered unspeakable terrors. Unable to plausibly explain to the authorities what happened - or why she''s covered in her friends'' blood - Sarah is forced back to the subterranean depths to help locate her five missing companions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOURlcw2MO0xys0Dl2NiAcUxlWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34480'),
  ('662464014080716017', 'The Desert', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Christoph Behl', 'Christoph Behl', 'Victoria Almeida, Lautaro Delgado Tymruk, Lucas Lagré, William Prociuk', null, 'The failed story of a love triangle in a post-apocalyptic world.', 'The failed story of a love triangle in a post-apocalyptic world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZAW9d7H7vCVK1QyrHY71wXuWwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206292'),
  ('369477723600666604', 'The Desert Bride', 2017, 'Drama', 'Cecilia Atán, Valeria Pivato, Sergio Armstrong', 'Valeria Pivato, Cecilia Atán', 'Paulina García, Claudio Rissi, Susana Pampín, Coqui, Daniel Muñoz', null, 'Teresa’s life is turned upside down when she is forced to accept a job far away. On her way, she loses her bag, causing her to cross paths with El Gringo, a traveling salesman.', 'Teresa’s life is turned upside down when she is forced to accept a job far away. On her way, she loses her bag, causing her to cross paths with El Gringo, a traveling salesman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufdIxLU0d0QMvtHDZGvRLu7ebrd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451985'),
  ('510295326035200797', 'The Desert Child', 2026, 'Family, Adventure', 'Gilles de Maistre, David Campi-Lemaire, Akrame El Meziane', 'Gilles de Maistre, Prune de Maistre', 'Kev Adams, Nahel Tran, Nahïl Bouazzaoui, Neige de Maistre, Adriane Gradziel', null, '14-year-old Sun has written and successfully published a story based on an incredible story told by her late grandfather about a wild child called Hadara, who is saved by a group of ostriches when he becomes separated from his family in a storm, and is then raised in the desert amid a host of wild animals, including his best friend, a desert fox. When Sun is invited to travel to the Sahara by a local community who has heard about her book, she meets Kharouba, a Nomad girl of her own age, and realizes there may be much more to Hadara than just a character in a bedtime story.', '14-year-old Sun has written and successfully published a story based on an incredible story told by her late grandfather about a wild child called Hadara, who is saved by a group of ostriches when he becomes separated from his family in a storm, and is then raised in the desert amid a host of wild animals, including his best friend, a desert fox. When Sun is invited to travel to the Sahara by a local community who has heard about her book, she meets Kharouba, a Nomad girl of her own age, and realizes there may be much more to Hadara than just a character in a bedtime story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PODwO3sxLAMU9NyffIdYOzxYVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266800'),
  ('626990912162661476', 'The Desert Fox: The Story of Rommel', 1951, 'Action, Drama, History, War', 'Henry Hathaway, Norbert Brodine', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'James Mason, Cedric Hardwicke, Jessica Tandy, Luther Adler, Everett Sloane, Leo G. Carroll, George Macready, Richard Boone', 'NR', 'The life and career of Erwin Rommel and his involvement in the plot to assassinate Hitler.', 'The life and career of Erwin Rommel and his involvement in the plot to assassinate Hitler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqid63zCxtVLmferoP2GYGH6jhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26205'),
  ('212837679080211545', 'The Desert of the Tartars', 1976, 'History, Drama', 'Valerio Zurlini, Christian de Chalonge, Franco Cirino', 'Valerio Zurlini, André G. Brunelin', 'Jacques Perrin, Vittorio Gassman, Giuliano Gemma, Helmut Griem, Philippe Noiret, Francisco Rabal, Fernando Rey, Laurent Terzieff', null, 'Lieutenant Giovanni Drogo is assigned to the old Bastiani border fortress where he expects an imminent attack by nomadic fearsome Tartars.', 'Lieutenant Giovanni Drogo is assigned to the old Bastiani border fortress where he expects an imminent attack by nomadic fearsome Tartars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwNtJlzMo6TZ3FPIEyVWD0vvHb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48203'),
  ('605098498734745680', 'The Desert Rats', 1953, 'War, Action', 'Robert Wise, Lucien Ballard, Richard Maybery', 'Richard Murphy', 'Richard Burton, James Mason, Robert Newton, Robert Douglas, Torin Thatcher, Chips Rafferty, Charles Tingwell, Charles Davis', 'NR', 'In North Africa, German Field Marshal Rommel and his troops have successfully fended off British forces, and now intend to take Tobruk, an important port city. A ramshackle group of Australian reinforcements sent to combat the Germans is put under the command of British Captain MacRoberts. The unruly Aussies immediately clash with MacRoberts, a gruff, strict disciplinarian, however this unorthodox team must band together to protect Tobruk from the German forces.', 'In North Africa, German Field Marshal Rommel and his troops have successfully fended off British forces, and now intend to take Tobruk, an important port city. A ramshackle group of Australian reinforcements sent to combat the Germans is put under the command of British Captain MacRoberts. The unruly Aussies immediately clash with MacRoberts, a gruff, strict disciplinarian, however this unorthodox team must band together to protect Tobruk from the German forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upCaOY9mkgF9tJoiPU8LFbLCkK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36554'),
  ('301883816524263265', 'The Desert Trail', 1935, 'Action, Western', 'Lewis D. Collins, Archie Stout', 'Lindsley Parsons', 'John Wayne, Mary Kornman, Paul Fix, Eddy Chandler, Carmen Laroux, Lafe McKee, Al Ferguson, Henry Hall', 'G', 'Rodeo star John Scott and his gambler friend Kansas Charlie are wrongly accused of armed robbery. They leave town as fast as they can to go looking for their own suspects in Poker City.', 'Rodeo star John Scott and his gambler friend Kansas Charlie are wrongly accused of armed robbery. They leave town as fast as they can to go looking for their own suspects in Poker City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVmticOjrsXFD0b4iR7r5xiR5Fa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53624'),
  ('99706807281336813', 'The Desert Within', 2008, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo Plá', 'Rodrigo Plá, Laura Santullo', 'Mario Zaragoza, Diego Cataño, Eileen Yañez, Luis Fernando Peña, Ximena Ayala, Angelina Peláez, Dolores Heredia, Katia Xanat Espino', null, 'To redeem himself from a great sin, a man dedicates himself to building a church.', 'To redeem himself from a great sin, a man dedicates himself to building a church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6louR5Q9R9fESgKskMbAxOLLcV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73104'),
  ('1139768987058198842', 'The Deserter and the Nomads', 1968, 'Drama, War', 'Juraj Jakubisko, František Velecký, Ján Gogál', 'Juraj Jakubisko, Karol Sidon, Ladislav Ťažký', 'Ferencz Gejza, Mikuláš Ladižinský, Helena Gorovová, Alexandra Sekulová, Albert Vojtech Pagáč, Augustín Kubán, Václav Kovařík, Štefan Pettö', null, 'An apocalyptic story of three wars in three film tales encompassing the end of the WWI,WWII, as well as a vision of the world destroyed by nuclear weapons. This film was honored at the film festivals in Venice and Sorrento. Immediately after that the copy with Italian subtitles was locked in a safe as evidence of the anti-communist activities of the director, who used real footage of the Soviet invasion.', 'An apocalyptic story of three wars in three film tales encompassing the end of the WWI,WWII, as well as a vision of the world destroyed by nuclear weapons. This film was honored at the film festivals in Venice and Sorrento. Immediately after that the copy with Italian subtitles was locked in a safe as evidence of the anti-communist activities of the director, who used real footage of the Soviet invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lazHDlPTxOFMxSmlT8r880mThdH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149898'),
  ('101402232176153211', 'The Design', 1981, 'Animation', 'Jiří Barta, Miloslav Špála', 'Jiří Barta', null, null, 'Animators and urban planners both create worlds, but Czech stop motion specialist Jiří Barta''s ingenious paper cut-out short punctures the stifling architecture of communist housing. Skilled hands blueprint an apartment tower standardized specifications. Envelopes contain the elements of each home. Family dwellings, bachelor pads, scholarly studies and artist studios: different social configurations are permitted but restrained to the same uniform box. A dystopian revision of the REAR WINDOW scenario, THE DESIGN''s darkly comic social critique still has teeth.', 'Animators and urban planners both create worlds, but Czech stop motion specialist Jiří Barta''s ingenious paper cut-out short punctures the stifling architecture of communist housing. Skilled hands blueprint an apartment tower standardized specifications. Envelopes contain the elements of each home. Family dwellings, bachelor pads, scholarly studies and artist studios: different social configurations are permitted but restrained to the same uniform box. A dystopian revision of the REAR WINDOW scenario, THE DESIGN''s darkly comic social critique still has teeth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJzI91oRNwEuS7mguRYTqmEnLkt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280006'),
  ('1121200955089962936', 'The Designated Victim', 1971, 'Thriller', 'Maurizio Lucidi, Angelo Zemella, Aldo Lado', 'Fulvio Gicca Palli', 'Tomas Milian, Pierre Clémenti, Katia Christine, Luigi Casellato, Marisa Bartoli, Ottavio Alessi, Alessandra Cardini, Enzo Tarascio', null, 'Stefano Augenti, an ambitious advertising executive, meets a curious hippie named Count Mateo Tiepolo and they form a strange bond. Seeking an escape from his unhappy marriage, Augenti is lured by the Count into a bizarre plot to kill each other''s relatives.', 'Stefano Augenti, an ambitious advertising executive, meets a curious hippie named Count Mateo Tiepolo and they form a strange bond. Seeking an escape from his unhappy marriage, Augenti is lured by the Count into a bizarre plot to kill each other''s relatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/du0DPGI2wFGHJuhQF1P3l4Irnk6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103067'),
  ('1058541205407966171', 'The Desired War', 2022, 'War, Comedy, Romance', 'Gianni Zanasi, Michele D''Attanasio', 'Gianni Zanasi, Lucio Pellegrini, Michele Pellegrini', 'Edoardo Leo, Miriam Leone, Giuseppe Battiston, Carlotta Natoli, Stefano Fresi, Teco Celio, Antonella Attili, Massimo Popolizio', null, 'A diplomatic incident threatens to break out a war inside Europe that only an unlikely couple of bickering lovers seems able to stop.', 'A diplomatic incident threatens to break out a war inside Europe that only an unlikely couple of bickering lovers seems able to stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvEPAnb7S1rBbfpO6mIvKIqTpm8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852756'),
  ('43392163360816481', 'The Desperado Trail', 1965, 'Adventure, Western', 'Ernst W. Kalinke, Harald Reinl', 'Harald G. Petersson, J. Joachim Bartsch', 'Lex Barker, Pierre Brice, Sophie Hardy, Rik Battaglia, Ralf Wolter, Carl Lange, Miha Baloh, Dušan Antonijević', null, 'Rollins'' gang wants to grab land by inciting the settlers in a war against the Indians but Winnetou and Old Shatterhand try to keep the peace, until Rollins frames Winnetou up for the murder of Jicarilla Chief''s son.', 'Rollins'' gang wants to grab land by inciting the settlers in a war against the Indians but Winnetou and Old Shatterhand try to keep the peace, until Rollins frames Winnetou up for the murder of Jicarilla Chief''s son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pGKMW4QpvljuS2AiEcxyP9RwCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7085'),
  ('607563585475605120', 'The Desperadoes', 1943, 'Western', 'Charles Vidor, George Rhein, George Meehan', 'Robert Carson', 'Randolph Scott, Claire Trevor, Glenn Ford, Evelyn Keyes, Edgar Buchanan, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams, Raymond Walburn, Porter Hall', 'NR', 'Popular mailcoach driver Uncle Willie is in fact in league with the town''s crooked banker. They plan to have the bank robbed after emptying it, and when Willie''s choice for this doesn''t show in time, he gets some local boys to do it. When his man does turn up he decides to stick around, as he is pals with the sheriff and also takes a shine to Willie''s daughter Allison. This gives the bad men several new problems.', 'Popular mailcoach driver Uncle Willie is in fact in league with the town''s crooked banker. They plan to have the bank robbed after emptying it, and when Willie''s choice for this doesn''t show in time, he gets some local boys to do it. When his man does turn up he decides to stick around, as he is pals with the sheriff and also takes a shine to Willie''s daughter Allison. This gives the bad men several new problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNC9av3DgKnNm3Ly5P44blqspOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59882'),
  ('34406871130617069', 'The Desperados', 1969, 'Western, Action', 'Henry Levin, Sam Leavitt', 'Walter Brough', 'Vince Edwards, Sylvia Syms, Benjamin Edney, Jack Palance, Sheila Burrell, George Maharis, Kate O''Mara, Christian Roberts', null, 'A Confederate and his sons become postwar marauders and face another son who left them, in Texas.', 'A Confederate and his sons become postwar marauders and face another son who left them, in Texas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eb6xRtHoKcCLycHJFqxWqYFpS1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102488'),
  ('524796664367815565', 'The Desperate Hour', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Beau Ferris, John Brawley, Phillip Noyce', 'Chris Sparling', 'Naomi Watts, Colton Gobbo, Sierra Maltby, Michelle Johnston, Woodrow Schrieber, David Reale, Jason Clarke, Debra Wilson', 'PG-13', 'A woman desperately races to save her child after police place her hometown on lockdown due to an active shooter incident.', 'A woman desperately races to save her child after police place her hometown on lockdown due to an active shooter incident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6Pg9eTklhg6Aa7kXaxrfdE1Chi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764835'),
  ('318863521739289994', 'The Desperate Hours', 1955, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Lee Garmes, William Wyler, Charles C. Coleman', 'Joseph Hayes', 'Humphrey Bogart, Fredric March, Arthur Kennedy, Martha Scott, Dewey Martin, Gig Young, Mary Murphy, Richard Eyer', null, 'Escaped convicts terrorize a suburban family they''re holding hostage.', 'Escaped convicts terrorize a suburban family they''re holding hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yW9S2jc4elEeNfzwXhm5sF9GTCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18612'),
  ('986661265186850714', 'The Desperate Trail', 1994, 'Western, Action, Drama, Crime', 'P.J. Pesce, Michael Bonvillain, Chris Edmonds', 'Tom Abrams, P.J. Pesce', 'Sam Elliott, Craig Sheffer, Linda Fiorentino, Frank Whaley, John Furlong, Bradley Whitford, Gretchen Becker, Robin Westphal', 'R', 'Amiable con man Jack Cooper is on a westbound stagecoach, headed for the next batch of suckers who will mistake him for an easy mark. Fiery Sarah O''Rourke rides the same coach, handcuffed to lawman Bill Speakes and headed for the hangman. In a few hours, all should reach their destinations. But the trail they travel takes an unexpected turn: Cooper and O''Rourke are soon off the stage and running for their lives. The law ends and the chase begins in a very alive tale of wanted-dead-or-alive fugitives (Linda Fiorentino and Craig Sheffer) pursued by a marshal (Sam Elliott) who''s a law unto himself.', 'Amiable con man Jack Cooper is on a westbound stagecoach, headed for the next batch of suckers who will mistake him for an easy mark. Fiery Sarah O''Rourke rides the same coach, handcuffed to lawman Bill Speakes and headed for the hangman. In a few hours, all should reach their destinations. But the trail they travel takes an unexpected turn: Cooper and O''Rourke are soon off the stage and running for their lives. The law ends and the chase begins in a very alive tale of wanted-dead-or-alive fugitives (Linda Fiorentino and Craig Sheffer) pursued by a marshal (Sam Elliott) who''s a law unto himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wH2QZv3aTBOmM7DMhpu1qK0pNp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67051'),
  ('804768155217180064', 'The Detached Mission', 1986, 'Action', 'Mikhail Tumanishvili, Boris Bondarenko, Aleksandr Khasin', 'Yevgeni Mesyatsev', 'Mikhail Nozhkin, Aleksandr Fatyushin, Sergei Nasibov, Nartai Begalin, Vitaliy Zikora, Arnis Līcītis, Oleg Golubitsky, Valerian Vinogradov', null, 'In the waters of the Pacific Ocean, regular maneuvers of the Soviet and American squadrons are taking place. After months of autonomous navigation, our military frigate heads to its home base. The distress signal received forces sailors to change course. The CIA arranges a provocation: on a secret American base, one of the missile launchers was prepared for a real strike on the enemy’s squadron. Instead of saving people, Soviet sailors will have to intervene in the deadly game started by NATO. At the cost of tremendous effort, the crew of one of the Soviet ships managed to prevent the catastrophe provoked by CIA agents. They enter a real battle...', 'In the waters of the Pacific Ocean, regular maneuvers of the Soviet and American squadrons are taking place. After months of autonomous navigation, our military frigate heads to its home base. The distress signal received forces sailors to change course. The CIA arranges a provocation: on a secret American base, one of the missile launchers was prepared for a real strike on the enemy’s squadron. Instead of saving people, Soviet sailors will have to intervene in the deadly game started by NATO. At the cost of tremendous effort, the crew of one of the Soviet ships managed to prevent the catastrophe provoked by CIA agents. They enter a real battle...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpLRU5XDQYwfZwxkmZOmS5ixutO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67845'),
  ('819839569033681961', 'The Details', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jacob Aaron Estes, Sharone Meir', 'Jacob Aaron Estes', 'Tobey Maguire, Elizabeth Banks, Kerry Washington, Ray Liotta, Laura Linney, Dennis Haysbert, Gary Schwartz, Cathy Vu', 'R', 'When a family of raccoons discover worms living underneath the sod in Jeff and Nealy''s backyard, this pest problem begins a darkly comic and wild chain reaction of domestic tension, infidelity and murder.', 'When a family of raccoons discover worms living underneath the sod in Jeff and Nealy''s backyard, this pest problem begins a darkly comic and wild chain reaction of domestic tension, infidelity and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejpsft6Utt4sHS68IcHTOgUjKhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135647'),
  ('36091835661650802', 'The Detective', 1968, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Gordon Douglas, Richard Lang, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Roderick Thorp', 'Frank Sinatra, Lee Remick, Ralph Meeker, Jack Klugman, Horace McMahon, Lloyd Bochner, William Windom, Tony Musante', 'PG', 'Police detective Joe Leland investigates the murder of a gay man.', 'Police detective Joe Leland investigates the murder of a gay man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMUJzLhzFotnJdi7WA9fE9xv5Te.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42636'),
  ('800220017581178077', 'The Detective', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Decha Srimantra, Jil Wong Pak-Kei', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Pang Pak-Sing', 'Aaron Kwok, Liu Kai-Chi, Kenny Wong Tak-Ban, Lau Siu-Ming, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Shing Fui-On, Kiki Sheung, Jo Kok Cho-Lam', null, 'A private detective is drawn into a complex murder mystery when he is hired to track down a missing young woman.', 'A private detective is drawn into a complex murder mystery when he is hired to track down a missing young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bgbtjBPp4xr2kev7n121EG5wLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56329'),
  ('504347382717863784', 'The Detonator', 2006, 'Action, Thriller', 'Leong Po-Chih, Richard Greatrex, Mihnea Vieru', 'Martin Wheeler', 'Wesley Snipes, Silvia Colloca, Warren Derosa, William Hope, Michael Brandon, Matthew Leitch, Tim Dutton, Bogdan Uritescu', 'R', 'Sonni Griffith, a top US Secret Agent must protect a witness as he crosses Europe.', 'Sonni Griffith, a top US Secret Agent must protect a witness as he crosses Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tt7p76n4cDBew4CT0dxC62cx7PU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24624'),
  ('995789930306522895', 'The Devil', 1988, 'Horror, History, Drama', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Krystyna Grochowicz, Krzysztof Wierzbiański', 'Andrzej Żuławski', 'Wojciech Pszoniak, Leszek Teleszyński, Małgorzata Braunek, Iga Mayr, Wiktor Sadecki, Michał Grudziński, Maciej Englert, Monika Niemczyk', null, 'Young Polish nobleman Jakub is saved from imprisonment by a stranger. In return, the stranger wants to obtain a list of Jakub’s fellow conspirators. As he follows his mysterious savior across the country, Jakub is affected by the overall chaos and moral corruption; he goes insane and becomes a mass murderer.', 'Young Polish nobleman Jakub is saved from imprisonment by a stranger. In return, the stranger wants to obtain a list of Jakub’s fellow conspirators. As he follows his mysterious savior across the country, Jakub is affected by the overall chaos and moral corruption; he goes insane and becomes a mass murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12vWPiAnnI7Ua2ByPBsVegrXfJo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95043'),
  ('894091281622901492', 'The Devil', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Gabriel Périot', 'Jean-Gabriel Périot', null, null, 'Documentary short about the Black Panther movement.', 'Documentary short about the Black Panther movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTmotxhxtQb4JUMKXMumbAQB8yf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351446'),
  ('349891654163903516', 'The Devil All the Time', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Antonio Campos, Lol Crawley, Brian Bettwy', 'Paulo Campos, Antonio Campos', 'Tom Holland, Robert Pattinson, Bill Skarsgård, Riley Keough, Jason Clarke, Sebastian Stan, Haley Bennett, Harry Melling', 'R', 'In Knockemstiff, Ohio and its neighboring backwoods, sinister characters converge around young Arvin Russell as he fights the evil forces that threaten him and his family.', 'In Knockemstiff, Ohio and its neighboring backwoods, sinister characters converge around young Arvin Russell as he fights the evil forces that threaten him and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVL7LGq528h3KzeNI90HOVbV5uW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499932'),
  ('46080966818115007', 'The Devil and Daniel Johnston', 2006, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jeff Feuerzeig, Fortunato Procopio', 'Jeff Feuerzeig', 'Daniel Johnston, Bill Johnston, Margie Johnston, Mabel Johnston, Jeff Tartakov, Kathy McCarty, Dick Johnston, Laurie Allen', 'PG-13', 'This 2005 documentary film chronicles the life of Daniel Johnston, a manic-depressive genius singer/songwriter/artist, from childhood up to the present, with an emphasis on his mental illness and how it manifested itself in demonic self-obsession.', 'This 2005 documentary film chronicles the life of Daniel Johnston, a manic-depressive genius singer/songwriter/artist, from childhood up to the present, with an emphasis on his mental illness and how it manifested itself in demonic self-obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7c5FUlodgZl52tMlpw2G64kqttt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13222'),
  ('397610808090390360', 'The Devil and Daniel Mouse', 1978, 'Animation, Music, Fantasy, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Clive A. Smith', 'Ken Sobol', 'Chris Wiggins, Annabel Kershaw, Martin Lavut, Jim Henshaw, Valerie Carter, John Sebastian, Dianne Lawrence', null, 'When a young female mouse makes a deal with the devil to become a rock star and learns the price, her boyfriend has to help her avoid damnation.', 'When a young female mouse makes a deal with the devil to become a rock star and learns the price, her boyfriend has to help her avoid damnation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15Iq0acwEd90gs2vLwNN0kNwIQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60637'),
  ('81414641277829809', 'The Devil and Father Amorth', 2018, 'Documentary, Horror', 'William Friedkin', 'Mark Kermode, William Friedkin', 'William Friedkin, Gabriele Amorth', null, 'William Friedkin attends an exorcism with Father Gabriele Amorth, as he treats an Italian woman named Cristina for the ninth time. Prior to filming, Cristina had purportedly been experiencing behavioural changes and “fits” that could not be explained by psychiatry, and which became worse during Christian holidays.', 'William Friedkin attends an exorcism with Father Gabriele Amorth, as he treats an Italian woman named Cristina for the ninth time. Prior to filming, Cristina had purportedly been experiencing behavioural changes and “fits” that could not be explained by psychiatry, and which became worse during Christian holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/de5VAk2YiONqmoXzyOO80QyM0Xa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457775'),
  ('854442156962521702', 'The Devil and Holy Water', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Corbucci, Giorgio Di Battista, Roberto Tatti', 'Mario Amendola, Bruno Corbucci', 'Tomas Milian, Piero Mazzarella, Margherita Fumero, Savina Geršak, Giacomo Rizzo, Luca Sportelli, Andrea Aureli, Alfredo Rizzo', null, 'Bruno Marangoni, former center-forward of Rome, has fallen into disgrace due to a series of injuries, and now lives with gimmicks and small scams. At the height of despair he decides to commit suicide but is saved by the parish priest of a village, so he decides to move to the rectory', 'Bruno Marangoni, former center-forward of Rome, has fallen into disgrace due to a series of injuries, and now lives with gimmicks and small scams. At the height of despair he decides to commit suicide but is saved by the parish priest of a village, so he decides to move to the rectory', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAng84tnn870gi78nSs8HVY8vFi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124207'),
  ('557983950725601320', 'The Devil and Max Devlin', 1981, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Steven Hilliard Stern, Howard Schwartz', 'Mary Rodgers', 'Elliott Gould, Bill Cosby, Susan Anspach, Adam Rich, Julie Budd, Sonny Shroyer, David Knell, Chuck Shamata', 'PG', 'When Max dies in an accident, he goes straight to Hell. But the Devil Barney makes him an offer: if he manages to get three innocent youths to sell him their souls in the next two months, he may stay on Earth. Max accepts, and returns to Earth, equipped with special powers. However, his task is harder than expected, especially when seven year old Tobi demands that he marry his mother.', 'When Max dies in an accident, he goes straight to Hell. But the Devil Barney makes him an offer: if he manages to get three innocent youths to sell him their souls in the next two months, he may stay on Earth. Max accepts, and returns to Earth, equipped with special powers. However, his task is harder than expected, especially when seven year old Tobi demands that he marry his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5XOONi82ThL4r5K20BKsWIhmi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40866'),
  ('1014970439022189535', 'The Devil and Miss Jones', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sam Wood, Harry Stradling Sr., Roy Webb', 'Norman Krasna', 'Charles Coburn, Jean Arthur, Robert Cummings, Edmund Gwenn, Spring Byington, S.Z. Sakall, William Demarest, Walter Kingsford', 'NR', 'The wealthiest man in the world, John P. Merrick, is a private person who likes to stay anonymous. One of his many assets is Neeley''s Department Store. There is labor unrest at the store, and the employees'' anger is directed at him, who they hang in effigy outside the store despite not knowing what he looks like. Merrick, not happy at what he sees going on, decides to mete out the rabble-rousers. So he goes undercover as a sales clerk in the shoe department.', 'The wealthiest man in the world, John P. Merrick, is a private person who likes to stay anonymous. One of his many assets is Neeley''s Department Store. There is labor unrest at the store, and the employees'' anger is directed at him, who they hang in effigy outside the store despite not knowing what he looks like. Merrick, not happy at what he sees going on, decides to mete out the rabble-rousers. So he goes undercover as a sales clerk in the shoe department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spGm2v3Jpg5l5xZS9xjKYNrLYF1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43801'),
  ('556368859606811210', 'The Devil and Ms. D', 1999, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Bernd Eichinger', 'Bernd Eichinger, Helmut Krausser', 'Til Schweiger, Corinna Harfouch, Sonja Kerskes, Christine Neubauer, Thomas Heinze, Christof Wackernagel, Stephan Kampwirth, Antoine Monot Jr.', null, 'Is he really the devil incarnate, as he claims? Or is he a dangerous weirdo who uses his stories to get the best out of women? Because in any case he is one thing: a great seducer, to whom the psychologist Cora falls hopelessly; he is the target of her unfulfilled dreams, her most secret longings. The reason to completely change her life and even commit a perfect murder...', 'Is he really the devil incarnate, as he claims? Or is he a dangerous weirdo who uses his stories to get the best out of women? Because in any case he is one thing: a great seducer, to whom the psychologist Cora falls hopelessly; he is the target of her unfulfilled dreams, her most secret longings. The reason to completely change her life and even commit a perfect murder...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3CeMSbZhFOH57KJabMcboGm5AL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9765'),
  ('829972824251202519', 'The Devil and the Statue', 1901, 'Romance, Horror, Fantasy, Drama', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'At the beginning of the scene Romeo in his gondola sings to Juliet a sentimental song, then goes away. Hardly has he departed when the colonnade falls to pieces, disclosing the devil. Juliet, frightened, runs to the window and calls Romeo. The latter attempts to enter and protect his fiancée, but at a gesture from the devil the window is instantly covered with a grating and Romeo makes frantic efforts to break it. The devil begins to dance a wild dance before Juliet, who is beside herself from terror. The devil gradually becomes the size of a giant (a novel effect). Juliet implores the statue of Madonna, which becomes animated, descends from its pedestal, and stretching out its arms orders the devil to disappear. (Méliès Catalog)', 'At the beginning of the scene Romeo in his gondola sings to Juliet a sentimental song, then goes away. Hardly has he departed when the colonnade falls to pieces, disclosing the devil. Juliet, frightened, runs to the window and calls Romeo. The latter attempts to enter and protect his fiancée, but at a gesture from the devil the window is instantly covered with a grating and Romeo makes frantic efforts to break it. The devil begins to dance a wild dance before Juliet, who is beside herself from terror. The devil gradually becomes the size of a giant (a novel effect). Juliet implores the statue of Madonna, which becomes animated, descends from its pedestal, and stretching out its arms orders the devil to disappear. (Méliès Catalog)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tl4tipCCxZG8Mes6Lb0pS1Wlm0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107439'),
  ('1121379557475387972', 'The Devil and the Ten Commandments', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Julien Duvivier, Tony Aboyantz, Pierre Desfons', 'Julien Duvivier', 'Claude Rich, Françoise Arnoul, Charles Aznavour, Jean-Claude Brialy, Danielle Darrieux, Alain Delon, Fernandel, Mel Ferrer', null, 'The film consists of seven roughly 15 minute episodes, each showing what will happen if one or more of the Ten Commandments will be broken: Jérome Chambard is warned that he will lose his job if he continues to swear; Françoise Beaufort enamored of a stripper calls on her only to find her married to a janitor who doesn''t know what kind of dancing his wife performs; Denis, a Jesuit novice, leaves the order to avenge his sister''s suicide, which was provoked by Garigny, who seduced her into prostitution and drug addiction; Philip buys a necklace for Micheline though he is bored with her; a young man find out that his real mother is not Madeleine, but actress Clarisse Ardant; Didier Marin, cashier of a bank, was fired by his boss; the Devil appears as a serpent for Jérome Chambard and the bishop are eating.', 'The film consists of seven roughly 15 minute episodes, each showing what will happen if one or more of the Ten Commandments will be broken: Jérome Chambard is warned that he will lose his job if he continues to swear; Françoise Beaufort enamored of a stripper calls on her only to find her married to a janitor who doesn''t know what kind of dancing his wife performs; Denis, a Jesuit novice, leaves the order to avenge his sister''s suicide, which was provoked by Garigny, who seduced her into prostitution and drug addiction; Philip buys a necklace for Micheline though he is bored with her; a young man find out that his real mother is not Madeleine, but actress Clarisse Ardant; Didier Marin, cashier of a bank, was fired by his boss; the Devil appears as a serpent for Jérome Chambard and the bishop are eating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIJUl5m4zbqUnb9qWdgmr684lQZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53386'),
  ('997178779296684378', 'The Devil at 4 O''Clock', 1961, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Mervyn LeRoy', 'Liam O''Brien', 'Spencer Tracy, Frank Sinatra, Kerwin Mathews, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Grégoire Aslan, Alexander Scourby, BarBara Luna, Bernie Hamilton', null, 'A crusty, eccentric priest recruits three reluctant convicts to help him rescue a children''s leper colony from a Pacific island menaced by a smoldering volcano.', 'A crusty, eccentric priest recruits three reluctant convicts to help him rescue a children''s leper colony from a Pacific island menaced by a smoldering volcano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3HVHD54IZNoujxUzIwYx51ARNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31916'),
  ('997768252390620451', 'The Devil Bat', 1940, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Jean Yarbrough, Arthur Martinelli, David Chudnow', 'John T. Neville', 'Bela Lugosi, Suzanne Kaaren, Dave O''Brien, Guy Usher, Yolande Donlan, Donald Kerr, Edmund Mortimer, Gene O''Donnell', 'NR', 'Dr. Paul Carruthers is frustrated because he thinks his employers, Mary Heath and Henry Morton, have cheated him out of the company''s profits. He decides to get revenge by altering bats to grow twice their normal size and training them to attack when they smell a perfume of his own making. He mixes the perfume into a lotion, which he offers as a gift to Mary and Henry. When they turn up dead, a newspaper reporter decides to investigate.', 'Dr. Paul Carruthers is frustrated because he thinks his employers, Mary Heath and Henry Morton, have cheated him out of the company''s profits. He decides to get revenge by altering bats to grow twice their normal size and training them to attack when they smell a perfume of his own making. He mixes the perfume into a lotion, which he offers as a gift to Mary and Henry. When they turn up dead, a newspaper reporter decides to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1boVvNLVKYbP2H7MoGol9sQAIH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41021'),
  ('755276183753373087', 'The Devil Below', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dave Halls, Bradley Parker, Morgan Susser', 'Stefan Jaworski, Eric Scherbarth', 'Alicia Sanz, Adan Canto, Will Patton, Zach Avery, Chinaza Uche, Jonathan Sadowski, Jesse LaTourette, William Mark McCullough', null, 'A group of four amateur adventurers who specialize in exploring remote and forsaken places pay a visit to Shookum Hills, a town in the remote Appalachian Mountains which was abandoned decades ago due to a mysterious coal mine fire.', 'A group of four amateur adventurers who specialize in exploring remote and forsaken places pay a visit to Shookum Hills, a town in the remote Appalachian Mountains which was abandoned decades ago due to a mysterious coal mine fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKpkB86oJ2IyIlpGLTF66zBPSDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760875'),
  ('786346136355600355', 'The Devil by the Tail', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Philippe de Broca, Jean Penzer, Claude Miller', 'Daniel Boulanger, Claude Sautet', 'Yves Montand, Madeleine Renaud, Maria Schell, Jean Rochefort, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Marthe Keller, Claude Piéplu, Xavier Gélin', null, 'In this comedy, a run-down hotel drums up customers by sabotaging passing cars. The stuck motorists are then obliged to stay. Unfortunately, one of the sabotaged cars belongs to a bank robber. The hotel staff wants the robber out, but they also want to keep his ill-gotten money.', 'In this comedy, a run-down hotel drums up customers by sabotaging passing cars. The stuck motorists are then obliged to stay. Unfortunately, one of the sabotaged cars belongs to a bank robber. The hotel staff wants the robber out, but they also want to keep his ill-gotten money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8stBuzOkXfu7DXiWJPzwhhTrxfi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79446'),
  ('933489616554882462', 'The Devil Came from Akasava', 1971, 'Adventure, Thriller', 'Manuel Merino, Jesús Franco', 'Paul André, Ladislas Fodor', 'Fred Williams, Soledad Miranda, Horst Tappert, Ewa Strömberg, Siegfried Schürenberg, Walter Rilla, Blandine Ebinger, Howard Vernon', null, 'A mineral is discovered which can turn metal to gold or humans into zombies. When the mineral is stolen, secret agents are sent in to get the mineral back!', 'A mineral is discovered which can turn metal to gold or humans into zombies. When the mineral is stolen, secret agents are sent in to get the mineral back!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdvfQDnxeqUFibFAfMokjKa068e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5623'),
  ('605353820977989749', 'The Devil Comes at Night', 2023, 'Horror', 'Scott Leaver, Nelson Rogers, Shawn Ahmed', 'Ryan Allen, Adrienne Kress, Scott Leaver', 'Jason Martorino, Elias Zarou, Jeremiah Sparks, Julie Cohn, Ty Andrassy, Scott Leaver, Adrienne Kress, Dana Fradkin', null, 'A washed up boxer searching for his inheritance must fight for his life when he is trapped in his deceased father''s farmhouse by a local cannibal cult.', 'A washed up boxer searching for his inheritance must fight for his life when he is trapped in his deceased father''s farmhouse by a local cannibal cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QIeZuKirT4cXVpW7ilVZmcRmdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1051560'),
  ('62648313486789639', 'The Devil Commands', 1941, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Edward Dmytryk, Allen G. Siegler, Morris Stoloff', 'Milton Gunzburg, Robert Hardy Andrews', 'Boris Karloff, Richard Fiske, Amanda Duff, Anne Revere, Dorothy Adams, Walter Baldwin, Kenneth MacDonald, Shirley Warde', 'NR', 'A story about a scientist who is obsessed with communicating with the dead.', 'A story about a scientist who is obsessed with communicating with the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVAKzdJV9suPxnhtwWQSmzE3gBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30307'),
  ('97885898205323111', 'The Devil Conspiracy', 2023, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Nathan Frankowski', 'Ed Alan', 'Alice Orr-Ewing, Joe Doyle, Eveline Hall, Peter Mensah, Joe Anderson, Brian Caspe, Spencer Wilding, James Faulkner', 'R', 'A powerful biotech company has breakthrough technology allowing them to clone history’s most influential people with just a few fragments of DNA. Behind this company is a cabal of Satanists that steals the shroud of Christ, putting them in possession of Jesus’ DNA. The clone will serve as the ultimate offering to the devil. The Archangel Michael comes to earth and will stop at nothing to end the devil’s conspiracy.', 'A powerful biotech company has breakthrough technology allowing them to clone history’s most influential people with just a few fragments of DNA. Behind this company is a cabal of Satanists that steals the shroud of Christ, putting them in possession of Jesus’ DNA. The clone will serve as the ultimate offering to the devil. The Archangel Michael comes to earth and will stop at nothing to end the devil’s conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZCWgbIq2IBDRMJmdx5NeYbbigL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296271'),
