  ('147337976248444643', 'The Devil Inside', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'William Brent Bell, Gonzalo Amat, Adriana Itu', 'William Brent Bell, Matthew Peterman', 'Fernanda Andrade, Simon Quarterman, Evan Helmuth, Ionut Grama, Suzan Crowley, Bonnie Morgan, Brian D. Johnson, John Prosky', 'R', 'In Italy, a woman becomes involved in a series of unauthorized exorcisms during her mission to discover what happened to her mother, who allegedly murdered three people during her own exorcism.', 'In Italy, a woman becomes involved in a series of unauthorized exorcisms during her mission to discover what happened to her mother, who allegedly murdered three people during her own exorcism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtyFRIRBmrCE2XKU5EnEK8dtu2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76487'),
