  ('282485912388448063', 'The Devil Is a Sissy', 1936, 'Comedy, Drama', 'W.S. Van Dyke, George Schneiderman, Harold Rosson', 'Richard Schayer, John Lee Mahin', 'Freddie Bartholomew, Jackie Cooper, Mickey Rooney, Ian Hunter, Peggy Conklin, Katharine Alexander, Gene Lockhart, Kathleen Lockhart', 'G', 'A well-bred young English lad living in lower Manhattan tries to gain acceptance from his not-so-well-bred peers at school.', 'A well-bred young English lad living in lower Manhattan tries to gain acceptance from his not-so-well-bred peers at school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9DOU8L48d5nVVdF57WwcD35DCn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88031'),
  ('950150769250531285', 'The Devil Is a Woman', 1935, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, History', 'Lucien Ballard, Josef von Sternberg, Josef von Sternberg', 'David Hertz, Oran Schee', 'Marlene Dietrich, Lionel Atwill, Edward Everett Horton, Alison Skipworth, Cesar Romero, Don Alvarado, Tempe Pigott, Francisco Moreno', 'NR', 'In the carnival in Spain in the beginning of the Twentieth Century, the exiled republican Antonio Galvan comes from Paris masquerade to enjoy the party and visit his friend Capt. Don Pasqual ''Pasqualito'' Costelar. However, he flirts with the mysterious Concha Perez and they schedule to meet each other later. When Antonio meets Pasqualito, his old friend discloses his frustrated relationship with the promiscuous Concha and her greedy mother and how his life was ruined by his obsession for the beautiful demimondaine. Pasqualito makes Antonio promise that he would not see Concha. However, when Antonio meets Concha, she seduces him and the long friendship between Antonio and Pasqualito is disrupted', 'In the carnival in Spain in the beginning of the Twentieth Century, the exiled republican Antonio Galvan comes from Paris masquerade to enjoy the party and visit his friend Capt. Don Pasqual ''Pasqualito'' Costelar. However, he flirts with the mysterious Concha Perez and they schedule to meet each other later. When Antonio meets Pasqualito, his old friend discloses his frustrated relationship with the promiscuous Concha and her greedy mother and how his life was ruined by his obsession for the beautiful demimondaine. Pasqualito makes Antonio promise that he would not see Concha. However, when Antonio meets Concha, she seduces him and the long friendship between Antonio and Pasqualito is disrupted', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cc5HUdBbnMSST78sfujsOU4T0Vk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42943'),
  ('1017763774164460496', 'The Devil Is Busy', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Christalyn Hampton, Geeta Gandbhir, Amber Fares', null, null, 'PG-13', 'At an Atlanta abortion clinic besieged by protesters, the director of operations, Tracii, takes necessary risks to safeguard staff and patients.', 'At an Atlanta abortion clinic besieged by protesters, the director of operations, Tracii, takes necessary risks to safeguard staff and patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75GH49xL5kEzyYeXGiOPy2FIZGe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1373150'),
  ('964898075510617945', 'The Devil Lives Here', 2016, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Dante Vescio, Rodrigo Gasparini', 'Rafael Ballu', 'Clara Verdier, Mariana Cortines, Diego Goullart, Pedro Carvalho, Felipe Frazão, Pedro Caetano, Sidney Santiago, Ivo Müller', 'PG-13', 'Three teenagers go visit a friend at his old farmhouse for the weekend. What they didn''t expect was to be stuck in the middle of a centenary war between good and evil.', 'Three teenagers go visit a friend at his old farmhouse for the weekend. What they didn''t expect was to be stuck in the middle of a centenary war between good and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8zNagqlMBYsMZOJpLEf7xhinxm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389849'),
  ('634978345551180188', 'The Devil Makes Three', 1952, 'Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Andrew Marton', 'Jerry Davis', 'Gene Kelly, Pier Angeli, Richard Rober, Richard Egan, Claus Clausen, Wilfried Seyferth, Margot Hielscher, Heinrich Gretler', 'NR', 'Jeff Elliot is an American GI investigating a black market gang in Munich.', 'Jeff Elliot is an American GI investigating a black market gang in Munich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7PXO0cFMXRZIhvzx0tzxIbVEOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99691'),
  ('310764927610491322', 'The Devil on Trial', 2023, 'Documentary, Drama, Crime', 'Chris Holt, Brendan McGinty', 'Chris Holt', 'Carlo Adamo, Hannah Mae Beatty, David Glanzer, Debbie Glatzel, Foster Hamilton, Adam Hunt, Arne Cheyenne Johnson, Kathy Rupcic', 'R', 'Explore the first – and only – time “demonic possession” has officially been used as a defense in a U.S. murder trial. Including firsthand accounts of alleged devil possession and a shocking murder, this extraordinary story forces reflection on our fear of the unknown.', 'Explore the first – and only – time “demonic possession” has officially been used as a defense in a U.S. murder trial. Including firsthand accounts of alleged devil possession and a shocking murder, this extraordinary story forces reflection on our fear of the unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqPIhVKPHePyGqQxbo4gpznsJsA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1171989'),
