  ('994605061518947784', 'The Devil Queen', 1974, 'Crime, Drama', 'Antonio Carlos da Fontoura, Emiliano Ribeiro, José Medeiros', 'Antonio Carlos da Fontoura', 'Milton Gonçalves, Stepan Nercessian, Nelson Xavier, Odete Lara, Wilson Grey, Lutero Luiz, Yara Cortes, Kim Negro', null, 'Rio''s criminal underworld is run by an unexpected boss: a femme Queen with a taste for power and violence. But heavy lies the crown: what Queen can trust her subjects, however fabulous? When she sets up a stoolie to take the fall for her boy, a plot against Her Majesty arises!', 'Rio''s criminal underworld is run by an unexpected boss: a femme Queen with a taste for power and violence. But heavy lies the crown: what Queen can trust her subjects, however fabulous? When she sets up a stoolie to take the fall for her boy, a plot against Her Majesty arises!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQd3yiCFGX7WIjEpH6sGatiei6j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259881'),
  ('1004343492213579848', 'The Devil Rides Out', 1968, 'Horror', 'Terence Fisher, Arthur Grant, Bernard Robinson', 'Richard Matheson', 'Christopher Lee, Leon Greene, Patrick Mower, Niké Arrighi, Charles Gray, Sarah Lawson, Paul Eddington, Patrick Allen', 'G', 'The powers of good are pitted against the forces of evil as the Duc de Richelieu wrestles with the charming but deadly Satanist, Mocata, for the soul of his friend. Mocata has the knowledge and the power to summon the forces of darkness and, as the Duc de Richelieu and his friends remain within the protected pentacle, they are subjected to ever-increasing horror until thundering hooves herald the arrival of the Angel of Death.', 'The powers of good are pitted against the forces of evil as the Duc de Richelieu wrestles with the charming but deadly Satanist, Mocata, for the soul of his friend. Mocata has the knowledge and the power to summon the forces of darkness and, as the Duc de Richelieu and his friends remain within the protected pentacle, they are subjected to ever-increasing horror until thundering hooves herald the arrival of the Angel of Death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1AWO8PIMfT6XGHV8uaa8erencj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39891'),
  ('362410885085528939', 'The Devil Strikes at Night', 1957, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Robert Siodmak, Georg Krause, Walter Boos', 'Werner Jörg Lüddecke', 'Claus Holm, Mario Adorf, Hannes Messemer, Peter Carsten, Carl Lange, Werner Peters, Annemarie Düringer, Monika John', null, 'Hamburg, Germany, 1944, during World War II. A serial killer terrorizes the city. When it seems clear that the local police are unable to catch him, forces as dark and terrible as the criminal himself become involved in the case.', 'Hamburg, Germany, 1944, during World War II. A serial killer terrorizes the city. When it seems clear that the local police are unable to catch him, forces as dark and terrible as the criminal himself become involved in the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sZjljOR09AQ9oSBhDDkMeWtpVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103396'),
  ('572952261310304760', 'The Devil Thumbs a Ride', 1947, 'Thriller, Crime', 'J. Roy Hunt, Felix E. Feist', 'Felix E. Feist', 'Lawrence Tierney, Ted North, Nan Leslie, Betty Lawford, Andrew Tombes, Harry Shannon, Marian Carr, William Gould', 'NR', 'Steve Morgan kills a man in a holdup and hitches a ride to Los Angeles with Fergie. At a gas station, they pick up two women. Encountering a roadblock, Morgan takes over and persuades the party to spend the night at an unoccupied beach house. The police close in as one by one, the others learn that Morgan is a killer.', 'Steve Morgan kills a man in a holdup and hitches a ride to Los Angeles with Fergie. At a gas station, they pick up two women. Encountering a roadblock, Morgan takes over and persuades the party to spend the night at an unoccupied beach house. The police close in as one by one, the others learn that Morgan is a killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/km6t4Ics2nesHLkvFpG9bNK5Aaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29470'),
  ('558900434742450177', 'The Devil to Pay', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Sherman Johnson, Ruckus Skye, Lane Skye', 'Lane Skye, Ruckus Skye', 'Danielle Deadwyler, Catherine Dyer, Jayson Warner Smith, Parisa Johnston, Adam Boyer, Allison Maier, Charles Black, Brad Carter', null, 'After the disappearance of her husband, a struggling farmer in an isolated Appalachian community fights to save her son when the cold-hearted matriarch of the oldest family on the mountain demands payment of a debt that could destroy a decades-old truce.', 'After the disappearance of her husband, a struggling farmer in an isolated Appalachian community fights to save her son when the cold-hearted matriarch of the oldest family on the mountain demands payment of a debt that could destroy a decades-old truce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VaJuPGaqxJ0Un8pbw5jL7uvWfS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637620'),
  ('973539506506209267', 'The Devil to Pay!', 1930, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Fitzmaurice, Gregg Toland, George Barnes', null, 'Ronald Colman, Loretta Young, Frederick Kerr, David Torrence, Florence Britton, Myrna Loy, Paul Cavanagh, Crauford Kent', 'NR', 'Spendthrift Willie Hale again returns penniless to the family home in London. His father is none too pleased, but Willie smooth-talks him into letting him stay. At the same time he turns the charm on Dorothy Hope, whose father is big in linoleum and who, before Willie''s arrival, was about to become engaged to a Russian aristocrat.', 'Spendthrift Willie Hale again returns penniless to the family home in London. His father is none too pleased, but Willie smooth-talks him into letting him stay. At the same time he turns the charm on Dorothy Hope, whose father is big in linoleum and who, before Willie''s arrival, was about to become engaged to a Russian aristocrat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IQm2kkFMCxHzPqDG4AA4s7BAji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120835'),
  ('760335422244579464', 'The Devil Wears Prada', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David Frankel, Florian Ballhaus, Murphy Occhino', 'Aline Brosh McKenna', 'Meryl Streep, Anne Hathaway, Emily Blunt, Stanley Tucci, Simon Baker, Adrian Grenier, Tracie Thoms, Rich Sommer', 'PG-13', 'A young woman from the Midwest gets more than she bargained for when she moves to New York to become a writer and ends up as the assistant to the tyrannical, larger-than-life editor-in-chief of a major fashion magazine.', 'A young woman from the Midwest gets more than she bargained for when she moves to New York to become a writer and ends up as the assistant to the tyrannical, larger-than-life editor-in-chief of a major fashion magazine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8912AsVuS7Sj915apArUFbv6F9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350'),
  ('590168406206517067', 'The Devil Wears Prada 2', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David Frankel, Christo Morse, Florian Ballhaus', 'Aline Brosh McKenna', 'Meryl Streep, Anne Hathaway, Emily Blunt, Stanley Tucci, Kenneth Branagh, Simone Ashley, Justin Theroux, Lucy Liu', 'PG-13', 'Miranda Priestly navigates her career amid the decline of traditional magazine publishing. She faces off against Emily Charlton, her one-time assistant, now a high-powered executive for a luxury group, with advertising dollars that Priestly desperately needs.', 'Miranda Priestly navigates her career amid the decline of traditional magazine publishing. She faces off against Emily Charlton, her one-time assistant, now a high-powered executive for a luxury group, with advertising dollars that Priestly desperately needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p35IoKfBtJDNiWJMO8ZEtIMZSfW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1314481'),
  ('712668415487361339', 'The Devil Who Limped', 1948, 'History', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Sacha Guitry, Lana Marconi, Émile Drain, Jeanne Fusier-Gir, Pauline Carton, Renée Devillers, Maurice Schutz, Henry Laverne', null, 'The film is a 125-minute, black-and-white biography of French priest and diplomat Charles Maurice de Talleyrand-Périgord (1754–1838), who served for 50 years under five different French regimes: the Absolute Monarchy, the Revolution, the Consulate, the Empire, and the Constitutional Monarchy. Its title comes from one of the main historical nicknames for Talleyrand, that he shares with demon king Asmodeus and English poet Lord Byron.', 'The film is a 125-minute, black-and-white biography of French priest and diplomat Charles Maurice de Talleyrand-Périgord (1754–1838), who served for 50 years under five different French regimes: the Absolute Monarchy, the Revolution, the Consulate, the Empire, and the Constitutional Monarchy. Its title comes from one of the main historical nicknames for Talleyrand, that he shares with demon king Asmodeus and English poet Lord Byron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izy1LKq3YJuzomP3bhUYe4zygQ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65644'),
  ('763299105244146097', 'The Devil with Seven Faces', 1971, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Walter Civirani, Osvaldo Civirani', 'Tito Carpi, Osvaldo Civirani', 'Carroll Baker, George Hilton, Stephen Boyd, Lucretia Love, Luciano Pigozzi, Daniele Vargas, Ivano Staccioli, Franco Ressel', null, 'Carroll Baker plays a dual role as translator Julie Harrison and her twin sister Mary. The serpentine plot begins as Julie tells her lawyer Dave Barton that Mary''s life is being threatened in London while Julie herself is being stalked by a mysterious stranger in Amsterdam.', 'Carroll Baker plays a dual role as translator Julie Harrison and her twin sister Mary. The serpentine plot begins as Julie tells her lawyer Dave Barton that Mary''s life is being threatened in London while Julie herself is being stalked by a mysterious stranger in Amsterdam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWXEaMGlj8tfzR4ZoXrM0AZdwTH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94744'),
  ('573399224187885400', 'The Devil Within', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Rubén Pérez-Barrena, Javier Salmones, Ruben Perez Barrena', 'Rubén Pérez-Barrena, Jesús Miguel Quintana, Ruben Perez Barrena', 'Tamar Novas, Marina Salas, Iván Marcos, Annick Weerts, Alban Petit', null, 'Spain, 1980s. Philippe is a ten-year-old French boy traveling with his very pregnant mother, Marie, and his father, Tomas, whose plan is to take them home to the village where he grew up and introduce the boy to his Spanish roots. But an unfortunate breakdown leads the family to a scrapyard on the outskirts of a deserted inland town, where they come upon its owners, Alicia and Miguel.', 'Spain, 1980s. Philippe is a ten-year-old French boy traveling with his very pregnant mother, Marie, and his father, Tomas, whose plan is to take them home to the village where he grew up and introduce the boy to his Spanish roots. But an unfortunate breakdown leads the family to a scrapyard on the outskirts of a deserted inland town, where they come upon its owners, Alicia and Miguel.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F5lG4gbjGOLGqGL029rkHpiac7W6.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-devil-within-2026'),
  ('1140883276198711641', 'The Devil You Know', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Charles Murray, Ludovica Isidori', 'Charles Murray', 'Omar Epps, William Catlett, Glynn Turman, Curtiss Cook, Vanessa Bell Calloway, Erica Tazel, Vaughn W. Hebron, Michael Beach', 'R', 'Once-incarcerated Marcus Cowans is trying to turn over a new leaf with the support of his loving family. Upon discovering that one of his brothers may have been involved in a horrific crime, Marcus grapples with the limits of brotherhood and loyalty. He and his family, increasingly weary of the justice system’s failings, end up in the crosshairs of a seasoned but jaded detective.', 'Once-incarcerated Marcus Cowans is trying to turn over a new leaf with the support of his loving family. Upon discovering that one of his brothers may have been involved in a horrific crime, Marcus grapples with the limits of brotherhood and loyalty. He and his family, increasingly weary of the justice system’s failings, end up in the crosshairs of a seasoned but jaded detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cd4n38adySpFP6ANJQBoNdgMJZ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950063'),
  ('1025847380119518321', 'The Devil-Doll', 1936, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Tod Browning, Leonard Smith, Stan Rogers', 'Garrett Fort, Guy Endore, Erich von Stroheim', 'Lionel Barrymore, Maureen O''Sullivan, Frank Lawton, Rafaela Ottiano, Robert Greig, Lucy Beaumont, Henry B. Walthall, Grace Ford', null, 'Respected Parisian banker Paul Lavond is framed for robbery and murder by crooked associates and sent to prison. Years later, he escapes with a friend, a scientist who was working on a method to reduce humans to a height of mere inches (all for the good of humanity, of course). Lavond, however, is consumed with hatred for those who betrayed him, and takes the scientist''s methods back to Paris to exact painful revenge.', 'Respected Parisian banker Paul Lavond is framed for robbery and murder by crooked associates and sent to prison. Years later, he escapes with a friend, a scientist who was working on a method to reduce humans to a height of mere inches (all for the good of humanity, of course). Lavond, however, is consumed with hatred for those who betrayed him, and takes the scientist''s methods back to Paris to exact painful revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5Wyaw9fx53gVUifKdgPiXKfceD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29320'),
  ('266687194094181665', 'The Devil-Ship Pirates', 1964, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Michael Reed, Don Sharp', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Christopher Lee, Andrew Keir, John Cairney, Duncan Lamont, Suzan Farmer, Joseph O''Conor, Barry Warren, Michael Ripper', null, 'A pirate ship, fighting in 1588 on the side of the Spanish Armada, suffers damage and must put into a village on the British coast for repairs. The village is small and isolated and the Spanish convince the villagers that the English fleet has been defeated and that they, the Spanish, are now their masters. This results in the villagers'' sullen cooperation, but rumors and unrest begin to spread and soon the Spanish pirates find themselves facing a revolt.', 'A pirate ship, fighting in 1588 on the side of the Spanish Armada, suffers damage and must put into a village on the British coast for repairs. The village is small and isolated and the Spanish convince the villagers that the English fleet has been defeated and that they, the Spanish, are now their masters. This results in the villagers'' sullen cooperation, but rumors and unrest begin to spread and soon the Spanish pirates find themselves facing a revolt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nn4Bm2Dha1bZTBPPOcYN0UqoFte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28778'),
  ('56173520110892069', 'The Devil, Probably', 1977, 'Drama', 'Robert Bresson, Humbert Balsan, Thierry Bodin', 'Robert Bresson', 'Antoine Monnier, Tina Irissari, Henri de Maublanc, Laetitia Carcano, Nicolas Deguy, Régis Hanrion, Geoffroy Gaussen, Roger Honorat', 'NR', 'Charles drifts through politics, religion and psychoanalysis, rejecting them all. Once he realises the depth of his disgust with the moral and physical decline of the society he lives in, he decides that suicide is the only option...', 'Charles drifts through politics, religion and psychoanalysis, rejecting them all. Once he realises the depth of his disgust with the moral and physical decline of the society he lives in, he decides that suicide is the only option...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8y00J2rVtxHntKMukkkzsYKQORe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32097'),
  ('469127000963403746', 'The Devil''s Advocate', 1997, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'Taylor Hackford, Andrzej Bartkowiak, Gary Kosko', 'Jonathan Lemkin, Tony Gilroy', 'Keanu Reeves, Al Pacino, Charlize Theron, Jeffrey Jones, Judith Ivey, Connie Nielsen, Craig T. Nelson, Tamara Tunie', 'R', 'Aspiring Florida defense lawyer Kevin Lomax accepts a job at a New York law firm. With the stakes getting higher every case, Kevin quickly learns that his boss has something far more evil planned.', 'Aspiring Florida defense lawyer Kevin Lomax accepts a job at a New York law firm. With the stakes getting higher every case, Kevin quickly learns that his boss has something far more evil planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZzBGpxy55OQzHxKVY11IpY6a0o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1813'),
  ('513895509738649045', 'The Devil''s Arithmetic', 1999, 'TV Movie, Drama, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Donna Deitch, Jacek Laskus', 'Robert J. Avrech', 'Kirsten Dunst, Brittany Murphy, Paul Freeman, Mimi Rogers, Louise Fletcher, Leonardas Pobedonoscevas, Mantas Vaitiekūnas, Lilo Baur', 'PG', 'An American-born Jewish adolescent, Hannah Stern, is uninterested in the culture, faith and customs of her relatives. However, she begins to revaluate her heritage when she has a supernatural experience that transports her back to a Nazi death camp in 1941. There she meets a young girl named Rivkah, a fellow captive in the camp. As Rivkah and Hannah struggle to survive in the face of daily atrocities, they form an unbreakable bond.', 'An American-born Jewish adolescent, Hannah Stern, is uninterested in the culture, faith and customs of her relatives. However, she begins to revaluate her heritage when she has a supernatural experience that transports her back to a Nazi death camp in 1941. There she meets a young girl named Rivkah, a fellow captive in the camp. As Rivkah and Hannah struggle to survive in the face of daily atrocities, they form an unbreakable bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QBXokkFDYOKLPAKk6FQO9gd6YS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22509'),
  ('490650220021217643', 'The Devil''s Backbone', 2001, 'Fantasy, Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Guillermo del Toro, Guillermo Navarro, Esther García', 'Guillermo del Toro, David Muñoz, Antonio Trashorras', 'Marisa Paredes, Eduardo Noriega, Federico Luppi, Fernando Tielve, Íñigo Garcés, Irene Visedo, José Manuel Lorenzo, Francisco Maestre', 'R', 'Spain, 1939. In the last days of the Spanish Civil War, the young Carlos arrives at the Santa Lucía orphanage, where he will make friends and enemies as he follows the quiet footsteps of a mysterious presence eager for revenge.', 'Spain, 1939. In the last days of the Spanish Civil War, the young Carlos arrives at the Santa Lucía orphanage, where he will make friends and enemies as he follows the quiet footsteps of a mysterious presence eager for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iP1z1aJzPnkP8FHg77TS7ukqoEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1433'),
  ('1008502177152215821', 'The Devil''s Bath', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, History, Horror', 'Severin Fiala, Veronika Franz, Martin Gschlacht', 'Severin Fiala, Veronika Franz', 'Anja Plaschg, Maria Hofstätter, David Scheid, Natalija Baranova, Lukas Walcher, Agnes Lampl, Camilla Schilien, Lorenz Tröbinger', null, 'In 1750 Austria, a deeply religious woman named Agnes has just married her beloved, but her mind and heart soon grow heavy as her life becomes a long list of chores and expectations. Day after day, she is increasingly trapped in a murky and lonely path leading to evil thoughts, until the possibility of committing a shocking act of violence seems like the only way out of her inner prison.', 'In 1750 Austria, a deeply religious woman named Agnes has just married her beloved, but her mind and heart soon grow heavy as her life becomes a long list of chores and expectations. Day after day, she is increasingly trapped in a murky and lonely path leading to evil thoughts, until the possibility of committing a shocking act of violence seems like the only way out of her inner prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txVfrmwFOKB5qczM0ENYSqKMnSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931944'),
  ('1060762454966803176', 'The Devil''s Bride', 1974, 'Fantasy, Music', 'Arūnas Žebriūnas, Algimantas Mockus', 'Kazys Boruta, Sigitas Geda', 'Vaiva Mainelytė, Tatjana Čiumičeva, Asta Chomentauskienė, Gediminas Girdvainis, Jonas Rupša, Regimantas Adomaitis, Vytautas Kernagis, Vasilijus Simčičius', null, 'A story of an impish devil who used to be an angel but got tired of singing Hosannah and so was condemned to live on earth. From his home in a windmill, he pursues love and happiness in a hilarious and sometimes tragic turmoil that affects the whole countryside.', 'A story of an impish devil who used to be an angel but got tired of singing Hosannah and so was condemned to live on earth. From his home in a windmill, he pursues love and happiness in a hilarious and sometimes tragic turmoil that affects the whole countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vmi6GE4HBDd2wD2i1eLvb4Ro0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219189'),
  ('589940604516163361', 'The Devil''s Bride', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Azhar Kinoi Lubis, Fahmy J. Saad', 'Husein M. Atmodjo', 'Erika Carlina, Emir Mahira, Wavi Zihan, Ruth Marini, Alfie Alfandy, Ence Bagus, Dwika Pradnyana, Baim D''Bill', null, 'Caught in a strained marriage, Echa finds solace in a man who visits her dreams. But comfort turns to terror when he emerges as a malicious spirit.', 'Caught in a strained marriage, Echa finds solace in a man who visits her dreams. But comfort turns to terror when he emerges as a malicious spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRkM4hAoT9wMPsYeHj2SdgJ3lmz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1339772'),
  ('924981618958379380', 'The Devil''s Brigade', 1968, 'Action, Drama, War', 'William H. Clothier, Andrew V. McLaglen, Marvin Paige', 'William Roberts', 'William Holden, Cliff Robertson, Vince Edwards, Andrew Prine, Jeremy Slate, Claude Akins, Jack Watson, Richard Jaeckel', 'NR', 'At the onset of World War II, American Lt. Col. Robert Frederick is put in charge of a unit called the 1st Special Service Force, composed of elite Canadian commandos and undisciplined American soldiers. With Maj. Alan Crown leading the Canadians and Maj. Cliff Bricker the acting head of the American contingent, there is initial tension -- but the team comes together when given a daunting mission that few would dare to attempt.', 'At the onset of World War II, American Lt. Col. Robert Frederick is put in charge of a unit called the 1st Special Service Force, composed of elite Canadian commandos and undisciplined American soldiers. With Maj. Alan Crown leading the Canadians and Maj. Cliff Bricker the acting head of the American contingent, there is initial tension -- but the team comes together when given a daunting mission that few would dare to attempt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbcyQHD93FcPxUvKQai5oJ9tUtE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31938'),
  ('135613160022170499', 'The Devil''s Brother', 1933, 'Comedy, Music', 'Hal Roach, Charley Rogers', 'Jeanie Macpherson', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Dennis King, Thelma Todd, Arthur Pierson, Lucile Browne, Henry Armetta, James Finlayson', 'NR', 'Two wannabe bandits join the service of a dashing nobleman, who secretly masquerades as Fra Diavolo, a notorious outlaw.', 'Two wannabe bandits join the service of a dashing nobleman, who secretly masquerades as Fra Diavolo, a notorious outlaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gblt0cSVu82R921SmgNFX0Nq9bv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58012'),
  ('694744214841788190', 'The Devil''s Candy', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Simon Chapman, Sean Byrne, Chad Rosen', 'Sean Byrne', 'Ethan Embry, Shiri Appleby, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Kiara Glasco, Tony Amendola, Leland Orser, Oryan Landa, Craig Nigh', 'NR', 'A struggling painter is possessed by satanic forces after he and his young family move into their dream home in rural Texas.', 'A struggling painter is possessed by satanic forces after he and his young family move into their dream home in rural Texas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLw8nDNLuffMdvjYXQLwL6UCXcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354216'),
  ('826948643748213793', 'The Devil''s Carnival', 2012, 'Horror, Music', 'Darren Lynn Bousman', 'Terrance Zdunich', 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Briana Evigan, Jessica Lowndes, Bill Moseley, Dayton Callie, Paul Sorvino, Terrance Zdunich, Alexa PenaVega', null, 'Sinners are invited to a theme park where they endure the repetition of their transgressions. What chances do a conniving kleptomaniac, a gullible teenager, and an obsessed father stand when facing their own moral failings? Lucifer and his colorful cast of singing carnies invite you to grab a ticket to The Devil’s Carnival to find out!', 'Sinners are invited to a theme park where they endure the repetition of their transgressions. What chances do a conniving kleptomaniac, a gullible teenager, and an obsessed father stand when facing their own moral failings? Lucifer and his colorful cast of singing carnies invite you to grab a ticket to The Devil’s Carnival to find out!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJsdJPMvEDTOXRsxz3NeHDvaaSW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100493'),
  ('482813775170949449', 'The Devil''s Chair', 2007, 'Horror', 'Adam Mason, Stuart Brereton, Ole Bratt Birkeland', 'Adam Mason, Simon Boyes', 'Andrew Howard, Pollyanna Rose, Olivia Hill, Nadja Brand, Louise Griffiths, Elize du Toit, Gary Mackay, Graham Riddell', null, 'With a pocketful of drugs, Nick West takes out his girlfriend Sammy, for a shag and a good time. When they explore an abandoned asylum, the discovery of a bizarre device - a cross between an electric chair and sadistic fetish machine - transforms drugged-out bliss into agony and despair', 'With a pocketful of drugs, Nick West takes out his girlfriend Sammy, for a shag and a good time. When they explore an abandoned asylum, the discovery of a bizarre device - a cross between an electric chair and sadistic fetish machine - transforms drugged-out bliss into agony and despair', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTdheraVT2tTvz9zJV5LgRrcULi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20919'),
  ('199584283514309432', 'The Devil''s Child', 1997, 'Thriller, Horror, TV Movie', 'Bobby Roth, Shelly Johnson, Richard Peter Schroer', null, 'Kim Delaney, Colleen Flynn, Matthew Lillard, Gia Carides, Christopher John Fields, Ivana Miličević, Larry Holden, Grace Zabriskie', null, 'A woman''s mother makes a last-minute deal with the Devil to save her daughter''s life, not realizing that her daughter''s life is her stake. The daughter lives but with no chance of children. 20 years later, she mysteriously becomes pregnant after meeting a dashing stranger. Yet people are dying around her...', 'A woman''s mother makes a last-minute deal with the Devil to save her daughter''s life, not realizing that her daughter''s life is her stake. The daughter lives but with no chance of children. 20 years later, she mysteriously becomes pregnant after meeting a dashing stranger. Yet people are dying around her...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkT941MeIFaY5wgl7Ntr95T6YXe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148993'),
  ('916175272510513648', 'The Devil''s Climb', 2024, 'Documentary, Adventure', 'Renan Öztürk', null, 'Alex Honnold, Tommy Caldwell', null, 'Climbers Alex Honnold and Tommy Caldwell set out on a daring expedition to tackle Alaska''s formidable Devils Thumb. Battling harsh conditions and daunting peaks, they push their physical and mental limits, while their deep friendship faces its toughest trial yet.', 'Climbers Alex Honnold and Tommy Caldwell set out on a daring expedition to tackle Alaska''s formidable Devils Thumb. Battling harsh conditions and daunting peaks, they push their physical and mental limits, while their deep friendship faces its toughest trial yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjecaspP70FPUL8G6TxzKYplDw3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1360677'),
  ('519928505451586587', 'The Devil''s Daffodil', 1961, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Ákos Ráthonyi, Desmond Dickinson', 'Basil Dawson, Donald Taylor, Egon Eis', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Sabine Sesselmann, Klaus Kinski, Ingrid van Bergen, Christopher Lee, Albert Lieven, Jan Hendriks, Marius Goring', null, 'A Chinese detective breaks up a drug smuggling ring and tries to find the "Daffodil Killer". The drug smugglers had devised the ingenious method of smuggling heroin from Hong Kong in the stems of daffodils.', 'A Chinese detective breaks up a drug smuggling ring and tries to find the "Daffodil Killer". The drug smugglers had devised the ingenious method of smuggling heroin from Hong Kong in the stems of daffodils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyT3SO9n5AYTVYaY3QOiVAHhYyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70028'),
  ('161501407217530909', 'The Devil''s Daughter', 1973, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Jeannot Szwarc, J.J. Jones, Bill Ross', 'Colin Higgins', 'Shelley Winters, Belinda Montgomery, Robert Foxworth, Jonathan Frid, Martha Scott, Joseph Cotten, Barbara Sammeth, Diane Ladd', null, 'A young girl whose mother had sold her soul to Satan when she was born is told by Satan that she must marry a fellow demon.', 'A young girl whose mother had sold her soul to Satan when she was born is told by Satan that she must marry a fellow demon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8QTbsvNVrVu5ljkREOyWNCc9r0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98903'),
  ('899815999788709994', 'The Devil''s Deal', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Kim Sung-an, Lee Seung-bin, Son Jae-hyuk', 'Lee Soo-jin', 'Cho Jin-woong, Lee Sung-min, Kim Moo-yul, Won Hyun-jun, Kim Min-jae, Yoo Seung-mok, Kim Yoon-sung, Park Se-jin', null, 'Hae-woong, an assembly member candidate, is taken out of the running because he became a thorn in the side of a local bigwig, Sun-tae. Hounded by loan sharks, due to defaulting a campaign loan, he decides to get his hands dirty. He steals classified government’s information about an urban development plan and obtains the help of a local gang leader, Pil-do, by promising hefty real estate profit. Now Hae-woong re-enters the race and tries to take revenge on Sun-tae. Unbeknownst to him, his messy journey through politics has only just begun.', 'Hae-woong, an assembly member candidate, is taken out of the running because he became a thorn in the side of a local bigwig, Sun-tae. Hounded by loan sharks, due to defaulting a campaign loan, he decides to get his hands dirty. He steals classified government’s information about an urban development plan and obtains the help of a local gang leader, Pil-do, by promising hefty real estate profit. Now Hae-woong re-enters the race and tries to take revenge on Sun-tae. Unbeknownst to him, his messy journey through politics has only just begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djUck1vW5nEyXLwS9bgRGKQBYHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640327'),
  ('979742493795469395', 'The Devil''s Disciple', 1959, 'War, Comedy, History', 'Guy Hamilton, Jack Hildyard, John Hollingsworth', 'Roland Kibbee, John Dighton', 'Burt Lancaster, Kirk Douglas, Laurence Olivier, Janette Scott, Eva Le Gallienne, Harry Andrews, Basil Sydney, George Rose', null, 'In a small New England town during the American War of Independence, Dick Dudgeon, a revolutionary American Puritan, is mistaken for local minister Rev. Anthony Anderson and arrested by the British. Dick discovers himself incapable of accusing another human to suffer and continues to masquerade as the reverend.', 'In a small New England town during the American War of Independence, Dick Dudgeon, a revolutionary American Puritan, is mistaken for local minister Rev. Anthony Anderson and arrested by the British. Dick discovers himself incapable of accusing another human to suffer and continues to masquerade as the reverend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axagX83w2B8nhap1IC19Ih1AvmN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78078'),
  ('193587760090010073', 'The Devil''s Doorway', 2018, 'Horror, Drama', 'Aislinn Clarke, Ryan Kernaghan, Carla Stronge', 'Martin Brennan, Michael B. Jackson, Aislinn Clarke', 'Lalor Roddy, Ciaran Flynn, Helena Bereen, Lauren Coe, Carleen Melaugh, Dearbhail Carr, Charlie Bonner, Cathy Brennan Bradley', null, 'In the autumn of 1960, Father Thomas Riley and Father John Thornton were sent by the Vatican to investigate a miraculous event in an Irish home for ''fallen women'', only to uncover something much more horrific.', 'In the autumn of 1960, Father Thomas Riley and Father John Thornton were sent by the Vatican to investigate a miraculous event in an Irish home for ''fallen women'', only to uncover something much more horrific.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOFn9lYmI8SAi15nhht37rhwxzT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524789'),
