  ('1103386018149987253', 'The Devil’s Rain', 1975, 'Horror', 'Robert Fuest, Álex Phillips Jr., Mario Cisneros', 'Gabe Essoe, James Ashton, Gerald Hopman', 'Ernest Borgnine, Eddie Albert, Ida Lupino, William Shatner, Keenan Wynn, Tom Skerritt, Joan Prather, Woody Chambliss', null, 'A Satanist cult leader is burnt alive by the local church. He vows to come back to hunt down and enslave every descendant of his congregation, by the power of the book of blood contracts, in which they sold their souls to the devil.', 'A Satanist cult leader is burnt alive by the local church. He vows to come back to hunt down and enslave every descendant of his congregation, by the power of the book of blood contracts, in which they sold their souls to the devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/855mdgEriehXBmjvG5n74CaAjTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38701'),
  ('1092854124213426707', 'The Devil''s Rejects', 2005, 'Drama, Horror, Crime', 'Phil Parmet, Rob Zombie', 'Rob Zombie', 'Sid Haig, Bill Moseley, Sheri Moon Zombie, William Forsythe, Ken Foree, Matthew McGrory, Leslie Easterbrook, Geoffrey Lewis', 'R', 'The murderous, backwoods Firefly family take to the road to escape the vengeful Sheriff Wydell, who is not afraid of being as ruthless as his target.', 'The murderous, backwoods Firefly family take to the road to escape the vengeful Sheriff Wydell, who is not afraid of being as ruthless as his target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drZz4AuI7trq6BxlH9Xa4v4O0Pb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1696'),
  ('888130392085813842', 'The Devil''s Rock', 2011, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller, War', 'Paul Campion, Rob Marsh', 'Paul Campion, Paul Finch, Brett Ihaka', 'Craig Hall, Matthew Sunderland, Gina Varela, Karlos Drinkwater, Jessica Grace Smith, Luke Hawker, Nick Dunbar, Jonathan King', null, 'Set in the Channel Islands on the eve of D Day, two Kiwi commandos, sent to destroy German gun emplacements to distract Hitler''s forces away from Normandy, discover a Nazi occult plot to unleash demonic forces to win the war.', 'Set in the Channel Islands on the eve of D Day, two Kiwi commandos, sent to destroy German gun emplacements to distract Hitler''s forces away from Normandy, discover a Nazi occult plot to unleash demonic forces to win the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/figybSBIvyyRcUdlmz5wWwtEymp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70386'),
  ('527630935269755183', 'The Devil''s Scarab', 2016, 'Adventure, Mystery', 'Carlo Milani, Pedro Farkas', 'Ronaldo Santos, Melanie Dimantas', 'Thiago Rosseti, Marcos Caruso, Jonas Bloch, Bruna Cavalieri, Selma Egrei, Cirillo Luna, Lourenço Mutarelli, Celso Frateschi', null, 'A series of crimes against redheads scares the people from a little town. After the death of his brother, the 13 year old Alberto decides to investigate what is happening and is helped by the experienced but forgetful Inspector Pimentel.', 'A series of crimes against redheads scares the people from a little town. After the death of his brother, the 13 year old Alberto decides to investigate what is happening and is helped by the experienced but forgetful Inspector Pimentel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qV1NEYRmDwhwtVX1dRm1vuQaCg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324463'),
  ('942896711132229890', 'The Devil''s Sleep', 1949, 'Drama', 'William C. Thompson, W. Merle Connell', 'Richard S. McMahan', 'Lita Grey, John Mitchum, Timothy Farrell, Stan Freed, William Thomason, Tracy Lynne, George Eiferman, Laura Travers', null, 'Innocent youth trapped in a hopped-up hell.', 'Innocent youth trapped in a hopped-up hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiWCLEXR8l4qOTjuLrFsHSuBq4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64451'),
  ('563522764988053274', 'The Devil''s Sword', 1984, 'Fantasy, Action, Horror, Adventure', 'Ratno Timoer, Herman Susilo', 'Imam Tantowi', 'Barry Prima, Sri Gudhi Sintara, Advent Bangun, Enny Christina, Rita Zahara, Kusno Sudjarwadi, Kandar Sinyo, H.I.M. Damsyik', null, 'A legendary warrior embarks on a deadly quest to retrieve the cursed Devil’s Sword, a mystical weapon with dark powers capable of unleashing unimaginable destruction. When the sword falls into the wrong hands, chaos, and bloodshed follow. Now, it’s up to our hero to confront an army of evil warriors, deadly assassins, and supernatural creatures in a battle for the fate of the world.', 'A legendary warrior embarks on a deadly quest to retrieve the cursed Devil’s Sword, a mystical weapon with dark powers capable of unleashing unimaginable destruction. When the sword falls into the wrong hands, chaos, and bloodshed follow. Now, it’s up to our hero to confront an army of evil warriors, deadly assassins, and supernatural creatures in a battle for the fate of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26XunDjetXxQzNqg2GwWzFU44xp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40104'),
  ('662046220677875782', 'The Devil''s Tomb', 2009, 'Action, Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jason Connery, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Keith Kjornes', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Ray Winstone, Ron Perlman, Taryn Manning, Stephanie Jacobsen, Valerie Cruz, Franky G, Zack Ward', 'R', 'Captain Mack leads an elite military unit on a search for a missing scientist, and comes face-to-face with an an ancient evil lying beneath the Middle Eastern desert. Evil that is not of this world. Evil that should never be unearthed.', 'Captain Mack leads an elite military unit on a search for a missing scientist, and comes face-to-face with an an ancient evil lying beneath the Middle Eastern desert. Evil that is not of this world. Evil that should never be unearthed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ex0dNOuABfkWVrNFfhsC0qTviA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17577'),
  ('37696389690650530', 'The Devil''s Toy', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Claude Jutra, Michel Brault', 'Claude Jutra', 'Pierre Charpentier, Charles Denner, Marc Harvey', null, 'Dedicated “to all victims of intolerance,” "The Devil’s Toy" is a faux–public service documentary that chronicles the early days of skateboarding in Montreal. Framed as mock anti-skateboarding propaganda, Claude Jutra contrasts official hostility with the exhilaration and freedom experienced by youths racing downhill through city streets, shortly before the activity was banned.', 'Dedicated “to all victims of intolerance,” "The Devil’s Toy" is a faux–public service documentary that chronicles the early days of skateboarding in Montreal. Framed as mock anti-skateboarding propaganda, Claude Jutra contrasts official hostility with the exhilaration and freedom experienced by youths racing downhill through city streets, shortly before the activity was banned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ww6vxwMvUPimPHQEzHlNiDLcSoz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183469'),
  ('56427526853293141', 'The Devil''s Trap', 1962, 'History, Drama, Mystery', 'František Vláčil, Milan Kadlec, Jaroslav Beránek', 'Miloš Václav Kratochvíl, František A. Dvořák', 'Vítězslav Vejražka, Miroslav Macháček, Čestmír Řanda, Vlastimil Hašek, Vít Olmer, Karla Chadimová, František Kovářík, Bedřich Karen', null, 'A small town is one day visited by a priest who is there on a secret mission. He is a member of the Inquisition sent to investigate the activities of a local miller. The miller and his son are the descendants of an old family whose ancestral home burned down a century ago, but was rebuilt from scratch. The miller inherited much of his knowledge about the land, water, and a building''s stability from generations of family experience. His reputation for finding water and predicting when a structure might collapse have come to the attention of the Inquisition -surely he must be in league with the Devil.', 'A small town is one day visited by a priest who is there on a secret mission. He is a member of the Inquisition sent to investigate the activities of a local miller. The miller and his son are the descendants of an old family whose ancestral home burned down a century ago, but was rebuilt from scratch. The miller inherited much of his knowledge about the land, water, and a building''s stability from generations of family experience. His reputation for finding water and predicting when a structure might collapse have come to the attention of the Inquisition -surely he must be in league with the Devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jU5e1LhMTVwmJSivPpTeaTcr69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117042'),
  ('584884736691940637', 'The Devil''s Violinist', 2013, 'Drama', 'Bernard Rose, Bernard Rose', 'Bernard Rose', 'David Garrett, Joely Richardson, Jared Harris, Andrea Deck, Christian McKay, Veronica Ferres, Helmut Berger, Oskar Ricketts', 'R', 'The life story of Italian violinist and composer, Niccolò Paganini, who rose to fame as a virtuoso in the early 19th Century.', 'The life story of Italian violinist and composer, Niccolò Paganini, who rose to fame as a virtuoso in the early 19th Century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja0TH6VlH2s72OEZeHJtAN82Dy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191820'),
  ('149588138087687125', 'The Devil''s Wedding Night', 1973, 'Horror', 'Joe D''Amato, Luigi Batzella, Joe D''Amato', 'Mark Damon', 'Mark Damon, Rosalba Neri, Esmeralda Barros, Xiro Papas, Gengher Gatti, Enza Sbordone, Carlo Gentili, Giorgio Dolfin', 'R', 'The 1800s: scholarly Karl Schiller believes he''s found the ring of the Nibelungen, which holds great power. It''s at Castle Dracula. His twin, Franz, a gambler, asks if vampires frighten Karl; Karl shows him an Egyptian amulet, which may protect him. Franz takes the amulet and sets out ahead of his brother, arriving at the castle first. There he finds a countess who invites him to dine. Later that night, Karl arrives. Coincidently, it''s the Night of the Virgin Moon, a night that falls every fifty years and draws five virgins from the surrounding village to the castle not be heard from again. Can Karl protect his brother, find the ring, and rescue any of the women?', 'The 1800s: scholarly Karl Schiller believes he''s found the ring of the Nibelungen, which holds great power. It''s at Castle Dracula. His twin, Franz, a gambler, asks if vampires frighten Karl; Karl shows him an Egyptian amulet, which may protect him. Franz takes the amulet and sets out ahead of his brother, arriving at the castle first. There he finds a countess who invites him to dine. Later that night, Karl arrives. Coincidently, it''s the Night of the Virgin Moon, a night that falls every fifty years and draws five virgins from the surrounding village to the castle not be heard from again. Can Karl protect his brother, find the ring, and rescue any of the women?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dXtC1zkssrvQSo25u9muvoGrns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74831'),
  ('855019907759368552', 'The Devil´s Shadow', 2020, 'Horror', 'Max Coronel', 'Max Coronel', 'Clara Kovacic, Germán Baudino, Gon Spina, Guillermina Mazzu, Micaela Bocconi, Nano Arias, Virginia Lombardo, Jordan Edge', null, 'In the midst of quarantine in 2020, a girl starts to experience supernatural events that will take her to the limit.', 'In the midst of quarantine in 2020, a girl starts to experience supernatural events that will take her to the limit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QULXWAJJg36PzPfiHad611Z69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:722893'),
  ('751062528468634048', 'The Devilish Plank', 1904, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A magic trick is performed with a long plank with two pots built into it, both with holes in the bottom. Pretty girls are part of the magic.', 'A magic trick is performed with a long plank with two pots built into it, both with holes in the bottom. Pretty girls are part of the magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wWOQcgBUcfL9t1Qyy05Vh8VbSl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196073'),
  ('936407397641473673', 'The Devils', 1971, 'Drama, History, Horror', 'Ken Russell, Leslie Dilley, Alan Tomkins', 'Ken Russell', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Oliver Reed, Dudley Sutton, Max Adrian, Gemma Jones, Murray Melvin, Michael Gothard, Georgina Hale', 'R', 'A charismatic 17th-century French priest becomes the target of a sexually obsessed nun’s witchcraft accusations, which corrupt church and state officials are all too happy to exploit.​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​', 'A charismatic 17th-century French priest becomes the target of a sexually obsessed nun’s witchcraft accusations, which corrupt church and state officials are all too happy to exploit.​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1k7eiOFc6fzm8XeTa1kNGx6JIs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31767'),
  ('621472095947084492', 'The Devils', 2002, 'Drama', 'Christophe Ruggia, Éric Guichard', 'Christophe Ruggia, Olivier Lorelle', 'Adèle Haenel, Vincent Rottiers, Rochdy Labidi, Jacques Bonnaffé, Aurélia Petit, Galamelah Lagra, Dominique Reymond, Frédéric Pierrot', null, 'The story of the struggle of an autistic girl and her brother trying to survive without their parents.', 'The story of the struggle of an autistic girl and her brother trying to survive without their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aesSCsKOoiy5CWXVitmOJffLsbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26793'),
  ('1071461718717463416', 'The Devious Path', 1928, 'Drama', 'G.W. Pabst, Theodor Sparkuhl', 'Adolf Lantz, Ladislaus Vajda, Helen Gosewish', 'Gustav Diessl, Brigitte Helm, Hertha von Walther, Jack Trevor, Fritz Odemar, Nico Turoff, Ilse Bachmann, Peter C. Leska', null, 'Neglected by her husband, an ambitious lawyer, Irene seeks variety in Berlin''s nightlife-- An evening of dancing, dolls, cocaine and immoral passion. Irene takes the "devious path" as she seeks to make her husband jealous.', 'Neglected by her husband, an ambitious lawyer, Irene seeks variety in Berlin''s nightlife-- An evening of dancing, dolls, cocaine and immoral passion. Irene takes the "devious path" as she seeks to make her husband jealous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vF2PJ4edgbKZcy6V60LYXyGpi3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171215'),
  ('730192138272119059', 'The Devonsville Terror', 1983, 'Horror', 'Ulli Lommel, Jürg V. Walther, Bruce Pearn', 'Suzanna Love, George T. Lindsey, Ulli Lommel', 'Suzanna Love, Robert Walker Jr., Donald Pleasence, Paul Willson, Mary Walden, Deanna Haas, Wally Flaherty, Michael Accardo', 'NR', 'Dr. Worley investigates a 300-year-old witch''s curse in the New England town of Devonsville. Three liberated, assertive women move into town, which angers the bigoted, male-dominated town fathers. One of the women is a reincarnation of the witch, who proceeds to exact revenge on them.', 'Dr. Worley investigates a 300-year-old witch''s curse in the New England town of Devonsville. Three liberated, assertive women move into town, which angers the bigoted, male-dominated town fathers. One of the women is a reincarnation of the witch, who proceeds to exact revenge on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4K67t8odo35Y3Quz5t15hGOEAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98012'),
  ('598327388311525319', 'The Devotion of Suspect X', 2017, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Alec Su, Max Da-Yung Wang', 'Carol Li, Sean Huang', 'Wang Kai, Zhang Luyi, Ruby Lin, Ye Zuxin, Ding Guansen, Deng Enxi, Cheng Taishen, Zhao Yang', 'NR', 'Based on Keigo Higashino’s award-winning novel, THE DEVOTION OF SUSPECT X follows a professor (Wang Kai) assisting in a murder investigation, only to find that a longtime rival and friend (Zhang Luyi) from his early university days may be involved.', 'Based on Keigo Higashino’s award-winning novel, THE DEVOTION OF SUSPECT X follows a professor (Wang Kai) assisting in a murder investigation, only to find that a longtime rival and friend (Zhang Luyi) from his early university days may be involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1XjBmHhGRltTDjPFaWD99kYI5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446076'),
  ('936165102855301870', 'The Dew Point', 2024, 'Drama', 'Marco Risi, Michele Paradisi', 'Francesco Frangipane, Riccardo De Torrebruna, Marco Risi', 'Massimo De Francovich, Alessandro Fella, Eros Pagni, Lucia Rossi, Luigi Diberti, Roberto Gudese, Valerio Binasco, Elena Cotta', null, '25-year-old carouser Carlo is sentenced to one year of community service after crashing his car while drunk and on cocaine. He has to serve his sentence at the Villa Bianca nursing home, along with other non-violent felons. He initially lives it as yet another nuisance, but spending time with Villa Bianca''s residents — especially Dino, a cultured and sarcastic 80-year-old who has attempted suicide several times — will make Carlo change his outlook on the world and on life itself.', '25-year-old carouser Carlo is sentenced to one year of community service after crashing his car while drunk and on cocaine. He has to serve his sentence at the Villa Bianca nursing home, along with other non-violent felons. He initially lives it as yet another nuisance, but spending time with Villa Bianca''s residents — especially Dino, a cultured and sarcastic 80-year-old who has attempted suicide several times — will make Carlo change his outlook on the world and on life itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clavm7LRHIu2AdG28pgbUVtdJPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1149512'),
  ('1047250282248332638', 'The Diabolic Tenant', 1909, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès, André Méliès', null, 'A man rents an apartment and furnishes it in remarkable fashion.', 'A man rents an apartment and furnishes it in remarkable fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zY6VJYhWytXStU2fdobZcfC393c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49271'),
  ('769993538060474044', 'The Diabolical', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Alistair Legrand', 'Alistair Legrand, Luke Harvis', 'Ali Larter, Arjun Gupta, Chloe Perrin, Joe Egender, Patrick Fischler, Wilmer Calderon, Tom Wright, Merrin Dungey', null, 'When a single mother and her two young children are tormented by an increasingly strange and intense presence in their quiet suburban home, she turns to her scientist boyfriend to take on the violent forces that paranormal experts are too frightened to face.', 'When a single mother and her two young children are tormented by an increasingly strange and intense presence in their quiet suburban home, she turns to her scientist boyfriend to take on the violent forces that paranormal experts are too frightened to face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hGRSbGChh9RY4Luw0PqPLcOJEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323370'),
  ('20321058866559874', 'The Diabolical Axe', 1965, 'Action, Horror', 'José Díaz Morales, Eduardo Valdés', 'Rafael García Travesí', 'El Santo, Lorena Velázquez, Fernando Osés, Bety González, Mario Sevilla, Mario Orea, Guillermo Hernández, José Alvarez Valdez', null, 'In the Age of the Inquisitions, 1603, Santo, El Enmascarado de Plata, is being laid to rest by a group of monks. The Black Hood, an axe-wielder and a tormented soul who sold his soul to the devil after losing his love to El Santo, appears at the foot of his tomb and swears to seek his revenge no matter how many centuries it takes. El Santo is the chosen one and is sworn to fight for good and justice at any cost. After he finds his love, Alicia, dead at the hands of the Black Hood, El Santo must trust his faith and use his strength in this battle of good vs. evil.', 'In the Age of the Inquisitions, 1603, Santo, El Enmascarado de Plata, is being laid to rest by a group of monks. The Black Hood, an axe-wielder and a tormented soul who sold his soul to the devil after losing his love to El Santo, appears at the foot of his tomb and swears to seek his revenge no matter how many centuries it takes. El Santo is the chosen one and is sworn to fight for good and justice at any cost. After he finds his love, Alicia, dead at the hands of the Black Hood, El Santo must trust his faith and use his strength in this battle of good vs. evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SdTXJLKWbjYm1liDSMHNdahf0e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62916'),
  ('975563031429310555', 'The Diabolical Church Window', 1911, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Here we have an old scholar/alchemist brooding over a book, challenged by the devil, and going through the familiar sorcery to create a woman by throwing pieces of clothing against a stain-glass church window, like a jigsaw puzzle (and later in reverse). The woman also multiplies herself five-fold so as to match a similar paravent.', 'Here we have an old scholar/alchemist brooding over a book, challenged by the devil, and going through the familiar sorcery to create a woman by throwing pieces of clothing against a stain-glass church window, like a jigsaw puzzle (and later in reverse). The woman also multiplies herself five-fold so as to match a similar paravent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLCc7ti3YlYpoMeTvkKri0l6J5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193954'),
  ('349448418141636825', 'The Diabolical Dr. Z', 1966, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Alejandro Ulloa, Jesús Franco, Robert Demollière', 'Jesús Franco, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Estella Blain, Mabel Karr, Fernando Montes, Howard Vernon, Guy Mairesse, Antonio Jiménez Escribano, Marcelo Arroita-Jáuregui, Cris Huerta', 'NR', 'A woman seeks to avenge her father''s death using a local dancer, with long poisonous fingernails, to do her bidding.', 'A woman seeks to avenge her father''s death using a local dancer, with long poisonous fingernails, to do her bidding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t20mOwAfmuxpfMpWGMPCxxLQrph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27697'),
  ('794347636009260492', 'The Diamond Wizard', 1954, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Dennis O''Keefe, Montgomery Tully, Gordon Lang', 'John C. Higgins', 'Dennis O''Keefe, Margaret Sheridan, Philip Friend, Alan Wheatley, Francis de Wolff, Eric Berry, Gudrun Ure, Seymour Green', 'NR', 'While in London trying to nab several fugitives who stole a million dollars from a U.S. Treasury vault, American federal agent Dennison (Dennis O''Keefe) assists Scotland Yard Insp. McClaren (Philip Friend) in his search for a missing atomic scientist (Paul Hardtmuth). The detective duo discovers that the key to solving both cases may rest with the scientist''s daughter (Margaret Sheridan) and her fascinating diamond.', 'While in London trying to nab several fugitives who stole a million dollars from a U.S. Treasury vault, American federal agent Dennison (Dennis O''Keefe) assists Scotland Yard Insp. McClaren (Philip Friend) in his search for a missing atomic scientist (Paul Hardtmuth). The detective duo discovers that the key to solving both cases may rest with the scientist''s daughter (Margaret Sheridan) and her fascinating diamond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEugVtlDT0CepejJI25APOaGgws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94164'),
  ('89404781409914950', 'The Diane Linkletter Story', 1970, 'Comedy', 'John Waters, John Waters', 'Mary Vivian Pearce, Divine, John Waters', 'David Lochary, Mary Vivian Pearce, Divine', null, 'This improvised film is based on the true-life suicide of TV personality Art Linkletter''s daughter, Diane. Mr. and Mrs. Linkletter fret about their daughter''s recent behaviour, which includes taking drugs and dating a lowlife named Jim. Eventually, the parents confront Diane… with tragic consequences.', 'This improvised film is based on the true-life suicide of TV personality Art Linkletter''s daughter, Diane. Mr. and Mrs. Linkletter fret about their daughter''s recent behaviour, which includes taking drugs and dating a lowlife named Jim. Eventually, the parents confront Diane… with tragic consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oSgdXXqgno2jAAE3vp4KWCMbg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30650'),
  ('1148685362382299633', 'The Diary', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Emma Bertrán, Alba Gil, Erwin Jaquez', 'Pamela Pons Saez, Emma Bertrán', 'Irene Azuela, Mauricio Ochmann, Leonardo Ortizgris, Isabella Arroyo, Yoshira Escárrega, Sofía Álvarez, Juan Acosta', null, 'Olga discovers the unfinished diary of a notorious killer and becomes captivated by its dark secrets. As she delves deeper, she uncovers a mysterious connection between them, putting her life—and the lives of those around her—in grave danger.', 'Olga discovers the unfinished diary of a notorious killer and becomes captivated by its dark secrets. As she delves deeper, she uncovers a mysterious connection between them, putting her life—and the lives of those around her—in grave danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yx3EK6omL8mD8mcmHR7nmiboex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1359153'),
  ('866790617338890224', 'The Diary of a Chambermaid', 1946, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Jean Renoir, Joseph Depew, Lucien N. Andriot', 'Burgess Meredith', 'Paulette Goddard, Burgess Meredith, Hurd Hatfield, Francis Lederer, Judith Anderson, Florence Bates, Irene Ryan, Reginald Owen', null, 'Celestine, the chamber-maid, has a new job in the country, at the Lanlaires. She has decided to use her beauty to seduce a wealthy man, but Mr. Lanlaire is not a right choice: the house is firmly controlled by Madame Lanlaire, helped by the strange valet Joseph. Then she tries the neighbour, former officer Mauger. This seems to work. But soon the son of the Lanlaires comes back. He is young, attractive and does not share his mother''s antirepublican opinions. So Celestine''s beauty attracts Captain Mauger, young Georges Lanlaire, and Joseph. Three men, from three different social classes, with three different conceptions of life. Will Celestine be able to convince Georges of her sincerity?', 'Celestine, the chamber-maid, has a new job in the country, at the Lanlaires. She has decided to use her beauty to seduce a wealthy man, but Mr. Lanlaire is not a right choice: the house is firmly controlled by Madame Lanlaire, helped by the strange valet Joseph. Then she tries the neighbour, former officer Mauger. This seems to work. But soon the son of the Lanlaires comes back. He is young, attractive and does not share his mother''s antirepublican opinions. So Celestine''s beauty attracts Captain Mauger, young Georges Lanlaire, and Joseph. Three men, from three different social classes, with three different conceptions of life. Will Celestine be able to convince Georges of her sincerity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7Dyo9P0goGyW5eYADR16Yrskfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45212'),
  ('991576367151326001', 'The Diary of a Teenage Girl', 2015, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Marielle Heller, Brandon Trost', 'Marielle Heller', 'Bel Powley, Kristen Wiig, Alexander Skarsgård, Christopher Meloni, Austin Lyon, Madeleine Waters, Margarita Levieva, Quinn Nagle', 'R', 'Minnie Goetze is a 15-year-old aspiring comic-book artist, coming of age in the haze of the 1970s in San Francisco. Insatiably curious about the world around her, Minnie is a pretty typical teenage girl. Oh, except that she’s sleeping with her mother’s boyfriend.', 'Minnie Goetze is a 15-year-old aspiring comic-book artist, coming of age in the haze of the 1970s in San Francisco. Insatiably curious about the world around her, Minnie is a pretty typical teenage girl. Oh, except that she’s sleeping with her mother’s boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YlUrdYKuscD7pwf3yy9duVLbui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250124'),
  ('1140670840093948730', 'The Diary of an Unknown Soldier', 1959, 'Documentary, Drama, War', 'Peter Watkins', 'Peter Watkins', 'Brian Robertson, Peter Watkins', null, 'A short story narrated by an unknown British soldier who reveals his hopes, fears, and disillusionment while heading into battle against the German army.', 'A short story narrated by an unknown British soldier who reveals his hopes, fears, and disillusionment while heading into battle against the German army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxmHI2QV2xw12o519sULHd4jht8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63194'),
