  ('314611042274219135', 'The Diary of Carlota', 2010, 'Family, Comedy, Romance', 'José Manuel Carrasco', 'Roberto Santiago, José Manuel Carrasco', 'Andrea Ros, Lorena Mateo, Lydia Fairén, Marcel Borràs, David Castillo, Maxi Iglesias', null, '17-year-old Carlota is in love with an athlete named Oriol but discovers sex with Sergio, every mother''s ideal son-in-law. Carlota is in big trouble but neither her parents (who are separating) nor her best friends (Elisa and Mirea) can help her. Among other reasons, because Elisa disguises herself as a boy so she can get close to Lucas, who she is madly in love with, and because Mirea intends to seduce young Oriol, thus betraying her best friend.', '17-year-old Carlota is in love with an athlete named Oriol but discovers sex with Sergio, every mother''s ideal son-in-law. Carlota is in big trouble but neither her parents (who are separating) nor her best friends (Elisa and Mirea) can help her. Among other reasons, because Elisa disguises herself as a boy so she can get close to Lucas, who she is madly in love with, and because Mirea intends to seduce young Oriol, thus betraying her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tm8sO2DSHdcWrgms8OJ8AbyeTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97131'),
