  ('1114317971087765058', 'The Dirty Mind of Young Sally', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Bethel Buckalew', 'Bethel Buckalew', 'Colleen Brennan, George Buck Flower, Norman Fields, James Mathers, Angela Carnon, John Paul Jones, Jacqueline Giroux, Penny Boran', null, 'Sally runs a mobile "pirate" radio station--which she operates from her van--where, in her sexy and sultry voice, she encourages her listeners (mostly teenagers) to use the music she plays "to ball by". She also takes calls from her listeners and even offers herself as a prize in a contest. Her show is so popular it winds up "turning on" large numbers of the local population. The authorities, of course, can''t allow that to happen, so they send out the cops to find her and shut her down.', 'Sally runs a mobile "pirate" radio station--which she operates from her van--where, in her sexy and sultry voice, she encourages her listeners (mostly teenagers) to use the music she plays "to ball by". She also takes calls from her listeners and even offers herself as a prize in a contest. Her show is so popular it winds up "turning on" large numbers of the local population. The authorities, of course, can''t allow that to happen, so they send out the cops to find her and shut her down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9n35BnWrY2SLG5ObrwycvNXfR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50955'),
  ('537884441793452520', 'The Dirty Outlaws', 1967, 'Western', 'Franco Rossetti', 'Ugo Guerra, Franco Rossetti, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Andrea Giordana, Rosemary Dexter, Franco Giornelli, Dana Ghia, Aldo Berti, Giovanni Petrucci, John Bartha, Piero Lulli', null, 'An outlaw masquerades as a blind man''s son in order to trick him into a cache of Gold. After a while he grows attached to the family and all goes well until the outlaws gang comes through town...', 'An outlaw masquerades as a blind man''s son in order to trick him into a cache of Gold. After a while he grows attached to the family and all goes well until the outlaws gang comes through town...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld7CyOgLe9mao8SDzgtHxhnenzf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117804'),
  ('1016677577969250096', 'The Dirty Picture', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Milan Luthria, Shahana Dasgupta, Praveen Fernandes', 'Rajat Arora', 'Vidya Balan, Emraan Hashmi, Tusshar Kapoor, Naseeruddin Shah, Anju Mahendru, Rajesh Sharma, Imran Hasnee, Shivani Tanksale', null, 'After running away from home in search of movie stardom, a village girl rises to become a prominent sex symbol.', 'After running away from home in search of movie stardom, a village girl rises to become a prominent sex symbol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oebs05w6hggeleB0F28uerrzvkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81273'),
  ('763071804811327123', 'The Dirty South', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Lara Hill, Matthew Yerby, Liat Krongrad', 'Matthew Yerby', 'Willa Holland, Dermot Mulroney, Shane West, Laura Cayouette, Gissette Valentin, Mike C. Manning, Wayne Péré, Billy Hayes', null, 'Sue Parker is thrust into a desperate struggle to rescue her family''s failing business, teetering on the edge of ruin due to her father''s negligence. With the arrival of a charming wanderer, she sees him as their sole hope to help prevent their bar from being seized by the merciless local tycoon.', 'Sue Parker is thrust into a desperate struggle to rescue her family''s failing business, teetering on the edge of ruin due to her father''s negligence. With the arrival of a charming wanderer, she sees him as their sole hope to help prevent their bar from being seized by the merciless local tycoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MIiVSXsHx5q9l3HgTc07gn895r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1133232'),
  ('1096837094777001813', 'The Disappearance', 1977, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Stuart Cooper, John Alcott', 'Paul Mayersberg', 'Donald Sutherland, Francine Racette, David Hemmings, John Hurt, David Warner, Peter Bowles, Virginia McKenna, Christopher Plummer', 'R', 'The wife of a contract killer disappears. When he is hired by an international organisation to carry out a hit, he suspects they are connected with her disappearance.', 'The wife of a contract killer disappears. When he is hired by an international organisation to carry out a hit, he suspects they are connected with her disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgUFjd27G7vyFr8ITup9AZTm9Eo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183213'),
  ('850457005631026564', 'The Disappearance of Alice Creed', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'J Blakeson, Philipp Blaubach, Benjamin Heath', 'J Blakeson', 'Gemma Arterton, Martin Compston, Eddie Marsan', 'R', 'A rich man''s daughter is held captive in an abandoned apartment by two former convicts who abducted her and hold her ransom in exchange for her father''s money.', 'A rich man''s daughter is held captive in an abandoned apartment by two former convicts who abducted her and hold her ransom in exchange for her father''s money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJT7eXt09OffD4WBOvV7eGgL3Lt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38542'),
  ('500223630606368410', 'The Disappearance of Conan Edogawa: The Worst Two Days in History', 2014, 'TV Movie, Animation, Mystery', 'Yasuichiro Yamamoto', 'Kenji Uchida', 'Minami Takayama, Megumi Hayashibara, Teruyuki Kagawa, Hirosue Ryoko, Wakana Yamazaki, Kappei Yamaguchi, Rikiya Koyama, Kenichi Ogata', null, 'After slipping in a bath house, Conan appears to have lost his memory. Worse yet, it looks like he will be used in a hit job.', 'After slipping in a bath house, Conan appears to have lost his memory. Worse yet, it looks like he will be used in a hit job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msDyR8yX9tMmjBbUqU30LuDZ0Cc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546822'),
  ('782985416675754702', 'The Disappearance of Eleanor Rigby: Her', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ned Benson, Christopher Blauvelt', 'Ned Benson', 'Jessica Chastain, James McAvoy, Viola Davis, Isabelle Huppert, William Hurt, Jess Weixler, Bill Hader, Katherine Waterston', 'R', 'Told from the woman''s perspective, the story of a couple trying to reclaim the life and love they once knew and pick up the pieces of a past that may be too far gone.', 'Told from the woman''s perspective, the story of a couple trying to reclaim the life and love they once knew and pick up the pieces of a past that may be too far gone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynQT7JLYoLwV8P2ropoQEpTH7gG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275060'),
  ('1016433356341388560', 'The Disappearance of Eleanor Rigby: Him', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ned Benson, Christopher Blauvelt', 'Ned Benson', 'James McAvoy, Jessica Chastain, Bill Hader, Ciarán Hinds, Nina Arianda, Isabelle Huppert, Viola Davis, Jeremy Shamos', 'R', 'Told from the man''s perspective, the story of a couple trying to reclaim the life and love they once knew and pick up the pieces of a past that may be too far gone.', 'Told from the man''s perspective, the story of a couple trying to reclaim the life and love they once knew and pick up the pieces of a past that may be too far gone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCxiOB5dgShUrsUkyTaMsRTiw7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276401'),
  ('880015722451099212', 'The Disappearance of Eleanor Rigby: Them', 2014, 'Drama', 'Ned Benson, Christopher Blauvelt', 'Ned Benson', 'Jessica Chastain, James McAvoy, Bill Hader, Viola Davis, Isabelle Huppert, Ciarán Hinds, Nina Arianda, Jess Weixler', 'R', 'A New York couple''s relationship is tested after the loss of their child. This film is the wide-released combination of the original two :him and :her volumes that premiered at the Cannes Film Festival.', 'A New York couple''s relationship is tested after the loss of their child. This film is the wide-released combination of the original two :him and :her volumes that premiered at the Cannes Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFBfW5RJbjgOYufLvu2DP4A71JW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157829'),
  ('728275755186183847', 'The Disappearance of Flight 412', 1974, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Jud Taylor, Robert B. Hauser', 'George Simpson, Neal R. Burger', 'Glenn Ford, Bradford Dillman, David Soul, Robert F. Lyons, Guy Stockwell, Greg Mullavey, Stanley Bennett Clay, Jack Ging', 'G', 'Colonel Pete Moore (Glenn Ford) is commander of the Whitney Radar Test Group, which has been experiencing electrical difficulties aboard its aircraft. To ferret out the problem, he sends a four-man crew on Flight 412. Shortly into the test, the jet picks up three blips on radar, and subsequently, two fighters scramble and mysteriously disappear. At this point, Flight 412 is monitored and forced to land by Digger Control, a top-level, military intelligence group that debunks UFO information. The intrepid colonel, kept in the dark about his crew, decides to investigate the matter himself.', 'Colonel Pete Moore (Glenn Ford) is commander of the Whitney Radar Test Group, which has been experiencing electrical difficulties aboard its aircraft. To ferret out the problem, he sends a four-man crew on Flight 412. Shortly into the test, the jet picks up three blips on radar, and subsequently, two fighters scramble and mysteriously disappear. At this point, Flight 412 is monitored and forced to land by Digger Control, a top-level, military intelligence group that debunks UFO information. The intrepid colonel, kept in the dark about his crew, decides to investigate the matter himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqfwjIJrAec4tso2grbsU2apI5E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37521'),
  ('339387191596277502', 'The Disappearance of Haruhi Suzumiya', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Mystery, Drama', 'Yota Tsuruoka, Yasuhiro Takemoto, Ryuta Nakagami', 'Nagaru Tanigawa', 'Tomokazu Sugita, Aya Hirano, Minori Chihara, Yuko Goto, Daisuke Ono, Natsuko Kuwatani, Yuki Matsuoka, Minoru Shiraishi', 'PG-13', 'A week before Christmas, Kyon wakes up in a world where the SOS Brigade doesn''t exist. Mikuru and Yuki don''t recognize him, and Haruhi and Itsuki seem to have vanished.', 'A week before Christmas, Kyon wakes up in a world where the SOS Brigade doesn''t exist. Mikuru and Yuki don''t recognize him, and Haruhi and Itsuki seem to have vanished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x52WmUnfpB2AB0YUNGWJZaRzcBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36865'),
  ('149034173742512044', 'The Disappearance of Josef Mengele', 2025, 'History, Drama', 'Vladislav Opelyants, Suse Marquardt, Macarena Basso', 'Kirill Serebrennikov', 'August Diehl, Max Bretschneider, David Ruland, Dana Herfurth, Burghart Klaußner, Friederike Becht, Carlos Kaspar, Heinz K. Krattiger', null, 'In the aftermath of the Second World War, Josef Mengele, the Nazi doctor at Auschwitz, escapes to South America to rebuild his life in hiding. Through the eyes of his son who finds him again, Mengele is confronted with a past he can no longer ignore. From Buenos Aires to Paraguay via Brazil, the man who became known as “The Angel of Death” will organize his methodical disappearance to avoid any form of trial.', 'In the aftermath of the Second World War, Josef Mengele, the Nazi doctor at Auschwitz, escapes to South America to rebuild his life in hiding. Through the eyes of his son who finds him again, Mengele is confronted with a past he can no longer ignore. From Buenos Aires to Paraguay via Brazil, the man who became known as “The Angel of Death” will organize his methodical disappearance to avoid any form of trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38S4QcCyfHyIVO0lQQkGn5lvDD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037264'),
  ('1066297576411394367', 'The Disappearance of My Mother', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Beniamino Barrese, Beniamino Barrese', 'Beniamino Barrese', 'Benedetta Barzini, Beniamino Barrese, Carlotta Antonelli, Michela De Rossi, Martina De Santis, Candice Lam, Olivia Ross', null, 'Aging fashion model Benedetta Barzini strives to escape the world of images and disappear for good, but her son’s determination to make a final film about her sparks an unexpected collaboration and confrontation with the camera’s gaze.', 'Aging fashion model Benedetta Barzini strives to escape the world of images and disappear for good, but her son’s determination to make a final film about her sparks an unexpected collaboration and confrontation with the camera’s gaze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdaD5bkUlTevt1IhOJvkw2NIosq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566062'),
  ('1061676552892781425', 'The Disappeared', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Johnny Kevorkian, Simon Aguirre, Emily Perowne', null, 'Harry Treadaway, Greg Wise, Alex Jennings, Tom Felton, Finlay Robertson, Nikki Amuka-Bird, Ros Leeming, Bronson Webb', null, 'Following the disappearance of his younger brother Tom, Matthew Ryan tries to put his life and sanity back together. However the past keeps coming back to haunt him.', 'Following the disappearance of his younger brother Tom, Matthew Ryan tries to put his life and sanity back together. However the past keeps coming back to haunt him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWMrrZTrU89MUVUutwETLqxFAdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32540'),
