  ('908040082924004604', 'The Disaster Artist', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'James Franco, Brandon Trost, Neil Lewis', 'Scott Neustadter, Michael H. Weber', 'Dave Franco, James Franco, Seth Rogen, Ari Graynor, Alison Brie, Jacki Weaver, Paul Scheer, Zac Efron', 'R', 'An aspiring actor in Hollywood meets an enigmatic stranger by the name of Tommy Wiseau, the meeting leads the actor down a path nobody could have predicted; creating the worst movie ever made.', 'An aspiring actor in Hollywood meets an enigmatic stranger by the name of Tommy Wiseau, the meeting leads the actor down a path nobody could have predicted; creating the worst movie ever made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HuLGiyH0TPYxnCvYHAxc8K738o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371638'),
