  ('100631519161690066', 'The Discarnates', 1988, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Yoshitaka Sakamoto, Shingo Matsubara', 'Shin''ichi Ichikawa', 'Morio Kazama, Kumiko Akiyoshi, Tsurutaro Kataoka, Toshiyuki Nagashima, Yūko Natori, Atsuko Kawada, Bengal, Takashi Sasano', null, 'A recently divorced writer is reunited with the ghosts of his parents who died when he was a boy. However, every time he sees them he loses more life energy. Now, he must choose between starting a new life or staying forever in the past.', 'A recently divorced writer is reunited with the ghosts of his parents who died when he was a boy. However, every time he sees them he loses more life energy. Now, he must choose between starting a new life or staying forever in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBVChAGFDl1vBWMmqrYYxvy2aMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129096'),
  ('500491308372825927', 'The Disciple', 2020, 'Drama, Music', 'Chaitanya Tamhane, Michał Sobociński, Ayan Saxena', 'Chaitanya Tamhane', 'Aditya Modak, Arun Dravid, Sumitra Bhave, Deepika Bhida Bhagwat, Kiran Yadnyopavit, Abhishek Kale, Neela Khedkar, Makarand Mukund', 'NR', 'Self-doubt, sacrifice and struggle converge into an existential crisis for a devoted classical vocalist as the mastery he strives for remains elusive.', 'Self-doubt, sacrifice and struggle converge into an existential crisis for a devoted classical vocalist as the mastery he strives for remains elusive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecESTxoNwnFNNknJrflxnMMzD7v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728116'),
  ('583918989025595825', 'The Discipline of D.E.', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gus Van Sant', null, 'David Worden, Frank Birney, Ken Shapiro, Tom Sherohman, Irving Sicherman, Doris Hess, Michael L. McManus, Budge Threlkeld', null, '"The Discipline of D.E." is a short 16mm film directed by Gus Van Sant. It’s based on a story in “Exterminator!” by William Burroughs that at times reads like Buddhist noir: "DE is a way of doing. DE simply means doing whatever you do in the easiest most relaxed way you can manage which is also the quickest and most efficient way, as you will find as you advance in DE. You can start right now tidying up your flat, moving furniture or books, washing dishes, making tea, sorting papers. Don''t fumble, jerk, grab an object. Drop cool possessive fingers onto it like a gentle old cop making a soft arrest.”', '"The Discipline of D.E." is a short 16mm film directed by Gus Van Sant. It’s based on a story in “Exterminator!” by William Burroughs that at times reads like Buddhist noir: "DE is a way of doing. DE simply means doing whatever you do in the easiest most relaxed way you can manage which is also the quickest and most efficient way, as you will find as you advance in DE. You can start right now tidying up your flat, moving furniture or books, washing dishes, making tea, sorting papers. Don''t fumble, jerk, grab an object. Drop cool possessive fingers onto it like a gentle old cop making a soft arrest.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wtZbnoo044LjPCGwSPiJbWYmBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147210'),
  ('112061133794253446', 'The Discord', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi, Claude Renoir, Hélène Bernardin', 'Claude Zidi, Michel Fabre', 'Louis de Funès, Annie Girardot, Maurice Risch, Jean-Jacques Moreau, Geneviève Fontanel, Jacques François, Georges Staquet, Mario David', null, 'Guillaume has made it: A machine that can clean dirty air by simply sucking all dirt into air balloons and then shipping them far far away so his explanation. Some Japanese business guys, after dinner with a lot of alcohol, order 5,000 pieces. His only problem: His production capacity is way to small so he gets to produce the machines in his private house. His wife Bernadette is far from being happy about it. Her private life goes down the line so she decides to leave Guillaume and to finally have revenge she candidates for major against her husband...', 'Guillaume has made it: A machine that can clean dirty air by simply sucking all dirt into air balloons and then shipping them far far away so his explanation. Some Japanese business guys, after dinner with a lot of alcohol, order 5,000 pieces. His only problem: His production capacity is way to small so he gets to produce the machines in his private house. His wife Bernadette is far from being happy about it. Her private life goes down the line so she decides to leave Guillaume and to finally have revenge she candidates for major against her husband...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQ3IUf65maoUtVIhfHurD0KzduD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11530'),
  ('9000742526688875', 'The Discovery', 2017, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Charlie McDowell, Sturla Brandth Grøvlen, Bill Trautvetter', 'Charlie McDowell, Justin Lader', 'Jason Segel, Rooney Mara, Robert Redford, Jesse Plemons, Riley Keough, Ron Canada, Brian McCarthy, Kimleigh Smith', null, 'In the near future, due to a breakthrough scientific discovery by Dr. Thomas Harbor, there is now definitive proof of an afterlife. While countless people have chosen suicide to reset their existence, others try to decide what it all means. Among them is Dr. Harbor''s son Will, who has arrived at his father''s isolated compound with a mysterious young woman named Isla. There, they discover the strange acolytes who help Dr. Harbor with his experiments.', 'In the near future, due to a breakthrough scientific discovery by Dr. Thomas Harbor, there is now definitive proof of an afterlife. While countless people have chosen suicide to reset their existence, others try to decide what it all means. Among them is Dr. Harbor''s son Will, who has arrived at his father''s isolated compound with a mysterious young woman named Isla. There, they discover the strange acolytes who help Dr. Harbor with his experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLIDouFvreSrs8xK62zuvpEPDw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376134'),
  ('998924132211946225', 'The Discovery of Heaven', 2001, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jeroen Krabbé, Theo Bierkens', 'Edwin de Vries', 'Stephen Fry, Greg Wise, Neil Newbon, Will Bowden, Jeroen Krabbé, Flora Montgomery, Dimitris Philippou, Diana Quick', null, 'Disappointed with humanity, God wants to revoke his contract with humanity and wants to take back the stone tablets containing the ten commandments. To this end an angel is sent out to affect the personal lives of three humans so an appropriate child may be conceived.', 'Disappointed with humanity, God wants to revoke his contract with humanity and wants to take back the stone tablets containing the ten commandments. To this end an angel is sent out to affect the personal lives of three humans so an appropriate child may be conceived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/posrSb1UQBfsoPb9U68vWqbGMOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1373'),
  ('1104111983551025501', 'The Discreet', 1990, 'Romance, Drama', 'Christian Vincent, Thierry Rabastin, Pascale Dallet', 'Jean-Pierre Ronssin, Christian Vincent', 'Fabrice Luchini, Judith Henry, Maurice Garrel, Marie Bunel, François Toumarkine, Brice Beaugier, Yvette Petit, Nicole Félix', null, 'There is an author who has been dumped by his girlfriend and has no inspiration for a next novel. In an attempt to find a solution to both crises, he, along with his publisher friend, decides to seduce a young woman with the singular purpose of keeping a diary of the seduction and then dump her before publishing the book about it. Unfortunately he falls in love with her.', 'There is an author who has been dumped by his girlfriend and has no inspiration for a next novel. In an attempt to find a solution to both crises, he, along with his publisher friend, decides to seduce a young woman with the singular purpose of keeping a diary of the seduction and then dump her before publishing the book about it. Unfortunately he falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kx06VoQ7sJmfYzq8JsnpLICkkb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66538'),
  ('441402238789715173', 'The Discreet Charm of the Bourgeoisie', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Edmond Richard, Luis Buñuel, Albert Rajau', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Luis Buñuel', 'Fernando Rey, Delphine Seyrig, Paul Frankeur, Stéphane Audran, Bulle Ogier, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Julien Bertheau, Claude Piéplu', 'PG', 'In Luis Buñuel’s deliciously satiric masterpiece, an upper-class sextet sits down to dinner but never eats, their attempts continually thwarted by a vaudevillian mixture of events both actual and imagined.', 'In Luis Buñuel’s deliciously satiric masterpiece, an upper-class sextet sits down to dinner but never eats, their attempts continually thwarted by a vaudevillian mixture of events both actual and imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zN4ILX2x64PvT2jIOAHXxCOi5WA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4593'),
  ('767481660870233693', 'The Disenchanted', 1990, 'Drama, Romance', 'Benoît Jacquot, Caroline Champetier', 'Benoît Jacquot', 'Judith Godrèche, Marcel Bozonnet, Thérèse Liotard, Ivan Desny, Malcolm Conrath, Thomas Salsmann, Hai Truhong Tu, Francis Mage', null, 'A worldly French teen is determined to escape from her current situation for a better life.', 'A worldly French teen is determined to escape from her current situation for a better life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbN7cjDyL5U2ldQk7Yft1JtSckL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66537'),
  ('525168039916905920', 'The Disenchantment', 1976, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Teo Escamilla, Jaime Chávarri, Francisco J. Querejeta', null, 'Felicidad Blanc, Leopoldo María Panero, Juan Luis Panero, Michi Panero, Luis Rosales', null, 'This film is a documentary about the poet Leopoldo Panero. His widow and his sons talk about death in general in this special case, and also about their own family problems.', 'This film is a documentary about the poet Leopoldo Panero. His widow and his sons talk about death in general in this special case, and also about their own family problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iR7UFO2vcyyA0FaRRyhlCFhKP47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4496'),
  ('167510378788436641', 'The Dish', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Rob Sitch, Graeme Wood, Iain Pirret', 'Rob Sitch, Santo Cilauro, Jane Kennedy', 'Sam Neill, Patrick Warburton, Kevin Harrington, Tom Long, Eliza Szonert, Roy Billing, John McMartin, Bille Brown', 'PG-13', 'A group of maverick scientists on a remote Australian sheep farm are the globe''s only hope for obtaining the epic images of man''s first steps on the moon.', 'A group of maverick scientists on a remote Australian sheep farm are the globe''s only hope for obtaining the epic images of man''s first steps on the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zG83o1wpU3p7QTd382K4HtctLq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5257'),
  ('749564408618004154', 'The Dish Ran Away with the Spoon', 1933, 'Animation', 'Rudolf Ising', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Margie Hines', null, 'Utensils and food dance, sing, and play in the kitchen, until a lump of dough turns into a monster and they all unite to stop it.', 'Utensils and food dance, sing, and play in the kitchen, until a lump of dough turns into a monster and they all unite to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJFDpnI2O2BXWw8rGXtQuRXNX5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152333'),
  ('607197899843783355', 'The Dishwasher', 2023, 'Drama', 'Francis Leclerc, Steve Asselin, Brigitte Viau', 'Francis Leclerc, Eric K. Boulianne', 'Henri Picard, Charles-Aubey Houde, Joan Hart, Maxime de Cotret, Fayolle Jean Jr, Robin L''Houmeau, Marie-Ève Beauregard, Zachary Evrard', null, 'Montreal, Winter 2002. Stéphane, 19 years old, fan of Metal, student in graphic design, dreams of becoming an illustrator. But for months he has been caught in a threatening spiral: he is addicted to games. Indebted, without an apartment, avoiding his friends to whom he owes money, Stéphane takes a job as a dishwasher in a restaurant in a major Italian restaurant in Montreal in order to get by. There, he will meet Bébert, a cook who burns the candle at both ends, and Greg, a waiter with disreputable actions. Will Stéphane make it through this new job or will he fall into a downward spiral of bad choices?', 'Montreal, Winter 2002. Stéphane, 19 years old, fan of Metal, student in graphic design, dreams of becoming an illustrator. But for months he has been caught in a threatening spiral: he is addicted to games. Indebted, without an apartment, avoiding his friends to whom he owes money, Stéphane takes a job as a dishwasher in a restaurant in a major Italian restaurant in Montreal in order to get by. There, he will meet Bébert, a cook who burns the candle at both ends, and Greg, a waiter with disreputable actions. Will Stéphane make it through this new job or will he fall into a downward spiral of bad choices?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olT3unJZihRZ5Tt0iJBDj3CJdJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937263'),
  ('485404260213468510', 'The Disorderly Orderly', 1964, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Tashlin, Ralph Axness, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Frank Tashlin', 'Jerry Lewis, Glenda Farrell, Karen Sharpe, Susan Oliver, Everett Sloane, Kathleen Freeman, Del Moore, Alice Pearce', 'NR', 'Poor Jerome Littlefield. He wants to be a doctor – but that''s not exactly the perfect career choice when you''re hopelessly squeamish. So he settles for the job of orderly at the Whitestone Sanitarium, a career move that''s guaranteed to keep the patients – and viewers – in stitches!', 'Poor Jerome Littlefield. He wants to be a doctor – but that''s not exactly the perfect career choice when you''re hopelessly squeamish. So he settles for the job of orderly at the Whitestone Sanitarium, a career move that''s guaranteed to keep the patients – and viewers – in stitches!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nL0phS4VMSCL2fMsDrzkCYkZFvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35188'),
  ('527960108101303728', 'The Dissident', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Bryan Fogel', 'Bryan Fogel, Mark Monroe', 'Jamal Khashoggi, Omar Abdulaziz, Prince Mohammed bin Salman al Saud, İrfan Fidan, Agnès Callamard, Hatice Cengiz, John O. Brennan, Fahrettin Altun', 'PG-13', 'When Washington Post journalist Jamal Khashoggi disappears after entering Saudi Arabia’s consulate in Istanbul, his fiancée and dissidents around the world are left to piece together the clues to a brutal murder and expose a global cover up perpetrated by the very country he loved.', 'When Washington Post journalist Jamal Khashoggi disappears after entering Saudi Arabia’s consulate in Istanbul, his fiancée and dissidents around the world are left to piece together the clues to a brutal murder and expose a global cover up perpetrated by the very country he loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDG6K0uLtJvJyp1cJmluqjBh79v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653746'),
  ('310455916402574931', 'The Distinguished Citizen', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat, Mariano Cohn', 'Andrés Duprat', 'Oscar Martínez, Dady Brieva, Andrea Frigerio, Belén Chavanne, Nora Navas, Manuel Vicente, Iván Steinhardt, Marcelo D''Andrea', null, 'After refusing big and prestigious awards all over the world, Mr. Mantovani, Literature Nobel Prize winner, accepts an invitation to visit his hometown in Argentina, which has been the inspiration for all of his books. It turns out that accepting this invitation is the worst idea of his life. Expect the unexpected when you have used real people as characters in your novels!', 'After refusing big and prestigious awards all over the world, Mr. Mantovani, Literature Nobel Prize winner, accepts an invitation to visit his hometown in Argentina, which has been the inspiration for all of his books. It turns out that accepting this invitation is the worst idea of his life. Expect the unexpected when you have used real people as characters in your novels!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bH63pZizNIJoYCE6kkVoj1lzkK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408537'),
  ('46383063521616490', 'The Distinguished Gentleman', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Lynn, Gabriel Beristain, Frank Capra III', 'Marty Kaplan', 'Eddie Murphy, Lane Smith, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Joe Don Baker, Victoria Rowell, Grant Shaud, Kevin McCarthy, Charles S. Dutton', 'R', 'A Florida con man uses the recent death of the long time Congressman from his district, who he just happens to share a last name with, to get elected to his version of paradise, the U.S. Congress, where the money flows from lobbyists.', 'A Florida con man uses the recent death of the long time Congressman from his district, who he just happens to share a last name with, to get elected to his version of paradise, the U.S. Congress, where the money flows from lobbyists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ny722xPMhsY6JlRmQQjLZs7JP0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10411'),
  ('1103513771696224283', 'The Ditch', 2011, 'Drama', 'Wang Bing, Lu Sheng', 'Wang Bing', 'Cheng Zhengwu, Niansong Jing, Xiangnian Li, Renjun Lian, Ye Lu, Yang Haoyu, Jieleu Wan, Li Daguang', null, 'The film focuses on the suffering of Chinese who were imprisoned in a forced labor camp called Jiabiangou in the Gobi Desert in winter 1960 under Mao Zedong on the grounds that they were "rightist elements". The film tells of the harsh life of these men, who coped with physical exhaustion, extreme cold, starvation and death on a daily basis.', 'The film focuses on the suffering of Chinese who were imprisoned in a forced labor camp called Jiabiangou in the Gobi Desert in winter 1960 under Mao Zedong on the grounds that they were "rightist elements". The film tells of the harsh life of these men, who coped with physical exhaustion, extreme cold, starvation and death on a daily basis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhSJD9Ffx8wc0Bvv3lvmlvqImlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91067'),
  ('440132253633400985', 'The Dive', 2023, 'Thriller, Adventure', 'Abigail Borg, Samantha Cassar Ellis, Ludovica Loda', 'Joachim Hedén, Maximilian Erlenwein', 'Louisa Krause, Sophie Lowe, Stella Uhrig, Shire Richardson, David Scicluna', null, 'Two sisters go diving at a beautiful, remote location. One of the sisters is struck by a rock, leaving her trapped 28 meters below. With dangerously low levels of oxygen and cold temperatures, it is up to her sister to fight for her life.', 'Two sisters go diving at a beautiful, remote location. One of the sisters is struck by a rock, leaving her trapped 28 meters below. With dangerously low levels of oxygen and cold temperatures, it is up to her sister to fight for her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aLFglfGkTFG5p6KQg9o07EN3rl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1109534'),
  ('939027926435259862', 'The Divide', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Xavier Gens, Eron Sheean, Laurent Barès', 'Eron Sheean, Karl Mueller', 'Lauren German, Michael Biehn, Milo Ventimiglia, Courtney B. Vance, Ashton Holmes, Rosanna Arquette, Iván González, Michael Eklund', 'R', 'Survivors of a nuclear attack are grouped together for days in the basement of their apartment building, where fear and dwindling supplies wear away at their dynamic.', 'Survivors of a nuclear attack are grouped together for days in the basement of their apartment building, where fear and dwindling supplies wear away at their dynamic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnwX5cUuzBDM0OWJB2UtnjkrHDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38541'),
  ('73927468980873217', 'The Divide', 2021, 'Drama', 'Catherine Corsini, Jeanne Lapoirie, Alexandra Denni', 'Laurette Polmanss, Agnès Feuvre, Catherine Corsini', 'Marina Foïs, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Pio Marmaï, Aissatou Diallo Sagna, Jean-Louis Coulloc''h, Camille Sansterre, Marin Laurens, Caroline Estremo', null, 'Raf and Julie, a couple on the verge of breaking up, find themselves in an emergency ward bordering on collapse on the evening of a Parisian Yellow Vest protest. Their encounter with Yann, an angry and injured demonstrator, will shatter each person''s certainties and prejudices. Outside, the tension escalates.', 'Raf and Julie, a couple on the verge of breaking up, find themselves in an emergency ward bordering on collapse on the evening of a Parisian Yellow Vest protest. Their encounter with Yann, an angry and injured demonstrator, will shatter each person''s certainties and prejudices. Outside, the tension escalates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymHLBkyX7TpYyJLSIyHswrMjQgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764686'),
