  ('346987882933284265', 'The Divine Emma', 1979, 'Drama, History', 'Jiří Krejčík, Josef Jarolímek, Jarmila Čajová', 'Jiří Krejčík, Zdeněk Mahler', 'Božidara Turzonovová, Juraj Kukura, Jiří Adamíra, Miloš Kopecký, Josef Somr, Čestmír Řanda, Josef Kemr, Václav Neužil st.', null, 'The opera lady singer Ema Destinnová is in all her splendor at the American stages. But in Europe there rages war and she decides to return home to Bohemia.', 'The opera lady singer Ema Destinnová is in all her splendor at the American stages. But in Europe there rages war and she decides to return home to Bohemia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ny4tXtOYyVPbVIlFLUSTpaGnSbd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341546'),
  ('230763771432116701', 'The Divine Fury', 2019, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Park Jun-gyu, Jason Kim, Cho Sang-yun', 'Jason Kim', 'Park Seo-jun, Ahn Sung-ki, Woo Do-hwan, Choi Woo-shik, Park Ji-hyun, Jung Ji-hoon, Lee Seung-hee, Sim Hee-seop', 'NR', 'After waking up with mysterious wounds on his hands, a champion fighter finds himself in an otherworldly battle against evil forces that wreak havoc in the human world.', 'After waking up with mysterious wounds on his hands, a champion fighter finds himself in an otherworldly battle against evil forces that wreak havoc in the human world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Z2qT9iZYLzzsCSYu7A4SEQsKX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571627'),
  ('1007271101743636568', 'The Divine Lady', 1928, 'Drama, History, Romance, War', 'Frank Lloyd, John F. Seitz', null, 'Corinne Griffith, Victor Varconi, H.B. Warner, Ian Keith, Marie Dressler, Montagu Love, William Conklin, Dorothy Cumming', null, 'Lady Hamilton''s love affair with Admiral Horatio Nelson rocks the British Empire.', 'Lady Hamilton''s love affair with Admiral Horatio Nelson rocks the British Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDMZL9CSDZ9iZhMXC2L4E09WpMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104214'),
  ('618892656466392953', 'The Divine Move', 2014, 'Action, Crime', 'Kim Hyeong-yong, Lee Hu-bin, Cho Beom-gu', 'Yu Seong-hyeob', 'Jung Woo-sung, Lee Beom-soo, Ahn Sung-ki, Kim In-kwon, Lee Si-young, Choi Jin-hyuk, An Kil-kang, Jung Hae-kyun', null, 'A professional GO player gathers a team to help him carry out his revenge against the man who killed his brother.', 'A professional GO player gathers a team to help him carry out his revenge against the man who killed his brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8pMocgsxL38alfi7hPCIK19XfJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281298'),
  ('303019524495969422', 'The Divine Move 2: The Wrathful', 2019, 'Crime, Action', 'Kim Hyeong-yong, Khan Lee, Kim Dong-young', 'Yu Seong-hyeob', 'Kwon Sang-woo, Kim Hie-won, Kim Sung-kyun, Heo Sung-tae, Woo Do-hwan, Jeong In-kyeom, Won Hyun-jun, Shin Soo-yeon', null, 'In the 1990s, when Go gambling fever swept Korea, Gui-su loses everything because his father gambled obsessively until there was nothing left. Left all alone in the world, Gui-su meets a mentor and Go teacher, Il-do, and goes through vicious training to become the grandmaster of Go. He sets out for revenge on the world that destroyed his life, but soon finds himself chased by an unknown loner pursuing his own vendetta.', 'In the 1990s, when Go gambling fever swept Korea, Gui-su loses everything because his father gambled obsessively until there was nothing left. Left all alone in the world, Gui-su meets a mentor and Go teacher, Il-do, and goes through vicious training to become the grandmaster of Go. He sets out for revenge on the world that destroyed his life, but soon finds himself chased by an unknown loner pursuing his own vendetta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcaRTiIOrkDM8vuQkDXhMgWJ2GO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580626'),
  ('1046553514179157362', 'The Divine Nymph', 1975, 'Romance, Drama', 'Giuseppe Patroni Griffi, Aldo Terlizzi, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Giuseppe Patroni Griffi, Alfio Valdarnini', 'Laura Antonelli, Terence Stamp, Marcello Mastroianni, Michele Placido, Duilio Del Prete, Ettore Manni, Carlo Tamberlani, Cecilia Polizzi', 'R', 'In the decadent Roaring Twenties, a beautiful woman engages in affairs with two men, playing them against each other.', 'In the decadent Roaring Twenties, a beautiful woman engages in affairs with two men, playing them against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zp6uuBRpZp5P3P7fGIrdisYLmpJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44926'),
  ('158131496775991199', 'The Divine Order', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Petra Biondina Volpe, Judith Kaufmann', 'Petra Biondina Volpe', 'Marie Leuenberger, Maximilian Simonischek, Marta Zoffoli, Bettina Stucky, Rachel Braunschweig, Sibylle Brunner, Noe Krejcí, Finn Sutter', null, 'Nora is a young housewife and mother, living in a quaint little village with her husband and their two sons. The Swiss countryside is untouched by the major social upheavals the movement of 1968 has brought about. Nora’s life is not affected either; she is a quiet person who is liked by everybody – until she starts to publicly fight for women’s suffrage, which the men are due to vote on in a ballot on February 7, 1971.', 'Nora is a young housewife and mother, living in a quaint little village with her husband and their two sons. The Swiss countryside is untouched by the major social upheavals the movement of 1968 has brought about. Nora’s life is not affected either; she is a quiet person who is liked by everybody – until she starts to publicly fight for women’s suffrage, which the men are due to vote on in a ballot on February 7, 1971.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkdnTSj3Zia0rik1wh6agIf2jNF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436167'),
  ('364825236130747852', 'The Divine Sarah Bernhardt', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Brigitte Moidon, Aurélien Fauchet, Guillaume Nicloux', 'Nathalie Leuthreau, Guillaume Nicloux', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Laurent Lafitte, Amira Casar, Pauline Étienne, Mathilde Ollivier, Laurent Stocker, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Clément Hervieu-Léger', null, '1915, Sarah Bernhardt is the world''s first star. Free. Modern. Divine. Eccentric. Visionary... Between legend and fantasy, Sarah Bernhardt tells us the love story that marked her life.', '1915, Sarah Bernhardt is the world''s first star. Free. Modern. Divine. Eccentric. Visionary... Between legend and fantasy, Sarah Bernhardt tells us the love story that marked her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pC6muFFqI58gsImo3Rhd8HkkPAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1228322'),
  ('562344232517962101', 'The Divine Weapon', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, History', 'Kim Yoo-jin, Lim Jae-young', 'Shin Hyeon jeong, Gang Hui-yeon, Lee Man-hee', 'Jung Jae-young, Han Da-gam, Huh Joon-ho, Ahn Sung-ki, Shin Jung-keun, In Gyo-jin, Lee Do-gyeong, In Gyo-jin', null, 'During the reign of King Sejong in the 15th century, the Joseon Dynasty was the embodiment of the perfect state. To the Ming China, the aspiring imperial power, Joseon presented an obstacle to territorial expansion. To protect themselves from war, King Sejong develops a secret weapon to defend their territory and take back their land and supremacy.', 'During the reign of King Sejong in the 15th century, the Joseon Dynasty was the embodiment of the perfect state. To the Ming China, the aspiring imperial power, Joseon presented an obstacle to territorial expansion. To protect themselves from war, King Sejong develops a secret weapon to defend their territory and take back their land and supremacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/863GjRsIE2YRfom07WkTbCeDfny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50341'),
  ('423286030357728926', 'The Diving Bell and the Butterfly', 2007, 'Drama, History', 'Julian Schnabel, Janusz Kamiński, Stéphane Gluck', 'Ronald Harwood', 'Mathieu Amalric, Emmanuelle Seigner, Marie-Josée Croze, Anne Consigny, Patrick Chesnais, Niels Arestrup, Olatz López Garmendia, Jean-Pierre Cassel', 'PG-13', 'Jean-Dominique Bauby, editor-in-chief of French fashion bible Elle magazine, has a devastating stroke at age 43. The damage to his brain stem results in locked-in syndrome, with which he is almost completely paralyzed and only able to communicate by blinking an eye. Bauby painstakingly dictates his memoir via the only means of expression left to him.', 'Jean-Dominique Bauby, editor-in-chief of French fashion bible Elle magazine, has a devastating stroke at age 43. The damage to his brain stem results in locked-in syndrome, with which he is almost completely paralyzed and only able to communicate by blinking an eye. Bauby painstakingly dictates his memoir via the only means of expression left to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NkJ4gnLrvLj0PZDW6sNM85JMbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2013'),
  ('863612762767089811', 'The Division', 2020, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Gustavo Hadba, Vicente Amorim', 'Rafael Spínola, José Luiz Magalhães, Gustavo Bragança', 'Sílvio Guindane, Erom Cordeiro, Natália Lage, Thelmo Fernandes, Marcos Palmeira, Vanessa Gerbelli, Dalton Vigh, Hanna Romanazzi', null, 'In the 90s, Rio de Janeiro was shaken by a wave of kidnappings. Security forces call controversial agents to help save the city from thugs and also from the police itself.', 'In the 90s, Rio de Janeiro was shaken by a wave of kidnappings. Security forces call controversial agents to help save the city from thugs and also from the police itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dH6Pcn03vAcXfKFig7eOK6Z0O9s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651866'),
  ('272973662398683741', 'The Divorce of Lady X', 1938, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tim Whelan, Harry Stradling Sr., Philip Brandon', 'Robert E. Sherwood, Arthur Wimperis, Ian Dalrymple', 'Merle Oberon, Laurence Olivier, Binnie Barnes, Ralph Richardson, Morton Selten, J.H. Roberts, Gertrude Musgrove, Gus McNaughton', 'NR', 'A London barrister believes the woman who spent the night in his hotel suite is the erring wife of his newest client.', 'A London barrister believes the woman who spent the night in his hotel suite is the erring wife of his newest client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJIu073QhiXdxOYlmA07yNRPFRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43850'),
  ('745832401724118256', 'The Divorcee', 1930, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert Z. Leonard, Norbert Brodine, Douglas Shearer', 'Zelda Sears, Nick Grindé', 'Norma Shearer, Chester Morris, Conrad Nagel, Robert Montgomery, Florence Eldridge, Helene Millard, Robert Elliott, Mary Doran', 'NR', 'When a woman discovers that her husband has been unfaithful, she decides to pay him back in kind.', 'When a woman discovers that her husband has been unfaithful, she decides to pay him back in kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzu6IW9ilkUt6L4DL9SoNnwtAfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80708'),
  ('408430193285454482', 'The Dizzy Acrobat', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Alex Lovy', null, 'Mel Blanc, Kent Rogers', 'NR', 'Woody Woodpecker visits the circus. Singing "I Went to the Animal Fair," he strolls through a tiger''s cage. As Woody looks at a rhinoceros, the nearby lion eats Woody''s hot dog. Woody gets revenge by putting the lion''s tail in the bun; the lion eats his own tail. Woody next tries to sneak into the main tent, and the run-ins with the guard take up the rest of the cartoon. First, the guard tells Woody he can work for his admission by watering an elephant, but he''s not pleased when Woody ties the elephant''s trunk to a hydrant. The chase is on, leading into the lion tamer''s cage, onto the trapeze, and bicycling across the tightrope. Both Woody and the guard end up as targets in the shooting gallery.', 'Woody Woodpecker visits the circus. Singing "I Went to the Animal Fair," he strolls through a tiger''s cage. As Woody looks at a rhinoceros, the nearby lion eats Woody''s hot dog. Woody gets revenge by putting the lion''s tail in the bun; the lion eats his own tail. Woody next tries to sneak into the main tent, and the run-ins with the guard take up the rest of the cartoon. First, the guard tells Woody he can work for his admission by watering an elephant, but he''s not pleased when Woody ties the elephant''s trunk to a hydrant. The chase is on, leading into the lion tamer''s cage, onto the trapeze, and bicycling across the tightrope. Both Woody and the guard end up as targets in the shooting gallery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1kQlqRj3zlBE8ViN5Eyh1fLERe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86030'),
